values
  ('689445348606801195', 'At a Glance', 2008, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Vladan Radović, Pierluigi Ferrandini, Gianni Costantino', 'Carla Cavalluzzi, Sergio Rubini, Angelo Pasquini', 'Sergio Rubini, Riccardo Scamarcio, Vittoria Puccini, Richard Sammel, Paola Barale, Emanuele Salce, Giancarlo Ratti, Anna Orso', null, 'Adrian is a talented young sculptor eager to assert himself in the art world. His first exhibition in the Capital catches Gloria''s eye. She''s an art student looking for "her" artist. Between the two something''s born and soon she becomes Adrian''s lover and muse, as well as his agent. But someone else also falls in love with Adrian''s work: Lulli, an internationally-renowned art critic – and also Gloria''s guardian and lover before Adrian''s arrival.', 'Adrian is a talented young sculptor eager to assert himself in the art world. His first exhibition in the Capital catches Gloria''s eye. She''s an art student looking for "her" artist. Between the two something''s born and soon she becomes Adrian''s lover and muse, as well as his agent. But someone else also falls in love with Adrian''s work: Lulli, an internationally-renowned art critic – and also Gloria''s guardian and lover before Adrian''s arrival.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/szFFTtNMoKoC0S96EdL9immTpC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82145'),
  ('3208424872031632', 'At Any Price', 2012, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Ramin Bahrani, Michael Simmonds', 'Hallie Elizabeth Newton', 'Dennis Quaid, Zac Efron, Kim Dickens, Clancy Brown, Maika Monroe, Heather Graham, Red West, Chelcie Ross', 'R', 'Henry Whipple wants his rebellious son Dean to help expand his family’s farming empire. However, Dean has his sights set on becoming a professional race car driver. When a high-stakes investigation into their business is exposed, father and son are pushed into an unexpected situation that threatens the family''s entire livelihood.', 'Henry Whipple wants his rebellious son Dean to help expand his family’s farming empire. However, Dean has his sights set on becoming a professional race car driver. When a high-stakes investigation into their business is exposed, father and son are pushed into an unexpected situation that threatens the family''s entire livelihood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eZB526cDGE8qxgycckTP7SaM1Pr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:121789'),
  ('46479234992591582', 'At Cafe 6', 2016, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Neal Wu', 'He Su-Fen, Neal Wu, Liao Ming-Yi', 'Austin Lin, Dong Zijian, Cherry Ngan Cheuk-Ling, Nini Ou-Yang, Ireine Song, Leon Dai, Sandrine Pinna, Mickey Huang', null, 'One rainy night, a woman takes refuge in At Cafe 6 after an argument with her boyfriend. She strikes up a conversation with the café owner, who shares a story from his youth.', 'One rainy night, a woman takes refuge in At Cafe 6 after an argument with her boyfriend. She strikes up a conversation with the café owner, who shares a story from his youth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gpbbaOc15tgAakBTtqLfiDzyrw8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:406125'),
  ('262113602253635372', 'At Cairo''s Railway Station', 2006, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Ahmed Nader Galal, Ehab Mohamed Ali', 'Belal Fadl', 'Karim Abdel Aziz, Menna Shalabi, Lotfy Labib, Inam Salusah, Zizi Mostafa, Said Tarabeek, Sandy Ali, Edward', null, 'Reda, a young salesperson meets Malak in the railway station who asks him to play the role of her husband before her rich parents who live in Upper Egypt.', 'Reda, a young salesperson meets Malak in the railway station who asks him to play the role of her husband before her rich parents who live in Upper Egypt.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fjbdAIEDGPgu1Lod2I4G6hmvgcn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57408'),
  ('462809460102425194', 'At Close Range', 1986, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'James Foley, Juan Ruiz Anchía, Ric Kidney', 'Nicholas Kazan', 'Sean Penn, Christopher Walken, Mary Stuart Masterson, Chris Penn, Millie Perkins, Eileen Ryan, Tracey Walter, David Strathairn', 'R', 'Brad Whitewood Jr. lives in rural Pennsylvania and has few prospects. Against his mother''s wishes, he seeks out his estranged father, the head of a gang of thieves in a nearby town. Though his new girlfriend supports his criminal ambitions, Brad Jr. soon learns that his father is a dangerous man. Inspired by the real events that led to the end of the Johnston Gang, who operated in the northeastern United States in the 1970s.', 'Brad Whitewood Jr. lives in rural Pennsylvania and has few prospects. Against his mother''s wishes, he seeks out his estranged father, the head of a gang of thieves in a nearby town. Though his new girlfriend supports his criminal ambitions, Brad Jr. soon learns that his father is a dangerous man. Inspired by the real events that led to the end of the Johnston Gang, who operated in the northeastern United States in the 1970s.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bOkXqMmLowHBZY9lptWi3ljOXx4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13715'),
  ('205695205840861735', 'At Eternity''s Gate', 2018, 'Drama, History', 'Dylan Talleux, Johana Katz, Jérémy Debord', 'Jean-Claude Carrière, Julian Schnabel, Louise Kugelberg', 'Willem Dafoe, Rupert Friend, Oscar Isaac, Mads Mikkelsen, Mathieu Amalric, Emmanuelle Seigner, Niels Arestrup, Anne Consigny', 'PG-13', 'Famed but tormented artist Vincent van Gogh spends his final years in Arles, France, painting masterworks of the natural world that surrounds him.', 'Famed but tormented artist Vincent van Gogh spends his final years in Arles, France, painting masterworks of the natural world that surrounds him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y4LvHQoX5YunHJ2EMBSjQvOkvD9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:491472'),
  ('823240708565703263', 'At Eye Level', 2016, 'Comedy, Drama, Family', 'Joachim Dollhopf, Jürgen Jürges', 'Evi Goldbrunner, Joachim Dollhopf', 'Anica Dobra, Mira Bartuschek, Luis Vorbach, Sebastian Gerold, Jordan Prentice, Patrick Kalupa, Phil Laude, Ella Frey', null, '11-year-old Michi lives in a children''s home, every day fighting to win the respect of the other kids, till the day he finds his real dad, Tom - who happens to be a dwarf, even shorter than Michi is, the opposite of his idea of manliness and strength. When the kids find out, Michi''s life becomes hell and he flees. With nowhere to go, he moves in with Tom, who is new to this fatherhood thing, while Michi tried to hide his embarrassment and shame from his fellow school kids. This forces Tom, who had coped well till now, to confront his handicap head on. As time passes, they discover they have more in common than other sons and fathers, until their relationship is again suddenly put to the hard test...', '11-year-old Michi lives in a children''s home, every day fighting to win the respect of the other kids, till the day he finds his real dad, Tom - who happens to be a dwarf, even shorter than Michi is, the opposite of his idea of manliness and strength. When the kids find out, Michi''s life becomes hell and he flees. With nowhere to go, he moves in with Tom, who is new to this fatherhood thing, while Michi tried to hide his embarrassment and shame from his fellow school kids. This forces Tom, who had coped well till now, to confront his handicap head on. As time passes, they discover they have more in common than other sons and fathers, until their relationship is again suddenly put to the hard test...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gzvlYHk1AOXuR74RtOSK9zWDNBc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:375111'),
  ('308004317705078664', 'At First Light', 2018, 'Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Jason Stone, David Robert Jones', 'Jason Stone', 'Stefanie Scott, Théodore Pellerin, Saïd Taghmaoui, Percy Hynes White, Kate Burton, Janet-Laine Green, Jahmil French, James Wotherspoon', 'PG-13', 'High school senior Alex has an encounter with mysterious lights that appear over her small town. She soon develops dangerous, supernatural abilities, and turns to her childhood friend Sean. The authorities target them and a chase ensues as officials try to discover the truth behind Alex''s transformation.', 'High school senior Alex has an encounter with mysterious lights that appear over her small town. She soon develops dangerous, supernatural abilities, and turns to her childhood friend Sean. The authorities target them and a chase ensues as officials try to discover the truth behind Alex''s transformation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wez4hCV7ltekZwRkQVyiKEZNrm5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:470894'),
  ('859372516137473368', 'At First Sight', 1999, 'Drama, Romance', 'Irwin Winkler, John Seale', 'Steve Levitt', 'Val Kilmer, Mira Sorvino, Kelly McGillis, Steven Weber, Bruce Davison, Nathan Lane, Ken Howard, Laura Kirk', 'PG-13', 'A blind man has an operation to regain his sight at the urging of his girlfriend and must deal with the changes to his life.', 'A blind man has an operation to regain his sight at the urging of his girlfriend and must deal with the changes to his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9nylrKj8zWxTor9BCy3umv6WHZe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15556'),
  ('1012767904207596208', 'At Full Gallop', 1996, 'Comedy, History, Drama', 'Krzysztof Zanussi, Jarosław Żamojda', 'Krzysztof Zanussi', 'Maja Komorowska, Bartosz Obuchowicz, Karolina Wajda, Piotr Adamczyk, Piotr Szwedes, Stanisława Celińska, Andrzej Szenajch, Agnieszka Warchulska', null, 'Zanussi has described the film as his most autobiographical work. A young boy in post-World War II, Communist-dominated Poland, whose father''s decision to remain in Britain after the war has made his family politically-suspect with the local Party authorities, is sent by his mother to stay with an "aunt" (in reality an old family friend) in Warsaw.', 'Zanussi has described the film as his most autobiographical work. A young boy in post-World War II, Communist-dominated Poland, whose father''s decision to remain in Britain after the war has made his family politically-suspect with the local Party authorities, is sent by his mother to stay with an "aunt" (in reality an old family friend) in Warsaw.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l3CU2pUX0N85voZPBxWe3gM1H6q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:271973'),
  ('392357164501279283', 'At Gunpoint', 1955, 'Western', 'Edward Morey Jr., Ellsworth Fredericks, Alfred L. Werker', 'Daniel B. Ullman', 'Fred MacMurray, Dorothy Malone, Walter Brennan, Tommy Rettig, Skip Homeier, Whit Bissell, Irving Bacon, Jack Lambert', 'NR', 'A general-store keeper scares off bank robbers with a lucky shot, but they come back.', 'A general-store keeper scares off bank robbers with a lucky shot, but they come back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fgRS9iBrmwtE7AOLxGK4xsgUnRR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:140062'),
  ('789314853603690456', 'At Home', 2015, 'Crime, Drama', 'Hiroshi Chôno', 'Teruo Abe', 'Yutaka Takenouchi, Yasuko Matsuyuki, Kentaro Sakaguchi, Yuina Kuroshima, Yūto Ikeda, Itsuji Itao, Seiji Chihara, Daisuke Muramoto', null, 'A father, a mother, an elder son, a daughter and a younger son. A family of five. For all appearances, a perfectly normal, happy family. But none them related', 'A father, a mother, an elder son, a daughter and a younger son. A family of five. For all appearances, a perfectly normal, happy family. But none them related', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uMYWnCspOwJlXtbXB8kEGlbYFX9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:356210'),
  ('698704416300900497', 'At Home Among Strangers, a Stranger Among His Own', 1974, 'Action, Drama, Adventure', 'Nikita Mikhalkov, Pavel Lebeshev, Rem Sobinov', 'Nikita Mikhalkov, Eduard Volodarskiy', 'Yuri Bogatyryov, Anatoliy Solonitsyn, Sergey Shakurov, Aleksandr Porokhovshchikov, Nikolai Pastukhov, Aleksandr Kaydanovskiy, Nikita Mikhalkov, Nikolay Zasukhin', null, 'Following the Russian Civil War, a loyal Red, Shilov, must prove he is at home among strangers as he attempts to recapture a shipment of gold that he was supposed to deliver to Moscow. Needed as a means of buying food for the people, the gold Shilov was entrusted with is stolen, initially by a group of assassins and then by a group of bandits. In tracking the gold’s whereabouts, Shilov’s motives are questioned and he is suspected of treason, in part because his brother was a devoted White. In an effort to clear his name, Shilov locates the gold, but he also discovers rampant greed and corruption.', 'Following the Russian Civil War, a loyal Red, Shilov, must prove he is at home among strangers as he attempts to recapture a shipment of gold that he was supposed to deliver to Moscow. Needed as a means of buying food for the people, the gold Shilov was entrusted with is stolen, initially by a group of assassins and then by a group of bandits. In tracking the gold’s whereabouts, Shilov’s motives are questioned and he is suspected of treason, in part because his brother was a devoted White. In an effort to clear his name, Shilov locates the gold, but he also discovers rampant greed and corruption.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iJPDN8gYHN9357QsBLXspugzCw3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38361'),
  ('1043957821911316844', 'At Home with the Rozes', 2003, 'Comedy', 'Francis Palluau, Romain Winding', 'Francis Palluau', 'Jean Dujardin, Carole Bouquet, Lorànt Deutsch, Michel Duchaussoy, Olivier Saladin, Yolande Moreau, Dominique Pinon, André Wilms', null, 'Two ex-convicts, MG and Gilbert find refuge in a charming middle-class house whose couple is about to celebrate its 20-year old marriage. Our duo has no other solution than to take this entire brood in hostage. But, contrary to all expectations, they are warmly greeted by the occupants who don''t think twice before helping them, they are even ready to put their guests off, even to kill them if necessary...', 'Two ex-convicts, MG and Gilbert find refuge in a charming middle-class house whose couple is about to celebrate its 20-year old marriage. Our duo has no other solution than to take this entire brood in hostage. But, contrary to all expectations, they are warmly greeted by the occupants who don''t think twice before helping them, they are even ready to put their guests off, even to kill them if necessary...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pigSG3zhAXxc3CUdQByx4wFcjkB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44710'),
  ('681022432536111785', 'At Home with the Webbers', 1993, 'Comedy', 'Brad Marlowe, Irv Goodnoff', 'Brad Marlowe', 'Jeffrey Tambor, Jennifer Tilly, David Arquette, Rita Taggart, Merle Kennedy, Robby Benson, Brian Bloom, Caroline Goodall', null, 'AT HOME WITH THE WEBBERS explores what happens when a typical American family is turned into a hot, new, totally uncensored TV show. Viewers get hooked on the real-life soap, while the Webbers grapple with their unexpected fame.', 'AT HOME WITH THE WEBBERS explores what happens when a typical American family is turned into a hot, new, totally uncensored TV show. Viewers get hooked on the real-life soap, while the Webbers grapple with their unexpected fame.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l1w5UXhLnS6nOKv6Zej8y2xqZ8b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:128640'),
  ('61641708163348748', 'At Land', 1944, 'Fantasy', 'Maya Deren', 'Maya Deren', 'Maya Deren, John Cage, Parker Tyler, Alexander Hammid, Hella Hammid, Philip Lamantia', null, 'A woman washes up on a beach and embarks on a surreal journey, encountering others and fragmented versions of herself in a quest for identity.', 'A woman washes up on a beach and embarks on a surreal journey, encountering others and fragmented versions of herself in a quest for identity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/97g5V60msJWADVBJyJMpzmRZAnd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44445'),
  ('754434191951271376', 'At Long Last Love', 1975, 'Comedy, Music, Romance', 'Peter Bogdanovich, László Kovács, Jerry Ballew', 'Peter Bogdanovich', 'Burt Reynolds, Cybill Shepherd, Madeline Kahn, Duilio Del Prete, Eileen Brennan, John Hillerman, Mildred Natwick, Quinn K. Redeker', 'G', 'Four socialites unexpectedly clash: heiress Brooke Carter runs into gambler Johnny Spanish at the race track while playboy Michael O. Pritchard nearly runs into stage star Kitty O''Kelly with his car. Backstage at Kitty''s show, it turns out she and Brooke are old friends who attended public school together. The foursome do the town, accompanied by Brooke''s companion Elizabeth, who throws herself at Michael''s butler and chauffeur Rodney James.', 'Four socialites unexpectedly clash: heiress Brooke Carter runs into gambler Johnny Spanish at the race track while playboy Michael O. Pritchard nearly runs into stage star Kitty O''Kelly with his car. Backstage at Kitty''s show, it turns out she and Brooke are old friends who attended public school together. The foursome do the town, accompanied by Brooke''s companion Elizabeth, who throws herself at Michael''s butler and chauffeur Rodney James.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5bAMJ8SU3zdggtyJ3Iy2tyXXSf2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4704'),
  ('172639235026521553', 'At Middleton', 2013, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Trey Donner, Marc Dahlstrom, Emmanuel Kadosh', 'Glenn German, Adam Rodgers', 'Andy Garcia, Vera Farmiga, Taissa Farmiga, Spencer Rocco Lofranco, Nicholas Braun, Tom Skerritt, Peter Riegert, Mirjana Joković', 'R', 'George is an uptight surgeon with a rebellious teenage son. Edith is a free spirit with an overachieving teenage daughter. When they meet during an admissions tour with their kids at the small, idyllic Middleton University, they decide to ditch the group. Though adversaries at first, they soon discover that the only thing better than the college tour, is the detour.', 'George is an uptight surgeon with a rebellious teenage son. Edith is a free spirit with an overachieving teenage daughter. When they meet during an admissions tour with their kids at the small, idyllic Middleton University, they decide to ditch the group. Though adversaries at first, they soon discover that the only thing better than the college tour, is the detour.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6hhXewoxobQ0C6sWFmvnsslvZOB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:194722'),
  ('692134371631558677', 'At Midnight', 2023, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Jonah Feingold, Chuy Chávez', 'Jonah Feingold, Giovanni Porta, María Hinojos', 'Monica Barbaro, Diego Boneta, Anders Holm, Catherine Cohen, Casey Thomas Brown, Fernando Carsa, Whitney Cummings, Ricardo Esquerra', 'R', 'Alejandro''s life is disrupted when actress Sophie Wilder stays at his hotel. To their surprise, the two fall for one another, meeting at midnight.', 'Alejandro''s life is disrupted when actress Sophie Wilder stays at his hotel. To their surprise, the two fall for one another, meeting at midnight.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1PqMUjNOkkGLT0h0QkacvBrrf8C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1061163'),
  ('1006216669056105570', 'At Midnight I''ll Take Your Soul', 1964, 'Horror, Thriller, Fantasy', 'José Mojica Marins, Giorgio Attili, Ozualdo Ribeiro Candeias', 'José Mojica Marins, Magda Mei', 'José Mojica Marins, Magda Mei, Nivaldo Lima, Valéria Vasquez, Ilídio Martins Simões, Eucaris Moraes, Mario Lima, Arildo Iruam', null, 'Zé do Caixão is an undertaker in a small Brazilian town, searching for the perfect woman to bear him a superior child. Unable to conceive with his wife, he kills her and sets out to find someone else.', 'Zé do Caixão is an undertaker in a small Brazilian town, searching for the perfect woman to bear him a superior child. Unable to conceive with his wife, he kills her and sets out to find someone else.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tzPyUpVEObyLov2VC0aFu5H07ww.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30913'),
  ('983717067959562465', 'At Play in the Fields of the Lord', 1991, 'Drama, Romance', 'Héctor Babenco, Lauro Escorel', 'Héctor Babenco, Jean-Claude Carrière, Vincent Patrick', 'Tom Berenger, John Lithgow, Daryl Hannah, Aidan Quinn, Tom Waits, Kathy Bates, Stênio Garcia, Nelson Xavier', 'R', 'Martin and Hazel Quarrier are small-town fundamentalist missionaries sent to the jungles of South America to convert the Indians. Their remote mission was previously run by the Catholics, before the natives murdered them all. They are sent by the pompous Leslie Huben, who runs the missionary effort in the area but who seems more concerned about competing with his Catholic ''rivals'' than in the Indians themselves. Hazel is terrified of the Indians while Martin is fascinated. Soon American pilot Lewis Moon joins the Indian tribe but is attracted by Leslie''s young wife, Andy. Can the interaction of these characters and cultures, and the advancing bulldozers of civilization, avoid disaster?', 'Martin and Hazel Quarrier are small-town fundamentalist missionaries sent to the jungles of South America to convert the Indians. Their remote mission was previously run by the Catholics, before the natives murdered them all. They are sent by the pompous Leslie Huben, who runs the missionary effort in the area but who seems more concerned about competing with his Catholic ''rivals'' than in the Indians themselves. Hazel is terrified of the Indians while Martin is fascinated. Soon American pilot Lewis Moon joins the Indian tribe but is attracted by Leslie''s young wife, Andy. Can the interaction of these characters and cultures, and the advancing bulldozers of civilization, avoid disaster?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mySgPPUOxKOHGzTtuVSfGegCBRg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51515'),
  ('482710543783971125', 'At Sword''s Point', 1952, 'Adventure, Action', 'Lewis Allen, William Dorfman, Ray Rennahan', 'Joseph Hoffman, Walter Ferris', 'Cornel Wilde, Maureen O''Hara, Gladys Cooper, June Clayworth, Dan O''Herlihy, Alan Hale Jr., Blanche Yurka, Nancy Gates', 'NR', 'France, 1648: Richelieu and Louis XIII are dead, the new king is a minor, and the Duc de Lavalle is in virtually open rebellion, scheming to seize power. As a last resort, Queen Anne summons the heirs of the original Musketeers to her aid...including Claire, daughter of Athos, who when she chooses can miraculously pass as a boy, and wields as fine a sword as any. All their skills will be needed for a battle against increasing odds. One for all and all for one! Written by Rod Crawford', 'France, 1648: Richelieu and Louis XIII are dead, the new king is a minor, and the Duc de Lavalle is in virtually open rebellion, scheming to seize power. As a last resort, Queen Anne summons the heirs of the original Musketeers to her aid...including Claire, daughter of Athos, who when she chooses can miraculously pass as a boy, and wields as fine a sword as any. All their skills will be needed for a battle against increasing odds. One for all and all for one! Written by Rod Crawford', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pr1adxmuZ1RqSeMVtx3wFlI3blU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:147882'),
  ('826520336864393791', 'At the Bar', 2007, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Serdar Akar, Mehmet Aksin', 'Volkan Sümbül, Sertaç Akar, Emre Özdür', 'Nejat İşler, Hakan Boyav, Serdar Orçin, Erdal Beşikçioğlu, Volga Sorgu, Doğu Alpan, Burak Altay, Melis Birkan', null, 'A group of drug-influenced lumpen teenagers from the suburbs of the city descends into the center where they do not belong, where they are excluded. They adopted a brutal method to seize rights that were not granted to them. Unaware of what will happen to them, cheerful and well-to-do university students are helpless in the face of this gun-wielding mob that suddenly raids the bar where they are having fun.', 'A group of drug-influenced lumpen teenagers from the suburbs of the city descends into the center where they do not belong, where they are excluded. They adopted a brutal method to seize rights that were not granted to them. Unaware of what will happen to them, cheerful and well-to-do university students are helpless in the face of this gun-wielding mob that suddenly raids the bar where they are having fun.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4Fd5wFCqiWMCdCG2nhGsKkrsD5N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27721'),
  ('142893203202326252', 'At the Circus', 1939, 'Comedy, Music', 'Edward Buzzell, Stan Rogers, Franz Waxman', 'Irving Brecher', 'Groucho Marx, Chico Marx, Harpo Marx, Kenny Baker, Florence Rice, Eve Arden, Margaret Dumont, Nat Pendleton', 'NR', 'Jeff Wilson, the owner of a small circus, owes his partner Carter $10,000. Before Jeff can pay, Carter''s accomplices steal the money so he can take over the circus. Antonio Pirelli and Punchy, who work at the circus, together with lawyer Loophole try to find the thief and get the money back.', 'Jeff Wilson, the owner of a small circus, owes his partner Carter $10,000. Before Jeff can pay, Carter''s accomplices steal the money so he can take over the circus. Antonio Pirelli and Punchy, who work at the circus, together with lawyer Loophole try to find the thief and get the money back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dJsDjHYfOemGvVtHTdivU0Tl0YK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22553'),
  ('316426880994697068', 'At the Club', 1899, 'Comedy', 'Alice Guy-Blaché', null, null, null, 'Some men get into hijinks at a sidewalk cafe. There is no known credited director for this film, although the attribution usually goes for Alice Guy.', 'Some men get into hijinks at a sidewalk cafe. There is no known credited director for this film, although the attribution usually goes for Alice Guy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3iZ1UcTlFLMLrYFeLn06fvV9C37.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:119961'),
  ('48143582694421460', 'At the Devil''s Door', 2014, 'Horror', 'Jeremy Phoenix, Kristin Graham, Nicholas McCarthy', 'Nicholas McCarthy', 'Ashley Rickards, Nick Eversman, Michael Massee, Mark Steger, Catalina Sandino Moreno, Naya Rivera, Wyatt Russell, Daniel Roebuck', 'R', 'When ambitious young real estate agent Leigh is asked to sell a house with a checkered past, she crosses paths with a disturbed girl whom she learns is the runaway daughter of the couple selling the property. When Leigh tries to intervene and help her, she becomes entangled with a supernatural force that soon pulls Leigh''s artist sister Vera into its web - and has sinister plans for both of them.', 'When ambitious young real estate agent Leigh is asked to sell a house with a checkered past, she crosses paths with a disturbed girl whom she learns is the runaway daughter of the couple selling the property. When Leigh tries to intervene and help her, she becomes entangled with a supernatural force that soon pulls Leigh''s artist sister Vera into its web - and has sinister plans for both of them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/veJ20fCOlKN60zWcNygmLkdu6EJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:254188'),
  ('705503202684281117', 'At the Earth''s Core', 1976, 'Adventure, Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'Kevin Connor, Alan Hume', 'Milton Subotsky', 'Doug McClure, Peter Cushing, Caroline Munro, Cy Grant, Godfrey James, Sean Lynch, Keith Barron, Helen Gill', 'PG', 'A huge burrowing machine tunnels out of control at ferocious speed, cutting clean through to the center of the earth, to the twilight world of pellucidar. Once there, Dr. Perry and David Innes are threatened by half human creatures, lizard-like birds, and man-eating plants.', 'A huge burrowing machine tunnels out of control at ferocious speed, cutting clean through to the center of the earth, to the twilight world of pellucidar. Once there, Dr. Perry and David Innes are threatened by half human creatures, lizard-like birds, and man-eating plants.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hDMmR5asPdAHNXjo1uijHlba9VX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26398'),
  ('78142360690352967', 'At the End of the Day', 2024, 'Comedy, Music, Romance', 'Michaël Pierrard, Maxime Héraud, Claude Lelouch', 'Claude Lelouch', 'Kad Merad, Elsa Zylberstein, Michel Boujenah, Sandrine Bonnaire, Barbara Pravi, Françoise Gillard, Marianne Denicourt, François Morel', null, 'In an increasingly crazy world, Lino, who has decided to leave everything behind, will come to realise that, at the end of the day, everything that happens to us is for our own good!', 'In an increasingly crazy world, Lino, who has decided to leave everything behind, will come to realise that, at the end of the day, everything that happens to us is for our own good!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1hSaYzCU1zmwM46qxVTbJ7nLhQO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1132634'),
  ('281606678251375919', 'At the End of the Rainbow', 1971, 'Western', 'Aldo Florio', 'Eduardo Manzanos, Aldo Florio, Bruno Di Geronimo', 'Fabio Testi, Eduardo Fajardo, Luciano Pigozzi, Daniel Martín, Charo López, José Calvo, Ben Carra, Romano Puppo', null, 'Roy runs away from the labor camp of Santa Lucia with Emiliano, a New Mexico rancher, both imprisoned unjustly for three powerful American bankers, to seize the gold mine that had Emiliano. During flight, the landowner dies and in his last moments asked Roy to recover the mine and save Jessica, daughter of his former foreman.', 'Roy runs away from the labor camp of Santa Lucia with Emiliano, a New Mexico rancher, both imprisoned unjustly for three powerful American bankers, to seize the gold mine that had Emiliano. During flight, the landowner dies and in his last moments asked Roy to recover the mine and save Jessica, daughter of his former foreman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/swmcnr4lAYgk5kRRD4JShXs74mB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80631'),
  ('766420921041114268', 'At the End of the Spectra', 2006, 'Mystery, Horror', 'Juan Felipe Orozco', null, 'Noëlle Schonwald, Julieth Restrepo, Silvia de Dios, Kepa Amuchastegui, Manuel José Chaves, Carlos Serrato, Juan Pablo Aristizábal', null, 'After a traumatic situation that makes Vega become an agoraphobic person, she decides to live like a hermit in an apartment because of her father''s recommendation. But some strange things start happening, she sees visions, and hears noises and voices. She starts to worry about the dark past of that apartment, and the bizarre obsession of her neighbor.', 'After a traumatic situation that makes Vega become an agoraphobic person, she decides to live like a hermit in an apartment because of her father''s recommendation. But some strange things start happening, she sees visions, and hears noises and voices. She starts to worry about the dark past of that apartment, and the bizarre obsession of her neighbor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aD26sbzNE1hfmyKpVBuW8hgLTVP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40511'),
  ('480520271358626195', 'At the End of the Tunnel', 2016, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Félix "Chango" Monti, Rodrigo Grande', 'Rodrigo Grande', 'Leonardo Sbaraglia, Pablo Echarri, Clara Lago, Federico Luppi, Javier Godino, Uma Salduende', 'R', 'A paraplegic computer engineer who moves in a wheelchair and works in his basement starts hearing noises and voices of bank-robbers.', 'A paraplegic computer engineer who moves in a wheelchair and works in his basement starts hearing noises and voices of bank-robbers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gKfm5UqRwvoNiImFQLEH2WDMK5S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:394374'),
  ('244861942637860492', 'At the Ends of the Earth', 1999, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Konstantin Bronzit', 'Konstantin Bronzit', 'Konstantin Bronzit', null, 'A family lives in a house that teeters precariously on the very tip of a mountain. The balance of the house is affected not only by the family that lives inside, but also their cow, dog, cat, a passing bird, and a man with a couple of sheep who returns in a car. The slopes of the hill themselves also seem rather slippery at times.', 'A family lives in a house that teeters precariously on the very tip of a mountain. The balance of the house is affected not only by the family that lives inside, but also their cow, dog, cat, a passing bird, and a man with a couple of sheep who returns in a car. The slopes of the hill themselves also seem rather slippery at times.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kfEugmHx7oZroE58vP8l8o6Gf0F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:233880'),
  ('176098907915109000', 'At the First Breath of Wind', 2003, 'Drama', 'Franco Piavoli, Franco Piavoli', 'Franco Piavoli', 'Primo Gaburri, Mariella Fabbris, Ida Carnevali, Alessandra Agosti, Bianca Galeazzi, Lucky Ben Dele, Guglielmo Dal Corso, Ferruccio Bolognesi', null, 'Set on an August afternoon in the Lombardy countryside, a family lingers around the table after a long summer meal. As the day stretches on, each member moves off to their own activities, quietly passing the hours.', 'Set on an August afternoon in the Lombardy countryside, a family lingers around the table after a long summer meal. As the day stretches on, each member moves off to their own activities, quietly passing the hours.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hqMp9JaelgI1DTXlZndNRqxg9pG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:220005'),
  ('497068837066563233', 'At the Floral Ball', 1900, 'Music', 'Alice Guy-Blaché', null, 'Miss Lally, Miss Julyett', null, 'A turn-of-the-last-century hand-tinted short, which features two women, Miss Lally and Miss Julyett, dancing at a ball. By the legendary French filmmaker Alice Guy (attributed only, but not confirmed in any primary sources).', 'A turn-of-the-last-century hand-tinted short, which features two women, Miss Lally and Miss Julyett, dancing at a ball. By the legendary French filmmaker Alice Guy (attributed only, but not confirmed in any primary sources).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wjTb31aDvldzKMjKZOwXgQEMt8q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:119976'),
  ('338595761182009556', 'At the Gate of the Ghost', 2011, 'Mystery, Drama', 'Santi Piratsao, Pundhevanop Dhewakul, Phanom Phromachat', 'Pundhevanop Dhewakul, Ryūnosuke Akutagawa', 'Ananda Everingham, Chermarn Boonyasak, Dom Hetrakul, Mario Maurer, Petchtai Wongkamlao, Pongpat Wachirabunjong, Rudklao Amratisha, Sakarat Lerkthamrong', null, 'In this worthy adaptation of the Japanese film Rashomon, a young monk is left to determine the truth behind three competing perspectives after a bandit''s disturbing murder trial.', 'In this worthy adaptation of the Japanese film Rashomon, a young monk is left to determine the truth behind three competing perspectives after a bandit''s disturbing murder trial.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rcQPlRCHsePVznsLIjt3yCrdg6D.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74149'),
  ('810039313924161641', 'At the Grand Balcony', 1949, 'Drama', 'Henri Decoin, Nicolas Hayer', 'Marcel Rivet, Joseph Kessel', 'Georges Marchal, Pierre Fresnay, André Bervil, Félix Oudart, Janine Crispin, Germaine Michel, Abel Jacquin, Clément Thierry', null, 'World War I aviator Carbot attempts to establish a commercial airline after the war, for the purpose of delivering the mail to the outermost regions of France.', 'World War I aviator Carbot attempts to establish a commercial airline after the war, for the purpose of delivering the mail to the outermost regions of France.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xUKRh3VP46hb3BrpBJmMbef3Ia5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64896'),
  ('827074906032613911', 'At the Heart of Gold: Inside the USA Gymnastics Scandal', 2019, 'Documentary', 'Bryan Sarkinen, Erin Lee Carr', null, 'Simone Biles, McKayla Maroney, Aly Raisman, Jordyn Wieber, Rachael Denhollander, Dianne Feinstein, Nadia Comăneci, Larry Nassar', 'PG-13', 'A look inside the USA gymnastics sexual abuse scandal that shook the sports world in 2017 depicting a landscape in which women spend their youth seeking victory on a world stage, juxtaposed against a culture where abuse prevails and lives are damaged forever.', 'A look inside the USA gymnastics sexual abuse scandal that shook the sports world in 2017 depicting a landscape in which women spend their youth seeking victory on a world stage, juxtaposed against a culture where abuse prevails and lives are damaged forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a3t1RktaXBTfNmwzuIoTC4rpuJj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:557800'),
  ('1061007022463525964', 'At the Hypnotist''s', 1898, 'Comedy', 'Alice Guy-Blaché, Gaston Breteau, Georges Hatot', null, null, null, 'A hypnotist tricks his patients. There is no credited director for this film, although three different persons get attributed, Gaston Breteau, Alice Guy or Georges Hatot.', 'A hypnotist tricks his patients. There is no credited director for this film, although three different persons get attributed, Gaston Breteau, Alice Guy or Georges Hatot.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b3VCf6RhbECl30qlm4Ct0uzexjm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:119953'),
  ('731173611527454269', 'At the Meeting with Joyous Death', 1973, 'Horror, Drama', 'Juan Luis Buñuel, Antoine Gannagé, Ghislain Cloquet', 'Juan Luis Buñuel, Pierre-Jean Maintigneux', 'Françoise Fabian, Jean-Marc Bory, Jean-Pierre Darras, Claude Dauphin, Michel Creton, Gérard Depardieu, André Weber, Yasmine Dahm', null, 'The premise deals with a family living in a country-house which turns out to be ''alive'' – to the point where a TV crew is brought in to ''capture'' the paranormal phenomena', 'The premise deals with a family living in a country-house which turns out to be ''alive'' – to the point where a TV crew is brought in to ''capture'' the paranormal phenomena', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7HNRTdn2vpe7J63ZI9szUPto6hs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:121017'),
  ('119399246091144305', 'At the Midnight Hour', 1995, 'Drama, Romance', 'Charles Jarrott, Robert Fresco, Woody Sidarous', 'Joe Wiesenfeld', 'Patsy Kensit, Keegan MacIntosh, Cynthia Dale, Lindsay Merrithew, Simon MacCorkindale, Kay Hawtrey, Doug Lennox, Shawn Lawrence', 'PG-13', 'Wealthy widower Richard Keaton engages young widow Elizabeth ''Liz'' Guinness as the 4th consecutive nanny for his pre-teen, equally science-devoted son Andrew, with instructions to disturb neither. She learns of mother Alycia''s fatal fall, an official suicide but was probably murder. Dad keeps Andy at a distance, so he draws towards Liz. Real danger starts when Richard''s brother, novelist Blain, arrives with his friend Jillian, to sell the ancestral estate against Richard''s will.', 'Wealthy widower Richard Keaton engages young widow Elizabeth ''Liz'' Guinness as the 4th consecutive nanny for his pre-teen, equally science-devoted son Andrew, with instructions to disturb neither. She learns of mother Alycia''s fatal fall, an official suicide but was probably murder. Dad keeps Andy at a distance, so he draws towards Liz. Real danger starts when Richard''s brother, novelist Blain, arrives with his friend Jillian, to sell the ancestral estate against Richard''s will.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vM14KFQldRq3cjlo0CHfstzweAV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:135185'),
