  ('255212377171918256', 'At the Photographer''s', 1900, 'Comedy', 'Alice Guy-Blaché', null, null, null, 'A client has trouble listening to the photographer''s instructions.', 'A client has trouble listening to the photographer''s instructions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aEPMXOLIZX9c6ji3XPqU2pKJ0aj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:119970'),
  ('80172271289346650', 'At the Photographer''s', 1907, null, 'Johann Schwarzer', null, null, null, 'A photographer has a studio in which he asks women to pose in the nude or in daring clothes. Then he receives his all-male clientele, to show them (and the camera, via inserts) the results of his art. But a previous model who refused to take off her clothes, accusing him of harassment, returns with the police in tow.', 'A photographer has a studio in which he asks women to pose in the nude or in daring clothes. Then he receives his all-male clientele, to show them (and the camera, via inserts) the results of his art. But a previous model who refused to take off her clothes, accusing him of harassment, returns with the police in tow.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eZT7lMH8c9ueBGe4farqUVJeKWi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:196467'),
  ('104864254476194391', 'At the Sea', 2026, 'Drama', 'Kornél Mundruczó, Yorick Le Saux, Alexander Armero, Katie Valovcin', 'Kata Wéber', 'Amy Adams, Murray Bartlett, Chloe East, Brett Goldstein, Dan Levy', null, 'The film follows the life of Laura after a long rehabilitation, as she returns to her family at their beach holiday home where she has to readjust to the complicated life she left behind. Now she is forced to face the following next chapter of her life without the career that gave her fame, fortune and, most importantly, identity.', 'The film follows the life of Laura after a long rehabilitation, as she returns to her family at their beach holiday home where she has to readjust to the complicated life she left behind. Now she is forced to face the following next chapter of her life without the career that gave her fame, fortune and, most importantly, identity.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F8tQSsdN56xbrXYLMBm8At16icv3.jpg', 'plex:movie:at-the-sea-2026'),
  ('341368173812336473', 'At the Sports Bar', 1983, 'Comedy', 'Francesco Massaro, Bruno Cortini, Luigi Kuveiller', 'Franco Ferrini, Enrico Vanzina, Enrico Oldoini', 'Lino Banfi, Jerry Calà, Mara Venier, Annie Belle, Mirella Banti, Franco Barbero, Tognella, Annabella Schiavone', null, 'Lino lives in Turin with the family of his sister. He doesn''t have a good job and never enough money. But in a day his life changes: he wins 1 billion dollars in a lottery and... everyone becomes a friend, the girl who he liked becomes his girlfriend and his sister begins to love him. He leaves Turin with his friend Parola and, in a casino, he loses all money! But luck returns...', 'Lino lives in Turin with the family of his sister. He doesn''t have a good job and never enough money. But in a day his life changes: he wins 1 billion dollars in a lottery and... everyone becomes a friend, the girl who he liked becomes his girlfriend and his sister begins to love him. He leaves Turin with his friend Parola and, in a casino, he loses all money! But luck returns...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gXsLQgkpEFIpAXUnjJ5TwwjKNG2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45995'),
  ('298515717840689414', 'At War', 2018, 'Drama', 'Éric Dumont, Stéphane Brizé', 'Olivier Lemaire, Xavier Mathieu, Stéphane Brizé', 'Vincent Lindon, Mélanie Rover, Jacques Borderie, David Rey, Olivier Lemaire, Isabelle Rufin, Bruno Bourthol, Sébastien Vamelle', null, 'After promising 1100 employees that they would protect their jobs, the managers of a factory decide to suddenly close up shop. Laurent takes the lead in a fight against this decision.', 'After promising 1100 employees that they would protect their jobs, the managers of a factory decide to suddenly close up shop. Laurent takes the lead in a fight against this decision.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3kBy9hymoNzAGC2uwplYTgOVWb6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:485162'),
  ('963794859730487629', 'At War as at War', 1969, 'Drama, War', 'Viktor Tregubovich, Yevgeni Mezentsev, B. Dovlatov', 'Viktor Tregubovich, Viktor Kurochkin', 'Mikhail Kononov, Oleg Borisov, Viktor Pavlov, Fyodor Odinokov, Boris Tabarovsky, Mikhail Gluzskiy, Pyotr Lyubeshkin, Valentin Zubkov', null, 'The film tells about the fighting everyday life of the crew of self-propelled guns during the liberation of Right-Bank Ukraine. Junior Lieutenant Maleshkin, an unshooted graduate of the school, commands the crew of the self-propelled gun SU-100. All the subordinates of Maleshkin are older than him and much more experienced. The authority of the young commander is tested at every step, he quarrels, then reconciles with his crew. In addition, Maleshkin is very dissatisfied with the battery commander, he now and then threatens to remove the sluggish young officer from the command. In the crew of Maleshkin, various troubles constantly occur: either the driver will catch the commandant’s eyes in an untidy, grimy look, then a combat grenade with a dropped check will be discovered in the car, or a breakdown will occur just at the moment the regiment enters the march. Ending in a sprawling battle against German forces.', 'The film tells about the fighting everyday life of the crew of self-propelled guns during the liberation of Right-Bank Ukraine. Junior Lieutenant Maleshkin, an unshooted graduate of the school, commands the crew of the self-propelled gun SU-100. All the subordinates of Maleshkin are older than him and much more experienced. The authority of the young commander is tested at every step, he quarrels, then reconciles with his crew. In addition, Maleshkin is very dissatisfied with the battery commander, he now and then threatens to remove the sluggish young officer from the command. In the crew of Maleshkin, various troubles constantly occur: either the driver will catch the commandant’s eyes in an untidy, grimy look, then a combat grenade with a dropped check will be discovered in the car, or a breakdown will occur just at the moment the regiment enters the march. Ending in a sprawling battle against German forces.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qt5TOE4V0xil0fu7YpMXjz05Vqs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:89226'),
  ('211931077762059439', 'At War for Love', 2016, 'War, Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Pif, Roberto Forza, Alberto Mangiante', 'Marco Martani, Pif, Michele Astori', 'Pif, Miriam Leone, Andrea Di Stefano, Stella Egitto, David Mitchum Brown, Maurizio Marchetti, Sergio Vespertino, Maurizio Bologna', null, 'It''s 1943 and World War II is raging in Europe. In New York, Arturo and Flora the daughter of a restaurant owner are in love, but she is promised in marriage to the son of a Mafia boss. There is a way around this, but to be able to marry Flora, Arturo needs to get permission from her father, who lives in a village in Sicily. Arturo doesn''t have any money, so the only way he can get to Sicily is to enlist in the U.S. Army, which is preparing for a landing on the island.', 'It''s 1943 and World War II is raging in Europe. In New York, Arturo and Flora the daughter of a restaurant owner are in love, but she is promised in marriage to the son of a Mafia boss. There is a way around this, but to be able to marry Flora, Arturo needs to get permission from her father, who lives in a village in Sicily. Arturo doesn''t have any money, so the only way he can get to Sicily is to enlist in the U.S. Army, which is preparing for a landing on the island.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bmy7S1xTY9yLJTg48pxucx790xZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:403450'),
  ('1115451947419047241', 'At War with the Army', 1950, 'Comedy, War', 'Hal Walker, Frank McWhorter, Stuart Thompson', 'Fred F. Finklehoffe', 'Dean Martin, Jerry Lewis, Mike Kellin, Dick Stabile, Danny Dayton, Angela Greene, Polly Bergen, Dewey Robinson', 'NR', 'Two former nightclub partners are now enlisted in the Army. Sergeant Puccinelli ranks above his former partner, Private First Class Korwin. Puccinelli is desperately trying to get transferred from his dull job to active duty overseas. Meanwhile, all Korwin wants is a pass to see his wife and new baby.', 'Two former nightclub partners are now enlisted in the Army. Sergeant Puccinelli ranks above his former partner, Private First Class Korwin. Puccinelli is desperately trying to get transferred from his dull job to active duty overseas. Meanwhile, all Korwin wants is a pass to see his wife and new baby.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/viLzurxFrHbosBtTGf0gkPKa9qx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23325'),
  ('620323363208377715', 'At Work', 2026, 'Drama', 'Valérie Donzelli, Irina Lubtchansky, Faustine Chevrin', 'Valérie Donzelli, Gilles Marchand', 'Bastien Bouillon, Virginie Ledoyen, André Marcon, Valérie Donzelli, Marie Rivière, Adrien Barazzone, Marion Lecrivain, Oscar Tillette', null, 'A successful photographer gives up everything to devote himself to writing and discovers poverty.', 'A successful photographer gives up everything to devote himself to writing and discovers poverty.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pRECZt7LEHL4ZMkr1Hyol7lHkMi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1430820'),
  ('1011633111624732457', 'At World''s End', 2009, 'Adventure, Action, Comedy, Thriller', 'Tomas Villum Jensen, Jan Richter-Friis', 'Anders Thomas Jensen', 'Nikolaj Lie Kaas, Birgitte Hjort Sørensen, Nikolaj Coster-Waldau, Steven Berkoff, Matthias Hues, Bille Brown, Nicolas Bro, Blerim Destani', null, 'An english tv-team discovers a special white flower in the indonesian rainforest, but they never get to investegate it further, before the danish recluse Severin has shot them down. A danish special enforcement with a psychiatrist in front is sent off, and they find out, that Severin claims, that he is 129 years old, and it''s the flower, which keeps him young. Soon all hunts the white flower, which apparently gives eternal life.', 'An english tv-team discovers a special white flower in the indonesian rainforest, but they never get to investegate it further, before the danish recluse Severin has shot them down. A danish special enforcement with a psychiatrist in front is sent off, and they find out, that Severin claims, that he is 129 years old, and it''s the flower, which keeps him young. Soon all hunts the white flower, which apparently gives eternal life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d7A9uSwsqZHQJdPmrgRQcmuTrep.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19306'),
  ('474812917784314788', 'At Your Doorstep', 2016, 'Drama, Music', 'Eduard Cortés', null, 'Sílvia Pérez Cruz, Lluís Homar, Adriana Ozores, Iván Massague, Miguel Morón, Ivan Benet, Oriol Vila, Montse Morillo', null, 'Three stories intertwine as different people deal with the challenges of living through times of crisis. An evicted mother, a banker with a conscience and a police officer who has to do his job no matter what, sing and dance in this Brechtian musical drama about the economic crisis, people’s struggle with daily life, solidarity and hope.', 'Three stories intertwine as different people deal with the challenges of living through times of crisis. An evicted mother, a banker with a conscience and a police officer who has to do his job no matter what, sing and dance in this Brechtian musical drama about the economic crisis, people’s struggle with daily life, solidarity and hope.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hx4kSQMoXZN4pNk7f3arSSUP30v.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:346354'),
  ('425116279121593675', 'Ata Demirer: Tek Kişilik Dev Kadro', 2005, 'Comedy', 'Ali Taner Baltacı', 'Ata Demirer', 'Ata Demirer', null, 'The stand-up, which was staged 104 times from 2002 to 2005, hosted approximately 100,000 audiences. In this show, Ata Demirer reveals his unique style with scenes from Turkey, special characters and musical transitions.', 'The stand-up, which was staged 104 times from 2002 to 2005, hosted approximately 100,000 audiences. In this show, Ata Demirer reveals his unique style with scenes from Turkey, special characters and musical transitions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ujNXOFPyg6KIyJj5X90ncBvbxkp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80982'),
  ('280139206393608940', 'Ata Demirer: Tek Kişilik Dev Kadro 2', 2011, 'Comedy', 'Hakan Algül', 'Ata Demirer', 'Ata Demirer', null, 'Between 2007 and 2011, this stand-up was watched by approximately 100,000 people with 116 plays. “Ata Demirer One-Man Giant Staff 2”, which started to take the curtain almost ten years after the first “One Man Giant Staff” show, is a stand-up show enriched with popular culture references and musical details.', 'Between 2007 and 2011, this stand-up was watched by approximately 100,000 people with 116 plays. “Ata Demirer One-Man Giant Staff 2”, which started to take the curtain almost ten years after the first “One Man Giant Staff” show, is a stand-up show enriched with popular culture references and musical details.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iOgnRjGo7mE8pJl1e5EchUZa16D.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80983'),
  ('933862665266674755', 'Atacada: la teoría del dolor', 2015, 'Thriller', 'Aldo Miyashiro', 'Aldo Miyashiro', 'Érika Villalobos, Jason Day, Gustavo Cesti, Pierina Carcelén, Cristian Rivero', null, 'A young woman is sexually assaulted by a powerful businessman, starting a public trial in which she will have to endure the abuse of those who do not want justice to be made.', 'A young woman is sexually assaulted by a powerful businessman, starting a public trial in which she will have to endure the abuse of those who do not want justice to be made.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eplf3cvPy5lYjmkZUd6NDqaRstj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:329161'),
  ('1125511227457602827', 'Atacama''s 33', 2011, 'Drama', 'Antonio Recio Beladiez', 'Jacobo Bergareche, Antonio Recio Beladiez, J.J. Barrios', 'Alejandro Goic, Mario Soto, Cristian Mercado, Francisco González Hermosilla, Eduardo Barril, Mario Bustos, Jorge Yáñez, Rodrigo Muñoz', null, 'A team of Chilean miners are trapped underground for months and hold out for a miraculous rescue.', 'A team of Chilean miners are trapped underground for months and hold out for a miraculous rescue.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nvlHmxCupDKxQuS773wCGKLVpBL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61134'),
  ('753456273734528448', 'Atakan. The Bloody Legend', 2020, 'Horror', 'Dmitry Prosyannikov, Alexandr Grishin', 'Alexandra Radushinskaya, Evgeniy Labetskiy', 'Kseniya Plyusnina, Vladimir Kuznetsov, Denis Lukichev, Anna Serpeneva, Polina Strogaya', null, 'Atakan is a bloody boulder, a giant granite block, on which pagans sacrificed human sacrifices for centuries. A group of student historians, led by a young teacher, descend into the dungeons of St. Petersburg to find the legendary stone. With each step, the situation gets out of control, only death awaits them. The attack craves new blood. Who will survive?', 'Atakan is a bloody boulder, a giant granite block, on which pagans sacrificed human sacrifices for centuries. A group of student historians, led by a young teacher, descend into the dungeons of St. Petersburg to find the legendary stone. With each step, the situation gets out of control, only death awaits them. The attack craves new blood. Who will survive?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i44SqyITIbAeiTW4xAzTmDs5MRR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:696070'),
  ('652163356707891054', 'Atanarjuat: The Fast Runner', 2002, 'Fantasy, Drama', 'Zacharias Kunuk, Norman Cohn', 'Paul Apak Angilirq, Pauloosie Qulitalik, Zacharias Kunuk', 'Natar Ungalaaq, Sylvia Ivalu, Peter-Henry Arnatsiaq, Lucy Tulugarjuk, Pakak Innuksuk, Madeline Ivalu, Pauloosie Qulitalik, Eugene Ipkarnak', 'R', 'Based on a local legend and set in an unknown era, it deals with universal themes of love, possessiveness, family, jealousy and power. Beautifully shot, and acted by Inuit people, it portrays a time when people fought duels by taking turns to punch each other until one was unconscious, made love on the way to the caribou hunt, ate walrus meat and lit their igloos with seal-oil lamps.', 'Based on a local legend and set in an unknown era, it deals with universal themes of love, possessiveness, family, jealousy and power. Beautifully shot, and acted by Inuit people, it portrays a time when people fought duels by taking turns to punch each other until one was unconscious, made love on the way to the caribou hunt, ate walrus meat and lit their igloos with seal-oil lamps.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jSGiFOTwosoiAAXLTLHtzMUCVUN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13245'),
  ('826429037168237027', 'Atari: Game Over', 2014, 'Documentary', 'Zak Penn', 'Zak Penn', 'Nolan Bushnell, Howard Scott Warshaw, Manny Gerard, Joe Lewandowski, Paul Sanchez, Ernest Cline, Seamus Blackley, Raiford Guins', 'PG-13', 'The Xbox Originals documentary that chronicles the fall of the Atari Corporation through the lens of one of the biggest mysteries of all time, dubbed “The Great Video Game Burial of 1983.” Rumor claims that millions of returned and unsold E.T. cartridges were buried in the desert, but what really happened there?', 'The Xbox Originals documentary that chronicles the fall of the Atari Corporation through the lens of one of the biggest mysteries of all time, dubbed “The Great Video Game Burial of 1983.” Rumor claims that millions of returned and unsold E.T. cartridges were buried in the desert, but what really happened there?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/69VCXTki2gDutUhndJgU8UHlvxA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:284470'),
  ('867760529116443205', 'Atasco en la nacional', 2007, 'Comedy', 'Josetxo San Mateo, Ángel Luis Fernández', 'Josetxo San Mateo, Javier Muñoz', 'Pablo Carbonell, Anabel Alonso, Ana Polvorosa, Luisber Santiago, Christian Casani, Carles Castillo, Roberto San Martín, Malena Gracia', null, 'La familia Montoro se va de vacaciones a la playa de Cullera. Manuel, el padre, Soledad, la madre, Sergio y Estíbaliz, dos mellizos de dieciséis años que no se parecen en nada, y Álex, de cinco. Al iniciar el viaje, se ven inmersos en uno de los habituales atascos de esas fechas, por lo que terminan llegando tarde al apartahotel de Cullera. Allí les dicen que su apartamento ha sido alquilado, pues tenían que avisar si iban a llegar después de las seis. Tras la sorpresa y discusión, consiguen finalmente que les den un apartamento que tiene ciertas deficiencias… De esa forma comienzan sus vacaciones que no van a ser tan maravillosas como pensaban, pero que les van a deparar, también, las aventuras que nunca imaginaron.', 'La familia Montoro se va de vacaciones a la playa de Cullera. Manuel, el padre, Soledad, la madre, Sergio y Estíbaliz, dos mellizos de dieciséis años que no se parecen en nada, y Álex, de cinco. Al iniciar el viaje, se ven inmersos en uno de los habituales atascos de esas fechas, por lo que terminan llegando tarde al apartahotel de Cullera. Allí les dicen que su apartamento ha sido alquilado, pues tenían que avisar si iban a llegar después de las seis. Tras la sorpresa y discusión, consiguen finalmente que les den un apartamento que tiene ciertas deficiencias… De esa forma comienzan sus vacaciones que no van a ser tan maravillosas como pensaban, pero que les van a deparar, también, las aventuras que nunca imaginaron.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5cRSkInUJcOvTBzglrZfwhiWpH9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32537'),
  ('552038117674231810', 'Atatürk 1881 - 1919', 2023, 'History, Drama, War', 'Mehmet Ada Öztekin, Torben Forsberg, Kemal Aydoğan', 'Necati Şahin', 'Aras Bulut Iynemli, Songül Öden, Sarp Akkaya, Esra Bilgiç, Mehmet Günsür, Celile Toyon, Darko Perić, Berk Cankat', null, 'A biopic focusing on to the childhood and the early years of the military career of the founder and the first President of the Turkish Republic, Mustafa Kemal Atatürk.', 'A biopic focusing on to the childhood and the early years of the military career of the founder and the first President of the Turkish Republic, Mustafa Kemal Atatürk.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fVebJc8quJGZPGRRNrQpb54xdw1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1184606'),
  ('499350637522766993', 'Atatürk II 1881 – 1919', 2024, 'History, Drama, War', 'Mehmet Ada Öztekin', 'Necati Şahin', 'Aras Bulut Iynemli, Songül Öden, Sarp Akkaya, Esra Bilgiç, Alican Barlas, Berk Cankat, Lidija Kordić', null, 'Mustafa Kemal had just begun his journey after proving himself in 1915 at the Gallipoli front. He would go on to face major battles on the eastern front against the Russians and later against the British in Syria, ultimately becoming the only Ottoman officer not to lose a battle during WW1. However, despite all his success, he would encounter an unexpected challenge upon his return to Istanbul.', 'Mustafa Kemal had just begun his journey after proving himself in 1915 at the Gallipoli front. He would go on to face major battles on the eastern front against the Russians and later against the British in Syria, ultimately becoming the only Ottoman officer not to lose a battle during WW1. However, despite all his success, he would encounter an unexpected challenge upon his return to Istanbul.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mmUxzWaQp1HrdySFl7cIjPkms0E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1198904'),
  ('571990987861124761', 'Atàvic', 2026, 'Horror', 'Albert Blay', null, 'María Bonet, Mar Linares, Ferran Rull', null, 'A group of filmmakers sets out to document an isolated rural community rumored to practice ancient rituals, but their investigation quickly unravels as they encounter something far older and more disturbing than expected.', 'A group of filmmakers sets out to document an isolated rural community rumored to practice ancient rituals, but their investigation quickly unravels as they encounter something far older and more disturbing than expected.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/evL003QEIvIpoFSSxWu6zFYoiMl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1450216'),
  ('33757224272094724', 'Atelier Fontana', 2011, 'Drama', 'Riccardo Milani', 'Lucia Maria Zei', 'Alessandra Mastronardi, Anna Valle, Federica De Cola, Anna Bonaiuto, Marco Bocci', null, 'The drama recounts the life and career of unparalleled three sisters Fountain. Micol is just a dressmaker with 500 pounds in his pocket when she arrives in Rome with her sisters Giovanna and Zoe. The effort of the beginnings is compensated by a passion for fashion that never fails, until the day when the whole world notices them.', 'The drama recounts the life and career of unparalleled three sisters Fountain. Micol is just a dressmaker with 500 pounds in his pocket when she arrives in Rome with her sisters Giovanna and Zoe. The effort of the beginnings is compensated by a passion for fashion that never fails, until the day when the whole world notices them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3rFR4e9ySf21FWe9gufVciz6oaa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85463'),
  ('1142059554018823961', 'Ateliers de La Ciotat', 1896, 'Documentary', 'Louis Lumière', null, null, null, 'Men working at the shipyards of La Ciotat.', 'Men working at the shipyards of La Ciotat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8xgyQnQSLSoZzB4iaI2YGGnXABo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:189581'),
  ('403465864663537050', 'Athadu', 2005, 'Action, Thriller, Family', 'Naveenbandi, Trivikram Srinivas, K. V. Guhan', 'Trivikram Srinivas', 'Mahesh Babu, Trisha Krishnan, Sonu Sood, Prakash Raj, Nassar, Kota Srinivasa Rao, Sayaji Shinde, Sunil Varma', null, 'A hitman, Nandu, is hired to stage the assassination of a politician. However, when the politician is actually killed and Nandu is framed for the murder, he assumes a dead man''s identity to evade the law.', 'A hitman, Nandu, is hired to stage the assassination of a politician. However, when the politician is actually killed and Nandu is framed for the murder, he assumes a dead man''s identity to evade the law.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AlopJ5sUgsf0pFn8FfXqdhyfL2Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37172'),
  ('828519362189193945', 'Athena', 2022, 'Action, Adventure, Thriller, Drama', 'Romain Gavras, Mohamed Belhamar, Lola Berteloot', 'Ladj Ly, Romain Gavras, Elias Belkeddar', 'Dali Benssalah, Anthony Bajon, Alexis Manenti, Ouassini Embarek, Sami Slimane, Radostina Rogliano, Karim Lasmi, Mehdi Abdelhakmi', 'R', 'Hours after the tragic death of their youngest brother in unexplained circumstances, three siblings have their lives thrown into chaos.', 'Hours after the tragic death of their youngest brother in unexplained circumstances, three siblings have their lives thrown into chaos.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s8B0GsFEebd0DW2spykLMxnc1Kn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:852046'),
  ('374489326963501312', 'Athena: Goddess of War', 2011, 'Action, Thriller', 'Kim Young-jun, Kim Tae-hun, Choi Eun-jong', 'Yoo Nam-Gyung, Kim Hyeon-jun', 'Jung Woo-sung, Cha Seung-won, Soo Ae, Kim Min-jong, Ricky Kim, Lee Ji-ah, Choi Si-won, Kim Seung-woo', null, 'Sometime in the near future, the Korean peninsula attempts to reunify. The South Korean government, which needs enormous funds for the unification to succeed, develops a landmark new technology called the TWR. The TWR is a high speed nuclear reactor and other countries want the technology. To prevent terror in the aftermath of the TWR breakthrough, the government establishes a new organization named NTS (National Anti-Terror Service). Jung-Woo (Jung Woo-Sung) is transferred to the NTS group from the NIS. He''s excited about the transfer and hopes to live the life of a real agent, but then discovers his main responsibility is to watch North Korean defectors.', 'Sometime in the near future, the Korean peninsula attempts to reunify. The South Korean government, which needs enormous funds for the unification to succeed, develops a landmark new technology called the TWR. The TWR is a high speed nuclear reactor and other countries want the technology. To prevent terror in the aftermath of the TWR breakthrough, the government establishes a new organization named NTS (National Anti-Terror Service). Jung-Woo (Jung Woo-Sung) is transferred to the NTS group from the NIS. He''s excited about the transfer and hopes to live the life of a real agent, but then discovers his main responsibility is to watch North Korean defectors.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nrOGMQswDTSQWYqN37IHQ9o1G2y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:97872'),
  ('1193863130671928', 'Athlete', 2019, 'Drama, Romance', 'Takamasa Oe', 'Yasutoshi Murakawa', 'Joe Nakamura, Kondo Yohdi, Reina Tasaki, Yoshiaki Umegaki, Minamoto Rai', 'NR', 'Ex-swimmer Kōhei, facing divorce, meets aspiring animator Yūtaka in Tokyo’s gay district. Their fiery attraction deepens amid emotional highs and lows.', 'Ex-swimmer Kōhei, facing divorce, meets aspiring animator Yūtaka in Tokyo’s gay district. Their fiery attraction deepens amid emotional highs and lows.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qM1zyK8AkFCljRciLata7rpIE3C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:598570'),
  ('307397160165599160', 'Athlete A', 2020, 'Documentary', 'Jon Shenk, Bonni Cohen, Jon Shenk', null, 'Maggie Nichols, Jamie Dantzscher, Mark Alesia, Rachael Denhollander, Géza Poszar, Tracee Talavera, Jennifer Sey', 'PG-13', 'Follow the Indianapolis Star reporters that broke the story about USA Gymnastics doctor Larry Nassar''s abuse and hear from gymnasts.', 'Follow the Indianapolis Star reporters that broke the story about USA Gymnastics doctor Larry Nassar''s abuse and hear from gymnasts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jUVbqKcDgcLSS5s4UV82XUkMKlU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:684700'),
  ('301210750156942229', 'Athos', 2016, 'Documentary', 'Christian Wiege, Peter Bardehle, Andreas Martin', 'Andreas Martin, Peter Bardehle', 'Father Akakios, Father Alypios, Father Avakum, Father Epiphanios, Father Philoumenos, Father Galaktion, Father Grigorios, Father Josef', null, 'The Athos peninsula in Greece is one of Europe''s last secrets. Over 2000 monks live on Athos - cut off from the outside world. Access is denied to women, tourists are not welcome. Only workers and pilgrims can obtain a visa. The "Autonomous Monastic State of the Holy Mountain" attracts people who feel like they are missing something from their modern lives. With the help of three Athos monks, "Athos - A Taste of Heaven" tells the story of the island and its inhabitants in a unique filmed diary style. The film''s guiding theme is the path we as people have to find and follow - each and everyone for themselves. "First we must heal our own souls, only then we can help others", is one of Father Galaktions core messages. He lives as a hermit on the holy mountain. Not all monks, however, live as secluded and demure as Father Galaktion. The film team is also received by Father Epiphanios - a gifted and poetic cook who certainly does not disdain the pleasures of life.', 'The Athos peninsula in Greece is one of Europe''s last secrets. Over 2000 monks live on Athos - cut off from the outside world. Access is denied to women, tourists are not welcome. Only workers and pilgrims can obtain a visa. The "Autonomous Monastic State of the Holy Mountain" attracts people who feel like they are missing something from their modern lives. With the help of three Athos monks, "Athos - A Taste of Heaven" tells the story of the island and its inhabitants in a unique filmed diary style. The film''s guiding theme is the path we as people have to find and follow - each and everyone for themselves. "First we must heal our own souls, only then we can help others", is one of Father Galaktions core messages. He lives as a hermit on the holy mountain. Not all monks, however, live as secluded and demure as Father Galaktion. The film team is also received by Father Epiphanios - a gifted and poetic cook who certainly does not disdain the pleasures of life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8gXoDGOkL6JaOC0ohgFaR99Gc74.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:443843'),
  ('432260749659906136', 'ATHOS Au coeur de la Patrouille de France', 2026, 'Documentary, Action', 'Mathieu Giombini', null, null, null, 'Follows the French Air and Space Force''s aerobatics team for one year, documenting their selection process, training, and aerial performances.', 'Follows the French Air and Space Force''s aerobatics team for one year, documenting their selection process, training, and aerial performances.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FpV3dRAQXGXhZKn1cl4R6p7dijHQ.jpg', 'plex:movie:athos-au-coeur-de-la-patrouille-de-france'),
  ('371222808802805318', 'Atithi Tum Kab Jaoge?', 2010, 'Comedy', 'Ashwni Dhir, Honey Trehan, Aseem Bajaj', 'Robin Bhatt, Tushar Hiranandani', 'Ajay Devgn, Konkona Sen Sharma, Paresh Rawal, Sanjay Mishra, Mukesh Tiwari, Satish Kaushik, Akhilendra Mishra, Viju Khote', 'PG', 'The story of a happily married couple living in Mumbai whose lives take an interesting turn when a distant relative turns up unannounced at their doorstep from a far off village.', 'The story of a happily married couple living in Mumbai whose lives take an interesting turn when a distant relative turns up unannounced at their doorstep from a far off village.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cia1gaHHjO626oSSH5Pf9hwbXN0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34144'),
  ('181577814045964577', 'ATL', 2006, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Karsten ''Crash'' Gopinath, Charles Croughwell, Chris Robinson', 'Tina Gordon, Antwone Fisher', 'T.I., Evan Ross, Jackie Long, Lauren London, Albert Daniels, Big Boi, Jason Weaver, Keith David', 'PG-13', 'As four friends prepare for life after high school, different challenges bring about turning points in each of their lives. The dramas unfold and resolve at their local rollerskating rink, Cascade.', 'As four friends prepare for life after high school, different challenges bring about turning points in each of their lives. The dramas unfold and resolve at their local rollerskating rink, Cascade.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wi9VRukGburXfDwDKqcQQdgFK5S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13960'),
  ('390868944042258937', 'Atla Gel Şaban', 1984, 'Comedy', 'Natuk Baytan, Meral Bayer, Zuhal Üstüntaş', 'Aydemir Akbaş', 'Kemal Sunal, Nevra Serezli, Dinçer Çekmez, Turgut Özatay, Reha Yurdakul, Zihni Göktay, Metin Çekmez, Renan Fosforoğlu', null, 'Niyazi is a humble factory worker whose life is turned upside down when he wins the “altılı ganyan” (six-horse accumulator) lottery. Suddenly, everyone from neighbours to total strangers, claiming to be his long-lost relatives, crowds around him hoping for a share of his fortune. Thanks to his quick wit, Niyazi manages to outsmart these opportunists and keep his winnings.', 'Niyazi is a humble factory worker whose life is turned upside down when he wins the “altılı ganyan” (six-horse accumulator) lottery. Suddenly, everyone from neighbours to total strangers, claiming to be his long-lost relatives, crowds around him hoping for a share of his fortune. Thanks to his quick wit, Niyazi manages to outsmart these opportunists and keep his winnings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A8AO47pfYfxK1LaZ6hftntjx7Jg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52285'),
  ('819934411305526007', 'Atlantic', 1929, 'Drama', 'E.A. Dupont, Charles Rosher, Marjorie Gaffney', 'Victor Kendall', 'Franklin Dyall, Ellaline Terriss, Donald Calthrop, Madeleine Carroll, Monty Banks, Joan Barry, John Stuart, Helen Haye', 'NR', 'English-language version. "Atlantic" is a drama film based on the sinking of the RMS "Titanic" and set aboard a fictional ship, called the "Atlantic". The main plotline revolves around a man who has a shipboard affair with a fellow passenger, which is eventually discovered by his wife. The ship also has aboard an elderly couple, the Rools, who are on their anniversary cruise. Midway across the Atlantic Ocean, the "Atlantic" strikes an iceberg and is damaged to the point where it is sinking into the Atlantic.', 'English-language version. "Atlantic" is a drama film based on the sinking of the RMS "Titanic" and set aboard a fictional ship, called the "Atlantic". The main plotline revolves around a man who has a shipboard affair with a fellow passenger, which is eventually discovered by his wife. The ship also has aboard an elderly couple, the Rools, who are on their anniversary cruise. Midway across the Atlantic Ocean, the "Atlantic" strikes an iceberg and is damaged to the point where it is sinking into the Atlantic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7pMyokJtzh0rZGOJWlJ3xAxUZuA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:190373'),
  ('322511418531394936', 'Atlantic Bar', 2023, 'Documentary', 'Fanny Molins, Martin Roux', null, null, null, 'At l''Atlantic Bar, Nathalie, the owner, is at the center of attention. Here, people sing, dance and hold each other close. After the bar is put up for sale, Nathalie and the regulars are faced with the end of their world and the loss of a place, at times harmful, but desperately needed.', 'At l''Atlantic Bar, Nathalie, the owner, is at the center of attention. Here, people sing, dance and hold each other close. After the bar is put up for sale, Nathalie and the regulars are faced with the end of their world and the loss of a place, at times harmful, but desperately needed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rRQ4oE4g15NauCIWRaG57jQIk3W.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:964808'),
  ('856413679937797915', 'Atlantic City', 1980, 'Crime, Drama, Romance', 'Louis Malle, Richard Ciupka, Jim Chory', 'John Guare', 'Burt Lancaster, Susan Sarandon, Kate Reid, Michel Piccoli, Hollis McLaren, Robert Joy, Al Waxman, Robert Goulet', 'R', 'In a corrupt city, a small-time gangster and the estranged wife of a pot dealer find themselves thrown together in an escapade of love, money, drugs and danger.', 'In a corrupt city, a small-time gangster and the estranged wife of a pot dealer find themselves thrown together in an escapade of love, money, drugs and danger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t7COhy9HkznR0gcdhTNwtHmBN31.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23954'),
  ('1083573506546207387', 'Atlantic Rim', 2013, 'Action, Science Fiction', 'Jared Cohn, Alexander Yellen, Ken Cosentino', 'Thunder Levin, Richard Lima, Hank Woon Jr', 'Graham Greene, David Chokachi, Jackie Moore, Treach, Nicole Alexandra Shipley, Jared Cohn, Jinhi Evans, Steven Marlow', 'R', 'When monsters suddenly appear from the bottom of the Atlantic Ocean, a special team pilots giant robots to combat the new threat.', 'When monsters suddenly appear from the bottom of the Atlantic Ocean, a special team pilots giant robots to combat the new threat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/weK1hp8lVe8kcNtIsRaLD3GzCfE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:203351'),
  ('1057774009831516537', 'Atlantic Wall', 1970, 'Adventure, Comedy, War', 'Marcel Camus, Alain Levent, Claude Carliez', 'Marcel Jullian', 'Bourvil, Sophie Desmarets, Peter McEnery, Sara Franchetti, Jean Poiret, Reinhard Kolldehoff, Pino Caruso, Terry-Thomas', null, '1944. Léon Duchemin owns a restaurant with his sister. His clients are Germans, Résistance et black marketeers. Léon unwillingly joins the Résistance when a British pilot is shot down and hides in his attic and, through a series of mishaps, he accidentally steals the plans for Hitler''s V1 missiles.', '1944. Léon Duchemin owns a restaurant with his sister. His clients are Germans, Résistance et black marketeers. Léon unwillingly joins the Résistance when a British pilot is shot down and hides in his attic and, through a series of mishaps, he accidentally steals the plans for Hitler''s V1 missiles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ptT65WBRA2wMHTpbDi8EqpXKXK4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61231'),
  ('718810907060121439', 'Atlantics', 2019, 'Drama, Romance, Fantasy', 'Laura Bücher, Mati Diop, Claire Mathon', 'Mati Diop, Olivier Demangel', 'Mame Bineta Sane, Amadou Mbow, Ibrahima Traore, Nicole Sougou, Aminata Kane, Mariama Gassama, Coumba Dieng, Ibrahima Mbaye', 'PG-13', 'Arranged to marry a rich man, young Ada is crushed when her true love goes missing at sea during a migration attempt — until a miracle reunites them.', 'Arranged to marry a rich man, young Ada is crushed when her true love goes missing at sea during a migration attempt — until a miracle reunites them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zRnZM6HqglFK31MYyrTSQVlj1dQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:496967'),
  ('1001920724931788006', 'Atlántida', 2014, 'Drama', 'Inés María Barrionuevo, Ezequiel Salinas', 'Inés María Barrionuevo', 'Melissa Romero, Florencia Decall, Sol Zavala, Guillermo Pfening, Axel Prato, Marcos Lazarte, Victoria Castelo Arzubialde, Julián Hellrigc', null, 'In the summer of 1987 in a town in Córdoba, two teenage sisters, Elena and Lucia, are alone at home. The youngest is upset with her older sister, who thinks about how to get out of that town, to study and to live differently.', 'In the summer of 1987 in a town in Córdoba, two teenage sisters, Elena and Lucia, are alone at home. The youngest is upset with her older sister, who thinks about how to get out of that town, to study and to live differently.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/brP04zgW5N3tw1Ht5dFgcYj92Sr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:288618'),
  ('21981738588550509', 'Atlantide', 2022, 'Drama, Documentary', 'Yuri Ancarani, Yuri Ancarani', 'Yuri Ancarani', 'Daniele Barison, Maila Dabalà, Bianka Berényi, Alberto Tedesco, Jacopo Torcellan', null, 'Daniele is a young man from Sant’Erasmo, an island on the edges of the Venice Lagoon. He lives on his wits, isolated even from his peer group who are busy exploring an existence of pleasure-seeking expressed in the cult of the barchino (motorboat). This obsession focuses on the building of ever more powerful engines to transform the little lagoon launches into dangerously fast racing boats. Daniele too dreams of a record-breaking barchino, one that will take him to the top of the leader board, but everything he does to further his dream and win respect from the others turns out to be tragically counterproductive. The decline that erodes the relationships, environment and habits of a rootless generation is observed from the timeless perspective of the Venetian landscape and its island outskirts: the point of no return is a foolish, vestigial tale of male initiation. Violent and destined to fail, it explodes dragging the ghost city along on a psychedelic shipwreck.', 'Daniele is a young man from Sant’Erasmo, an island on the edges of the Venice Lagoon. He lives on his wits, isolated even from his peer group who are busy exploring an existence of pleasure-seeking expressed in the cult of the barchino (motorboat). This obsession focuses on the building of ever more powerful engines to transform the little lagoon launches into dangerously fast racing boats. Daniele too dreams of a record-breaking barchino, one that will take him to the top of the leader board, but everything he does to further his dream and win respect from the others turns out to be tragically counterproductive. The decline that erodes the relationships, environment and habits of a rootless generation is observed from the timeless perspective of the Venetian landscape and its island outskirts: the point of no return is a foolish, vestigial tale of male initiation. Violent and destined to fail, it explodes dragging the ghost city along on a psychedelic shipwreck.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yhcNnMrZB46rvsWFwvGQxNaMIFO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:854317'),
  ('35725406503544656', 'Atlantiques', 2009, 'Documentary, Drama', 'Mati Diop, Mati Diop, El H. Sambi Sarr', 'Mati Diop', 'Ouli Seck, Serigne Seck, Alpha Diop, Cheikh M''Baye, Ibou Laye, Vieux Seck, Asta M''Boup', null, 'The odyssey of Senegalese friends who attempt a life-threatening boat crossing.', 'The odyssey of Senegalese friends who attempt a life-threatening boat crossing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kIdQDhIwHYt5VUw0g8EVSDOY1aX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:141569'),
  ('510175392649814611', 'Atlantis', 1991, 'Music, Documentary', 'Luc Besson, Marie Guesnier', null, null, null, 'Atlantis is filmmaker Luc Besson''s celebration of the beauty and wonder of the world beneath the sea, expanding upon themes touched on in his film The Big Blue. Combining stunning underwater cinematography and a hypnotic score by Eric Serra, Besson''s singular vision defies dialogue or narrative structure to explore ocean life as you''ve never seen it before. Following the colossal success of The Big Blue, Luc Besson crisscrossed the world''s seas and oceans to film the beauty and diversity of marine life: from the giant octopuses of Vancouver to the manta rays of the Pacific (New Caledonia), and the grey sharks of Tahiti. A film with no actors or sets other than the underwater world. A breathtaking view of marine species: sharks, dolphins, manatees, octopuses. An exploration of the seabed in the Bahamas, the Galapagos, Vancouver, and Tahiti.', 'Atlantis is filmmaker Luc Besson''s celebration of the beauty and wonder of the world beneath the sea, expanding upon themes touched on in his film The Big Blue. Combining stunning underwater cinematography and a hypnotic score by Eric Serra, Besson''s singular vision defies dialogue or narrative structure to explore ocean life as you''ve never seen it before. Following the colossal success of The Big Blue, Luc Besson crisscrossed the world''s seas and oceans to film the beauty and diversity of marine life: from the giant octopuses of Vancouver to the manta rays of the Pacific (New Caledonia), and the grey sharks of Tahiti. A film with no actors or sets other than the underwater world. A breathtaking view of marine species: sharks, dolphins, manatees, octopuses. An exploration of the seabed in the Bahamas, the Galapagos, Vancouver, and Tahiti.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Y9GVuu0tVPUWvcFufTkBLg2840.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15466'),
  ('743216825671723214', 'Atlantis', 2020, 'War, Drama, Science Fiction', 'Valentyn Vasyanovych, Valentyn Vasyanovych', 'Valentyn Vasyanovych', 'Andrii Rymaruk, Liudmyla Bileka, Vasyl Antoniak, Kateryna Popravka, Oleksandr Sobko', null, 'A soldier suffering from PTSD befriends a young volunteer hoping to restore peaceful energy to a war-torn society.', 'A soldier suffering from PTSD befriends a young volunteer hoping to restore peaceful energy to a war-torn society.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/PbloUeFTTquf6jC5gyPy3YfHZc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:618245'),
  ('462714792268607052', 'Atlantis: Milo''s Return', 2003, 'Fantasy, Animation, Science Fiction, Family, Action', 'Victor Cook, Tad Stones, Toby Shelton', 'Henry Gilroy, Kevin Hopps, Steve Englehart', 'James Arnold Taylor, Cree Summer, John Mahoney, Jacqueline Obradors, Don Novello, Corey Burton, Phil Morris, Florence Stanley', 'G', 'Milo and Kida reunite with their friends to investigate strange occurances around the world that seem to have links to the secrets of Atlantis.', 'Milo and Kida reunite with their friends to investigate strange occurances around the world that seem to have links to the secrets of Atlantis.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hyAbWGld5WLdrmUB9OHyewcJQGL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8965'),
  ('407185414746008153', 'Atlantis: The Lost Continent', 1961, 'Adventure, Fantasy', 'George Pal, Harold E. Wellman', 'Daniel Mainwaring', 'Sal Ponti, Joyce Taylor, John Dall, William Smith, Edward Platt, Frank De Kova, Berry Kroeger, Edgar Stehli', null, 'A Greek Fisherman brings an Atlantean Princess back to her homeland which is the mythical city of Atlantis. He is enslaved for his trouble. The King is being manipulated by an evil sorcerer who is bent on using a natural resource of Atlantis to take over the world. The Atlanteans, or rather the slaves of Atlantis, are forced to mine a crystalline material which absorbs the suns rays. These crystals can then be used for warmth. The misuse of science has created weapons out of the crystals that can fire a heat ray to destroy whatever it touches.', 'A Greek Fisherman brings an Atlantean Princess back to her homeland which is the mythical city of Atlantis. He is enslaved for his trouble. The King is being manipulated by an evil sorcerer who is bent on using a natural resource of Atlantis to take over the world. The Atlanteans, or rather the slaves of Atlantis, are forced to mine a crystalline material which absorbs the suns rays. These crystals can then be used for warmth. The misuse of science has created weapons out of the crystals that can fire a heat ray to destroy whatever it touches.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ygC5yVRyrXqwMSmcpvf2khjThAR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28758'),
  ('391647629840692598', 'Atlantis: The Lost Empire', 2001, 'Animation, Family, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Gary Trousdale, Kirk Wise', 'Tab Murphy', 'Michael J. Fox, Cree Summer, James Garner, Claudia Christian, Corey Burton, Phil Morris, Jacqueline Obradors, Don Novello', 'PG', 'A young linguist named Milo Thatch joins an intrepid group of explorers to find the mysterious lost continent of Atlantis.', 'A young linguist named Milo Thatch joins an intrepid group of explorers to find the mysterious lost continent of Atlantis.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rdCyK9hgoA2vYrLtVFpDc3KWBaC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10865'),
  ('715048654143772046', 'Atlas', 1961, 'Adventure, Action, Fantasy', 'Roger Corman, Henry Yatron, Basil Maros', 'Charles B. Griffith', 'Michael Forest, Barboura Morris, Frank Wolff, Walter Maslow, Andreas Filippides, Jean Moore, Christos Exarchos, Robert Hudson', 'NR', 'Evil king Praximedes convinces superhero Atlas to fight for him, but Atlas eventually sees the king''s true nature and turns against him.', 'Evil king Praximedes convinces superhero Atlas to fight for him, but Atlas eventually sees the king''s true nature and turns against him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4Ydqzv9bxgxhFGS7syokvI7yX2X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29066'),
  ('604356061274768748', 'Atlas', 2013, 'Documentary', 'Antoine D''Agata, Antoine D''Agata', 'Antoine D''Agata', 'Antoine D''Agata', null, 'The renowned French Magnum photographer - again and always - uses his sublime camera and whole being to reveal a parallel world of prostitution and drugs, punctuated by exhausted bodies and lost souls in Cambodia, Russia and India. Disturbing surely, but also transcendental.', 'The renowned French Magnum photographer - again and always - uses his sublime camera and whole being to reveal a parallel world of prostitution and drugs, punctuated by exhausted bodies and lost souls in Cambodia, Russia and India. Disturbing surely, but also transcendental.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ejb7ATadMt09THYWmbxuezMLVFn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:250300'),
  ('391325078925265578', 'Atlas', 2018, 'Drama', 'David Nawrath, Tobias von dem Borne, Stefan Nickel', 'David Nawrath, Paul Salisbury', 'Rainer Bock, Albrecht Schuch, Uwe Preuss, Thorsten Merten, Nina Gummich, Friederike Bellstedt, Roman Kanonik, Mohammad-Ali Behboudi', null, 'Walter is a 60-year-old removal man for forced evictions. He recognizes in one of the tenants about to be evicted his estranged son, Jan. In order to help Jan, Walter has to confront not only his crooked boss but also his own past.', 'Walter is a 60-year-old removal man for forced evictions. He recognizes in one of the tenants about to be evicted his estranged son, Jan. In order to help Jan, Walter has to confront not only his crooked boss but also his own past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xP9Da09itvve7r3Lj7twji8eQ0S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:565388'),
  ('905602515889057862', 'Atlas', 2021, 'Drama', 'Pietro Zuercher, Niccolò Castelli, Andrea de Stoutz', 'Stefano Pasetto, Niccolò Castelli', 'Matilda De Angelis, Helmi Dridi, Angelo Bison, Nicola Perot, Kevin Blaser, Irene Casagrande, Anna Manuelli, Anna Ferruzzo', null, 'Passionate for climbing, Allegra is victim of a terrorist attack, in which her friends lose their lives. She isolates herself after crushing fear towards people and a burning desire for revenge start devouring her. Her beloved ones are helpless. In order to be able to go back enjoying her life, she will have to face her inner struggles. In doing so, Arad – a young refugee from Middle East – crosses her path. Allegra’s greatest challenge will be regaining trust, especially when the element of diversity is involved.', 'Passionate for climbing, Allegra is victim of a terrorist attack, in which her friends lose their lives. She isolates herself after crushing fear towards people and a burning desire for revenge start devouring her. Her beloved ones are helpless. In order to be able to go back enjoying her life, she will have to face her inner struggles. In doing so, Arad – a young refugee from Middle East – crosses her path. Allegra’s greatest challenge will be regaining trust, especially when the element of diversity is involved.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hADNRmrv22KaKlKgBwfPeI8MlTP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:787836'),
  ('157539046195854199', 'Atlas', 2024, 'Science Fiction, Action', 'John Schwartzman, Brad Peyton, Richard Goodwin', 'Aron Eli Coleite, Leo Sardarian', 'Jennifer Lopez, Simu Liu, Sterling K. Brown, Gregory James Cohan, Abraham Popoola, Lana Parrilla, Mark Strong, Briella Guiza', 'PG-13', 'A brilliant counterterrorism analyst with a deep distrust of AI discovers it might be her only hope when a mission to capture a renegade robot goes awry.', 'A brilliant counterterrorism analyst with a deep distrust of AI discovers it might be her only hope when a mission to capture a renegade robot goes awry.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bcM2Tl5HlsvPBnL8DKP9Ie6vU4r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:614933'),
  ('49888879379110319', 'Atlas Shrugged: Part I', 2011, 'Drama, Thriller, Science Fiction, Mystery', 'Paul Johansson, Ross Berryman, Aaron Barsky', 'Brian Patrick O''Toole, John Aglialoro', 'Taylor Schilling, Grant Bowler, Matthew Marsden, Edi Gathegi, Jsu Garcia, Graham Beckel, Jon Polito, Patrick Fischler', 'PG-13', 'A powerful railroad executive, Dagny Taggart, struggles to keep her business alive while society is crumbling around her. Based on the 1957 novel by Ayn Rand.', 'A powerful railroad executive, Dagny Taggart, struggles to keep her business alive while society is crumbling around her. Based on the 1957 novel by Ayn Rand.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tYfZIQb6ZabSUy1s1TRqSrYaAoM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56780'),
  ('329070358167748159', 'Atlas Shrugged: Part II', 2012, 'Drama, Science Fiction, Mystery', 'John Putch, Ross Berryman, Richard E. White', 'Duke Sandefur, Brian Patrick O''Toole, Duncan Scott', 'Samantha Mathis, Jason Beghe, Esai Morales, Patrick Fabian, Kim Rhodes, Richard T. Jones, D. B. Sweeney, Paul McCrane', 'PG-13', 'Railroad owner Dagny Taggart and steel mogul Henry Rearden search desperately for the inventor of a revolutionary motor as the U.S. government continues to spread its control over the national economy.', 'Railroad owner Dagny Taggart and steel mogul Henry Rearden search desperately for the inventor of a revolutionary motor as the U.S. government continues to spread its control over the national economy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9iwPz9zy1uCP73QMxhNs6gaTTom.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:134371'),
  ('212906340358560319', 'Atlas Shrugged: Part III', 2014, 'Drama, Science Fiction, Mystery', 'Gale Tattersall, J. James Manera, Andrew M. Ward', 'Harmon Kaslow, J. James Manera, John Aglialoro', 'Kristoffer Polaha, Laura Regan, Greg Germann, Eric Allan Kramer, Tony Denison, Mark Moses, Lew Temple, Stephen Tobolowsky', 'PG-13', 'In a post-apocalyptic America, the iron fist of the totalitarian government seeks to crush one mysterious man named John Galt, who has the power and influence to change everything...', 'In a post-apocalyptic America, the iron fist of the totalitarian government seeks to crush one mysterious man named John Galt, who has the power and influence to change everything...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wR7NM125F63zxECZKCVMzibkWpZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:199933'),
  ('357562287737046263', 'Atlit', 2015, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Boaz Yehonatan Yaacov , Shirel Amitay', 'Shirel Amitay', 'Géraldine Nakache, Judith Chemla, Yaël Abecassis, Arsinée Khanjian, Pippo Delbono, Makram J. Khoury', null, 'In October 1995 three French sisters gather in Atlit, Israel to sell the family home. Tensions arise between elders Darel and Cali when Darel proves unwilling to sell. That''s when the sisters start seeing apparitions of their dead parents.', 'In October 1995 three French sisters gather in Atlit, Israel to sell the family home. Tensions arise between elders Darel and Cali when Darel proves unwilling to sell. That''s when the sisters start seeing apparitions of their dead parents.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uU1gtkj3sNzjXpZ0ZP1O7L0HO5V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:319342'),
  ('454828057028033266', 'Atlıkarınca', 2011, 'Drama', 'İlksen Başarır, Hayk Kirakosyan', null, 'Mert Fırat, Nergis Öztürk, Zeynep Oral, Sema Çeyrekbaşı, Sercan Badur, Oğulcan Güler, Eren Öner, Helin Melike Çal', null, 'The lives of Erdem, Sevil, and their children Edip and Sevgi in a small town change when they move to Istanbul after Sevil''s mother suffers a stroke. Edip has been away from home for ten years, attending boarding school, while Erdem continues to dream of becoming a successful writer. Noticing Sevgi''s withdrawal and unhappiness, and suspicious of her sudden changes in behavior, Sevil begins to question some of the events taking place within the home and discovers a secret that has been hidden behind closed doors for years. When Erdem loses his life in a traffic accident, his death leads to the emergence of new secrets within the family. Each member of the small family is left to face the truths they must carry alone for the rest of their lives. What is this secret they cannot even confess to themselves?', 'The lives of Erdem, Sevil, and their children Edip and Sevgi in a small town change when they move to Istanbul after Sevil''s mother suffers a stroke. Edip has been away from home for ten years, attending boarding school, while Erdem continues to dream of becoming a successful writer. Noticing Sevgi''s withdrawal and unhappiness, and suspicious of her sudden changes in behavior, Sevil begins to question some of the events taking place within the home and discovers a secret that has been hidden behind closed doors for years. When Erdem loses his life in a traffic accident, his death leads to the emergence of new secrets within the family. Each member of the small family is left to face the truths they must carry alone for the rest of their lives. What is this secret they cannot even confess to themselves?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fxZW5LBLI86HMxnQiSVqvbXubiM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:110170'),
  ('404220539890215707', 'ATM', 2012, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Bengt Jonsson, David Brooks, Charles Crossin', 'Chris Sparling', 'Alice Eve, Josh Peck, Brian Geraghty, Mike O''Brien, Robert Huculak, Ernesto Griffith, Bryan Terrell Clark, Dan De Jaeger', 'R', 'After leaving their company Christmas Party together, David Hargrove and Emily Brandt’s impromptu first date takes an unexpected turn when their coworker, Corey, asks them to make a late-night stop at an ATM. What should be a routine transaction turns into a desperate struggle for survival when an unknown man appears outside the vestibule.', 'After leaving their company Christmas Party together, David Hargrove and Emily Brandt’s impromptu first date takes an unexpected turn when their coworker, Corey, asks them to make a late-night stop at an ATM. What should be a routine transaction turns into a desperate struggle for survival when an unknown man appears outside the vestibule.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kTfxloA4zUrL2jCII0IEGaivIwh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:89691'),
  ('1087060938198205829', 'Atman', 1975, 'Horror, Animation', 'Toshio Matsumoto, Hiroshi Yamazaki, Kenji Takama', null, null, null, 'ĀTMAN is a visual tour-de-force based on the idea of the subject at the centre of the circle created by camera positions (480 such positions). Shooting frame-by-frame the filmmaker set up an increasingly rapid circular motion. ĀTMAN is an early Buddhist deity often connected with destruction; the Japanese aspect is stressed by the devil mask of Hangan, from the Noh, and by using both Noh music and the general principle of acceleration often associated with Noh drama.', 'ĀTMAN is a visual tour-de-force based on the idea of the subject at the centre of the circle created by camera positions (480 such positions). Shooting frame-by-frame the filmmaker set up an increasingly rapid circular motion. ĀTMAN is an early Buddhist deity often connected with destruction; the Japanese aspect is stressed by the devil mask of Hangan, from the Noh, and by using both Noh music and the general principle of acceleration often associated with Noh drama.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/74fZ1ajvxtmwMT08cUgG8GkO8a7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:174838'),
  ('775857222744883371', 'Atmosphere', 2010, 'Science Fiction', 'Alejandro Cantú, Julián Hernández', 'Sergio Loo, Julián Hernández, Ulises Pérez Mancilla', 'Damayanti Quintanar, Harold Torres, Patricia Madrid, Memo Villegas', null, 'Cecilia, Alberto, and Felipe live through a strange epidemic that plagues the abandoned streets of a coastal town. Suddenly, an uncontrollable desire forces them to leave in search of the sea.', 'Cecilia, Alberto, and Felipe live through a strange epidemic that plagues the abandoned streets of a coastal town. Suddenly, an uncontrollable desire forces them to leave in search of the sea.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3BYOSyh7Ln8pPZcUFAfINfRh6uZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:444167'),
  ('256293774031656773', 'Atom Age Vampire', 1960, 'Horror', 'Anton Giulio Majano, Aldo Giordani', 'Alberto Bevilacqua, Gino De Santis, Anton Giulio Majano', 'Susanne Loret, Alberto Lupo, Sergio Fantoni, Roberto Bertea, Franca Parisi, Ivo Garrani, Andrea Scotti, Rina Franchetti', 'NR', 'When a singer is horribly disfigured in a car accident, a scientist develops a treatment which can restore her beauty by injecting her with a special serum. While performing the procedure, however, he falls in love with her. As the treatment begins to fail, he determines to save her appearance, regardless of how many women he must kill for her sake.', 'When a singer is horribly disfigured in a car accident, a scientist develops a treatment which can restore her beauty by injecting her with a special serum. While performing the procedure, however, he falls in love with her. As the treatment begins to fail, he determines to save her appearance, regardless of how many women he must kill for her sake.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nMwOVezYX24qmNs5HLyxEhDRoO6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22699'),
  ('1099037591630710079', 'Atom Man vs. Superman', 1950, 'Action, Science Fiction', 'Spencer Gordon Bennet, Ira H. Morgan', 'David Mathews, George H. Plympton, Joseph F. Poland', 'Kirk Alyn, Lyle Talbot, Noel Neill, Tommy Bond, Pierre Watkin, Chuck Roberson, Stuart Hall', 'NR', 'Superman battles Lex Luthor, who is using a teleportation device and a new identity as Atom Man in his criminal plans.', 'Superman battles Lex Luthor, who is using a teleportation device and a new identity as Atom Man in his criminal plans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ujs17umEBEhhBONTBF5OXJ3h3Pc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:106358'),
  ('580841986279810795', 'Atoman', 2025, 'Adventure, Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'Anouar Moatassim', 'Omar Mrani', 'Youssef Akdim, Samy Naceri, Sarah Perles, Fatima Herandi Raouya, Kaoutar Boudarraja, Nadia Niazi, Mohamed Targuisti, Mourade Zeguendi', null, 'Hakim is a professional hacker and used to muscular interrogations. But his last encounter with the Moroccan secret service will change his life forever. He will discover that his genes give him extraordinary powers. And if they manifest themselves now, it is for a very simple reason: he is the only one who can prevent a global catastrophe…', 'Hakim is a professional hacker and used to muscular interrogations. But his last encounter with the Moroccan secret service will change his life forever. He will discover that his genes give him extraordinary powers. And if they manifest themselves now, it is for a very simple reason: he is the only one who can prevent a global catastrophe…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1JhP42OirTTYN57LqvkBVSibHyS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:869048'),
  ('190294747450065574', 'Atomic Age', 2012, 'Drama', 'Hélène Louvart, Héléna Klotz', 'Héléna Klotz', 'Eliott Paquet, Dominik Wojcik, Niels Schneider, Mathilde Bisson, Clémence Boisnard, Luc Chessel, Arnaud Rebotini, Cécilia Ranval', null, 'Two young boys, Victor and Rainer, take the commuter train to spend the evening in Paris. In a nightclub on the banks of the Seine they go from one disappointment to another, from failed chat ups to street brawls. But as they get carried away by the night, they leave the city for the forest. In the silence of the moonlight nature, the desire between the two friends becomes increasingly vibrant. A new day is born from their friendship.', 'Two young boys, Victor and Rainer, take the commuter train to spend the evening in Paris. In a nightclub on the banks of the Seine they go from one disappointment to another, from failed chat ups to street brawls. But as they get carried away by the night, they leave the city for the forest. In the silence of the moonlight nature, the desire between the two friends becomes increasingly vibrant. A new day is born from their friendship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ymPWiAi9SumzLenSUbFgcw9GAGz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:126879'),
  ('1125612988534699521', 'Atomic Blonde', 2017, 'Action, Thriller', 'David Leitch, Jonathan Sela, Rickie-Lee Roberts', 'Kurt Johnstad', 'Charlize Theron, James McAvoy, Eddie Marsan, John Goodman, Toby Jones, James Faulkner, Roland Møller, Sofia Boutella', 'R', 'An undercover MI6 agent is sent to Berlin during the Cold War to investigate the murder of a fellow agent and recover a missing list of double agents.', 'An undercover MI6 agent is sent to Berlin during the Cold War to investigate the murder of a fellow agent and recover a missing list of double agents.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kV9R5h0Yct1kR8Hf8sJ1nX0Vz4x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:341013'),
  ('248567528996661917', 'Atomic Dog', 1998, 'Horror, Science Fiction, TV Movie', 'Brian Trenchard-Smith, David Lewis', 'Miguel Tejada-Flores', 'Isabella Hofmann, Daniel Hugh Kelly, Cindy Pickett, Scott Olynek, Micah Gardener, Katie Stuart, Deryl Hayes, Matt Clarke', 'PG', 'When a pooch is irradiated by a nuclear plant and threatens the town, only a teenage boy can redeem him.', 'When a pooch is irradiated by a nuclear plant and threatens the town, only a teenage boy can redeem him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2GzQDugAABrvCJLVODakCJcFYAv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:102794'),
  ('63528395371227508', 'Atomic Summer', 2022, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Clément Comet, Mariana Giani, Simon Beaufils', 'Gaël Lépingle, Pierre Chosson', 'Shaïn Boumedine, Carmen Kassovitz, Théo Augier, Constantin Vidal, Manon Valentin, Alexia Chardard, Jean-Marc Lombard, Antoine Delahousse', null, 'Victor, in his early 20s, works at the town hall and lives with his girlfriend Charlotte, who is expecting their first child. When an incident happens at the nearby nuclear power plant, he and his high school friends are forced to confine themselves inside a farmhouse, whereas they should have evacuated the area. As the rain is threatening, they are keeping an eye out for the radioactive cloud. The next 24 hours will be crucial.', 'Victor, in his early 20s, works at the town hall and lives with his girlfriend Charlotte, who is expecting their first child. When an incident happens at the nearby nuclear power plant, he and his high school friends are forced to confine themselves inside a farmhouse, whereas they should have evacuated the area. As the rain is threatening, they are keeping an eye out for the radioactive cloud. The next 24 hours will be crucial.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d0Bkh2ZWK2Ua1LOhsm6fxfqUjpw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:717670'),
  ('204405079680491003', 'Atomic Twister', 2002, 'Action, Drama, Thriller', 'Donald Duncan, Bill Corcoran', 'Ron McGee', 'Sharon Lawrence, Mark-Paul Gosselaar, Carl Lewis, Jonathan Blick, Daniel Costello, Charmaine Guest, George Henare, John Leigh', 'PG', 'When tornadoes hit a nuclear power plant, critically damaging the plant''s cooling system, the results could be catastrophic. Atomic Twister, a countdown to disaster, traces an extraordinary day in the lives of small town citizens who unexpectedly find themselves facing the possibility of mass destruction.', 'When tornadoes hit a nuclear power plant, critically damaging the plant''s cooling system, the results could be catastrophic. Atomic Twister, a countdown to disaster, traces an extraordinary day in the lives of small town citizens who unexpectedly find themselves facing the possibility of mass destruction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/krupHiuUFEXOVTdp7MUBBUMM1VF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24617'),
  ('47226196979639224', 'Atomic War Bride', 1960, 'Drama, Science Fiction', 'Veljko Bulajić', 'Cesare Zavattini', 'Antun Vrdoljak, Janez Vrhovec, Zlatko Madunić, Ewa Krzyżewska, Ita Rina, Ljubiša Jovanović, Dušan Poček, Marija Kohn', null, 'At a church in the country, eternally optimistic John marries Maria, his Atomic War Bride, as a war starts, planes buzz overhead and bombs start dropping. Though John is "mobilized" by the military seconds after the ceremony, he and Maria seek to be reunited.', 'At a church in the country, eternally optimistic John marries Maria, his Atomic War Bride, as a war starts, planes buzz overhead and bombs start dropping. Though John is "mobilized" by the military seconds after the ceremony, he and Maria seek to be reunited.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5Pjsi0qSa29BJeE656bVuVOm2qC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:108063'),
  ('403391713323587393', 'Atomica', 2017, 'Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Dagen Merrill', 'Kevin Burke', 'Tom Sizemore, Sarah Habel, Dominic Monaghan, Phil Austin, Tony Doupe, Jennifer Spriggs, Sarah-Eve Gazitt, Hahn Cho', null, 'In the near future, when communications go offline at a remote nuclear power plant isolated in the desert, a young safety inspector, Abby Dixon, is forced to fly out to bring them back online. Once inside the facility, mysterious clues and strange behaviors cause Abby to have doubts about the sanity, and perhaps identities, of the two employees onsite.', 'In the near future, when communications go offline at a remote nuclear power plant isolated in the desert, a young safety inspector, Abby Dixon, is forced to fly out to bring them back online. Once inside the facility, mysterious clues and strange behaviors cause Abby to have doubts about the sanity, and perhaps identities, of the two employees onsite.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o0fYUDBEvymij9WM3JtG1AVrgex.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:188924'),
  ('664031526469361236', 'Atonement', 2007, 'Drama, Romance', 'Seamus McGarvey, Joe Wright, Josh Robertson', 'Christopher Hampton', 'James McAvoy, Keira Knightley, Saoirse Ronan, Romola Garai, Vanessa Redgrave, Brenda Blethyn, Juno Temple, Benedict Cumberbatch', 'R', 'A young girl irrevocably changes the course of several lives when she accuses her older sister''s lover of a crime he did not commit.', 'A young girl irrevocably changes the course of several lives when she accuses her older sister''s lover of a crime he did not commit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hMRIyBjPzxaSXWM06se3OcNjIQa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4347'),
  ('725241990460900129', 'Atonement', 2025, 'Drama, Action', 'Mark Woo Yiu-Fai, Ronald Cheng Chung-Kei, O Sing-Pui', 'Mark Woo Yiu-Fai, Ronald Cheng Chung-Kei, Lam Fung', 'Ronald Cheng Chung-Kei, Chrissie Chau Sau-Na, Philip Keung Ho-Man, Jiang Chao, Fu Shun-Ying', null, 'Single father Lung (Ronald CHENG) and his daughter Ying (FU Shun Ying) are each other’s only dependence. Despite the huge debt left by his ex-wife, Lung believes in good karma for good people, until he loses his beloved daughter in a kidnap while travelling in Thailand. Lung abandons all his faith. He marries a Thai Chinese, Lan (Chrissie CHAU) and starts a new life in Thailand, but he never leaves the past behind. All these years he has been gathering information of the kidnap gang, and vows to take justice into his own hands at any cost…', 'Single father Lung (Ronald CHENG) and his daughter Ying (FU Shun Ying) are each other’s only dependence. Despite the huge debt left by his ex-wife, Lung believes in good karma for good people, until he loses his beloved daughter in a kidnap while travelling in Thailand. Lung abandons all his faith. He marries a Thai Chinese, Lan (Chrissie CHAU) and starts a new life in Thailand, but he never leaves the past behind. All these years he has been gathering information of the kidnap gang, and vows to take justice into his own hands at any cost…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i8oxXUaEVPHCTSFpOgA8M4HWBO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:741596'),
