  ('639279886662244141', 'Atragon', 1963, 'Science Fiction, Action, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Ishirō Honda, Hajime Koizumi', 'Shinichi Sekizawa', 'Tadao Takashima, Yōko Fujiyama, Yū Fujiki, Kenji Sahara, Ken Uehara, Hiroshi Koizumi, Jun Tazaki, Yoshibumi Tajima', null, 'The legendary empire of the lost continent of Mu reappears to threaten the world with domination. While countries unite to resist, an isolated World War II Captain has created the greatest warship ever seen, and possibly the surface world''s only defense.', 'The legendary empire of the lost continent of Mu reappears to threaten the world with domination. While countries unite to resist, an isolated World War II Captain has created the greatest warship ever seen, and possibly the surface world''s only defense.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u5fD2mfsovtW1Pn2Umtl2G3280w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35072'),
  ('783906584820061324', 'Atrangi Re', 2021, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'Sham Kaushal, Mukesh Chhabra, Aanand L. Rai', 'Himanshu Sharma', 'Sara Ali Khan, Dhanush, Akshay Kumar, Seema Biswas, Ashish Verma, Dimple Hayathi, Pankaj Jha, Ashok Banthia', null, 'Runaway Rinku gets forcefully married to already engaged Vishu. Both don''t want this marriage and make a deal to go on their separate ways. The equation gets weirder when Rinku''s lover Sajjad shows up and Vishu starts developing feelings for her.', 'Runaway Rinku gets forcefully married to already engaged Vishu. Both don''t want this marriage and make a deal to go on their separate ways. The equation gets weirder when Rinku''s lover Sajjad shows up and Vishu starts developing feelings for her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oHPFZLf2jPZSgFiqzPsSWqPmUMd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:618911'),
  ('883321030374655370', 'Atrocious', 2010, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Fernando Barreda Luna', 'Fernando Barreda Luna', 'Rafael Amaya, Jose Masegosa, Chus Pereiro, Cristian Valencia, Clara Moraleda, Sergi Martin, Xavi Doz, Sammy Gad', 'R', 'Quintanilla family was found dead in their country side house. Police reported the existence of 37 hours of recorded evidence. The family traveled to their old farm house, where they investigated about the Legend of the Girl in the Garraf woods. They used to record whatever they did. Atrocious shows the last five days of this family, and the strange situations that they lived in those moments and which remain unexplained.', 'Quintanilla family was found dead in their country side house. Police reported the existence of 37 hours of recorded evidence. The family traveled to their old farm house, where they investigated about the Legend of the Girl in the Garraf woods. They used to record whatever they did. Atrocious shows the last five days of this family, and the strange situations that they lived in those moments and which remain unexplained.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lVzWJ0xV6AJxsHwL2KcdIbaNNeV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71622'),
  ('731908444441848324', 'Atrocious', 2018, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Lex Ortega, Luis García', 'Lex Ortega, Sergio Tello', 'Lex Ortega, Carlos Valencia, Orlando Moguel, Aleyda Gallardo, Carlos Padilla, Florencia Ríos, Miguel Angel Nava, Alberto Hernandez Campusano', null, 'After they''re arrested, the horrific crimes of two serial killers are revealed via confiscated videotapes. These tapes contain brutal murders displaying pure human wickedness, the background, paraphilias and psyche of these murderers.', 'After they''re arrested, the horrific crimes of two serial killers are revealed via confiscated videotapes. These tapes contain brutal murders displaying pure human wickedness, the background, paraphilias and psyche of these murderers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7x43axWAQjFXGJfp99Ys76YcjGt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:300906'),
  ('1084208371087260079', 'Atrocious Tales of Love and Death', 1979, 'Comedy, Thriller', 'Sergio Corbucci, Luigi Kuveiller, Amanzio Todini', 'Giuseppe Catalano, Sabatino Ciuffini', 'Marcello Mastroianni, Ornella Muti, Michel Piccoli, Zeudi Araya, Capucine, Peppino De Filippo, Renato Pozzetto, Elena Fiore', null, 'Raphael, a restaurant mandolin player with a limp, a father to support, and a lot of debt, accepts a job offered by his friend, Giardino, to play a serenade under an apartment window at the behest of a mysterious blonde. As he’s playing, a man high up on a balcony is pushed to his death. Raffaele is compelled to conduct his own investigation and becomes embroiled in a mystery involving a macabre secret...', 'Raphael, a restaurant mandolin player with a limp, a father to support, and a lot of debt, accepts a job offered by his friend, Giardino, to play a serenade under an apartment window at the behest of a mysterious blonde. As he’s playing, a man high up on a balcony is pushed to his death. Raffaele is compelled to conduct his own investigation and becomes embroiled in a mystery involving a macabre secret...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4ogyahfLNJxwjMJGZruKa7vnlVb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:105667'),
