  ('1030208710170160275', 'Attack Girls'' Swim Team Versus the Undead', 2007, 'Horror, Action', 'Koji Kawano, Koumei Fujimoto, Chikara Abe', 'Satoshi Ôwada', 'Sasa Handa, Yuria Hidaka, Ayumu Tokitô, Hiromitsu Kiba, Hidetomo Nishida, Sakae Yamazaki, Noriko Fujioka, Yumeko Imai', 'NR', 'A psycho scientist sent in to inoculate the luscious young student bodies against a new virus makes a little error in judgment, resulting in a not-so-little flesh-eating zombie problem. Now, with most of the school and all of the teachers running amuck, eating each other, having rabid sex and juggling, it''s up to Aki and her new found allies on the Girls Swim Team to take care of business.', 'A psycho scientist sent in to inoculate the luscious young student bodies against a new virus makes a little error in judgment, resulting in a not-so-little flesh-eating zombie problem. Now, with most of the school and all of the teachers running amuck, eating each other, having rabid sex and juggling, it''s up to Aki and her new found allies on the Girls Swim Team to take care of business.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lppsvJNhXLwsucDw66Rnf0rOOUv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25727'),
  ('718127446701232694', 'Attack of the 50 Foot Cheerleader', 2012, 'Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Kevin O''Neill, Michael Etheridge, Alison Goser', 'Mike MacLean', 'Jena Sims, Sean Young, Treat Williams, Sasha Jackson, Olivia Alexander, Ryan Merriman, Ted Raimi, Anne McDaniels', 'R', 'Aspiring college cheerleader, Cassie Stratford consumes an experimental drug that grants her beauty and enough athletic ability to make the cheer squad. The drug has an unforeseen side effect — Cassie starts to grow and grow and grow!', 'Aspiring college cheerleader, Cassie Stratford consumes an experimental drug that grants her beauty and enough athletic ability to make the cheer squad. The drug has an unforeseen side effect — Cassie starts to grow and grow and grow!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jedxj1EMqX2TiHtChHhErx69jUx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:128564'),
  ('74128119344209269', 'Attack of the 50 Foot Woman', 1958, 'Science Fiction, Drama, Horror', 'Nathan Juran, Jacques R. Marquette', 'Mark Hanna', 'Allison Hayes, William Hudson, Yvette Vickers, Roy Gordon, George Douglas, Otto Waldis, Eileen Stevens, Michael Ross', null, 'When an abused wife grows to giant size because of an alien encounter and an aborted murder attempt, she goes after her cheating husband with revenge on her mind.', 'When an abused wife grows to giant size because of an alien encounter and an aborted murder attempt, she goes after her cheating husband with revenge on her mind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y661j8lD78zuV2sDGF5uc6nU7KF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18724'),
  ('1032433178840618056', 'Attack of the 50 Ft. Woman', 1994, 'Science Fiction, Comedy, TV Movie', 'Christopher Guest, Russell Carpenter, Josh King', 'Mark Hanna, Joseph Dougherty', 'Daryl Hannah, Daniel Baldwin, William Windom, Frances Fisher, Cristi Conaway, Paul Benedict, O''Neal Compton, Victoria Haas', 'R', 'When an abused heiress grows to giant size because of her encounter with aliens, she decides to get revenge on her cheating husband and those who looked down on her.', 'When an abused heiress grows to giant size because of her encounter with aliens, she decides to get revenge on her cheating husband and those who looked down on her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xklTXjnDMYKkmWJTe5HlyQ4Mc0T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74629'),
  ('295969486550540408', 'Attack of the 60 Foot Centerfold', 1995, 'Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Fred Olen Ray, Gary Graver, Greg Webb', 'Steve Armogida', 'J.J. North, Ted Monte, Raelyn Saalman, Tammy Parks, Tim Abell, John Henry Richardson, John Lazar, Michelle Bauer', 'R', 'Among the finalists for "Centerfold Of The Year" are Angel and her spiteful rival Betty. However, no one is aware of Angel''s involvement in a secret medical beauty enhancement program headed by Dr. Lindstrom. Desperate to win, Angel overdoses on Lindstrom''s formula, with disastrous results. Soon she has grown to monstrous but shapely proportions, causing all sorts of complications, the most dangerous being Betty''s jealousy of Angel''s new-found attention. Betty discovers Angel''s secret and takes the formula herself, causing her to grow into an equally gorgeous giant. As the girls battle it out on Hollywood Blvd., Dr. Lindstrom races to find an antidote.', 'Among the finalists for "Centerfold Of The Year" are Angel and her spiteful rival Betty. However, no one is aware of Angel''s involvement in a secret medical beauty enhancement program headed by Dr. Lindstrom. Desperate to win, Angel overdoses on Lindstrom''s formula, with disastrous results. Soon she has grown to monstrous but shapely proportions, causing all sorts of complications, the most dangerous being Betty''s jealousy of Angel''s new-found attention. Betty discovers Angel''s secret and takes the formula herself, causing her to grow into an equally gorgeous giant. As the girls battle it out on Hollywood Blvd., Dr. Lindstrom races to find an antidote.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3deidjIPhTzylT4hQqimYs7V3a6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23142'),
  ('630144354509840013', 'Attack of the Beast Creatures', 1985, 'Horror, Fantasy', 'Michael Stanley, Robert A. Hutton', 'Robert A. Hutton', 'Robert Nolfi, Julia Rust, Robert Lengyel, Lisa Pak, Frank Murgalo, John Vichiola, Kay Bailey, Frans Kal', null, 'A terrible storm at sea turns an ocean liner''s luxury voyage into a nightmare! Those lucky enough to survive the sinking ship soon find themselves stranded on an uncharted island. A living hell breaks loose when the survivors encounter gruesome, flesh-eating Beast Creatures!', 'A terrible storm at sea turns an ocean liner''s luxury voyage into a nightmare! Those lucky enough to survive the sinking ship soon find themselves stranded on an uncharted island. A living hell breaks loose when the survivors encounter gruesome, flesh-eating Beast Creatures!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eHWnqyt6jDkSX6dGrAoaDh3dW27.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84068'),
  ('803031547921522134', 'Attack of the Blind Dead', 1973, 'Horror', 'Amando de Ossorio, Miguel Fernández Mila', 'Amando de Ossorio', 'Tony Kendall, Fernando Sancho, Esperanza Roy, Frank Braña, José Canalejas, Loreta Tovar, Ramón Lillo, Lone Fleming', null, '500 years after they were blinded and executed for committing human sacrifices, a band of Templar knights returns from the grave to terrorize a rural Portuguese village during it''s centennial celebration. Being blind, the Templars find their victims through sound, usually the screams of their victims. Taking refuge in a deserted cathedral, a small group of people must find a way to escape from the creatures.', '500 years after they were blinded and executed for committing human sacrifices, a band of Templar knights returns from the grave to terrorize a rural Portuguese village during it''s centennial celebration. Being blind, the Templars find their victims through sound, usually the screams of their victims. Taking refuge in a deserted cathedral, a small group of people must find a way to escape from the creatures.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6xayo9umWRgmH5maFmFDeKD9Y0s.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12550'),
  ('991428592506183397', 'Attack of the Crab Monsters', 1957, 'Science Fiction, Horror', 'Roger Corman, Floyd Crosby', 'Charles B. Griffith', 'Richard Garland, Pamela Duncan, Russell Johnson, Leslie Bradley, Mel Welles, Richard H. Cutting, Beach Dickerson, Tony Miller', null, 'A group of scientists travel to a remote island to study the effects of nuclear weapons tests, only to get stranded when their airplane mysteriously explodes. The team soon discovers that the tests have given rise to crabs mutated into intelligent, impervious, telepathic giants intent on increasing their numbers by breeding, then travelling to populated areas to feed, and which do not intend to be stopped by their discoverers.', 'A group of scientists travel to a remote island to study the effects of nuclear weapons tests, only to get stranded when their airplane mysteriously explodes. The team soon discovers that the tests have given rise to crabs mutated into intelligent, impervious, telepathic giants intent on increasing their numbers by breeding, then travelling to populated areas to feed, and which do not intend to be stopped by their discoverers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pDaJt3Jv41mOvND7HaDnmiGsD5V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26946'),
  ('1132668107049772246', 'Attack of the Giant Leeches', 1959, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Bernard L. Kowalski, John M. Nickolaus Jr.', 'Leo Gordon', 'Ken Clark, Yvette Vickers, Jan Shepard, Michael Emmet, Tyler McVey, Bruno VeSota, Gene Roth, Dan White', 'NR', 'A backwoods game warden and a local doctor discover that giant leeches are responsible for disappearances and deaths in a local swamp, but the local police don''t believe them.', 'A backwoods game warden and a local doctor discover that giant leeches are responsible for disappearances and deaths in a local swamp, but the local police don''t believe them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n3dAhWfWxsNQJ5ZUcn8Q3mW8EIP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22718'),
  ('1116426333290411715', 'Attack of the Helping Hand!', 1979, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Scott Spiegel', 'Scott Spiegel', 'Linda Quiroz, Sam Raimi, Bruce Campbell', null, 'General Mills'' popular Hamburger Helper mascot also known as Helping Hand or Lefty, a four-fingered, left-hand white glove, which appears on the product''s packaging, comes to life in a woman''s kitchen and tries to grope her and kill her.', 'General Mills'' popular Hamburger Helper mascot also known as Helping Hand or Lefty, a four-fingered, left-hand white glove, which appears on the product''s packaging, comes to life in a woman''s kitchen and tries to grope her and kill her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k4C67bttu0qNblghbXq17YuC5nm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:200671'),
  ('819777147122360613', 'Attack of the Hollywood Clichés!', 2021, 'Documentary', 'Sean Doherty, Liz T. Miles, Brendan H. Banks', 'Dane Baptiste, Ben Caudell, Jason Hazeley', 'Rob Lowe, John August, Sanjeev Bhaskar, Anna Bogutskaya, Jess Cagle, David Edelstein, Robert Englund, Andrew Garfield', null, 'One-man armies, meet-cutes, casual strolls away from huge explosions — stars and industry insiders toast and roast these cinematic chestnuts and more.', 'One-man armies, meet-cutes, casual strolls away from huge explosions — stars and industry insiders toast and roast these cinematic chestnuts and more.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fmI1oIAwXjfX8LcZYT8Rs2rZe2R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:877657'),
  ('848075599949824786', 'Attack of the Killer Donuts', 2016, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Jeff Robinson, Howard Wexler, Scott D. Wheeler', 'Nathan Dalton, Rafael Diaz-Wagner, Chris De Christopher', 'Kayla Compton, C. Thomas Howell, Christine Nguyen, Michael Swan, Justin Ray, Alison England, Michael Gaglio, Fredrick Burns', 'NR', 'A chemical accident turns ordinary donuts into blood thirsty killers. Now it''s up to Johnny, Michelle, and Howard to save their sleepy town from...Killer Donuts.', 'A chemical accident turns ordinary donuts into blood thirsty killers. Now it''s up to Johnny, Michelle, and Howard to save their sleepy town from...Killer Donuts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jYvWEvt9k2Zn2g5kCjicu51E6Pt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:400649'),
  ('660389168992418934', 'Attack of the Killer Tomatoes!', 1978, 'Comedy, Horror, Science Fiction', 'John De Bello, John K. Culley', 'John De Bello, Costa Dillon, J. Stephen Peace', 'David Miller, George Wilson, Sharon Taylor, J. Stephen Peace, Ernie Meyers, Eric Christmas, Jack Riley, Nigel Barber', 'PG', 'After a wave of reports of mysterious attacks involving people and pets being eaten by the traditionally docile fruit, a special government task force is set up to investigate the violent fruit and put a stop to their murderous spree.', 'After a wave of reports of mysterious attacks involving people and pets being eaten by the traditionally docile fruit, a special government task force is set up to investigate the violent fruit and put a stop to their murderous spree.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/flCZ7TcuFsT8K5pz6vDZ0Gjk7Nu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2182'),
  ('899490452224279771', 'Attack of the Lederhosen Zombies', 2016, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Dominik Hartl', 'Armin Prediger, Dominik Hartl', 'Gabriela Marcinková, Laurie Paul Calvert, Margarethe Tiesel, Karl Fischer, Patricia Aulitzky, Oscar Dyekjær Giese, Kari Rakkola, Martina Schölzhorn', null, 'Steve, a young professional snowboarder, ruins a high-paying photo shoot by playing a silly prank. He, his girlfriend Branka and fellow snowboarder Joschi are left behind on the mountain. They seek shelter in an après-ski tavern that is hosting an all-night party. Things go from bad to worse when a scientific experiment unleashes an epidemic of zombies and mutant wildlife. This is mostly lost on the local drunkards, as they are not always easy to distinguish from zombies themselves. But Steve, Branka and Joschi have to find a way to survive this hellish night.', 'Steve, a young professional snowboarder, ruins a high-paying photo shoot by playing a silly prank. He, his girlfriend Branka and fellow snowboarder Joschi are left behind on the mountain. They seek shelter in an après-ski tavern that is hosting an all-night party. Things go from bad to worse when a scientific experiment unleashes an epidemic of zombies and mutant wildlife. This is mostly lost on the local drunkards, as they are not always easy to distinguish from zombies themselves. But Steve, Branka and Joschi have to find a way to survive this hellish night.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lhTROo0nUrUnc8eK0qbowdOOWKM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:383788'),
  ('1018909139636869863', 'Attack of the Mayan Mummy', 1964, 'Horror, TV Movie', 'Rafael Portillo, Jerry Warren, Enrique Wallace', null, 'George Mitchell André, Rosita Arenas, Ramón Gay, Bruno VeSota, Jorge Mondragón, Jaime González Quiñones, Crox Alvarado, Chuck Niles', null, 'A scientist hypnotically regresses a woman to a previous life, a Mayan princess, who leads him to a secret tomb where the princess was buried - and the mummy of an ancient warrior, cursed to live after death and guard the treasure buried with her. Edited by Jerry Warren from the Mexican horror film LA MOMIA AZTECA, and following its general plot but with 36 minutes of new, American-made footage added and English narration in lieu of dubbed dialogue for the Mexican footage.', 'A scientist hypnotically regresses a woman to a previous life, a Mayan princess, who leads him to a secret tomb where the princess was buried - and the mummy of an ancient warrior, cursed to live after death and guard the treasure buried with her. Edited by Jerry Warren from the Mexican horror film LA MOMIA AZTECA, and following its general plot but with 36 minutes of new, American-made footage added and English narration in lieu of dubbed dialogue for the Mexican footage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8C4Ly3hv7pyEaTLFK4Ybc4fvjKj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:120045'),
  ('436517200898033617', 'Attack of the Meth Gator', 2024, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Action', 'Christopher Ray, Thomas Hennessy', 'Joe Roche, Lauren Pritchard', 'LaRonn Marzett, Ray Acevedo, Vanessa Tamayo, Robbie Rist, Wade Hunt Williams, Bruce Peoples, Stuart Maxheimer, Benjamin L Newmark', null, 'On a small island in the Florida Everglades, a DEA agent and a local sheriff gather a team of locals to take down a giant meth-fueled alligator.', 'On a small island in the Florida Everglades, a DEA agent and a local sheriff gather a team of locals to take down a giant meth-fueled alligator.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/td0L3VZvBFPYb6hZ3WTbq0VD9q2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1091298'),
  ('46965950870914256', 'Attack of the Puppet People', 1958, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Bert I. Gordon, Maurice Lessay, Jack R. Berne', 'George Worthing Yates', 'John Hoyt, John Agar, June Kenney, Marlene Willis, Laurie Mitchell, Scott Peters, Ken Miller, Jean Moorhead', 'NR', 'A deranged scientist creates a ray that can shrink people down to doll size.', 'A deranged scientist creates a ray that can shrink people down to doll size.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tN8lARzROe06PIOFhEyB6nyT1D3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44585'),
  ('1093888759913761874', 'Attack of the Robots', 1966, 'Comedy, Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Antonio Macasoli, Jesús Franco, Pierre Lary', 'Jean-Claude Carrière, Jesús Franco', 'Eddie Constantine, Françoise Brion, Fernando Rey, Sophie Hardy, Alfredo Mayo, Ricardo Palacios, Marcelo Arroita-Jáuregui, Vicente Roca', null, 'Al Pereira, a wise-cracking superspy, investigates a series of assassinations being performed by ruthless killers with bronze skin and horn-rimmed glasses. The trail of these mindless automata leads him to the lair of a seductive villainess who has formulated a computer-powered plot to overthrow the governments of Europe. ''Cartes sur table'' is at once an homage to classical Hollywood thrillers and a playful riff on the newly-popular James Bond films.', 'Al Pereira, a wise-cracking superspy, investigates a series of assassinations being performed by ruthless killers with bronze skin and horn-rimmed glasses. The trail of these mindless automata leads him to the lair of a seductive villainess who has formulated a computer-powered plot to overthrow the governments of Europe. ''Cartes sur table'' is at once an homage to classical Hollywood thrillers and a playful riff on the newly-popular James Bond films.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1OEZsQGjyIzCn0eEuCXJRsC88A4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28281'),
  ('421207545799396359', 'Attack of the Sabretooth', 2005, 'Horror, Action', 'George T. Miller, Mark Melville, John Powditch', 'Tom Woosley', 'Robert Carradine, Nicholas Bell, Brian Wimmer, Stacy Haiduk, Susanne Sutchy, Cleopatra Coleman, Bonnie Piesse, Natalie Avital', null, 'In the Fiji islands, the greedy and unscrupulous owner of the Valalola Resort Primal Park invites investors and guests for an opening party of his compound composed of hotel and zoo aiming to find partners for his discoveries. When a bunch of college smalltime thieves puts a virus in the security system to participate in a scavenger hunt, the greatest attractions of the zoo - sabretoothes from the prehistoric age developed from DNA found in fossils - escape, killing the hosts and guards for fun.', 'In the Fiji islands, the greedy and unscrupulous owner of the Valalola Resort Primal Park invites investors and guests for an opening party of his compound composed of hotel and zoo aiming to find partners for his discoveries. When a bunch of college smalltime thieves puts a virus in the security system to participate in a scavenger hunt, the greatest attractions of the zoo - sabretoothes from the prehistoric age developed from DNA found in fossils - escape, killing the hosts and guards for fun.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o6SEJ0EFun5IiDHIgOtf2Cw1GTG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58788'),
  ('1071220479284621834', 'Attack of the Unknown', 2020, 'Action, Science Fiction, Horror', 'Tamara Rhoads, Adam Werth, Bryce Feeser', 'Brandon Slagle', 'Tara Reid, Robert LaSardo, Richard Grieco, Tania Fox, Jolene Andersen, Tasha Reign, Roberta Sparta, Douglas Tait', null, 'A SWAT team transporting a vicious crime syndicate boss must fight their way out of a county detention center during a catastrophic alien invasion.', 'A SWAT team transporting a vicious crime syndicate boss must fight their way out of a county detention center during a catastrophic alien invasion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c5wDSjzstchAAN3cnVEhAlo10eC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:733006'),
  ('437820573520895052', 'Attack on Darfur', 2009, 'War, Thriller, Drama, Action', 'Uwe Boll, Mathias Neumann, Jacqueline H. Jojo', 'Uwe Boll, Chris Roland', 'Edward Furlong, Billy Zane, Kristanna Loken, David O''Hara, Noah Dalton Danby, Matt Frewer, Hakeem Kae-Kazim, Maggie Benedict', null, 'American journalists in Sudan are confronted with the dilemma of whether to return home to report on the atrocities they have seen, or to stay behind and help some of the victims they have encountered.', 'American journalists in Sudan are confronted with the dilemma of whether to return home to report on the atrocities they have seen, or to stay behind and help some of the victims they have encountered.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mkM5DKevVQmWRXnuY2o42nZEa5T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46217'),
  ('674994069870258004', 'Attack on Finland', 2021, 'Action, Thriller', 'Andrei Alén, Matilde Matvere, Milla Karjalainen', 'Jari Rantala', 'Jasper Pääkkönen, Nanna Blondell, Sverrir Gudnason, Cathy Belton, Nika Savolainen, Pertti Sveholm, Juhan Ulfsak, Zijad Gračić', null, 'The reception for Finland''s Independence Day is rudely interrupted when the presidential palace is attacked and the state leadership is taken hostage. Max Tanner of the Security Police is appointed as a negotiator in the hostage crisis, that unfolds as part of a bigger plan to undermine European security.', 'The reception for Finland''s Independence Day is rudely interrupted when the presidential palace is attacked and the state leadership is taken hostage. Max Tanner of the Security Police is appointed as a negotiator in the hostage crisis, that unfolds as part of a bigger plan to undermine European security.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3Qf11JrAS1Qt5HhhQdBMAETiJzS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:655302'),
  ('515651033231104350', 'Attack on Terror: The FBI vs. the Ku Klux Klan', 1975, 'Drama, Crime, TV Movie', 'Marvin J. Chomsky, Jacques R. Marquette', 'Calvin Clements Sr.', 'Ned Beatty, John Beck, Billy Green Bush, Dabney Coleman, Andrew Duggan, Ed Flanders, George Grizzard, L.Q. Jones', 'NR', 'After three civil-rights workers are murdered in Mississippi in 1964, a team of FBI agents is sent there to find the killers.', 'After three civil-rights workers are murdered in Mississippi in 1964, a team of FBI agents is sent there to find the killers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aLmg6M9TQ5Cjv2363DFc58Vg3KQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:416095'),
  ('781141780484949890', 'Attack on the Iron Coast', 1968, 'War', 'Paul Wendkos', 'Herman Hoffman', 'Lloyd Bridges, Andrew Keir, Sue Lloyd, Mark Eden, Maurice Debham, Glyn Owen, Howard Pays, Walter Gotell', 'PG', 'The film depicts an account of Allied Combined Operations Headquarters commandos executing a daring raid on the German-occupied French coast during the Second World War. The story is based on the commando raid on the French port of St. Nazaire.', 'The film depicts an account of Allied Combined Operations Headquarters commandos executing a daring raid on the German-occupied French coast during the Second World War. The story is based on the commando raid on the French port of St. Nazaire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8OqI7yeaqg1561BkzioghJKCAlE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:124227'),
  ('502459321614564724', 'Attack on the Pin-Up Boys', 2007, 'Comedy', 'Lee Kwon, Eo Jeong-il, Chu In-sik', 'Park Yeon-seon', 'Kim Ki-bum, Donghae, Kim Hee-chul, Kim Young-woon, Choi Si-won, Ryeowook, Shindong, Eunhyuk', null, 'After the unusual attack on a school ''flower boy'', Sung-min, on February 14, the same attacks begin to happen at different high schools on every month of the same day. Rumors say that the next victims will be at Neulparan High School.', 'After the unusual attack on a school ''flower boy'', Sung-min, on February 14, the same attacks begin to happen at different high schools on every month of the same day. Rumors say that the next victims will be at Neulparan High School.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8brn2X1taKNpWxSuZVXrcHN3LMw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75100'),
  ('151607844897181148', 'Attack on Titan', 2015, 'Horror, Action, Science Fiction', 'Kimiyoshi Adachi, Shinji Higuchi, Shôji Ehara', 'Yusuke Watanabe, Tomohiro Machiyama', 'Haruma Miura, Kiko Mizuhara, Kanata Hongo, Hitomi Miyauchi, Takahiro Miura, Satomi Ishihara, Hiroki Hasegawa, Ayame Misaki', 'NR', '100 years ago, titans suddenly appeared on Earth. Soon, human civilization veered on collapse due to the titans. Humans then built a giant wall to defend themselves. Within the giant walls, humans lived in peace, but, 100 years later, the giant wall is broken.', '100 years ago, titans suddenly appeared on Earth. Soon, human civilization veered on collapse due to the titans. Humans then built a giant wall to defend themselves. Within the giant walls, humans lived in peace, but, 100 years later, the giant wall is broken.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ihK3jUDlcQBMEObbLwSswqpiy3Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:295830'),
  ('27151762516462022', 'Attack on Titan', 2022, 'Science Fiction, Action', 'Noah Luke, Noah Luke', 'Gil Luna', 'Michael Paré, Erin Coker, Jack Pearson, Anthony Jensen, Neli Sabour, Karan Sagoo, Natalie Storrs, Justin Tanks', null, 'As viable water is depleted on Earth, a mission is sent to Saturn''s moon Titan to retrieve sustainable H2O reserves from its alien inhabitants. But just as the humans acquire the precious resource, they are attacked by Titan rebels, who don''t trust that the Earthlings will leave in peace.', 'As viable water is depleted on Earth, a mission is sent to Saturn''s moon Titan to retrieve sustainable H2O reserves from its alien inhabitants. But just as the humans acquire the precious resource, they are attacked by Titan rebels, who don''t trust that the Earthlings will leave in peace.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aQQ9oRO273ImFTAmY4RR3kPTkff.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1033219'),
  ('1052709194150988513', 'Attack on Titan II: End of the World', 2015, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Action', 'Kimiyoshi Adachi, Shôji Ehara, Shinji Higuchi', 'Tomohiro Machiyama, Yusuke Watanabe', 'Haruma Miura, Kiko Mizuhara, Kanata Hongo, Hiroki Hasegawa, Hitomi Miyauchi, Satomi Ishihara, Jun Kunimura, Rina Takeda', 'NR', 'Eren Yeager leaves to restore a break in the wall destroyed by a Titan. He comes under attack by the Titans and is cornered. Shikishima comes to his aid. The titans never stops attacking. Eren is now injured and tries to protect Armin, but is swallowed by a titan. A Titan with black hair appears and begins to expel the other titans.', 'Eren Yeager leaves to restore a break in the wall destroyed by a Titan. He comes under attack by the Titans and is cornered. Shikishima comes to his aid. The titans never stops attacking. Eren is now injured and tries to protect Armin, but is swallowed by a titan. A Titan with black hair appears and begins to expel the other titans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l9cJ5PKEkVJb6YUCiURtcMbTQ5D.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:340382'),
  ('303490242263889125', 'Attack on Titan: THE LAST ATTACK', 2024, 'Animation, Action, Adventure, Drama', 'Yuichiro Hayashi, Daisuke Niinuma, Manabu Akita', 'Hiroshi Seko', 'Yuki Kaji, Yui Ishikawa, Marina Inoue, Hiroshi Kamiya, Yu Shimamura, Romi Park, Yoshimasa Hosoya, Kisho Taniyama', 'NR', 'A colossal-sized omnibus film bringing together the last two episodes of Attack on Titan in the franchise''s first-ever theatrical experience. After venturing beyond the walls and separated from his comrades, Eren finds himself inspired by this new truth and plots the "Rumbling," a terrifying plan to eradicate every living thing in the world. With the fate of the world hanging in the balance, a motley crew of Eren''s former comrades and enemies scramble to halt his deadly mission. The only question is, can they stop him?', 'A colossal-sized omnibus film bringing together the last two episodes of Attack on Titan in the franchise''s first-ever theatrical experience. After venturing beyond the walls and separated from his comrades, Eren finds himself inspired by this new truth and plots the "Rumbling," a terrifying plan to eradicate every living thing in the world. With the fate of the world hanging in the balance, a motley crew of Eren''s former comrades and enemies scramble to halt his deadly mission. The only question is, can they stop him?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wgwldDDlTDDMrluOMkpSA8lyKjv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1333100'),
  ('893149585450296414', 'Attack the Block', 2011, 'Action, Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Peter Talbot, Julian Morson, Joe Cornish', 'Joe Cornish', 'John Boyega, Jodie Whittaker, Nick Frost, Alex Esmail, Luke Treadaway, Selom Awadzi, Franz Drameh, Simon Howard', 'R', 'A teen gang in a South London housing estate must team up with the other residents to protect their neighbourhood from a terrifying alien invasion.', 'A teen gang in a South London housing estate must team up with the other residents to protect their neighbourhood from a terrifying alien invasion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wzCMnA6NDruLzgWeqMcLPDrGAdF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59678'),
  ('1101228324401740486', 'Attack the Gas Station 2', 2010, 'Action, Comedy', 'Kim Sang-jin, Im Gyeong-ho', 'Baek Sang-Yeol', 'Ji Hyun-woo, Jo Han-sun, Moon Won-ju, Jeong Jae-hoon, Park Young-kyu, Kwon Yong-hoon, Park Sang-myeon, Lee Hyeon-ji', null, 'It’s been 10 years since Mr. Park’s gas station was attacked by motorcycle gangs. To get his revenge, Park hires a quartet of dodgy boys: a lethal puncher, a footballer with a killer high kick, a potbellied wrestler, and a video game addict who mastered the art of bluffing. But these employees turn out to be more dangerous when they demand their overdue salaries.', 'It’s been 10 years since Mr. Park’s gas station was attacked by motorcycle gangs. To get his revenge, Park hires a quartet of dodgy boys: a lethal puncher, a footballer with a killer high kick, a potbellied wrestler, and a video game addict who mastered the art of bluffing. But these employees turn out to be more dangerous when they demand their overdue salaries.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xC4KG3ewDW4FwxtVQ5ptb7FGItK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38983'),
  ('859711854254674939', 'Attack the Gas Station!', 1999, 'Action, Comedy', 'Kim Sang-jin, Jung Sung-jin', 'Park Jung-woo', 'Lee Sung-jae, Yu Oh-seong, Kang Seong-jin, Yoo Ji-tae, Park Young-kyu, Lee Yo-won, Jung Jun, Kim Soo-ro', 'R', 'A quartet of disaffected Korean youths have robbed a Seoul gas station. After taking the gas station over, their wacky antics ensue; forcing the manager to sing, kidnapping customers that complain about the service, and staging fist-fights between street gang members and gas station employees; all of these reflect their own gripes against society.', 'A quartet of disaffected Korean youths have robbed a Seoul gas station. After taking the gas station over, their wacky antics ensue; forcing the manager to sing, kidnapping customers that complain about the service, and staging fist-fights between street gang members and gas station employees; all of these reflect their own gripes against society.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z4EXiiifZCfqE9nc4FYhcCt12Kw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16606'),
  ('743681770533401680', 'Attelage d''un camion', 1897, 'Documentary', null, null, null, null, 'A parade of horses pulling a very large and, one must assume, heavy cart. Not to be confused with "Transport d’une tourelle par un attelage de 60 chevaux"', 'A parade of horses pulling a very large and, one must assume, heavy cart. Not to be confused with "Transport d’une tourelle par un attelage de 60 chevaux"', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x2vidhSAet1Vxls36kvrDeoT7Ph.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:195133'),
  ('1012092385664936995', 'Attenberg', 2010, 'Drama', 'Athina Rachel Tsangari, Thimios Bakatakis', 'Athina Rachel Tsangari', 'Ariane Labed, Evangelia Randou, Vangelis Mourikis, Yorgos Lanthimos, Kostas Berikopoulos, Michel Demopoulos, Alexandros Niagos, Vasileia Rozana', 'NR', 'Marina, 23, is growing up with her architect father in a prototype factory town by the sea. Finding the human species strange and repellent, she keeps her distance...that is until a stranger comes to town and challenges her to a foosball duel, on her own table. Her father, meanwhile, ritualistically prepares for his exit from the 20th century, which he considers to be "overrated."', 'Marina, 23, is growing up with her architect father in a prototype factory town by the sea. Finding the human species strange and repellent, she keeps her distance...that is until a stranger comes to town and challenges her to a foosball duel, on her own table. Her father, meanwhile, ritualistically prepares for his exit from the 20th century, which he considers to be "overrated."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ry03y6yIwgEZwG5zuCHmOxj8Thk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62321'),
  ('366781286127127921', 'Attention', 1985, 'Romance, Drama', 'Giovanni Soldati, Rinaldo Ricci, Ruth Gross', 'Leone Colonna, Giovanni Soldati, Rodolfo Sonego', 'Stefania Sandrelli, Ben Cross, Amanda Sandrelli, Arnoldo Foà, Claudia Cavalcanti, Elena Pompei, Anita Zagaria, Luciano Baglioni', null, 'On the plane back to Rome, a well-known journalist indulges in an unbridled and somewhat melodramatic erotic fantasy involving his estranged wife and his stepdaughter.', 'On the plane back to Rome, a well-known journalist indulges in an unbridled and somewhat melodramatic erotic fantasy involving his estranged wife and his stepdaughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ooytznPnrS1BD7Ii033kSUgvmDV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:255559'),
  ('650262828626082808', 'Attention danger travail', 2003, 'Documentary', 'Stéphane Goxe, Christophe Coello, Pierre Carles', null, 'Christophe Coello, Stéphane Goxe', null, 'With the energy of the dying, those in power apply themselves to reasserting the value of work – with force, if need be. But more and more workers have understood that, to truly value their work, they have to do without it. They also have to get rid of the society of consumption that goes along with it. It may not be easy, but it is certainly amusing. We present a panorama of a mass desertion destined to spread.', 'With the energy of the dying, those in power apply themselves to reasserting the value of work – with force, if need be. But more and more workers have understood that, to truly value their work, they have to do without it. They also have to get rid of the society of consumption that goes along with it. It may not be easy, but it is certainly amusing. We present a panorama of a mass desertion destined to spread.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kwEbBkqhSVKXWQc7Eki2u1Zp2Pu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31368'),
