  ('716264988148139604', 'Attention, Turtle!', 1970, 'Comedy, Family, Adventure', 'Rolan Bykov, Anatoliy Mukasey, Lika Averbakh', 'Semyon Lungin, Ilya Nusinov', 'Galina Budanova, Alexey Ershov, Andrei Samotolkin, Mikhail Martirosyan, Yelena Ryabukhina, Galina Verbitskaya, Aleksei Golubev, Inga Volodina', null, 'Two curious first-graders decide to steal a turtle named Rocket from a living corner to conduct a risky experiment — they want to put it under the tank in order to check the carrying capacity and strength of the shell. But their classmate Tanya is smarter than her friends: with the help of adults, she manages to organize the rescue of the unfortunate turtle.', 'Two curious first-graders decide to steal a turtle named Rocket from a living corner to conduct a risky experiment — they want to put it under the tank in order to check the carrying capacity and strength of the shell. But their classmate Tanya is smarter than her friends: with the help of adults, she manages to organize the rescue of the unfortunate turtle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eQ5H20a3Zo3ns9HGRLMQWbLSyb5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:141066'),
  ('284755814428101526', 'Attention! Bandits!', 1951, 'Drama, War', 'Gianni Di Venanzo, Carlo Lizzani, Massimo Mida', 'Giuliani G. De Negri, Rodolfo Sonego, Giuseppe Dagnino', 'Gina Lollobrigida, Andrea Checchi, Vittorio Duse, Lamberto Maggiorani, Maria Laura Rocca, Giuliano Montaldo, Giuseppe Taffarel, Franco Bologna', null, 'During the winter of 1944, the partisans stationed in the Ligurian Apennines must go to a factory in Genoa, in order to pick up a delivery of weapons. Meanwhile, there''s a strike in the city and the Nazis are trying to suppress it violently. The factory becomes the scene of fighting between the Germans and the partisans but the latter, aided by the workers, will be able to get the better.', 'During the winter of 1944, the partisans stationed in the Ligurian Apennines must go to a factory in Genoa, in order to pick up a delivery of weapons. Meanwhile, there''s a strike in the city and the Nazis are trying to suppress it violently. The factory becomes the scene of fighting between the Germans and the partisans but the latter, aided by the workers, will be able to get the better.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/maJRFxQHilZIEHY2K7bhAOqRymo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74656'),
