  ('1088931102801780259', 'Attica', 1980, 'Drama, History, TV Movie', 'Marvin J. Chomsky, Donald H. Birnkrant, Tom McCrory', 'James S. Henerson', 'Henry Darrow, Charles Durning, Joel Fabiani, Morgan Freeman, George Grizzard, David Harris, Roger E. Mosley, Arlen Dean Snyder', 'PG-13', 'Acclaimed dramatization recreating the incidents surrounding the 1971 revolt in New York''s Attica State Prison that lasted for 23 days and resulted in the greatest casualty toll between Americans since the Civil War.', 'Acclaimed dramatization recreating the incidents surrounding the 1971 revolt in New York''s Attica State Prison that lasted for 23 days and resulted in the greatest casualty toll between Americans since the Civil War.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dSxPDsiX9qYjAsdBPimrUzUS7m9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:247426'),
