  ('485947372173991160', 'Au Hasard Balthazar', 1966, 'Drama', 'Robert Bresson, Claude Miller, Jacques Kébadian', 'Robert Bresson', 'Anne Wiazemsky, Walter Green, François Lafarge, Jean-Claude Guilbert, Philippe Asselin, Pierre Klossowski, Nathalie Joyaut, Marie-Claire Fremont', 'NR', 'The story of a donkey Balthazar as he is passed from owner to owner, some kind and some cruel but all with motivations beyond his understanding. Balthazar, whose life parallels that of his first keeper, Marie, is truly a beast of burden, suffering the sins of humankind. But despite his powerlessness, he accepts his fate nobly.', 'The story of a donkey Balthazar as he is passed from owner to owner, some kind and some cruel but all with motivations beyond his understanding. Balthazar, whose life parallels that of his first keeper, Marie, is truly a beast of burden, suffering the sins of humankind. But despite his powerlessness, he accepts his fate nobly.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lkLO1HDzzaXpTXtAgnGpVqIQkvF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20108'),
