  ('407765040738857653', 'Audioscopiks', 1935, 'Documentary', 'Jacob Leventhal, John Norling', null, 'Pete Smith', null, 'After the audience is instructed how to use the 3-D glasses they received, demonstrations of three-dimensional films are presented. Various objects move towards the camera, including a ladder being shoved out a window, the slide on a trombone, a woman on a swing, and a thrown baseball.', 'After the audience is instructed how to use the 3-D glasses they received, demonstrations of three-dimensional films are presented. Various objects move towards the camera, including a ladder being shoved out a window, the slide on a trombone, a woman on a swing, and a thrown baseball.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e3jGE8aVKHspxiBdLISrECIsKl0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:197173'),
  ('100895401986699763', 'Audition', 1964, 'Music, Documentary', 'Ivan Passer, Tomáš Kulík, Boca Abrhámová', 'Ivan Passer, Miloš Forman', 'Jan Vostrčil, František Zeman, Vladimír Pucholt, Václav Blumentál, Jindřich Praveček, Jiří Suchý, Jiří Šlitr, Věra Křesadlová', null, 'Two closely related episodes. Youths make problems for two local orchestras about to compete nationally, and in a talent competition a young girl gets stage fright, while another lies to her boss to compete.', 'Two closely related episodes. Youths make problems for two local orchestras about to compete nationally, and in a talent competition a young girl gets stage fright, while another lies to her boss to compete.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aebIhngYMxNhK9CupfnJ6OACLOb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48599'),
  ('805050218047534089', 'Audition', 2000, 'Horror, Drama', 'Takashi Miike, Hideo Yamamoto, Michael Villella', 'Daisuke Tengan', 'Ryo Ishibashi, Eihi Shiina, Jun Kunimura, Tetsu Sawaki, Renji Ishibashi, Miyuki Matsuda, Toshie Negishi, Yuriko Hirooka', 'R', 'Seven years after the death of his wife, widower Shigeharu seeks advice on how to find a new wife from a colleague. Taking advantage of their position as a film company, they stage an audition. Interviewing a series of women, Shigeharu is enchanted by the quiet Asami. But soon things take a twisted turn as Asami isn’t what she seems to be.', 'Seven years after the death of his wife, widower Shigeharu seeks advice on how to find a new wife from a colleague. Taking advantage of their position as a film company, they stage an audition. Interviewing a series of women, Shigeharu is enchanted by the quiet Asami. But soon things take a twisted turn as Asami isn’t what she seems to be.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zwGaUMm0wAqi0wkO7LJDlwoA5LP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11075'),
  ('900456469860475579', 'Audition', 2005, 'Drama', 'Luc Picard', 'Luc Picard', 'Luc Picard, Suzanne Clément, Alexis Martin, Marie-France Lambert, Denis Bernard, Julie McClemens , Louise Proulx, Henri Picard', null, 'Louis is "repo man" who is no stranger to strong-arm tactics in his work, but he has dreamed of becoming an actor since he was a child. When his cousin helps him get an audition, Louis gets the help of a famous actor to secretly help rehearse his scenes. He doesn''t even tell his girlfriend Suzie. But Suzie also has a secret; she''s pregnant and doesn''t want her child to grow up in an atmosphere of violence.', 'Louis is "repo man" who is no stranger to strong-arm tactics in his work, but he has dreamed of becoming an actor since he was a child. When his cousin helps him get an audition, Louis gets the help of a famous actor to secretly help rehearse his scenes. He doesn''t even tell his girlfriend Suzie. But Suzie also has a secret; she''s pregnant and doesn''t want her child to grow up in an atmosphere of violence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kk24p9zkWafZgPOYKN6aG7Lq8QL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49735'),
  ('1119362002838359295', 'Auditions', 1978, 'Comedy', 'Harry Hurwitz, R. Michael Stringer', 'Albert Band', 'Bonnie Werchan, Rick Cassidy, Mitch Evans, Ernie Guderjahn, Linnea Quigley, Vance Kolberg, Carolyn Burch, Robert Staats', null, 'A pseudo-documentary about the processes involved in putting together and casting actors and actresses for a porn film. Although several actual porn stars are in the film, it is not a porn film itself.', 'A pseudo-documentary about the processes involved in putting together and casting actors and actresses for a porn film. Although several actual porn stars are in the film, it is not a porn film itself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5GJ7OwV54XbgNH8blIs9Sfz7KIe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29818'),
  ('143297110607482783', 'Audrey', 2020, 'Documentary, History, TV Movie', 'Jeanne Veldhoen, Robyn Henderson, Libby Adam', 'Helena Coan', 'Alessandra Ferri, Francesca Hayward, Keira Moore, Michael Avedon, Peter Bogdanovich, Clémence Boulouque, Anna Cataldi, Richard Dreyfuss', null, 'An unprecedented and intimate look at the life, work and enduring legacy of British actress Audrey Hepburn (1929-1993).', 'An unprecedented and intimate look at the life, work and enduring legacy of British actress Audrey Hepburn (1929-1993).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ikAgImz1rkedYM2mW0TeGZP1xdi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:757388'),
  ('927144670536506776', 'Audrey Rose', 1977, 'Drama, Horror, Thriller', 'Robert Wise, Victor J. Kemper', 'Frank De Felitta', 'Marsha Mason, Anthony Hopkins, John Beck, Susan Swift, Norman Lloyd, John Hillerman, Robert Walden, Philip Sterling', 'PG', 'A man is convinced that 11-year old girl, Ivy, is the reincarnation of his own daughter Audrey Rose, who died in a fiery car accident, along with his wife, two minutes before Ivy was born.', 'A man is convinced that 11-year old girl, Ivy, is the reincarnation of his own daughter Audrey Rose, who died in a fiery car accident, along with his wife, two minutes before Ivy was born.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/omtHuaCwKRX20x5R8xnqxWYq8Xp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49126'),
  ('1128946751873021496', 'Audrie & Daisy', 2016, 'Documentary', 'Bonni Cohen, Jon Shenk, Jon Shenk', null, 'Daisy Coleman, Jim Fall, Delaney Henderson, Darren White', null, 'A documentary film about three cases of rape, that includes the stories of two American high school students, Audrie Pott and Daisy Coleman. At the time of the sexual assaults, Pott was 15 and Coleman was 14 years old. After the assaults, the victims and their families were subjected to abuse and cyberbullying.', 'A documentary film about three cases of rape, that includes the stories of two American high school students, Audrie Pott and Daisy Coleman. At the time of the sexual assaults, Pott was 15 and Coleman was 14 years old. After the assaults, the victims and their families were subjected to abuse and cyberbullying.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4AsrmTmKMVs8PmBnu6jNpMekoBj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:376228'),
  ('101139308721837674', 'Auf der anderen Seite ist das Gras viel Grüner', 2017, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'Daniel Gottschalk, Pepe Danquart', 'Antonia Rothe-Liermann, Pepe Danquart, Stefan Barth', 'Jessica Schwarz, Felix Klare, Christoph Letkowski, Judy Winter, Elena Uhlig, Mirijam Verena Jeremic, Pheline Roggan, Juliane Köhler', null, 'Kati has had her dream man at home for five years: attractive, loyal and professionally successful as a doctor. Unfortunately, "her" Felix now spends so much time at work in the hospital that Kati too often feels alone. When she met the good-looking, charming artist Mathias, it hit her like Felix did back then. Shortly before her last inhibitions fall, fate shuffles the cards in an unbelievable way: after a car accident, Kati wakes up in the past - exactly on the day five years ago when she accidentally met Felix', 'Kati has had her dream man at home for five years: attractive, loyal and professionally successful as a doctor. Unfortunately, "her" Felix now spends so much time at work in the hospital that Kati too often feels alone. When she met the good-looking, charming artist Mathias, it hit her like Felix did back then. Shortly before her last inhibitions fall, fate shuffles the cards in an unbelievable way: after a car accident, Kati wakes up in the past - exactly on the day five years ago when she accidentally met Felix', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3og1mlPzJW8xcBQR7qg8mwNjfoM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:432689'),
  ('248700118163261621', 'Auggie Rose', 2000, 'Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Matthew Tabak, Adam Kimmel', 'Matthew Tabak', 'Jeff Goldblum, Anne Heche, Nancy Travis, Timothy Olyphant, Joe Santos, Richard T. Jones, Kim Coates, Paige Moss', null, 'An insurance salesman''s humdrum existence takes a turn when a stranger, ex-con Auggie Rose, unexpectedly dies in his arms. Assuming the identity of the dead man, the salesman embarks on a double life, keeping it secret from his live-in girlfriend.', 'An insurance salesman''s humdrum existence takes a turn when a stranger, ex-con Auggie Rose, unexpectedly dies in his arms. Assuming the identity of the dead man, the salesman embarks on a double life, keeping it secret from his live-in girlfriend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lNTPMDT6tts9zLPTRjjiH5goIcC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:113213'),
  ('1121006618720461730', 'Auguri professore', 1997, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Riccardo Milani, Loredana Conte, Massimiliano Papi', 'Stefano Rulli, Sandro Petraglia, Riccardo Milani', 'Silvio Orlando, Claudia Pandolfi, Duilio Del Prete, Claudia Della Seta, Lorenzo Alessandri, Claudio Remondi, Lucio Allocca, Imma Piro', null, 'Professor Lipari teaches in a public school and is in a full-on existential crisis. He has no faith in himself and in the possibility of changing the world for the better. At school, a former student of his who is also a teacher will change his attitude.', 'Professor Lipari teaches in a public school and is in a full-on existential crisis. He has no faith in himself and in the possibility of changing the world for the better. At school, a former student of his who is also a teacher will change his attitude.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vZWOYuT2qYvRy8I3ypnyrINdpj4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58741'),
  ('1101057228681578731', 'August', 1996, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'Anthony Hopkins, Robin Vidgeon', 'Julian Mitchell', 'Anthony Hopkins, Leslie Phillips, Kate Burton, Gawn Grainger, Rhian Morgan, Hugh Lloyd, Menna Trussler, Rhys Ifans', 'PG-13', 'Set in 1890s North Wales over a long, hot August weekend, the Victorian calm of a household is suddenly upset with the arrival of a London couple who impose their city ways and thoughts on the more rurally based family. An adaptation of Anton Chekhov''s play, "Uncle Vanya."', 'Set in 1890s North Wales over a long, hot August weekend, the Victorian calm of a household is suddenly upset with the arrival of a London couple who impose their city ways and thoughts on the more rurally based family. An adaptation of Anton Chekhov''s play, "Uncle Vanya."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lWU5Sf6xQGzVWd2OkKlDZhdK29k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:161070'),
  ('192477914129022593', 'August', 2008, 'Drama', 'Austin Chick, Andrij Parekh', 'Howard A. Rodman', 'Josh Hartnett, Adam Scott, Robin Tunney, Andre Royo, Naomie Harris, Emmanuelle Chriqui, Laila Robins, Caroline Lagerfelt', 'PG-13', 'Two brothers, ambitious dot-com entrepreneurs, attempt to keep their company afloat as the stock market begins to collapse in August 2001, one month prior to the 9/11 attacks.', 'Two brothers, ambitious dot-com entrepreneurs, attempt to keep their company afloat as the stock market begins to collapse in August 2001, one month prior to the 9/11 attacks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8jvENQepW1ZrJ4KxN2H8eExWIzs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13692'),
  ('283690517245888178', 'August 15th', 2001, 'Comedy', 'Patrick Alessandrin, Damien Morisot', 'Lisa Azuelos, Patrick Alessandrin', 'Richard Berry, Charles Berling, Jean-Pierre Darroussin, Blandine Bury, Mélanie Thierry, Selma El Mouissi, Manon Gaurin, Thomas Goulard', null, 'Three men are abandonned by their wives for a few days in the summer holidays. They are alone with five kids to feed and a house to maintain. And they will learn what they did wrong with their wives.', 'Three men are abandonned by their wives for a few days in the summer holidays. They are alone with five kids to feed and a house to maintain. And they will learn what they did wrong with their wives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9tC2c9pGVMEqfivcYH412FwFeQa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18296'),
  ('404091477047749289', 'August 32nd on Earth', 1999, 'Romance, Drama', 'Denis Villeneuve, André Turpin, Mireille Goulet', 'Denis Villeneuve', 'Pascale Bussières, Alexis Martin, Paule Baillargeon, Emmanuel Bilodeau, Joanne Côté, Frédéric Desager, Venelina Ghiaourov, R. Craig Costin', null, 'After escaping unscathed from a car accident, photo model Simone decides that having a baby is the only way to give her vacant life some meaning. She asks her best friend Philippe to get her pregnant, and he reluctantly agrees, on the condition that they conceive somewhere in a desert, so they leave Montréal on a 24-hour round-trip to Salt Lake City to find a suitable spot.', 'After escaping unscathed from a car accident, photo model Simone decides that having a baby is the only way to give her vacant life some meaning. She asks her best friend Philippe to get her pregnant, and he reluctantly agrees, on the condition that they conceive somewhere in a desert, so they leave Montréal on a 24-hour round-trip to Salt Lake City to find a suitable spot.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iE0XpMkBOGgqYZ2UsS6bqtjvfLG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59482'),
  ('752131567746528855', 'August in the Water', 1995, 'Science Fiction, Drama, Fantasy, Mystery', 'Gakuryu Ishii, Shûichi Matsumura, Yoshimasa Fujie', 'Gakuryu Ishii', 'Rena Komine, Shinsuke Aoki, Reiko Matsuo, Masaaki Takarai, Naho Toda, Hideyo Amamoto, Masao Kusakari, Yuji Nakamura', null, 'A teenage girl gains supernatural power after an accident and comes to understand her place in the universe.', 'A teenage girl gains supernatural power after an accident and comes to understand her place in the universe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7DSzmj7srsNMtiYntX2VeZEVufN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104268'),
  ('236100377934200050', 'August Rush', 2007, 'Family, Drama, Music', 'Kirsten Sheridan, John Mathieson', 'James V. Hart, Nick Castle', 'Freddie Highmore, Keri Russell, Jonathan Rhys Meyers, Terrence Howard, Robin Williams, William Sadler, Marian Seldes, Mykelti Williamson', 'PG', 'Lyla and Louis, a singer and a musician, fall in love, but are soon compelled to separate. Lyla is forced to give up her newborn but unknown to her, he grows up to become a musical genius.', 'Lyla and Louis, a singer and a musician, fall in love, but are soon compelled to separate. Lyla is forced to give up her newborn but unknown to her, he grows up to become a musical genius.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oA6ZeICPINiS6YtD5WZeBaGVmuT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5123'),
  ('279208035904977200', 'August Underground', 2001, 'Horror', 'Fred Vogel', 'Allen Peters, Fred Vogel', 'Fred Vogel, Kyle Dealman, Allen Peters, Casey Eganey, Dan Friedman, AnnMarie Reveruzzi, Alexa Iris, Victoria Jones', 'NR', 'Imagine walking down the street and finding an unmarked VHS tape. Curiosity piqued, you take it home and pop it in. What starts off as two men screwing around with a video camera quickly transforms into an ultra-realistic torture sequence where the unidentified psychopaths tape their exploits as they torment and violate a woman tied to a chair. The devastation of your morals continues throughout the entirety of the footage, while subtly revealing the killer''s shattered pasts via the interaction with their victims and each other.', 'Imagine walking down the street and finding an unmarked VHS tape. Curiosity piqued, you take it home and pop it in. What starts off as two men screwing around with a video camera quickly transforms into an ultra-realistic torture sequence where the unidentified psychopaths tape their exploits as they torment and violate a woman tied to a chair. The devastation of your morals continues throughout the entirety of the footage, while subtly revealing the killer''s shattered pasts via the interaction with their victims and each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4zdKBTOl4I6fOcXNWeecT0RXpLB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24836'),
  ('526322496950017118', 'August Underground''s Mordum', 2003, 'Horror', 'Fred Vogel, Jerami Cruise, Cristie Whiles', 'Fred Vogel, Jerami Cruise', 'Fred Vogel, Cristie Whiles, Michael Todd Schneider, Jerami Cruise, Killjoy, ''M.'' Kadath, Erik Schultz, Midian Crosby', 'NR', 'The sequel to the cult classic August Underground is a character study in the sick, an amoral putrid fantasy. The found footage contained in August Underground’s MORDUM documents extreme deviant sexuality, torture and murder, while unfolding a classic tale of a man and woman in love. However, the woman cannot give up her other lover, who also happens to be her younger brother. August Underground’s MORDUM will vomit all over you and leave you for dead!', 'The sequel to the cult classic August Underground is a character study in the sick, an amoral putrid fantasy. The found footage contained in August Underground’s MORDUM documents extreme deviant sexuality, torture and murder, while unfolding a classic tale of a man and woman in love. However, the woman cannot give up her other lover, who also happens to be her younger brother. August Underground’s MORDUM will vomit all over you and leave you for dead!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aiPdmqkCr4el6YSKTUyKUdhTrbL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24837'),
  ('369264502781615566', 'August Underground''s Penance', 2007, 'Horror', 'Fred Vogel', 'Cristie Whiles, Fred Vogel, Allen Peters', 'Fred Vogel, Cristie Whiles, Shelby Vogel, Jerami Cruise, Anthony Matthews, Rob Steinbruegge, Talia Becker, Lucious Ridgewood', 'NR', 'Has someone ever handed you a movie, not telling you one thing about it, only telling you to watch it. What if that tape was the personal home video of two sociopaths on a killing spree? This is their home movie, for their eyes-only. This is August Underground''s Penance. The third and final film in the AU franchise directed by Fred Vogel and starring Cristie "Crusty" Whiles. Penance shows the dark decline of the two nameless killers from the previous films as they continue to videotape their madness on their path to destruction.', 'Has someone ever handed you a movie, not telling you one thing about it, only telling you to watch it. What if that tape was the personal home video of two sociopaths on a killing spree? This is their home movie, for their eyes-only. This is August Underground''s Penance. The third and final film in the AU franchise directed by Fred Vogel and starring Cristie "Crusty" Whiles. Penance shows the dark decline of the two nameless killers from the previous films as they continue to videotape their madness on their path to destruction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a1vplTEojgW37KxkcTlhS6W3l1p.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39855'),
  ('985340736263343213', 'August Vacation', 1996, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Paolo Virzì, Paolo Carnera, Gianluca Greco', 'Paolo Virzì, Francesco Bruni', 'Silvio Orlando, Sabrina Ferilli, Ennio Fantastichini, Laura Morante, Antonella Ponziani, Piero Natoli, Paola Tiziana Cruciani, Gigio Alberti', null, 'Like every August, journalist Sandro, his family and acquaintances vacation on the island of Ventotene. This time, however, they find out the house next door has been rented to a lower middle class family, whose crass nature and values soon clash with their own intellectual and progressive background.', 'Like every August, journalist Sandro, his family and acquaintances vacation on the island of Ventotene. This time, however, they find out the house next door has been rented to a lower middle class family, whose crass nature and values soon clash with their own intellectual and progressive background.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4Z0006tsCju5lqQJjb4kAsaXlhx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56399'),
  ('754680009327650858', 'August Winds', 2014, 'Drama', 'Gabriel Mascaro, Ana Lucia Diniz, Pedro Maia', 'Rachel Ellis, Gabriel Mascaro', 'Dandara de Morais, Geová Manoel do Santos, Maria Salvino dos Santos, Cândida Bezerra Galindo, Antônio José dos Santos, Gabriel Mascaro, Antônio José da Silva, Julian Monteiro', null, 'Shirley has left the big city to live in a small seaside town and look after her elderly grandmother. She drives a tractor on a local coconut plantation, loves rock music and wants to be a tattoo artist. She feels trapped in the tiny coastal village. She is involved with Jeison, who also works on the coconut farm and who free dives for lobster and octopus in his spare time.', 'Shirley has left the big city to live in a small seaside town and look after her elderly grandmother. She drives a tractor on a local coconut plantation, loves rock music and wants to be a tattoo artist. She feels trapped in the tiny coastal village. She is involved with Jeison, who also works on the coconut farm and who free dives for lobster and octopus in his spare time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ttS1OvOlAV9yrOTe6l02ReZTCdy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:285581'),
  ('414941828858571513', 'August Without Emperor', 1978, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Noritaka Sakamoto, Satsuo Yamamoto, Isao Kumagai', 'Masayuki Shibuya, Nobuo Yamada, Satsuo Yamamoto', 'Tsunehiko Watase, Sayuri Yoshinaga, Etsushi Takahashi, Kei Yamamoto, Rentaro Mikuni, Tsutomu Yamazaki, Kensaku Morita, Toshiyuki Nagashima', null, 'Taking the Chilean coup as an example, a group of young officers plan to overthrow the Japanese government on V-J Day. They aim to abolish the post-war constitution, restore the national army and revive the traditional spirit of Japan. As the conspiracy is exposed, the coup squadrons are wiped out one by one. The remaining squadron takes over a night train bound for Tokyo.', 'Taking the Chilean coup as an example, a group of young officers plan to overthrow the Japanese government on V-J Day. They aim to abolish the post-war constitution, restore the national army and revive the traditional spirit of Japan. As the conspiracy is exposed, the coup squadrons are wiped out one by one. The remaining squadron takes over a night train bound for Tokyo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wdU5Ft7YZzwOgbvwDlw9y6I0s4H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:299042'),
  ('683512423990596162', 'August Without Him', 1994, 'Documentary', 'Hirokazu Kore-eda', null, 'Hirata Yukata', null, 'Hirata Yukata became the first man in Japan to publicly acknowledge that he had contracted HIV through gay sex. Filmed over a series of months, the documentary contrasts his public life as an outspoken figure on the lecture circuit with his personal descent into illness and death.', 'Hirata Yukata became the first man in Japan to publicly acknowledge that he had contracted HIV through gay sex. Filmed over a series of months, the documentary contrasts his public life as an outspoken figure on the lecture circuit with his personal descent into illness and death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wUEZTeLNejBqLPMnRAAfpGRse1e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:247739'),
  ('550914742773613138', 'August: Osage County', 2013, 'Comedy, Drama', 'John Wells, Adriano Goldman, Ian Calip', 'Tracy Letts', 'Meryl Streep, Julia Roberts, Julianne Nicholson, Juliette Lewis, Ewan McGregor, Margo Martindale, Abigail Breslin, Chris Cooper', 'R', 'An intense look at the lives of the strong-willed daughters of the Weston family, whose paths have diverged until a family crisis brings them back to the Midwest house they grew up in, and to the dysfunctional mother who raised them.', 'An intense look at the lives of the strong-willed daughters of the Weston family, whose paths have diverged until a family crisis brings them back to the Midwest house they grew up in, and to the dysfunctional mother who raised them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fvjxr77dfxdIOY3lvj0bHP4B5xT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:152737'),
  ('633140524272980566', 'August. Eighth', 2012, 'Action, Drama, Fantasy', 'Sergey Trofimov, Dzhanik Fayziev, Mikhail Milashin', 'Dzhanik Fayziev, Michael A. Lerner', 'Svetlana Ivanova, Maksim Matveev, Artyom Fadeev, Aleksey Guskov, Aleksandr Oleshko, Vladimir Vdovichenkov, Sergey Gazarov, Gosha Kutsenko', 'R', 'August Eighth - story of an ordinary young woman. Ksenia''s life is not too happy. Problem at work, problem in personal life, problem with mother, a baby requiring constant cares... Ksenia want to spend a few days in Sochi with new boyfriend, and mom sends her son Artem to the boy''s father on Caucasus. But Georgia started war and she must overcome fear, overcome circumstances, she must save her child...', 'August Eighth - story of an ordinary young woman. Ksenia''s life is not too happy. Problem at work, problem in personal life, problem with mother, a baby requiring constant cares... Ksenia want to spend a few days in Sochi with new boyfriend, and mom sends her son Artem to the boy''s father on Caucasus. But Georgia started war and she must overcome fear, overcome circumstances, she must save her child...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gZuO1a7izjsUSDu3OZtv4M4gzgs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:96231'),
  ('805102064458665218', 'Augustin, King of Kung-Fu', 1999, 'Comedy', 'Anne Fontaine, Christophe Pollock, Marie-Jeanne Pascal', 'Anne Fontaine, Jacques Fieschi, Gilles Taurand', 'Bernard Campan, Jean-Chrétien Sibertin-Blanc, Paulette Dubost, Maggie Cheung, Jackie Chan, Darry Cowl, Pascal Bonitzer, Patricia Dinev', null, 'The solitary and largely self-contained Augustin (Jean-Chretien Sibertin Blanc), on obscure young actor of bit-parts and advertisements, has but one ambition - to play the lead role in a Kung Fu epic. But hours of Kung Fu practice alone in his room are not enough. Augustin knows he must pack up and start a new life in China... or at least that part of China within bicycling distance: Chinatown in south-east Paris. There he meets Ling (Maggie Cheung), a young Chinese woman who practices ocupuncture, and little by little, Ling''s needles awaken emotions in Augustin that his virginal body had never dreamed of. Where will this lead him? To Kung Fu stardom, maybe not, but to another destiny, a quirky but logical continuation of the same dream.', 'The solitary and largely self-contained Augustin (Jean-Chretien Sibertin Blanc), on obscure young actor of bit-parts and advertisements, has but one ambition - to play the lead role in a Kung Fu epic. But hours of Kung Fu practice alone in his room are not enough. Augustin knows he must pack up and start a new life in China... or at least that part of China within bicycling distance: Chinatown in south-east Paris. There he meets Ling (Maggie Cheung), a young Chinese woman who practices ocupuncture, and little by little, Ling''s needles awaken emotions in Augustin that his virginal body had never dreamed of. Where will this lead him? To Kung Fu stardom, maybe not, but to another destiny, a quirky but logical continuation of the same dream.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tKzm2brQ1mO7gkRtIbQodBSAljh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64919'),
  ('37515520243285836', 'Augustine', 2012, 'Drama, History', 'Georges Lechaptois, Alice Winocour', 'Alice Winocour', 'Soko, Vincent Lindon, Chiara Mastroianni, Roxane Duran, Olivier Rabourdin, Lise Lamétrie, Ange Ruzé, Stéphan Wojtowicz', 'NR', 'Set in Belle Époque France, the story follows nineteen-year-old "hysteria" patient Augustine, the star of Professor Charcot''s experiments in hypnosis, as she transitions from object of study to object of desire.', 'Set in Belle Époque France, the story follows nineteen-year-old "hysteria" patient Augustine, the star of Professor Charcot''s experiments in hypnosis, as she transitions from object of study to object of desire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7RWCu5ZmfyuUeWaDDIvv70djcbE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:127856'),
