  ('357059099943440301', 'Aurora Teagarden Mysteries: A Game of Cat and Mouse', 2019, 'Mystery, TV Movie, Crime', 'Mariana Garcia Arteaga, Laurie Pavon Solis, Stephanie Boeke', 'Teena Booth', 'Candace Cameron Bure, Marilu Henner, Niall Matter, Lexa Doig, Peter Benson, Miranda Frigon, Dylan Sloane, Tammy Gillis', 'PG', 'Someone begins taunting Aurora Teagarden with cryptic clues left at crime scenes, so the librarian-turned-crime buff attempts to figure out who is behind the creepy “game.” But when the people closest to Aurora become targets, the game takes on a much more dangerous edge as it points to a planned murder. The 10th installment in Aurora Teagarden Mysteries.', 'Someone begins taunting Aurora Teagarden with cryptic clues left at crime scenes, so the librarian-turned-crime buff attempts to figure out who is behind the creepy “game.” But when the people closest to Aurora become targets, the game takes on a much more dangerous edge as it points to a planned murder. The 10th installment in Aurora Teagarden Mysteries.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pb15uoxtqbK8JdSPbjEx1K0KPA7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:590118'),
  ('939328266889685050', 'Aurora Teagarden Mysteries: A Very Foul Play', 2019, 'Mystery, TV Movie, Thriller, Crime', 'Manon Lewis, Stephanie Boeke, Pieter Stathis', 'Michael Vickerman, Teena Booth', 'Candace Cameron Bure, Niall Matter, Marilu Henner, Lexa Doig, Peter Benson, Miranda Frigon, Dylan Sloane, Lauren K. Robek', 'PG', 'At a gathering of mystery and true crime fans, Aurora Teagarden’s nephew, Phillip, is accused of murder when an unplanned onstage blackout during the play in which he is performing ends, revealing Phillip holding the bloody knife that has just killed one of the other performers. 12th installment in Aurora Teagarden Mysteries', 'At a gathering of mystery and true crime fans, Aurora Teagarden’s nephew, Phillip, is accused of murder when an unplanned onstage blackout during the play in which he is performing ends, revealing Phillip holding the bloody knife that has just killed one of the other performers. 12th installment in Aurora Teagarden Mysteries', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wIJ9u8pL2Pi7bAfDto4mLTy9i9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:590123'),
