  ('738722572223306165', 'Aurora Teagarden Mysteries: Reunited and It Feels So Deadly', 2020, 'Mystery, Crime, TV Movie, Drama', 'Jason Yeung, Kevin Speckmaier, Adam McCarthy', 'Teena Booth', 'Candace Cameron Bure, Niall Matter, Marilu Henner, Lexa Doig, Peter Benson, Miranda Frigon, Ellie Harvie, Kate Isaac', 'PG', 'Aurora''s high school reunion turns deadly when a body is found in the hotel pool. Aurora and her Real Murders Club help investigate which classmate was most likely to kill.', 'Aurora''s high school reunion turns deadly when a body is found in the hotel pool. Aurora and her Real Murders Club help investigate which classmate was most likely to kill.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mc5SHXpgl8D5R6AqMF4SvS46bSA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:741755'),
  ('431342333479531425', 'Aurora Teagarden Mysteries: The Disappearing Game', 2018, 'TV Movie, Drama, Crime, Mystery', 'Kevin Speckmaier, Adam McCarthy, Ross Langill', 'Teena Booth', 'Candace Cameron Bure, Marilu Henner, Niall Matter, Lexa Doig, Peter Benson, James Rittinger, Dylan Sloane, Dakota Daulby', 'G', 'Crime-solving librarian Aurora Teagarden leaps headfirst into Lawrenceton’s latest murder investigation when her nephew Phillip and his college roommate go missing after the roommate’s girlfriend is found dead. Enlisting the help of her Real Murders pals, and the handsome college professor Nick Miller who just moved in across the street from her, Roe uncovers a kidnapping plot gone awry.', 'Crime-solving librarian Aurora Teagarden leaps headfirst into Lawrenceton’s latest murder investigation when her nephew Phillip and his college roommate go missing after the roommate’s girlfriend is found dead. Enlisting the help of her Real Murders pals, and the handsome college professor Nick Miller who just moved in across the street from her, Roe uncovers a kidnapping plot gone awry.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n922tm6mZm3m2XNv7VzhGqxgFF6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:531158'),
  ('224617520830655024', 'Aurora Teagarden Mysteries: Til Death Do Us Part', 2021, 'TV Movie, Mystery, Crime', 'Pieter Stathis, Riley Walsh, Ashley Sawyer', 'Teena Booth', 'Candace Cameron Bure, Niall Matter, Marilu Henner, Lexa Doig, Peter Benson, Dylan Sloane, Ellie Harvie, Andrew Airlie', 'PG', 'Just days before Aurora’s wedding, a body is discovered, and she fears her father may be a suspect. She and Nick race to solve the cold case before they walk down the aisle.', 'Just days before Aurora’s wedding, a body is discovered, and she fears her father may be a suspect. She and Nick race to solve the cold case before they walk down the aisle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ujQEazbtIX9WnbXE9ZyJClabFiL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:793465'),
