  ('73855857617921185', 'Austeria', 1983, 'Drama, War', 'Jerzy Kawalerowicz, Zygmunt Samosiuk, Andrzej Reiter', 'Tadeusz Konwicki, Jerzy Kawalerowicz, Julian Stryjkowski', 'Franciszek Pieczka, Wojciech Pszoniak, Jan Szurmiej, Ewa Domańska, Wojciech Standełło, Liliana Komorowska, Szymon Szurmiej, Gołda Tencer', null, 'During a pogrom in Poland on the eve of World War I, a group of Jews seek refuge from the Cossacks. The fugitives hide out in a rural inn, terrified that they may be given away at any moment.', 'During a pogrom in Poland on the eve of World War I, a group of Jews seek refuge from the Cossacks. The fugitives hide out in a rural inn, terrified that they may be given away at any moment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7tvIpxLksOEmAvrmCkB0cKnM19b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38379'),
  ('259797253228541421', 'Austin Powers in Goldmember', 2002, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Jay Roach, Peter Deming, Mark Worthington', 'Mike Myers, Michael McCullers', 'Mike Myers, Beyoncé, Seth Green, Michael York, Robert Wagner, Mindy Sterling, Verne Troyer, Michael Caine', 'PG-13', 'The world''s most shagadelic spy continues his fight against Dr. Evil. This time, the diabolical doctor and his clone, Mini-Me, team up with a new foe—''70s kingpin Goldmember. While pursuing the team of villains to stop them from world domination, Austin gets help from his dad and an old girlfriend.', 'The world''s most shagadelic spy continues his fight against Dr. Evil. This time, the diabolical doctor and his clone, Mini-Me, team up with a new foe—''70s kingpin Goldmember. While pursuing the team of villains to stop them from world domination, Austin gets help from his dad and an old girlfriend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n8V61f1v7idya4WJzGEJNoIp9iL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:818'),
  ('914036554678506002', 'Austin Powers: International Man of Mystery', 1997, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Jay Roach, Peter Deming, Douglas Aarniokoski', 'Mike Myers', 'Mike Myers, Elizabeth Hurley, Michael York, Mimi Rogers, Robert Wagner, Seth Green, Fabiana Udenio, Mindy Sterling', 'PG-13', 'As a swinging fashion photographer by day and a groovy British superagent by night, Austin Powers is the ''60s'' most shagadelic spy. But can he stop megalomaniac Dr. Evil after the bald villain freezes himself and unthaws in the ''90s? With the help of sexy sidekick Vanessa Kensington, he just might.', 'As a swinging fashion photographer by day and a groovy British superagent by night, Austin Powers is the ''60s'' most shagadelic spy. But can he stop megalomaniac Dr. Evil after the bald villain freezes himself and unthaws in the ''90s? With the help of sexy sidekick Vanessa Kensington, he just might.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5uD4dxNX8JKFjWKYMHyOsqhi5pN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:816'),
  ('86945159566000669', 'Austin Powers: The Spy Who Shagged Me', 1999, 'Comedy, Adventure, Crime', 'Jay Roach, Ueli Steiger, Hal Olofsson', 'Mike Myers, Michael McCullers', 'Mike Myers, Heather Graham, Verne Troyer, Michael York, Robert Wagner, Seth Green, Mindy Sterling, Will Ferrell', 'PG-13', 'When diabolical genius Dr. Evil travels back in time to steal superspy Austin Powers''s ‘mojo,’ Austin must return to the swingin'' ''60s himself - with the help of American agent, Felicity Shagwell - to stop the dastardly plan. Once there, Austin faces off against Dr. Evil''s army of minions to try to save the world in his own unbelievably groovy way.', 'When diabolical genius Dr. Evil travels back in time to steal superspy Austin Powers''s ‘mojo,’ Austin must return to the swingin'' ''60s himself - with the help of American agent, Felicity Shagwell - to stop the dastardly plan. Once there, Austin faces off against Dr. Evil''s army of minions to try to save the world in his own unbelievably groovy way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jiF7UShERJFn5RtgfBK2lIJrOTc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:817'),
  ('947667913820867099', 'Australia', 2008, 'Adventure, Romance, Drama', 'Mandy Walker, Baz Luhrmann, Ed Cotton', 'Stuart Beattie, Ronald Harwood, Richard Flanagan', 'Nicole Kidman, Hugh Jackman, Essie Davis, David Wenham, Bryan Brown, David Gulpilil, John Jarratt, Shea Adams', 'PG-13', 'Set in northern Australia before World War II, an English aristocrat who inherits a sprawling ranch reluctantly pacts with a stock-man in order to protect her new property from a takeover plot. As the pair drive 2,000 head of cattle over unforgiving landscape, they experience the bombing of Darwin by Japanese forces firsthand.', 'Set in northern Australia before World War II, an English aristocrat who inherits a sprawling ranch reluctantly pacts with a stock-man in order to protect her new property from a takeover plot. As the pair drive 2,000 head of cattle over unforgiving landscape, they experience the bombing of Darwin by Japanese forces firsthand.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tFQpccGMTWe24eWxK5U9rb7tK3M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6972'),
