  ('157700378495690315', 'Author! Author!', 1982, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Arthur Hiller, Victor J. Kemper', 'Israel Horovitz', 'Al Pacino, Dyan Cannon, Tuesday Weld, Bob Dishy, Bob Elliott, Ray Goulding, Eric Gurry, Elva Josephson', 'PG', 'A broadway playwright is burning the candle at both ends. He is dealing with pressure from a production nearing premiere, a wife who is leaving him, and 5 children 4 of which belong to her.', 'A broadway playwright is burning the candle at both ends. He is dealing with pressure from a production nearing premiere, a wife who is leaving him, and 5 children 4 of which belong to her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t23OHqoicdzDOlQcpHJkuKJcQKd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41760'),
  ('51150432879886912', 'Authors Anonymous', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Ellie Kanner, Tobias Datum', 'David Congalton', 'Kaley Cuoco, Chris Klein, Tricia Helfer, Jonathan Banks, Teri Polo, Jonathan Bennett, Dennis Farina, Dylan Walsh', 'PG-13', 'When a dysfunctional group of unpublished writers accept Hannah into their fold, the last thing they expect is her overnight success. Can these lovable misfits achieve their artistic dreams and avoid killing one another in the process?', 'When a dysfunctional group of unpublished writers accept Hannah into their fold, the last thing they expect is her overnight success. Can these lovable misfits achieve their artistic dreams and avoid killing one another in the process?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xTfJv2AYpwPq9cK8xNCIlK9DthY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:255491'),
  ('587856715826687943', 'Auto de Resistência', 2018, 'Documentary', 'Natasha Neri, Lula Carvalho', null, 'Marcelo Freixo, Marielle Franco, Flávio Bolsonaro', null, 'A documentary about the Rio de Janeiro police killings praticed as so-called "self-defense acts". The film follows people who deal with those deaths in their daily lives, showing how Brazil''s Federal Government deals with these cases, from the police investigations to the courtrooms.', 'A documentary about the Rio de Janeiro police killings praticed as so-called "self-defense acts". The film follows people who deal with those deaths in their daily lives, showing how Brazil''s Federal Government deals with these cases, from the police investigations to the courtrooms.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gFcLL1LZqiZFDsSjgVCiQxF4PJM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:515488'),
  ('454533544717999210', 'Auto Focus', 2002, 'Crime, Drama', 'Paul Schrader, Barbara M. Ravis, Aaron Barsky', 'Michael Gerbosi', 'Greg Kinnear, Willem Dafoe, Rita Wilson, Maria Bello, Ron Leibman, Kurt Fuller, Ed Begley Jr., Michael E. Rodgers', 'R', 'A successful TV star during the 1960s, former "Hogan''s Heroes" actor Bob Crane projects a wholesome family-man image, but this front masks his persona as a sex addict who records and photographs his many encounters with women, often with the help of his seedy friend, John Henry Carpenter. This biographical drama reveals how Crane''s double life takes its toll on him and his family, and ultimately contributes to his death.', 'A successful TV star during the 1960s, former "Hogan''s Heroes" actor Bob Crane projects a wholesome family-man image, but this front masks his persona as a sex addict who records and photographs his many encounters with women, often with the help of his seedy friend, John Henry Carpenter. This biographical drama reveals how Crane''s double life takes its toll on him and his family, and ultimately contributes to his death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/71CQUn4vtpDQtAPXtaLP7IGH0Sg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14112'),
  ('525747300020509691', 'Autobiographical Scene Number 6882', 2005, 'Drama', 'Ruben Östlund, Ruben Östlund', 'Erik Hemmendorff, Ruben Östlund', 'Anette Andersson, Ingela Borgström, Martin Byström, Elin Gradin, Mats Lekander, Gunnar Nyström, Martin Zetterlund', null, 'A 30-years old man is celebrating Midsummer''s eve together with friends on the west coast of Sweden. He makes his friends come and watch as he is going to jump into the sea from a very high bridge.', 'A 30-years old man is celebrating Midsummer''s eve together with friends on the west coast of Sweden. He makes his friends come and watch as he is going to jump into the sea from a very high bridge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dZTWpy51zq7n1vpVxV4smfWa449.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:183786'),
  ('1047663788294942112', 'Autobiography', 2023, 'Drama, Thriller, Crime', 'Makbul Mubarak, Wojciech Staroń', 'Makbul Mubarak', 'Kevin Ardilova, Arswendy Bening Swara, Yusuf Mahardika, Lukman Sardi, Yudi Ahmad Tajudin, Rukman Rosadi, Haru Sandra, Mardiko Agus Nugroho', null, 'A young man is working as a housekeeper in an empty mansion. When its owner returns to start his mayoral election campaign, the young man bonds with him and defends him when his campaign is vandalized, setting off a chain of violence.', 'A young man is working as a housekeeper in an empty mansion. When its owner returns to start his mayoral election campaign, the young man bonds with him and defends him when his campaign is vandalized, setting off a chain of violence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n6DC6tCHXh7eJB60g175KlZ1nIP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:859981'),
  ('216243771145590768', 'Autobiography of a Princess', 1975, 'Drama, History', 'James Ivory, Walter Lassally, Anthony Korner', 'Ruth Prawer Jhabvala', 'James Mason, Madhur Jaffrey, Diane Fletcher, Timothy Bateson, Johnny Stuart, Nazrul Rahman, Keith Varnier', null, 'On the birthday of her late father, a deposed Maharaja, a displaced Indian princess living in London and his former private secretary watch home movies and reminisce about royal India.', 'On the birthday of her late father, a deposed Maharaja, a displaced Indian princess living in London and his former private secretary watch home movies and reminisce about royal India.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sfJeNFXoiVTJBXzaaS6LWFbcfOq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:185154'),
  ('1150760965429581585', 'Automania 2000', 1964, 'Science Fiction, Animation, Comedy', 'John Halas', 'Joy Batchelor, John Halas', 'Ed Bishop', null, 'An animated, dark satire of America''s automobile-obsessed, consumerist culture. An anonymous, brilliant scientist toils tirelessly in his ivory tower satisfying the public''s ever-increasing demands for novelty and status consciousness, with predictable environmental consequences.', 'An animated, dark satire of America''s automobile-obsessed, consumerist culture. An anonymous, brilliant scientist toils tirelessly in his ivory tower satisfying the public''s ever-increasing demands for novelty and status consciousness, with predictable environmental consequences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c1gGunw58Al2c6rZmSxpyO5W7lZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:206998'),
  ('878995408670057919', 'Automata', 2014, 'Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Gabe Ibáñez, Alejandro Martínez, Simeon Asenov', 'Gabe Ibáñez, Igor Legarreta, Javier Sánchez Donate', 'Antonio Banderas, Melanie Griffith, Birgitte Hjort Sørensen, Dylan McDermott, Robert Forster, Tim McInnerny, Andy Nyman, David Ryall', 'R', 'Jacq Vaucan, an insurance agent of ROC robotics corporation, routinely investigates the case of manipulating a robot. What he discovers will have profound consequences for the future of humanity.', 'Jacq Vaucan, an insurance agent of ROC robotics corporation, routinely investigates the case of manipulating a robot. What he discovers will have profound consequences for the future of humanity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h7SEtIWOfLsuCWhQgflev7ppRPq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:262543'),
  ('718056678532887254', 'Automated Hat-Maker and Sausage-Grinder', 1900, 'Comedy', 'Alice Guy-Blaché', null, 'Henri Vallouy', null, 'A machine churns out sausages on one side and spits out hats on the other. The director of this film is not credited in any contemporary catalogues or trade publications, or attributed to anyone by scholars or primary sources, however Alice Guy-Blaché is the most probable candidate.', 'A machine churns out sausages on one side and spits out hats on the other. The director of this film is not credited in any contemporary catalogues or trade publications, or attributed to anyone by scholars or primary sources, however Alice Guy-Blaché is the most probable candidate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oe2wKcfgngmtHm3lnPJl0JaEsX2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:119968'),
  ('47116422567731993', 'Automatic', 1995, 'Action, Science Fiction, Horror, Thriller', 'John Murlowski, Peter Fernberger', 'Susan Lambert', 'Olivier Gruner, Daphne Ashbrook, John Glover, Jeff Kober, Dennis Lipscomb, Stanley Kamel, Penny Johnson Jerald, Annabelle Gurwitch', 'R', 'Robgen industries newest security system is "The J Series Automatic", an android model designed and programmed to protect humans from violent attacks. But one night, an Automatic named J269 discovers a Robgen executive trying to rape a female employee named Nora Rochester. While trying to stop the crime, he inadvertently kills the executive. At this point, J269 then calls Goddard Marx (his creator and a Robgen chairman) to inform him of the incident. Marx tells the android to stay there with Rochester until help arrives, but Marx is intent on sweeping the fiasco under the rug by sending mercenaries to eliminate both J269 and Rochester. Now the two are fugitives on the run from a para-military hit squad.', 'Robgen industries newest security system is "The J Series Automatic", an android model designed and programmed to protect humans from violent attacks. But one night, an Automatic named J269 discovers a Robgen executive trying to rape a female employee named Nora Rochester. While trying to stop the crime, he inadvertently kills the executive. At this point, J269 then calls Goddard Marx (his creator and a Robgen chairman) to inform him of the incident. Marx tells the android to stay there with Rochester until help arrives, but Marx is intent on sweeping the fiasco under the rug by sending mercenaries to eliminate both J269 and Rochester. Now the two are fugitives on the run from a para-military hit squad.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nSNwzg3cylklJsvreSgKpDmP0o4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38610'),
  ('804912391247287830', 'Automaton Transfusion', 2008, 'Horror', 'Steven C. Miller', 'Steven C. Miller', 'Juliet Reeves London, Garrett Jones, William Howard, Rowan Bousaid', 'NR', 'Three teens find themselves in a town over run with zombies. Deciding to fight back, they go on a punch you in the throat, action packed, non stop ride through the city, woods, and schools.', 'Three teens find themselves in a town over run with zombies. Deciding to fight back, they go on a punch you in the throat, action packed, non stop ride through the city, woods, and schools.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/neZNJiOF1BPGvsX2tBPpSkUg7Wi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18177'),
  ('381595275624846021', 'Automobile Accident', 1905, 'Comedy', null, null, null, null, 'A tramp is run over by a car and dismembered. Helpful passers-by reassemble him.', 'A tramp is run over by a car and dismembered. Helpful passers-by reassemble him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xombwFpRaKAJUW6iy8yS9wasynu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:195941'),
  ('1125064143994304837', 'Autopsy', 1975, 'Horror, Thriller, Mystery', 'Carlo Carlini, Armando Crispino, Lorenzo Magnolia', 'Lucio Battistrada, Armando Crispino', 'Mimsy Farmer, Barry Primus, Ray Lovelock, Carlo Cataneo, Angela Goodwin, Gaby Wagner, Massimo Serato, Ernesto Colli', 'R', 'A series of random suicides in Rome, Italy are attributed to a heatwave, but a young pathologist named Simona—who is working on a thesis about murders disguised as suicides—suspects otherwise. When a young girl associated with Simona''s playboy father ends up dead in another apparent suicide, Simona teams up with the girl''s priest brother to prove she was murdered and track down the unknown serial killer.', 'A series of random suicides in Rome, Italy are attributed to a heatwave, but a young pathologist named Simona—who is working on a thesis about murders disguised as suicides—suspects otherwise. When a young girl associated with Simona''s playboy father ends up dead in another apparent suicide, Simona teams up with the girl''s priest brother to prove she was murdered and track down the unknown serial killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o3XWyyQccWDy40hJJ4O9twA5f4D.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:96167'),
  ('339816885305685515', 'Autopsy', 2007, 'Drama, Romance, Crime', 'Jérôme Anger', 'Jérôme Anger, Gérard Carré', 'Stéphane Freiss, Claude Perron, François Civil, Philippe Duclos, Thierry Neuvic, Sara Martins, Pascal Rénéric', null, 'Eric and Sarah are detectives who are investigating the murder of a professor which it seems like a gay hate crime. Married Eric becomes attracted to the pathologist, Emmanuel.', 'Eric and Sarah are detectives who are investigating the murder of a professor which it seems like a gay hate crime. Married Eric becomes attracted to the pathologist, Emmanuel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8hpKpywwmzNMkHESUnSdW8bfRC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:264230'),
