  ('494604225994252873', 'Autopsy of a Ghost', 1968, 'Science Fiction, Comedy, Horror', 'Ismael Rodríguez', 'Mario Hernández', 'Basil Rathbone, John Carradine, Amadee Chabot, Cameron Mitchell, Pompín Iglesias, Nacho Contla, Manuel Palacios, Estanislao Schillinsky', null, 'Satan offers a weary ghost a chance for redemption through true love.', 'Satan offers a weary ghost a chance for redemption through true love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pd8NVSw7vCeCwhH999NMmQHNjH7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27497'),
  ('938456567765645132', 'Autumn', 1930, 'Animation', 'Ub Iwerks', null, null, 'NR', 'The season series of Silly Symphonies continues, with squirrels storing nuts and corn, crows stealing it, beavers building a dam, ducks migrating, and the like, as the first snows fall.', 'The season series of Silly Symphonies continues, with squirrels storing nuts and corn, crows stealing it, beavers building a dam, ducks migrating, and the like, as the first snows fall.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a5IXXOKsCut8GimqmNYtL2J0HmJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51825'),
  ('801895209884539980', 'Autumn', 1974, 'Drama, Romance', 'Andrey Smirnov, Aleksandr Knyazhinsky', 'Andrey Smirnov', 'Natalya Rudnaya, Leonid Kulagin, Natalya Gundareva, Aleksandr Fatyushin, Lyudmila Maksakova, Armen Dzhigarkhanyan, Zoya Mokeyeva, Mikhail Bychkov', null, 'In their youth, they loved each other, but broke up. Ilya got married, became a doctor, Sasha learned to become an engineer, got married. And now they are together again, at a small, deaf station. They introduced themselves as husband and wife. In fact, while he is married to another, and she has the experience of a failed marriage. For eight days they will be in a remote stop where no one knows them and no one will interfere with love...', 'In their youth, they loved each other, but broke up. Ilya got married, became a doctor, Sasha learned to become an engineer, got married. And now they are together again, at a small, deaf station. They introduced themselves as husband and wife. In fact, while he is married to another, and she has the experience of a failed marriage. For eight days they will be in a remote stop where no one knows them and no one will interfere with love...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9CMXKJ0AGuvOXbCuncKKLthU2eu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72629'),
  ('141950486911779714', 'Autumn', 2008, 'Drama', 'Özcan Alper, Feza Çaldıran', 'Özcan Alper', 'Onur Saylak, Megi Kobaladze, Raife Yenigül, Serkan Keskin, Nino Lezhava, Sibel Öz, Cihan Camkerte, Serhan Pirpir', null, 'Arrested while a student in university, Yusuf is released from prison after ten years. He returns home and is welcomed by his sick and elderly mother. Soon he will meet Eka, a beautiful Georgian girl who is a sex worker, and love becomes a final desperate attempt to grasp life and elude loneliness.', 'Arrested while a student in university, Yusuf is released from prison after ten years. He returns home and is welcomed by his sick and elderly mother. Soon he will meet Eka, a beautiful Georgian girl who is a sex worker, and love becomes a final desperate attempt to grasp life and elude loneliness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cGE5larTDRaoWcFfbNfc5bvx39n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12417'),
  ('474998221563649108', 'Autumn', 2009, 'Horror, Drama', 'Steven Rumbelow', 'Steven Rumbelow, David Moody', 'Dexter Fletcher, Lana Kamenov, David Carradine, Dickon Tolson, Anton Brejak, Tricia McMurtry, Jody Willis, Marisa Zaza', null, 'The virus came so fast no one had time to prepare. Before the day was over, entire towns were decimated, and large cities became monumental tombs. Left with nothing but fading hope and the will to live, reclusive software consultant Michael (Dexter Fletcher) and temperamental mechanic Carl (Dickon Tolson) lead a small group of survivors into the country in hopes of riding out the coming winter. But now the decaying victims of the plague are reanimating, growing more smart and vicious with each passing day. Now, the only hope for the survival of the human race is Phillip (Carradine), a man who refused to leave the city, and has somehow avoided becoming food for the flesh-eating masses.', 'The virus came so fast no one had time to prepare. Before the day was over, entire towns were decimated, and large cities became monumental tombs. Left with nothing but fading hope and the will to live, reclusive software consultant Michael (Dexter Fletcher) and temperamental mechanic Carl (Dickon Tolson) lead a small group of survivors into the country in hopes of riding out the coming winter. But now the decaying victims of the plague are reanimating, growing more smart and vicious with each passing day. Now, the only hope for the survival of the human race is Phillip (Carradine), a man who refused to leave the city, and has somehow avoided becoming food for the flesh-eating masses.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l3vNdN57edCqvbfxnNlHaQn11Ki.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22177'),
  ('859113420342384394', 'Autumn Almanac', 1984, 'Drama', 'Béla Tarr, Buda Gulyás, Ferenc Pap', 'Béla Tarr', 'Hédi Temessy, Erika Bodnár, Székely B. Miklós, Pál Hetényi, János Derzsi', null, 'In this dense setting, the inhabitants of a large, claustrophobic apartment reveal their darkest secrets, fears, obsessions and hostilities.', 'In this dense setting, the inhabitants of a large, claustrophobic apartment reveal their darkest secrets, fears, obsessions and hostilities.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w1zFwAX87FwLvx9JEHnhFCf5kZj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74903'),
  ('782727796995239738', 'Autumn and the Black Jaguar', 2024, 'Adventure, Family', 'Gilles de Maistre, David Campi-Lemaire, Yoanna Piwinski Tagle', 'Gilles de Maistre, Prune de Maistre', 'Lumi Pollack, Emily Bett Rickards, Wayne Charles Baker, Paul Greene, Kelly Hope Taylor, Lucrezia Pini, Letitia Brookes, K.C. Coombs', 'PG', 'Growing up in the Amazon rainforest gave Autumn the rarest of friendships – a lost jaguar cub she named Hope. When a tragic event forces her to leave Hope for New York City, she dreams of going back to the rainforest and her friend. That opportunity soon comes when Autumn decides to return to the Amazon to save her beloved jaguar from animal traffickers who threaten her childhood village.', 'Growing up in the Amazon rainforest gave Autumn the rarest of friendships – a lost jaguar cub she named Hope. When a tragic event forces her to leave Hope for New York City, she dreams of going back to the rainforest and her friend. That opportunity soon comes when Autumn decides to return to the Amazon to save her beloved jaguar from animal traffickers who threaten her childhood village.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/krLaIUZezfBDBSdQA2ChVTg9t3Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:959098'),
  ('985094011502416505', 'Autumn Ball', 2007, 'Drama', 'Veiko Õunpuu, Mart Taniel', 'Veiko Õunpuu', 'Rain Tolk, Taavi Eelmaa, Juhan Ulfsak, Maarja Jakobson, Sulevi Peltola, Tiina Tauraite, Mirtel Pohla, Iris Persson', null, 'Autumn in Estonia, where six people live, six solitudes, prisoners of the monotonous architecture of Soviet-era concrete buildings, in search of human companionship, of love, of a ray of light in an ocean of gray.', 'Autumn in Estonia, where six people live, six solitudes, prisoners of the monotonous architecture of Soviet-era concrete buildings, in search of human companionship, of love, of a ray of light in an ocean of gray.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ecW82xTHctX1999ivXOP3uLJnel.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46847'),
  ('254136101549442410', 'Autumn Beat', 2022, 'Drama, Music', 'Antonio Dikele Distefano', 'Massimo Vavassori, Antonio Dikele Distefano', 'Hamed Seydou, Abby 6ix, Guè, Matteo Professione, Tredici Pietro, Sfera Ebbasta, Genemé Tonini, Juliet Joseph', null, 'Two brothers Tito and Paco have the same dream: to break into the rap music world. Paco is a born performer and Tito knows how to write like no other but ambition, life, and love for the same woman will test their bond.', 'Two brothers Tito and Paco have the same dream: to break into the rap music world. Paco is a born performer and Tito knows how to write like no other but ambition, life, and love for the same woman will test their bond.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/udMx3Fcfo5oM4CEPMX1HYbeU7HP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1046562'),
  ('171655519506491219', 'Autumn Days', 1963, 'Drama', 'Roberto Gavaldón, Gabriel Figueroa, Ignacio Villareal', 'Emilio Carballido', 'Pina Pellicer, Ignacio López Tarso, Adriana Roel, Luis Lomelí, Graciela Döring, Hortensia Santoveña, Eva Calvo, Guillermo Orea', null, 'Luisa is a small-town girl who works in the bakery of the widower Don Albino. Luisa dreams of marrying and loves children. Just as Don Albino shows interest in her, Luisa announces that she will marry soon with Carlos, the driver of a rich house whom she met recently...', 'Luisa is a small-town girl who works in the bakery of the widower Don Albino. Luisa dreams of marrying and loves children. Just as Don Albino shows interest in her, Luisa announces that she will marry soon with Carlos, the driver of a rich house whom she met recently...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4PYF7DelnFYk8B5ga2C1qLmf2gc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:342590'),
  ('24549333678128481', 'Autumn Dreams', 2015, 'TV Movie, Romance', 'Neill Fearnley, David Pelletier, Karen Robyn', 'Laurie Stevens', 'Jill Wagner, Colin Egglesfield, Michael Karl Richards, Rachel Hayward, Tasya Teles, Ken Tremblett, Matty Finochio, Catherine Lough Haggquist', 'G', 'With plans to leave their small town, teenage loves Annie and Ben elope. Their big city plans are halted, though, when Annie''s parents have the marriage annulled. Ben moves to New York, while Annie stays in Iowa to help her family. Fifteen years later, both engaged to their respective fiancés, the two discover that their annulment was never finalized. They reunite to make their divorce legal, but begin to reminisce about what could have been. When romantic feelings resurface, Annie and Ben must decide if their past love could be the love of their future.', 'With plans to leave their small town, teenage loves Annie and Ben elope. Their big city plans are halted, though, when Annie''s parents have the marriage annulled. Ben moves to New York, while Annie stays in Iowa to help her family. Fifteen years later, both engaged to their respective fiancés, the two discover that their annulment was never finalized. They reunite to make their divorce legal, but begin to reminisce about what could have been. When romantic feelings resurface, Annie and Ben must decide if their past love could be the love of their future.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rqhBCMzRU6DPhoMIB07bXYcsPNh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:361745'),
  ('415006131749175034', 'Autumn Fire', 1931, 'Drama, Romance', 'Herman G. Weinberg', null, 'Erna Bergman, Willy Hildebrand', null, 'A story told with few words. We see a solitary man and a solitary woman, each alone with their thoughts. She is in the country, staring out a window. Nature is quiet, waiting for spring, trees are bare. He is in the city, walking from the docks, watching, somewhat aimless. She walks a country lane. Both are alone. She writes him a letter, offering an opportunity. Will he take it?', 'A story told with few words. We see a solitary man and a solitary woman, each alone with their thoughts. She is in the country, staring out a window. Nature is quiet, waiting for spring, trees are bare. He is in the city, walking from the docks, watching, somewhat aimless. She walks a country lane. Both are alone. She writes him a letter, offering an opportunity. Will he take it?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xvJunL1p8LMNVg9nqs4Wkgqg9Vy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:144819'),
  ('248902615541657622', 'Autumn Girl', 2021, 'Drama, History', 'Katarzyna Klimkiewicz, Weronika Bilska', 'Patrycja Mnich, Katarzyna Klimkiewicz', 'Maria Dębska, Leszek Lichota, Krzysztof Zalewski, Bartłomiej Kotschedoff, Katarzyna Obidzińska, Katia Paliwoda, Rafał Rutkowski, Dariusz Basiński', null, 'Polish film and music icon Kalina Jedrusik, a scandalous free-spirited sex symbol, fights for her independence in the prude society of the 1960s.', 'Polish film and music icon Kalina Jedrusik, a scandalous free-spirited sex symbol, fights for her independence in the prude society of the 1960s.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i9bWt4ZFUpgZRCn5dB4cWW1zY61.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:859468'),
  ('876013085044357637', 'Autumn in New York', 2000, 'Drama, Romance', 'Gu Changwei, Joan Chen, Michelle L. Keiser', 'Allison Burnett', 'Richard Gere, Winona Ryder, Anthony LaPaglia, Elaine Stritch, Vera Farmiga, Sherry Stringfield, Jill Hennessy, J.K. Simmons', 'PG-13', 'Will Keane, a Manhattan restaurateur, is content with his playboy lifestyle until he meets Charlotte Fielding, a free-spirited young woman. Together the pair pursue a passionate affair that forces them both to reevaluate what they want out of life, even as fate threatens to steal away their future.', 'Will Keane, a Manhattan restaurateur, is content with his playboy lifestyle until he meets Charlotte Fielding, a free-spirited young woman. Together the pair pursue a passionate affair that forces them both to reevaluate what they want out of life, even as fate threatens to steal away their future.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/avtPZ5vGvFugnY0NK8d3Przx6P7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10641'),
  ('270570813094944982', 'Autumn in the City', 2022, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Romance', 'Michael Robison, Jesse D.E. Young, Linda Crain', 'Joey Elkins, Blake Silver', 'Aimee Teegarden, Evan Roderick, Laura Soltis, Adam Beauchesne, Shayan Bayat, Vincent Gale, Brittany-Ellen Willacy, Byron Noble', 'G', 'Piper Grant moves to New York for a fresh start and to find her career passion. As she bounces between different exciting temp jobs that take her all over the city, she meets Austin Edwards, an aspiring writer. While Piper’s sunny optimism is at odds with Austin’s jaded personality, the magic of the autumn season soon brings them closer together. When Piper realizes her true passion is illustration, they decide to team up on a children’s book project, and in the process, they discover the thing they’re really searching for might be each other.', 'Piper Grant moves to New York for a fresh start and to find her career passion. As she bounces between different exciting temp jobs that take her all over the city, she meets Austin Edwards, an aspiring writer. While Piper’s sunny optimism is at odds with Austin’s jaded personality, the magic of the autumn season soon brings them closer together. When Piper realizes her true passion is illustration, they decide to team up on a children’s book project, and in the process, they discover the thing they’re really searching for might be each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xSVaamZtuDR4jgW4or9JUQ0qgQ7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1020489'),
  ('42411451007576967', 'Autumn in the Vineyard', 2016, 'TV Movie, Romance', 'Tim Whyte, Claude M. Pavel, Clea Mihalik', 'Suzette Couture', 'Rachael Leigh Cook, Brendan Penny, Marcus Rosner, Jill Teed, Tom Butler, Jeremy Guilbaut, Lucia Walters, Laura Soltis', null, 'When Frankie Baldwin and Nate Deluca both have a claim to ownership of Sorrento Farm, they are forced to divide the vineyard right down the middle and work the fields alongside each other to bring in the harvest leading up to the Best Wine competition at the annual Autumn Harvest Festival -- only this rivalry won''t be settled in the fields, because in spite of their contentious bickering, the simplest way to settle this particular legal dispute is with a romance.', 'When Frankie Baldwin and Nate Deluca both have a claim to ownership of Sorrento Farm, they are forced to divide the vineyard right down the middle and work the fields alongside each other to bring in the harvest leading up to the Best Wine competition at the annual Autumn Harvest Festival -- only this rivalry won''t be settled in the fields, because in spite of their contentious bickering, the simplest way to settle this particular legal dispute is with a romance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/17GH8ACvkrNdYhJx9yLd1FWlxjo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:413441'),
  ('113175127601928568', 'Autumn Leaves', 1956, 'Drama, Mystery, Romance', 'Robert Aldrich, Charles Lang, Jack R. Berne', 'Jean Rouverol, Lewis Meltzer, Hugo Butler', 'Joan Crawford, Cliff Robertson, Vera Miles, Lorne Greene, Ruth Donnelly, Shepperd Strudwick, Selmer Jackson, Maxine Cooper', 'NR', 'A woman falls for a younger man with severe mental problems.', 'A woman falls for a younger man with severe mental problems.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9WdCLe9vMgWic184e19JOFXm4Od.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43256'),
  ('173920894159124303', 'Autumn Marathon', 1979, 'Drama, Romance, Comedy', 'Georgiy Daneliya, Sergey Vronsky, Yuriy Kushneryov', 'Aleksandr Volodin', 'Oleg Basilashvili, Natalya Gundareva, Marina Neyolova, Galina Volchek, Evgeni Leonov, Nikolay Kryuchkov, Vladimir Grammatikov, Boryslav Brondukov', null, 'Andrey Pavlovich Buzykin, who makes a living by teaching at an institute and translating English literature, is cheating on his wife. Buzykin''s main problem is that he''s a kind man with a weak character. The lies he is telling his wife all the time are inconvincing, but he never has the courage to tell her the truth. His lover, Alla, is aware of his family life, but gets offended when, for example, he cannot meet her so that he doesn''t come home late, or when he doesn''t want to go home in a new jacket she gives him to avoid having to explain to his wife. Alla and Nina, Andrei''s wife, both leave him, forgive him, and return to him at the same time, and Andrei continues with this kind of life, full of suffering and deceit. Finally, both women are so fed up with his lies that they don''t believe him even when he is telling the truth...', 'Andrey Pavlovich Buzykin, who makes a living by teaching at an institute and translating English literature, is cheating on his wife. Buzykin''s main problem is that he''s a kind man with a weak character. The lies he is telling his wife all the time are inconvincing, but he never has the courage to tell her the truth. His lover, Alla, is aware of his family life, but gets offended when, for example, he cannot meet her so that he doesn''t come home late, or when he doesn''t want to go home in a new jacket she gives him to avoid having to explain to his wife. Alla and Nina, Andrei''s wife, both leave him, forgive him, and return to him at the same time, and Andrei continues with this kind of life, full of suffering and deceit. Finally, both women are so fed up with his lies that they don''t believe him even when he is telling the truth...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vAAkpQ1Z9hpVO9j7lfJWZNeU6Tz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27924'),
  ('811874028022710589', 'Autumn Milk', 1989, 'Drama', 'Joseph Vilsmaier, Joseph Vilsmaier', 'Peter Steinbach', 'Dana Vávrová, Werner Stocker, Claude-Oliver Rudolph, Eva Mattes, Ilona Mayer, Renate Grosser, Philipp Moog, Klára Lidová', null, 'With the death of her mother, eight-year-old Anna ends her childhood: From now on, she has to look after the nine-member family. Deprivation-rich years, which also find no end when Anna marries: Her husband Albert must be a soldier in the Second World War, and the pregnant Anna has to work hard in the farm and care sick relatives. Lonely and exposed to the harassment of the tyrannical mother-in-law, she waits for Albert, with no certainty that he will ever return.', 'With the death of her mother, eight-year-old Anna ends her childhood: From now on, she has to look after the nine-member family. Deprivation-rich years, which also find no end when Anna marries: Her husband Albert must be a soldier in the Second World War, and the pregnant Anna has to work hard in the farm and care sick relatives. Lonely and exposed to the harassment of the tyrannical mother-in-law, she waits for Albert, with no certainty that he will ever return.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ifVFzDKcK0A1RFqUSywjfcXu38k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10129'),
  ('585695391333585415', 'Autumn Mists', 1929, 'Drama', 'Dimitri Kirsanoff', null, 'Nadia Sibirskaïa', null, 'An early impressionist short featuring a woman who dreams of, and escapes into, an autumn forest.', 'An early impressionist short featuring a woman who dreams of, and escapes into, an autumn forest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hBgN6TUnTtkFXlUgaFFuPvxcWe4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:105540'),
  ('908799607093843818', 'Autumn Moon', 1992, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Clara Law, Tony Cheung Tung-Leung', 'Eddie Fong Ling-Ching', 'Masatoshi Nagase, Lee Pui-Wai, Choi Siu Wan, Maki Kiuchi, Suen Ching Hung, Sung Lap Young, Tsang Yuet Guen, Chu Kit Ming', null, 'A Japanese tourist, Tokio, meets a 15-year-old Hong Kong girl and her grandmother left behind in Hong Kong while their family emigrates to Canada.', 'A Japanese tourist, Tokio, meets a 15-year-old Hong Kong girl and her grandmother left behind in Hong Kong while their family emigrates to Canada.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cVYkCp19XMEfyYLdXYkdTrXXBuw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26855'),
  ('450273479562049540', 'Autumn Sun', 1996, 'Romance', 'Eduardo Mignogna, Marcelo Camorino', 'Santiago Carlos Oves, Eduardo Mignogna', 'Norma Aleandro, Federico Luppi, Jorge Luz, Cecilia Rossetto, Roberto Carnaghi, Nicolás Goldschmidt, Erasmo Olivera, Gabriela Acher', null, 'Clara Goldstein is a lovely, middle-aged Jewish woman who, because of an impending visit from her American brother, is forced to create a contrived relationship with a man of her own faith. She places an ad in a personals column and meets Raul, a well-spoken, handsome and charming man whom she soon discovers is a Gentile and does not fulfill her reason for placing the ad. Having no alternative, Clara proceeds to instruct Raul with an intensive course in Judaism. Their journey is both humorous and captivating, but not without pitfalls. These two mature people risk a last chance at a meaningful relationship in their lives.', 'Clara Goldstein is a lovely, middle-aged Jewish woman who, because of an impending visit from her American brother, is forced to create a contrived relationship with a man of her own faith. She places an ad in a personals column and meets Raul, a well-spoken, handsome and charming man whom she soon discovers is a Gentile and does not fulfill her reason for placing the ad. Having no alternative, Clara proceeds to instruct Raul with an intensive course in Judaism. Their journey is both humorous and captivating, but not without pitfalls. These two mature people risk a last chance at a meaningful relationship in their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cQ6gS1CAk1QAvjgApDrmjkSfhRi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:143989'),
  ('267454276949967152', 'Auxilio: The Power of Sin', 2023, 'Horror', 'Tamae Garateguy', 'Miguel Forza de Paul', 'Cumelén Sanz, Martina Garello, Marcela Benjumea, Paula Carruega, Camila Toker, Naiara Awada, Jazmín Rodríguez, Lorena Damonte', null, 'It tells the story of Emilia, who is sent to a convent where paranormal forces start to mount among the holy and the tortured.', 'It tells the story of Emilia, who is sent to a convent where paranormal forces start to mount among the holy and the tortured.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qnY0OTPs2ytBFFQM6uPn0QNgBHB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1017388'),
  ('883469296170640086', 'Auzaar', 1997, 'Action', 'Sohail Khan, Kaka Thakur', null, 'Salman Khan, Sanjay Kapoor, Shilpa Shetty Kundra, Nirmal Pandey, Kiran Kumar, Aasif Sheikh, Ila Arun, Paresh Rawal', null, 'Suraj, who is a police officer, discovers that Yash, his friend''s father, runs an illegal business. He must now convince Yash to make his father mend his ways or face criticism from his superiors for not confronting him.', 'Suraj, who is a police officer, discovers that Yash, his friend''s father, runs an illegal business. He must now convince Yash to make his father mend his ways or face criticism from his superiors for not confronting him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6lchKwXaCNNzOr0sWorkww3yIZq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:161237'),
  ('462036612913886544', 'Av: The Hunt', 2021, 'Thriller', 'Ayda Varon, Efecan Yıldız, Özkan Bağçecik', 'Deniz Cuylan, Emre Akay', 'Billur Melis Koç, Ahmet Rıfat Şungar, Yağız Can Konyalı, Baki Rıdvan Kaymaz, Yilmaz Bayraktar, Kenan Acar, Yılmaz Erdem, Emre Yetim', null, 'Police officer Sedat raids a derelict apartment squatted by a young couple. The man is killed, the young woman, Ayşe, escapes. When her friends and relatives offer no help, Ayşe is forced to steal cash and a car from her father and flee town like an outlaw. The chase goes deeper into the wild. Along with three men he has recruited, Sedat is pursuing her, out to kill in the name of honour. Taking off from the suburbs of Anatolia, Av: The Hunt continues reaching breath-taking natural landscapes, and recounts how a young woman is pulled into spiral of violence while trying to escape the patriarchal society she lives in.', 'Police officer Sedat raids a derelict apartment squatted by a young couple. The man is killed, the young woman, Ayşe, escapes. When her friends and relatives offer no help, Ayşe is forced to steal cash and a car from her father and flee town like an outlaw. The chase goes deeper into the wild. Along with three men he has recruited, Sedat is pursuing her, out to kill in the name of honour. Taking off from the suburbs of Anatolia, Av: The Hunt continues reaching breath-taking natural landscapes, and recounts how a young woman is pulled into spiral of violence while trying to escape the patriarchal society she lives in.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yR13baWG6jrsViqWjWHdBQfeLm5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:706085'),
  ('9675927767081301', 'Ava', 2017, 'Drama', 'Léa Mysius, Paul Guilhaume, Elodie Roy', 'Paul Guilhaume, Léa Mysius', 'Noée Abita, Laure Calamy, Juan Cano, Tamara Cano, Ismaël Capelot, Daouda Diakhaté, Baptiste Archimbaud, Franck Beckmann', null, 'Ava, 13, is spending the summer on the Atlantic coast when she learns that she will lose her sight sooner than expected. Her mother decides to act as if everything were normal so as to spend their best summer ever. Ava confronts the problem in her own way. She steals a big black dog that belongs to a young man on the run...', 'Ava, 13, is spending the summer on the Atlantic coast when she learns that she will lose her sight sooner than expected. Her mother decides to act as if everything were normal so as to spend their best summer ever. Ava confronts the problem in her own way. She steals a big black dog that belongs to a young man on the run...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5MTsowSLS4ryluc2Nahj8ZzGi0F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:453354'),
  ('728273066549897638', 'Ava', 2020, 'Action, Thriller, Crime', 'Tate Taylor, Stephen Turro, Brett Robinson', 'Matthew Newton', 'Jessica Chastain, John Malkovich, Common, Colin Farrell, Geena Davis, Jess Weixler, Ioan Gruffudd, Diana Silvers', 'R', 'A black ops assassin is forced to fight for her own survival after a job goes dangerously wrong.', 'A black ops assassin is forced to fight for her own survival after a job goes dangerously wrong.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qzA87Wf4jo1h8JMk9GilyIYvwsA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:539885'),
  ('983304961503947965', 'Ava Gardner, the Gypsy of Hollywood', 2018, 'Documentary, TV Movie', 'Jean-Louis Laforêt, Sergio G. Mondelo', null, 'Ava Gardner, Anna Mouglalis, Philippe Spiteri, Frédéric Martinez, Antoine Sire, Jesús García de Dueñas, Nieves Herrero, Silvia Marsó', null, 'At the height of her fame in 1954, actress Ava Gardner transplanted herself from Hollywood to the country of Spain. As she lovingly stated in her autobiography, “I don’t know if it was the climate, the men, or the music, but as soon as I set foot in Spain, I had a crush on this country.” In this documentary by Sergio Mondelo, the filmmaker explores the motivations behind this move and contrasts Gardner’s glitz and glam lifestyle with the hardships faced by the Spainish people under Franco’s rule.', 'At the height of her fame in 1954, actress Ava Gardner transplanted herself from Hollywood to the country of Spain. As she lovingly stated in her autobiography, “I don’t know if it was the climate, the men, or the music, but as soon as I set foot in Spain, I had a crush on this country.” In this documentary by Sergio Mondelo, the filmmaker explores the motivations behind this move and contrasts Gardner’s glitz and glam lifestyle with the hardships faced by the Spainish people under Franco’s rule.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oeMG43XNGjjIQ8FDkvDvBTgq9LF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:513172'),
  ('53722058470226304', 'Ava''s Possessions', 2015, 'Comedy, Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Jordan Galland, Adrian Peng Correia', 'Jordan Galland', 'Louisa Krause, Whitney Able, Deborah Rush, Lou Taylor Pucci, William Sadler, Zachary Booth, Wass Stevens, Annabelle Dexter-Jones', 'R', 'Ava is recovering from demonic possession. With no memory of the past month, she must attend a Spirit Possessions Anonymous support group to figure out what happened. Ava''s life was hijacked by a demon, now it''s time to get it back.', 'Ava is recovering from demonic possession. With no memory of the past month, she must attend a Spirit Possessions Anonymous support group to figure out what happened. Ava''s life was hijacked by a demon, now it''s time to get it back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tmTlL0U3NMQFjB1KGnWj2NuAE3g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:323665'),
  ('827020398965791292', 'Avalanche', 1978, 'Action, Adventure, Drama', 'Corey Allen, Pierre-William Glenn', 'Corey Allen, Claude Pola', 'Rock Hudson, Mia Farrow, Robert Forster, Jeanette Nolan, Rick Moses, Steve Franken, Barry Primus, Cathey Paine', 'PG', 'After an avalanche of snow crashes into their ski resort, a holiday at a winter wonderland turns into a game of survival for a group of vacationers.', 'After an avalanche of snow crashes into their ski resort, a holiday at a winter wonderland turns into a game of survival for a group of vacationers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zMORD6VDGIWo5thfMuA4Edb1mbj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:166680'),
  ('52953781702112541', 'Avalanche', 1994, 'Action, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Paul Shapiro, Alar Kivilo, Julia Done', 'Tim Redman', 'Deanna Milligan, Myles Ferguson, David Hasselhoff, Don S. Davis, George Josef, Ben Cardinal, Michael Gross', null, 'Duncan is a murderous thief. When he jumps out of his plane, it crashes into the Rockies and produces an avalanche. A quiet family trapped inside their house will rescue him. They will have to survive the disaster and the madman.', 'Duncan is a murderous thief. When he jumps out of his plane, it crashes into the Rockies and produces an avalanche. A quiet family trapped inside their house will rescue him. They will have to survive the disaster and the madman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4vQTAte2YXp63vFUwZz8KnYh4rO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:151366'),
  ('843550119302596980', 'Avalanche Express', 1979, 'Action, Thriller', 'Jack Cardiff, Mark Robson, Don French', 'Abraham Polonsky', 'Lee Marvin, Robert Shaw, Linda Evans, Maximilian Schell, Joe Namath, Horst Buchholz, Mike Connors, Claudio Cassinelli', 'PG', 'CIA agent Harry Wargrave is sent to aid Gen. Marenkov, a senior Russian official, who is defecting to the west. Wargrave decides they should travel to safety on a train across Europe, the "Atlantic Express". During the journey, they must survive attacks by terrorists and an avalanche, all planned by Russian spy-catcher Nikolai Bunin.', 'CIA agent Harry Wargrave is sent to aid Gen. Marenkov, a senior Russian official, who is defecting to the west. Wargrave decides they should travel to safety on a train across Europe, the "Atlantic Express". During the journey, they must survive attacks by terrorists and an avalanche, all planned by Russian spy-catcher Nikolai Bunin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mxCZj8tbz64uPcdzdv02ODIeucy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2036'),
  ('328401450195607945', 'Avalanche Sharks', 2012, 'Horror, Action, Science Fiction, Adventure, Comedy', 'Scott D. Wheeler, Ioana Vasile', 'Keith Shaw', 'Alexander Mendeluk, Kate Nauta, Benjamin Easterday, Eric Scott Woods, Kelle Cantwell, Richard Gleason, Amy Ninh, James Ouimet', null, 'A snow avalanche awakens humungous, prehistoric sharks that proceed to chomp on bikini clad co-eds.', 'A snow avalanche awakens humungous, prehistoric sharks that proceed to chomp on bikini clad co-eds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c8XL1mLik4IdRsEpcPUdcm8RxR9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:249260'),
  ('638257004465782739', 'Avalon', 1990, 'Drama', 'Allen Daviau, Barry Levinson', 'Barry Levinson', 'Armin Mueller-Stahl, Aidan Quinn, Elizabeth Perkins, Joan Plowright, Leo Fuchs, Lou Jacobi, Eve Gordon, Kevin Pollak', 'PG', 'A Polish-Jewish family comes to the U.S. at the beginning of the twentieth century. There, the family and their children try to make themselves a better future in the so-called promised land.', 'A Polish-Jewish family comes to the U.S. at the beginning of the twentieth century. There, the family and their children try to make themselves a better future in the so-called promised land.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lsyPs8pU6hIJCS5sw0H9Q8Tl1nJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2302'),
  ('896736151821294986', 'Avalon', 2001, 'Action, Science Fiction', 'Mamoru Oshii, Grzegorz Kędzierski', 'Kazunori Ito', 'Małgorzata Foremniak, Władysław Kowalski, Jerzy Gudejko, Dariusz Biskupski, Bartłomiej Świderski, Katarzyna Bargiełowska, Alicja Sapryk, Zuzanna Kasz', null, 'In a future world, young people are increasingly becoming addicted to an illegal (and potentially deadly) battle simulation game called Avalon. When Ash, a star player, hears of rumors that a more advanced level of the game exists somewhere, she gives up her loner ways and joins a gang of explorers. Even if she finds the gateway to the next level, will she ever be able to come back to reality?', 'In a future world, young people are increasingly becoming addicted to an illegal (and potentially deadly) battle simulation game called Avalon. When Ash, a star player, hears of rumors that a more advanced level of the game exists somewhere, she gives up her loner ways and joins a gang of explorers. Even if she finds the gateway to the next level, will she ever be able to come back to reality?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y1iJWqwIn8rf6EN3pLM2jRoDjKU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10881'),
  ('475785807515327065', 'Avalon High', 2011, 'Fantasy, Family, Drama, TV Movie', 'Stuart Gillard, Thomas Burstyn, Aimee Robertson', 'Julie Sherman Wolfe, Amy Talkington', 'Britt Robertson, Gregg Sulkin, Joey Pollari, Devon Graye, Molly C. Quinn, Steve Valentine, Chris Tavarez, Don Lake', 'G', 'Elaine "Ellie" Harrison has just moved from Minnesota to Annapolis, Maryland while her parents take a year-long sabbatical to continue their medieval studies in nearby Washington D.C. Her new high school, Avalon High, seems like a typical high school with the stereotypical students: Lance the jock, Jennifer the cheerleader, Marco, the bad boy/desperado, and Will, the senior class president, quarterback, and all around good guy. But not everyone at Avalon High is who they appear to be, not even Ellie herself. Eventually, it becomes apparent that Avalon High is a situation where the ancient Arthurian legend is repeating itself.', 'Elaine "Ellie" Harrison has just moved from Minnesota to Annapolis, Maryland while her parents take a year-long sabbatical to continue their medieval studies in nearby Washington D.C. Her new high school, Avalon High, seems like a typical high school with the stereotypical students: Lance the jock, Jennifer the cheerleader, Marco, the bad boy/desperado, and Will, the senior class president, quarterback, and all around good guy. But not everyone at Avalon High is who they appear to be, not even Ellie herself. Eventually, it becomes apparent that Avalon High is a situation where the ancient Arthurian legend is repeating itself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A0VRhkL3l7YWHH4FTWMCki55rfx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50479'),
  ('432451591649764435', 'Avanak Apti', 1978, 'Comedy', 'Natuk Baytan, İsmail Güneş, Namık Karakılıç', 'Suavi Sualp', 'Kemal Sunal, Ayşen Gruda, Ünal Gürel, Necdet Yakın, Ali Şen, Atilla Ergün, Yadigar Ejder, Ehat Alinçe', null, 'Apti is a simple minded village man and he believes what is happening around him by chance is actually his doing. He becomes famous by beating a feared man and everyone starts to respect him than he meets a singer and an action-love story starts.', 'Apti is a simple minded village man and he believes what is happening around him by chance is actually his doing. He becomes famous by beating a feared man and everyone starts to respect him than he meets a singer and an action-love story starts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/SrqLRBam6DyjMpLVRdRtBgxueP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:148697'),
  ('426538287526271328', 'Avanti!', 1972, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Billy Wilder, Luigi Kuveiller', 'I. A. L. Diamond, Billy Wilder', 'Jack Lemmon, Juliet Mills, Clive Revill, Edward Andrews, Gianfranco Barra, Franco Angrisano, Pippo Franco, Franco Acampora', 'R', 'A successful businessman travels to Italy to arrange for the return of his tycoon father''s body, only to learn that dear old dad died with his longtime mistress.', 'A successful businessman travels to Italy to arrange for the return of his tycoon father''s body, only to learn that dear old dad died with his longtime mistress.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dxhQzsBIjWMRu7rqprX4I2WzyEo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12530'),
  ('64571395224150861', 'Avarice', 2022, 'Thriller, Action', 'John V. Soto', 'Dane Millerd, Andrew Slattery, Adam Enslow', 'Gillian Alexy, Luke Ford, Nick Atkinson, Tom O''Sullivan, Priscilla-Anne Jacob, Alex Fleri, John McPherson, Ryan Panizza', null, 'Kate, a gifted archer, is on vacation with her family when they are ambushed by a team of mercenaries in a vicious home invasion. Kate’s husband and daughter are abducted during the violent onslaught, and she must rely on her archery skills to defeat their captors and save her family.', 'Kate, a gifted archer, is on vacation with her family when they are ambushed by a team of mercenaries in a vicious home invasion. Kate’s husband and daughter are abducted during the violent onslaught, and she must rely on her archery skills to defeat their captors and save her family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4uhSK3rq6aymSlzgoX3EKm1y2sf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:942894'),
  ('688694102655864403', 'Avariya - Cop''s Daughter', 1989, 'Drama, Action', 'Boris Bondarenko, Mikhail Tumanishvili, Aleksandr Khasin', 'Yuri Korotkov', 'Oksana Arbuzova, Vladimir Ilin, Anastasia Voznesenskaya, Nikolai Pastukhov, Boris Romanov, Lyubov Sokolova, Igor Nefyodov, Valentina Berezutskaya', null, 'A teenage girl nicknamed Avariya - "Crash" - is a rebel child that just can''t get along with her family members that try to persuade her to behave normally - that is as other people do. But when Avariya gets gang-raped, his father (who is a cop) breaks all the rules and goes out for revenge.', 'A teenage girl nicknamed Avariya - "Crash" - is a rebel child that just can''t get along with her family members that try to persuade her to behave normally - that is as other people do. But when Avariya gets gang-raped, his father (who is a cop) breaks all the rules and goes out for revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/matQUPMpkFklwtjxEpXSmMfzlY2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:208701'),
  ('890418067998092859', 'Avarya', 2019, 'Science Fiction, Animation', 'Gökalp Gönen, Gökalp Gönen, Ferit Yücel', 'Gökalp Gönen', 'Sermet Yeşil, Damla Çay', null, 'Embarked on a spaceship in the hope of finding a new habitable planet, the human trapped in his own ship after the robot overseer finds every single candidate planet unsuitable.', 'Embarked on a spaceship in the hope of finding a new habitable planet, the human trapped in his own ship after the robot overseer finds every single candidate planet unsuitable.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sdmQqUpPFLaghBzJmlS76MNw4Ph.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:590890'),
  ('936170126241255715', 'Avatar', 1916, 'Drama, Fantasy', 'Carmine Gallone', 'Théophile Gautier', 'Soava Gallone, Andrea Habay, Amleto Novelli, Augusto Mastripietri', null, 'Based on Théophile Gautier''s novel of the same name, the film tells of the tragic love affair of Ottavio de Saville. He falls madly in love with Madame Prascovie Labinska, a woman very faithful to her husband, the Polish count Olaf Labinski. Alarmed by the growing physical and mental weariness of the desperate young man, his relatives and friends decide to turn to Doctor Balthazar, who has just returned from a trip to the Indies where he was initiated into the secrets of Brahman.', 'Based on Théophile Gautier''s novel of the same name, the film tells of the tragic love affair of Ottavio de Saville. He falls madly in love with Madame Prascovie Labinska, a woman very faithful to her husband, the Polish count Olaf Labinski. Alarmed by the growing physical and mental weariness of the desperate young man, his relatives and friends decide to turn to Doctor Balthazar, who has just returned from a trip to the Indies where he was initiated into the secrets of Brahman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nUTlHxnwomoIwojD0AF0OMzkonw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1295181'),
  ('571466282473877420', 'Avatar', 1941, null, 'Premankur Atorthy', null, 'Devidas Bannerjee, Durgadas Bandyopadhyay, Ahindra Choudhury, Jyotsna Gupta, Tulsi Lahiri, Panna Rani', null, 'Indranath’s son is ill, Guru Omkarananda suggests he pray to the goddess Kamala. His son improves but bad luck follows Indranath; his son and daughter die. Unable to stand the grief the Queen/Kalyani loses her mental equilibrium. Goddess Kamala manifests as Rupasi, the daughter of Omkarananda. Virodhananda and his son Tribhanga are the incarnation of Narad and Narayan on earth. The kingdom goes through difficult times. Omkarananda is arrested and Rupasi goes to meet Bastabesh/Indranath who is attracted to her. Rupasi takes refuge in Birodhananda’s house to avoid Bastabesh’s advances. Birodhananda is interested in getting his son Tribhanga married to Rupasi. Bastabesh goes after Rupasi/Kamala who blinds him. Finally the gods perform their miracle and a repentant Bastabesh is restored his sight and kingdom.', 'Indranath’s son is ill, Guru Omkarananda suggests he pray to the goddess Kamala. His son improves but bad luck follows Indranath; his son and daughter die. Unable to stand the grief the Queen/Kalyani loses her mental equilibrium. Goddess Kamala manifests as Rupasi, the daughter of Omkarananda. Virodhananda and his son Tribhanga are the incarnation of Narad and Narayan on earth. The kingdom goes through difficult times. Omkarananda is arrested and Rupasi goes to meet Bastabesh/Indranath who is attracted to her. Rupasi takes refuge in Birodhananda’s house to avoid Bastabesh’s advances. Birodhananda is interested in getting his son Tribhanga married to Rupasi. Bastabesh goes after Rupasi/Kamala who blinds him. Finally the gods perform their miracle and a repentant Bastabesh is restored his sight and kingdom.', null, 'tmdb:movie:421403'),
  ('332749384640998127', 'Avatar', 2006, 'Drama', 'Lluís Quílez, Hammudi Al-Rahmoun Font, Isaac Vila', 'Lluís Quílez', 'Sebastián Haro, Rosana Pastor, Gerard Villegas', null, 'Tension mounts between a quadraplegic man and his wife as she prepares a bath for him.', 'Tension mounts between a quadraplegic man and his wife as she prepares a bath for him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gmnD2e1RvMdCl9D1rsDEQaQlJxK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1096978'),
  ('18787734434788845', 'Avatar', 2009, 'Science Fiction, Action, Adventure', 'Mauro Fiore, James Cameron, Mike Stassi', 'James Cameron', 'Sam Worthington, Zoe Saldaña, Sigourney Weaver, Stephen Lang, Michelle Rodriguez, Giovanni Ribisi, Joel David Moore, CCH Pounder', 'PG-13', 'In the 22nd century, a paraplegic Marine is dispatched to the moon Pandora on a unique mission, but becomes torn between following orders and protecting an alien civilization.', 'In the 22nd century, a paraplegic Marine is dispatched to the moon Pandora on a unique mission, but becomes torn between following orders and protecting an alien civilization.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gKY6q7SjCkAU6FqvqWybDYgUKIF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19995'),
  ('717106984751504462', 'Avatar', 2011, 'Horror', 'Atsushi Wada, Toru Hirao', 'Teruo Noguchi', 'Ai Hashimoto, Nako Mizusawa, Haneyuri, Rikako Sakata, Non, Marin, Kazuma Sano, Mizuki Sashide', null, 'Michiko lost her dad in a car accident when she was 10 years old. After the car accident, Michiko has lived with her mother Kyoko. Michiko, now in her 2nd year of high school, gets a cell phone from her mother as a birthday present. Michiko is so excited to have her very first cell phone. Soon afterwards, she is forced into joining social networking site "AvaQ" by classmate, and queen of the classroom, Taeko.', 'Michiko lost her dad in a car accident when she was 10 years old. After the car accident, Michiko has lived with her mother Kyoko. Michiko, now in her 2nd year of high school, gets a cell phone from her mother as a birthday present. Michiko is so excited to have her very first cell phone. Soon afterwards, she is forced into joining social networking site "AvaQ" by classmate, and queen of the classroom, Taeko.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/itpOoQ9aoY1ZdZFPhYwPSvY9Dt0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:282908'),
  ('451530569824781882', 'Avatar 4', 2029, 'Science Fiction, Adventure, Action', 'James Cameron, Mauro Fiore', 'James Cameron, Josh Friedman', 'Sam Worthington, Zoe Saldaña, Stephen Lang, Sigourney Weaver, Oona Chaplin, Giovanni Ribisi, Joel David Moore, CCH Pounder', null, 'The fourth installment of the franchise. Plot TBA.', 'The fourth installment of the franchise. Plot TBA.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qzMYKnT4MG1d0gnhwytr4cKhUvS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:216527'),
  ('487171662408771250', 'Avatar 5', 2031, 'Adventure, Science Fiction, Action', 'James Cameron, Mauro Fiore', 'James Cameron, Shane Salerno', 'Sam Worthington, Zoe Saldaña, Sigourney Weaver, Oona Chaplin, Giovanni Ribisi, CCH Pounder, Joel David Moore, Matt Gerald', null, 'The fifth installment of the franchise. Plot TBA.', 'The fifth installment of the franchise. Plot TBA.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rtmmvqkIC5zDMEd638Es2woxbz8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:393209'),
  ('5446065779187903', 'Avatar: Creating the World of Pandora', 2010, 'Documentary', 'Thomas C. Grane', null, 'James Cameron, Laz Alonso, Richard Baneham, Christopher Boyes, Rick Carter, Dylan Cole, Glenn Derry, Paul R. Frommer', null, 'The Making-of James Cameron''s Avatar. It shows interesting parts of the work on the set.', 'The Making-of James Cameron''s Avatar. It shows interesting parts of the work on the set.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d9oqcfeCyc3zmMal6eJbfj3gatc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:111332'),
  ('26116939555057620', 'Avatar: Fire and Ash', 2025, 'Science Fiction, Adventure, Fantasy', 'James Cameron, Maria Battle-Campbell, Garrett Warren', 'James Cameron, Amanda Silver, Rick Jaffa', 'Sam Worthington, Zoe Saldaña, Sigourney Weaver, Stephen Lang, Oona Chaplin, Jack Champion, Kate Winslet, Cliff Curtis', 'PG-13', 'In the wake of the devastating war against the RDA and the loss of their eldest son, Jake Sully and Neytiri face a new threat on Pandora: the Ash People, a violent and power-hungry Na''vi tribe led by the ruthless Varang. Jake''s family must fight for their survival and the future of Pandora in a conflict that pushes them to their emotional and physical limits.', 'In the wake of the devastating war against the RDA and the loss of their eldest son, Jake Sully and Neytiri face a new threat on Pandora: the Ash People, a violent and power-hungry Na''vi tribe led by the ruthless Varang. Jake''s family must fight for their survival and the future of Pandora in a conflict that pushes them to their emotional and physical limits.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bRBeSHfGHwkEpImlhxPmOcUsaeg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83533'),
