  ('460580623073737491', 'Avatar: The Deep Dive - A Special Edition of 20/20', 2022, 'Documentary', 'Dave Hoffman', null, 'Chris Connelly, James Cameron, Zoe Saldaña, Sigourney Weaver, Kate Winslet, Stephen Lang, Jamie Flatters, Bailey Bass', 'PG-13', 'An inside look at one of the most anticipated movie sequels ever with James Cameron and cast.', 'An inside look at one of the most anticipated movie sequels ever with James Cameron and cast.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pzZGqIyrrSqIfrkPLJnN1tvCGnV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1059673'),
  ('1060484009531422056', 'Avatar: The Exchange of Souls', 1964, 'TV Movie, Drama, Family', 'Janusz Majewski, Halina Garus, Kurt Weber', 'Janusz Majewski', 'Wanda Koczeska, Jan Machulski, Henryk Boukołowski, Gustaw Holoubek, Kazimierz Rudzki, Krzysztof Litwin, Lucjan Zitrig, Ryszard Kotys', null, 'Count Olgierd Łabiński lives in Paris with his beloved wife, but their quiet life is disturbed by the arrival of Octavius de Saville, a former admirer of the Countess from her days in Florence. Obsessed with possessing her, Octavius seeks out Dr. Cherbonneau, a sinister figure dabbling in Eastern teachings of reincarnation. Through the doctor’s occult science, Octavius attempts a dangerous “exchange of souls,” scheming to inhabit the Count’s body and win the woman he desires.', 'Count Olgierd Łabiński lives in Paris with his beloved wife, but their quiet life is disturbed by the arrival of Octavius de Saville, a former admirer of the Countess from her days in Florence. Obsessed with possessing her, Octavius seeks out Dr. Cherbonneau, a sinister figure dabbling in Eastern teachings of reincarnation. Through the doctor’s occult science, Octavius attempts a dangerous “exchange of souls,” scheming to inhabit the Count’s body and win the woman he desires.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ymydy1zLK4lNWT6PQB1o5P6Wy9X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:155444'),
  ('1050539278265580901', 'Avatar: The Way of Water', 2022, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'James Cameron, Aashrita Kamath, Luke Freeborn', 'James Cameron, Amanda Silver, Rick Jaffa', 'Sam Worthington, Zoe Saldaña, Sigourney Weaver, Stephen Lang, Kate Winslet, Cliff Curtis, Joel David Moore, CCH Pounder', 'PG-13', 'Set more than a decade after the events of the first film, learn the story of the Sully family (Jake, Neytiri, and their kids), the trouble that follows them, the lengths they go to keep each other safe, the battles they fight to stay alive, and the tragedies they endure.', 'Set more than a decade after the events of the first film, learn the story of the Sully family (Jake, Neytiri, and their kids), the trouble that follows them, the lengths they go to keep each other safe, the battles they fight to stay alive, and the tragedies they endure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t6HIqrRAclMCA60NsSmeqe9RmNV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76600'),
  ('446534871980395003', 'Avatara Purusha: Part 1', 2022, 'Thriller, Fantasy, Horror', 'William David, Suni', 'Suni', 'Sharan, Ashika Ranganath, Sai Kumar, Bhavya, Balaji Manohar, Sudharani, Srinagar Kitty, Ashutosh Rana', null, 'When a son of an Ayurveda scholar goes missing, he blames his sister and cuts all ties with her. When the latter''s daughter decides to set things right with a devious plan, there seems to be more trouble waiting for the family.', 'When a son of an Ayurveda scholar goes missing, he blames his sister and cuts all ties with her. When the latter''s daughter decides to set things right with a devious plan, there seems to be more trouble waiting for the family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gQ29E9Qy6z5ExsxnpgUTHfpZFO3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:677528'),
  ('520073624242568431', 'Avataro Sentai Donbrothers The Movie: New First Love Hero', 2022, 'Action, Adventure, Fantasy, Science Fiction, Family', 'Ryuta Tasaki', 'Toshiki Inoue', 'Kouhei Higuchi, Yuuki Beppu, Kohaku Shida, Totaro, Hirofumi Suzuki, Raizou Ishikawa, Kiita Komagine, Yuya Tominaga', null, 'The Donbrothers are offered to appear in a movie based on Haruka''s debut manga, which she allegedly plagiarized, First Love Hero by talented producer Reiko Mieda! She can''t hide that she is upset about the offer. Will the plagiarism be revealed? That said, shooting for the movie is a mess and the Noto even got parts! What is happening with the movie''s shooting?! ​', 'The Donbrothers are offered to appear in a movie based on Haruka''s debut manga, which she allegedly plagiarized, First Love Hero by talented producer Reiko Mieda! She can''t hide that she is upset about the offer. Will the plagiarism be revealed? That said, shooting for the movie is a mess and the Noto even got parts! What is happening with the movie''s shooting?! ​', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8MacEBNLdMnmroPAx6LNmi6oJaj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:937315'),
  ('1068840257314625381', 'Avataro Sentai Donbrothers vs. Avataro Sentai Donburies', 2023, 'Comedy', 'Hirofumi Fukuzawa', 'Ayumi Shimo', 'Kouhei Higuchi, Kohaku Shida, Yuuki Beppu, Hirofumi Suzuki, Totaro, Raizou Ishikawa, Yuya Tominaga, Amisa Miyazaki', null, 'The Avataro Sentai Donburies, which first appeared in Avataro Sentai Donbrothers'' press conference gets a TTFC special!', 'The Avataro Sentai Donburies, which first appeared in Avataro Sentai Donbrothers'' press conference gets a TTFC special!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9hiiML3NMC4Qj25V97XEYl7bVKw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1132450'),
  ('166495136751995422', 'Avataro Sentai Donbrothers vs. Zenkaiger', 2023, 'Action, Drama, Science Fiction', 'Katsuya Watanabe', 'Toshiki Inoue, Junko Komura', 'Kouhei Higuchi, Yuuki Beppu, Kohaku Shida, Totaro, Hirofumi Suzuki, Raizou Ishikawa, Yuya Tominaga, Shinnosuke Takahashi', null, 'Divided into three acts, the first act is about the Zenkaigers dealing with a new Kashiwa Mochi World and Zocks declares himself as "Kashiwa Mochi King", the ruler of Zenkaitopia?! In the second act, it''s been a year since Taro left and the five companions continue to fight as a team with Jiro as their leader. Taro later regains his memories, only for his companions to ask him to leave the Donbrothers. In the final act, an incident caused the two worlds to connect, thus a full-throttle miracle battle between the two Super Sentai begins!', 'Divided into three acts, the first act is about the Zenkaigers dealing with a new Kashiwa Mochi World and Zocks declares himself as "Kashiwa Mochi King", the ruler of Zenkaitopia?! In the second act, it''s been a year since Taro left and the five companions continue to fight as a team with Jiro as their leader. Taro later regains his memories, only for his companions to ask him to leave the Donbrothers. In the final act, an incident caused the two worlds to connect, thus a full-throttle miracle battle between the two Super Sentai begins!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aytVlwmwwdyl9UksAZInDwR7jhk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1092060'),
  ('185340116323416258', 'Avengement', 2019, 'Crime, Action, Thriller', 'Jesse V. Johnson, Jonathan Hall, Bradley Dennis', 'Stu Small, Jesse V. Johnson', 'Scott Adkins, Craig Fairbrass, Thomas Turgoose, Nick Moran, Kierston Wareing, Leo Gregory, Beau Fowler, Louis Mandylor', 'NR', 'While on a prison furlough, a lowly criminal evades his guards and returns to his old stomping ground to take revenge on the people who turned him into a cold blooded killer.', 'While on a prison furlough, a lowly criminal evades his guards and returns to his old stomping ground to take revenge on the people who turned him into a cold blooded killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rXPxSAYf3FdQktnOtQnvhUPMhFp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:534490'),
  ('54238396281397008', 'Avenger', 2006, 'TV Movie, Action, Thriller', 'Robert Markowitz, Oliver Bokelberg', null, 'Sam Elliott, Timothy Hutton, James Cromwell, William Hope, David Hayman, Jamie Bartlett, Lucy Russell, Jacqueline Chan', null, 'After his own daughter was killed in Panama in 1994, former CIA agent Calvin Dexter became a private ''specialist'' in cases which wouldn''t reach justice trough the regular legal channels. Two years later he accepts to find Richard ''Ricky'' Edmunds for his pa, influential rich businessman Stephen Edmonds. Ricky for a private Canadian war victims charity in Bosnia and went missing. Dexter discovers Ricky was beaten to pulp and drowned for no other crime then helping street boys from the other side by Zoran Zilic and his Serbian paramilitary ''order''. He offers Steven to ''finish the job'' as such war criminals don''t go to trial. But deputy CIA director Paul Devereaux cares only for a nuclear arms project he wants to use Zilic for. So CIA troubleshooter Frank McBride is ordered to protect him and handle Dexter.', 'After his own daughter was killed in Panama in 1994, former CIA agent Calvin Dexter became a private ''specialist'' in cases which wouldn''t reach justice trough the regular legal channels. Two years later he accepts to find Richard ''Ricky'' Edmunds for his pa, influential rich businessman Stephen Edmonds. Ricky for a private Canadian war victims charity in Bosnia and went missing. Dexter discovers Ricky was beaten to pulp and drowned for no other crime then helping street boys from the other side by Zoran Zilic and his Serbian paramilitary ''order''. He offers Steven to ''finish the job'' as such war criminals don''t go to trial. But deputy CIA director Paul Devereaux cares only for a nuclear arms project he wants to use Zilic for. So CIA troubleshooter Frank McBride is ordered to protect him and handle Dexter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cEI5aazuAVJ3PcWeNM8gxYiNjmq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47369'),
  ('401155777512949588', 'Avenger of the Seven Seas', 1962, 'Adventure, Crime, Drama', 'Carlo Bellero, Domenico Paolella', 'Ugo Guerra, Luciano Martino', 'Richard Harrison, Michèle Mercier, Roldano Lupi, Marisa Belli, Walter Barnes, Paul Müller, Carlo Hintermann, Lilia Nguyen', null, 'It''s 1790 and British Naval Commander Redway is driven by greed for money and will stop at nothing to get it. His second in command, David Robinson, questions his allegiance when Redway kills his father and takes his brother prisoner. In order to save his brother and avenge his father''s death David must join forces with a band of pirates, led by Captain Bernard, hunt down and kill Redway.', 'It''s 1790 and British Naval Commander Redway is driven by greed for money and will stop at nothing to get it. His second in command, David Robinson, questions his allegiance when Redway kills his father and takes his brother prisoner. In order to save his brother and avenge his father''s death David must join forces with a band of pirates, led by Captain Bernard, hunt down and kill Redway.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kW0YRXV4PpOUGspB68tQit9oGpI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6618'),
  ('407650856882860269', 'Avengers Confidential: Black Widow & Punisher', 2014, 'Animation, Science Fiction, Action', 'Kenichi Shimizu, Toshihiko Nakajima, Kenji Fujita', 'Mitsutaka Hirota', 'Miyuki Sawashiro, Tessyo Genda, Hideaki Tezuka, Hiroki Touchi, Ryuuzaburou Ootomo, Junko Minagawa, Daisuke Namikawa, Masashi Sugawara', 'PG-13', 'When the Punisher takes out a black-market weapons dealer, he stumbles upon a far-reaching terrorist plot devised by a group known as Leviathan.', 'When the Punisher takes out a black-market weapons dealer, he stumbles upon a far-reaching terrorist plot devised by a group known as Leviathan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wJcyYVRPZDOZOD2w0r2R6wuZqqN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:257346'),
  ('335827279305249360', 'Avengers from Hell', 1981, 'Fantasy, Horror, Mystery', 'Lee Pooi-Kuen', null, 'Alex Man Chi-Leung, JoJo Chan Kei-Kei, Lee Yin-Yin, Philip Chan Yan-Kin, Yiu Wai, Lily Chan, Jenny Liang, Chun Wong', null, 'Three macabre short stories about gambling, vengeance and homicide.', 'Three macabre short stories about gambling, vengeance and homicide.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8SWh0e8LSQQO5ErKVPUCuvTcuMo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:157421'),
  ('838422164884190865', 'Avengers Grimm', 2015, 'Action, Fantasy', 'Jeremy M. Inman, John DeFazio', 'Jeremy M. Inman', 'Casper Van Dien, Lou Ferrigno, Kimo Leopoldo, Milynn Sarley, Marah Fairclough, Lauren Parkinson, Rileah Vanderbilt, Justine Herron', 'NR', 'When Rumpelstiltskin destroys the Magic Mirror and escapes to the modern world, the four princesses of "Once Upon a Time"-Cinderella, Sleeping Beauty, Snow White, and Rapunzel-are sucked through the portal too. Well-trained and endowed with magical powers, the four women must fight Rumpelstiltskin and his army of thralls before he enslaves everyone on Earth.', 'When Rumpelstiltskin destroys the Magic Mirror and escapes to the modern world, the four princesses of "Once Upon a Time"-Cinderella, Sleeping Beauty, Snow White, and Rapunzel-are sucked through the portal too. Well-trained and endowed with magical powers, the four women must fight Rumpelstiltskin and his army of thralls before he enslaves everyone on Earth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9sdAHQxt53W8gZKivX0Pdk4DuXA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:323660'),
  ('301890701733021016', 'Avengers Grimm: Time Wars', 2018, 'Action, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Maximilian Elfeldt', 'Jeremy M. Inman', 'Lauren Parkinson, Marah Fairclough, Christina Licciardi, Elizabeth Peterson, Eric Feltes, Randall Yarbrough, Michael Marcel, Katherine Maya', 'NR', 'When Rumpelstiltskin tries to take over Earth once and for all, The Avengers Grimm must track him down through time in order to defeat him.', 'When Rumpelstiltskin tries to take over Earth once and for all, The Avengers Grimm must track him down through time in order to defeat him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nNlDEQ4ksXpzpu3M230Yba6zMQv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:521720'),
  ('335744109873239882', 'Avengers: Age of Ultron', 2015, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Joss Whedon, Ben Davis, Ray Chan', 'Joss Whedon', 'Robert Downey Jr., Chris Hemsworth, Mark Ruffalo, Chris Evans, Scarlett Johansson, Jeremy Renner, James Spader, Samuel L. Jackson', 'PG-13', 'When Tony Stark tries to jumpstart a dormant peacekeeping program, things go awry and Earth’s Mightiest Heroes are put to the ultimate test as the fate of the planet hangs in the balance. As the villainous Ultron emerges, it is up to The Avengers to stop him from enacting his terrible plans, and soon uneasy alliances and unexpected action pave the way for an epic and unique global adventure.', 'When Tony Stark tries to jumpstart a dormant peacekeeping program, things go awry and Earth’s Mightiest Heroes are put to the ultimate test as the fate of the planet hangs in the balance. As the villainous Ultron emerges, it is up to The Avengers to stop him from enacting his terrible plans, and soon uneasy alliances and unexpected action pave the way for an epic and unique global adventure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4ssDuvEDkSArWEdyBl2X5EHvYKU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:99861'),
  ('629724927238656598', 'Avengers: Doomsday', 2026, 'Science Fiction, Action, Adventure', 'Joe Russo, Anthony Russo, Chris Castaldi', 'Stephen McFeely, Michael Waldron', 'Chris Hemsworth, Vanessa Kirby, Anthony Mackie, Sebastian Stan, Letitia Wright, Paul Rudd, Wyatt Russell, Tenoch Huerta Mejía', null, 'The Avengers, Wakandans, Fantastic Four, Thunderbolts, and X-Men all fight against Doctor Doom. Plot TBA.', 'The Avengers, Wakandans, Fantastic Four, Thunderbolts, and X-Men all fight against Doctor Doom. Plot TBA.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8HkIe2i4ScpCkcX9SzZ9IPasqWV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1003596'),
  ('680059688231446705', 'Avengers: Endgame', 2019, 'Adventure, Science Fiction, Action', 'Paul Schneider, Chris Castaldi, Simon Downes', 'Stephen McFeely, Christopher Markus', 'Robert Downey Jr., Chris Evans, Mark Ruffalo, Chris Hemsworth, Scarlett Johansson, Jeremy Renner, Josh Brolin, Don Cheadle', 'PG-13', 'After the devastating events of Avengers: Infinity War, the universe is in ruins due to the efforts of the Mad Titan, Thanos. With the help of remaining allies, the Avengers must assemble once more in order to undo Thanos'' actions and restore order to the universe once and for all, no matter what consequences may be in store.', 'After the devastating events of Avengers: Infinity War, the universe is in ruins due to the efforts of the Mad Titan, Thanos. With the help of remaining allies, the Avengers must assemble once more in order to undo Thanos'' actions and restore order to the universe once and for all, no matter what consequences may be in store.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ulzhLuWrPK07P1YkdWQLZnQh1JL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:299534'),
  ('257095571067368413', 'Avengers: Infinity War', 2018, 'Adventure, Action, Science Fiction', 'Paul Schneider, Trent Opaloch, Simon Downes', 'Christopher Markus, Stephen McFeely', 'Robert Downey Jr., Chris Evans, Chris Hemsworth, Josh Brolin, Mark Ruffalo, Scarlett Johansson, Don Cheadle, Benedict Cumberbatch', 'PG-13', 'As the Avengers and their allies have continued to protect the world from threats too large for any one hero to handle, a new danger has emerged from the cosmic shadows: Thanos. A despot of intergalactic infamy, his goal is to collect all six Infinity Stones, artifacts of unimaginable power, and use them to inflict his twisted will on all of reality. Everything the Avengers have fought for has led up to this moment - the fate of Earth and existence itself has never been more uncertain.', 'As the Avengers and their allies have continued to protect the world from threats too large for any one hero to handle, a new danger has emerged from the cosmic shadows: Thanos. A despot of intergalactic infamy, his goal is to collect all six Infinity Stones, artifacts of unimaginable power, and use them to inflict his twisted will on all of reality. Everything the Avengers have fought for has led up to this moment - the fate of Earth and existence itself has never been more uncertain.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7WsyChQLEftFiDOVTGkv3hFpyyt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:299536'),
  ('336637197191141070', 'Avengers: Secret Wars', 2027, 'Science Fiction, Action, Adventure', 'Anthony Russo, Joe Russo', 'Stephen McFeely', 'Robert Downey Jr., Pedro Pascal, Vanessa Kirby, Ebon Moss-Bachrach, Joseph Quinn, Sebastian Stan, Florence Pugh, David Harbour', null, 'An upcoming film in Phase Six of the Marvel Cinematic Universe (MCU) and the finale of The Multiverse Saga. Plot TBA.', 'An upcoming film in Phase Six of the Marvel Cinematic Universe (MCU) and the finale of The Multiverse Saga. Plot TBA.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f0YBuh4hyiAheXhh4JnJWoKi9g5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1003598'),
  ('321498075021280105', 'Avenging Angel', 1985, 'Action, Thriller, Crime', 'Robert Vincent O''Neil, Peter Lyons Collister, Sandy Collister', 'Robert Vincent O''Neil, Joseph Michael Cala', 'Betsy Russell, Rory Calhoun, Robert F. Lyons, Steven M. Porter, Ossie Davis, Susan Tyrrell, Paul Lambert, Barry Pearl', 'R', 'Molly Stewart, now a law student at UCLA, is determined to leave her prostitute past behind. After learning that the detective who helped save her life has been murdered, she quickly finds herself pitted against an underworld of mob figures who might be more than she''s bargained for...', 'Molly Stewart, now a law student at UCLA, is determined to leave her prostitute past behind. After learning that the detective who helped save her life has been murdered, she quickly finds herself pitted against an underworld of mob figures who might be more than she''s bargained for...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6rksWEKXrg0QgdxyTxOajArn2Ub.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67390'),
  ('606158636933108949', 'Avenging Angelo', 2002, 'Action, Comedy, Crime', 'Martyn Burke, Ousama Rawi, Myron Hoffert', 'Steve Mackall, Will Aldis', 'Sylvester Stallone, Madeleine Stowe, Anthony Quinn, Raoul Bova, Harry Van Gorkum, Billy Gardell, George Touliatos, Angelo Celeste', 'R', 'A woman who has recently discovered that she is the daughter of Angelo, a major mafia boss, decides to wreak vengeance when he is killed by a hitman. She''s aided by his faithful bodyguard, with whom she soon falls in love.', 'A woman who has recently discovered that she is the daughter of Angelo, a major mafia boss, decides to wreak vengeance when he is killed by a hitman. She''s aided by his faithful bodyguard, with whom she soon falls in love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hl4mI28D4NhE6ePNgPojQuyEYw7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13437'),
  ('171145732680700434', 'Avenging Force', 1986, 'Action, Drama, Thriller', 'Sam Firstenberg, Sharon Mann, Gideon Porath', 'James Booth', 'Michael Dudikoff, Steve James, William Wallace, John P. Ryan, James Booth, Karl Johnson, Marc Alaimo, Allison Gereighty', 'R', 'Martial arts expert Matt Hunter was one of the most promising operatives in Army intelligence until his parents were killed by terrorists, and he retired to the family''s farm in Louisiana to take care of his 12-year-old sister Sara and their grandfather Jimmy. Larry Richards, a black man running for the Senate, is one of Matt''s best friends. Larry has become the target of The Pentangle, a racist organization led by a man named Glastenbury, and Glastenbury doesn''t want Larry to be elected. In an attempt on Larry''s life during a Mardi Gras parade in New Orleans, The Pentangle kills one of Larry''s sons. Matt lets Larry, his wife Daisy, and his other son move to the remotely located farm so they can hide from Glastenbury and the Pentangle, but the Pentangle strikes again, setting the farmhouse on fire. Matt and Sara escape as the only survivors. Then the Pentangle kidnaps Sara, sending Matt on a mission to rescue Sara from Glastenbury and the Pentangle', 'Martial arts expert Matt Hunter was one of the most promising operatives in Army intelligence until his parents were killed by terrorists, and he retired to the family''s farm in Louisiana to take care of his 12-year-old sister Sara and their grandfather Jimmy. Larry Richards, a black man running for the Senate, is one of Matt''s best friends. Larry has become the target of The Pentangle, a racist organization led by a man named Glastenbury, and Glastenbury doesn''t want Larry to be elected. In an attempt on Larry''s life during a Mardi Gras parade in New Orleans, The Pentangle kills one of Larry''s sons. Matt lets Larry, his wife Daisy, and his other son move to the remotely located farm so they can hide from Glastenbury and the Pentangle, but the Pentangle strikes again, setting the farmhouse on fire. Matt and Sara escape as the only survivors. Then the Pentangle kidnaps Sara, sending Matt on a mission to rescue Sara from Glastenbury and the Pentangle', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nR2SSO740LzAAL43l8iDdik5flP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52657'),
  ('1025820403709209310', 'Aventure Malgache', 1944, 'War, Drama', 'Alfred Hitchcock, Günther Krampf', 'Angus MacPhail', 'Paul Bonifas, Paul Clarus, Jean Dattas, Andre Frere, Guy Le Feuvre, Paulette Preney', 'NR', 'Backstage before a performance, a French actor recalls his time in Madagascar during World War II, when he secretly ran a Resistance radio station under the watch of a collaborationist police chief. His story unfolds in flashback, revealing espionage, deception, and divided loyalties within the French ranks. Made for Britain’s Ministry of Information, this 1944 French-language propaganda short satirizes Vichy opportunism and wartime hypocrisy, and was shelved for decades before its release in 1993.', 'Backstage before a performance, a French actor recalls his time in Madagascar during World War II, when he secretly ran a Resistance radio station under the watch of a collaborationist police chief. His story unfolds in flashback, revealing espionage, deception, and divided loyalties within the French ranks. Made for Britain’s Ministry of Information, this 1944 French-language propaganda short satirizes Vichy opportunism and wartime hypocrisy, and was shelved for decades before its release in 1993.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/taPsP0LhQ78KdcHWwdduWtO34Yl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48133'),
  ('309644500465189629', 'Aventurera', 1950, 'Drama, Music, Crime', 'Alberto Gout, Alex Phillips', 'Alvaro Custodio, Carlos Sampelayo', 'Ninón Sevilla, Tito Junco, Andrea Palma, Rubén Rojo, Miguel Inclán, Jorge Mondragón, Maruja Grifell, Luis López Somoza', 'NR', 'Left alone after her mother runs off with another man and her father kills himself, Elena attempts to make a new life for herself in a new city. Believing he''s a friend, Elena goes to dinner with "Pretty Boy" Lucio, but he drugs her champagne and sells her to Rosaura, who runs a brothel out of her nightclub. Elena becomes a sensation as a dancer, but all the while she nurtures plans of revenge against those who have conspired against her.', 'Left alone after her mother runs off with another man and her father kills himself, Elena attempts to make a new life for herself in a new city. Believing he''s a friend, Elena goes to dinner with "Pretty Boy" Lucio, but he drugs her champagne and sells her to Rosaura, who runs a brothel out of her nightclub. Elena becomes a sensation as a dancer, but all the while she nurtures plans of revenge against those who have conspired against her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A2hJ0jnC4GzEkzw8YOHp4bXAya0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:114896'),
  ('943930868274758761', 'Avenue de l''Opéra', 1900, 'Documentary', 'Alice Guy-Blaché', null, null, null, 'A shot of a busy street in Paris is shown in reverse.', 'A shot of a busy street in Paris is shown in reverse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6dzSQApIkxAvL1XMhwvsv2cq2zc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:119966'),
  ('1024894515018711278', 'Avenue Montaigne', 2006, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Jean-Marc Fabre, Danièle Thompson', 'Christopher Thompson, Danièle Thompson', 'Cécile de France, Valérie Lemercier, Albert Dupontel, Claude Brasseur, Dani, Christopher Thompson, Laura Morante, Suzanne Flon', null, 'A young woman arrives in Paris where she finds a job as a waitress in bar next on Avenue Montaigne that caters to the surrounding theaters and the wealthy inhabitants of the area. She will meet a pianist, a famous actress and a great art collector, and become acquainted with the "luxurious" world her grandmother has told her about since her childhood.', 'A young woman arrives in Paris where she finds a job as a waitress in bar next on Avenue Montaigne that caters to the surrounding theaters and the wealthy inhabitants of the area. She will meet a pianist, a famous actress and a great art collector, and become acquainted with the "luxurious" world her grandmother has told her about since her childhood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fgJwqYJ59daMvOS3JuZJcJiVRVn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10051'),
  ('75224776604672491', 'Average Joe', 2021, 'Action', 'Andrew Glassman', null, 'Jason Sedillo, Caitlin Rose Williams, Akasha Villalobos, Taylor James Johnson, Roman Garcia, Jason Scarbrough, Camden Toy, Timmy Williams', null, 'When Lord Menace returns from the dead to terrorize San Antonio, the old gang must reassemble to fight evil once more. Unfortunately, since their last adventure the gang has become complacent. They have families, lives, and weight gain, so how can they fight an otherworldly evil when they first must get in shape?', 'When Lord Menace returns from the dead to terrorize San Antonio, the old gang must reassemble to fight evil once more. Unfortunately, since their last adventure the gang has become complacent. They have families, lives, and weight gain, so how can they fight an otherworldly evil when they first must get in shape?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3F5qxOsRB5sb358Xhf3aXeXFrf4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:787644'),
  ('840825104922588246', 'Averno', 2018, 'Fantasy', 'Marcos Loayza', null, 'Paolo Vargas, Franco Miranda, Raúl Beltrán, Rosa Ríos, Miguel Ángel Estellano, Álvaro Gonzáles, Percy Jimenez', null, 'Young bootblack Tupah embarks on a frantic quest to find his uncle, Jacinto, lost in the Averno. In a dangerous journey through the underworld, myth and reality get endlessly intertwined and the death-loaded night in La Paz unveils the darkest and most surreal face of the imaginary of the Andes.', 'Young bootblack Tupah embarks on a frantic quest to find his uncle, Jacinto, lost in the Averno. In a dangerous journey through the underworld, myth and reality get endlessly intertwined and the death-loaded night in La Paz unveils the darkest and most surreal face of the imaginary of the Andes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l1N8U0Htd3HdacZRl4aRovVsA3A.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:497945'),
  ('779202353965522655', 'Aves de corral', 2026, 'Comedy, Crime, Drama', 'Antonio Vicent', 'Antonio Vicent', 'Diego Anido, Pedro Casablanc, Olivia Baglivi, José Luis García Pérez, Antonio Durán ''Morris''', null, 'A singular criminal organization orchestrates the assassination of a senior official from the National Intelligence Centre, but their mission takes an unexpected turn when it collides with the weekend getaway of a young couple', 'A singular criminal organization orchestrates the assassination of a senior official from the National Intelligence Centre, but their mission takes an unexpected turn when it collides with the weekend getaway of a young couple', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F6lgoxIgsjFKdaqQku27CSO28xmB.jpg', 'plex:movie:aves-de-corral-2026'),
  ('108959504735311206', 'Avetik', 1992, 'Drama', 'Don Askarian, Andreas Sinanos, Barbara Schubert', 'Don Askarian', 'Alik Asatryan, Mikhail Stepanyan, Karen Dzhanibekyan, Eduard Saribekyan, Samvel Ovazaryan, Geno Lechner', null, 'A tableaux of poetry and images exploring the historical trauma, identity, and collective memory of the Armenian people centered on an Armenian filmmaker exiled in Berlin.', 'A tableaux of poetry and images exploring the historical trauma, identity, and collective memory of the Armenian people centered on an Armenian filmmaker exiled in Berlin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7MBMLLk8EyLVa4dnLYbTzRr5lPI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:237422'),
  ('212537221492417062', 'AVH: Alien vs. Hunter', 2007, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Action', 'Scott Harper, Rachel Lee Goldenberg, Mark Atkins', 'David Michael Latt', 'William Katt, Dedee Pfeiffer, Wittly Jourdan, Randy Mulkey, Jennifer Couch, Jason S. Gray, John Murphy Jr.', null, 'A journalist named Lee Custler (William Katt) is out jogging when a flying object passes behind him and crashes. Sheriff Joel Armstrong (Collin Brock) picks him up and they go to check it out. They find an abandoned caravan close to where the object crashed. As they discover the object and realize it is a spaceship, an Alien emerges. The Alien (resembling a giant spider with a lizard-like head and torso) then chases them, after which Lee flees to the car. However Armstrong makes a stand, trips, falls and is killed by the Alien that then leaves. A terrified Tammy finds Lee and they call the local authorities but their car is destroyed by the Alien.', 'A journalist named Lee Custler (William Katt) is out jogging when a flying object passes behind him and crashes. Sheriff Joel Armstrong (Collin Brock) picks him up and they go to check it out. They find an abandoned caravan close to where the object crashed. As they discover the object and realize it is a spaceship, an Alien emerges. The Alien (resembling a giant spider with a lizard-like head and torso) then chases them, after which Lee flees to the car. However Armstrong makes a stand, trips, falls and is killed by the Alien that then leaves. A terrified Tammy finds Lee and they call the local authorities but their car is destroyed by the Alien.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/46whh6JCDqRFxHfKssePScUvD8D.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24198'),
  ('350256006419205029', 'Avicii - I''m Tim', 2024, 'Documentary, Music', 'Henrik Burman, Björn Tjärnberg', 'Henrik Burman', 'Avicii, Chris Martin, David Guetta, Nile Rodgers, Arash Pournouri, Aloe Blacc, Dan Tyminski, Joe Janiak', 'R', 'Before Avicii, there was Tim. Through his own words, witness how a prodigious musical talent became one of the defining artists of his generation.', 'Before Avicii, there was Tim. Through his own words, witness how a prodigious musical talent became one of the defining artists of his generation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bHrkrKQxYKem0ljWHPinIQK2gxy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1275945'),
