  ('15892561452376000', 'Avicii: True Stories', 2017, 'Music, Documentary', 'Levan Tsikurishvili, Olle Knutson Hjertén, Aidan Kelly', 'Levan Tsikurishvili', 'Avicii, David Guetta, Tiësto, Mike Einziger, Nile Rodgers, Wyclef Jean, Chris Martin, Aloe Blacc', null, 'Documentary about the arena-packing Swedish DJ, chronicling his explosive rise to fame and surprising decision to retire from live performances in 2016.', 'Documentary about the arena-packing Swedish DJ, chronicling his explosive rise to fame and surprising decision to retire from live performances in 2016.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/obVlatSLP94kmml5UaCjLsdWPWG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:479626'),
  ('2131316773923748', 'Avida', 2006, 'Comedy', 'Benoît Delépine, Gustave Kervern', 'Gustave Kervern, Benoît Delépine', 'Benoît Delépine, Albert Dupontel, Gustave Kervern, Velvet, Fernando Arrabal, Jean-Claude Carrière, Kati Outinen, Rémo Forlani', null, 'The kidnapping of a plump billionaire''s dog by a deaf-mute and 2 ketamine addicts goes wrong. The wealthy woman takes advantage of the situation to make them fullfil her last wishes.', 'The kidnapping of a plump billionaire''s dog by a deaf-mute and 2 ketamine addicts goes wrong. The wealthy woman takes advantage of the situation to make them fullfil her last wishes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iuTP8Pp2FokX4MDW4WtAB8RX8yW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61077'),
  ('55692453773248606', 'Aviya''s Summer', 1988, 'Drama, Family', 'Eli Cohen, David Gurfinkel', 'Haim Bouzaglo, Eli Cohen, Gila Almagor', 'Gila Almagor, Kaipu Cohen, Eli Cohen, Avital Dicker, Yossi Kantz, Rami Baruch, Marina Rossetti, Ariella Miniely', null, 'A young girl and her mother both carry the scars of their experiences during the holocaust in this drama from Israel. In 1951, Aviya is a ten-year-old girl being raised by her single mother, Henya, in a small village in Israel. Henya is a survivor of a Nazi concentration camp, and has come out of the experience considerably worse for wear; she''s haunted by the memories of her past, and has become emotionally unstable. Circumstances for her and her daughter are hardly improved by the poverty of the newly wounded state of Israel, and their own difficult economic circumstances. Aviya, meanwhile, is obsessed with finding her missing father, and wonders if he might be the man who has just moved into their village. Henya, however, knows better, and knows why Aviya''s father is never coming back to them.', 'A young girl and her mother both carry the scars of their experiences during the holocaust in this drama from Israel. In 1951, Aviya is a ten-year-old girl being raised by her single mother, Henya, in a small village in Israel. Henya is a survivor of a Nazi concentration camp, and has come out of the experience considerably worse for wear; she''s haunted by the memories of her past, and has become emotionally unstable. Circumstances for her and her daughter are hardly improved by the poverty of the newly wounded state of Israel, and their own difficult economic circumstances. Aviya, meanwhile, is obsessed with finding her missing father, and wonders if he might be the man who has just moved into their village. Henya, however, knows better, and knows why Aviya''s father is never coming back to them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k5VEIKIb5uwTJAcV2baEbQVyTAy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:173948'),
  ('981162938309440690', 'Avocado Toast', 2021, 'Comedy', 'Tyler Farr, Charles Unice', 'Tyler Farr', 'Justin Ray, Joe Burns, Mikayla Iverson, Jyllian Petrie, Joshua Michael French, Tito Livas, Mitchell Schouten, Eric Osmond', 'NR', 'Avocado Toast is a story about Adam, a hard-working, plays by the rules family-man, who risks everything he has by experimenting with "millennialism."', 'Avocado Toast is a story about Adam, a hard-working, plays by the rules family-man, who risks everything he has by experimenting with "millennialism."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kJLoazo035LwpI6QRoEKfz7nAAI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:814064'),
  ('1118358237165700913', 'AVP: Alien vs. Predator', 2004, 'Adventure, Science Fiction, Action, Horror', 'Paul W. S. Anderson, David Johnson, Mark Bartholomew', 'Paul W. S. Anderson', 'Sanaa Lathan, Lance Henriksen, Ian Whyte, Raoul Bova, Ewen Bremner, Colin Salmon, Tommy Flanagan, Joseph Rye', 'PG-13', 'When scientists discover something near Antarctica that appears to be a buried Pyramid, they send a research team out to investigate. Little do they know that they are about to step into a hunting ground where Aliens are grown as sport for the Predator race.', 'When scientists discover something near Antarctica that appears to be a buried Pyramid, they send a research team out to investigate. Little do they know that they are about to step into a hunting ground where Aliens are grown as sport for the Predator race.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ySWu5bCnnmgV1cVacvFnFIhgOjp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:395'),
