  ('28312584780927645', 'Awake', 2007, 'Thriller, Crime, Mystery', 'Russell Carpenter, Joby Harold, Amanda Slater', 'Joby Harold', 'Hayden Christensen, Jessica Alba, Terrence Howard, Lena Olin, Christopher McDonald, Sam Robards, Arliss Howard, Fisher Stevens', 'R', 'While undergoing heart surgery, a man experiences a phenomenon called ‘anesthetic awareness’, which leaves him awake but paralyzed throughout the operation. As various obstacles present themselves, his wife must make life-altering decisions while wrestling with her own personal drama.', 'While undergoing heart surgery, a man experiences a phenomenon called ‘anesthetic awareness’, which leaves him awake but paralyzed throughout the operation. As various obstacles present themselves, his wife must make life-altering decisions while wrestling with her own personal drama.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jIPIxaBcppLLkygko7tV5yuTIs1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13483'),
  ('222209010467621787', 'Awake', 2019, 'Action, Thriller', 'Alexander Chernyaev, Fedor Lyass', 'Elana Zeltser', 'Jonathan Rhys Meyers, Francesca Eastwood, William Forsythe, Malik Yoba, James Austin Kerr, Ginger Gilmartin, Cheyenne Rose Martin, Kaye Brownlee-France', 'NR', 'A man wakes in a hospital bed with no recollection of who he is, and learns that he''s wanted by the police for a committing a series of murders.', 'A man wakes in a hospital bed with no recollection of who he is, and learns that he''s wanted by the police for a committing a series of murders.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t2dYdtArwjZJRXbKNFlqr20g8Er.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:618019'),
  ('900200604550212901', 'Awake', 2021, 'Drama, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Alan Poon, Mark Raso', 'Joseph Raso, Mark Raso', 'Gina Rodriguez, Ariana Greenblatt, Lucius Hoyos, Shamier Anderson, Jennifer Jason Leigh, Finn Jones, Frances Fisher, Gil Bellows', 'R', 'After a sudden global event wipes out all electronics and takes away humankind’s ability to sleep, chaos quickly begins to consume the world. Only Jill, an ex-soldier with a troubled past, may hold the key to a cure in the form of her own daughter. The question is, can Jill safely deliver her daughter and save the world before she herself loses her mind.', 'After a sudden global event wipes out all electronics and takes away humankind’s ability to sleep, chaos quickly begins to consume the world. Only Jill, an ex-soldier with a troubled past, may hold the key to a cure in the form of her own daughter. The question is, can Jill safely deliver her daughter and save the world before she herself loses her mind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d8WJFQyNNAEmuGeDwxPhBpx0G4B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:615658'),
  ('1029726099416571908', 'Awaken', 2015, 'Horror, Thriller, Action', 'Mark Atkins, Ronn Burner, Mark Atkins', 'Mark Atkins, Ryan Priest', 'Natalie Burn, Jason London, Robert Davi, David Keith, Michael Copon, Edward Furlong, Daryl Hannah, Vinnie Jones', 'R', 'A random group of people wake up on an Island where they are being hunted down in a sinister plot to harvest their organs.', 'A random group of people wake up on an Island where they are being hunted down in a sinister plot to harvest their organs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qq67VdhYp1JYLLRwqheAcLE9HQW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:322922'),
