  ('792199053975440806', 'Awakening the Zodiac', 2017, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Boris Mojsovski, Jonathan Wright', 'Jennifer Archer, Jonathan Wright, Mike Horrigan', 'Shane West, Leslie Bibb, Matt Craven, Nicholas Campbell, Stephen McHattie, Kenneth Welsh, John Bregar, Eva Link', 'R', 'The story follows a down-on-their-luck couple who discovers a serial killer''s film reels. They decide to take the law into their own hands, risking everything for the chance at a $100,000 reward. It isn''t long until they find themselves in the killer''s lethal cross-hairs.', 'The story follows a down-on-their-luck couple who discovers a serial killer''s film reels. They decide to take the law into their own hands, risking everything for the chance at a $100,000 reward. It isn''t long until they find themselves in the killer''s lethal cross-hairs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qSk8EX5OTexKp90ZPZufDjSZ6ux.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:431112'),
  ('1063063157920618868', 'Awakenings', 1990, 'Drama', 'Penny Marshall, Miroslav Ondříček, Alan E. Muraoka', 'Steven Zaillian', 'Robert De Niro, Robin Williams, John Heard, Julie Kavner, Penelope Ann Miller, Ruth Nelson, Max von Sydow, Anne Meara', 'PG-13', 'Dr. Malcolm Sayer, a shy research physician, uses an experimental drug to "awaken" the catatonic victims of a rare disease. Leonard is the first patient to receive the controversial treatment. His awakening, filled with awe and enthusiasm, proves a rebirth for Sayer too, as the exuberant patient reveals life''s simple but unutterably sweet pleasures to the introverted doctor.', 'Dr. Malcolm Sayer, a shy research physician, uses an experimental drug to "awaken" the catatonic victims of a rare disease. Leonard is the first patient to receive the controversial treatment. His awakening, filled with awe and enthusiasm, proves a rebirth for Sayer too, as the exuberant patient reveals life''s simple but unutterably sweet pleasures to the introverted doctor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9gztZXuHLG6AJ0fgqGd7Q43cWRI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11005'),
  ('655057513975640032', 'Awara Paagal Deewana', 2002, 'Comedy, Action', 'Vikram Bhatt', 'Khalid Azmi', 'Akshay Kumar, Aftab Shivdasani, Paresh Rawal, Preeti Jhangiani, Aarti Chabria, Amrita Arora, Suniel Shetty, Johny Lever', null, 'A dentist and a henpecked husband finds his life in trouble after getting embroiled in a mafia rivalry.', 'A dentist and a henpecked husband finds his life in trouble after getting embroiled in a mafia rivalry.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yrNFzWj68qBC0zcf1HvX6sqeSoV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115124'),
