  ('367354509729004708', 'Ay Lav Yu', 2010, 'Comedy', 'Sermiyan Midyat', 'Sermiyan Midyat', 'Sermiyan Midyat, Katie Gill, Steve Guttenberg, Mariel Hemingway, Ayşenil Şamlıoğlu, Meray Ülgen, Fadik Sevin Atasoy, Ayça Damgacı', null, 'Mukhtar Yusuf Ağa’s unregistered village in eastern Anatolia has been championed through letters to government officials, and his lost son İbrahim, rescued and registered by Father Hana, is finally returning at age 30 with his American love Jessica; the question is whether Tinne can become their true homeland.', 'Mukhtar Yusuf Ağa’s unregistered village in eastern Anatolia has been championed through letters to government officials, and his lost son İbrahim, rescued and registered by Father Hana, is finally returning at age 30 with his American love Jessica; the question is whether Tinne can become their true homeland.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vNLFSrGgwu9Ue0mHpLJKCCIK1dl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49833'),
