  ('276095591135622867', 'Aziz Ansari: Buried Alive', 2013, 'Comedy', 'Will Lovelace, Dylan Southern', 'Aziz Ansari', 'Aziz Ansari', 'NR', 'Standup comedian Aziz Ansari ("Parks and Recreation") headlines his third standup special, where he shares his uniquely hilarious perspective on fears of adulthood, babies, marriage, and more. Ansari''s look at life on the cusp of 30 years old is smart, unfiltered, and hysterical.', 'Standup comedian Aziz Ansari ("Parks and Recreation") headlines his third standup special, where he shares his uniquely hilarious perspective on fears of adulthood, babies, marriage, and more. Ansari''s look at life on the cusp of 30 years old is smart, unfiltered, and hysterical.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rGkwXZEP1zLV6HBSbDBjxi8wXCH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:230158'),
