  ('348176519545595073', 'Aziz Ansari: Live at Madison Square Garden', 2015, 'Comedy', 'Aziz Ansari', 'Aziz Ansari', 'Aziz Ansari', null, 'Ansari headlines the iconic Madison Square Garden and delivers his most hilarious and insightful stand-up yet. Filmed in front of a sold-out audience, Ansari''s latest special is an uproarious document of the comic in top form -- covering topics ranging from the struggle of American immigrants to the food industry to relationships to gender inequality.', 'Ansari headlines the iconic Madison Square Garden and delivers his most hilarious and insightful stand-up yet. Filmed in front of a sold-out audience, Ansari''s latest special is an uproarious document of the comic in top form -- covering topics ranging from the struggle of American immigrants to the food industry to relationships to gender inequality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jmZKABNheJNx6etJlGTPAvmJce9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:326665'),
  ('174331907507568620', 'Aziz Ansari: Nightclub Comedian', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Aziz Ansari, Arseni Khachaturan', 'Aziz Ansari', 'Aziz Ansari, Phil Hanley', 'R', 'After another year of lockdowns, Aziz takes the stage to skewer pandemic life, quarantines, vaccine cards, celebrity side-gigs, smartphones and more.', 'After another year of lockdowns, Aziz takes the stage to skewer pandemic life, quarantines, vaccine cards, celebrity side-gigs, smartphones and more.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hgo2USQOTbiQR0HzwQQ7wuXSfCi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:926179'),
  ('897377681881010395', 'Aziz Ansari: Right Now', 2019, 'Comedy, TV Movie, Documentary', 'Spike Jonze, Autumn Durald Arkapaw', 'Aziz Ansari', 'Aziz Ansari', null, 'In a comedy special directed by Spike Jonze, Aziz Ansari shares deep personal insights and hilarious takes on wokeness, family and the social climate.', 'In a comedy special directed by Spike Jonze, Aziz Ansari shares deep personal insights and hilarious takes on wokeness, family and the social climate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5vaYOkQ3MxOnxQLeKUNXiAfZVHb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:613999'),
  ('674469258457576484', 'Aznavour by Charles', 2019, 'Documentary, Music', 'Marc di Domenico, Nathalie Nghet', 'Antoine Barraud, Marc di Domenico', 'Romain Duris, Marie Montoya, Michel Klochendler, Charles Aznavour, Pierre Roche, Lino Ventura, Evelyne Plessis, Édith Piaf', null, 'In 1948, French singer Charles Aznavour (1924-2018) receives a Paillard Bolex, his first camera. Until 1982, he will shoot hours of footage, his filmed diary. Wherever he goes, he carries his camera with him. He films his life and lives as he films: places, moments, friends, loves, misfortunes.', 'In 1948, French singer Charles Aznavour (1924-2018) receives a Paillard Bolex, his first camera. Until 1982, he will shoot hours of footage, his filmed diary. Wherever he goes, he carries his camera with him. He films his life and lives as he films: places, moments, friends, loves, misfortunes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hF2vYV8yP3Ggf9uG4MUwbHugTyl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:620039'),
  ('830327943304429192', 'Azooma', 2013, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Won Jin, Lee Ji-seung, Hwang Ki-suk', 'Lee Ji-seung', 'Jang Young-nam, Don Lee, Hwang Tae-kwang, Bae Sung-woo, Lee Jae-hee, Chu Gwi-jeong, Um Tae-goo, Do Yong-gu', null, 'A mother goes to extreme measures against her daughter''s attacker after after feeling that the local law enforcement have failed her.', 'A mother goes to extreme measures against her daughter''s attacker after after feeling that the local law enforcement have failed her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iKo9GLETQ8ekfCQChnS9XsgvJG4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:137547'),
  ('180742409593297513', 'Azor', 2021, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Gisela Zicarelli, Lucas Outeda, Ana Laura Urriza', 'Mariano Llinás, Andreas Fontana', 'Fabrizio Rongione, Stéphanie Cléau, Carmen Iriondo, Juan Trench, Ignacio Vila, Pablo Torre Nilson, Juan Pablo Geretto, Alexandre Trocki', null, 'Yvan De Wiel, a private banker from Geneva, is going to Argentina in the midst of a dictatorship to replace his partner, the object of the most worrying rumors, who disappeared overnight. Between hushed lounges, swimming pools, and gardens under surveillance, a remote duel takes place between two bankers who, despite different methods, are the accomplices of a discreet and merciless form of colonization.', 'Yvan De Wiel, a private banker from Geneva, is going to Argentina in the midst of a dictatorship to replace his partner, the object of the most worrying rumors, who disappeared overnight. Between hushed lounges, swimming pools, and gardens under surveillance, a remote duel takes place between two bankers who, despite different methods, are the accomplices of a discreet and merciless form of colonization.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qciSIhwpjS3NtzW4VcgSzxK04sG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:659954'),
  ('235216958432977818', 'Azrael', 2024, 'Action, Horror, Thriller', 'E.L. Katz, Mart Taniel, Inger Põder', 'Simon Barrett', 'Samara Weaving, Vic Carmen Sonne, Katariina Unt, Peter Christoffersen, Nathan Stewart-Jarrett, Johhan Rosenberg, Eero Milonoff, Sebastian Bull Sarning', 'R', 'In a world where no one speaks, a devout female hunts down a young woman who has escaped her imprisonment. Recaptured by its ruthless leaders, Azrael is due to be sacrificed to pacify an ancient evil deep within the surrounding wilderness.', 'In a world where no one speaks, a devout female hunts down a young woman who has escaped her imprisonment. Recaptured by its ruthless leaders, Azrael is due to be sacrificed to pacify an ancient evil deep within the surrounding wilderness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qpdFKDvJS7oLKTcBLXOaMwUESbs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1029235'),
  ('319892220646658920', 'Aztec Batman: Clash of Empires', 2025, 'Animation, Action, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Juan Jose Meza-Leon, Mike Pallotta', 'Ernie Altbacker', 'Horacio García Rojas, Álvaro Morte, Omar Chaparro, Humberto Busto, Jorge R. Gutierrez, Jesús Guzmán, José Carlos Illanes, Maya Zapata', 'R', 'In the time of the Aztec empire, tragedy strikes Yohualli Coatl when his father is murdered by Spanish conquistadors. To warn King Moctezuma and his high priest, Yoka, of imminent danger, Yohualli escapes to Tenochtitlán. There, he trains in the temple of the bat god Tzinacan with his mentor, developing equipment and weaponry to confront the Spanish invasion and avenge his father’s death. Along the way, he encounters key figures like the fierce Jaguar Woman and the conquistador Hernán Cortés.', 'In the time of the Aztec empire, tragedy strikes Yohualli Coatl when his father is murdered by Spanish conquistadors. To warn King Moctezuma and his high priest, Yoka, of imminent danger, Yohualli escapes to Tenochtitlán. There, he trains in the temple of the bat god Tzinacan with his mentor, developing equipment and weaponry to confront the Spanish invasion and avenge his father’s death. Along the way, he encounters key figures like the fierce Jaguar Woman and the conquistador Hernán Cortés.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aNkBvhwnYC9itaHDzlnJPfuZcoO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:987400'),
  ('463827448856351831', 'Aztech', 2020, 'Science Fiction, Fantasy, Horror', 'Ulises Guzmán Reyes, Leopoldo Laborde, Francisco Laresgoiti', null, 'Ximena Romo, Naian González Norvind, Sofía Espinosa, Gustavo Sánchez Parra, Elpidia Carrillo, Fernando Becerril, Michelle Betancourt, Ignacio Guadalupe', null, 'Fragments of a meteor crash in Mexico and United States. Thirteen stories in different spaces and times happen in places of collisions .', 'Fragments of a meteor crash in Mexico and United States. Thirteen stories in different spaces and times happen in places of collisions .', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2aMO15yV5tH3J5AwdA7f91cgtpu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:674025'),
  ('385775481528563776', 'Azumanga Daioh: The Very Short Movie', 2001, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Hiroshi Nishikiori, Yota Tsuruoka, Hiromi Kato', 'Hiroshi Nishikiori', 'Chieko Higuchi, Houko Kuwashima, Rie Tanaka, Tomoko Kaneda, Yuki Matsuoka, Yuu Asakawa, Sakura Nogawa, Akiko Hiramatsu', null, 'In this short movie featuring familiar characters from Azumanga Daioh, Osaka is yet again having a strange dream of Chiyo-Chan''s pigtails being posessed. As Chiyo-Chan''s pigtails bounce out of the window, who knows if young Chiyo will ever be happy again.', 'In this short movie featuring familiar characters from Azumanga Daioh, Osaka is yet again having a strange dream of Chiyo-Chan''s pigtails being posessed. As Chiyo-Chan''s pigtails bounce out of the window, who knows if young Chiyo will ever be happy again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tZNAkdZ4He4sg66RkPfIb1MK63o.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87785'),
  ('232430662793166249', 'Azumi', 2003, 'Adventure, Drama, Action, Thriller, Romance', 'Ryuhei Kitamura, Toshihide Kosaka, Takumi Furuya', 'Isao Kiriyama', 'Aya Ueto, Kenji Kohashi, Hiroki Narimiya, Takatoshi Kaneko, Yuma Ishigaki, Yasuomi Sano, Shinji Suzuki, Eita Nagayama', 'R', 'In war-torn Japan, the Tokugawa Shogun, desperate to restore peace to his people, orders the assassination of the hostile warlords. A beautiful young woman is raised from birth with nine other orphans, to become an assassin. Her name is Azumi, the ultimate assassin.', 'In war-torn Japan, the Tokugawa Shogun, desperate to restore peace to his people, orders the assassination of the hostile warlords. A beautiful young woman is raised from birth with nine other orphans, to become an assassin. Her name is Azumi, the ultimate assassin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3pnMViIDP6whWXnTBq7ibQipSyS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5889'),
  ('483179703357050973', 'Azumi 2: Death or Love', 2005, 'Action', 'Shusuke Kaneko, Taro Nishiyama, Yoshitaka Sakamoto', 'Mataichirô Yamamoto, Yoshiaki Kawajiri', 'Aya Ueto, Yuma Ishigaki, Chiaki Kuriyama, Shun Oguri, Kazuki Kitamura, Kenichi Endo, Kai Shishido, Tak Sakaguchi', 'NR', 'Young assassins Azumi and Nagara continue their mission to prevent a civil war. In their hunt for Masayuki Sanada, who is protected by both an army and a dangerous clan, they meet Ginkaku, a person who shows a remarking resemblance with former friend Nachi.', 'Young assassins Azumi and Nagara continue their mission to prevent a civil war. In their hunt for Masayuki Sanada, who is protected by both an army and a dangerous clan, they meet Ginkaku, a person who shows a remarking resemblance with former friend Nachi.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zEdtkkcAbR1StLAvbAh6vpGquiu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5890'),
  ('513512182419814776', 'Azuro', 2022, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Matthieu Rozé, Georges Lechaptois', 'Marguerite Duras, Matthieu Rozé', 'Valérie Donzelli, Yannick Choirat, Nuno Lopes, Florence Loiret Caille, Maya Sansa, Thomas Scimeca, Odilon Aubert Choirat', null, 'It’s summer, the heat is overwhelming and the weather is out of whack. A group of friends are enjoying their yearly holiday in their favorite little village, wedged between the sea and the mountains. As usual, they are bored and eat and drink a lot. They do not pay attention to the fire which progresses on the mountain nearby, nor to the world around them. But this year, a mysterious man arrives from the sea and shakes up their seemingly balanced existence...', 'It’s summer, the heat is overwhelming and the weather is out of whack. A group of friends are enjoying their yearly holiday in their favorite little village, wedged between the sea and the mountains. As usual, they are bored and eat and drink a lot. They do not pay attention to the fire which progresses on the mountain nearby, nor to the world around them. But this year, a mysterious man arrives from the sea and shakes up their seemingly balanced existence...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4ldw48KYh3bMqciNOSGu16eOG8L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:843066'),
  ('191981059620138301', 'Azzurri: Road to Wembley', 2021, 'Documentary', 'Manuele Mandolesi', null, 'Stefano Accorsi, Roberto Mancini, Marco Verratti, Ciro Immobile, Lorenzo Insigne, Gianluigi Donnarumma', null, 'A docu-film that traces the victorious ride of Mancini''s Azzurri, from the debut match to the final against England. A troupe lived with the Azzurri for a month, to bring the spectators into the lives of the players and all the members of the staff, between training sessions, matches, travels and celebrations. An adventure told through the voices of the protagonists, who confided dreams, joys, pains and hopes to the cameras. "Blue Dream, the road to Wembley" is the completion of a project started a year ago together with the FIGC, to tell the national team''s approach to the European Championships through the 4 episodes aired in the days immediately preceding the European Championship, bringing the new television language of the docu-series to one of the most important time slots of the first generalist network. "Blue Dream, the road to Wembley" is a project of the New Formats Development Department', 'A docu-film that traces the victorious ride of Mancini''s Azzurri, from the debut match to the final against England. A troupe lived with the Azzurri for a month, to bring the spectators into the lives of the players and all the members of the staff, between training sessions, matches, travels and celebrations. An adventure told through the voices of the protagonists, who confided dreams, joys, pains and hopes to the cameras. "Blue Dream, the road to Wembley" is the completion of a project started a year ago together with the FIGC, to tell the national team''s approach to the European Championships through the 4 episodes aired in the days immediately preceding the European Championship, bringing the new television language of the docu-series to one of the most important time slots of the first generalist network. "Blue Dream, the road to Wembley" is a project of the New Formats Development Department', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2MHWwQxw4dEUu69HrWDrDett2BV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:850953'),
  ('991786644076805198', 'B', 2015, 'Crime, Drama', 'David Ilundain, Ángel Amorós', 'David Ilundain, Jordi Casanovas', 'Pedro Casablanc, Manolo Solo, Eduardo Recabarren, Patxi Freytez, Enric Benavent', 'PG-13', 'July 15, 2013 Luis Barcenas - Old party treasurer was transferred from prison to National Court to testify. Previously, he had denied everything. Today he will tell the truth.', 'July 15, 2013 Luis Barcenas - Old party treasurer was transferred from prison to National Court to testify. Previously, he had denied everything. Today he will tell the truth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5omOdNsLDGvIc5lCGA5AAKzW9SJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:346352'),
  ('412157257894206044', 'B Cut', 2022, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Kim Jin-young', 'Kim Su-in', 'Kim Dong-wan, Jeon Se-hyun, Kim Byeong-ok, Choi Jae-hwan, Song Yeon-ji, Cho Seo-hoo, Cho Hyun-min', null, 'The one who tries to hide VS the one who wants to reveal A shocking scandal unfolds around the B Cut that must be revealed in order to survive! One day, a woman visits Seung-hyeon, who runs a smartphone repair and data recovery company. Actress Min-yeong, who once captivated South Korea, asks for the restoration of a B-cut, which should not be released to the world. Min-yeong''s B-cut stimulates Seung-hyeon''s curiosity, and he finds out that it will cause a huge scandal in Korea! The secret of the B-cut that someone wants to hide and that must be revealed is unlocked.', 'The one who tries to hide VS the one who wants to reveal A shocking scandal unfolds around the B Cut that must be revealed in order to survive! One day, a woman visits Seung-hyeon, who runs a smartphone repair and data recovery company. Actress Min-yeong, who once captivated South Korea, asks for the restoration of a B-cut, which should not be released to the world. Min-yeong''s B-cut stimulates Seung-hyeon''s curiosity, and he finds out that it will cause a huge scandal in Korea! The secret of the B-cut that someone wants to hide and that must be revealed is unlocked.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kvLmGVPRJBlQvsAT5AGyVlIrOj0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:930750'),
  ('247986646565681905', 'B for Busy', 2021, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Shao Yihui, Xie Zhengyu', 'Shao Yihui', 'Xu Zheng, Ma Yili, Wu Yue, Ni Hongjie, Zhou Yemang, Feng Maya, Huang Minghao, Wang Yinglu', null, 'A divorced, retired painting teacher from Shanghai falls in love with a woman who is also divorced. The involvement of his ex-wife and a student of his makes the whole thing complicated.', 'A divorced, retired painting teacher from Shanghai falls in love with a woman who is also divorced. The involvement of his ex-wife and a student of his makes the whole thing complicated.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iQKlRLw0WEkKcN3bVyu8aPjbaXp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:902478'),
  ('994077364274395048', 'B-Girl', 2009, 'Music, Crime, Drama', 'Emily Dell', 'Emily Dell', 'Julie ''Jules'' Urich, Missy Yager, Wesley Jonathan, Drew Sidora, Aimee Garcia, James Martinez, Richard Yniguez, Jenny Gago', 'PG-13', 'A young female breakdancer, Angel, moves to Los Angeles after an attack by an ex-boyfriend nearly ends her dance career forever. B-Girl follows Angel through recovery and acceptance of a new life as she busts a move into the male-centric world of underground hip hop.', 'A young female breakdancer, Angel, moves to Los Angeles after an attack by an ex-boyfriend nearly ends her dance career forever. B-Girl follows Angel through recovery and acceptance of a new life as she busts a move into the male-centric world of underground hip hop.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kgPoFMvfrvNBT0HQtqZ5vcMzT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26837'),
  ('152338894624248026', 'B-Happy', 2004, 'Drama', 'Daniel de la Vega, Gonzalo Justiniano, Andrés Garretón', 'Fernando Aragón, Sergio Gómez, Daniela Lillo', 'Manuela Martelli, Eduardo Barril, Lorene Prieto, Felipe Ríos, Ricardo Fernández, Juan Falcón, Carmen Gloria Bresky, Consuelo Edwards', null, 'A determined teenager must rely on her own wits when her fractured family abandons her.', 'A determined teenager must rely on her own wits when her fractured family abandons her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/unzckX72mjQug32eoukVFR9kJIY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:274104'),
  ('774089120410532178', 'B. Monkey', 1999, 'Romance, Crime, Drama', 'Michael Radford, Ashley Rowe', 'Michael Thomas, Michael Radford, Chloe King', 'Asia Argento, Jared Harris, Rupert Everett, Jonathan Rhys Meyers, Julie T. Wallace, Ian Hart, Tim Woodward, Bryan Pringle', 'R', 'When wistful introvert Alan Furnace meets quick-witted bombshell Beatrice, he has no idea of her secret life as "B. Monkey" -- the top thief-for-hire in London''s criminal underworld. Charmed by Furnace''s innocent and chivalrous ways, Beatrice resolves to reform. But to cash in on her first chance at real love, she must escape her former partner in crime, the ruthless Paul Neville -- and a dark past that seems to haunt her every step.', 'When wistful introvert Alan Furnace meets quick-witted bombshell Beatrice, he has no idea of her secret life as "B. Monkey" -- the top thief-for-hire in London''s criminal underworld. Charmed by Furnace''s innocent and chivalrous ways, Beatrice resolves to reform. But to cash in on her first chance at real love, she must escape her former partner in crime, the ruthless Paul Neville -- and a dark past that seems to haunt her every step.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/80bQjfpH14P5p2TDnfWUukEkM55.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2923'),
  ('816182549918322850', 'B.A. Pass', 2012, 'Drama', 'Ajay Bahl', 'Ritesh Shah', 'Shadab Kamal, Shilpa Shukla, Dibyendu Bhattacharya, Rajesh Sharma, Deepti Naval, Geeta Agrawal Sharma, Vijay Kaushik, Shikha Joshi', null, 'After losing his parents in a car accident, Mukesh stays at his Aunt''s house in Delhi. Enrolled in a good for nothing course in college he finds peace by playing chess at the local cemetery, the rest of the times he worries over ways to make a living and taking care of his sisters. ''B.A.Pass'' is a story looking at the fatal promise of a new life. When Mukesh meets Sarika ''auntie'' at a kitty party, little does he know of the city and it''s ways and means to survive. Sarika seduces Mukesh, shy and inexperienced he falls for her. What follows is a twist of destiny, a kind of story that appears in the tabloids as ''heinous acts of crime''', 'After losing his parents in a car accident, Mukesh stays at his Aunt''s house in Delhi. Enrolled in a good for nothing course in college he finds peace by playing chess at the local cemetery, the rest of the times he worries over ways to make a living and taking care of his sisters. ''B.A.Pass'' is a story looking at the fatal promise of a new life. When Mukesh meets Sarika ''auntie'' at a kitty party, little does he know of the city and it''s ways and means to survive. Sarika seduces Mukesh, shy and inexperienced he falls for her. What follows is a twist of destiny, a kind of story that appears in the tabloids as ''heinous acts of crime''', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5KiuF1VdtjFXTp7aeYsGyFcKa7O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:222951'),
  ('250278329372347644', 'B.A.P.S', 1997, 'Comedy', 'Robert Townsend, Bill Dill, Angela Barnes', 'Troy Byer', 'Halle Berry, Natalie Desselle-Reid, Martin Landau, Ian Richardson, Pierre Edwards, Anthony Johnson, Troy Byer, Luigi Amodeo', null, 'Two wannabe Black American princesses aim to marry rich men, who will pay for their world''s first combination hair salon and soul food restaurant.', 'Two wannabe Black American princesses aim to marry rich men, who will pay for their world''s first combination hair salon and soul food restaurant.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yi40NrDfdv8vX0aoWvis3CnCVWj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18423'),
  ('450443510510035210', 'B.O.B.''s Big Break', 2009, 'Animation, Adventure, Action, Comedy', 'Robert Porter', 'Robert Porter', 'Will Arnett, Hugh Laurie, Seth Rogen, Mike Mitchell, Kiefer Sutherland', 'PG', 'Dr. Cockroach comes up with a brilliant plan to break themselves out of Area 52 – but to implement the plan, he has to trick B.O.B. into thinking it’s his birthday.', 'Dr. Cockroach comes up with a brilliant plan to break themselves out of Area 52 – but to implement the plan, he has to trick B.O.B. into thinking it’s his birthday.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9HWUhtFd2QBvFNmI8nbWcv1apgs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24884'),
  ('457956850729082350', 'B.T.K.', 2008, 'Drama, Horror, Thriller', 'Michael Feifer', 'Michael Feifer', 'Kane Hodder, Amy Lyndon, Odessa Rae, Cara Sigmund, Caia Coley, Sarah Shoup, Nino Simone, Kelsey McCann', null, 'A story based on real-life serial killer Dennis L. Rader, who systematically tortured and killed his victims for over two decades and evaded the police for over 30 years, all while leading a seemingly normal life as a husband, father, security officer and church president.', 'A story based on real-life serial killer Dennis L. Rader, who systematically tortured and killed his victims for over two decades and evaded the police for over 30 years, all while leading a seemingly normal life as a husband, father, security officer and church president.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yLtPO8E2UPxjyNHeLcw7KMCRyam.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36671'),
  ('222790878702823637', 'B.T.S. (Better Than Sex)', 2002, 'Comedy, Crime, Drama', 'Su Chaobin', 'Su Chaobin', 'Michael Wong Kong-Leong, Ginny Liu, Leon Dai, Sheng Chen, Phoebe Huang, Akio Shibata, Tomohisa Kagami, Ying Wei-min', null, 'A web of connected stories on crime, sex, and love in Taiwan, including a 17 y.o. boy with a porn obsession, three hoodlums, and a self-righteous police officer.', 'A web of connected stories on crime, sex, and love in Taiwan, including a 17 y.o. boy with a porn obsession, three hoodlums, and a self-righteous police officer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o0fPd4oMIq2RA1ToPwW4WIRa1j3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:269785'),
  ('1031725135078829070', 'B&B', 2017, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Joe Ahearne, Seth Adams, Rose Harrison', 'Joe Ahearne', 'Tom Bateman, Sean Teale, Callum Woodhouse, Žilvinas Tratas, Paul McGann, Claire Rammelkamp, Alli Downing, Casper Ingram', null, 'Gay Londoners Marc and Fred plan for a weekend of mischief, baiting the Christian owner of a remote Christian B&B. Events take a deadly turn when another guest arrives, who they think might have something more sinister in mind.', 'Gay Londoners Marc and Fred plan for a weekend of mischief, baiting the Christian owner of a remote Christian B&B. Events take a deadly turn when another guest arrives, who they think might have something more sinister in mind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sYJadAZWoEalx69zRQpLBZFx4Lq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:455404'),
  ('487133168676365936', 'B&B Merry', 2022, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama, TV Movie', 'Paula Elle', 'Hayley Carr, Guy Yosub', 'Jen Lilley, Jesse Hutch, Nick Preston, Shelly Williams, Peter Louis Chouinard, Marnie Mahannah, Kate Twa, Laura Yenga', 'G', 'Tracey Wise is a renowned luxury travel blogger who is invited by Graham Cooper to a Christmas getaway in exchange for her review of his family’s small bed & breakfast, Silver Peak. Unfortunately, the humble B&B is facing tough competition from an upscale hotel resort nearby that has been stealing guests and threatening the survival of the family business.', 'Tracey Wise is a renowned luxury travel blogger who is invited by Graham Cooper to a Christmas getaway in exchange for her review of his family’s small bed & breakfast, Silver Peak. Unfortunately, the humble B&B is facing tough competition from an upscale hotel resort nearby that has been stealing guests and threatening the survival of the family business.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7WSMNERoqgtOwV1Q5xDmAiLvMeE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1029578'),
  ('918044386149617543', 'BA:BO - Miracle of Giving Fool', 2008, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Kim Jeong-kwon, Kim Tae-kyeong, Han Jun-hee', 'Kim Jeong-kwon', 'Cha Tae-hyun, Ha Ji-won, Park Hee-soon, Park Ha-seon, Park Gri-na, Lim Hyung-kook, Lee Ki-young, Sulli', null, 'Seung-ryong owns a small toast shop, who is sick from taking in briquette gas in the past after his parents died. One day, his first love comes back to Korea, and they become close. However, he finds out that his little sister is sick.', 'Seung-ryong owns a small toast shop, who is sick from taking in briquette gas in the past after his parents died. One day, his first love comes back to Korea, and they become close. However, he finds out that his little sister is sick.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xxBPduPo0K8QCZY2rgxbpl2IFEN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18526'),
  ('961185360828284325', 'Ba''al', 2008, 'Fantasy, Adventure, TV Movie, Action', 'Paul Ziller, Mahlon Todd Williams', 'Andrew Black, Paul Ziller', 'Jeremy London, Stefanie von Pfetten, Scott Hylands, Michael Kopsa, Lexa Doig, David James Lewis, Peter Benson, Elias Toufexis', 'PG-13', 'A world-renowned archaeologist must reawaken the storm god Ba''al by collecting four ancient amulets scattered around the world. As each amulet is uncovered, Ba''al''s fury threatens to destroy everything in its path with the most powerful storm mankind has ever seen.', 'A world-renowned archaeologist must reawaken the storm god Ba''al by collecting four ancient amulets scattered around the world. As each amulet is uncovered, Ba''al''s fury threatens to destroy everything in its path with the most powerful storm mankind has ever seen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y3l86vkgmRHaOxkmV7Q3LfIcuPV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17004'),
  ('1045607081201775963', 'Baabul', 2006, 'Drama, Romance, Family', 'Ravi Chopra, Barun Mukherjee, Himanshu Katiyar', null, 'Amitabh Bachchan, Rani Mukerji, Hema Malini, Salman Khan, John Abraham, Om Puri, Sarika, Aman Verma', null, 'When his only son dies in an accident, Balraaj urges his depressed daughter-in-law to marry a man who has long loved her in silence.', 'When his only son dies in an accident, Balraaj urges his depressed daughter-in-law to marry a man who has long loved her in silence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/301y5k764riqCJIgzs1OIh7d0MA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48184'),
  ('1003403193918317504', 'BaadAsssss Cinema', 2002, 'Action, Documentary', 'Isaac Julien', null, 'Larry Cohen, Tamara Dobson, Ron Finley, Pam Grier, Ed Guerrero, Isaac Hayes, Gloria Hendry, bell hooks', null, 'With archive film clips and interviews, this brief look at a frequently overlooked historical period of filmmaking acts as an introduction rather than a complete record. It features interviews with some of the genre''s biggest stars, like Fred Williamson, Pam Grier, and Richard Roundtree. Director Melvin Van Peebles discusses the historical importance of his landmark film Sweet Sweetback''s Baadasssss Song. For a contemporary perspective, the excitable Quentin Tarantino offers his spirited commentary and author/critic bell hooks provides some scholarly social analysis.', 'With archive film clips and interviews, this brief look at a frequently overlooked historical period of filmmaking acts as an introduction rather than a complete record. It features interviews with some of the genre''s biggest stars, like Fred Williamson, Pam Grier, and Richard Roundtree. Director Melvin Van Peebles discusses the historical importance of his landmark film Sweet Sweetback''s Baadasssss Song. For a contemporary perspective, the excitable Quentin Tarantino offers his spirited commentary and author/critic bell hooks provides some scholarly social analysis.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f3kNL2XdDm6HVHCxWxVkpuc7aw4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67083'),
  ('352012652816803160', 'Baadasssss!', 2004, 'Drama', 'Mario Van Peebles, Robert Primes', 'Dennis Haggerty, Mario Van Peebles', 'Mario Van Peebles, Joy Bryant, Khleo Thomas, T.K. Carter, Terry Crews, Ossie Davis, David Alan Grier, Nia Long', 'R', 'Director Mario Van Peebles chronicles the complicated production of his father Melvin''s classic 1971 film, "Sweet Sweetback''s Baadasssss Song." Playing his father in the film, Van Peebles offers an unapologetic account of Melvin''s brash and sometimes deceptive conduct on the set of the film, including questionable antics like writing bad checks, tricking a local fire department and allowing his son, Mario, to shoot racy sex scenes at the age of 11.', 'Director Mario Van Peebles chronicles the complicated production of his father Melvin''s classic 1971 film, "Sweet Sweetback''s Baadasssss Song." Playing his father in the film, Van Peebles offers an unapologetic account of Melvin''s brash and sometimes deceptive conduct on the set of the film, including questionable antics like writing bad checks, tricking a local fire department and allowing his son, Mario, to shoot racy sex scenes at the age of 11.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mMFWMlNMFPSPDbYvKpBH7baDzjp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28219'),
  ('967514121159454578', 'Baader', 2002, 'Action, Crime, Drama', 'Jutta Pohlmann, Bella Halben, Christopher Roth', 'Moritz von Uslar, Christopher Roth', 'Frank Giering, Laura Tonke, Vadim Glowna, Birge Schade, Bastian Trost, Jana Pallaske, Hinnerk Schönemann, Anna Böttcher', null, 'Andreas Baader starts out as a small-time criminal. In Berlin, he is recruited by a revolutionary cell. They plan to overthrow the state.', 'Andreas Baader starts out as a small-time criminal. In Berlin, he is recruited by a revolutionary cell. They plan to overthrow the state.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mOFAAA8IGDAr6609xFJCghv6jqa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9097'),
  ('739335026772600536', 'Baadshah', 1999, 'Action, Comedy', 'Abbas Alibhai Burmawalla, Mustan Alibhai Burmawalla, Thomas A. Xavier', 'Shyam Goel', 'Shah Rukh Khan, Twinkle Khanna, Rakhee Gulzar, Amrish Puri, Johny Lever, Sharat Saxena, Deepshika Nagpal, Sachin Khedekar', null, 'A small time detective is mistaken as a CBI agent and gets embroiled in a deadly mission to save the Chief Minister from an assassination attempt.', 'A small time detective is mistaken as a CBI agent and gets embroiled in a deadly mission to save the Chief Minister from an assassination attempt.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7r1nKEVxIlVQFSsijr3fndD1TDn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41902'),
  ('630864658832963868', 'Baadshaho', 2017, 'Action, Thriller', 'Milan Luthria, Sunita Radia', 'Rajat Arora', 'Ajay Devgn, Ileana D''Cruz, Emraan Hashmi, Esha Gupta, Vidyut Jammwal, Sanjay Mishra, Priyanshu Chatterjee, Sharad Kelkar', null, 'Emergency has been declared in India. Maharani Gitanjali from one of Rajasthan''s princely states has already lost her privy purse. Now, she fears that she will lose the last treasure chest of gold which has been forcibly taken away from her. So she asks her trusted lieutenant, Bhawani to step in and plan a heist.', 'Emergency has been declared in India. Maharani Gitanjali from one of Rajasthan''s princely states has already lost her privy purse. Now, she fears that she will lose the last treasure chest of gold which has been forcibly taken away from her. So she asks her trusted lieutenant, Bhawani to step in and plan a heist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cSeNkoe7ZC84jTa6HKdLEzUsSYW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:441894'),
  ('200833985368286229', 'Baaghi', 2016, 'Action, Thriller, Romance, Adventure', 'Sabbir Khan, Binod Pradhan', 'Sanjeev Dutta', 'Tiger Shroff, Shraddha Kapoor, Sunil Grover, Sudheer Babu, Saurav Chakrabarti, Sanjay Mishra, Shaurya Bharadwaj, Kota Srinivasa Rao', 'NR', 'Ronny is a rebellious man, who falls in love with Sia but circumstances separate them. Years later, Ronny learns that Sia is abducted by a martial arts champion, Raghav.', 'Ronny is a rebellious man, who falls in love with Sia but circumstances separate them. Years later, Ronny learns that Sia is abducted by a martial arts champion, Raghav.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4IEqNeF3PzL06Y2YKsvi4uMGJ1q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:391629'),
  ('337322751552667231', 'Baaghi 2', 2018, 'Action, Crime, Adventure, Mystery, Thriller', 'Ahmed Khan, Pratha Narang, Santhana Krishnan Ravichandran', 'Jojo Khan, Abbas Hirapurwala, Niraj Kumar Mishra', 'Tiger Shroff, Disha Patani, Manoj Bajpayee, Randeep Hooda, Darshan Kumaar, Prateik Smita Patil, Deepak Dobriyal, Aryan Prajapati', null, 'Ronny, a battle-hardened soldier, learns of the disappearance of the daughter of his former lover. His intense investigation leads him to uncover a web of crimes and a secret from the past.', 'Ronny, a battle-hardened soldier, learns of the disappearance of the daughter of his former lover. His intense investigation leads him to uncover a web of crimes and a secret from the past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nkjkHg9yCpPDM7COGCXfDtUJa2X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:496316'),
  ('1024478034819619183', 'Baaghi 3', 2020, 'Action, Adventure, Thriller', 'Ahmed Khan, Fazl Khan, Jelena Tvrdišić', 'Madhur Sharma, Farhad Samji, Sparsh Khetarpal', 'Tiger Shroff, Riteish Deshmukh, Shraddha Kapoor, Ankita Lokhande, Jameel Khoury, Jaideep Ahlawat, Vijay Varma, Jackie Shroff', null, 'A man embarks on a bloody rampage to save his kidnapped brother.', 'A man embarks on a bloody rampage to save his kidnapped brother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sykmmFSkIPkW4Y3m4tbmSTZZD3T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:594669'),
  ('1121499434959452133', 'Baaghi 4', 2025, 'Action, Romance, Thriller', 'A. Harsha, Swamy J. Gowda, Mukesh Chhabra', 'Sasi', 'Tiger Shroff, Sanjay Dutt, Harnaaz Kaur Sandhu, Sonam Bajwa, Shreyas Talpade, Saurabh Sachdeva, Upendra Limaye, Sheeba', 'NR', 'After waking up from a coma, a grieving man sets out to uncover the truth about his missing girlfriend.', 'After waking up from a coma, a grieving man sets out to uncover the truth about his missing girlfriend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u2YEFW5o2Y7RAw2K4hSA4TEXF3Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:758923'),
  ('140339386526876932', 'Baaghi: A Rebel for Love', 1990, 'Action, Drama, Romance', 'Deepak S. Shivdasani, Arvind Laad', null, 'Salman Khan, Nagma, Shakti Kapoor, Kiran Kumar, Beena Banerjee, Mohnish Behl, Asha Sachdev, Pradeep Ram Singh Rawat', null, 'Saajan is a college youth, enjoying his life, meets with Kajal the girl of his dreams at a brothel. Kajal is an innocent victim of Dhanraj, who runs this brothel. Saajan eventually falls in love with Kajal, but this love affair is not acceptable to the society, which includes his parents Mr. and Mrs. Sood. Saajan''s dad Col. Sood wants his son to join the Indian army. On the other side, this relationship of love is also not acceptable to Dhanraj, since he doesn''t want any of his brothel girls to go into normal respectable society. Trapped between both, Saajan, along with his friends, rescues his love from the brothel. But the question remains: Will Saajan''s parents accept him along with Kajal or Will Dhanraj''s evilness overcome the couple''s love?', 'Saajan is a college youth, enjoying his life, meets with Kajal the girl of his dreams at a brothel. Kajal is an innocent victim of Dhanraj, who runs this brothel. Saajan eventually falls in love with Kajal, but this love affair is not acceptable to the society, which includes his parents Mr. and Mrs. Sood. Saajan''s dad Col. Sood wants his son to join the Indian army. On the other side, this relationship of love is also not acceptable to Dhanraj, since he doesn''t want any of his brothel girls to go into normal respectable society. Trapped between both, Saajan, along with his friends, rescues his love from the brothel. But the question remains: Will Saajan''s parents accept him along with Kajal or Will Dhanraj''s evilness overcome the couple''s love?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rmKu3ZUUipA0NFjhck8cE6Lf5Hj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:161392'),
  ('748073262878233828', 'Baal', 1970, 'Drama', 'Volker Schlöndorff, Dietrich Lohmann', 'Volker Schlöndorff', 'Rainer Werner Fassbinder, Sigi Graue, Margarethe von Trotta, Günther Neutze, Hanna Schygulla, Marian Seidowsky, Irmgard Paulis, Wilmut Borell', null, 'An exploration of the cult of the genius, an anti-heroic figure who chooses to be a social outcast and live on the fringe of bourgeois morality.', 'An exploration of the cult of the genius, an anti-heroic figure who chooses to be a social outcast and live on the fringe of bourgeois morality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s0oSuSDII8oCyQr6mvEAXqwQQfo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:252767'),
  ('452863590766930982', 'Baal', 1982, 'Music, Drama, TV Movie', 'Alan Clarke', 'Bertolt Brecht', 'David Bowie, Jonathan Kent, Zoë Wanamaker, Juliet Hammond-Hill, Tracey Childs, Julian Wadham, Robert Austin, Russell Wootton', null, 'Baal is an amoral poetic genius who, after a life of debauchery, betrayal and violence, is about to cut his ties to the world and meet his doom. A high society party is where the end begins.', 'Baal is an amoral poetic genius who, after a life of debauchery, betrayal and violence, is about to cut his ties to the world and meet his doom. A high society party is where the end begins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zgEoidO6G6IPQmltu6puEdwvjYo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:145930'),
