  ('646907933850724302', 'Baazi', 1995, 'Crime, Drama, Action', 'Ashutosh Gowariker, Teja', 'Ashutosh Gowariker', 'Aamir Khan, Mamta Kulkarni, Raza Murad, Mukesh Rishi, Paresh Rawal, Kulbhushan Kharbanda, Avtar Gill, Asrani', null, 'A tough and honest police officer wages a one-man war against terrorists and a corrupt politician who have planned to assassinate the chief minister of the state.', 'A tough and honest police officer wages a one-man war against terrorists and a corrupt politician who have planned to assassinate the chief minister of the state.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ovZzl24CtM4UevTLHMyJO9svRXB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:159657'),
  ('350881372625012935', 'Baazigar', 1993, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Abbas Alibhai Burmawalla, Mustan Alibhai Burmawalla, Dinkar Kapur', null, 'Shah Rukh Khan, Kajol, Shilpa Shetty Kundra, Rakhee Gulzar, Dalip Tahil, Ananth Narayan Mahadevan, Dinesh Hingoo, Johny Lever', 'PG-13', 'A young man with a vendetta against a business tycoon seduces and kills his eldest daughter and then proceeds to his younger daughter but she begins to suspect her new lover''s ulterior motive.', 'A young man with a vendetta against a business tycoon seduces and kills his eldest daughter and then proceeds to his younger daughter but she begins to suspect her new lover''s ulterior motive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ndQQ2bTV0JLSRxUBchE4eD3qhDb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19657'),
  ('1131567025190393713', 'Bab''Aziz', 2006, 'Drama', 'Nacer Khemir, Mahmoud Kalari', 'Nacer Khemir, Tonino Guerra', 'Parviz Shahinkhou, Golshifteh Farahani, Maryam Hamid, Hossein Panahi, Nessim Khaloul, Mohamed Grayaâ, Jahansooz Fooladi', null, 'The story of a blind dervish named Bab''Aziz and his spirited granddaughter, Ishtar. Together they wander the desert in search of a great reunion of dervishes that takes place just once every thirty years. With faith as their only guide, the two journey for days through the expansive, barren landscape.', 'The story of a blind dervish named Bab''Aziz and his spirited granddaughter, Ishtar. Together they wander the desert in search of a great reunion of dervishes that takes place just once every thirty years. With faith as their only guide, the two journey for days through the expansive, barren landscape.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sdCuifwyHNRG1tmEdPOinCMqC22.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45882'),
  ('997105393293795580', 'Baba', 2002, 'Drama, Action, Fantasy', 'Suresh Krissna, Chota K. Naidu, A. R. Rajasekar', 'Rajinikanth', 'Rajinikanth, Goundamani, Manisha Koirala, M. N. Nambiar, Amrish Puri, Vijayakumar, Delhi Ganesh, Vasu Vikram', null, 'Baba is an atheist who always questions the existence of a higher power. But when a turn of events bestows him with divine powers, he uses the opportunity to help other people.', 'Baba is an atheist who always questions the existence of a higher power. But when a turn of events bestows him with divine powers, he uses the opportunity to help other people.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4r5Kne06Q20OuzEzV1oGlVv8mEv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66243'),
  ('696929303965535107', 'Baba Parası', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Selçuk Aydemir', null, 'Ahmet Kural, Murat Cemcir, Devrim Yakut, Rasim Öztekin, Yağmur Tanrısevsin, Özgür Emre Yıldırım, Deniz Barut, Giray Altınok', null, 'A group of siblings that share nothing but a father come together after the patriarch''s death to compete for his fortune. He left a save for his children, but took the password to the grave with him.', 'A group of siblings that share nothing but a father come together after the patriarch''s death to compete for his fortune. He left a save for his children, but took the password to the grave with him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/emy9RWQ4YbpBqfxY5dINQdzJeKy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:657247'),
  ('926687084505197681', 'Baba Yaga', 1973, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Corrado Farina, Aiace Parolin', 'Corrado Farina', 'Carroll Baker, George Eastman, Isabelle De Funès, Ely Galleani, Daniela Balzaretti, Mario Mattia Giorgetti, Sergio Masieri, Angela Covello', null, 'Carroll Baker stars in this psychedelic shocker about a mysterious witch who casts a spell over attractive, youthful fashion photographer Valentina Rosselli. Thrust into a world of sadism, Valentina must figure out whether the torture being inflicted on her is because of one woman''s twisted agenda … or a curse known as Baba Yaga.', 'Carroll Baker stars in this psychedelic shocker about a mysterious witch who casts a spell over attractive, youthful fashion photographer Valentina Rosselli. Thrust into a world of sadism, Valentina must figure out whether the torture being inflicted on her is because of one woman''s twisted agenda … or a curse known as Baba Yaga.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9jXaty7Z7WpZBFFb1zB5ztI7IN9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55689'),
  ('808281750190479566', 'Baba Yaga: Terror of the Dark Forest', 2020, 'Horror', 'Anton Zenkovich, Svyatoslav Podgaevsky', 'Ivan Kapitonov, Svyatoslav Podgaevsky, Nataliya Dubovaya', 'Oleg Chugunov, Glafira Golubeva, Artem Zhigulin, Igor Khripunov, Svetlana Ustinova, Aleksey Rozin, Maryana Spivak, Marta Timofeeva', null, 'The young family who moved to a new apartment on the outskirts of the city. The nanny hired by them for the newborn daughter quickly gained confidence. However, the older boy, Egor, talks about the frightening behavior of a woman, but his parents do not believe him. The surveillance cameras installed by the father for comfort only confirm everything is in order. Then one day, Egor, returning home, finds no trace of either the nanny or the little sister, and the parents are in a strange trance and do not even remember that they had a daughter. Then Egor, together with his friends, goes in search, during which it turns out that the nanny is an ancient Slavic demon, popularly known as Baba Yaga.', 'The young family who moved to a new apartment on the outskirts of the city. The nanny hired by them for the newborn daughter quickly gained confidence. However, the older boy, Egor, talks about the frightening behavior of a woman, but his parents do not believe him. The surveillance cameras installed by the father for comfort only confirm everything is in order. Then one day, Egor, returning home, finds no trace of either the nanny or the little sister, and the parents are in a strange trance and do not even remember that they had a daughter. Then Egor, together with his friends, goes in search, during which it turns out that the nanny is an ancient Slavic demon, popularly known as Baba Yaga.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sQF8UV3LrYtELqcJluckTOl9q4D.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:575088'),
  ('190292777694798937', 'Babamın Ceketi', 2018, 'Family, Comedy', 'Müfit Can Saçıntı', 'Müfit Can Saçıntı', 'Müfit Can Saçıntı, Mert Turak, Erkan Can, Ayşen Gruda, Uğur Demirpehlivan, Ünal Yeter, Elif Nur Kerkük, Suat Sungur', null, 'Facing pressure to marry immediately, an unemployed man must find a way to pay for a wedding by any means necessary.', 'Facing pressure to marry immediately, an unemployed man must find a way to pay for a wedding by any means necessary.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eHmHGv3qTrkzAh3Ms7biPn5m6SY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:542008'),
  ('673335161376367896', 'Babar and Father Christmas', 1986, 'Animation, Family', 'Gerry Capelle', 'Laurent de Brunhoff, Merilyn Read, Gerry Capelle', 'Laurent de Brunhoff, James Bradford, Noel Counsil, Les Lye', null, 'After writing to Santa, Arthur, Pom, Flora and Alexander carefully monitor the mailbox, but in vain. Finding their excellent idea of wanting to bring Santa home, Babar sets out on a long journey to find him and convince him to include elephant country on his gift giving tour.', 'After writing to Santa, Arthur, Pom, Flora and Alexander carefully monitor the mailbox, but in vain. Finding their excellent idea of wanting to bring Santa home, Babar sets out on a long journey to find him and convince him to include elephant country on his gift giving tour.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hZvldD6HQfmJlpJ5fNOBujNzEV2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:137231'),
  ('868175836580266574', 'Babar: King of the Elephants', 1999, 'Family, Animation', 'Raymond Jafelice', 'Peter Sauder, Raymond Jafelice', 'Philip Williams, Wayne Robson, Ellen-Ray Hennessy, Kristin Fairlie, Dan Lett, Chris Wiggins, Jennifer Martini, Kyle Fairlie', 'G', 'Babar is a young elephant in the great forest. Whilst out with his mother a hunter kills his mother and he flees to escape the same fate. He eventually finds himself in a human city and experiences the many differences between city and forest life. Treated as an outsider he is taken in by an elderly woman, dressed in fancy suits, taught to write and count and is brought up in human culture.', 'Babar is a young elephant in the great forest. Whilst out with his mother a hunter kills his mother and he flees to escape the same fate. He eventually finds himself in a human city and experiences the many differences between city and forest life. Treated as an outsider he is taken in by an elderly woman, dressed in fancy suits, taught to write and count and is brought up in human culture.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/srD54CdOctl9WWQHgmeWyRU7C0l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18068'),
  ('1101593787673058878', 'Babar: The Movie', 1989, 'Adventure, Animation, Family, Fantasy', 'Alan Bunce', 'Peter Sauder, J.D. Smith, John de Klein', 'Gordon Pinsent, Elizabeth Hanna, Lisa Yamanaka, Marsha Moreau, Bobby Becken, Amos Crawley, Gavin Magrath, Sarah Polley', 'G', 'Children''s book authors Jean and Laurent de Brunhoff''s most beloved elephant comes to the big screen in this animated family tale. Elephant monarch King Babar tells the tale, that unfolds via flashback, of how a much-younger Barbar and his girlfriend Celeste save her village from the pugnacious rhinoceroses that have come to raid it.', 'Children''s book authors Jean and Laurent de Brunhoff''s most beloved elephant comes to the big screen in this animated family tale. Elephant monarch King Babar tells the tale, that unfolds via flashback, of how a much-younger Barbar and his girlfriend Celeste save her village from the pugnacious rhinoceroses that have come to raid it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iKc7iG1vfD22ciOQZDlSqJol5Ir.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35927'),
  ('516924563657909645', 'Babbo Natale non viene da Nord', 2015, 'Comedy', 'Maurizio Casagrande, Antonello Emidi', 'Maurizio Casagrande, Francesco Velonà', 'Maurizio Casagrande, Giampaolo Morelli, Eva Grimaldi, Angelo Orlando, Francesca Tomassoni, Annalisa Scarrone, Nino Frassica, Massimiliano Gallo', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aft7ElDtQvTdKQnkGzjo2Gck9hn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:370085'),
  ('378316790566638108', 'Babe', 1995, 'Fantasy, Drama, Comedy, Family', 'Andrew Lesnie, Chris Noonan, P.J. Voeten', 'Chris Noonan, George Miller', 'Christine Cavanaugh, Miriam Margolyes, Danny Mann, Hugo Weaving, Miriam Flynn, James Cromwell, Magda Szubanski, Russi Taylor', 'G', 'Babe is a little pig who doesn''t quite know his place in the world. With a bunch of odd friends, like Ferdinand the duck who thinks he is a rooster and Fly the dog he calls mum, Babe realises that he has the makings to become the greatest sheep pig of all time, and Farmer Hoggett knows it. With the help of the sheep dogs, Babe learns that a pig can be anything that he wants to be.', 'Babe is a little pig who doesn''t quite know his place in the world. With a bunch of odd friends, like Ferdinand the duck who thinks he is a rooster and Fly the dog he calls mum, Babe realises that he has the makings to become the greatest sheep pig of all time, and Farmer Hoggett knows it. With the help of the sheep dogs, Babe learns that a pig can be anything that he wants to be.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zKuQMtnbVTz9DsOnOJmlW71v4qH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9598'),
  ('907980113176561293', 'Babe Watch', 1996, 'Comedy', 'Rick Sloane, Robert Hayes', 'Rick Sloane', 'Tane McClure, Raelyn Saalman, Ashlie Rhey, Steven Todd Lange, Christopher Tichy, Kelli Hoffman, Karen Knotts, Honey Lauren', null, 'A lifeguard academy becomes a breeding ground for cat fights, shenanigans and pranks aplenty in this send up of the bouncy beach drama Baywatch.', 'A lifeguard academy becomes a breeding ground for cat fights, shenanigans and pranks aplenty in this send up of the bouncy beach drama Baywatch.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cbhug1d8yb5bEu75WxAXmg4jiHx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:252066'),
  ('442673261601103', 'Babe: Pig in the City', 1998, 'Family, Adventure, Comedy, Drama', 'George Miller, Andrew Lesnie, P.J. Voeten', 'George Miller, Mark Lamprell, Judy Morris', 'E. G. Daily, Magda Szubanski, James Cromwell, Mickey Rooney, Mary Stein, Danny Mann, Glenne Headly, Steven Wright', 'G', 'Babe, fresh from his victory in the sheepherding contest, returns to Farmer Hoggett''s farm, but after Farmer Hoggett is injured and unable to work, Babe has to go to the big city to save the farm.', 'Babe, fresh from his victory in the sheepherding contest, returns to Farmer Hoggett''s farm, but after Farmer Hoggett is injured and unable to work, Babe has to go to the big city to save the farm.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/glO6LcTWUZcbxWT2SB4eRDnFSsP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9447'),
  ('288872803691703648', 'Babel', 2006, 'Drama', 'Rodrigo Prieto, Alejandro González Iñárritu', 'Guillermo Arriaga', 'Brad Pitt, Rinko Kikuchi, Adriana Barraza, Cate Blanchett, Satoshi Nikaido, Said Tarchani, Boubker Ait El Caid, Gael García Bernal', 'R', 'Tragedy strikes a married couple vacationing in the Moroccan desert, which jumpstarts an interlocking story involving four different families.', 'Tragedy strikes a married couple vacationing in the Moroccan desert, which jumpstarts an interlocking story involving four different families.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bZByZbvU7u14WjoUJERqCRW9saN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1164'),
  ('910003283690434357', 'Babenco: Tell Me When I Die', 2020, 'Documentary', 'Bárbara Paz, Stefan Ciupek, Carolina Costa', 'Maria Camargo, Bárbara Paz', 'Héctor Babenco, Willem Dafoe, Bárbara Paz, Ana Simonsen, Pedro Simonsen, Chen Lin, Fernanda Montenegro, Paulo José', null, 'Besieged by cancer and nearing the end, the genius Argentine-Brazilian filmmaker Héctor Babenco (1946-2016) asks Bárbara Paz, his wife, for one last wish: to be the protagonist of his own death.', 'Besieged by cancer and nearing the end, the genius Argentine-Brazilian filmmaker Héctor Babenco (1946-2016) asks Bárbara Paz, his wife, for one last wish: to be the protagonist of his own death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a8jcRvQZyCbXLaaYUmBZaI3rbVB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:618386'),
  ('495059996018284515', 'Babes', 2024, 'Comedy', 'Pamela Adlon, Jeffrey Kim, Dan Taggatz', 'Ilana Glazer, Josh Rabinowitz', 'Ilana Glazer, Michelle Buteau, John Carroll Lynch, Oliver Platt, Sandra Bernhard, Stephan James, Hasan Minhaj, Keith Lucas', 'R', 'After getting pregnant from a one-night stand, a single woman leans on her married best friend and mother of two to guide her through gestation and beyond.', 'After getting pregnant from a one-night stand, a single woman leans on her married best friend and mother of two to guide her through gestation and beyond.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1Cg4G1iQpisGXmWqns5uo4I6fPk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:999582'),
  ('428849938685063558', 'Babes in Arms', 1939, 'Comedy, Music', 'Busby Berkeley, Ray June, William Ryan', 'Jack McGowan, Kay Van Riper', 'Mickey Rooney, Judy Garland, Charles Winninger, Guy Kibbee, June Preisser, Margaret Hamilton, Grace Hayes, Betty Jaynes', 'NR', 'Mickey Moran, son of two vaudeville veterans, decides to put up his own vaudeville show with his girlfriend Patsy Barton. But child actress Rosalie wants to make a comeback and replace Patsy both professionally and as Mickey''s girl.', 'Mickey Moran, son of two vaudeville veterans, decides to put up his own vaudeville show with his girlfriend Patsy Barton. But child actress Rosalie wants to make a comeback and replace Patsy both professionally and as Mickey''s girl.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hCE0OHNjMI2LNpoqJxDX4Otb06X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32610'),
  ('615355047070735839', 'Babes in the Woods', 1932, 'Animation', 'Burt Gillett', null, 'Lucille La Verne, Pinto Colvig, Mary Moder, Purv Pullen, Toby Wing', 'NR', 'Two Dutch children stumble on a clearing in the woods where gnomes are going about their business. The gnomes are friendly to the children. A witch comes and takes them away on her broom to her gingerbread house, where she turns nasty on them, turning the boy into a spider, her yowling cat to stone, and tries to turn the girl into a rat when a gnome''s arrow stops her. While the gnomes are fighting the witch, Hansel and Gretl free the other children who have been imprisoned and transformed by the witch.', 'Two Dutch children stumble on a clearing in the woods where gnomes are going about their business. The gnomes are friendly to the children. A witch comes and takes them away on her broom to her gingerbread house, where she turns nasty on them, turning the boy into a spider, her yowling cat to stone, and tries to turn the girl into a rat when a gnome''s arrow stops her. While the gnomes are fighting the witch, Hansel and Gretl free the other children who have been imprisoned and transformed by the witch.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v6GjctO6e4MjT082EZLfiOIR1Fj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80928'),
  ('714523371911327975', 'Babes in Toyland', 1934, 'Fantasy, Comedy, Family', 'Gus Meins, Charley Rogers, Kenneth Peach', 'Frank Butler, Nick Grindé', 'Stan Laurel, Oliver Hardy, Charlotte Henry, Henry Brandon, Felix Knight, Virginia Karns, Florence Roberts, Richard Alexander', 'NR', 'Ollie Dee and Stannie Dum try to borrow money from their employer, the toymaker, to pay off the mortgage on Mother Peep''s shoe and keep it and Little Bo Peep from the clutches of the evil Barnaby. When that fails, they trick Barnaby, enraging him.', 'Ollie Dee and Stannie Dum try to borrow money from their employer, the toymaker, to pay off the mortgage on Mother Peep''s shoe and keep it and Little Bo Peep from the clutches of the evil Barnaby. When that fails, they trick Barnaby, enraging him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iN8B54ymwiLJmnbz5iluqbsit1e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25898'),
  ('7124354806883822', 'Babes in Toyland', 1961, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Family, Music', 'Austen Jewell, Jack Donohue', 'Ward Kimball, Lowell S. Hawley, Joe Rinaldi', 'Ray Bolger, Tommy Sands, Annette Funicello, Ed Wynn, Tommy Kirk, Kevin Corcoran, Henry Calvin, Gene Sheldon', 'G', 'All roads lead to magical, merry Toyland as Mary Contrary and Tom Piper prepare for their wedding! But villainous Barnaby wants Mary for himself, so he kidnaps Tom, setting off a series of comic chases, searches, and double-crosses! The "March Of The Wooden Soldiers" helps put Barnaby in his place, and ensures a "happily ever after" for Tom and Mary!', 'All roads lead to magical, merry Toyland as Mary Contrary and Tom Piper prepare for their wedding! But villainous Barnaby wants Mary for himself, so he kidnaps Tom, setting off a series of comic chases, searches, and double-crosses! The "March Of The Wooden Soldiers" helps put Barnaby in his place, and ensures a "happily ever after" for Tom and Mary!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pPNVXVQTCgdUiIiyxxYlTTqkgiZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32611'),
  ('916602750158012248', 'Babes in Toyland', 1986, 'Family, Fantasy, TV Movie, Adventure', 'Clive Donner, Bert Batt, Bert Batt', 'Paul Zindel', 'Drew Barrymore, Richard Mulligan, Eileen Brennan, Keanu Reeves, Pat Morita, Jill Schoelen, Googy Gress, Walter Buschhoff', 'G', '11-year-old Lisa has no time for toys; she''s too busy taking care of her siblings and cooking for her mother. During the Christmas Eve blizzard, Lisa travels to Toyland in Wizard of Oz-like fashion and arrives just in time for a wedding. Young Mary Contrary is about to marry mean, old Barnaby Barnacle, despite the fact that she loves Jack Be Nimble. Lisa tries to stop this terrible wedding and, together with her new friends, discovers that Barnaby wants to take over Toyland. Lisa, Mary, Jack, and Georgie Porgie ask the Toymaster for help, but he can''t help them as long as Lisa doesn''t truly believe in toys.', '11-year-old Lisa has no time for toys; she''s too busy taking care of her siblings and cooking for her mother. During the Christmas Eve blizzard, Lisa travels to Toyland in Wizard of Oz-like fashion and arrives just in time for a wedding. Young Mary Contrary is about to marry mean, old Barnaby Barnacle, despite the fact that she loves Jack Be Nimble. Lisa tries to stop this terrible wedding and, together with her new friends, discovers that Barnaby wants to take over Toyland. Lisa, Mary, Jack, and Georgie Porgie ask the Toymaster for help, but he can''t help them as long as Lisa doesn''t truly believe in toys.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mTg72oYoK18oV1uuuZGW2JI752x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26984'),
  ('887354614145851710', 'Babes in Toyland', 1997, 'Animation, Family, Fantasy', 'Charles Grosvenor, Toby Bluth, Paul Sabella', 'John Loy', 'Charles Nelson Reilly, Raphael Sbarge, Cathy Cavadini, Joseph Ashton, Lacey Chabert, Christopher Plummer, Jim Belushi, Bronson Pinchot', 'G', 'With just days to go before presents are scheduled for Christmas delivery, Toyland is buzzing with activity. However, curmudgeonly creditor Barnaby Crookedman is hatching a devious scheme to destroy Toyland – meaning no presents for the world''s children! Siblings Jack and Jill, alongside toy factory workers Tom and Mary, rush into action to stop the villain, receiving some assistance from the likes of Humpty Dumpty and even Santa Claus himself.', 'With just days to go before presents are scheduled for Christmas delivery, Toyland is buzzing with activity. However, curmudgeonly creditor Barnaby Crookedman is hatching a devious scheme to destroy Toyland – meaning no presents for the world''s children! Siblings Jack and Jill, alongside toy factory workers Tom and Mary, rush into action to stop the villain, receiving some assistance from the likes of Humpty Dumpty and even Santa Claus himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pkzVNVm0MG4mJ1bJe0rFxz3rzDd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72850'),
  ('85910149804821972', 'Babes on Broadway', 1941, 'Comedy, Music, Romance', 'Busby Berkeley, Lester White', 'Fred F. Finklehoffe, Elaine Ryan', 'Mickey Rooney, Judy Garland, Fay Bainter, Virginia Weidler, Ray McDonald, Richard Quine, Donald Meek, Alexander Woollcott', null, 'Penny Morris and Tommy Williams are both starstruck young teens but nobody seems to give them any chance to perform. Instead, they decide to put up their own show to collect money for a summer camp for the kids.', 'Penny Morris and Tommy Williams are both starstruck young teens but nobody seems to give them any chance to perform. Instead, they decide to put up their own show to collect money for a summer camp for the kids.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vN1D8TJm93jYtYZQp8p6Rd7HpDG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43790'),
  ('1099829617552237439', 'Babette Goes to War', 1959, 'Comedy, War', 'Christian-Jaque, Armand Thirard, Serge Vallin', 'Michel Audiard', 'Brigitte Bardot, Jacques Charrier, Ronald Howard, Michael Cramer, Hannes Messemer, René Havard, Mona Goya, Viviane Gosset', null, 'Comedy about a naive French country girl in London who helps the war effort by parachuting into German-occupied France to help kidnap an important German general. She bungles through to a heroic finish of plot and counter-plot.', 'Comedy about a naive French country girl in London who helps the war effort by parachuting into German-occupied France to help kidnap an important German general. She bungles through to a heroic finish of plot and counter-plot.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xQpq0EopAjrAmkeX7Bo3MCKRtz6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56499'),
  ('643381369372387807', 'Babette''s Feast', 1987, 'Drama, History, Comedy', 'Gabriel Axel, Henning Kristiansen, Tom Hedegaard', 'Gabriel Axel, Annemarie Aaes', 'Stéphane Audran, Bodil Kjer, Birgitte Federspiel, Jarl Kulle, Jean-Philippe Lafont, Bibi Andersson, Ghita Nørby, Asta Esper Hagen Andersen', 'G', 'A French housekeeper with a mysterious past brings quiet revolution in the form of one exquisite meal to a circle of starkly pious villagers in late 19th century Denmark.', 'A French housekeeper with a mysterious past brings quiet revolution in the form of one exquisite meal to a circle of starkly pious villagers in late 19th century Denmark.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3ibptSbnAHd0SUBnOKapNZQBpCl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11832'),
  ('271912426117419141', 'Babies', 2010, 'Documentary', 'Thomas Balmès', 'Thomas Balmès, Alain Chabat', 'Hattie, Ponijao, Mari, Bayar', 'PG', 'A non-narrated documentary following the lovesome lives of four infants from birth to their first birthday. The babies featured are two from rural areas: Ponijao from Opuwo, Namibia, and Bayar from Bayanchandmani, Mongolia, as well as two from urban areas: Mari from Tokyo, Japan, and Hattie from San Francisco, USA.', 'A non-narrated documentary following the lovesome lives of four infants from birth to their first birthday. The babies featured are two from rural areas: Ponijao from Opuwo, Namibia, and Bayar from Bayanchandmani, Mongolia, as well as two from urban areas: Mari from Tokyo, Japan, and Hattie from San Francisco, USA.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zfXmRDjbMewZWAIGfKwMG5xjxzj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44737'),
  ('807933450594665064', 'Babies Don''t Come with Instructions', 2024, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Marina Seresesky, Rosa Estévez', 'Marta Sánchez, Irene Niubó', 'Paco León, Maia Zaitegi, Silvia Alonso, Malcolm Sitté, Yailene Sierra, Amber Shana Williams, Gorka Aguinagalde, Philipp Boos', null, 'Leo is a single, womanizing guy who lives day to day in a tiny beach town in the Canary Islands. One day one of his old flings, Julia, reappears to leave a baby of a few months in his arms and she disappears at the next morning.', 'Leo is a single, womanizing guy who lives day to day in a tiny beach town in the Canary Islands. One day one of his old flings, Julia, reappears to leave a baby of a few months in his arms and she disappears at the next morning.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2Lq2meSVsGvfFOh89iWTcA76wST.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1238200'),
  ('753275052417035117', 'Babies Galore', 1956, 'Comedy', 'Paul Mesnier', 'Marcel Franck', 'Jane Sourza, Raymond Souplex, Louis de Funès, Jean Carmet, Andrée Servilanges, Andréa Parisy, Marthe Alycia, Florence Blot', null, 'Stéphane Petitbourgeois is having trouble with his son-in-law Hubert, who has an extra child every year and is expecting his ninth, making thirteen people in the same apartment. However, a competition promises twenty million to the youngest grandfather of twelve grandchildren. Stéphane begins to encourage Hubert. But Pat became sterile from that day on. Finally, after two years, a child is announced. In fact, triplets were born, and after a few twists and turns, Stéphane became the youngest grandfather of twelve grandchildren.', 'Stéphane Petitbourgeois is having trouble with his son-in-law Hubert, who has an extra child every year and is expecting his ninth, making thirteen people in the same apartment. However, a competition promises twenty million to the youngest grandfather of twelve grandchildren. Stéphane begins to encourage Hubert. But Pat became sterile from that day on. Finally, after two years, a child is announced. In fact, triplets were born, and after a few twists and turns, Stéphane became the youngest grandfather of twelve grandchildren.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6GVshr8HxCGfyhrJwdG07EkWQ0D.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:95216'),
  ('454855925697523542', 'Babilônia 2000', 2001, 'Documentary', 'Eduardo Coutinho', null, 'Benedita da Silva, Eduardo Coutinho, Jorge Dos Santos', null, 'Documentary on poor people living in a slum in Rio de Janeiro, on the occasion of New Year''s Eve of 1999.', 'Documentary on poor people living in a slum in Rio de Janeiro, on the occasion of New Year''s Eve of 1999.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yzkuRcozZMDGFGYPt9ShzQ4uCnQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:254984'),
  ('826388899164449250', 'Babine', 2008, 'Fantasy, Drama', 'Luc Picard, Jérôme Sabourin', 'Fred Pellerin', 'Antoine Bertrand, Marie Brassard, René Richard Cyr, Maude Laurendeau, Alexis Martin, Vincent-Guillaume Otis, Marie-Chantal Perron, Luc Picard', null, 'The adventures of Babine, the son of a witch and a village pariah, as he ventures forth into the world and narrowly evades death.', 'The adventures of Babine, the son of a witch and a village pariah, as he ventures forth into the world and narrowly evades death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tAhL01GVDYkrBLSXPYk3owkreas.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18380'),
  ('665746851196295693', 'Babo: The Haftbefehl Story', 2025, 'Documentary, Music', 'Wesley Salamone, Sinan Sevinç, Juan Moreno', null, 'Aykut Anhan, Nina Anhan, Xatar, Cem Anhan, Aytac Anhan, Niko Hüls, Jan Delay, Peter Fox', 'R', 'Personal interviews with Haftbefehl and those closest to him reveal the story behind the German rap icon as he takes a brutally honest look at his life.', 'Personal interviews with Haftbefehl and those closest to him reveal the story behind the German rap icon as he takes a brutally honest look at his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nFoKuQj5O4XJ8t0O0pQ4TJ5WR5G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1557993'),
  ('238537033168298879', 'Babumoshai Bandookbaaz', 2017, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Kushan Nandy, Vishal Vittal, Sanjay Chouhan', 'Ghalib Asad Bhopali', 'Nawazuddin Siddiqui, Bidita Bag, Shraddha Das, Murali Sharma, Divya Dutta', null, 'Two contract killer from Uttar Pradesh, Babu Bihari and Banke Bihari who are often paid to bump off the same game, cross each other''s path and end up fighting with each other.', 'Two contract killer from Uttar Pradesh, Babu Bihari and Banke Bihari who are often paid to bump off the same game, cross each other''s path and end up fighting with each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nmqyewAS2fbpXUKKEl5VehuxdfA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:461809'),
  ('715044245431011214', 'Baby', 2015, 'Action, Thriller', 'Neeraj Pandey, Raghav Jairath, Suganndha Mehrotra', 'Neeraj Pandey', 'Akshay Kumar, Anupam Kher, Kay Kay Menon, Rana Daggubati, Danny Denzongpa, Taapsee Pannu, Madhurima Tuli, Mikaal Zulfiqar', null, 'A nascent elite team of the Indian intelligence system perpetually strives to detect and eliminate terrorists and their plots. Officer Ajay leads his team to destroy one such potentially lethal ploy in their biggest operation yet.', 'A nascent elite team of the Indian intelligence system perpetually strives to detect and eliminate terrorists and their plots. Officer Ajay leads his team to destroy one such potentially lethal ploy in their biggest operation yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5yezGgo37qmd6kDknZKFzbhT19b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:314389'),
  ('352418228743229684', 'Baby', 2018, 'Drama', 'Liu Jie, Florian Zinke', 'Liu Jie', 'Yang Mi, Guo Jingfei, Lee Hong-chi', null, 'When a woman who was abandoned at birth because of a genetic disorder sees a child facing the same fate, she finds herself trying to persuade their parents to reconsider and goes to extreme lengths to save the child.', 'When a woman who was abandoned at birth because of a genetic disorder sees a child facing the same fate, she finds herself trying to persuade their parents to reconsider and goes to extreme lengths to save the child.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gcsssxtfPXXvwYoL5rq4mOnfdZD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:542630'),
  ('1005898087236792803', 'Baby', 2020, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Josep M. Civit, Juanma Bajo Ulloa, Carlos Rosal Fernández', 'Elisa Marinas, Juanma Bajo Ulloa', 'Rosie Day, Harriet Sansom Harris, Natalia Tena, Charo López, Mafalda Carbonell, Carmen San Esteban, Susana Soleto, Natalia Ruiz', null, 'A young drug addict who has lost touch with her rich family hits rock bottom when she sells her new-born baby to child traffickers. She soon regrets her decision and finds the courage and strength to get him back. To do so, she must follow a trail into the woods and find an eerie house where the old lady she met, her albino servant and a girl with a strange gait, all live together. Nothing could have prepared her for the horror she is about to discover.', 'A young drug addict who has lost touch with her rich family hits rock bottom when she sells her new-born baby to child traffickers. She soon regrets her decision and finds the courage and strength to get him back. To do so, she must follow a trail into the woods and find an eerie house where the old lady she met, her albino servant and a girl with a strange gait, all live together. Nothing could have prepared her for the horror she is about to discover.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ala49VxcJmyDdNOCNg9PWfrxTWu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:751496'),
  ('102078866180796928', 'Baby', 2025, 'Drama, Romance', 'Marcelo Caetano, Joana Luz, Pedro Sotero', 'Marcelo Caetano, Gabriel Domingues', 'João Pedro Mariano, Ricardo Teodoro, Ana Flavia Cavalcanti, Bruna Linzmeyer, Luiz Bertazzo, Marcelo Várzea, Patrick Coelho, Kyra Reis', 'NR', 'After being released from a juvenile detention center, Wellington finds himself alone and adrift on the streets of São Paulo, without any contact from his parents and lacking the resources to rebuild his life. During a visit to a porn theater, he encounters Ronaldo, a mature man, who teaches him new ways of surviving. Gradually, their relationship turns into a conflicting passion, oscillating between exploitation and protection, jealousy and complicity.', 'After being released from a juvenile detention center, Wellington finds himself alone and adrift on the streets of São Paulo, without any contact from his parents and lacking the resources to rebuild his life. During a visit to a porn theater, he encounters Ronaldo, a mature man, who teaches him new ways of surviving. Gradually, their relationship turns into a conflicting passion, oscillating between exploitation and protection, jealousy and complicity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2vOI8fX71B6QP4teu50Ml5DnKBg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1274746'),
  ('443319452336503997', 'Baby and Me', 2008, 'Comedy, Family', 'Kim Jin-young', 'Kim Jin-young, Lee Sung-min', 'Jang Keun-suk, Song Ha-yoon, Moon Mason, Ko Kyu-pil, Lee Moon-sik, Oh Kwang-rok, Jeong Gyu-su, Jang Jung-hee', null, 'A rebellious high school student sees his life take a strange turn when he goes to the grocery store and someone leaves a baby in his shopping cart, along with a note claiming he''s the father.', 'A rebellious high school student sees his life take a strange turn when he goes to the grocery store and someone leaves a baby in his shopping cart, along with a note claiming he''s the father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6JWyPBk0R3DA3QzIWtutYxdabPM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54330'),
  ('1086847182441633072', 'Baby Assassins', 2021, 'Action, Drama, Comedy, Mystery, Crime', 'Yugo Sakamoto, Kensuke Sonomura', 'Yugo Sakamoto', 'Akari Takaishi, Saori Izawa, Mone Akitani, Yasukaze Motomiya, Satoshi Uekiya, Nagiko Tsuji, Masanori Mimoto, Yukina Fukushima', null, 'Two high school girls who are about to graduate also happen to be highly-skilled assassins. When the organization they work for orders them to share a room, their relationship quickly sours. But when they become targets of the yakuza, the girls realize they''ll have to work together to survive.', 'Two high school girls who are about to graduate also happen to be highly-skilled assassins. When the organization they work for orders them to share a room, their relationship quickly sours. But when they become targets of the yakuza, the girls realize they''ll have to work together to survive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jiJbHtaJTf41T7fZhN5Lm7e7nMd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:847143'),
  ('988640704462785994', 'Baby Assassins: 2 Babies', 2023, 'Action, Comedy, Crime, Drama', 'Yugo Sakamoto, Naohiro Kawamoto, Kensuke Sonomura', 'Yugo Sakamoto', 'Akari Takaishi, Saori Izawa, Joey Iwanaga, Tatsuomi Hamada, Atomu Mizuishi, Tsubasa Tobinaga, Tomo Nakai, Junpei Hashino', null, 'Chisato and Mahiro must pay four years of overdue fees or lose their membership in their assassin guild. They take part-time jobs, but find themselves in the middle of an armed robbery and being hunted by other assassins.', 'Chisato and Mahiro must pay four years of overdue fees or lose their membership in their assassin guild. They take part-time jobs, but find themselves in the middle of an armed robbery and being hunted by other assassins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8BW7KMi9ANWZQicIjov31zyJZ4A.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1077600'),
  ('209897935508127694', 'Baby Assassins: Nice Days', 2024, 'Action, Comedy, Crime, Drama', 'Yugo Sakamoto, Kensuke Sonomura, Moritada Iju', 'Yugo Sakamoto', 'Akari Takaishi, Saori Izawa, Sosuke Ikematsu, Atsuko Maeda, Mondo Otani, Atomu Mizuishi, Tomo Nakai, Karuma', 'NR', 'Teenage assassins Mahiro and Chisato visit the coastal city of Miyazaki for a contract and a vacation, but they unexpectedly cross paths with a legendary, bloodthirsty assassin looking to add to his kill count.', 'Teenage assassins Mahiro and Chisato visit the coastal city of Miyazaki for a contract and a vacation, but they unexpectedly cross paths with a legendary, bloodthirsty assassin looking to add to his kill count.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k8hk9ndfEUoRtAJd5xHSi3xAChj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1279752'),
  ('883826875517361716', 'Baby Blood', 1990, 'Horror', 'Alain Robak, Bernard Déchet, Thierry Guerinel', 'Serge Cukier, Alain Robak', 'Emmanuelle Escourrou, Christian Sinniger, Jean-François Gallotte, Roselyne Geslot, François Frappier, Thierry Le Portier, Rémy Roubakha, Eric Averlant', 'R', 'A cruel circus owner beats and abuses his pregnant wife. One day the circus receives a leopard newly captured in Africa, but the animal soon dies. However, an evil creature that was inside the leopard bursts out of the animal''s body, burrows into the wife''s body and takes over her fetus. It soon starts demanding blood, and the woman goes searching for victims for her new "baby."', 'A cruel circus owner beats and abuses his pregnant wife. One day the circus receives a leopard newly captured in Africa, but the animal soon dies. However, an evil creature that was inside the leopard bursts out of the animal''s body, burrows into the wife''s body and takes over her fetus. It soon starts demanding blood, and the woman goes searching for victims for her new "baby."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qMLmTUwbAlPsfsIPuoiGKkYDZq2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40258'),
  ('235584459895536330', 'Baby Blue', 2025, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Adam Mason, Mac Fisken', 'Simon Boyes, Adam Mason', 'Dylan Sprayberry, Lia McHugh, Anthony Turpel, Aramis Knight, Alexia Ioannides, Oliver Cooper, Cyrus Arnold, Michole Briana White', 'NR', 'A group of teens stumble across the story of now dead serial killer Baby Blue and decide he''d be the perfect subject of a true crime vodcast. But when they start digging, they quickly discover that his murder spree never stopped. Now they are being targeted from beyond the grave.', 'A group of teens stumble across the story of now dead serial killer Baby Blue and decide he''d be the perfect subject of a true crime vodcast. But when they start digging, they quickly discover that his murder spree never stopped. Now they are being targeted from beyond the grave.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pC6j3tSoneNbe4pjjtGOcWWxGMU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1026542'),
  ('141045875958841286', 'Baby Blue Marine', 1976, 'Drama', 'John D. Hancock, László Kovács', 'Stanford Whitmore', 'Jan-Michael Vincent, Glynnis O''Connor, Katherine Helmond, Dana Elcar, Bert Remsen, Bruno Kirby, Richard Gere, Art Lund', null, 'A would-be Marine fails basic training, and is sent home wearing the "baby blue" fatigues of a washout. En route, he is mugged by a battle-fatigued Marine Raider, who leaves him to hitch-hike home in an undeserved hero''s uniform. A small Colorado town takes him in, treating him like the hero he appears to be.', 'A would-be Marine fails basic training, and is sent home wearing the "baby blue" fatigues of a washout. En route, he is mugged by a battle-fatigued Marine Raider, who leaves him to hitch-hike home in an undeserved hero''s uniform. A small Colorado town takes him in, treating him like the hero he appears to be.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2l0xzqizttza3TgwhkE7gWxFi2a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83864'),
  ('712413876143215373', 'Baby Blues', 2008, 'Drama, Horror, Thriller', 'Lars Jacobson, Amardeep Kaleka, Andrew Shipsides', 'Lars Jacobson', 'Colleen Porch, Aiden Kersh, Ridge Canipe, Sean Johnson, Holden Thomas Maynard, Kali Majors, Joel Bryant, Gene Witham', 'R', 'On a secluded family farm, a mother suffers a psychotic break due to postpartum depression, forcing the eldest son to protect his sibling from the mother they have always known and loved.', 'On a secluded family farm, a mother suffers a psychotic break due to postpartum depression, forcing the eldest son to protect his sibling from the mother they have always known and loved.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6CthGEm4pPQXnCBBQCZwlTHwYuV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14795'),
  ('1142844054396979005', 'Baby Boom', 1987, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'William A. Fraker, Charles Shyer, John T. Kretchmer', 'Nancy Meyers, Charles Shyer', 'Diane Keaton, Sam Shepard, Harold Ramis, Kristina Kennedy, Michelle Kennedy, Sam Wanamaker, James Spader, Pat Hingle', 'PG', 'J.C. Wiatt is a talented and ambitious New York City career woman who is married to her job and working towards partner at her firm. She has a live-in relationship with Steven, a successful investment broker who, along with J.C., agreed children aren''t part of the plan. J.C.''s life takes an unexpected turn when a distant relative dies and the will appoints her the caretaker of their baby girl, Elizabeth. The baby''s sudden arrival causes Steven to leave, breaking off their relationship. Juggling power lunches and powdered formula, she is soon forced off the fast track by a conniving colleague and a bigoted boss. But she won''t stay down for long. She''ll prove to the world that a woman can have it all and on her own terms too!', 'J.C. Wiatt is a talented and ambitious New York City career woman who is married to her job and working towards partner at her firm. She has a live-in relationship with Steven, a successful investment broker who, along with J.C., agreed children aren''t part of the plan. J.C.''s life takes an unexpected turn when a distant relative dies and the will appoints her the caretaker of their baby girl, Elizabeth. The baby''s sudden arrival causes Steven to leave, breaking off their relationship. Juggling power lunches and powdered formula, she is soon forced off the fast track by a conniving colleague and a bigoted boss. But she won''t stay down for long. She''ll prove to the world that a woman can have it all and on her own terms too!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4Jy5U4HITJWUDYJc1NGgJLIjbWz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11215'),
  ('1113666791220268380', 'Baby Bottleneck', 1946, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Robert Clampett, Carl W. Stalling', null, 'Mel Blanc, Sara Berner', 'NR', 'As the baby boom commences, and with the delivery service overworked, Porky Pig and Daffy Duck are placed in charge of a baby preparation factory, where they help the stork keep up.', 'As the baby boom commences, and with the delivery service overworked, Porky Pig and Daffy Duck are placed in charge of a baby preparation factory, where they help the stork keep up.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cQA6hToekWXrHiN5qGU3vRahzgf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83679'),
  ('95776104881440199', 'Baby Boy', 2001, 'Crime, Drama, Romance, Thriller', 'John Singleton, Charles Mills, Frank Davis', 'John Singleton', 'Tyrese Gibson, Taraji P. Henson, Omar Gooding, Ving Rhames, Snoop Dogg, A.J. Johnson, Angell Conwell, Kareem J. Grimes', 'R', 'The story of Jody, a misguided, 20-year-old African-American who is really just a baby boy finally forced-kicking and screaming to face the commitments of real life. Streetwise and jobless, he has not only fathered two children by two different women-Yvette and Peanut but still lives with his own mother. He can''t seem to strike a balance or find direction in his chaotic life.', 'The story of Jody, a misguided, 20-year-old African-American who is really just a baby boy finally forced-kicking and screaming to face the commitments of real life. Streetwise and jobless, he has not only fathered two children by two different women-Yvette and Peanut but still lives with his own mother. He can''t seem to strike a balance or find direction in his chaotic life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2zhkM2rxCPVLxuZRYejcTiOhzfU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16161'),
  ('961870570644668883', 'Baby Buggy Bunny', 1954, 'Animation, Comedy, Crime', 'Chuck Jones', null, 'Mel Blanc', 'NR', 'Baby-Faced Finster robs a bank, but the baby carriage with the money in it goes down Bugs'' rabbit hole.', 'Baby-Faced Finster robs a bank, but the baby carriage with the money in it goes down Bugs'' rabbit hole.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n7cj5KdN6e2b33vxejZELdKGqAk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74952'),
  ('1012781385564110652', 'Baby Butch', 1954, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Joseph Barbera, William Hanna', null, null, 'NR', 'An alley cat is foraging for food when he sees Tom''s house and decides it''s a rich haul. He dresses as a foundling baby and lands on the doorstep. Tom takes him in and Butch proceeds to raid the fridge between Tom''s babying him. What he doesn''t know is that Jerry''s going to grab the ham Butch swiped every chance he gets.', 'An alley cat is foraging for food when he sees Tom''s house and decides it''s a rich haul. He dresses as a foundling baby and lands on the doorstep. Tom takes him in and Butch proceeds to raid the fridge between Tom''s babying him. What he doesn''t know is that Jerry''s going to grab the ham Butch swiped every chance he gets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lB1lgB1rZRkwNxljKpvlmg4albw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46842'),
  ('611991711600094076', 'Baby Doll', 1956, 'Drama', 'Elia Kazan, Paul Sylbert, Boris Kaufman', 'Tennessee Williams', 'Karl Malden, Carroll Baker, Eli Wallach, Mildred Dunnock, Lonny Chapman, Eades Hogue, Noah Williamson, R.G. Armstrong', null, 'Archie Lee Meighan is a failing cotton gin owner who is married to Baby Doll, a 19-year old childlike beauty whose father arranged the marriage for financial reasons. As Archie awaits the arrival of Baby Doll''s 20th birthday, the day that they are supposed to consummate their marriage, he faces interference from business rival Silva Vacarro, who plots to seduce Baby Doll away from Meighan.', 'Archie Lee Meighan is a failing cotton gin owner who is married to Baby Doll, a 19-year old childlike beauty whose father arranged the marriage for financial reasons. As Archie awaits the arrival of Baby Doll''s 20th birthday, the day that they are supposed to consummate their marriage, he faces interference from business rival Silva Vacarro, who plots to seduce Baby Doll away from Meighan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1Wj0H6HA7xCy8kWYWOTytqwOqWk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40478'),
  ('968689377324869022', 'Baby Doll', 2021, 'Horror', 'Manfe Lozial', 'Manfe Lozial', 'Samantha Ciravolo, Ortensia Fioravanti, Mauro Loverre, Marco Paolini, Marta Tananyan, Claudia Zarauti, Andrea Zirio', 'NR', 'Four foreign exchange students from Italy, stranded in an abandoned house spiral as their worst fears are realized; They are being haunted by a terrifying evil.', 'Four foreign exchange students from Italy, stranded in an abandoned house spiral as their worst fears are realized; They are being haunted by a terrifying evil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wh9Dd5FHmdnxxUBsTe7Ztrcu6DK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:942161'),
  ('90559066408634683', 'Baby Done', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Ian McCarroll, Harry Ashby, Matt Johnston', 'Sophie Henderson', 'Rose Matafeo, Matthew Lewis, Emily Barclay, Rachel House, Nic Sampson, Madeleine Sami, Matenga Ashby, Fasitua Amosa', null, 'Wannabe-adventurer Zoe freaks out when she falls pregnant to her long-term boyfriend Tim. As Tim embraces the prospect of fatherhood, Zoe attempts to rush through her dreams.', 'Wannabe-adventurer Zoe freaks out when she falls pregnant to her long-term boyfriend Tim. As Tim embraces the prospect of fatherhood, Zoe attempts to rush through her dreams.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wHNFvpNTQzRKM9OuCUg24jaxheM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:586695'),
  ('951159592431416729', 'Baby Driver', 2017, 'Action, Crime', 'Darrin Prescott, Edgar Wright, Bill Pope', 'Edgar Wright', 'Ansel Elgort, Kevin Spacey, Lily James, Jon Hamm, Jamie Foxx, Jon Bernthal, Eiza González, Flea', 'R', 'After being coerced into working for a crime boss, a young getaway driver finds himself taking part in a heist doomed to fail.', 'After being coerced into working for a crime boss, a young getaway driver finds himself taking part in a heist doomed to fail.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tYzFuYXmT8LOYASlFCkaPiAFAl0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:339403'),
  ('1029467929697512176', 'Baby Face', 1933, 'Drama', 'Alfred E. Green, James Van Trees, Fred Fox', 'Gene Markey, Kathryn Scola', 'Barbara Stanwyck, George Brent, Donald Cook, Alphonse Ethier, Henry Kolker, Margaret Lindsay, Arthur Hohl, John Wayne', null, 'A young woman uses her body and her sexuality to help her climb the social ladder, but soon begins to wonder if her new status will ever bring her happiness.', 'A young woman uses her body and her sexuality to help her climb the social ladder, but soon begins to wonder if her new status will ever bring her happiness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ul4BLZAXepOQRwUtORmvEpZ4KW4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27449'),
  ('823174885081204906', 'Baby Face Morgan', 1942, 'Crime, Comedy', 'Arthur Dreifuss', 'Jack Rubin, Edward Dein', 'Richard Cromwell, Mary Carlisle, Robert Armstrong, Chick Chandler, Warren Hymer, Charles Judels, Vince Barnett, Ralf Harolde', null, 'When crime boss Big Mike Morgan is killed, his lieutenant, "Doc" Rogers, learns that Morgan has a son named Edward living in the country with his mother. Rogers has naïve Edward brought to the city and installs him as the head of Acme Protective Agency. Good-hearted Eddy assumes his company provides insurance, rather than extortion-- But don''t be too hard on the guy, he still doesn''t know he''s Baby Face Morgan, the most feared gangster in the city!', 'When crime boss Big Mike Morgan is killed, his lieutenant, "Doc" Rogers, learns that Morgan has a son named Edward living in the country with his mother. Rogers has naïve Edward brought to the city and installs him as the head of Acme Protective Agency. Good-hearted Eddy assumes his company provides insurance, rather than extortion-- But don''t be too hard on the guy, he still doesn''t know he''s Baby Face Morgan, the most feared gangster in the city!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8QdaUGQ9skDW7JXlF3I2oorX53O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79973'),
  ('104372484187088215', 'Baby Face Nelson', 1957, 'Crime, Drama', 'Don Siegel, Hal Mohr, Harry M. Slott', 'Daniel Mainwaring', 'Mickey Rooney, Carolyn Jones, Cedric Hardwicke, Leo Gordon, Anthony Caruso, Jack Elam, John Hoyt, Ted de Corsia', 'NR', 'Famed Depression-era gangster “Baby Face Nelson” robs and kills while accompanied by his beautiful moll.', 'Famed Depression-era gangster “Baby Face Nelson” robs and kills while accompanied by his beautiful moll.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z6ec472A2ilD3Bd1kEtaLuK3UMT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35926'),
  ('146657483226292686', 'Baby Gang', 2019, 'Crime, Drama, Action, Thriller', 'Fabio Ciani, Stefano Calvagna', 'Stefano Calvagna', 'Daniele Lelli, Raffaele Sola, Gianluca Barone, Francesco Lisandrelli, Gianmarco Malizia, Stefano Calvagna, Claudio Vanni, Andrea Autullo', null, 'Giorgio and Marco are two close teenage friends and part of a baby gang: a group dedicated to petty crime: thefts, robberies, drug dealing, fights, all to afford an insane consumption of alcohol and drugs. The gang decides to broaden its range to prostitution, starting friends of the same age. The plan is to rob the customers just before they have sex, but to do so they need the right tools.', 'Giorgio and Marco are two close teenage friends and part of a baby gang: a group dedicated to petty crime: thefts, robberies, drug dealing, fights, all to afford an insane consumption of alcohol and drugs. The gang decides to broaden its range to prostitution, starting friends of the same age. The plan is to rob the customers just before they have sex, but to do so they need the right tools.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/upmb0YHo7J3jFjbN5YeYtnVPe3m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:616351'),
  ('596737478208989570', 'Baby Geniuses', 1999, 'Science Fiction, Comedy, Family', 'Bob Clark, Stephen M. Katz', 'Greg Michael, Bob Clark', 'Kathleen Turner, Christopher Lloyd, Kim Cattrall, Peter MacNicol, Dom DeLuise, Ruby Dee, Kyle Howard, Kaye Ballard', 'PG', 'BabyCo is the world''s leading manufacturer in baby products. However, what the public doesn''t know, is that Drs Kinder and Heep, two of its most brilliant scientists, are tirelessly working in complete secrecy to crack the indecipherable code to ''baby talk'': a highly sophisticated language, and the key to the secrets of the universe. Before long, problems arise when mischievous Sly, the smartest of the toddlers, escapes confinement, bent on uniting all babies to free those trapped in the laboratory. Now, Kinder and Heep must find Sly before it is too late.', 'BabyCo is the world''s leading manufacturer in baby products. However, what the public doesn''t know, is that Drs Kinder and Heep, two of its most brilliant scientists, are tirelessly working in complete secrecy to crack the indecipherable code to ''baby talk'': a highly sophisticated language, and the key to the secrets of the universe. Before long, problems arise when mischievous Sly, the smartest of the toddlers, escapes confinement, bent on uniting all babies to free those trapped in the laboratory. Now, Kinder and Heep must find Sly before it is too late.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7zvPhjHkz5YEMUMPyvANCR96RJA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22345'),
  ('98251276376973906', 'Baby Girl', 2026, 'Drama, Family, Thriller', 'Arun Raj Varma, Faiz Siddik, Jijish Rajendran Pillai, Arjun Sati, Binoy Nambala', 'Sanjay, Bobby Sanjay', 'Nivin Pauly, Lijomol Jose, Sangeeth Prathap, Abhimanyu Thilakan, Azees Nedumangad', null, 'On a Christmas night, a guilt-ridden hospital attendant and a determined rookie cop race against time to recover a kidnapped newborn, unaware that the woman who took the baby is fighting a heartbreaking battle to finally call a child her own.', 'On a Christmas night, a guilt-ridden hospital attendant and a determined rookie cop race against time to recover a kidnapped newborn, unaware that the woman who took the baby is fighting a heartbreaking battle to finally call a child her own.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fmetadata-static.plex.tv%2F6%2Fgracenote%2F6055ec8a56e6785b2276cae1e76c0b5d.jpg', 'plex:movie:baby-girl-2026'),
  ('673822256060414951', 'Baby God', 2020, 'Documentary', 'Hannah Olson, Justin Zweifach', null, 'Wendi Babst, Quincy Fortier, Brad Gulko, Cathy Holm, Brent Leavitt, Frank Silver', null, 'A shocking examination into Las Vegas fertility specialist, Dr. Quincy Fortier, who assisted hundreds of couples struggling with conceiving. Decades later, many children born from his interventions discover through DNA and genealogical websites, that Dr. Fortier had used his own sperm to impregnate their mothers without their knowledge or consent.', 'A shocking examination into Las Vegas fertility specialist, Dr. Quincy Fortier, who assisted hundreds of couples struggling with conceiving. Decades later, many children born from his interventions discover through DNA and genealogical websites, that Dr. Fortier had used his own sperm to impregnate their mothers without their knowledge or consent.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iJ7k5pR5hKc6nII53I318l3ZnBJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:682588'),
  ('201460104001764963', 'Baby Invasion', 2024, 'Crime, Thriller, Science Fiction, Action', 'Harmony Korine, Joao Rosa, Shawn Thomas', 'Harmony Korine', 'Anonymous, Juan C. Bofill, Shawn Thomas, Steven Rodriguez, Antonio Jackson, Tej Limlas Ly, Troy Roker, Andrea Douglas', 'NR', 'In a first-person shooter game leaked to the Dark Web, a group of mercenaries disguised with baby faces invade mansions of the wealthy and powerful with murderous intent. However, as gamers livestream, the protagonists’ gang of horrific murders may or may not be correlating with reality.', 'In a first-person shooter game leaked to the Dark Web, a group of mercenaries disguised with baby faces invade mansions of the wealthy and powerful with murderous intent. However, as gamers livestream, the protagonists’ gang of horrific murders may or may not be correlating with reality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vQUMVlgDzKjcTWn7WfZsA8UCAbE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1262740'),
