  ('46237527091960003', 'Babylon 5: In the Beginning', 1998, 'Action, Science Fiction, Adventure', 'John C. Flinn III, Michael Vejar, Douglas E. Wise', 'J. Michael Straczynski', 'Bruce Boxleitner, Mira Furlan, Richard Biggs, Andreas Katsulas, Peter Jurasik, Theodore Bikel, Reiner Schöne, Michael O''Hare', null, 'Londo Mollari, the Centauri Emperor, recounts the initial contact between the Humans and Minbari, which resulted in a major incident and subsequent war, for an eager pair of youngsters wanting a story about love and conflict.', 'Londo Mollari, the Centauri Emperor, recounts the initial contact between the Humans and Minbari, which resulted in a major incident and subsequent war, for an eager pair of youngsters wanting a story about love and conflict.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iFum9eQ5DztNMGE1c1CFm01SnJt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10940'),
  ('686157562622201588', 'Babylon 5: The Gathering', 1993, 'Science Fiction, Action, Adventure', 'Billy Dickson, Richard Compton, Chris Muller', 'J. Michael Straczynski', 'Michael O''Hare, Tamlyn Tomita, Jerry Doyle, Mira Furlan, Peter Jurasik, Andreas Katsulas, Blaire Baron, John Fleck', null, 'The feature-length pilot for this Emmy award-winning show. Babylon 5 is the latest in a series of space stations built by humans. The Vorlon ambassador, Kosh, has been poisoned. It is the new commanding officer, Jeffrey Sinclair, who has the responsibility of finding the culprit. Otherwise, the space station will fail in its role of bringing many alien races together.', 'The feature-length pilot for this Emmy award-winning show. Babylon 5 is the latest in a series of space stations built by humans. The Vorlon ambassador, Kosh, has been poisoned. It is the new commanding officer, Jeffrey Sinclair, who has the responsibility of finding the culprit. Otherwise, the space station will fail in its role of bringing many alien races together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1eRyJK9ImrmXqSkGXVO7OlDNrYq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10942'),
  ('968556995378286392', 'Babylon 5: The Legend of the Rangers - To Live and Die in Starlight', 2002, 'Science Fiction, Adventure, Action', 'Michael Vejar, Alysse Leite-Rogers, Henry Chan', 'J. Michael Straczynski', 'Dylan Neal, Andreas Katsulas, Alex Zahara, Myriam Sirois, Dean Marshall, Enid-Raye Adams, Warren Takeuchi, Jennie Rebecca Hogan', null, 'After being punished for retreat from combat, Ranger David Martel is given command of the Liandra, a haunted 20-year old Minbari fighting ship. He''s escorting ambassadors to a secret archaeological site, the oldest city on record and a clue to a dangerous ancient race.', 'After being punished for retreat from combat, Ranger David Martel is given command of the Liandra, a haunted 20-year old Minbari fighting ship. He''s escorting ambassadors to a secret archaeological site, the oldest city on record and a clue to a dangerous ancient race.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bIhOn8xKsOQGjiNCQ8sKoQyYmNa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16068'),
  ('492523077795919891', 'Babylon 5: The Lost Tales - Voices in the Dark', 2007, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'J. Michael Straczynski, Sara Barnes, Karl Herrmann', 'J. Michael Straczynski, J. Michael Straczynski', 'Bruce Boxleitner, Peter Woodward, Alan Scarfe, Teryl Rothery, Keegan MacIntosh, Craig Veroni, Tracy Scoggins, Bruce Ramsay', null, 'This instalment of Babylon 5 is in two parts: the first is about an entity that has possessed a worker. Colonel Lochley prevents a priest from performing an exorcism. The host is returned to Earth. The second has Galen trying to dupe President Sheridan into assassinating the future Centauri emperor to stop him from attacking Earth in around 30 years time.', 'This instalment of Babylon 5 is in two parts: the first is about an entity that has possessed a worker. Colonel Lochley prevents a priest from performing an exorcism. The host is returned to Earth. The second has Galen trying to dupe President Sheridan into assassinating the future Centauri emperor to stop him from attacking Earth in around 30 years time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vJfaGrtbugADGYdlmtI6xfWxfpB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15289'),
  ('119965098486264845', 'Babylon 5: The River of Souls', 1998, 'Action, Science Fiction, Adventure', 'Janet Greek, Fred V. Murphy, Timothy M. Earls', 'J. Michael Straczynski', 'Tracy Scoggins, Jerry Doyle, Jeff Conaway, Richard Biggs, Martin Sheen, Ian McShane, Jeff Doucette, Wayne Alexander', null, 'A group of Soul Hunters come to Babylon 5 demanding the return of something that was stolen from them.', 'A group of Soul Hunters come to Babylon 5 demanding the return of something that was stolen from them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bG8H9cnusrothe1HixryGGvSo9S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10921'),
  ('560287502900690981', 'Babylon 5: The Road Home', 2023, 'Animation, Science Fiction, Action, Adventure', 'Matt Peters', 'J. Michael Straczynski', 'Bruce Boxleitner, Claudia Christian, Peter Jurasik, Bill Mumy, Tracy Scoggins, Patricia Tallman, Paul Guyet, Anthony Hansen', 'PG-13', 'Travel across the galaxy with John Sheridan as he unexpectedly finds himself transported through multiple timelines and alternate realities in a quest to find his way back home. Along the way he reunites with some familiar faces, while discovering cosmic new revelations about the history, purpose, and meaning of the Universe.', 'Travel across the galaxy with John Sheridan as he unexpectedly finds himself transported through multiple timelines and alternate realities in a quest to find his way back home. Along the way he reunites with some familiar faces, while discovering cosmic new revelations about the history, purpose, and meaning of the Universe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qlXLiFKf2kvJ4K2VDBC5Z048vm3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1121575'),
  ('96054050988235704', 'Babylon 5: Thirdspace', 1998, 'Action, Science Fiction, Adventure', 'Jesús Salvador Treviño, John C. Flinn III, Ronald Chong', 'J. Michael Straczynski', 'Bruce Boxleitner, Claudia Christian, Mira Furlan, Shari Belafonte, Stephen Furst, Patricia Tallman, Jeff Conaway, Clyde Kusatsu', null, 'Susan Ivanova discovers a derelict spaceship in hyperspace. They tow it back to Babylon 5, then strange things start happening. People are being telepathically taken over by aliens from another (third)space.', 'Susan Ivanova discovers a derelict spaceship in hyperspace. They tow it back to Babylon 5, then strange things start happening. People are being telepathically taken over by aliens from another (third)space.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lGRkbsA4cqFBjvshNAnCnUg0uyV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10941'),
  ('870053964789606375', 'Babylon A.D.', 2008, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Mathieu Kassovitz, Thierry Arbogast, Milena Koubková', 'Éric Besnard, Mathieu Kassovitz', 'Vin Diesel, Mélanie Thierry, Lambert Wilson, Charlotte Rampling, Michelle Yeoh, Gérard Depardieu, Mark Strong, Jérôme Le Banner', 'PG-13', 'A veteran-turned-mercenary is hired to take a young woman with a secret from post-apocalyptic Eastern Europe to New York City.', 'A veteran-turned-mercenary is hired to take a young woman with a secret from post-apocalyptic Eastern Europe to New York City.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bQqb3T0FIHOvgozzX9aygmWUbLZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9381'),
  ('820333250963315591', 'Babysitter', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Noémie Sirois, Charles-Olivier Tremblay, Josée Deshaies', 'Catherine Léger', 'Patrick Hivon, Monia Chokri, Nadia Tereszkiewicz, Steve Laplante, Hubert Proulx, Stéphane Moukarzel, Nathalie Breuer, Patrice Dubois', null, 'After a sexist joke goes viral, Cédric loses his job and embarks on a therapeutic journey to free himself from sexism and misogyny. He and his girlfriend hire a mysterious and liberated babysitter to help shake things up.', 'After a sexist joke goes viral, Cédric loses his job and embarks on a therapeutic journey to free himself from sexism and misogyny. He and his girlfriend hire a mysterious and liberated babysitter to help shake things up.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sEdR0lapigrin4S4EMLICiTKDTO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:764837'),
  ('705812320394580157', 'Babysitter Must Die', 2021, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Kohl Glass', 'Julie Auerbach, Kevin Tavolaro', 'Riley Scott, Scarlett Hazen, Nathan Stevens, Melinda Yeaman', null, 'Members of a cult invade the home of a wealthy family, but they didn''t count on a resourceful babysitter who''s armed with a variety of weapons.', 'Members of a cult invade the home of a wealthy family, but they didn''t count on a resourceful babysitter who''s armed with a variety of weapons.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zRUa84aEI7UuVM3k4TWmPcL2LPT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:737737'),
  ('174879626766375711', 'Babysitter Wanted', 2007, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Michael Manasseri, Jonas Barnes, Alex Vendler', null, 'Tina Houtz, Sarah Thompson, Kristen Dalton, Nana Visitor, Matt Dallas, Bruce Thomas, Jillian Schmitz, Bill Moseley', 'R', 'When she takes a job babysitting a young boy for a night at his family''s remote farmhouse, sweet college co-ed Angie Albright becomes the target of a scar-covered creep making mysterious phone calls and prowling outside the windows. Angie gets the drop on the would-be killer, but quickly discovers that her nightmare has just begun.', 'When she takes a job babysitting a young boy for a night at his family''s remote farmhouse, sweet college co-ed Angie Albright becomes the target of a scar-covered creep making mysterious phone calls and prowling outside the windows. Angie gets the drop on the would-be killer, but quickly discovers that her nightmare has just begun.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7DQlbb4ax5L5NZvMjr54KOsXGyF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60086'),
  ('701067400391744421', 'Babysitter''s Black Book', 2015, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Pietro Zuercher, Lee Friedlander, Joseph M. Setele', 'Michele Samit, Richard Kletter', 'Spencer Locke, Angeline Appel, Lauren Swickard, Steffani Brass, David Shatraw, Stacy Edwards, Doug Noble, Ryan McPartlin', 'PG-13', 'When her parents'' financial problems threaten Ashley''s dreams for college, the high school whiz kid takes matters into her own hands. She and her girlfriends turn their babysitting business into a wildly successful escort service for dads. But in this small suburban community, nothing stays secret for long.', 'When her parents'' financial problems threaten Ashley''s dreams for college, the high school whiz kid takes matters into her own hands. She and her girlfriends turn their babysitting business into a wildly successful escort service for dads. But in this small suburban community, nothing stays secret for long.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lH8aKsjxVx1sxbV4XLIEuczsscP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:326923'),
  ('487129511985378994', 'Babysitting', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Nicolas Benamou, Philippe Lacheau, Antoine Marteau', 'Philippe Lacheau, Pierre Lacheau, Julien Arruti', 'Philippe Lacheau, Alice David, Vincent Desagnat, Tarek Boudali, Julien Arruti, Grégoire Ludig, David Marsais, Gérard Jugnot', null, 'Looking for a baby-sitter for the night, Marc Schaudel entrusts his son Remy to the care of his employee Franck, a straight man. But the thing that Marc doesn''t know, is that Franck is getting 30 years old this weekend and that his son Remy is a very capricious child. The next day, Marc and his wife Claire are awakened by a call from the police. Remy and Franck are missing, and the house is totally devastated. The police finds a camera in the leftovers. Marc, Claire and the police start watching the video that has been recorded the day before during the night and find out what happened to Franck and Remy.', 'Looking for a baby-sitter for the night, Marc Schaudel entrusts his son Remy to the care of his employee Franck, a straight man. But the thing that Marc doesn''t know, is that Franck is getting 30 years old this weekend and that his son Remy is a very capricious child. The next day, Marc and his wife Claire are awakened by a call from the police. Remy and Franck are missing, and the house is totally devastated. The police finds a camera in the leftovers. Marc, Claire and the police start watching the video that has been recorded the day before during the night and find out what happened to Franck and Remy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hThGBaLMp9koVMQr1LQqb5Z377d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:262551'),
  ('524985984770867250', 'Babysitting 2', 2015, 'Comedy', 'Nicolas Benamou, Philippe Lacheau, Antoine Marteau', 'Julien Arruti, Nicolas Benamou, Philippe Lacheau', 'Philippe Lacheau, Alice David, Vincent Desagnat, Tarek Boudali, Christian Clavier, Julien Arruti, Charlotte Gabris, Valériane de Villeneuve', null, 'Franck and his girlfriend Sonya, plus some of their friends go on holiday in Brazil. Franck, his friends, two girls and Sonya''s grandmother leave to visit a cave, but everything goes wrong and their crazy adventures begin.', 'Franck and his girlfriend Sonya, plus some of their friends go on holiday in Brazil. Franck, his friends, two girls and Sonya''s grandmother leave to visit a cave, but everything goes wrong and their crazy adventures begin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8kDHjMLw5knh0AYdp9iIeUt5AYZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:331836'),
  ('740901966934162349', 'Babyteeth', 2020, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Erin Lander, Shannon Murphy, Andrew Commis', 'Rita Kalnejais', 'Eliza Scanlen, Toby Wallace, Essie Davis, Ben Mendelsohn, Eugene Gilfedder, Emily Barclay, Andrea Demetriades, Charles Grounds', null, 'A terminally ill teen upsets her parents when she falls in love with a small-time drug dealer.', 'A terminally ill teen upsets her parents when she falls in love with a small-time drug dealer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aINpljdt3VVMrCLtJW4BektwYOp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:522098'),
