  ('322213856804586558', 'Bachelor in Paradise', 1961, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Jack Arnold, Erich von Stroheim Jr., Joseph Ruttenberg', 'Valentine Davies, Hal Kanter', 'Bob Hope, Lana Turner, Janis Paige, Jim Hutton, Paula Prentiss, Don Porter, Virginia Grey, Agnes Moorehead', null, 'A bachelor author of sleazy books moves to a family-oriented subdivision where he becomes an unofficial relationship advisor to unhappy local housewives, to the dismay of their respective husbands who suspect him of sexual misconduct.', 'A bachelor author of sleazy books moves to a family-oriented subdivision where he becomes an unofficial relationship advisor to unhappy local housewives, to the dismay of their respective husbands who suspect him of sexual misconduct.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b5KDQqX4wIbT9G2Er8juwnd3E8c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52841'),
