  ('448462067408704560', 'Bachelor Party', 1984, 'Comedy', 'Hal Trussell, Neal Israel, Jerry Sobul', 'Pat Proft, Neal Israel', 'Tom Hanks, Tawny Kitaen, Adrian Zmed, George Grizzard, Barbara Stuart, Robert Prescott, William Tepper, Wendie Jo Sperber', 'R', 'On the eve of his wedding to his longtime girlfriend, unassuming nice guy Rick is dragged out for a night of debauchery by his friends.', 'On the eve of his wedding to his longtime girlfriend, unassuming nice guy Rick is dragged out for a night of debauchery by his friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dZf3UpPZDvJYTODSUJQy7wYEop.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12309'),
  ('637885558162116463', 'Bachelor Party 2: The Last Temptation', 2008, 'Comedy', 'James Ryan, Roy H. Wagner, Melanie Grefé', 'Neal Israel, Pat Proft', 'Josh Cooke, Sara Foster, Warren Christie, Danny Jacobs, Greg Pitts, Emmanuelle Vaugier, Harland Williams, Max Landwirth', 'R', 'Ron and Melinda may be happily engaged, but Melinda''s scheming brother-in-law Todd doesn''t like the thought of a new addition to the family business, so he plans to incriminate Ron at the ultimate bachelor bash in Miami Beach. Between Ron''s party-hearty friends and Todd''s tantalizing temptations, not to mention a sex addicts convention right in their hotel, it''s an outrageously sinful celebration that you have to see to believe!', 'Ron and Melinda may be happily engaged, but Melinda''s scheming brother-in-law Todd doesn''t like the thought of a new addition to the family business, so he plans to incriminate Ron at the ultimate bachelor bash in Miami Beach. Between Ron''s party-hearty friends and Todd''s tantalizing temptations, not to mention a sex addicts convention right in their hotel, it''s an outrageously sinful celebration that you have to see to believe!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5jYCn53G4oqNnGLh6TThQduJqxT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14503'),
