  ('830994849148594613', 'Bachna Ae Haseeno', 2008, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'Siddharth Anand, Sunil Patel, Bidyut Dumra', 'Devika Bhagat', 'Ranbir Kapoor, Deepika Padukone, Bipasha Basu, Minissha Lamba, Kunal Kapoor, Hiten Paintal, Sumeet Arora, Puneet Issar', null, 'Raj is a heartbreaker. His love stories with Mahi, Radhika and Gayatri finally teach him about love and life in their own sweet, sexy and sassy way.', 'Raj is a heartbreaker. His love stories with Mahi, Radhika and Gayatri finally teach him about love and life in their own sweet, sexy and sassy way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bFjzXEDw7b8tjWJeFEKMXjCkqbz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15864'),
