  ('1147657369051553437', 'Back and Forth', 2016, 'Romance, Comedy', 'José Eduardo Belmonte, André Levenère, Janaína Cabello', 'José Eduardo Belmonte, Cláudia Jouvin', 'Ingrid Guimarães, Fábio Assunção, Alice Braga, Rosanne Mulholland, Caroline Abras, João Assunção, Marisol Ribeiro, Sergio Tadeu Iglesias', null, 'Afonso is a university professor and a single father to his son Benedict. One day, they decide to take a trip together, but face problems when their car breaks down. They are helped by four very beautiful telemarketing operators who take them back to São Paulo.', 'Afonso is a university professor and a single father to his son Benedict. One day, they decide to take a trip together, but face problems when their car breaks down. They are helped by four very beautiful telemarketing operators who take them back to São Paulo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/10lMoRN0SDMlLktjucciFE5WrOu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:352993'),
  ('257550997217070461', 'Back Door to Hell', 1964, 'Action, War, Drama', 'Monte Hellman, Mars Rasca', 'Richard A. Guttman, John Hackett', 'Jimmie Rodgers, Jack Nicholson, John Hackett, Annabelle Huggins, Johnny Monteiro, Conrad Maga, Joe Sison, Henry Duval', 'PG', 'During WWII, a three-man commando team places its trust in the hands of a band of Filipino resistors, as they try to knock out a Japenese communication center.', 'During WWII, a three-man commando team places its trust in the hands of a band of Filipino resistors, as they try to knock out a Japenese communication center.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6xQ3GkHopXbH8za3mEXxsPlIWty.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62755'),
  ('691986626270445762', 'Back for Good', 2017, 'Drama', 'Mia Spengler', 'Stefanie Schmitz, Mia Spengler', 'Kim Riedle, Juliane Köhler, Leonie Wesselow, Nicki von Tempelhoff, Emma Nova, Anna Oussankina, Hanife Syleimani, Lena Thom', null, 'Three women, one family: Monika the mother, Angie the older sister and Kiki the baby of the family. Angie is a reality-TV star who is doggedly clinging onto her fading career. Fresh out of rehab, she suddenly finds herself without any money, friends or a place to live and is condemned to returning to her mother in her hated dump of a hometown. Angie''s teenage sister Kiki is also finding life tough-going. Due to her epilepsy, her mother Monika insists that she wears a freaky protective helmet. The consequence: Kiki is ostracised and bullied, her life has long since become the hell from which her mother is trying to protect her.', 'Three women, one family: Monika the mother, Angie the older sister and Kiki the baby of the family. Angie is a reality-TV star who is doggedly clinging onto her fading career. Fresh out of rehab, she suddenly finds herself without any money, friends or a place to live and is condemned to returning to her mother in her hated dump of a hometown. Angie''s teenage sister Kiki is also finding life tough-going. Due to her epilepsy, her mother Monika insists that she wears a freaky protective helmet. The consequence: Kiki is ostracised and bullied, her life has long since become the hell from which her mother is trying to protect her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7tIrzQsK6Oo6Y50MOZvP7jnHqJM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:399351'),
  ('326331516737188772', 'Back from Eternity', 1956, 'Adventure, Drama', 'John Farrow, Emmett Emerson, William C. Mellor', 'Jonathan Latimer', 'Robert Ryan, Anita Ekberg, Rod Steiger, Phyllis Kirk, Keith Andes, Gene Barry, Fred Clark, Beulah Bondi', 'NR', 'A South American plane loaded with an assortment of characters crash lands in a remote jungle area in the middle of a storm. The passengers then discover they are in an area inhabited by vicious cannibals and must escape before they are found. A remake of Five Came Back (1939).', 'A South American plane loaded with an assortment of characters crash lands in a remote jungle area in the middle of a storm. The passengers then discover they are in an area inhabited by vicious cannibals and must escape before they are found. A remake of Five Came Back (1939).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uh1OztOgr6ICHH2vNzb2g5tJ2WF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46525'),
  ('803516442081407340', 'Back from the Dead', 1957, 'Horror', 'Charles Marquis Warren, Ernest Haller, Nathan Barragar', 'Catherine Turney', 'Peggie Castle, Marsha Hunt, Arthur Franz, Don Haggerty, Helen Wallace, Otto Reichow, James Bell, Marianne Stewart', 'NR', 'A woman is possessed by the spirt of her husband''s deceased first wife, turning her into a cold, scheming flirt who will stop at nothing to get what she wants. The woman''s sister, husband and the sister''s new boyfriend struggle with accepting what has happened, who has caused it and how to correct it, which soon brings them into contact with a coven of devil-worshippers and forces of the supernatural.', 'A woman is possessed by the spirt of her husband''s deceased first wife, turning her into a cold, scheming flirt who will stop at nothing to get what she wants. The woman''s sister, husband and the sister''s new boyfriend struggle with accepting what has happened, who has caused it and how to correct it, which soon brings them into contact with a coven of devil-worshippers and forces of the supernatural.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/985e2B42NiuvjPZCi8gnKpmFn06.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:117028'),
  ('109064171370208820', 'Back from the Front', 1943, 'Comedy, War', 'Jules White', 'Jack White, Ewart Adamson', 'Curly Howard, Larry Fine, Moe Howard, Stanley Blystone, Vernon Dent, Bud Jamison, Adele Mara, Al Thompson', 'NR', 'The Stooges join the war effort by enlisting at Merchant Marines. While aboard, they have a brief run-in with (a secret German Nazi officer) Lt. Dungen (Vernon Dent), and then mistake a torpedo for a beached whale. Moe says they have to kill it, and it promptly explodes. After being lost at sea for several days, they come across the SS Schicklgruber and climb aboard. Now with fully grown beards, they come across Lt. Dungen again, who does not recognize them. After realizing they are on a German war ship they eventually overtake the crew and toss them overboard.', 'The Stooges join the war effort by enlisting at Merchant Marines. While aboard, they have a brief run-in with (a secret German Nazi officer) Lt. Dungen (Vernon Dent), and then mistake a torpedo for a beached whale. Moe says they have to kill it, and it promptly explodes. After being lost at sea for several days, they come across the SS Schicklgruber and climb aboard. Now with fully grown beards, they come across Lt. Dungen again, who does not recognize them. After realizing they are on a German war ship they eventually overtake the crew and toss them overboard.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hF7GrvCIIzsdzxb1IN3BYz0hPuI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:100600'),
  ('405031126709508498', 'Back Home', 2020, 'Drama', 'Jessica Palud, Victor Seguin', 'Jessica Palud, Philippe Lioret, Diastème', 'Niels Schneider, Adèle Exarchopoulos, Roman Coustère Hachez, Patrick d''Assumçao, Hélène Vincent, Franck Falise, Jonathan Couzinié, Catherine Salée', null, 'The prodigal son of a family in turmoil returns home to his French rural home to reconnect with his family and make sense of their dysfunctions.', 'The prodigal son of a family in turmoil returns home to his French rural home to reconnect with his family and make sense of their dysfunctions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6Ki0HNLFiamF748Ibmz9tKw1a7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:582922'),
  ('484918670610973533', 'Back in Action', 1994, 'Action, Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Steve DiMarco, Paul Ziller, Gilles Corbeil', 'Karl Schiffman', 'Billy Blanks, Roddy Piper, Bobbie Phillips, Kai Soremekun, Matt Birman, Nigel Bennett, Damon D''Oliveira, Martin McNamara', 'R', 'Two men have different motivations but the same goal when they team up and mount an assault on a powerful drug gang.', 'Two men have different motivations but the same goal when they team up and mount an assault on a powerful drug gang.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cADs1ZbZbkvgr6TJtnPHi6PypxL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30443'),
  ('918002426952946700', 'Back in Action', 2025, 'Action, Comedy', 'Seth Gordon, J.J. Perry, Ken Seng', 'Brendan O''Brien, Seth Gordon', 'Jamie Foxx, Cameron Diaz, McKenna Roberts, Rylan Jackson, Kyle Chandler, Glenn Close, Jamie Demetriou, Andrew Scott', 'PG-13', 'Fifteen years after vanishing from the CIA to start a family, elite spies Matt and Emily jump back into the world of espionage when their cover is blown.', 'Fifteen years after vanishing from the CIA to start a family, elite spies Matt and Emily jump back into the world of espionage when their cover is blown.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3L3l6LsiLGHkTG4RFB2aBA6BttB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:993710'),
  ('326047447242640883', 'Back in Business', 1997, 'Action, TV Movie', 'Walter Bal, Philippe Mora', 'Ed Decatur, Ash Staley', 'Brian Bosworth, Joe Torry, Dara Tomanovich, Alan Scarfe, Brion James, Guy Torry, Michael Clarke Duncan, Ron Glass', null, 'An ex-cop gets pulled back in an undercover mission for the FBI by his former partner. The mission is to catch drug runners, but it is also sting operation against dirty cops, some of whom set up the ex-cops'' dismissal from the force.', 'An ex-cop gets pulled back in an undercover mission for the FBI by his former partner. The mission is to catch drug runners, but it is also sting operation against dirty cops, some of whom set up the ex-cops'' dismissal from the force.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vfpXAqj4j8QwiT3L9DSMoiooAaX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:90785'),
  ('466287759440820444', 'Back in Crime', 2013, 'Crime, Fantasy', 'Germinal Alvarez, Vincent Mathias', 'Germinal Alvarez, Vanessa Lépinard, Nathalie Saugeon', 'Jean-Hugues Anglade, Mélanie Thierry, Philippe Bérodot, Pierre Moure, Loïc Rojouan, Frédéric Saurel, Nicolas Villemagne, Adrien Cauchetier', null, 'Inspector Richard Kemp never got around to putting the handcuffs around the Eardrum Slasher, a dangerous serial killer whose rampage began 20 years before. When Hélène, a psychologist, witnesses the Slasher’s latest crime and offers to testify, Kemp falls in love with her at first sight. In a mysterious turn of event, Kemp is suddenly transported back in time to the site of the Eardrum Slasher’s first murder, he realizes that this could provide a second chance to catch the killer...', 'Inspector Richard Kemp never got around to putting the handcuffs around the Eardrum Slasher, a dangerous serial killer whose rampage began 20 years before. When Hélène, a psychologist, witnesses the Slasher’s latest crime and offers to testify, Kemp falls in love with her at first sight. In a mysterious turn of event, Kemp is suddenly transported back in time to the site of the Eardrum Slasher’s first murder, he realizes that this could provide a second chance to catch the killer...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qfA6JAOJBgxRK8qiF7LXJtMypmW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:197772'),
  ('783540026377838290', 'Back in the Day', 2016, 'Drama', 'Paul Borghese, George Mitas', null, 'Alec Baldwin, Michael Madsen, Shannen Doherty, Danny Glover, Annabella Sciorra, Joseph D''Onofrio, Louis Lombardi, Manny Perez', null, 'A young boxer is taken under the wing of a mob boss after his mother dies and his father is run out of town for being an abusive alcoholic.', 'A young boxer is taken under the wing of a mob boss after his mother dies and his father is run out of town for being an abusive alcoholic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eSLGYrj0IGgScf95TQB7JDX9k19.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:368596'),
  ('434031414572857658', 'Back in Time', 2015, 'Documentary', 'Jason Aron, Jason Aron', null, 'Michael J. Fox, Lea Thompson, Christopher Lloyd, Robert Zemeckis, Alan Silvestri, Bob Gale, Claudia Wells, Dean Cundey', 'PG', 'Cast, crew and fans explore the ''Back to the Future'' time-travel trilogy''s resonance throughout our culture—30 years after Marty McFly went back in time.', 'Cast, crew and fans explore the ''Back to the Future'' time-travel trilogy''s resonance throughout our culture—30 years after Marty McFly went back in time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yx564Sa6KUgzKmgcv4wUCefzEzI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:330127'),
  ('428603144085606665', 'Back of the Net', 2019, 'Drama, Family', 'Louise Alston', 'Alison Spuck McNeeley, Casie Tabanou', 'Sofia Wylie, Kate Box, Christopher Kirby, Tiarnie Coupland, Ashleigh Ross, Yasmin Honeychurch, Melissa Bonne, Gemma Chua-Tran', null, 'A new student at a soccer academy is determined to beat her rival''s team in the national tournament.', 'A new student at a soccer academy is determined to beat her rival''s team in the national tournament.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1wwfTLrtvgM8Nnv6djel3b2eHqM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:515743'),
  ('110721561413430102', 'Back on the Strip', 2023, 'Comedy', 'Chris Spencer, Joshua Reis', 'Chris Spencer, Eric Daniel', 'Wesley Snipes, Spence Moore II, Kevin Hart, Tiffany Haddish, Faizon Love, JB Smoove, Bill Bellamy, Colleen Camp', 'R', 'Aspiring magician Merlin moves to Las Vegas but gets waylaid by his natural gifts and a place with the black male strippers The Chocolate Chips.', 'Aspiring magician Merlin moves to Las Vegas but gets waylaid by his natural gifts and a place with the black male strippers The Chocolate Chips.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wy6FIXGqaOiNeBOkVei3hOB6sVM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:943818'),
  ('534510373975506149', 'Back on Track', 2013, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Kilian Riedhof, Judith Kaufmann', 'Kilian Riedhof, Marc Blöbaum', 'Dieter Hallervorden, Tatja Seibt, Heike Makatsch, Frederick Lau, Heinz W. Krückeberg, Katrin Sass, Otto Mellies, Mehdi Nebbou', null, 'A former Olympic champion wants to compete in the Berlin Marathon one last time.', 'A former Olympic champion wants to compete in the Berlin Marathon one last time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qbZxpzebpY803LUHdCBrSYf6OIX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:218736'),
  ('797424093633720603', 'Back Roads', 1981, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Martin Ritt, John A. Alonzo', 'Gary DeVore', 'Sally Field, Tommy Lee Jones, David Keith, M. Emmet Walsh, Michael V. Gazzo, Nell Carter, Royce D. Applegate, Don ''Red'' Barry', 'R', 'A prostitute and a drifter find themselves bound together as they make their way through the rural South, doing what they have to do to survive.', 'A prostitute and a drifter find themselves bound together as they make their way through the rural South, doing what they have to do to survive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gjEnwAqNADksJugIs2F7EgQ5ekp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61653'),
  ('689387081763614007', 'Back Roads', 2019, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Alex Pettyfer, Jarin Blaschke, Wright McFarland', 'Adrian Lyne, Tawni O''Dell', 'Alex Pettyfer, Jennifer Morrison, Nicola Peltz Beckham, June Carryl, Juliette Lewis, Tom Everett Scott, Danika Yarosh, Robert Patrick', null, 'A young man cares for his younger sisters after their mother is imprisoned for murdering their abusive father. When he strikes up an affair with a married woman, long-dormant family secrets bubble to the surface.', 'A young man cares for his younger sisters after their mother is imprisoned for murdering their abusive father. When he strikes up an affair with a married woman, long-dormant family secrets bubble to the surface.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/va3CVH59k7b79JLl4t2TLJAh0fZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:465929'),
  ('384534453072598877', 'Back Soon', 2007, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Rob Williams', 'Rob Williams', 'Windham Beacham, Matthew Montgomery, Maggie McCollester, Artie O''Daly, Jake Christian, Kelly Keaton, Bethany Dotson, Danny Aguirre', 'R', 'Back Soon is a story of love, loss, identity and hope. It follows the relationship between aspiring actor Logan Foster and reformed drug dealer Gil Ramirez, two men who find themselves inexplicably drawn together despite their disparate backgrounds, and the fact that they both regarded themselves as straight. However, their bond is soon threatened by Gil''s mysterious past and a startling revelation about the true nature of their connection. Neither man is prepared for this, nor the impact it will have on their lives.', 'Back Soon is a story of love, loss, identity and hope. It follows the relationship between aspiring actor Logan Foster and reformed drug dealer Gil Ramirez, two men who find themselves inexplicably drawn together despite their disparate backgrounds, and the fact that they both regarded themselves as straight. However, their bond is soon threatened by Gil''s mysterious past and a startling revelation about the true nature of their connection. Neither man is prepared for this, nor the impact it will have on their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wmCAChQFo0I3oJExBsat7E6tfwt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54325'),
  ('724450289566237568', 'Back Street', 1932, 'Drama, Romance', 'John M. Stahl, David Broekman, Scott R. Beal', 'Gene Fowler, Ben Hecht', 'Irene Dunne, John Boles, George Meeker, Zasu Pitts, June Clyde, William Bakewell, Arletta Duncan, Doris Lloyd', 'NR', 'A woman''s love for and devotion to a married man results in her being relegated to the "back streets" of his life.', 'A woman''s love for and devotion to a married man results in her being relegated to the "back streets" of his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kj74LmtNkIBpoLDHOq5Crmvc2eq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:109197'),
  ('581346043949267319', 'Back Street', 1941, 'Drama', 'Robert Stevenson', 'Bruce Manning, Felix Jackson', 'Charles Boyer, Margaret Sullavan, Richard Carlson, Frank McHugh, Tim Holt, Frank Jenks, Esther Dale, Peggy Stewart', null, 'In turn-of-the-century Cincinnati, vibrant shop girl Ray Smith falls in love with banker Walter Saxel, who is engaged to a socially prominent woman. Inadvertently prevented from running away with Walter, Ray remains single but reunites with him five years later. Despite Walter being married and having a son, Ray becomes his mistress, and over the years suffers social ostracism and long stretches of solitude while waiting for their brief interludes together.', 'In turn-of-the-century Cincinnati, vibrant shop girl Ray Smith falls in love with banker Walter Saxel, who is engaged to a socially prominent woman. Inadvertently prevented from running away with Walter, Ray remains single but reunites with him five years later. Despite Walter being married and having a son, Ray becomes his mistress, and over the years suffers social ostracism and long stretches of solitude while waiting for their brief interludes together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wGgQfM26ID1TSSaCBxoDbSIBTvX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:109016'),
  ('933899562234027297', 'Back Street', 1961, 'Drama, Romance', 'David Miller, Stanley Cortez', 'Eleanore Griffin, William Ludwig', 'Susan Hayward, John Gavin, Vera Miles, Charles Drake, Virginia Grey, Reginald Gardiner, Tammy Marihugh, Robert Eyer', null, 'Ambitious but thwarted, Rae Smith meets handsome Marine Paul Saxon, (of the Saxon department store chain), as he passes through Lincoln, Nebraska, on his way home from World War II. There''s a definite spark between them but circumstances intervene and he leaves town without her. Later she learns he''s married. Determined to make it as a fashion designer, Rae moves to New York and becomes a great success. One day she happens to meet Paul again and again there''s that spark but he''s still married so, as a form of escape, Rae moves to Rome to set up shop. Once again she meets Paul and finally they begin an actual affair since Paul''s shrewish, drunken wife, Liz, won''t give him a divorce. Time passes, the affair continues whenever time and place permit, but then, Paul''s young son finds out about Rae and Rae''s back-street world begins to crumble.', 'Ambitious but thwarted, Rae Smith meets handsome Marine Paul Saxon, (of the Saxon department store chain), as he passes through Lincoln, Nebraska, on his way home from World War II. There''s a definite spark between them but circumstances intervene and he leaves town without her. Later she learns he''s married. Determined to make it as a fashion designer, Rae moves to New York and becomes a great success. One day she happens to meet Paul again and again there''s that spark but he''s still married so, as a form of escape, Rae moves to Rome to set up shop. Once again she meets Paul and finally they begin an actual affair since Paul''s shrewish, drunken wife, Liz, won''t give him a divorce. Time passes, the affair continues whenever time and place permit, but then, Paul''s young son finds out about Rae and Rae''s back-street world begins to crumble.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xTxEV8GW0ucigMVzps6tGUwBWDB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43017'),
  ('921875569049324539', 'Back Street Girls: Gokudoruzu', 2019, 'Action, Comedy', 'Keinosuke Hara', 'Shoichiro Masumoto', 'Natsumi Okamoto, Ruka Matsuda, Akane Sakanoue, Jin Shirasu, Masato Hanazawa, Reiya Masaki, Nana Asakawa, Koichi Iwaki', null, 'Three male gangsters are forced by their boss into becoming a trio of female pop singers.', 'Three male gangsters are forced by their boss into becoming a trio of female pop singers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/liv8t2cDPfXI7jPehzSZQY7FuF2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:572630'),
  ('771669843605898827', 'Back Streets of Paris', 1946, 'Drama', 'Marcel Blistène, Jacques Feyder', 'Jacques Viot', 'Françoise Rosay, Paul Meurisse, Andrée Clément, Simone Signoret, Paul Demange, Jeannette Batti, Jacques Dacqmine, André Roanne', null, 'Madame Rose runs a seedy hotel in a suburb of Paris. Strong-minded but without the least moral scruple, she once killed her husband whose honesty was a hindrance to her business. Under a suspended sentence, she now indulges in smuggling. One day, Victor, one of her former accomplices hounded by the police, finds sanctuary with her. During a drinking spree, he has the bad idea to entrust to her a suitcase filled with bank notes, a loot with which Victor hopes to rebuild his life in South America. But Rose, lured by temptation, betrays Victor, who is arrested by the police. However, he manages to escape with only one thing in mind, to take revenge on Rose...', 'Madame Rose runs a seedy hotel in a suburb of Paris. Strong-minded but without the least moral scruple, she once killed her husband whose honesty was a hindrance to her business. Under a suspended sentence, she now indulges in smuggling. One day, Victor, one of her former accomplices hounded by the police, finds sanctuary with her. During a drinking spree, he has the bad idea to entrust to her a suitcase filled with bank notes, a loot with which Victor hopes to rebuild his life in South America. But Rose, lured by temptation, betrays Victor, who is arrested by the police. However, he manages to escape with only one thing in mind, to take revenge on Rose...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4jAlsHZSIElwqfhUMbiNUHkU3z5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:95257'),
  ('315596768798434064', 'Back Then', 2021, 'Comedy, Drama, History', 'Kinga Dębska, Alina Trybiło-Falana, Andrzej Wojciechowski', 'Kinga Dębska', 'Kinga Preis, Adam Woronowicz, Ewa Wiśniewska, Barbara Papis, Alicja Warchocka, Milena Lisiecka, Przemysław Bluszcz, Katarzyna Kwiatkowska', null, 'Marta is a romantic and a loser in school. She shares a room with her sister Kasia and grandma, who tells her granddaughters insurgency stories instead of fairy tales. In the room behind the wall, the parents - Tadek and Elżbieta - live their married life. He is an intelligent constantly humiliated by the state, he also makes his own moonshine after work and silently envies his prosperous brother in law. She is the leader of the "Solidarity" union at work, with the need for freedom and a dream to get out of Poland. The real adventure for the family starts when they manage to get their dream orange Fiat 126p. Ela and Tadek discover their appetite for trading and trips abroad, and the growing Marta will fall in love for the first time.', 'Marta is a romantic and a loser in school. She shares a room with her sister Kasia and grandma, who tells her granddaughters insurgency stories instead of fairy tales. In the room behind the wall, the parents - Tadek and Elżbieta - live their married life. He is an intelligent constantly humiliated by the state, he also makes his own moonshine after work and silently envies his prosperous brother in law. She is the leader of the "Solidarity" union at work, with the need for freedom and a dream to get out of Poland. The real adventure for the family starts when they manage to get their dream orange Fiat 126p. Ela and Tadek discover their appetite for trading and trips abroad, and the growing Marta will fall in love for the first time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/OlqnsMeaIhz92d7HEAWEDncCs9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:866237'),
  ('101458744363271573', 'Back to 1942', 2012, 'War, Drama', 'Feng Xiaogang, Lü Yue', 'Liu Zhenyun', 'Zhang Guoli, Xu Fan, Zhang Mo, Zhang Hanyu, Chen Daoming, Adrien Brody, Tim Robbins, Wang Ziwen', 'NR', 'In 1942, Henan Province was devastated by one of the most tragic famines in modern Chinese history, resulting in the deaths of at least three million men, women and children. Although the primary cause of the famine was a severe drought, it was exacerbated by locusts, windstorms, earthquakes, epidemic disease and the corruption of the ruling Kuomintang government.', 'In 1942, Henan Province was devastated by one of the most tragic famines in modern Chinese history, resulting in the deaths of at least three million men, women and children. Although the primary cause of the famine was a severe drought, it was exacerbated by locusts, windstorms, earthquakes, epidemic disease and the corruption of the ruling Kuomintang government.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3VY5D7RrqnfEfmTTYKRsPgEMO5g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:139329'),
  ('1079561461959529826', 'Back to Back, Face to Face', 1994, 'Drama', 'Yang Yazhou, Huang Jianxin, Xu Xuezheng', 'Huang Jianxin, Sun Yi’an', 'Niu Zhen-Hua, Lei Kesheng, Li Qiang, Ju Hao, Liu Guoxiang, Xu Xuezheng, Haihai Lin, Wang Jinsong', null, 'Wang Shuangli is Deputy Director of the local Cultural Centre, and hopes to be appointed Director. However Old Ma is brought in from the country and installed as Director. This starts a long train of events with Wang''s cronies using the bureaucracy to try to oust the new director.', 'Wang Shuangli is Deputy Director of the local Cultural Centre, and hopes to be appointed Director. However Old Ma is brought in from the country and installed as Director. This starts a long train of events with Wang''s cronies using the bureaucracy to try to oust the new director.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5Rk2y9T7Cnz4jxQowlnquLMLAgI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:295279'),
  ('1112171160098640173', 'Back to Bataan', 1945, 'War, Drama', 'Edward Dmytryk, Nicholas Musuraca, Ruby Rosenberg', 'Ben Barzman, Richard H. Landau', 'John Wayne, Beulah Bondi, Anthony Quinn, Fely Franquelli, Richard Loo, Philip Ahn, Alex Havier, ''Ducky'' Louie', 'PG-13', 'An Army colonel leads a guerrilla campaign against the Japanese in the Philippines.', 'An Army colonel leads a guerrilla campaign against the Japanese in the Philippines.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3AQRnZbdjiAvabgrDMc3NfXPQkF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19096'),
  ('829887900891643967', 'Back to Black', 2024, 'Music, History, Drama', 'Sam Taylor-Johnson, Polly Morgan', 'Matt Greenhalgh', 'Marisa Abela, Jack O''Connell, Eddie Marsan, Lesley Manville, Juliet Cowan, Sam Buchanan, Pete Lee-Wilson, Thelma Ruby', 'R', 'The extraordinary story of Amy Winehouse’s early rise to fame from her early days in Camden through the making of her groundbreaking album, Back to Black that catapulted Winehouse to global fame. Told through Amy’s eyes and inspired by her deeply personal lyrics, the film explores and embraces the many layers of the iconic artist and the tumultuous love story at the center of one of the most legendary albums of all time.', 'The extraordinary story of Amy Winehouse’s early rise to fame from her early days in Camden through the making of her groundbreaking album, Back to Black that catapulted Winehouse to global fame. Told through Amy’s eyes and inspired by her deeply personal lyrics, the film explores and embraces the many layers of the iconic artist and the tumultuous love story at the center of one of the most legendary albums of all time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xHQEeUT3Ac4fTY72UeNrI75xLtE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:998846'),
  ('76348562124872039', 'Back to Burgundy', 2017, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Alexis Kavyrchine, Cédric Klapisch', 'Cédric Klapisch, Santiago Amigorena, Jean-Marc Roulot', 'Pio Marmaï, Ana Girardot, François Civil, Jean-Marc Roulot, María Valverde, Karidja Touré, Yamée Couture, Jean-Marie Winling', null, 'Jean left his hometown ten years ago. When his father falls ill, he comes back and reunites with his sister Juliette and his brother Jérémie. As seasons go by around their vineyard, they''ll have to trust each other again.', 'Jean left his hometown ten years ago. When his father falls ill, he comes back and reunites with his sister Juliette and his brother Jérémie. As seasons go by around their vineyard, they''ll have to trust each other again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m8Y433w0oaFyZnBUhXv5H180aqU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:432087'),
  ('860769506732461088', 'Back to Gaya', 2004, 'Animation, Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'Lenard Fritz Krawinkel, Holger Tappe', 'Don McEnery, Jan Berger, Bob Shaw', 'Michael Herbig, Torsten Münchow, Vanessa Petruo, Wolfgang Völz, Uwe Büschken, Klaus Sonnenschein, Bodo Wolf, Claudia Lössl', 'PG', 'The beautiful world of Gaya is home to two similar humanoid species: Zeldons who are the furry majority residents, and Snurks, who are goblin-like outcasts. But suddenly all Gayans are facing imminent danger when a magic stone which protects their world, "the Dalamite", is beamed away by a mysterious force. Three Snurks immediately go after it, hoping to be the heroes for once. They are shortly followed by some standout Zeldons: Zino the trouble-prone popular guy & his sidekick, clever but somewhat cowardly inventor Boo, as well as rebel princess Alanta. Their journey ends up leading them all on a dangerous interdimensional quest to find the stone, while they must also figure out a way to get back to Gaya.', 'The beautiful world of Gaya is home to two similar humanoid species: Zeldons who are the furry majority residents, and Snurks, who are goblin-like outcasts. But suddenly all Gayans are facing imminent danger when a magic stone which protects their world, "the Dalamite", is beamed away by a mysterious force. Three Snurks immediately go after it, hoping to be the heroes for once. They are shortly followed by some standout Zeldons: Zino the trouble-prone popular guy & his sidekick, clever but somewhat cowardly inventor Boo, as well as rebel princess Alanta. Their journey ends up leading them all on a dangerous interdimensional quest to find the stone, while they must also figure out a way to get back to Gaya.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/daqf0AgiiBAzbOyEJMn3LPr8HbZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10927'),
  ('670926895445004801', 'Back to Hannibal: The Return of Tom Sawyer and Huckleberry Finn', 1990, 'Adventure, Drama, TV Movie', 'Paul Krasny, James W. Roberson', 'Roy Johansen', 'Raphael Sbarge, Megan Follows, Mitchell Anderson, William Windom, Ned Beatty, Paul Winfield, Graham Jarvis, George Petrie', null, 'This is yet another telling of the adventures of Tom Sawyer and Huckleberry Finn as the two try to clear their friend Jim of murder charges.', 'This is yet another telling of the adventures of Tom Sawyer and Huckleberry Finn as the two try to clear their friend Jim of murder charges.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5OYGads5UWktlNdowg01VIJDJaZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:102936'),
  ('496672015301505132', 'Back to Mom''s', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Eric Lavaine, François Hernandez', 'Héctor Cabello Reyes, Eric Lavaine', 'Alexandra Lamy, Josiane Balasko, Mathilde Seigner, Philippe Lefebvre, Jérôme Commandeur, Didier Flamand, Cécile Rebboah, Guilaine Londez', null, 'At 40, Stephanie loses her job and is forced to move back in with her mother. She is welcomed with open arms to the joys of overheated apartment, Francis Cabrel playing on loop, Scrabble games and precious motherly advice on how to behave at the table and live her life.', 'At 40, Stephanie loses her job and is forced to move back in with her mother. She is welcomed with open arms to the joys of overheated apartment, Francis Cabrel playing on loop, Scrabble games and precious motherly advice on how to behave at the table and live her life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nAVRxYsTgr8bnsTFda8wPCgDE77.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:383869'),
