  ('691180813442570696', 'Back to Stay', 2011, 'Drama', 'Milagros Mumenthaler, Martín Frías, Dan Wechsler', 'Milagros Mumenthaler', 'María Canale, Martina Juncadella, Ailín Salas, Julián Tello, Andrés Granier, Sofia Bertolotto, Fernando Sáyago, Ana María Monti', null, 'Marina, Sofía and Violeta are three teenage sisters who have just suffered the loss of the grandmother who raised them. Each one will live the mourning in her own way, in a house inhabited by a myriad of memories, responsibilities and tensions.', 'Marina, Sofía and Violeta are three teenage sisters who have just suffered the loss of the grandmother who raised them. Each one will live the mourning in her own way, in a house inhabited by a myriad of memories, responsibilities and tensions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/71WCKP6gKyv4eGSfJj78JBm46W3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85544'),
  ('638008814207583592', 'Back to Switzerland', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Carlos Iglesias', 'Carlos Iglesias', 'Carlos Iglesias, Nieve de Medina, Javier Gutiérrez, Ángela del Salto, Isabel Blanco, Adrián Expósito, Luisber Santiago', null, 'Madrid, 1974. Six years have passed since Martin and his family have returned to Spain from Switzerland. A visit to their adopted country will bring complications.', 'Madrid, 1974. Six years have passed since Martin and his family have returned to Spain from Switzerland. A visit to their adopted country will bring complications.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eGx8qWvtJYmdIuXY7RHLPRx3sCj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:254129'),
  ('807584113249127950', 'Back to the 90s', 2015, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Thanika Jenjesda, Yanyong Kuruaungkoul, Chutharat Buaplod', 'Yanyong Kuruaungkoul', 'Dan Aaron Ramnarong, Pimchanok Luevisadpaibul, Chanintorn Jitpreeda, Chonlakarn Puangnoy, Achita Pramoj Na-Ayudhya, Vichuda Pindum, Kreangsak Riantong, Likit Sittiphan', null, 'A teenager is accidentally transported back in time where he meets his young parents during their college days. He then decides to alter the events to revive his parents'' lifeless marriage.', 'A teenager is accidentally transported back in time where he meets his young parents during their college days. He then decides to alter the events to revive his parents'' lifeless marriage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ljyqzjdLISSupHLqNbpnNR0g2wu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:358329'),
  ('828527756252533880', 'Back to the Beach', 1987, 'Comedy, Music', 'Lyndall Hobbs, Bruce Surtees, James Lansbury', 'Steve Meerson, Peter Krikes, Chris Thompson', 'Frankie Avalon, Annette Funicello, Lori Loughlin, Tommy Hinkley, Demian Slade, Joe Holland, John Calvin, David Bowe', 'PG', 'Cowabunga! The surfing ''60s ride into the new wave as Frankie and Annette star in this hip update of their old-time, good-time beach movies. With special appearances by Bob Denver, Tony Dow, Pee-Wee Herman, Jerry Mathers and other familiar faces. Frankie and Annette grow up and have kids in the midwest. They return to LA to visit their daughter who is shacked up with her boyfriend and tries to hide the fact. They begin to have marriage problems when Frankie runs into Connie, who has erected a shrine to him in her night club. Their punk son has joined up with the local surf toughs, and things all come to a head when the toughs challenge the good guys to a surfing duel', 'Cowabunga! The surfing ''60s ride into the new wave as Frankie and Annette star in this hip update of their old-time, good-time beach movies. With special appearances by Bob Denver, Tony Dow, Pee-Wee Herman, Jerry Mathers and other familiar faces. Frankie and Annette grow up and have kids in the midwest. They return to LA to visit their daughter who is shacked up with her boyfriend and tries to hide the fact. They begin to have marriage problems when Frankie runs into Connie, who has erected a shrine to him in her night club. Their punk son has joined up with the local surf toughs, and things all come to a head when the toughs challenge the good guys to a surfing duel', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6LwAXK0nmeahNgoJz5sSigSwdwz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26477'),
  ('1057349789427661736', 'Back to the Future', 1985, 'Adventure, Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Robert Zemeckis, Dean Cundey, Pamela M. Eilerson', 'Robert Zemeckis, Bob Gale', 'Michael J. Fox, Christopher Lloyd, Crispin Glover, Lea Thompson, Claudia Wells, Thomas F. Wilson, Marc McClure, Wendie Jo Sperber', 'PG', 'Eighties teenager Marty McFly is accidentally sent back in time to 1955, inadvertently disrupting his parents'' first meeting and attracting his mother''s romantic interest. Marty must repair the damage to history by rekindling his parents'' romance and - with the help of his eccentric inventor friend Doc Brown - return to 1985.', 'Eighties teenager Marty McFly is accidentally sent back in time to 1955, inadvertently disrupting his parents'' first meeting and attracting his mother''s romantic interest. Marty must repair the damage to history by rekindling his parents'' romance and - with the help of his eccentric inventor friend Doc Brown - return to 1985.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vN5B5WgYscRGcQpVhHl6p9DDTP0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:105'),
  ('713739449051494697', 'Back to the Future Part II', 1989, 'Adventure, Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Robert Zemeckis, Dean Cundey, Lynn Christopher', 'Bob Gale', 'Michael J. Fox, Christopher Lloyd, Lea Thompson, Thomas F. Wilson, Elisabeth Shue, James Tolkan, Jeffrey Weissman, Casey Siemaszko', 'PG', 'Marty and Doc are at it again as the time-traveling duo head to 2015 to nip some McFly family woes in the bud. But things go awry thanks to bully Biff Tannen and a pesky sports almanac. In a last-ditch attempt to set things straight, Marty finds himself bound for 1955 and face to face with his teenage parents -- again.', 'Marty and Doc are at it again as the time-traveling duo head to 2015 to nip some McFly family woes in the bud. But things go awry thanks to bully Biff Tannen and a pesky sports almanac. In a last-ditch attempt to set things straight, Marty finds himself bound for 1955 and face to face with his teenage parents -- again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hQq8xZe5uLjFzSBt4LanNP7SQjl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:165'),
  ('304260602920026990', 'Back to the Future Part III', 1990, 'Adventure, Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Robert Zemeckis, Dean Cundey, Erin M. Cummins', 'Bob Gale', 'Michael J. Fox, Christopher Lloyd, Mary Steenburgen, Thomas F. Wilson, Lea Thompson, Elisabeth Shue, Matt Clark, Richard Dysart', 'PG', 'The final installment finds Marty digging the trusty DeLorean out of a mineshaft and looking for Doc in the Wild West of 1885. But when their time machine breaks down, the travelers are stranded in a land of spurs. More problems arise when Doc falls for pretty schoolteacher Clara Clayton, and Marty tangles with Buford Tannen.', 'The final installment finds Marty digging the trusty DeLorean out of a mineshaft and looking for Doc in the Wild West of 1885. But when their time machine breaks down, the travelers are stranded in a land of spurs. More problems arise when Doc falls for pretty schoolteacher Clara Clayton, and Marty tangles with Buford Tannen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/crzoVQnMzIrRfHtQw0tLBirNfVg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:196'),
  ('936308138581206644', 'Back to the Past', 2025, 'Science Fiction, Action, Comedy', 'Jack Lai Jan-Lung, Ng Yuen-Fai, Sammo Hung Kam-Bo', 'Lily He', 'Louis Koo, Raymond Lam Fung, Bai Baihe, Jessica Hsuan, Sonija Kwok Sin-Nae, Joyce Tang Lai-Ming, Michael Miu Kiu-Wai, Louis Cheung', null, 'In the Qin Dynasty, time-traveller Hong Siu-lung has lived in seclusion with his family for twenty years. Yet every step he takes remains under the watchful eye of his former disciple, now the Qin Emperor. On the brink of ultimate power after conquering the six warring states, the emperor is suddenly ambushed by a mysterious team wielding advanced weapons clearly originating from Hong’s time. Drawn together by fate again, Hong and Qin Emperor are forced to confront the long-buried conflict between them, because the future now depends on how they settle their past.', 'In the Qin Dynasty, time-traveller Hong Siu-lung has lived in seclusion with his family for twenty years. Yet every step he takes remains under the watchful eye of his former disciple, now the Qin Emperor. On the brink of ultimate power after conquering the six warring states, the emperor is suddenly ambushed by a mysterious team wielding advanced weapons clearly originating from Hong’s time. Drawn together by fate again, Hong and Qin Emperor are forced to confront the long-buried conflict between them, because the future now depends on how they settle their past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h3OUaPfCaFmzwB2eMHik50RsXlP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:650524'),
  ('994983840897179397', 'Back to the Present', 2021, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Andrea Maia, Antonio Fornari, Rocco Marra', 'Augusto Fornari, Antonio Fornari, Andrea Maia', 'Stefano Fresi, Ilaria Spada, Simone Montedoro, Marco Mazzoli, Augusto Fornari, Luca Angeletti', null, 'While he is speaking on the phone with a member of his staff, Filippo has a severe headache and faints. As soon as he regains consciousness, he calls his friend Pippo for help and asks him to invite the group of old friends to join, too. Little by little the four friends remind him of happy moments shared in the past and Filippo gradually manages to remember with their help….But something unhappy comes back to their mind….', 'While he is speaking on the phone with a member of his staff, Filippo has a severe headache and faints. As soon as he regains consciousness, he calls his friend Pippo for help and asks him to invite the group of old friends to join, too. Little by little the four friends remind him of happy moments shared in the past and Filippo gradually manages to remember with their help….But something unhappy comes back to their mind….', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ixnRFEbQZXrizFiq3xlO7W60IXw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:993169'),
  ('895588312834829372', 'Back to the Secret Garden', 2000, 'Fantasy, Drama, Family', 'Michael Tuchner', 'Joe Wiesenfeld', 'Joan Plowright, George Baker, Florence Hoath, Aled Roberts, Cherie Lunghi, Leigh Lawson, Gwyneth Powell, Camilla Belle', null, 'A youngster living in a stately home discovers the magical garden Mary, Colin & Dickon stumbled across years before - but faces a battle with the housekeeper over whether to nurture it.', 'A youngster living in a stately home discovers the magical garden Mary, Colin & Dickon stumbled across years before - but faces a battle with the housekeeper over whether to nurture it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1dwwbomp6Q0dx5D3s1s1Pnbg4BH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29941'),
  ('758549182596319108', 'Back to the Wall', 1958, 'Crime, Drama', 'Édouard Molinaro, Pierre-André Bertrand, Jacques Brizzio', null, 'Jeanne Moreau, Gérard Oury, Philippe Nicaud, Claire Maurier, Gérard Buhr, George Cusin, Robert Bazil, Jean Degrave', 'NR', 'Rich industrialist Jacques Decret learns his wife Gloria is having an affair with a young actor. For revenge, he bombards her with anonymous letters, convincing her that her lover is the culprit while Gloria desperately seeks a way out.', 'Rich industrialist Jacques Decret learns his wife Gloria is having an affair with a young actor. For revenge, he bombards her with anonymous letters, convincing her that her lover is the culprit while Gloria desperately seeks a way out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2Lch5zdcpXrp0hr1DQvIwfSciHV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:105670'),
