  ('421598268159452481', 'Back to the Woods', 1937, 'Comedy', 'Jack White', 'Andrew Bennison', 'Curly Howard, Larry Fine, Moe Howard, Vernon Dent, Charles Dorety, William Irving, Bud Jamison, Ethelreda Leopold', 'NR', 'Set in colonial times, the stooges are convicted criminals who are banished from England to the American colonies. When they arrive, they find that the colonists are starving because the local Indians won''t let them on their hunting grounds. The stooges go hunting any, and after a wild chase, are captured by the Indians. They escape and another wild chase ensues.', 'Set in colonial times, the stooges are convicted criminals who are banished from England to the American colonies. When they arrive, they find that the colonists are starving because the local Indians won''t let them on their hunting grounds. The stooges go hunting any, and after a wild chase, are captured by the Indians. They escape and another wild chase ensues.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hspud6RFRoQWzgRBoOtVqOr8sls.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115815'),
