  ('832183214084350351', 'Backbeat', 1994, 'Drama, Music', 'Iain Softley, Ian Wilson, Cliff Lanning', 'Michael Thomas, Iain Softley, Stephen Ward', 'Stephen Dorff, Ian Hart, Sheryl Lee, Gary Bakewell, Chris O''Neill, Scot Williams, Paul Duckworth, Kai Wiesinger', 'R', 'Chronicles the early days of The Beatles in Hamburg, Germany. The film focuses primarily on the relationship between Stuart Sutcliffe, John Lennon, and Sutcliffe''s girlfriend Astrid Kirchherr.', 'Chronicles the early days of The Beatles in Hamburg, Germany. The film focuses primarily on the relationship between Stuart Sutcliffe, John Lennon, and Sutcliffe''s girlfriend Astrid Kirchherr.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1BuFx7P8veAUUZDXqdMNhtdCUSM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12635'),
  ('572614074787505623', 'Backcountry', 2015, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Adam MacDonald, Christian Bielz', 'Adam MacDonald', 'Missy Peregrym, Jeff Roop, Eric Balfour, Nicholas Campbell', 'R', 'A couple on a deep-wilderness hike become hopelessly lost within an aggressive black bear''s territory.', 'A couple on a deep-wilderness hike become hopelessly lost within an aggressive black bear''s territory.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AdIkDCWcBqv1B10ncm71sMiqEEF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:228973'),
  ('76205048110820421', 'Backdraft', 1991, 'Drama, Thriller, Action, Crime', 'Ron Howard, Mikael Salomon, Jack Gallagher', 'Gregory Widen', 'Kurt Russell, William Baldwin, Robert De Niro, Donald Sutherland, Jennifer Jason Leigh, Scott Glenn, Rebecca De Mornay, Jason Gedrick', 'R', 'Two feuding siblings carrying on a heroic family tradition as Chicago firefighters. But when a puzzling series of arson attacks is reported, they are forced to set aside their differences to solve the mystery surrounding these crimes.', 'Two feuding siblings carrying on a heroic family tradition as Chicago firefighters. But when a puzzling series of arson attacks is reported, they are forced to set aside their differences to solve the mystery surrounding these crimes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bymJtYNIdiAiBR1LRetaJXbfryc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2924'),
  ('263816335785566294', 'Backdraft 2', 2019, 'Action, Crime, Drama', 'Gonzalo López-Gallego, José David Montero, Miguel Gallego', 'Gregory Widen', 'Joe Anderson, Alisha Bailey, Jessamine-Bliss Bell, William Baldwin, Donald Sutherland, Patrick Walshe McBride, Alastair Mackenzie, Mark Arnold', 'R', 'Years after the original Backdraft, Sean, son of the late Steve "Bull" McCaffrey, is assigned to investigate a deadly fire only to realize it is something much more sinister.', 'Years after the original Backdraft, Sean, son of the late Steve "Bull" McCaffrey, is assigned to investigate a deadly fire only to realize it is something much more sinister.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d5QfKjWG5UcEbbo7btAmXnJpaOn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:587808'),
  ('574025469985729398', 'Backfire', 1950, 'Mystery, Crime, Thriller', 'Vincent Sherman, Carl E. Guthrie, Ray Heindorf', 'Lawrence B. Marcus, Ivan Goff, Ben Roberts', 'Viveca Lindfors, Dane Clark, Virginia Mayo, Edmond O''Brien, Gordon MacRae, Ed Begley, Frances Robinson, Richard Rober', 'NR', 'When he''s discharged from a military hospital, ex-GI Bob Corey goes on a search for his army buddy Steve Connolly. A reformed crook, Connolly is on the lam from a trumped-up murder rap, and Corey hopes to clear his pal. Tagging along is Army nurse Julie Benson, who has fallen for Corey.', 'When he''s discharged from a military hospital, ex-GI Bob Corey goes on a search for his army buddy Steve Connolly. A reformed crook, Connolly is on the lam from a trumped-up murder rap, and Corey hopes to clear his pal. Tagging along is Army nurse Julie Benson, who has fallen for Corey.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2qPDrYCedMnhiuXNedlzAYd2pRK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32929'),
  ('793210004842480319', 'Backfire', 1964, 'Crime, Adventure, Comedy', 'Jean Becker, Edmond Séchan, Costa-Gavras', 'Maurice Fabre, Jean Becker, Didier Goulard', 'Jean-Paul Belmondo, Jean Seberg, Enrico Maria Salerno, Renate Ewert, Jean-Pierre Marielle, Wolfgang Preiss, Diana Lorys, Fernando Rey', 'NR', 'A greedy gold smuggler hires a handsome hero to transport a stolen fortune to a new hideout accompanied by the smuggler''s sexy girlfriend.', 'A greedy gold smuggler hires a handsome hero to transport a stolen fortune to a new hideout accompanied by the smuggler''s sexy girlfriend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cLojWssdCS3svE4BUv4vsofsnk4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:133827'),
  ('719355271047648233', 'Backfire', 1988, 'Thriller, Drama, Mystery', 'Tak Fujimoto, Donald Hauer, Richard Coleman', 'Rebecca Reynolds, Larry Brand', 'Karen Allen, Keith Carradine, Jeff Fahey, Bernie Casey, Dean Paul Martin, Virginia Capers, Philip Sterling, Dinah Manoff', 'R', 'Mara McAndrew''s marriage is falling apart. Her husband, Donnie, a Vietnam veteran, suffers troubling flashbacks about the war, leaving him unresponsive to her needs. Mara wants out, but she also wants Donnie''s money. When Mara meets a mysterious stranger, Reed, at a local bar, she believes she has found the right person to help her out of her predicament. But Mara worries that Donnie''s sister, Jill, is on to her.', 'Mara McAndrew''s marriage is falling apart. Her husband, Donnie, a Vietnam veteran, suffers troubling flashbacks about the war, leaving him unresponsive to her needs. Mara wants out, but she also wants Donnie''s money. When Mara meets a mysterious stranger, Reed, at a local bar, she believes she has found the right person to help her out of her predicament. But Mara worries that Donnie''s sister, Jill, is on to her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tOSeaK36x7Z5xZD3BXf4A7ylRGr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:181753'),
  ('932479769030374698', 'Backflip!! The Movie', 2022, 'Animation, Drama, Comedy', 'Yuka Shibata, Ryo Ito, Toshimasa Kuroyanagi', 'Toshizo Nemoto', 'Shimba Tsuchiya, Kaito Ishikawa, Daisuke Ono, Takashi Kondo, Hiro Shimono, Hiroshi Kamiya, Ayumu Murase, Katsuyuki Konishi', null, 'Ever since coming across the world of boy’s rhythmic gymnastics during the last summer of junior-high, Shotaro Futaba has become fascinated with the sport. So when he enters Soshokuan Private High School, known as Ao High for short, he heads to the boy’s rhythmic gymnastics club, where he meets unique seniors and the ace of the team, Ryoya Misato. The members of the club each have their own passions, but they’ve put it all on the line with a single goal in mind. Now the next stage in their journey has arrived: the inter-high competition!', 'Ever since coming across the world of boy’s rhythmic gymnastics during the last summer of junior-high, Shotaro Futaba has become fascinated with the sport. So when he enters Soshokuan Private High School, known as Ao High for short, he heads to the boy’s rhythmic gymnastics club, where he meets unique seniors and the ace of the team, Ryoya Misato. The members of the club each have their own passions, but they’ve put it all on the line with a single goal in mind. Now the next stage in their journey has arrived: the inter-high competition!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qZ68mGQaljxo5qrazKCQ47hlSUJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:952175'),
  ('881107581498290760', 'Backgammon Game', 1895, 'Documentary', 'Louis Lumière', null, 'Rose Lumière, Juliette Winckler, Pierre Bellingard, Antoine Féraud, Charles-Albert Winckler, Marguerite Lumière, Lazare Sellier', null, 'A man and a woman, observed by others, are playing a game of Tric-trac, a French variant of Backgammon. During the course of the game, the man gets caught red-handed, which results in him closing the game board.', 'A man and a woman, observed by others, are playing a game of Tric-trac, a French variant of Backgammon. During the course of the game, the man gets caught red-handed, which results in him closing the game board.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2w4sxR8OfZWP5qHL4ct7v5xGVo8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:194236'),
  ('474378010592114557', 'Background to Danger', 1943, 'Thriller, War', 'Raoul Walsh, Tony Gaudio', 'William Faulkner, Daniel Fuchs', 'George Raft, Brenda Marshall, Sydney Greenstreet, Peter Lorre, Osa Massen, Turhan Bey, Willard Robertson, Kurt Katch', 'NR', 'An American gets caught up in wartime action in Turkey.', 'An American gets caught up in wartime action in Turkey.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mepMDzGmh0Fmzq0CuWsNXZTBm6m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34944'),
  ('850827227684854146', 'Backlash', 1947, 'Crime, Mystery', 'Eugene Forde, Benjamin H. Kline, Earl Bellamy', 'Irving Elman', 'Jean Rogers, Richard Travis, Larry J. Blake, John Eldredge, Leonard Strong, Robert Shayne, Louise Currie, Douglas Fowley', 'NR', 'In a series of flashbacks, shows that attorney John Morland has given a lift to a hitchhiker who turns out to be a murderer. As a result, Morland himself is implicated in a killing. A pair of detectives discover that Morland has been having business problems and no end of difficulties with his wife Catherine. The trail of clues leads to a surprising revelation.', 'In a series of flashbacks, shows that attorney John Morland has given a lift to a hitchhiker who turns out to be a murderer. As a result, Morland himself is implicated in a killing. A pair of detectives discover that Morland has been having business problems and no end of difficulties with his wife Catherine. The trail of clues leads to a surprising revelation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1WnmubVdek4oH8wVjg2PFqcgccj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44101'),
  ('908136590738896366', 'Backlash', 1956, 'Western', 'John Sturges, John Sherwood, Irving Glassberg', 'Borden Chase', 'Richard Widmark, Donna Reed, William Campbell, John McIntire, Barton MacLane, Harry Morgan, Robert J. Wilke, Jack Lambert', 'NR', 'Jim Slater''s father (whom he never knew) died in the Apache ambush at Gila Valley, and Jim is searching for the one survivor, who supposedly went for help but disappeared with a lot of gold. In the process, he gets several people gunning for him, and he keeps meeting liberated woman Karyl Orton, who may be on a similar mission. Renewed Apache hostilities and an impending range war provide complications.', 'Jim Slater''s father (whom he never knew) died in the Apache ambush at Gila Valley, and Jim is searching for the one survivor, who supposedly went for help but disappeared with a lot of gold. In the process, he gets several people gunning for him, and he keeps meeting liberated woman Karyl Orton, who may be on a similar mission. Renewed Apache hostilities and an impending range war provide complications.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ny5zwvwmToqeHrLSlJMGk4wXtGZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62648'),
  ('494106249687229040', 'Backroads', 1997, 'Romance, Drama', 'Emilio Martínez Lázaro', 'Ignacio Martínez de Pisón', 'Antonio Resines, Maribel Verdú, Fernando Ramallo, Jesús Bonilla, Miriam Díaz-Aroca, Maite Blasco, Ramón Langa, Montserrat Carulla', null, 'Spain, 1974. A teenager and his father are traveling in a car that is the only property they have. Their life is a continuous move by desolate coastal apartments in the tourism low season. When forced to change route and get away from sea, their lives will change dramatically.', 'Spain, 1974. A teenager and his father are traveling in a car that is the only property they have. Their life is a continuous move by desolate coastal apartments in the tourism low season. When forced to change route and get away from sea, their lives will change dramatically.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dwpOso278gaYZLYIpCVcUqxJlzX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:103626'),
