  ('960234683401718068', 'Bad Boy Bubby', 1993, 'Crime, Drama, Comedy', 'Rolf de Heer, Ian Jones', 'Rolf de Heer', 'Nicholas Hope, Ralph Cotterill, Claire Benito, Syd Brisbane, Ullie Birvé, Natalie Carr, Celine O''Leary, Carmel Johnson', 'NR', 'Bad Boy Bubby is just that: a bad boy. So bad, in fact, that his mother has kept him locked in their house for his entire thirty years, convincing him that the air outside is poisonous. After a visit from his estranged father, circumstances force Bubby into the waiting world, a place which is just as unusual to him as he is to the world.', 'Bad Boy Bubby is just that: a bad boy. So bad, in fact, that his mother has kept him locked in their house for his entire thirty years, convincing him that the air outside is poisonous. After a visit from his estranged father, circumstances force Bubby into the waiting world, a place which is just as unusual to him as he is to the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fERbcofifizJmDt892lFcrIYhFh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14135'),
  ('88283353574027321', 'Bad Boys', 1983, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Bruce Surtees, Rick Rosenthal, Donald E. Thorin', 'Richard Di Lello', 'Sean Penn, Reni Santoni, Jim Moody, Eric Gurry, Esai Morales, Ally Sheedy, Clancy Brown, Robert Lee Rush', 'R', 'Mick O''Brien is a young Chicago street thug torn between a life of petty crime and the love of his girlfriend. But when the heist of a local drug dealer goes tragically wrong Mick is sentenced to a brutal juvenile prison where violence is a rite of passage and respect is measured in vengeance.', 'Mick O''Brien is a young Chicago street thug torn between a life of petty crime and the love of his girlfriend. But when the heist of a local drug dealer goes tragically wrong Mick is sentenced to a brutal juvenile prison where violence is a rite of passage and respect is measured in vengeance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5nHZ3wflOifKJMUcTCw0isKhmCv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13633'),
  ('16610775823235322', 'Bad Boys', 1995, 'Action, Comedy, Crime, Thriller', 'Howard Atherton, Michael Bay, Carlos A. Menéndez', 'Michael Barrie, Jim Mulholland, Doug Richardson', 'Will Smith, Martin Lawrence, Téa Leoni, Tchéky Karyo, Joe Pantoliano, Theresa Randle, Marg Helgenberger, Nestor Serrano', 'R', 'Marcus Burnett is a henpecked family man. Mike Lowrey is a footloose and fancy free ladies'' man. Both Miami policemen, they have 72 hours to reclaim a consignment of drugs stolen from under their station''s nose. To complicate matters, in order to get the assistance of the sole witness to a murder, they have to pretend to be each other.', 'Marcus Burnett is a henpecked family man. Mike Lowrey is a footloose and fancy free ladies'' man. Both Miami policemen, they have 72 hours to reclaim a consignment of drugs stolen from under their station''s nose. To complicate matters, in order to get the assistance of the sole witness to a murder, they have to pretend to be each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x1ygBecKHfXX4M2kRhmFKWfWbJc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9737'),
  ('975839726117328933', 'Bad Boys for Life', 2020, 'Thriller, Action, Crime', 'Charlie Daboub, Nathan Krochmal, Adil El Arbi', 'Joe Carnahan, Chris Bremner, Peter Craig', 'Will Smith, Martin Lawrence, Vanessa Hudgens, Alexander Ludwig, Charles Melton, Paola Nuñez, Kate del Castillo, Nicky Jam', 'R', 'Marcus and Mike are forced to confront new threats, career changes, and midlife crises as they join the newly created elite team AMMO of the Miami police department to take down the ruthless Armando Armas, the vicious leader of a Miami drug cartel.', 'Marcus and Mike are forced to confront new threats, career changes, and midlife crises as they join the newly created elite team AMMO of the Miami police department to take down the ruthless Armando Armas, the vicious leader of a Miami drug cartel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y95lQLnuNKdPAzw9F9Ab8kJ80c3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38700'),
  ('850473048506580986', 'Bad Boys II', 2003, 'Action, Crime, Comedy', 'Michael Bay, Amir Mokri, David B. Nowell', 'Ron Shelton, Jerry Stahl', 'Martin Lawrence, Will Smith, Jordi Mollà, Gabrielle Union, Peter Stormare, Theresa Randle, Joe Pantoliano, Michael Shannon', 'R', 'Detectives Marcus Burnett and Mike Lowrey of the Miami Narcotics Task Force are tasked with stopping the flow of the drug Ecstasy into Miami. They track the drugs to the whacked-out Cuban drug lord Johnny Tapia, who is also involved in a bloody war with Russian and Haitian mobsters. If that isn''t bad enough, there''s tension between the two detectives when Marcus discovers that playboy Mike is secretly romancing Marcus’ sister, Syd.', 'Detectives Marcus Burnett and Mike Lowrey of the Miami Narcotics Task Force are tasked with stopping the flow of the drug Ecstasy into Miami. They track the drugs to the whacked-out Cuban drug lord Johnny Tapia, who is also involved in a bloody war with Russian and Haitian mobsters. If that isn''t bad enough, there''s tension between the two detectives when Marcus discovers that playboy Mike is secretly romancing Marcus’ sister, Syd.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yCvB5fG5aEPqa1St7ihY6KEAsHD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8961'),
  ('543827571980361964', 'Bad Boys: A True Story', 2003, 'Drama, Comedy, Crime', 'Aleksi Mäkelä, Marja Pyykkö, Pini Hellstedt', 'Pekka Lehtosaari', 'Peter Franzén, Niko Saarela, Lauri Nurkse, Jasper Pääkkönen, Vesa-Matti Loiri, Elsa Saisio, Risto Tuorila, Hannu-Pekka Björkman', null, 'The story bases on four Finnish brothers, nicknamed ''the Eura Daltons'' who received nation-wide notoriety for tearing gas pumps apart when they needed cash.', 'The story bases on four Finnish brothers, nicknamed ''the Eura Daltons'' who received nation-wide notoriety for tearing gas pumps apart when they needed cash.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6LofhRTJEOuLoSzEobxDFLuCbEb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20164'),
  ('855828416761151492', 'Bad Boys: Ride or Die', 2024, 'Action, Comedy, Crime', 'Adil El Arbi, Bilall Fallah, Robrecht Heyvaert', 'Chris Bremner, Will Beall', 'Will Smith, Martin Lawrence, Vanessa Hudgens, Alexander Ludwig, Paola Nuñez, Eric Dane, Ioan Gruffudd, Jacob Scipio', 'R', 'After their late former Captain is framed, Lowrey and Burnett try to clear his name, only to end up on the run themselves.', 'After their late former Captain is framed, Lowrey and Burnett try to clear his name, only to end up on the run themselves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oGythE98MYleE6mZlGs5oBGkux1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:573435'),
