  ('108822614155770545', 'Bad Candy', 2021, 'Horror', 'Blake Studwell, Scott B. Hansen, Scott B. Hansen', 'Desiree Connell, Scott B. Hansen', 'Zach Galligan, Corey Taylor, Derek Russo, Brittney Rae, Haley Leary, Kevin Wayne, Alexandra Lucchesi, Audrey Williams', 'NR', 'On Halloween night in New Salem, Radio DJs Chilly Billy and Paul tell a twisted anthology of terrifying local myths. Residents of the small-town experience horrifying paranormal encounters that lead them to a grim end.', 'On Halloween night in New Salem, Radio DJs Chilly Billy and Paul tell a twisted anthology of terrifying local myths. Residents of the small-town experience horrifying paranormal encounters that lead them to a grim end.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9HRQiPxTGsUpP9hqCC1R5D1gQZT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:520963'),
