  ('633863974386424346', 'Bad Day to Go Fishing', 2009, 'Drama, Comedy, Thriller', 'Álvaro Brechner, Sergio de León, Matías Estevez Ciganda', 'Gary Piquer, Juan Carlos Onetti, Álvaro Brechner', 'Gary Piquer, Jouko Ahola, Antonella Costa, César Troncoso, Roberto Pankow, Bruno Aldecosea, Alfonso Tort, Cristian Casañol', null, 'Jacob van Oppen, the former strongest man on earth, and his manager Orsini, who calls himself "the Prince", make a good living by traveling around small South American towns and organizing wrestling exhibitions. Arriving in Santa Maria, they are met with uncommon enthusiasm, the local newspaper wants to sponsor the fight, helping hands placard the town with posters, and an open call is made for a worthy adversary. Ever so resourceful, Orsini knows how to find the right combatant, but fishing in Santa Maria could lead to a bigger catch than he''d hoped for.', 'Jacob van Oppen, the former strongest man on earth, and his manager Orsini, who calls himself "the Prince", make a good living by traveling around small South American towns and organizing wrestling exhibitions. Arriving in Santa Maria, they are met with uncommon enthusiasm, the local newspaper wants to sponsor the fight, helping hands placard the town with posters, and an open call is made for a worthy adversary. Ever so resourceful, Orsini knows how to find the right combatant, but fishing in Santa Maria could lead to a bigger catch than he''d hoped for.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lQJCrr6ypVgHdCQYI9BBPq2GHvN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61718'),
  ('568040167275096373', 'Bad Director', 2024, 'Comedy', 'Oskar Roehler, Philipp Sichler', 'Oskar Roehler', 'Oliver Masucci, Bella Dayne, Götz Otto, Anne Ratte-Polle, Ralf Richter, Samuel Finzi, Marios Gavrilis, Elie Kaempfen', null, 'Director Gregor Samsa, washed-up and in his late fifties, is reviewing his life. Having wasted it as a cultural worker doesn''t exactly add to his joy.', 'Director Gregor Samsa, washed-up and in his late fifties, is reviewing his life. Having wasted it as a cultural worker doesn''t exactly add to his joy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3TzW1ZKbMgt9hNsetvIPzErB9aG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1190993'),
  ('151735555997116542', 'Bad Dreams', 1988, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Verónica González Rubio, Brent Brewington, John R. Woodward', 'Andrew Fleming, Steven E. de Souza', 'Jennifer Rubin, Bruce Abbott, Richard Lynch, Dean Cameron, Harris Yulin, Susan Barnes, John Scott Clough, E. G. Daily', 'R', 'Unity Field, a "free love" cult from the ''70s, is mostly remembered for its notorious mass suicide led by Harris, its charismatic leader. While all members are supposed to burn in a fire together, young Cynthia is spared by chance. Years later, the nightmare of Unity Field remains buried in her mind. But when those around Cynthia start killing themselves, and she begins having visions of Harris, she may be forced to confront the past -- before it confronts her.', 'Unity Field, a "free love" cult from the ''70s, is mostly remembered for its notorious mass suicide led by Harris, its charismatic leader. While all members are supposed to burn in a fire together, young Cynthia is spared by chance. Years later, the nightmare of Unity Field remains buried in her mind. But when those around Cynthia start killing themselves, and she begins having visions of Harris, she may be forced to confront the past -- before it confronts her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jIsulLLmM50PC7fG5UwV1jO43xo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59797'),
  ('16159891415734595', 'Bad Education', 2019, 'Drama, Crime, History', 'Cory Finley, Lyle Vincent, Peter Thorell', 'Mike Makowsky', 'Hugh Jackman, Allison Janney, Geraldine Viswanathan, Alex Wolff, Rafael Casal, Stephen Spinella, Annaleigh Ashford, Ray Romano', 'R', 'A superintendent of a school district works for the betterment of the student’s education when an embezzlement scheme is discovered, threatening to destroy everything.', 'A superintendent of a school district works for the betterment of the student’s education when an embezzlement scheme is discovered, threatening to destroy everything.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gizz5FphOtfSnLaGpRALOZgILd5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:530723'),
