  ('140171885571410289', 'Bad Girl', 2016, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Fin Edquist, Stephen Kearney', 'Fin Edquist', 'Sara West, Samara Weaving, Ben Winspear, Felicity Price, Rebecca Massey, Sam Hutchin, Liam Graham, Chris Buckley', null, 'Bad girl Amy is given one last chance by her adoptive parents, who think her friendship with local girl Chloe is a step in the right direction. But when Amy discovers that Chloe harbors a dark secret, she finds herself fighting for her life.', 'Bad girl Amy is given one last chance by her adoptive parents, who think her friendship with local girl Chloe is a step in the right direction. But when Amy discovers that Chloe harbors a dark secret, she finds herself fighting for her life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kqXK1EI5G5yVEQNyrbakWeewZ7F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:405050'),
  ('739273574261408943', 'Bad Girl Island', 2007, 'Mystery, Science Fiction', 'Stewart Raffill, John Darbonne', 'Stewart Raffill', 'AnnaLynne McCord, Antonio Sabàto, Jr., James Brolin, Joanna Bacalso, Mario Macaluso, Marnee McClellan, Simone Griffeth, Lou Gazzara', null, 'A wealthy film producer Michael Pace discovers a beautiful unconscious woman pushed ashore by what appears to be a friendly dolphin. Confused and captivated by the apparent supernatural events taking place around him, Michael decides to make a film about his experience with the mysterious woman from the sea. Very soon the movie that Michael is making entwines itself into his family''s past, his children''s lives, and the very future of their existence together. Set at the cross roads of the modern world and ancient mystical cults, "Bad Girl Island" spins a tale of murder, obsession and seduction that leads its audience into a labyrinth of intrigue, action and mysterious forces.', 'A wealthy film producer Michael Pace discovers a beautiful unconscious woman pushed ashore by what appears to be a friendly dolphin. Confused and captivated by the apparent supernatural events taking place around him, Michael decides to make a film about his experience with the mysterious woman from the sea. Very soon the movie that Michael is making entwines itself into his family''s past, his children''s lives, and the very future of their existence together. Set at the cross roads of the modern world and ancient mystical cults, "Bad Girl Island" spins a tale of murder, obsession and seduction that leads its audience into a labyrinth of intrigue, action and mysterious forces.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qdH73TYLG9rPYlnzr2vStiY92Qf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86235'),
  ('1101897452184090545', 'Bad Girls', 1994, 'Romance, Western', 'Jonathan Kaplan, Ralf D. Bode, Jules Lichtman', 'Ken Friedman, Yolande Turner', 'Madeleine Stowe, Mary Stuart Masterson, Andie MacDowell, Drew Barrymore, James Russo, James Le Gros, Robert Loggia, Dermot Mulroney', 'R', 'Four former harlots try to leave the wild west (Colorado, to be exact) and head north to make a better life for themselves. Unfortunately someone from Cody''s past won''t let it happen that easily.', 'Four former harlots try to leave the wild west (Colorado, to be exact) and head north to make a better life for themselves. Unfortunately someone from Cody''s past won''t let it happen that easily.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cXY79luLXt2dzUP2Tx601zpZFzK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11853'),
  ('847712781047527515', 'Bad Girls', 2012, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Weng Jing Ting, Randy Che', 'Chang Ying-Min, Liao Mint, Lu Toki', 'Ella Chen Chia-hwa, Mike He, Jack Kao, Chris Wang', null, 'S.H.E''s Ella Chen (New Perfect Two) joins hands with screen heartthrob Mike He (Love Keeps Going) in Bad Girls! Ella plays spunky high-school girl A-Dan, who, along with her best friends Pei Pei ("otaku''s goddess" Da Yuan) and Xiao Mi (Beatrice Fang), forms the notoriously prone-to-violence trio known as the "Bad Girls". She takes it upon herself to deal out justice, protect other girls from bullies, and, most importantly, punish the insufferable boys. This summer, young popular idol Justin (Mike He) comes to A-Dan''s school to shoot his latest romantic movie, and that makes the girls in town crazy. But it is the nonchalant A-Dan who, by pure chance of fate, accidentally crashes into the filming lot, and is assigned the female lead role opposite the arrogant Justin! There is a problem - she has no prior romantic experience at all..', 'S.H.E''s Ella Chen (New Perfect Two) joins hands with screen heartthrob Mike He (Love Keeps Going) in Bad Girls! Ella plays spunky high-school girl A-Dan, who, along with her best friends Pei Pei ("otaku''s goddess" Da Yuan) and Xiao Mi (Beatrice Fang), forms the notoriously prone-to-violence trio known as the "Bad Girls". She takes it upon herself to deal out justice, protect other girls from bullies, and, most importantly, punish the insufferable boys. This summer, young popular idol Justin (Mike He) comes to A-Dan''s school to shoot his latest romantic movie, and that makes the girls in town crazy. But it is the nonchalant A-Dan who, by pure chance of fate, accidentally crashes into the filming lot, and is assigned the female lead role opposite the arrogant Justin! There is a problem - she has no prior romantic experience at all..', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/leDyn9ILrlpHyRBVx9NnBMTyzsJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:136930'),
  ('46679331880906472', 'Bad Girls Dormitory', 1986, 'Horror, Action, Drama, Thriller', 'Tim Kincaid, Arthur D. Marks', 'Tim Kincaid', 'Carey Zuris, Teresa Farley, Natalie Savage, Rick Gianasi, Marita, Jennifer Delora, Donna Eskra, Danny Barclay', 'R', 'Inmates at a women''s prison run by a corrupt warden and her gang of sadistic guards plan a breakout.', 'Inmates at a women''s prison run by a corrupt warden and her gang of sadistic guards plan a breakout.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6jvsWMf0P3TcKhcbyU7YMKh69Ur.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40076'),
  ('704570136630133809', 'Bad Girls from Mars', 1990, 'Comedy, Horror, Science Fiction', 'Gary Graver, Fred Olen Ray', 'Mark Thomas McGee, Fred Olen Ray', 'Edy Williams, Oliver Darrow, Brinke Stevens, John Henry Richardson, James R. Sweeney, Robert Ruth, Dana Bentley, Jasae', null, 'Someone is killing off the female leads of the movie production "Bad Girls from Mars." The producers feel they should try to finish the film, even though they''re making a lucrative amount from insurance payoffs, so they fly in European sex bomb Emanuelle as the new lead. Emanuelle immediately begins embarrassing the producers by leading a wild party life around town. Meanwhile the killings continue, and detectives try to stop the fiend responsible.', 'Someone is killing off the female leads of the movie production "Bad Girls from Mars." The producers feel they should try to finish the film, even though they''re making a lucrative amount from insurance payoffs, so they fly in European sex bomb Emanuelle as the new lead. Emanuelle immediately begins embarrassing the producers by leading a wild party life around town. Meanwhile the killings continue, and detectives try to stop the fiend responsible.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/SWH6Hqu2hPaBBnIHtHbfTCsQQ0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27825'),
  ('100718442302149452', 'Bad Girls Go to Hell', 1965, 'Drama, Crime', 'Doris Wishman, C. Davis Smith', 'Doris Wishman', 'Gigi Darlene, Charles E. Mazin, Sam Stewart, Gertrude Cross, Alan Feinstein, Barnard L. Sackett, Darlene Bennett, Marlene Starr', 'NR', 'On the run after dispatching her rapist, homemaker Ellen flees to the Big City, where further misfortunes befall her. When she finally finds stability, she discovers that her landlady''s son is a detective, threatening her newfound identity and peace of mind.', 'On the run after dispatching her rapist, homemaker Ellen flees to the Big City, where further misfortunes befall her. When she finally finds stability, she discovers that her landlady''s son is a detective, threatening her newfound identity and peace of mind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vfFT9V2EPHFCgvT6kpBP7MixNAe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42732'),
  ('138405083624145690', 'Bad Guy', 2002, 'Drama, Thriller, Romance', 'Kim Ki-duk', 'Kim Ki-duk', 'Cho Jae-hyun, Seo Won, Kim Yun-tae, Choi Deok-moon, Choi Yoon-young, Yoo-jin Shin, Kim Jung-young, Namkoong Min', null, 'A pimp enforcer takes revenge on a woman who rejected his advances by tricking her into prostitution, but complications arise.', 'A pimp enforcer takes revenge on a woman who rejected his advances by tricking her into prostitution, but complications arise.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2gI1b0kHperlUjC4EE34mKJBGI6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25649'),
  ('1051431113149650636', 'Bad Guys Always Die', 2015, 'Action, Comedy', 'Sun Hao', 'Sun Hao', 'Son Ye-jin, Chen Bolin, Qiao Zhenyu, Shin Hyun-jun, Park Cheol-min, Jang Kwang, Ding Wenbo, Wi Ha-jun', null, 'A Chinese teacher in Busan awaits 3 of his friends to spend holidays together in Jeju Island, Korea. Secret gangsters, Sexy Korean woman, old policeman and pastors exist in their tour one by one. The tour became a mysterious and unknown adventures.', 'A Chinese teacher in Busan awaits 3 of his friends to spend holidays together in Jeju Island, Korea. Secret gangsters, Sexy Korean woman, old policeman and pastors exist in their tour one by one. The tour became a mysterious and unknown adventures.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nY4x38B3RFeYl4lgQeWnmghMgRA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:375599'),
