  ('101526482912425609', 'Bad Hair Day', 2015, 'Comedy, Adventure, TV Movie, Family', 'Érik Canuel, Mario Janelle', null, 'Laura Marano, Leigh-Allyn Baker, Christian Campbell, Kiana Madeira, Christian Paul, Alain Goulem, Jake Manley, Zoé De Grand Maison', 'G', 'Monica is desperate to be prom queen, but on the big night, her hair is an uncontrollable mess. Meanwhile, FBI agent Liz Morgan is on the hunt for a jewel thief who is looking for a stolen necklace, which Monica has in her possession. Soon, she and the agent chase the jewel thief, and she''s whizzed on a wild adventure in the city.', 'Monica is desperate to be prom queen, but on the big night, her hair is an uncontrollable mess. Meanwhile, FBI agent Liz Morgan is on the hunt for a jewel thief who is looking for a stolen necklace, which Monica has in her possession. Soon, she and the agent chase the jewel thief, and she''s whizzed on a wild adventure in the city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i1Vum1dbHkFVF0aqb1cNR0OSkD0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:317198'),
