  ('625740769652066356', 'Bad Johnson', 2014, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Romance', 'Anthony E. Cabral, Luke Geissbühler, Huck Botko', 'Jeff Tetreault', 'Cam Gigandet, Nick Thune, Katherine Cunningham, Kevin Miller, Jessica Joy, Katie Rich, Holly Houk, Jamie Chung', 'NR', 'With women practically throwing themselves at him, Rich can’t control himself. But he continually blames his penis, which seems to have a mind of its own. After ruining yet another promising relationship with Jamie, Rich has finally had enough and wishes his penis would just leave him alone. The next morning, Rich wakes up to find his wish has come true and his johnson is no longer on his body.', 'With women practically throwing themselves at him, Rich can’t control himself. But he continually blames his penis, which seems to have a mind of its own. After ruining yet another promising relationship with Jamie, Rich has finally had enough and wishes his penis would just leave him alone. The next morning, Rich wakes up to find his wish has come true and his johnson is no longer on his body.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j9w5V6N5RqzoYGeLDgrBpJ2iy6a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:258805'),
