  ('192756406241230739', 'Bad Moon', 1996, 'Horror', 'Eric Red, Jan Kiesser, Geza Sinkovics', 'Eric Red', 'Michael Paré, Mariel Hemingway, Mason Gamble, Hrothgar Mathews, Ken Pogue, Johanna Marlowe, Julia Montgomery Brown, Gavin Buhr', 'R', 'One man''s struggle to contain the curse he hides within... and his last-ditch attempt to free himself with the love of family. But when it looks as if he is losing his battle, and endangering all he holds most dear, the family dog, Thor, is the last hope for his family''s survival... and the end to his Werewolf curse.', 'One man''s struggle to contain the curse he hides within... and his last-ditch attempt to free himself with the love of family. But when it looks as if he is losing his battle, and endangering all he holds most dear, the family dog, Thor, is the last hope for his family''s survival... and the end to his Werewolf curse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1RobAQaPIYV2PBmkb4XISbsQZPe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49763'),
  ('1146535392614667548', 'Bad News Bears', 2005, 'Comedy', 'Richard Linklater, Rogier Stoffers', 'Bill Lancaster, Glenn Ficarra, John Requa', 'Billy Bob Thornton, Greg Kinnear, Marcia Gay Harden, Sammi Kane Kraft, Ridge Canipe, Brandon Craggs, Jeffrey Davies, Timmy Deters', 'PG-13', 'Morris Buttermaker is a burned-out minor league baseball player who loves to drink and can''t keep his hands to himself. His long-suffering lawyer arranges for him to manage a local Little League team, and Buttermaker soon finds himself the head of a rag-tag group of misfit players. Through unconventional team-building exercises and his offbeat coaching style, Buttermaker helps his hapless Bears prepare to meet their rivals, the Yankees.', 'Morris Buttermaker is a burned-out minor league baseball player who loves to drink and can''t keep his hands to himself. His long-suffering lawyer arranges for him to manage a local Little League team, and Buttermaker soon finds himself the head of a rag-tag group of misfit players. Through unconventional team-building exercises and his offbeat coaching style, Buttermaker helps his hapless Bears prepare to meet their rivals, the Yankees.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ja1yrgfYAGmwnridioMY3MV0GDm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13341'),
  ('330632882442895034', 'Bad Newz', 2024, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Anand Tiwari, Debojeet Ray, Vaibhav Vishant', 'Tarun Dudeja, Ishita Moitra', 'Vicky Kaushal, Triptii Dimri, Ammy Virk, Neha Dhupia, Sheeba Chaddha, Faisal Rashid, Ananya Panday, Neha Sharma', null, 'After a whirlwind marriage with social media influencer Akhil Chadha that ends in divorce, chef Saloni Bagga meets hotelier Gurbir Pannu. One night with Gurbir – and then also with Akhil – leads to Saloni getting pregnant. But who''s the father? By a one-in-a-billion twist of fate, Saloni is carrying twins – and not just any twins, each child has a different father!', 'After a whirlwind marriage with social media influencer Akhil Chadha that ends in divorce, chef Saloni Bagga meets hotelier Gurbir Pannu. One night with Gurbir – and then also with Akhil – leads to Saloni getting pregnant. But who''s the father? By a one-in-a-billion twist of fate, Saloni is carrying twins – and not just any twins, each child has a different father!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qDlqxGATpYBWqGciPB4tmQm3bFT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:984101'),
  ('630073714485540158', 'Bad Ol'' Putty Tat', 1949, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Friz Freleng', null, 'Mel Blanc', 'NR', 'Sylvester Cat starts to saw down Tweety Bird''s house. Tweety flees into a badminton court, where he becomes the birdie in the game. Sylvester disguises himself as a player, and Tweety drops a TNT stick into Sylvester''s mouth.', 'Sylvester Cat starts to saw down Tweety Bird''s house. Tweety flees into a badminton court, where he becomes the birdie in the game. Sylvester disguises himself as a player, and Tweety drops a TNT stick into Sylvester''s mouth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hpekVm9XwrUjbSeKf0i04kLKPnl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:118805'),
  ('578416979944306022', 'Bad Reputation', 2005, 'Drama, Horror, Thriller', 'Jim Hemphill', 'Jim Hemphill', 'Angelique Hennessy, Kristina Conzen, Danielle Noble, Dakota Ferreiro, Mark Kunzman, Jerad Anderson, Chris Basler, Jennifer Holloway', 'R', 'A high school girl wrongly branded as the school slut embraces her ''bad reputation'' and takes revenge on the kids who have made her life a living hell.', 'A high school girl wrongly branded as the school slut embraces her ''bad reputation'' and takes revenge on the kids who have made her life a living hell.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/51vJ7WZj8OZms54GXgjzK3duKXG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46113'),
  ('182311771782632137', 'Bad Roads', 2021, 'Drama', 'Valentina Yamshchikova, Anastasiya Yamshchykova, Volodymyr Ivanov', 'Nataliia Vorozhbyt', 'Ihor Koltovskyi, Andrey Lelyukh, Anna Zhurakovskaya, Yuliya Matrosova, Oksana Cherkashyna, Yurii Kulinich, Oksana Voronina, Volodymyr Hurin', null, 'Four short stories are set along the roads of Donbass during the war. There are no safe spaces and no one can make sense of just what is going on. Even as they are trapped in the chaos, some manage to wield authority over others. But in this world, where tomorrow may never come, not everyone is defenseless and miserable. Even the most innocent victims may have their turn at taking charge.', 'Four short stories are set along the roads of Donbass during the war. There are no safe spaces and no one can make sense of just what is going on. Even as they are trapped in the chaos, some manage to wield authority over others. But in this world, where tomorrow may never come, not everyone is defenseless and miserable. Even the most innocent victims may have their turn at taking charge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kA8Ekt0QInrgs0NqeKs7zFOHCOi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:677054'),
  ('49019398347442219', 'Bad Ronald', 1974, 'TV Movie, Drama, Thriller, Horror', 'Buzz Kulik, Charles F. Wheeler', null, 'Scott Jacoby, Pippa Scott, John Larch, Dabney Coleman, Kim Hunter, John Fiedler, Linda Watkins, Cindy Fisher', 'NR', 'When awkward teen Ronald Wilby accidentally kills a young girl whose sister rejected his affections, his overbearing mother decides to hide him from the law by creating a concealed room in their home for him to live.', 'When awkward teen Ronald Wilby accidentally kills a young girl whose sister rejected his affections, his overbearing mother decides to hide him from the law by creating a concealed room in their home for him to live.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oe2GpLL3twEG6TVuO7bDHiI1n1C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56787'),
  ('747352326275558450', 'Bad Roomies', 2015, 'Comedy', 'Jason Schnell', 'Justin Mooney', 'Patrick Renna, Tommy Savas, Annie Monroe, Jackie Tohn, Page Kennedy, Kyle Howard, Jordan Masterson, Christopher Masterson', null, 'Two guys find a beautiful young woman to take the place of their missing roommate. Everything seems fine until a horrible mistake on drunken night leads all three on a downward spiral.', 'Two guys find a beautiful young woman to take the place of their missing roommate. Everything seems fine until a horrible mistake on drunken night leads all three on a downward spiral.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ejYslOKoRQdD3WWKqYEabwvPlSV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:371442'),
  ('329956142124758051', 'Bad Samaritan', 2018, 'Thriller, Crime, Horror, Drama', 'Dean Devlin, David Connell, Carsten H.W. Lorenz', 'Brandon Boyce', 'David Tennant, Robert Sheehan, Kerry Condon, Carlito Olivero, Jacqueline Byers, Tracey Heggins, Rob Nagle, Lorraine Bahr', 'R', 'A thief makes a disturbing discovery in the house where he breaks in. Later, when he returns to the same house with his partner in crime, things are no longer how he expected.', 'A thief makes a disturbing discovery in the house where he breaks in. Later, when he returns to the same house with his partner in crime, things are no longer how he expected.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ojCu9SLxAPwhhC2tXtHNdrTmxCH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:467632'),
  ('52709439730655754', 'Bad Santa', 2003, 'Drama, Comedy, Crime', 'Terry Zwigoff, Jamie Anderson, James Alan Hensz', 'John Requa, Glenn Ficarra', 'Billy Bob Thornton, Tony Cox, Lauren Graham, Brett Kelly, Lauren Tom, John Ritter, Bernie Mac, Ajay Naidu', 'R', 'You''d better watch out - Willie T. Soke is coming to town, and he doesn''t care if you''ve been naughty or nice. Willie''s favorite holiday tradition is to fill his sacks with loot lifted from shopping malls across the country. But this year his plot gets derailed by a wisecracking store detective, a sexy bartender, and a kid who''s convinced Willie is the real Santa Claus.', 'You''d better watch out - Willie T. Soke is coming to town, and he doesn''t care if you''ve been naughty or nice. Willie''s favorite holiday tradition is to fill his sacks with loot lifted from shopping malls across the country. But this year his plot gets derailed by a wisecracking store detective, a sexy bartender, and a kid who''s convinced Willie is the real Santa Claus.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rfClLIyeHqpMofmrPY8DaLe4z9x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10147'),
  ('529943703831354082', 'Bad Santa 2', 2016, 'Comedy, Crime, Mystery', 'Mark Waters, Theo van de Sande, Andrew Shea', 'Johnny Rosenthal, Shauna Cross', 'Billy Bob Thornton, Kathy Bates, Tony Cox, Christina Hendricks, Brett Kelly, Ryan Hansen, Jenny Zigrino, Jeff Skowron', 'R', 'Fueled by cheap whiskey, greed and hatred, Willie Soke teams up with his angry little sidekick, Marcus, to knock off a Chicago charity on Christmas Eve. Along for the ride is chubby and cheery Thurman Merman, a 250-pound ray of sunshine who brings out Willie''s sliver of humanity. Issues arise when the pair are joined by Willie''s horror story of a mother, who raises the bar for the gang''s ambitions, while somehow lowering the standards of criminal behavior.', 'Fueled by cheap whiskey, greed and hatred, Willie Soke teams up with his angry little sidekick, Marcus, to knock off a Chicago charity on Christmas Eve. Along for the ride is chubby and cheery Thurman Merman, a 250-pound ray of sunshine who brings out Willie''s sliver of humanity. Issues arise when the pair are joined by Willie''s horror story of a mother, who raises the bar for the gang''s ambitions, while somehow lowering the standards of criminal behavior.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xmsEwpA2fSq6IO3sfKrLuIPLHSc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:338964'),
  ('577771950579755475', 'Bad Seed', 1934, 'Crime, Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Billy Wilder, Alexander Esway', 'Billy Wilder, Jan Lustig, Max Kolpé', 'Danielle Darrieux, Pierre Mingand, Raymond Galle, Jean Wall, Gaby Heritier, Michel Duran, Paul Velsa, Marcel Maupi', null, 'A young man-about-Paris, cut off from his father''s money, falls in with a picaresque gang of car thieves.', 'A young man-about-Paris, cut off from his father''s money, falls in with a picaresque gang of car thieves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7BLrXi3vB9sE0ZbShcVsjUMd7X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82185'),
  ('1140926645528295656', 'Bad Seeds', 2016, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Louis Bélanger, Pierre Mignot, Emmanuelle Beaugrand-Champagne', 'Louis Bélanger, Alexis Martin', 'Alexis Martin, Gilles Renaud, Emmanuelle Lussier Martinez, Mimi Côté, Gary Boudreault, François Papineau, Stéphane Jacques, Sylvio Archambault', null, 'Jacques is an actor who runs away to the countryside to escape his gambling debts. He meets Simon, a rough and wily farmer who manipulates him into a business relationship. After a difficult start, the men help each other grow marijuana. They happen to meet Francesca, a sharp young woman who soon embraces their venture. By the time they get to the winter harvest, the three have learned to live together, but outside forces threaten the delicate balance of their little business...', 'Jacques is an actor who runs away to the countryside to escape his gambling debts. He meets Simon, a rough and wily farmer who manipulates him into a business relationship. After a difficult start, the men help each other grow marijuana. They happen to meet Francesca, a sharp young woman who soon embraces their venture. By the time they get to the winter harvest, the three have learned to live together, but outside forces threaten the delicate balance of their little business...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/leN08Xfc4eJBFAxnWTT1J1SkTZp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:388222'),
  ('378540347874048498', 'Bad Sister', 2015, 'Thriller, TV Movie', 'Joseph M. Setele, Allan Aguilar, Andrés Moret Urdampilleta', 'Barbara Kymlicka', 'Alyshia Ochse, Devon Werkheiser, Ryan Whitney, Helen Eigenberg, Robert Leeshock, Lise Simms, Sloane Avery, Hugh Holub', 'PG-13', 'As a top student at St. Adeline''s Catholic Boarding School, Zoe senses that something is not quite right about the school''s new nun-- a sense proven to be true when it is revealed the "good'' nun is an imposter with a fatal attraction to Zoe''s brother.', 'As a top student at St. Adeline''s Catholic Boarding School, Zoe senses that something is not quite right about the school''s new nun-- a sense proven to be true when it is revealed the "good'' nun is an imposter with a fatal attraction to Zoe''s brother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jKrIlgfJPIWNeowaOZPBZuOPmq0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:375846'),
  ('1125853137480499033', 'Bad Slippers', 2026, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Ruben Van Der Meer, Michael Winter', 'Ruben Van Der Meer', 'Ruben van der Meer, Hajo Bruins, Linde van den Heuvel', null, 'After a crypto-scam, a slick salesman stumbles into a chaotic art heist where con men, Picassos, and a lost slipper spiral into hilarious-and deadly-consequences.', 'After a crypto-scam, a slick salesman stumbles into a chaotic art heist where con men, Picassos, and a lost slipper spiral into hilarious-and deadly-consequences.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FvEjhSzdvUJocaaj6kqQn8ZYbmB8.jpg', 'plex:movie:bad-slippers'),
  ('1056611658970688666', 'Bad Spelling', 2004, 'Drama', 'Jean-Jacques Zilbermann', 'Philippe Lasry, Jean-Jacques Zilbermann', 'Damien Jouillerot, Carole Bouquet, Olivier Gourmet, Raphaël Goldman, Franc Bruneau, Khalid Maadour, Arnaud Giovaninetti, Deborah Grall', null, 'At a French boarding school for troubled youth in the early 1970''s, the Headmaster and his wife decide that their son Daniel, who is fifteen years old but looks younger, should finally go live in the dorm with all the other students, as they do not want it to seem Daniel is receiving any special treatment. Daniel is now faced with the challenge of earning the trust and respect of the other students, who all come from troubled backgrounds.', 'At a French boarding school for troubled youth in the early 1970''s, the Headmaster and his wife decide that their son Daniel, who is fifteen years old but looks younger, should finally go live in the dorm with all the other students, as they do not want it to seem Daniel is receiving any special treatment. Daniel is now faced with the challenge of earning the trust and respect of the other students, who all come from troubled backgrounds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nveU3l9FfDg9KhEG1ODK6oIazR9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72278'),
  ('902843145058872226', 'Bad Tales', 2020, 'Drama', 'Marco Angeli, Fabio Simonelli, Fabio D''Innocenzo', 'Fabio D''Innocenzo, Damiano D''Innocenzo', 'Elio Germano, Tommaso Di Cola, Giulietta Rebeggiani, Gabriel Montesi, Justin Alexander Korovkin, Barbara Chichiarelli, Lino Musella, Ileana D''Ambra', null, 'In a small suburb on the outskirts of Rome, the cheerful heat of summer camouflages a stifling atmosphere of alienation. From a distance, the families seem normal, but it’s an illusion: in the houses, courtyards and gardens, silence shrouds the subtle sadism of the fathers, the passivity of the mothers and the guilty indifference of adults. But it’s the desperation and repressed rage of the children that will explode and cut through this grotesque façade, with devastating consequences for the entire community.', 'In a small suburb on the outskirts of Rome, the cheerful heat of summer camouflages a stifling atmosphere of alienation. From a distance, the families seem normal, but it’s an illusion: in the houses, courtyards and gardens, silence shrouds the subtle sadism of the fathers, the passivity of the mothers and the guilty indifference of adults. But it’s the desperation and repressed rage of the children that will explode and cut through this grotesque façade, with devastating consequences for the entire community.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k2NTmlJkdHhEZtKGQhQz5ovozAB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:614292'),
  ('1042432488915487069', 'Bad Taste', 1987, 'Action, Comedy, Horror, Science Fiction', 'Peter Jackson, Peter Jackson', 'Peter Jackson', 'Terry Potter, Pete O''Herne, Craig Smith, Mike Minett, Peter Jackson, Doug Wren, Peter Vere-Jones, Ken Hammon', 'NR', 'A team from the intergalactic fast food chain Crumb''s Crunchy Delights descends on Earth, planning to make human flesh the newest taste sensation. After they wipe out the New Zealand town Kaihoro, the country’s Astro-Investigation and Defense Service (AIaDS) is called in to deal with the problem. Things are complicated due to Giles, an aid worker who comes to Kaihoro the same day to collect change from the residents. He is captured by the aliens, and AIaDS stages a rescue mission that quickly becomes an all-out assault on the aliens’ headquarters.', 'A team from the intergalactic fast food chain Crumb''s Crunchy Delights descends on Earth, planning to make human flesh the newest taste sensation. After they wipe out the New Zealand town Kaihoro, the country’s Astro-Investigation and Defense Service (AIaDS) is called in to deal with the problem. Things are complicated due to Giles, an aid worker who comes to Kaihoro the same day to collect change from the residents. He is captured by the aliens, and AIaDS stages a rescue mission that quickly becomes an all-out assault on the aliens’ headquarters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/msttMX3undIiaeJLZbMRq94v1bw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9964'),
  ('10869150760058351', 'Bad Teacher', 2011, 'Comedy', 'Jake Kasdan, Bill Purple, Steve Windle', 'Lee Eisenberg, Gene Stupnitsky', 'Cameron Diaz, Justin Timberlake, Jason Segel, Lucy Punch, Phyllis Smith, Kaitlyn Dever, John Michael Higgins, Thomas Lennon', 'R', 'A lazy, incompetent middle school teacher who hates her job and her students is forced to return to her job to make enough money for a boob job after her rich fiancé dumps her.', 'A lazy, incompetent middle school teacher who hates her job and her students is forced to return to her job to make enough money for a boob job after her rich fiancé dumps her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zpIY4qUSX91J9XpPgr0hFrk1eKr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52449'),
  ('845179672120194630', 'Bad Therapy', 2020, 'Comedy, Drama', 'William Teitler, Rob Givens, Aaron Steele-Nicholson', 'Nancy Doyne', 'Michaela Watkins, Alicia Silverstone, Rob Corddry, Anna Pniowsky, David Paymer, Aisha Tyler, Sarah Shahi, Haley Joel Osment', 'NR', 'Married couple Bob and Susan Howard decide to see a marriage counselor named Judy Small, who appears trustworthy but harbors dark and conflicted impulses.', 'Married couple Bob and Susan Howard decide to see a marriage counselor named Judy Small, who appears trustworthy but harbors dark and conflicted impulses.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4dXeF33A7tlWggztDfyTYUmq8Zy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:527382'),
  ('318656879737808257', 'Bad Times at the El Royale', 2018, 'Thriller, Mystery, Crime', 'Amanda Petura, Jason Halley, Chad Belair', 'Drew Goddard', 'Jeff Bridges, Cynthia Erivo, Lewis Pullman, Dakota Johnson, Cailee Spaeny, Jon Hamm, Chris Hemsworth, Nick Offerman', 'R', 'Lake Tahoe, 1969. Seven strangers, each one with a secret to bury, meet at El Royale, a decadent motel with a dark past. In the course of a fateful night, everyone will have one last shot at redemption.', 'Lake Tahoe, 1969. Seven strangers, each one with a secret to bury, meet at El Royale, a decadent motel with a dark past. In the course of a fateful night, everyone will have one last shot at redemption.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qExufIc4Rw0e4xdVZlhMdmEDGES.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:446021'),
  ('1049646160727688158', 'Bad Timing', 1980, 'Mystery, Drama, Thriller', 'Nicolas Roeg, Anthony B. Richmond', 'Yale Udoff', 'Art Garfunkel, Theresa Russell, Harvey Keitel, Denholm Elliott, Daniel Massey, Dana Gillespie, William Hootkins, Eugene Lipinski', 'R', 'Alex Linden is a psychiatrist living in Vienna who meets Milena Flaherty though a mutual friend. Though Alex is quite a bit older than Milena, he''s attracted to her young, carefree spirit. Despite the fact that Milena is already married, their friendship quickly turns into a deeply passionate love affair that threatens to overtake them both. When Milena ends up in the hospital from an overdose, Alex is taken into custody by Inspector Netusil.', 'Alex Linden is a psychiatrist living in Vienna who meets Milena Flaherty though a mutual friend. Though Alex is quite a bit older than Milena, he''s attracted to her young, carefree spirit. Despite the fact that Milena is already married, their friendship quickly turns into a deeply passionate love affair that threatens to overtake them both. When Milena ends up in the hospital from an overdose, Alex is taken into custody by Inspector Netusil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/raLS93dykOabizFuguWZ9KeCKAS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33214'),
  ('257142078932400506', 'Bad Trip', 2021, 'Comedy', 'Knia Bonds, Ibrahim Yilla, Kitao Sakurai', 'Kathryn Borel Jr., Jenna Park', 'Eric André, Lil Rel Howery, Tiffany Haddish, Michaela Conlin, Gerald Espinoza, Kaleila Johnson, Michael Starr, Yvette Tucker', 'R', 'In this hidden-camera prank comedy, two best friends bond on a wild road trip to New York as they pull real people into their raunchy, raucous antics.', 'In this hidden-camera prank comedy, two best friends bond on a wild road trip to New York as they pull real people into their raunchy, raucous antics.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A1Gy5HX3DKGaNW1Ay30NTIVJqJ6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:578908'),
  ('571541281547069241', 'Bad Turn Worse', 2014, 'Thriller, Crime, Drama', 'Simon Hawkins, Zeke Hawkins, Jeff Bierman', 'Dutch Southern', 'Mackenzie Davis, Logan Huffman, Jeremy Allen White, William Devane, Jon Gries, Mark Pellegrino, Erasmo Martinez', 'NR', 'Three teenage friends get in way over their head when they cross a down-home crime syndicate. They hope to make a break for it and escape their dead-end existence in a cotton-mill town but get sucked into the seedy underbelly of organized crime when one of them steals from the wrong man.', 'Three teenage friends get in way over their head when they cross a down-home crime syndicate. They hope to make a break for it and escape their dead-end existence in a cotton-mill town but get sucked into the seedy underbelly of organized crime when one of them steals from the wrong man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hDuYlLFSkYO2ex8k5GfYXJnibf6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:211076'),
  ('896976718196406451', 'Bad Voodoo', 2026, 'Horror', 'Andre Hepburn, Andrew Adler', 'Devin Fearn', 'John Fiore, Manny Perez, Cristina Moody, Justin Genna', 'Not Rated', 'Two escaped convicts break into a house and take a hostage, only to discover that the hideout houses something far more dangerous: a voodoo curse born from a grieving couple’s thirst for vengeance. As the night spirals into terror, they must battle an unseen power that feeds on guilt, blood, and lost souls.', 'Two escaped convicts break into a house and take a hostage, only to discover that the hideout houses something far more dangerous: a voodoo curse born from a grieving couple’s thirst for vengeance. As the night spirals into terror, they must battle an unseen power that feeds on guilt, blood, and lost souls.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fmetadata-static.plex.tv%2F5%2Fgracenote%2F5d30e4f2f61795f802fe60f4abc1ecbf.jpg', 'plex:movie:bad-voodoo'),
  ('473825925307667275', 'Bad Words', 2013, 'Comedy', 'Jason Bateman, Nicole Abellera Hallman, Ken Seng', 'Andrew Dodge', 'Jason Bateman, Kathryn Hahn, Rohan Chand, Philip Baker Hall, Allison Janney, Ben Falcone, Steve Witting, Beth Grant', 'R', 'Forty-year-old misanthrope, Guy Trilby, enters the National Golden Quill Spelling Bee through a loophole in the rules.', 'Forty-year-old misanthrope, Guy Trilby, enters the National Golden Quill Spelling Bee through a loophole in the rules.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hZo399sszo6QxEPOmqJiq5NhQeU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:209403'),
  ('348873703746103931', 'Badal', 2000, 'Action, Crime, Romance', 'Raj Kanwar, Harmeet Singh', 'Robin Bhatt, Sutanu Gupta', 'Bobby Deol, Rani Mukerji, Amrish Puri, Ashish Vidhyarthi, Ashutosh Rana, Mayuri Kango, Upasna Singh, Suman Ranganathan', null, 'Badal is a victim of the 1984 riots, brought up by a terrorist. Badal aims to kill the treacherous police officer who had killed his parents and his loving sister. He takes shelter in the house of an honest police officer and falls in love with a minister''s granddaughter. Will he be able to accomplish his revenge?', 'Badal is a victim of the 1984 riots, brought up by a terrorist. Badal aims to kill the treacherous police officer who had killed his parents and his loving sister. He takes shelter in the house of an honest police officer and falls in love with a minister''s granddaughter. Will he be able to accomplish his revenge?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lMMOhx1VTkf3TS5xnS1LisoRIHc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:276846'),
  ('408470742172021735', 'Bade Miyan Chote Miyan', 1998, 'Action, Comedy', 'David Dhawan', 'Rumi Jaffery', 'Amitabh Bachchan, Govinda, Raveena Tandon, Ramya Krishnan, Anupam Kher, Paresh Rawal, Satish Kaushik, Sharat Saxena', null, 'Arjun and Pyare are two police officers witha friendly rivalry, who get framed for various crimes being committed by their doppelgangers.', 'Arjun and Pyare are two police officers witha friendly rivalry, who get framed for various crimes being committed by their doppelgangers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1iiBcRXR8OFDyfXitR5W72z7rrU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46373'),
