  ('644153043079249426', 'Badjävlar', 1971, 'Comedy', 'Christian Lund, Roland Sterner', 'Lars Molin', 'Ernst Günther, Gun Jönsson, Anders Nyström, Gösta Bredefeldt, Sven Holmberg, Per-Axel Arosenius, Oscar Ljung, Tommy Johnson', null, 'Holidays on the swedish east coast. Invading summer guests collide with the locals, all without inhibitions. The formerly so radical Social Democratic municipal councilor has completely lost his visions and fully accepts that the area is transformed into a tourist resort for the rich.', 'Holidays on the swedish east coast. Invading summer guests collide with the locals, all without inhibitions. The formerly so radical Social Democratic municipal councilor has completely lost his visions and fully accepts that the area is transformed into a tourist resort for the rich.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bqoosvceepCa0Lpiu4SkydBRG1c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:124519'),
  ('1123134097935942771', 'Badla', 2019, 'Crime, Thriller, Mystery, Drama', 'Sujoy Ghosh, Chandrika Chandran, Shome Makhija', 'Oriol Paulo', 'Amitabh Bachchan, Taapsee Pannu, Tony Luke, Amrita Singh, Manav Kaul, Tanveer Ghani, Denzil Smith, Mark Mansfield', null, 'A dynamic young entrepreneur finds herself locked in a hotel room with the corpse of her dead lover. She hires a prestigious lawyer to defend her and they work together to figure out what actually happened.', 'A dynamic young entrepreneur finds herself locked in a hotel room with the corpse of her dead lover. She hires a prestigious lawyer to defend her and they work together to figure out what actually happened.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eKpzbERuhogYTwI3PwfVsAHXnuO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:581361'),
  ('256741529080624062', 'Badland', 2019, 'Western', 'Idan Menin, Todd A. Robinson, Justin Lee', 'Justin Lee', 'Bruce Dern, Mira Sorvino, Kevin Makely, Jeff Fahey, Wes Studi, Tony Todd, Trace Adkins, James Russo', 'PG-13', 'Detective Matthias Breecher, hired to track down the worst of the Confederate war criminals, roams the Old West seeking justice. His resolve is tested when he meets a determined pioneer woman who is far more than she seems.', 'Detective Matthias Breecher, hired to track down the worst of the Confederate war criminals, roams the Old West seeking justice. His resolve is tested when he meets a determined pioneer woman who is far more than she seems.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/217ddlMrnXll436baw7y5ERmz3x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:634524'),
  ('805890149813975819', 'Badland Doves', 2021, 'Western', 'Paul Winters', 'Paul Winters', 'Jessica Y. Martin, Sandy Penny, Michelle Nuquay, Elizabeth Selby, Sean J. Dillingham, Alaina Laethem, Harley Queen, Dan Weisgerber', null, 'On the trail to seek justice for murders by a man the entire town is protecting, these girls are out for revenge and they''re up to the fight.', 'On the trail to seek justice for murders by a man the entire town is protecting, these girls are out for revenge and they''re up to the fight.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y1LuNKZb9PFLLgH8MM2DSyRs6Yb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:911184'),
  ('292722741252538581', 'Badland Hunters', 2024, 'Action, Adventure, Thriller, Horror', 'Heo Myeong-haeng, Byun Bong-sun, Song Hyun-suk', 'Kwak Jae-min, Kim Bo-tong', 'Don Lee, Lee Jun-young, Lee Hee-jun, Roh Jeong-eui, Ahn Ji-hye, Park Ji-hoon, Kang Sung-Wook, Lee Sung-woo', 'R', 'After a deadly earthquake turns Seoul into a lawless badland, a fearless huntsman springs into action to rescue a teenager abducted by a mad doctor.', 'After a deadly earthquake turns Seoul into a lawless badland, a fearless huntsman springs into action to rescue a teenager abducted by a mad doctor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zVMyvNowgbsBAL6O6esWfRpAcOb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:933131'),
  ('226572237899375107', 'Badlanders', 1992, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Armand Gazarian', 'Armand Gazarian', 'James Phillips, Michael M. Foley, Deborah Thompson Duda, Dave Bean, Jack Willcox, Rhino Michaels, Frankie Ray, Kim Kopf', null, 'Committed to overthrowing a bloodthirsty tyrant, brave freedom fighter Blaine earns a one-way ticket to Prison Planet, an inhospitable wasteland where he battles violent goons and struggles to find Himshaw, the key to restoring peace and justice.', 'Committed to overthrowing a bloodthirsty tyrant, brave freedom fighter Blaine earns a one-way ticket to Prison Planet, an inhospitable wasteland where he battles violent goons and struggles to find Himshaw, the key to restoring peace and justice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xZ7fJRf2gdhdDHGgmpD1OOxQEq2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:116883'),
  ('346348582502344701', 'Badlands', 1974, 'Crime, Drama, Romance', 'Brian Probyn, Terrence Malick, Tak Fujimoto', 'Terrence Malick', 'Martin Sheen, Sissy Spacek, Warren Oates, Ramon Bieri, Alan Vint, Gary Littlejohn, John Carter, Bryan Montgomery', 'PG', 'An impressionable teenage girl from a dead-end town and her older greaser boyfriend embark on a killing spree in the South Dakota badlands.', 'An impressionable teenage girl from a dead-end town and her older greaser boyfriend embark on a killing spree in the South Dakota badlands.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z81rBzHNgiNLean2JTGHgxjJ8nq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3133'),
  ('836923078428396814', 'Badmaash Company', 2010, 'Crime', 'Parmeet Sethi, Ali Abbas Zafar, Sanjay Kapoor', 'Parmeet Sethi', 'Shahid Kapoor, Anushka Sharma, Meiyang Chang, Vir Das, Anupam Kher, Kiran Juneja, Pavan Malhotra, Jameel Khan', null, 'Four young friends decide to work together when one of them comes up with an innovative and lucrative business plan. But their lives begin to deteriorate when their personal issues surface.', 'Four young friends decide to work together when one of them comes up with an innovative and lucrative business plan. But their lives begin to deteriorate when their personal issues surface.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bz1nDlkhUN1XB9rERhN1jYRe4ka.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37822'),
  ('667189906091273787', 'Badman''s Territory', 1946, 'Action, Western', 'Tim Whelan, Robert De Grasse, Harry Mancke', 'Jack Natteford, Luci Ward', 'Randolph Scott, Ann Richards, George ''Gabby'' Hayes, Ray Collins, James Warren, Morgan Conway, Virginia Sale, John Halloran', 'NR', 'After some gun play with a posse, the James Gang head for Quinto in a section of land which is not a part of America. Anyone there is beyond the law so the town is populated with outlaws. Next to arrive is Sheriff Rowley, following his brother whom the Gang have brought in injured. Rowley has no authority and gets on well enough with the James boys but is soon involved in other local goings-on, including a move to vote for annexation with Oklahoma which would allow the law well and truly in.', 'After some gun play with a posse, the James Gang head for Quinto in a section of land which is not a part of America. Anyone there is beyond the law so the town is populated with outlaws. Next to arrive is Sheriff Rowley, following his brother whom the Gang have brought in injured. Rowley has no authority and gets on well enough with the James boys but is soon involved in other local goings-on, including a move to vote for annexation with Oklahoma which would allow the law well and truly in.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lSWoCa2dhC4VvATPmmKiEV33uRz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38807'),
  ('70249216604490670', 'Badrinath Ki Dulhania', 2017, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Shashank Khaitan, Neha Parti Matiyani', 'Shashank Khaitan', 'Varun Dhawan, Alia Bhatt, Shweta Basu Prasad, Gauahar Khan, Sahil Vaid, Shiv Darshan, Aakanksha Singh, Puneet Singh Ratn', null, 'Badrinath Ki Dulhania is a story of Badrinath Bansal from Jhansi and Vaidehi Trivedi from Kota and what happens when the two of them meet. Even though they both belong to small towns, their mindset about gender roles in society and about life in general are diametrically opposite. This leads to a clash of ideologies, despite both of them recognising the goodness in each other. Will they be able to overcome circumstances to accept their love for each other? Will they be able to surpass the expectations and pressures of their small town families to be together? Answers to these and many more such questions make for an interesting journey of love, laughter, emotions and madness called Badrinath Ki Dulhania.', 'Badrinath Ki Dulhania is a story of Badrinath Bansal from Jhansi and Vaidehi Trivedi from Kota and what happens when the two of them meet. Even though they both belong to small towns, their mindset about gender roles in society and about life in general are diametrically opposite. This leads to a clash of ideologies, despite both of them recognising the goodness in each other. Will they be able to overcome circumstances to accept their love for each other? Will they be able to surpass the expectations and pressures of their small town families to be together? Answers to these and many more such questions make for an interesting journey of love, laughter, emotions and madness called Badrinath Ki Dulhania.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e1tV7gYSF5iw8NPR78sUHNb3YLU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:413646'),
  ('94740766502049797', 'Baeus', 1987, 'Animation', 'Bruno Bozzetto', null, null, null, 'A small insect falls in love with a distraught housewife whose husband has just walked out on her. The bug is unable to gain her affection until he finds a book of magic spells. But his problems are not over yet.', 'A small insect falls in love with a distraught housewife whose husband has just walked out on her. The bug is unable to gain her affection until he finds a book of magic spells. But his problems are not over yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1zHQnXE0ve5DQXztHgX9P7p17OL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:224444'),
  ('173386527849908311', 'Baffled!', 1973, 'Science Fiction, Thriller, Mystery, Horror, TV Movie', 'Philip Leacock, Ken Hodges, Michael Dryhurst', null, 'Leonard Nimoy, Susan Hampshire, Rachel Roberts, Vera Miles, Jewel Blanch, Valerie Taylor, Ray Brooks, Angharad Rees', 'NR', 'Tom Kovack is a hard-nosed race car driver until a sudden supernatural vision causes a near-fatal crash while he''s hurtling down the backstretch at 140 miles per hour. Michele Brent is the woman who convinces Kovack that his visions are significant. She leads him to the manor house that appeared in his vision, which in turn leads him into a world of revenge and murder from beyond the grave. Kovack must tap into his newfound power to conquer the evil forces at work.', 'Tom Kovack is a hard-nosed race car driver until a sudden supernatural vision causes a near-fatal crash while he''s hurtling down the backstretch at 140 miles per hour. Michele Brent is the woman who convinces Kovack that his visions are significant. She leads him to the manor house that appeared in his vision, which in turn leads him into a world of revenge and murder from beyond the grave. Kovack must tap into his newfound power to conquer the evil forces at work.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dEwwdLV0cYQNne18mC8f45yxFRD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:171308'),
  ('701184880220046551', 'Bag of Lies', 2024, 'Horror, Thriller', 'David Andrew James, Brandt Hackney', 'Joe Zappa, David Andrew James', 'John Wells, Madison Pullins, Patrick Taft, Brandi Botkin, Terry Tocantins, Aja Nicole, Kayla Theis, Judy McQueen Bauer', null, 'Desperate to save his dying wife, Matt turns to The Bag, an ancient relic with dark magic. The cure demands a chilling ritual and strict rules. As his wife heals, Matt''s sanity unravels, facing terrifying consequences.', 'Desperate to save his dying wife, Matt turns to The Bag, an ancient relic with dark magic. The cure demands a chilling ritual and strict rules. As his wife heals, Matt''s sanity unravels, facing terrifying consequences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pPElE8npavUirQWmscJUGZyPiP6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1255208'),
  ('59960768449342866', 'Bagdad', 1949, 'Adventure', 'Charles Lamont, Russell Metty, Jesse Hibbs', 'Robert Hardy Andrews', 'Maureen O''Hara, Paul Hubschmid, Vincent Price, John Sutton, Jeff Corey, Frank Puglia, David Bauer, Fritz Leiber', 'NR', 'An Arab sheik''s daughter (Maureen O''Hara) avenges his death, blamed on Hassan (Paul Christian) and his Black Riders.', 'An Arab sheik''s daughter (Maureen O''Hara) avenges his death, blamed on Hassan (Paul Christian) and his Black Riders.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ePIwEbjNop87h5Xpn1JMTVK5niD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:177231'),
  ('929896762313151329', 'Bagdad Cafe', 1987, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Percy Adlon, Bernd Heinl, Marc Pickett', 'Eleonore Adlon, Percy Adlon, Christopher Doherty', 'Marianne Sägebrecht, CCH Pounder, Jack Palance, Christine Kaufmann, Monica Calhoun, Darron Flagg, George Aguilar, G. Smokey Campbell', null, 'A German woman named Jasmin stumbles upon a dilapidated motel/diner in the middle of nowhere. Her unusual appearance and demeanor are at first suspicious to Brenda, the exasperated owner who has difficulty making ends meet. But when an unlikely magic sparks between the two women, this lonely desert outpost is transformed into a thriving and popular oasis.', 'A German woman named Jasmin stumbles upon a dilapidated motel/diner in the middle of nowhere. Her unusual appearance and demeanor are at first suspicious to Brenda, the exasperated owner who has difficulty making ends meet. But when an unlikely magic sparks between the two women, this lonely desert outpost is transformed into a thriving and popular oasis.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zeEa3jVkLE8C0KjOiiKqMbhHgaL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3543'),
  ('1058122106364086056', 'Bager', 2003, 'Drama', 'Tomi Grgicevic', null, 'Zoran Dževerdanović, Sonja Miklauzic', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', null, 'tmdb:movie:1193886'),
  ('956555687551913072', 'Baggage Buster', 1941, 'Family, Animation, Comedy', 'Jack Kinney', null, 'Danny Webb', 'NR', 'Goofy has to get a box belonging to a magician in time for the next train to pick the baggage. Clumsy Goofy drops the box and a lot of magician''s props appear.', 'Goofy has to get a box belonging to a magician in time for the next train to pick the baggage. Clumsy Goofy drops the box and a lot of magician''s props appear.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/za1EHKMknko1Sq7MT66VXPGiGRE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66821'),
  ('257404041100862085', 'Baggage Claim', 2013, 'Romance, Comedy', 'David E. Talbert, Eric Sherman, Christopher S. Bryson', 'David E. Talbert', 'Paula Patton, Derek Luke, Jill Scott, Adam Brody, Jenifer Lewis, Taye Diggs, Boris Kodjoe, Trey Songz', 'PG-13', 'Although she has traveled all over the world, flight attendant Montana Moore has yet to find a man with whom she wants to settle down. However, with her sister''s upcoming wedding and pressure from her oft-married mother, she''s determined to get engaged in the next 30 days. In that time, her best friends (and fellow flight attendants) conspire to help her re-encounter her exes as she flies all over the country.', 'Although she has traveled all over the world, flight attendant Montana Moore has yet to find a man with whom she wants to settle down. However, with her sister''s upcoming wedding and pressure from her oft-married mother, she''s determined to get engaged in the next 30 days. In that time, her best friends (and fellow flight attendants) conspire to help her re-encounter her exes as she flies all over the country.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qSKvf23QuEJGt8MMrKvoFk85TZo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:175528'),
  ('258376475937109869', 'Baggio: The Divine Ponytail', 2021, 'Drama', 'Benjamin Maier, Alessandro Panza, Fausto Girasole', 'Ludovica Rampoldi, Stefano Sardo', 'Andrea Arcangeli, Valentina Bellè, Andrea Pennacchi, Antonio Zavatteri, Anna Ferruzzo, Riccardo Goretti, Roberto Turchetta, Martufello', 'NR', 'A chronicle biopic of the 22-year career of soccer star Roberto Baggio, including depictions of his difficult debut as a player, his deep rifts with some of his coaches, his triumph over injuries and personal discovery of Buddism.', 'A chronicle biopic of the 22-year career of soccer star Roberto Baggio, including depictions of his difficult debut as a player, his deep rifts with some of his coaches, his triumph over injuries and personal discovery of Buddism.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i0NOqrnE4FhXrk9cHm6DQeRo1Zm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:694254'),
  ('805944543017241785', 'Baghban', 2003, 'Drama', 'Ravi Chopra, Barun Mukherjee, Vishal Desai', 'Ram Govind, Satish Bhatnagar, Achala Nagar', 'Amitabh Bachchan, Hema Malini, Salman Khan, Mahima Chaudhry, Aman Verma, Paresh Rawal, Lillete Dubey, Sharat Saxena', null, 'After dedicating their whole life in upbringing their children, elderly couple Raj Malhotra and Pooja gets homeless. Instead of caring, their children treat them as a burden.', 'After dedicating their whole life in upbringing their children, elderly couple Raj Malhotra and Pooja gets homeless. Instead of caring, their children treat them as a burden.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p6NPup58fPjIEAU9tKU4XpQhtTA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39839'),
  ('548161994497917196', 'Baghead', 2008, 'Comedy, Drama, Horror', 'Mark Duplass, Jay Duplass, Chris Ohlson', 'Mark Duplass, Jay Duplass', 'Steve Zissis, Ross Partridge, Greta Gerwig, Elise Muller, Jett Garner, Jennifer Lafleur, Darrell Bryant, Cass Naumann', 'R', 'Four actors go to a cabin in the woods to write, direct, and act in a film that will jump-start their careers. Their idea is a horror film about a man with a bag over his head, but what happens when that man mysteriously shows up?', 'Four actors go to a cabin in the woods to write, direct, and act in a film that will jump-start their careers. Their idea is a horror film about a man with a bag over his head, but what happens when that man mysteriously shows up?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pO3Au8iDpZsJt7Xco6fRsNvm3vz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5759'),
  ('762839053361722682', 'Baghead', 2023, 'Horror', 'Alberto Corredor, Cale Finot, Laura Mihartescu', 'Bryce McGuire, Christina Pamies, Lorcan Reilly', 'Freya Allan, Jeremy Irvine, Ruby Barker, Peter Mullan, Anne Müller, Svenja Jung, Ned Dennehy, Julika Jenkins', 'PG-13', 'Following the death of her estranged father, Iris learns she has inherited a run-down, centuries-old pub. She travels to Berlin to identify her father’s body and meet with The Solicitor to discuss the estate. Little does she know, when the deed is signed she will become inextricably tied to an unspeakable entity that resides in the pub’s basement – Baghead – a shape-shifting creature that can transform into the dead.', 'Following the death of her estranged father, Iris learns she has inherited a run-down, centuries-old pub. She travels to Berlin to identify her father’s body and meet with The Solicitor to discuss the estate. Little does she know, when the deed is signed she will become inextricably tied to an unspeakable entity that resides in the pub’s basement – Baghead – a shape-shifting creature that can transform into the dead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lbOyeiiRYAE6Nm2e7xiNAAaRwZB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:845783'),
  ('556952199361795939', 'Bagi, the Monster of Mighty Nature', 1984, 'Animation, Fantasy, TV Movie', 'Osamu Tezuka', 'Osamu Tezuka', 'Saeko Shimazu, Kazuhiko Inoue, Katsuji Mori, Kazuteru Suzuki, Kosei Tomita, Masako Ikeda, Yuzuru Fujimoto, Akie Yasuda', null, 'In 1984 the Japanese government approved gene recombination experiments. Baggy is Tezuka’s response. A cute kitten escapes a lab, and is befriended by lonely child Ryosuke. Years later, he joins her in a quest that’s part spaghetti Western, part contemporary adventure.', 'In 1984 the Japanese government approved gene recombination experiments. Baggy is Tezuka’s response. A cute kitten escapes a lab, and is befriended by lonely child Ryosuke. Years later, he joins her in a quest that’s part spaghetti Western, part contemporary adventure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3B85NHx0vN0ykU9zuUNttLZirJe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34577'),
  ('142338985534461219', 'Bagman', 2024, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Colm McCarthy, Anca Perja, Nick Remy Matthews', 'John Hulme', 'Sam Claflin, Antonia Thomas, Caréll Vincent Rhoden, Will Davis, Adelle Leonce, William Hope, Steven Cree, Rosalie Craig', 'PG-13', 'For centuries and across cultures, parents have warned their children of the legendary Bagman, who snatches innocent children and stuffs them into his vile, rotting bag—never to be seen again. Patrick McKee narrowly escaped such an encounter as a boy, which left him with lasting scars throughout his adulthood. Now, Patrick’s childhood tormentor has returned, threatening the safety of his wife Karina and son Jake.', 'For centuries and across cultures, parents have warned their children of the legendary Bagman, who snatches innocent children and stuffs them into his vile, rotting bag—never to be seen again. Patrick McKee narrowly escaped such an encounter as a boy, which left him with lasting scars throughout his adulthood. Now, Patrick’s childhood tormentor has returned, threatening the safety of his wife Karina and son Jake.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/53IK9rlZJbwFYbNnJZiLq7UWxkT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:978796'),
  ('420772802894947738', 'BAGMAN Profession: Meurtrier', 2004, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Jonathan Prévost, François Simard, Anouk Whissell', null, 'Alain Bakayoko, Jimmy Beaudoin, David Bellerive, Guillaume Blais-Dubuc, Stéphane Coutu, Daniel Stoit Désormeaux, Catherine Girard, Anouk Whissell', null, 'Bagman, a killer with a paper bag on the head, kills anybody who pronounces his name three times. When a gang of gangsters meets a girl who escaped the killer, they call Bagman and a violent battle ensues.', 'Bagman, a killer with a paper bag on the head, kills anybody who pronounces his name three times. When a gang of gangsters meets a girl who escaped the killer, they call Bagman and a violent battle ensues.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iKuComn2no06dqYKfSgaFZpXaHo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79075'),
  ('231101813657440390', 'Bagnomaria', 1999, 'Comedy', 'Giorgio Panariello, Danilo Desideri, Olivier Gérard', 'Piero De Bernardi, Leonardo Benvenuti, Giorgio Panariello', 'Giorgio Panariello, Ugo Pagliai, Manuela Arcuri, Gianna Giachetti, Pietro Fornaciari, Lillo Petrolo, Claudio Gregori, Andrea Cambi', null, 'In Pietrasanta all are excited for the annual party of summer end. Here we find four characters: Merigo, a naive guy passionate of bike; Pierre, son of the mayor; Simone, a pestiferous kid; Mario, lifeguard of "Bagnomaria".', 'In Pietrasanta all are excited for the annual party of summer end. Here we find four characters: Merigo, a naive guy passionate of bike; Pierre, son of the mayor; Simone, a pestiferous kid; Mario, lifeguard of "Bagnomaria".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7yxgsYHa1RCUYdnSyc73uazjgpT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61930'),
  ('370109068044619278', 'Bagong Tukso', 2026, 'Drama', 'Rodante Pajemna Jr.', null, 'Margaret Diaz, Allison Ross, Apphle Celso, Heart Fox', null, 'Meet the freshest faces of VMX! Apphle Celso, Margaret Diaz, Heart Fox, and Allison Ross turn up the heat, bare fantasies, and tease you into an unforgettable sexy experience.', 'Meet the freshest faces of VMX! Apphle Celso, Margaret Diaz, Heart Fox, and Allison Ross turn up the heat, bare fantasies, and tease you into an unforgettable sexy experience.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t7nlhiZNaGdXPmbsTM872VlZgXD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1614061'),
  ('1028089375341062964', 'Bah, Humduck!: A Looney Tunes Christmas', 2006, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Charles Visser', 'Ray DeLaurentis', 'Joe Alaskey, Bob Bergen, Billy West, June Foray, Maurice LaMarche, Jim Cummings, Tara Strong', 'NR', 'In this adaptation of Charles Dickens'' A Christmas Carol, Daffy Duck is the greedy proprietor of the Lucky Duck Mega-Mart and all he can think about is the money to be made during the holiday season.', 'In this adaptation of Charles Dickens'' A Christmas Carol, Daffy Duck is the greedy proprietor of the Lucky Duck Mega-Mart and all he can think about is the money to be made during the holiday season.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f568JOtSlQoevRIDBKK3YIkHbvd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13248'),
  ('1100796212222264460', 'Bahia Blanca', 1984, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Lina Romay, Jesús Franco, Juan Soler', 'Jesús Franco', 'Eva León, Lina Romay, Antonio Mayans, Trino Trives, Analía Ivars, Antonio Rebollo, José Llamas, Juan Soler', null, 'Pocho Martin''s body is found dead on the shore of a fishing village. According to the forensic Ramiro, Pocho has been assassinated, which alerts the Commissioner Carlos. Young Silvia, Pocho''s friend, receives the sad news but is more concerned about her impending wedding with Andy. Crackpot Oscar speaks to Carlos of the dangerous sirens of Deer Island, evil women who attract sailors and annihilate them. When Ramiro and Carlos go to the island, they find the sisters Lila and Mary, who run a tavern / brothel near the beach. Carlos and Lila are old acquaintances and celebrate the reunion, but the murder of Pocho remains unsolved.', 'Pocho Martin''s body is found dead on the shore of a fishing village. According to the forensic Ramiro, Pocho has been assassinated, which alerts the Commissioner Carlos. Young Silvia, Pocho''s friend, receives the sad news but is more concerned about her impending wedding with Andy. Crackpot Oscar speaks to Carlos of the dangerous sirens of Deer Island, evil women who attract sailors and annihilate them. When Ramiro and Carlos go to the island, they find the sisters Lila and Mary, who run a tavern / brothel near the beach. Carlos and Lila are old acquaintances and celebrate the reunion, but the murder of Pocho remains unsolved.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/igQ6DhvjtVgCd4x1cD5ZGNWDOP2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:243270'),
  ('880138184165127627', 'Bāhubali 2: The Conclusion', 2017, 'Action, Adventure, Fantasy', 'S. S. Rajamouli, Lee Whittaker, Ashwin Gangaraju', 'S. S. Rajamouli', 'Prabhas, Rana Daggubati, Anushka Shetty, Sathyaraj, Nassar, Ramya Krishnan, Subbaraju, Tamannaah Bhatia', 'NR', 'When Mahendra, the son of Bāhubali, learns about his heritage, he begins to look for answers. His story is juxtaposed with past events that unfolded in the Mahishmati Kingdom.', 'When Mahendra, the son of Bāhubali, learns about his heritage, he begins to look for answers. His story is juxtaposed with past events that unfolded in the Mahishmati Kingdom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/21sC2assImQIYCEDA84Qh9d1RsK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:350312'),
  ('494112972697957198', 'Bāhubali: The Beginning', 2015, 'Action, Drama', 'S. S. Rajamouli, Ashwin Gangaraju, K.K. Senthil Kumar', 'S. S. Rajamouli', 'Prabhas, Rana Daggubati, Tamannaah Bhatia, Anushka Shetty, Ramya Krishnan, Nassar, Sathyaraj, Prabhakar', 'NR', 'The young Shivudu is left as a foundling in a small village by his mother. By the time he’s grown up, it has become apparent that he possesses exceptional gifts. He meets the beautiful warrior princess Avanthika and learns that her queen has been held captive for the last 25 years. Shividu sets off to rescue her, discovering his own origins in the process.', 'The young Shivudu is left as a foundling in a small village by his mother. By the time he’s grown up, it has become apparent that he possesses exceptional gifts. He meets the beautiful warrior princess Avanthika and learns that her queen has been held captive for the last 25 years. Shividu sets off to rescue her, discovering his own origins in the process.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9BAjt8nSSms62uOVYn1t3C3dVto.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:256040'),
  ('355875452631498049', 'Bāhubali: The Epic', 2025, 'Action, Drama', 'S. S. Rajamouli', 'S. S. Rajamouli, Madhan Karky, Deva Katta', 'Prabhas, Rana Daggubati, Anushka Shetty, Ramya Krishnan, Sathyaraj, Nassar, Subbaraju, Tamannaah Bhatia', null, 'When a mysterious child is found by a tribal couple near a roaring waterfall, they raise him as their own. As he grows, Sivudu is drawn to the world beyond the cliffs, where he discovers the ancient kingdom of Mahishmati, ruled by a cruel tyrant, haunted by rebellion, and bound to his past. What begins as a quest for love soon unravels a legacy of betrayal, sacrifice, and a forgotten prince.', 'When a mysterious child is found by a tribal couple near a roaring waterfall, they raise him as their own. As he grows, Sivudu is drawn to the world beyond the cliffs, where he discovers the ancient kingdom of Mahishmati, ruled by a cruel tyrant, haunted by rebellion, and bound to his past. What begins as a quest for love soon unravels a legacy of betrayal, sacrifice, and a forgotten prince.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z9YIo2qscyaXYgRqIdRJtND3bw8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1511417'),
  ('942177856521527969', 'Bahut Hua Sammaan', 2020, 'Comedy, Crime, Drama', 'Ashish R. Shukla, Parasher Baruah, Bharat Jha', 'Avinash Singh, Vijay Narayan Verma', 'Sanjay Mishra, Raghav Juyal, Ram Kapoor, Abhishek Chauhan, Nidhi Singh, Dibyendu Bhattacharya, Flora Saini, Rohit Chaudhary', null, 'With their planned heist gone wrong, Bony and Fundoo get inextricably involved in the pursuit of ''Kohinoor'' - quite possibly the biggest scandal the country will ever witness.', 'With their planned heist gone wrong, Bony and Fundoo get inextricably involved in the pursuit of ''Kohinoor'' - quite possibly the biggest scandal the country will ever witness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6kDAeEiOkL14fwinIXzqwozjxKT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:748457'),
