  ('200646354671999146', 'Bairavaa', 2017, 'Action', 'Bharathan, M. Sukumar', 'Bharathan', 'Vijay, Keerthy Suresh, Jagapati Babu, Sathish, Aparna Vinod, Papri Ghosh, Rajendran, Daniel Balaji', null, 'A loan recovery agent takes on a corrupt head of an educational institution to save his girlfriend.​', 'A loan recovery agent takes on a corrupt head of an educational institution to save his girlfriend.​', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qHWdlIGu1uZSgP9xSLg0L7yXuEP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:411717'),
  ('1038765944466207649', 'Baise-en-ville', 2026, 'Comedy', 'Martin Jauvat, Vincent Peugnet, Louise Blachère', 'Martin Jauvat', 'Martin Jauvat, Emmanuelle Bercot, William Lebghil, Anaïde Rozam, Sébastien Chassagne, Annabelle Lengronne, Michel Hazanavicius, Géraldine Pailhas', null, 'Sprite, a 20-year-old young adult, returns to Chelles after a breakup. To pay for his driver’s license and please his parents, he joins Allo Nettoyo, a night-time cleaning start-up in the Paris suburbs. Unable to get around without a permit, he adopts the "baise-en-ville" technique—taught by his driving instructor—which involves spending the night at girls'' places of girls he meets through a dating app. Sprite struggles with this new approach to seduction.', 'Sprite, a 20-year-old young adult, returns to Chelles after a breakup. To pay for his driver’s license and please his parents, he joins Allo Nettoyo, a night-time cleaning start-up in the Paris suburbs. Unable to get around without a permit, he adopts the "baise-en-ville" technique—taught by his driving instructor—which involves spending the night at girls'' places of girls he meets through a dating app. Sprite struggles with this new approach to seduction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/37bcY42oSbPpVq683KQ3nOtV867.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1235303'),
  ('838168819699345273', 'Baise-moi', 2000, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Coralie Trinh Thi, Virginie Despentes, Benoît Chamaillard', 'Coralie Trinh Thi, Virginie Despentes', 'Karen Lancaume, Raffaëla Anderson, Ouassini Embarek, Adama Niane, Marc Barrow, Patrick Eudeline, Ian Scott, Zenza Raggi', null, 'Nadine and Manu are two mad women, as tidy as can be, almost perfectionists. They have several things in common: extreme sex, drugs, beer and the trigger. They find the solution to their problems with guns and beware to those who dare to get in their way!', 'Nadine and Manu are two mad women, as tidy as can be, almost perfectionists. They have several things in common: extreme sex, drugs, beer and the trigger. They find the solution to their problems with guns and beware to those who dare to get in their way!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zmkh7qyNIQmx2xi972WL39wzqOH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3134'),
  ('467528979343250161', 'Bait', 1954, 'Thriller, Drama, Crime', 'Hugo Haas, Eddie Fitzgerald, George Loper', 'Samuel W. Taylor', 'Cleo Moore, Hugo Haas, John Agar, Emmett Lynn, Bruno VeSota, Jan Englund, George Keymas, Cedric Hardwicke', 'NR', 'A man looking for his fortune in a mine decides to tempt his partner with his much younger wife. The goal? To catch them "in the act" and kill him without consequence.', 'A man looking for his fortune in a mine decides to tempt his partner with his much younger wife. The goal? To catch them "in the act" and kill him without consequence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qfw0rypbB7P0NHlRSEtdpG80IOj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45740'),
  ('932714509163057291', 'Bait', 2000, 'Action, Thriller, Crime', 'Antoine Fuqua, Tobias A. Schliessler', 'Andrew Scheinman, Adam Scheinman, Tony Gilroy', 'Jamie Foxx, David Morse, Robert Pastorelli, Doug Hutchison, Kimberly Elise, David Paymer, Mike Epps, Jamie Kennedy', 'R', 'Landing in jail for a petty theft crime, Alvin finds himself sharing a cell with John Jaster, the incarcerated half of the pair of high-tech thieves responsible for the missing gold. His partner, Bristol, is still at large. Alvin wants only to get out of prison and start fresh with his girlfriend, Lisa, and when the Feds, led by U.S. Treasury investigator Clenteen, set him loose on a sketchy deal, he thinks his luck has changed. Alvin has his freedom and the Feds have found their bait.', 'Landing in jail for a petty theft crime, Alvin finds himself sharing a cell with John Jaster, the incarcerated half of the pair of high-tech thieves responsible for the missing gold. His partner, Bristol, is still at large. Alvin wants only to get out of prison and start fresh with his girlfriend, Lisa, and when the Feds, led by U.S. Treasury investigator Clenteen, set him loose on a sketchy deal, he thinks his luck has changed. Alvin has his freedom and the Feds have found their bait.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jon5ux36iUn6GnntxkZaNtB6AZT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14805'),
  ('811910475510358805', 'Bait', 2012, 'Horror', 'Kimble Rendall, Ross Emery, Timothy Clark', 'S.P. Krause', 'Xavier Samuel, Richard Brancatisano, Sharni Vinson, Phoebe Tonkin, Julian McMahon, Alex Russell, Cariba Heine, Lincoln Lewis', 'R', 'A freak tsunami traps shoppers at a coastal Australian supermarket inside the building ... along with a 12-foot great white shark.', 'A freak tsunami traps shoppers at a coastal Australian supermarket inside the building ... along with a 12-foot great white shark.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e2OIr4y90ZZjIRWQ0XBOVzpBn4x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:118957'),
  ('599672381009829725', 'Bait', 2019, 'Drama', 'Mark Jenkin, Mark Jenkin', 'Mark Jenkin', 'Edward Rowe, Mary Woodvine, Giles King, Simon Shepherd, Chloe Endean, Janet Thirlaway, Isaac Woodvine, Martin Ellis', 'NR', 'Martin Ward is a cove fisherman, without a boat. His brother Steven has repurposed their father’s vessel as a tourist tripper, driving a wedge between the brothers. With their childhood home now a getaway for London money, Martin is displaced to the estate above the picturesque harbour. As his struggle to restore the family to their traditional place creates increasing friction with tourists and locals alike, a tragedy at the heart of the family changes his world.', 'Martin Ward is a cove fisherman, without a boat. His brother Steven has repurposed their father’s vessel as a tourist tripper, driving a wedge between the brothers. With their childhood home now a getaway for London money, Martin is displaced to the estate above the picturesque harbour. As his struggle to restore the family to their traditional place creates increasing friction with tourists and locals alike, a tragedy at the heart of the family changes his world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cr6T1ygg5jD3zyqmbR7l2TPaHkN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:576069'),
  ('246675917723698797', 'Baja', 1996, 'Thriller, Drama, Crime', 'Kurt Voss, Denis Maloney', 'Kurt Voss', 'Molly Ringwald, Lance Henriksen, Michael A. Nickles, Donal Logue, Corbin Bernsen, Chris Shearer, Nelson Lyon, Enrique Renaldo', 'R', 'On the run from a drug deal gone wrong, a beautiful young woman escapes across the border only to find herself trapped in a dangerous web of intrigue and deceit in old Mexico.', 'On the run from a drug deal gone wrong, a beautiful young woman escapes across the border only to find herself trapped in a dangerous web of intrigue and deceit in old Mexico.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k75jVJSYnTTX1qHcuMqqgLcTFTP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:290720'),
  ('1074465631249094333', 'Bajirao Mastani', 2015, 'History, Romance, Drama', 'Sanjay Leela Bhansali, Sharmin Segal, Rahul Singh Agnihotri', 'Prakash R. Kapadia', 'Ranveer Singh, Deepika Padukone, Priyanka Chopra Jonas, Tanvi Azmi, Vaibhav Tatwawadi, Mahesh Manjrekar, Milind Soman, Aditya Pancholi', null, 'Peshwa Bajirao married to Kashibai, falls in love with Mastani, a warrior princess in distress. They struggle to make their love triumph amid opposition from his conservative family.', 'Peshwa Bajirao married to Kashibai, falls in love with Mastani, a warrior princess in distress. They struggle to make their love triumph amid opposition from his conservative family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eXKHjELZAbF7cVd9fzYMhvSsXDI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:362045'),
  ('277896587178491669', 'Baked in Brooklyn', 2016, 'Comedy, Crime, Drama, Romance', 'Rory Rooney, Zachary May, Brand Birtwistle', 'David Shapiro', 'Josh Brener, Alexandra Daddario, Lindsey Broad, Paul Iacono, Al Sapienza, Tovah Feldshuh, Joe Grifasi, Chris Northrop', 'NR', 'A recent college graduate decides to sell marijuana on the streets of Manhattan after losing his job at a consulting firm. He soon meets the girl of his dreams. With an unsupportive girlfriend, an increase of clienteles, and the growing threats of being caught or killed, he soon realizes he is in way over his head.', 'A recent college graduate decides to sell marijuana on the streets of Manhattan after losing his job at a consulting firm. He soon meets the girl of his dreams. With an unsupportive girlfriend, an increase of clienteles, and the growing threats of being caught or killed, he soon realizes he is in way over his head.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9P66ST8IackgLaHmfOk0EoQwYg5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:417877'),
  ('223925107469215976', 'Bakery in Brooklyn', 2016, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Gustavo Ron, Miguel P. Gilaberte, Alice Johnson', 'Gustavo Ron, Francisco Zegers', 'Aimee Teegarden, Krysta Rodriguez, Ward Horton, Blanca Suárez, Griffin Newman, Aitor Luna, Anthony Chisholm, Enrique Arce', null, 'Brooklyn, New York. After the sudden death of their aunt Isabelle, Vivien and Chloe inherit her historic bakery. Vivien wants to keep up the tradition; Chloe feels that the business needs to be modernized. But when notified that they are about to be evicted, the two do not hesitate to work together to preserve the family legacy.', 'Brooklyn, New York. After the sudden death of their aunt Isabelle, Vivien and Chloe inherit her historic bakery. Vivien wants to keep up the tradition; Chloe feels that the business needs to be modernized. But when notified that they are about to be evicted, the two do not hesitate to work together to preserve the family legacy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/JMQhYg65RQkpZhjeL4tPJVhIQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:398891'),
  ('197250017855085036', 'Bakhit and Adeela', 1995, 'Comedy', 'Nader Galal, Samir Farag', 'Lenin EL Ramly', 'Adel Emam, Sherine, Mustafa Metwalli, Alaa Wali El Din, Ahmad Rateb, Youssef Daoud, Hassan Hosny, Ezzat Abu Ouf', null, 'Bekhit works in a small workshop. He meets Adila by chance in a train, and they both find a suitcase full of money left by an escaping drug dealer. After they fail in finding the suitcase''s owner, they both decide to share the money.', 'Bekhit works in a small workshop. He meets Adila by chance in a train, and they both find a suitcase full of money left by an escaping drug dealer. After they fail in finding the suitcase''s owner, they both decide to share the money.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8Y4Gqf37HN1pdClNW7mpst966iu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:514349'),
  ('495306921801795362', 'Bakhita', 2009, 'History, Adventure', 'Giacomo Campiotti', null, 'Fatou Kine Boye, Teresa Acerbis, Ettore Bassi, Federica Bau, Sonia Bergamasco', null, 'Born in a village in Sudan, kidnapped by slavers, often beaten and abused, and later sold to Federico Marin, a Venetian merchant, Bakhita then came to Italy and became the nanny servant of Federico''s daughter, Aurora, who had lost her mother at birth. She is treated as an outcast by the peasants and the other servants due to her black skin and African background, but Bakhita is kind and generous to others. Bakhita gradually comes closer to God with the help of the kind village priest, and embraces the Catholic faith. She requests to join the order of Canossian sisters, but Marin doesn''t want to give her up as his servant, treating her almost as his property. This leads to a moving court case that raised an uproar which impacts Bakhita''s freedom and ultimate decision to become a nun. Pope John Paul II declared her a saint in the year 2000.', 'Born in a village in Sudan, kidnapped by slavers, often beaten and abused, and later sold to Federico Marin, a Venetian merchant, Bakhita then came to Italy and became the nanny servant of Federico''s daughter, Aurora, who had lost her mother at birth. She is treated as an outcast by the peasants and the other servants due to her black skin and African background, but Bakhita is kind and generous to others. Bakhita gradually comes closer to God with the help of the kind village priest, and embraces the Catholic faith. She requests to join the order of Canossian sisters, but Marin doesn''t want to give her up as his servant, treating her almost as his property. This leads to a moving court case that raised an uproar which impacts Bakhita''s freedom and ultimate decision to become a nun. Pope John Paul II declared her a saint in the year 2000.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2qfDU2RWxFXB3k0pyd6DpxAsqY3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:233805'),
  ('815410896977338803', 'Baki Hanma VS Kengan Ashura', 2024, 'Animation, Action, Fantasy', 'Toshiki Hirano, Tatsuo Noguchi, Makoto Takahoko', 'Atsuo Ishino', 'Nobunaga Shimazaki, Tatsuhisa Suzuki, Akio Otsuka, Takuya Eguchi, Kenta Miyake, Nobuyuki Hiyama, Ken Narita, Yoshitsugu Matsuoka', 'R', 'It''s the ultimate showdown. The toughest fighters from "Baki Hanma" and "Kengan Ashura" clash in this unprecedented, hard-hitting martial arts crossover.', 'It''s the ultimate showdown. The toughest fighters from "Baki Hanma" and "Kengan Ashura" clash in this unprecedented, hard-hitting martial arts crossover.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/etbHJxil0wHvYOCmibzFLsMcl2C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1263421'),
  ('541609840212590380', 'Bakuman', 2015, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Hitoshi One, Kōji Shintoku, Wataru Miyamoto', null, 'Takeru Satoh, Ryunosuke Kamiki, Nana Komatsu, Kenta Kiritani, Hirofumi Arai, Sarutoki Minagawa, Kankuro Kudo, Takayuki Yamada', 'PG', 'Moritaka Mashiro doesn''t want to follow in the path of his uncle who worked as a manga artist, but ultimately died because of exhaustion. Moritaka Mashiro figures he will graduate from school and work at an office. Things change though when falls in love with a girl at school. The girl, who hopes to become a voice actress, tells Moritaka they can marry, but only after they both achieve their dreams. Moritaka then teams up with fellow classmate Akito Takagi to publish their first manga.', 'Moritaka Mashiro doesn''t want to follow in the path of his uncle who worked as a manga artist, but ultimately died because of exhaustion. Moritaka Mashiro figures he will graduate from school and work at an office. Things change though when falls in love with a girl at school. The girl, who hopes to become a voice actress, tells Moritaka they can marry, but only after they both achieve their dreams. Moritaka then teams up with fellow classmate Akito Takagi to publish their first manga.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kaf6zS27Oll9ja55PYMC7OpB8oa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:327536'),
