  ('1093897392808035045', 'Bakuryu Sentai Abaranger DELUXE: Abare Summer is Freezing Cold!', 2003, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction, Fantasy', 'Satoshi Morota, Michihiro Takeda, Shojiro Nakazawa', 'Naruhisa Arakawa', 'Kouichiro Nishi, Shou Tomita, Aiko Ito, Kaoru Abe, Kotaro Tanaka, Minako Komukai, Miyuki Nishijima, Kōen Okumura', null, 'The film opens on Dino Earth fifteen years ago with a village elder telling the story of how Princess Freezia sealed away a pair of evil Bakuryuu with the Holy Sword, encasing them in ice. If the evil creatures are ever released from their prison, the world will end in a grip of fear "encased in white".', 'The film opens on Dino Earth fifteen years ago with a village elder telling the story of how Princess Freezia sealed away a pair of evil Bakuryuu with the Holy Sword, encasing them in ice. If the evil creatures are ever released from their prison, the world will end in a grip of fear "encased in white".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bFpeeUuOuIPdpE053HXpWnkX4Xt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:200759'),
  ('1093123658493202441', 'Bakuryuu Sentai Abaranger vs. Hurricaneger', 2004, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction, Fantasy', 'Katsuya Watanabe, Wataru Kikuchi, Noboru Takemoto', 'Atsushi Maekawa', 'Kouichiro Nishi, Shou Tomita, Aiko Ito, Kaoru Abe, Kotaro Tanaka, Shun Shioya, Nao Nagasawa, Kohei Yamamoto', null, 'The crossover film between Bakuryuu Sentai Abaranger and Ninpuu Sentai Hurricaneger. After hijacking the Hurricaneger''s mechs; Wendinu and Furabijo, who survived their supposed deaths, unleash an ancient Jakanja warrior infused with Dino Guts known as Janil Iga. Iga allies himself with the Evolian to take over Earth and destroy the Abarangers, it''s up to both them and the Hurricaneger to stop the newest threat by combining their forces in a way never seen before!', 'The crossover film between Bakuryuu Sentai Abaranger and Ninpuu Sentai Hurricaneger. After hijacking the Hurricaneger''s mechs; Wendinu and Furabijo, who survived their supposed deaths, unleash an ancient Jakanja warrior infused with Dino Guts known as Janil Iga. Iga allies himself with the Evolian to take over Earth and destroy the Abarangers, it''s up to both them and the Hurricaneger to stop the newest threat by combining their forces in a way never seen before!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wFhUZCyFyUe5F25mnUGlqANJgfD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:200758'),
  ('549319142221149540', 'Bala', 2019, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Amar Kaushik, Ankita Lad, Anuj Dhawan', 'Niren Bhatt', 'Ayushmann Khurrana, Bhumi Pednekar, Yami Gautam Dhar, Saurabh Shukla, Javed Jaffrey, Seema Pahwa, Abhishek Banerjee, Dheerendra Kumar', null, 'A man suffering from alopecia copes with his lack of self-confidence and the societal pressure that comes with being bald.', 'A man suffering from alopecia copes with his lack of self-confidence and the societal pressure that comes with being bald.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yIDQRD4rPofIodn0b1Md2WyXzSD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:579230'),
  ('229625816935310571', 'Bala mordida', 2009, null, 'Diego Muñoz', null, 'Damián Alcázar, Roberto Sosa, Flor Payán, Dagoberto Gama, Adriana Louvier, Mariana Gajá, Andrés Montiel, Octavio Castro', null, 'Mauro Hernandez, a young preventive policeman, gets involved in a coke deal, and to keep some of the money he has for paying for the transaction, gives his gun away to cover the deal. He argues to Joaquin, old drug dealer and ex-policeman and ends up threatening him. On his way out of the operation, Mauro and his partner policemen, a gang controlled by Joaquin, stop their way out start a wrangle where Mauro is wounded. His body armor couldn´t even stop a small touch of the knife. The scandal on the bad quality of body armors turns into an investigation of malversation of police funds which is exaggerated and misreported by the media. Apparently made in 2009, but not released until 2011.', 'Mauro Hernandez, a young preventive policeman, gets involved in a coke deal, and to keep some of the money he has for paying for the transaction, gives his gun away to cover the deal. He argues to Joaquin, old drug dealer and ex-policeman and ends up threatening him. On his way out of the operation, Mauro and his partner policemen, a gang controlled by Joaquin, stop their way out start a wrangle where Mauro is wounded. His body armor couldn´t even stop a small touch of the knife. The scandal on the bad quality of body armors turns into an investigation of malversation of police funds which is exaggerated and misreported by the media. Apparently made in 2009, but not released until 2011.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4nWqfy1x0dBekOo4I60wSnG1Fud.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:249395'),
  ('477833025874958883', 'Balalayka', 2000, 'Drama', 'Ali Özgentürk', 'Işıl Özgentürk', 'Uğur Yücel, Cem Davran, Ozan Güven, Ercan Yazgan, Nadezhda Gorelova, İskender Bağcılar, Necdet Yakın, Atılay Uluışık', null, 'On a misty morning, an old bus leaves Batum to go to Istanbul. As the bus stops at various places on the way, Russian women of all ages and professions, each with a unique tale, board. In this bus full of women, there are three Turkish men. Three brothers who have come together after many years to carry their father''s last wish.', 'On a misty morning, an old bus leaves Batum to go to Istanbul. As the bus stops at various places on the way, Russian women of all ages and professions, each with a unique tale, board. In this bus full of women, there are three Turkish men. Three brothers who have come together after many years to carry their father''s last wish.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/inDd7azMBYFHIKNJOUZ9Vwox811.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:301898'),
  ('501688734989295680', 'Balamos', 1982, 'Adventure, Drama, Fantasy', 'Stavros Tornes, Stamatis Giannoulis', 'Stavros Tornes', 'Stavros Tornes, Kyriakos Vilanakis, Eleni Maniati, Mitsos Angelakopoulos, Enzo Attigenti, Constantine Pangalos, Christos Karagoutas, Salil Salil', null, 'In order to buy a horse, a man wanders in the bazaars of Thessaly. His journey will take him further than he imagines, as old prophets, forgotten witches and vampire princes will find himself on his way.', 'In order to buy a horse, a man wanders in the bazaars of Thessaly. His journey will take him further than he imagines, as old prophets, forgotten witches and vampire princes will find himself on his way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5SD8dxQsWwKKPAJhML2MOw84UoU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:253067'),
  ('237998145744463092', 'Balance', 1989, 'Drama, Animation', 'Christoph Lauenstein, Wolfgang Lauenstein', 'Christoph Lauenstein, Wolfgang Lauenstein', null, null, 'The setting is on a floating platform where a group of evenly and carefully placed men live. Each man is aware that the platform is not stable and in order not to fall to their deaths, they maintain a careful balance of weight to prevent the platform from tipping too far and cause them all to fall.', 'The setting is on a floating platform where a group of evenly and carefully placed men live. Each man is aware that the platform is not stable and in order not to fall to their deaths, they maintain a careful balance of weight to prevent the platform from tipping too far and cause them all to fall.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4GgliKAlzR0W5Xo96nfbZjesQQD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44338'),
  ('654585023022216153', 'Balance of Power', 1996, 'Action, Thriller', 'Garrett Warren, Gilles Corbeil, Rick Bennett', 'Rick Bennett, Phillip M. Good', 'Billy Blanks, Mako, Lisa Yamanaka, Denis Akiyama, James Lew, Adrian Hough, Lawrence Nakamura, Peter Schindelhauer', 'R', 'A martial arts expert who runs a dojo for under-privileged kids from a dilapidated warehouse is shaken down by gangsters demanding protection money. Then when one of his students is gunned down in the street by the gang, he swears revenge. Meanwhile the gang leader is setting up a death match between the best fighters and is forcing a former trainer to find a new champion by threatening his granddaughter.', 'A martial arts expert who runs a dojo for under-privileged kids from a dilapidated warehouse is shaken down by gangsters demanding protection money. Then when one of his students is gunned down in the street by the gang, he swears revenge. Meanwhile the gang leader is setting up a death match between the best fighters and is forcing a former trainer to find a new champion by threatening his granddaughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/66dh3GeSmxuPFpFaSNkjIfITz0g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40262'),
  ('462537571620795396', 'Balancing Act', 2013, 'Drama', 'Ivano De Matteo, Vittorio Omodei Zorini, Milena Cocozza', 'Ivano De Matteo, Valentina Ferlan', 'Valerio Mastandrea, Barbora Bobuľová, Maurizio Casagrande, Rolando Ravello, Rosabell Laurenti Sellers, Grazia Schiavo, Antonio Gerardi, Antonella Attili', null, 'Giulio suddenly finds himself having to change his life when his wife, after discovering his betrayal, asks for a separation and, suddenly, the reality around him is no longer the same. Forty years old and father of two children, Giulio is forced by circumstances to say goodbye to family and economic well-being and to study new solutions in order to stay afloat and not drown in a new poverty made of double rents and double bills to pay, solitary lunches in fourth-rate restaurants, children''s wishes not to be ignored and creditors to hide from.', 'Giulio suddenly finds himself having to change his life when his wife, after discovering his betrayal, asks for a separation and, suddenly, the reality around him is no longer the same. Forty years old and father of two children, Giulio is forced by circumstances to say goodbye to family and economic well-being and to study new solutions in order to stay afloat and not drown in a new poverty made of double rents and double bills to pay, solitary lunches in fourth-rate restaurants, children''s wishes not to be ignored and creditors to hide from.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s37AxtdijqZ5wLick35IpLN8Rlr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:141810'),
