  ('690966909179077831', 'Balandrau: Where the Fierce Wind Blew', 2026, 'Drama, Action, Adventure, Mystery, Thriller', 'Fernando Trullols, Miquel Prohens, Javier González Megías, Tomás Ybarra, Guillem Nicodemus, Andrea Revi, Marc Rial, Albert Roig Creus, Anna Rua, Irene Roqué', 'Danielle Schleif, Jordi Cruz I Serra', 'Álvaro Cervantes, Bruna Cusí, Marc Martínez, Pep Ambròs, Francesc Garrido', null, 'Based on the worst storm ever to hit the Catalan Pyrenees on December 30, 2000, with conditions that never converged again, killing nine hikers from Barcelona.', 'Based on the worst storm ever to hit the Catalan Pyrenees on December 30, 2000, with conditions that never converged again, killing nine hikers from Barcelona.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FiwcsgsolhDb4ws9SEkXioxo2xlr.jpg', 'plex:movie:balandrau-where-the-fierce-wind-blew'),
  ('99190029750876865', 'Balas & Bolinhos', 2001, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Luís Ismael, Silvio Rocha', 'Luís Ismael', 'Luís Ismael, J.D. Duarte, Jorge Neto, João Pires', null, 'A group of friends meet and set out to rob a gas station.', 'A group of friends meet and set out to rob a gas station.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9TlVtw08obpNZcz31SsCxz6eWK9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71780'),
  ('61408753262135336', 'Balas & Bolinhos: O Regresso', 2004, 'Adventure, Crime, Comedy', 'Luís Ismael, Bruno Carvalho', 'Luís Ismael', 'Jorge Neto, Luís Ismael, J.D. Duarte, João Pires, Fernando Rocha, Jorge Augusto, Pedro Carvalho, Joao Castro', null, 'A group of friends meet after some years apart and decide to go on a treasure hunt.', 'A group of friends meet after some years apart and decide to go on a treasure hunt.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eNZ8yUl1PydQTAGJuAtL96WEly4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71781'),
  ('444632132832018889', 'Balas & Bolinhos: O Último Capítulo', 2012, 'Action, Adventure, Comedy', 'Luís Ismael, Edgar Sousa', 'Luís Ismael', 'Luís Ismael, Jorge Neto, João Pires, Carlos Paulo, Fernando Rocha, Jaimão, Francisco Menezes, Jason Ninh Cao', null, 'One tries to con. Another keeps stealing. And there''s even someone that doesn''t know what he''s doing... The truth is life is hard for Cultara, Rato and Bino. But it all changes when Tone, the man of the world, returns home to save his dad on the deathbed. And when the four get together, they leave for the most surprising adventure yet. If everything was bad, it''s about to get worst!', 'One tries to con. Another keeps stealing. And there''s even someone that doesn''t know what he''s doing... The truth is life is hard for Cultara, Rato and Bino. But it all changes when Tone, the man of the world, returns home to save his dad on the deathbed. And when the four get together, they leave for the most surprising adventure yet. If everything was bad, it''s about to get worst!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jQaaF1ZDqipFwLJMjH3j08oCerw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:98472'),
  ('976109068347293068', 'Bald Mountain', 2013, 'Drama, Western', 'Heitor Dhalia', 'Heitor Dhalia, Vera Egito', 'Juliano Cazarré, Júlio Andrade, Wagner Moura, Matheus Nachtergaele, Sophie Charlotte, Eline Porto, Lyu Árisson, Edmilson Cordeiro', null, 'In 1980, best friends Juliano and Joaquin join the gold rush at Serra Pelada, Bald Mountain, a mountain town near the mighty Amazon river. As the town grows in numbers, it also sees an explosion in violent crime and pollution. Soon the friends'' dreams of hitting the jack pot are shattered. Winner of the 2014 Cinema Brazil Grand Prize.', 'In 1980, best friends Juliano and Joaquin join the gold rush at Serra Pelada, Bald Mountain, a mountain town near the mighty Amazon river. As the town grows in numbers, it also sees an explosion in violent crime and pollution. Soon the friends'' dreams of hitting the jack pot are shattered. Winner of the 2014 Cinema Brazil Grand Prize.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7YYBj1EsTBdqAkGhmbRmFKtB6Ma.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:228148'),
  ('762507749616761678', 'Bali', 1970, 'Drama, Romance', 'Paolo Heusch, Ugo Liberatore, Giorgio Gaslini', 'Fulvio Gicca Palli, Pier Giuseppe Murgia, Ottavio Alessi', 'John Steiner, Laura Antonelli, Umberto Orsini, Petra Pauly, Johannes Schaaf, Lydiawati, Ettore Manni, Fifi Young', null, 'The wife of a European photographer on assignment in exotic Bali falls for an enigmatic ex patriot under the spell of a mystical death cult...', 'The wife of a European photographer on assignment in exotic Bali falls for an enigmatic ex patriot under the spell of a mystical death cult...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rNkxjnBXMTSMFnjdi9sPn05GjOw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64513'),
  ('518745444364631043', 'Balibo', 2009, 'Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Robert Connolly, Nathan Croft, Tristan Milani', 'Robert Connolly, David Williamson', 'Anthony LaPaglia, Oscar Isaac, Nathan Phillips, Damon Gameau, Nick Farnell, Mark Leonard Winter, Gyton Grantley, Katherine Slattery', null, 'As Indonesia prepares to invade the tiny nation of East Timor, five Australian based journalists go missing. Four weeks later, veteran foreign correspondent Roger East is lured to East Timor by the young and charismatic José Ramos-Horta to tell the story of his country and investigate the fate of the missing men. As East''s determination to uncover the truth grows, the threat of invasion intensifie', 'As Indonesia prepares to invade the tiny nation of East Timor, five Australian based journalists go missing. Four weeks later, veteran foreign correspondent Roger East is lured to East Timor by the young and charismatic José Ramos-Horta to tell the story of his country and investigate the fate of the missing men. As East''s determination to uncover the truth grows, the threat of invasion intensifie', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xjb9lDIk7uf5o77MhxRaRFfEEhV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31686'),
  ('405288878331520371', 'Balinsasayaw', 2024, 'Drama', 'Rodante Pajemna Jr.', null, 'Apple Dy, Aiko Garcia, Benz Sangalang, Jonica Lazo, Aria Bench, Izza Watanabe, Marc Capilador', null, 'A rich woman marries a charming womanizer who conspires with his wife’s best friend. When all the revelations are exposed, the tables suddenly turn.', 'A rich woman marries a charming womanizer who conspires with his wife’s best friend. When all the revelations are exposed, the tables suddenly turn.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5gotyf6pPf9ZbDSW0yBLXMpDmmP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1266992'),
  ('311549116733750319', 'Balkan Express', 1983, 'Comedy, War', 'Branko Baletić', 'Gordan Mihić', 'Dragoslav ''Dragan'' Nikolić, Borivoje Todorović, Tanja Bošković, Velimir Živojinović, Olivera Marković, Radko Polič, Toma Zdravković, Branko Cvejić', null, 'In this entertaining, clever satire, it is the beginning of World War II and a group of con artists and thieves decide to pose as musicians under the rubric "The Balkan Express".', 'In this entertaining, clever satire, it is the beginning of World War II and a group of con artists and thieves decide to pose as musicians under the rubric "The Balkan Express".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rQ0nCQPmQ0V7dvJnPcE1672D021.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54649'),
  ('155331034601270015', 'Balkan Express 2', 1988, 'Comedy, War', 'Predrag Antonijević, Miloš Radović, Aleksandar Đorđević', 'Gordan Mihić', 'Borivoje Todorović, Olivera Marković, Velimir Živojinović, Aleksandar Berček, Anica Dobra, Ena Begović, Boro Stjepanović, Radko Polič', null, 'A group of musicians, whose band is called "Balkan express", in fact a quintet of small-time crooks , trying to make some money in Nazi-occupied Serbia.', 'A group of musicians, whose band is called "Balkan express", in fact a quintet of small-time crooks , trying to make some money in Nazi-occupied Serbia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pqbpXJmvoXpf5AFjwLsiaqyfgIa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54661'),
  ('1145144596481876935', 'Balkan Line', 2019, 'Drama, Action, War', 'Aleksandr Kopeykin, Andrey Volgin, Vyacheslav Lisnevsky', 'Andrey Anaykin, Ivan Naumov, Natalya Nazarova', 'Anton Pampushnyy, Gosha Kutsenko, Miloš Biković, Milena Radulović, Gojko Mitić, Ravshana Kurkova, Dmitry Frid, Aleksandar Srećković ''Kubura''', 'R', 'After the NATO bombing of Yugoslavia in 1999, the Yugoslav army pulls out of Kosovo region, leaving Serbian people at the mercy of the Albanian UCK. A small band of soldiers must take over the Slatina airport, and hold it until the Russian peacekeepers arrive.', 'After the NATO bombing of Yugoslavia in 1999, the Yugoslav army pulls out of Kosovo region, leaving Serbian people at the mercy of the Albanian UCK. A small band of soldiers must take over the Slatina airport, and hold it until the Russian peacekeepers arrive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/okiB4NUriKKbGjAtVSzveicPTtu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:517093'),
  ('486555141022375165', 'Balkan Spy', 1984, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Dušan Kovačević, Božidar ''Bota'' Nikolić, Zdravko Randić', 'Dušan Kovačević', 'Danilo ''Bata'' Stojković, Zvonko Lepetić, Mira Banjac, Borivoje Todorović, Branka Petrić, Sonja Savić, Predrag Laković, Milivoje ''Mića'' Tomić', null, 'Convinced that his subtenant is a spy and an enemy of the state, Ilija Čvorović falls into deep paranoia which leads to an absurd and destructive chain of events.', 'Convinced that his subtenant is a spy and an enemy of the state, Ilija Čvorović falls into deep paranoia which leads to an absurd and destructive chain of events.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2YxqcDSawVkJ99jU0Ji1gJAKJan.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31400'),
  ('321080657977264753', 'Balkanisateur', 1997, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Sotiris Goritsas, Stamatis Giannoulis', 'Sotiris Goritsas', 'Stelios Mainas, Gerasimos Skiadaresis, Yiota Festa, Katharina Zapatka, Sabine Berg, Vasilis Halakatevakis, Dimitris Mavropoulos, Kostas Bakalis', null, 'Two friends from a small Greek town travel to Bulgaria and Switzerland, hoping they can gain money from the difference in foreign exchange rates.', 'Two friends from a small Greek town travel to Bulgaria and Switzerland, hoping they can gain money from the difference in foreign exchange rates.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5F4NOG54K4f9543PQzDiiiPknA0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75194'),
  ('184223991357940171', 'Ball Lightning', 1979, 'Comedy', 'Ladislav Smoljak, Zdeněk Podskalský, Ivan Šlapeta', 'Ladislav Smoljak, Zdeněk Svěrák', 'Rudolf Hrušínský, Karel Kalaš, Josef Abrhám, Daniela Kolářová, Bedřich Prokoš, Zita Kabátová, Milada Ježková, Ladislav Smoljak', null, 'A comedy about exchange of 12 apartments , which, its organizer, lawyer Radosta, rightly called Action Ball Lightning. To prepare, organize and execute the exchange of twelve apartments is a work worthy champions. Radosta, who was excellently played by Rudolf Hrušínský, solved all sudden difficulties and complications on the fly and with grace. To be sure that the on the D-day everything goes well he prepares a little rehearsal, which reveals many minor issues caused for example by wedding ordered to inappropriate term or hesitation of some participants. Last but not least a night exercise announced by drunk psychologist Knotků, creates a lot of confusion that nearly sabotaged the whole operation.', 'A comedy about exchange of 12 apartments , which, its organizer, lawyer Radosta, rightly called Action Ball Lightning. To prepare, organize and execute the exchange of twelve apartments is a work worthy champions. Radosta, who was excellently played by Rudolf Hrušínský, solved all sudden difficulties and complications on the fly and with grace. To be sure that the on the D-day everything goes well he prepares a little rehearsal, which reveals many minor issues caused for example by wedding ordered to inappropriate term or hesitation of some participants. Last but not least a night exercise announced by drunk psychologist Knotků, creates a lot of confusion that nearly sabotaged the whole operation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/amPAKx2nQ1Q4uTG7BDnMWFW9WhR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36414'),
  ('18746835166919550', 'Ball of Fire', 1941, 'Comedy, Romance, Crime', 'Howard Hawks, McClure Capps, William Tummel', 'Charles Brackett, Billy Wilder', 'Gary Cooper, Barbara Stanwyck, Oskar Homolka, Henry Travers, S.Z. Sakall, Tully Marshall, Leonid Kinskey, Richard Haydn', 'NR', 'A group of academics have spent years shut up in a house working on the definitive encyclopedia. When one of them discovers that his entry on slang is hopelessly outdated, he ventures into the wide world to learn about the evolving language. Here he meets Sugarpuss O’Shea, a nightclub singer, who’s on top of all the slang—and, it just so happens, needs a place to stay.', 'A group of academics have spent years shut up in a house working on the definitive encyclopedia. When one of them discovers that his entry on slang is hopelessly outdated, he ventures into the wide world to learn about the evolving language. Here he meets Sugarpuss O’Shea, a nightclub singer, who’s on top of all the slang—and, it just so happens, needs a place to stay.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t9L16dMTuNq4saLpQswZjkNvaMt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29884'),
  ('392144028197132657', 'Ball of Wool', 1968, 'Animation, Fantasy', 'Nikolay Serebryakov, Vladimir Sarukhanov, Boris Filchikov', 'Ovsey Driz', null, null, 'Puppet animated folk tale about an old lady who finds a ball of yarn. After picking it the ball changes into a little dog, which has the magical power to be crocheted into anything the old lady fantasizes.', 'Puppet animated folk tale about an old lady who finds a ball of yarn. After picking it the ball changes into a little dog, which has the magical power to be crocheted into anything the old lady fantasizes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9sEDw6rfzH2aQ24jXKWA1MyOS80.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:341889'),
