  ('355369540960404439', 'Ballad', 2009, 'Drama, Action, Romance', 'Takashi Yamazaki, Toru Yamamoto', 'Yoshito Usui', 'Tsuyoshi Kusanagi, Yui Aragaki, Takao Osawa, Yui Natsukawa, Michitaka Tsutsui, Akashi Takei', null, 'Based on the plot of an award-winning Crayon Shin-chan animated movie from 2002, a boy named Shinichi (Takei) does the time-traveling and meets a feared general named Ijiri Matabei (Kusanagi). Ijiri is in love with Princess Ren (Aragaki) who subsequently rejects an arranged marriage to Okura Itakatora (Osawa), a powerful daimyo of northern Kanto. Enraged by the rejection, Okura sends a large army to Ijiri''s smaller state and it''s up to Shinichi to change their destiny.', 'Based on the plot of an award-winning Crayon Shin-chan animated movie from 2002, a boy named Shinichi (Takei) does the time-traveling and meets a feared general named Ijiri Matabei (Kusanagi). Ijiri is in love with Princess Ren (Aragaki) who subsequently rejects an arranged marriage to Okura Itakatora (Osawa), a powerful daimyo of northern Kanto. Enraged by the rejection, Okura sends a large army to Ijiri''s smaller state and it''s up to Shinichi to change their destiny.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/11uyb0tsOSyYMdpOHpNCzHhYKNt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74493'),
  ('257695186913384308', 'Ballad for a Pierced Heart', 2020, 'Crime, Drama, Comedy', 'Yannis Economides', 'Dimosthenis Papamakarkos, Yannis Economides, Harry Lagoussis', 'Vasilis Bisbikis, Vicky Papadopoulou, Yannis Tsortekis, Stathis Stamoulakatos, Vangelis Mourikis, Giorgos Giannopoulos, Lena Kitsopoulou, Vasiliki Kalimani', null, 'In a small town in Greece, when amorous passion meets with greed money, dead bodies start pilling up and "Sleeping Beauty" Olga will never know the horrors she has been spared of.', 'In a small town in Greece, when amorous passion meets with greed money, dead bodies start pilling up and "Sleeping Beauty" Olga will never know the horrors she has been spared of.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oKa3eZpoqG6Rt6tW7li81LuY4k6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:691853'),
  ('1060422067315871730', 'Ballad of a Hussar', 1963, 'Comedy, War', 'Eldar Ryazanov, Leonid Kraynenkov, Valeri Popov', 'Aleksandr Gladkov, Eldar Ryazanov', 'Larisa Golubkina, Yuriy Yakovlev, Igor Ilyinsky, Nikolay Kryuchkov, Viktor Koltsov, Antoni Khodursky, Tatyana Shmyga, Lev Polyakov', null, 'A young girl decides to join a Hussar squadron and fight against Napoleon. Dressed as a man, she proves herself an excellent, even heroic soldier, but complications ensue when her real identity is revealed.', 'A young girl decides to join a Hussar squadron and fight against Napoleon. Dressed as a man, she proves herself an excellent, even heroic soldier, but complications ensue when her real identity is revealed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4Bzy43hgPcFKF4OYH5ih3Jrzadn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63304'),
  ('814932385597131741', 'Ballad of a Small Player', 2025, 'Crime, Drama', 'Edward Berger, James Friend, Benedict Hoermann', 'Rowan Joffé', 'Colin Farrell, Fala Chen, Tilda Swinton, Deanie Ip, Alex Jennings, Jason Tobin, Adrienne Lau, Anthony Wong Chau-Sang', 'R', 'Amid the glittering casinos of Macau, a gambler running from his past—and his debts—becomes fascinated by an enigmatic woman at the baccarat table.', 'Amid the glittering casinos of Macau, a gambler running from his past—and his debts—becomes fascinated by an enigmatic woman at the baccarat table.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yiXpXNiBWENaSJmdKfoT5DU0bL4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1272166'),
  ('407600286696643071', 'Ballad of a Soldier', 1959, 'Drama, Romance, War', 'Grigoriy Chukhray, Vladimir Nikolayev, Era Savelyeva', 'Grigoriy Chukhray, Valentin Ezhov', 'Vladimir Ivashov, Zhanna Prokhorenko, Antonina Maksimova, Nikolay Kryuchkov, Evgeniy Urbanskiy, Elza Lezhdey, Aleksandr Kuznetsov, Yevgeni Teterin', null, 'During World War II, earnest young Russian soldier Alyosha Skvortsov is rewarded with a short leave of absence for performing a heroic deed on the battlefield. Feeling homesick, he decides to visit his mother. Due to his kindhearted nature, however, Alyosha is repeatedly sidetracked by his efforts to help those he encounters, including a lovely girl named Shura. In his tour of a country devastated by war, he struggles to keep hope alive.', 'During World War II, earnest young Russian soldier Alyosha Skvortsov is rewarded with a short leave of absence for performing a heroic deed on the battlefield. Feeling homesick, he decides to visit his mother. Due to his kindhearted nature, however, Alyosha is repeatedly sidetracked by his efforts to help those he encounters, including a lovely girl named Shura. In his tour of a country devastated by war, he struggles to keep hope alive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9teeqzdIgPkWsykRapYkqhdefmm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46592'),
  ('328310281768197309', 'Ballad of a White Cow', 2021, 'Drama', 'Amin Jafari, Behtash Sanaeeha, Maryam Moghaddam', 'Behtash Sanaeeha, Mehrdad Kouroshniya, Maryam Moghaddam', 'Maryam Moghaddam, Alireza Sanifar, Pouria Rahimi Sam, Avin Poor Raoufi, Farid Ghobadi, Lily Farhadpour, Mohammad Heidari, Pejvak Imani', null, 'Mina''s life is turned upside down when she learns that her husband was innocent of the crime for which he was executed, so she starts a silent battle against a cynical system for her own and her daughter''s sake.', 'Mina''s life is turned upside down when she learns that her husband was innocent of the crime for which he was executed, so she starts a silent battle against a cynical system for her own and her daughter''s sake.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8yTPga1RA9BFsgKNFFPf7c4jELx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:669401'),
  ('533798376782808125', 'Ballad of Dog Beach', 1987, 'Crime, Drama', 'José Fonseca e Costa, Jorge Paixão da Costa, Acácio de Almeida', 'Pedro Bandeira-Freire, José Fonseca e Costa, Antonio Larreta', 'Assumpta Serna, Raul Solnado, Patrick Bauchau, Sergi Mateu, Carmen Dolores, Pedro Efe, Henrique Viana, Mario Pardo', null, 'In Portugal, in the 60s, the corpse of a man appears on Dog''s Beach. The corpse is identified as the major Dantas, a man wanted by authorities after his escape from a military prison where he was awaiting trial for insurrection.', 'In Portugal, in the 60s, the corpse of a man appears on Dog''s Beach. The corpse is identified as the major Dantas, a man wanted by authorities after his escape from a military prison where he was awaiting trial for insurrection.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f1dr8E17EmMSuaEhWfIAYmb8vUR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:270778'),
  ('1047529144637552418', 'Ballad of Khevsureti', 1966, 'Drama, History', 'Shota Managadze, Giorgi Chelidze, Rafiel Kezeli', 'Giorgi Mdivani', 'Tengiz Archvadze, Sofiko Chiaureli, Levan Pilpani, Kote Daushvili, David Abashidze, Zurab Kapianidze', null, 'When Imeda’s father is killed in a blood revenge accident, the family moves him to the city where he is sheltered at his father’s friend. After fifteen year he gets back to Khevsureti. A talented painter, he spends most of his time doing sketches of nature and people. There he meets a local beauty, Mzekala and fells in love with her but finds out that Torghva is also in love with her. Enraged by Imeda’s impudence Torghva calls him for a sword fight and is killed by Imeda. To avoid another round of blood revenge, the villagers let Imeda and Mzekala out of the village but someone who wants Imeda’s blood finds it out and follows them.', 'When Imeda’s father is killed in a blood revenge accident, the family moves him to the city where he is sheltered at his father’s friend. After fifteen year he gets back to Khevsureti. A talented painter, he spends most of his time doing sketches of nature and people. There he meets a local beauty, Mzekala and fells in love with her but finds out that Torghva is also in love with her. Enraged by Imeda’s impudence Torghva calls him for a sword fight and is killed by Imeda. To avoid another round of blood revenge, the villagers let Imeda and Mzekala out of the village but someone who wants Imeda’s blood finds it out and follows them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ubkKKKXUQzkMnOUoUCZkY7rHRYF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:295548'),
  ('121043946247654075', 'Ballad of Orin', 1977, 'Drama', 'Masahiro Shinoda, Kazuo Miyagawa', 'Keiji Hasebe, Masahiro Shinoda', 'Shima Iwashita, Yoshio Harada, Tomoko Naraoka, Taiji Tonoyama, Tōru Abe, Jun Hamamura, Kaoru Kobayashi, Rie Yokoyama', null, 'A blind traveling musician is abused and oppressed wherever she goes, even as the modern world imposes change around her.', 'A blind traveling musician is abused and oppressed wherever she goes, even as the modern world imposes change around her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u9HROwb5VKN33OjXN9kmfDCjzFa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:195028'),
  ('783583769813701167', 'Ballad of the Little Soldier', 1984, 'Documentary', 'Michael Edols, Werner Herzog, Denis Reichle', 'Denis Reichle, Werner Herzog', 'Werner Herzog, Denis Reichle', null, 'A group of Miskito Indians use Nicaraguan child soldiers in their resistance against the Sandinistas.', 'A group of Miskito Indians use Nicaraguan child soldiers in their resistance against the Sandinistas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u8XDHRexM6jiBUqkyfnjrrSOjQ9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:140003'),
  ('1000580730541081402', 'Ballast', 2008, 'Drama', 'Lol Crawley, Lance Hammer', 'Lance Hammer', 'Micheal J. Smith Sr., JimMyron Ross, Tarra Riggs, Johnny McPhail, Ventress Bonner, Jimez Alexander', 'NR', 'A single mother and her embattled son struggle to subsist in a small Mississippi Delta township. An act of violence thrusts them into the world of an emotionally devastated highway store owner, awakening the fury of a bitter and longstanding conflict.', 'A single mother and her embattled son struggle to subsist in a small Mississippi Delta township. An act of violence thrusts them into the world of an emotionally devastated highway store owner, awakening the fury of a bitter and longstanding conflict.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rjMhIWlNRiAJ5ie88PwuvdRmbs9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25112'),
  ('869008491285282553', 'Ballerina', 2016, 'Animation, Adventure, Comedy, Family', 'Jericca Cleland, Eric Summer, Éric Warin', 'Carol Noble', 'Elle Fanning, Dane DeHaan, Carly Rae Jepsen, Maddie Ziegler, Mel Brooks, Julie Khaner, Terrence Scammell, Joe Sheridan', 'PG', 'In 1879 Paris, a young orphan dreams of becoming a ballerina and flees her rural Brittany for Paris, where she passes for someone else and accedes to the position of pupil at the Grand Opera house.', 'In 1879 Paris, a young orphan dreams of becoming a ballerina and flees her rural Brittany for Paris, where she passes for someone else and accedes to the position of pupil at the Grand Opera house.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qBxMhcmNnFniuDAZTKEHcSgKtsn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:342473'),
  ('405816161299770401', 'Ballerina', 2023, 'Action, Thriller', 'Lee Chung-hyun, Cho Young-jik', 'Lee Chung-hyun', 'Jeon Jong-seo, Kim Ji-hoon, Park Yu-rim, Shin Se-hwi, Park Hyoung-soo, Park Geun-jeong, Yang Jun-seok, Lee Jae-joon', 'R', 'Grieving the loss of a best friend she couldn''t protect, an ex-bodyguard sets out to fulfill her dear friend''s last wish: sweet revenge.', 'Grieving the loss of a best friend she couldn''t protect, an ex-bodyguard sets out to fulfill her dear friend''s last wish: sweet revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oE7xtGDqZnr7tFHfwb8oM9iRW6H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:961268'),
