  ('848859624031232539', 'Ballplayer: Pelotero', 2011, 'Drama, Documentary', 'Jonathan Paley, Ross Finkel, Trevor Martin', null, 'Jean Carlos Batista, John Leguizamo, Miguel Sano', null, 'Two top baseball prospects in the Dominican Republic face fierce competition and corruption as they chase their big league dreams.', 'Two top baseball prospects in the Dominican Republic face fierce competition and corruption as they chase their big league dreams.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c7rjWn722ZrUx22FwN6UGiC5rGH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:114562'),
  ('964483247297292393', 'Ballroom', 2003, 'Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Pierre Trividic, Xavier Brillat, Patrick Mario Bernard', null, 'Patrick Mario Bernard, Pierre Trividic, Jean-Yves Jouannais, Peter Bonke', null, 'René is an artist. His studio is set up in a former nightclub that is now closed down. He lives and works there with his friend. All goes well, and yet not as well as all that. René believes he’s caught something. He doesn’t really feel sick, but he’s doesn’t feel absorbed by the world around him. Why do things that enter his mind no longer want to leave it? One of them is this photo of two strange clowns that he cut out of a magazine.', 'René is an artist. His studio is set up in a former nightclub that is now closed down. He lives and works there with his friend. All goes well, and yet not as well as all that. René believes he’s caught something. He doesn’t really feel sick, but he’s doesn’t feel absorbed by the world around him. Why do things that enter his mind no longer want to leave it? One of them is this photo of two strange clowns that he cut out of a magazine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k6cpggk4nNEgPnhExa5gj9k7p5S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82965'),
  ('1050212233088104262', 'Balls of Fury', 2007, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Thomas E. Ackerman, Robert Ben Garant', 'Thomas Lennon, Robert Ben Garant', 'Dan Fogler, Christopher Walken, George López, Maggie Q, James Hong, Brett DelBuono, Aisha Tyler, Terry Crews', 'PG-13', 'Randy Daytona was a child ping pong prodigy who lost his chance at Olympic gold when his father is murdered by the mysterious Feng over a gambling debt. 15yrs later he''s down on his luck and scraping a living doing seedy back room shows in Vegas; when the FBI turn up and ask for his help to take down Feng... who just happens to love Ping Pong.', 'Randy Daytona was a child ping pong prodigy who lost his chance at Olympic gold when his father is murdered by the mysterious Feng over a gambling debt. 15yrs later he''s down on his luck and scraping a living doing seedy back room shows in Vegas; when the FBI turn up and ask for his help to take down Feng... who just happens to love Ping Pong.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1Uc6lFCcNlaKP5uLJdQAhdDfihy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9750'),
  ('718704740357896134', 'Balls Out: Gary the Tennis Coach', 2009, 'Comedy', 'Danny Leiner, Rogier Stoffers', null, 'Seann William Scott, Randy Quaid, Brando Eaton, Leonor Varela, A.D. Miles, Emilee Wallace, Tim Williams, Ryan Simpkins', 'R', 'An overenthusiastic high-school maintenance man attempts to lead an unlikely group of misfits to the Nebraska state tennis championship in Balls Out: The Gary Houseman Story? director Danny Leiner''s underdog sports comedy. American Pie star Seann William Scott stars as the ambitious janitor who believes he has what it takes to coach the winning team.', 'An overenthusiastic high-school maintenance man attempts to lead an unlikely group of misfits to the Nebraska state tennis championship in Balls Out: The Gary Houseman Story? director Danny Leiner''s underdog sports comedy. American Pie star Seann William Scott stars as the ambitious janitor who believes he has what it takes to coach the winning team.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s8LMr71B3ByCm2E1U33d9uynudY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14141'),
  ('41800233503452293', 'Balls Up', 2026, 'Action, Comedy', 'Peter Farrelly, John Brawley, Bill Booth', 'Rhett Reese, Paul Wernick', 'Mark Wahlberg, Paul Walter Hauser, Molly Shannon, Eva De Dominici, Benjamin Bratt, Daniela Melchior, Eric André, Chelsey Crisp', 'R', 'Two American marketing executives are fired for blowing a client sponsorship opportunity and decide to use their free tickets to a major soccer match. Their drunken debauchery leads them to be hunted by every person across the country.', 'Two American marketing executives are fired for blowing a client sponsorship opportunity and decide to use their free tickets to a major soccer match. Their drunken debauchery leads them to be hunted by every person across the country.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xwvJ3WzdJ1OCuDoY8LAxBUlQyig.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1084577'),
  ('606131771057891334', 'Ballsy Girl', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Katia Lewkowicz', 'Melha Bedia, Frédéric Hazan, Katia Lewkowicz', 'Melha Bedia, Valérie Lemercier, Alison Wheeler, Ramzy Bedia, Nanou Garcia, Frédéric Deleersnyder, Bastien Ughetto, Wilfried Capet', null, 'Nour is a pleasant and funny person who works as an accountant at a fitness center in Paris. Everybody likes her, but she has no luck in her romantic endeavours because she is overweight with atypical looks. Her close friends try to give her advice, but they are not particularly successful in the love department either. Her mother and brother are also close, but they are of no help, rather the contrary. One day she witnesses a pole dancing class at her workplace, something that she would never dream of doing herself, but she sees how much the women in the class and their teacher are enjoying themselves, so she is tempted. Finally the teacher starts giving her private lessons since she is too ashamed of her body to do anything in public. Slowly but surely she gains confidence in herself and many things change in her life.', 'Nour is a pleasant and funny person who works as an accountant at a fitness center in Paris. Everybody likes her, but she has no luck in her romantic endeavours because she is overweight with atypical looks. Her close friends try to give her advice, but they are not particularly successful in the love department either. Her mother and brother are also close, but they are of no help, rather the contrary. One day she witnesses a pole dancing class at her workplace, something that she would never dream of doing herself, but she sees how much the women in the class and their teacher are enjoying themselves, so she is tempted. Finally the teacher starts giving her private lessons since she is too ashamed of her body to do anything in public. Slowly but surely she gains confidence in herself and many things change in her life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ow6wuveiqHIsSUoj3hgkxUZs9FL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:613368'),
  ('764696033584593442', 'Balnearios', 2002, 'Documentary', 'Mariano Llinás, Lucio Bonelli, Martín Mohadeb', 'Mariano Llinás', 'José Palomino, Verónica Llinás, Daniel Natanson, Mario Mactas, Eduardo Gamba, Nicolás Goldbart, Rafael Filippelli, Ulises de la Orden', null, 'An album of odd and humorous stories on small places exclusively dedicated to idleness, which are empty in winter and crowded in summer: the spa towns. Cities under water, luxury hotels, mermaids, sea animals, sand castles, people who worship water, praying for health.', 'An album of odd and humorous stories on small places exclusively dedicated to idleness, which are empty in winter and crowded in summer: the spa towns. Cities under water, luxury hotels, mermaids, sea animals, sand castles, people who worship water, praying for health.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d7vaY3AoyM2UoewquS0cryq7E86.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:255979'),
  ('405801625118544419', 'Baltimore', 2024, 'Thriller, History, Drama', 'Christine Molloy, Joe Lawlor, Tom Comerford', 'Joe Lawlor, Christine Molloy', 'Imogen Poots, Jack Meade, Tom Vaughan-Lawlor, Lewis Brophy, Dermot Crowley, John Kavanagh, Andrea Irvine, Flynn Gray', null, 'Based on actual events that took place on 26 April 1974, former debutante turned IRA member Rose Dugdale and three comrades carried out an armed raid on Russborough House, Wicklow, in which nineteen masterpieces were stolen in an effort to support the IRA’s armed struggle. The film plays out over the course of the days following the raid, when Rose is in hiding in a remote cottage.', 'Based on actual events that took place on 26 April 1974, former debutante turned IRA member Rose Dugdale and three comrades carried out an armed raid on Russborough House, Wicklow, in which nineteen masterpieces were stolen in an effort to support the IRA’s armed struggle. The film plays out over the course of the days following the raid, when Rose is in hiding in a remote cottage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q8SXr3SCtHESHkmO2mFqzqlJ09L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1171296'),
  ('267277910449237922', 'Balto', 1995, 'Family, Animation, Adventure, Drama, History', 'Simon Wells', 'Elana Lesser, Roger S.H. Schulman, David Steven Cohen', 'Kevin Bacon, Bob Hoskins, Bridget Fonda, Jim Cummings, Phil Collins, Juliette Brewer, Jack Angel, Danny Mann', 'G', 'An outcast half-wolf risks his life to prevent a deadly epidemic from ravaging Nome, Alaska.', 'An outcast half-wolf risks his life to prevent a deadly epidemic from ravaging Nome, Alaska.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dCVcdb5oxDizqFLz0F7TE60NoC9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21032'),
  ('289838914302472407', 'Balto III: Wings of Change', 2004, 'Family, Adventure, Animation', 'Phil Weinstein', 'Cliff Ruby, Elana Lesser', 'Maurice LaMarche, Jodi Benson, Sean Astin, Charles Fleischer, Bill Fagerbakke, Keith Carradine, Charity James, Kathy Najimy', 'G', 'Balto and the other sled dogs are feeling dejected because the mail that used to be delivered by dogsled is now being delivered by airplanes. But when a mail plane crashes in the mountains, the dogs come to the rescue.', 'Balto and the other sled dogs are feeling dejected because the mail that used to be delivered by dogsled is now being delivered by airplanes. But when a mail plane crashes in the mountains, the dogs come to the rescue.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3tKVHAMFTajrSLfU6gUgdubiXBG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34942'),
  ('542806843505366677', 'Balto: Wolf Quest', 2002, 'Family, Animation, Adventure', 'Phil Weinstein', 'Dev Ross', 'Maurice LaMarche, Jodi Benson, Lacey Chabert, David Carradine, Mark Hamill, Charles Fleischer, Peter MacNicol, Joe Alaskey', 'G', 'Balto and his daughter Aleu embark on a journey of adventure and self discovery.', 'Balto and his daughter Aleu embark on a journey of adventure and self discovery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dZ958HnW3JO2pEZeedjmoZCV8Rn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25913'),
  ('570406123841676691', 'Balzac and the Little Chinese Seamstress', 2002, 'Drama', 'Dai Sijie, Jean-Marie Dreujou', 'Dai Sijie, Nadine Perront', 'Zhou Xun, Chen Kun, Liu Ye, Wang Shuangbao, Cong Zhijun, Wang Hongwei, Xiao Xiong, Zuohui Tang', null, 'During the Cultural Revolution, two young men are sent to a remote mining village where they fall in love with the local tailor''s beautiful granddaughter and discover a suitcase full of forbidden Western novels.', 'During the Cultural Revolution, two young men are sent to a remote mining village where they fall in love with the local tailor''s beautiful granddaughter and discover a suitcase full of forbidden Western novels.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/boIPnACAr2J29oLanoAuMjmQP8i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2111'),
  ('690965278189815501', 'Balzac: A Life of Passion', 1999, 'Drama, Romance', 'Josée Dayan, Willy Stassen', 'Didier Decoin', 'Gérard Depardieu, Jeanne Moreau, Fanny Ardant, Virna Lisi, Katja Riemann, Claude Rich, Gert Voss, Sergio Rubini', null, 'This is the sprawling saga of Honoré de Balzac, a man who created a great literary oeuvre from the dramas and adventures of his own life - a life that he shaped into one spectacular and unforgettable blaze of passion. At the heart of the story are the women in Balzac''s life. Although gruff, unsophisticated, and far from handsome, Balzac exerts an irresistible fascination on women.', 'This is the sprawling saga of Honoré de Balzac, a man who created a great literary oeuvre from the dramas and adventures of his own life - a life that he shaped into one spectacular and unforgettable blaze of passion. At the heart of the story are the women in Balzac''s life. Although gruff, unsophisticated, and far from handsome, Balzac exerts an irresistible fascination on women.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uXDP8j4ckiZ7JqW7o2waMOqRgIk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:294148'),
  ('1129472262530097822', 'Bamako', 2006, 'Drama', 'Abderrahmane Sissako, Jacques Besse', 'Abderrahmane Sissako', 'Aïssa Maïga, Tiécoura Traoré, Maimouna Hélène Diarra, Balla Habib Dembélé, Djénéba Koné, Hamadoun Kassogué, William Bourdon, Aïssata Tall Sall', null, 'Caught in the stranglehold of debt and structural adjustment, Africa is fighting for its survival. In the face of disaster, representatives of African society bring an action against international financial institutions. The trial takes place in Bamako, in the yard of a house, among its inhabitants.', 'Caught in the stranglehold of debt and structural adjustment, Africa is fighting for its survival. In the face of disaster, representatives of African society bring an action against international financial institutions. The trial takes place in Bamako, in the yard of a house, among its inhabitants.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bWFSFt3eyd53IgsQButgAsjSsjL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62652'),
  ('1035178004011331179', 'Bambi', 1942, 'Animation, Drama, Family', 'David Hand, C.O. Slyfield, Bill Roberts', null, 'Donnie Dunagan, Peter Behn, Stan Alexander, Cammie King, Will Wright, Hardie Albright, Ann Gillis, Tim Davis', 'G', 'Bambi''s tale unfolds from season to season as the young prince of the forest learns about life, love, and friends.', 'Bambi''s tale unfolds from season to season as the young prince of the forest learns about life, love, and friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wV9e2y4myJ4KMFsyFfWYcUOawyK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3170'),
  ('452300190971647448', 'Bambi', 2013, 'Documentary', 'Sébastien Lifshitz', 'Sébastien Lifshitz', 'Marie-Pierre Pruvot', null, 'Bambi was born Jean-Pierre Pruvot in a tiny Algerian village in 1935. Even as a child, she refused to meet the expectations of her extended family, choosing instead to find a way to become the woman she always knew herself to be. A Cabaret Carrousel de Paris performance in Algiers in the 1950s proved to be all the encouragement she needed to emigrate to the French capital, assume the stage name of ‘Bambi’ and lead the life she longed for on the music-hall stages.', 'Bambi was born Jean-Pierre Pruvot in a tiny Algerian village in 1935. Even as a child, she refused to meet the expectations of her extended family, choosing instead to find a way to become the woman she always knew herself to be. A Cabaret Carrousel de Paris performance in Algiers in the 1950s proved to be all the encouragement she needed to emigrate to the French capital, assume the stage name of ‘Bambi’ and lead the life she longed for on the music-hall stages.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gWwAKOzGWHO1vZizZLgkk81r6w1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:171944'),
  ('1029722561126247014', 'Bambi II', 2006, 'Animation, Drama, Family', 'Brian Pimental', 'Alicia Kirk', 'Alexander Gould, Patrick Stewart, Brendon Baerg, Nicky Jones, Andrea Bowen, Anthony Ghannam, Cree Summer, Keith Ferguson', 'G', 'Return to the forest and join Bambi as he reunites with his father, The Great Prince, who must now raise the young fawn on his own. But in the adventure of a lifetime, the proud parent discovers there is much he can learn from his spirited young son.', 'Return to the forest and join Bambi as he reunites with his father, The Great Prince, who must now raise the young fawn on his own. But in the adventure of a lifetime, the proud parent discovers there is much he can learn from his spirited young son.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wIVLCnwYynKIiAheJoEQtC8gTjq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13205'),
  ('487914187259873455', 'Bambi Meets Godzilla', 1969, 'Comedy, Animation', 'Marv Newland', 'Marv Newland', 'Bambi, Godzilla', null, 'A deer, disillusioned by the consumerism that defines his life. A lizard, ostracized from society, forever wandering. A chance meeting in the middle of a field. Who will survive? And who will transcend existence? Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in 2009.', 'A deer, disillusioned by the consumerism that defines his life. A lizard, ostracized from society, forever wandering. A chance meeting in the middle of a field. Who will survive? And who will transcend existence? Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in 2009.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lJazOe53J7FPC2H2d6i64jFGNGC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3171'),
  ('1149634521661866595', 'Bambi: A Tale of Life in the Woods', 2024, 'Documentary, Family, Adventure', 'Michel Fessler, Laurent Charbonnier', 'Michel Fessler, Laurence Buchmann', 'Mylène Farmer, Senta Berger, Arja Koriseva', null, 'The life of Bambi, a male roe deer, from his birth through childhood, the loss of his mother, the finding of a mate, the lessons he learns from his father, and the experience he gains about the dangers posed by human hunters in the forest.', 'The life of Bambi, a male roe deer, from his birth through childhood, the loss of his mother, the finding of a mate, the lessons he learns from his father, and the experience he gains about the dangers posed by human hunters in the forest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vWNVHtwOhcoOEUSrY1iHRGbgH8O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1094473'),
  ('443623604450757846', 'Bambi: The Reckoning', 2025, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Dan Allen, Ben J. Williams, Vince Knight', 'Rhys Warrington', 'Roxanne McKee, Tom Mulheron, Adrian Relph, Nicola Wright, Alex Cooke, Ewan Borthwick, Big Tobz, Joseph Greenwood', 'NR', 'After a mother and son get in a car wreck, they soon become hunted by Bambi, a mutated grief-stricken deer on a deadly rampage seeking revenge for the death of his mother and wife.', 'After a mother and son get in a car wreck, they soon become hunted by Bambi, a mutated grief-stricken deer on a deadly rampage seeking revenge for the death of his mother and wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8oBbWxWDJrrDtNkmd0OzZpPFFUR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1049942'),
  ('501051535805094165', 'Bambina', 1974, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Alberto Lattuada, Lamberto Caimi', 'Bruno Di Geronimo', 'Gigi Proietti, Irene Papas, Teresa Ann Savoy, Mario Scaccia, Bruno Cirino, Lina Polito, Isa Miranda, Pia Attanasio Fioretti', null, 'In order to convince Raimonda, a wealthy noble woman, to finance his project for a holiday resort, Saverio gets engaged to Clotilde, her mentally-disturbed and sex-obsessed adolescent daughter. He plans to have her kidnapped and raped by an accomplice so she won''t be a virgin anymore and he''ll have an excuse to get out of the impending marriage. But what he doesn''t plan is to fall in love with the girl...', 'In order to convince Raimonda, a wealthy noble woman, to finance his project for a holiday resort, Saverio gets engaged to Clotilde, her mentally-disturbed and sex-obsessed adolescent daughter. He plans to have her kidnapped and raped by an accomplice so she won''t be a virgin anymore and he''ll have an excuse to get out of the impending marriage. But what he doesn''t plan is to fall in love with the girl...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cscbVMzq5w7AlZd2aVnR4bdR91w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80207'),
  ('414859707902655721', 'Bambola', 1996, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Bigas Luna, Fabio Conversi', 'Cesare Frugoni, Bigas Luna', 'Valeria Marini, Stefano Dionisi, Jorge Perugorría, Manuel Bandera, Anita Ekberg, Antonino Iuorio, Lilli Berquini, Arsenio Luna', null, 'Her name is Mina, but she is called Bambola (doll). Upon the death of her mother, she and her homosexual brother, Flavio, open a pizzeria. A man named Ugo loans Bambola the money, but is then killed in a fight with another one of her boyfriends, Settimio. While visiting Settimio in jail, she meets a sadistic man named Furio, and they begin a relationship.', 'Her name is Mina, but she is called Bambola (doll). Upon the death of her mother, she and her homosexual brother, Flavio, open a pizzeria. A man named Ugo loans Bambola the money, but is then killed in a fight with another one of her boyfriends, Settimio. While visiting Settimio in jail, she meets a sadistic man named Furio, and they begin a relationship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8o2xRDWl9DTmSTpdLCN0GHl9zqJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54065'),
  ('255670123610284720', 'Bamboo Doll of Echizen', 1963, 'Drama', 'Kōzaburō Yoshimura, Kazuo Miyagawa', 'Ryōzō Kasahara', 'Ayako Wakao, Junichiro Yamashita, Tamao Nakamura, Kō Nishimura, Jun Hamamura, Saburo Date, Taiji Tonoyama, Yūsaku Terashima', null, 'Kisuke, a young bamboo worker marries Tomoe, a courtesan who was once involved with Kisuke''s late father.', 'Kisuke, a young bamboo worker marries Tomoe, a courtesan who was once involved with Kisuke''s late father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tooZafPa0JT76fEanuZWWp3Urd0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:407128'),
  ('396372478254396898', 'Bamboo Revenge', 2025, 'TV Movie, Horror, Thriller', 'Raphaël Bourdin, Edgar Marie', 'Edgar Marie', 'Audrey Pirault, Sophie Maréchal, Paul Deby, Constantin Vidal, Jimony Ekila', null, 'After a party, three male friends wake up tied to the ground in a forest. Eve, who suspects them of being responsible for her sister’s disappearance, has planted a special variety of fast-growing bamboo right under them. Either they confess, or they die impaled before the end of the day.', 'After a party, three male friends wake up tied to the ground in a forest. Eve, who suspects them of being responsible for her sister’s disappearance, has planted a special variety of fast-growing bamboo right under them. Either they confess, or they die impaled before the end of the day.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k0NpRvMsjgkLQbGZLPt5thxt3lq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1301511'),
  ('686966060957202742', 'Bamboozled', 2000, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Spike Lee, Ellen Kuras, Mike Ellis', 'Spike Lee', 'Damon Wayans, Savion Glover, Jada Pinkett Smith, Tommy Davidson, Michael Rapaport, Thomas Jefferson Byrd, Paul Mooney, Gillian White', 'R', 'Frustrated when network brass reject his sitcom idea, producer Pierre Delacroix pitches the worst idea he can think of in an attempt to get fired: a 21st century minstrel show. The network not only airs it, but it becomes a smash hit.', 'Frustrated when network brass reject his sitcom idea, producer Pierre Delacroix pitches the worst idea he can think of in an attempt to get fired: a 21st century minstrel show. The network not only airs it, but it becomes a smash hit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oAg1mUUxdWJNLa6t1gctbQhXHVN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24664'),
  ('974786194699958116', 'Bambou', 2009, 'Comedy', 'Didier Bourdon', 'Didier Bourdon, Michel Delgado', 'Didier Bourdon, Anne Consigny, Pierre Arditi, Hélène Patarot, Jean-Pierre Tagliaferri, Jarry, Adeline Zarudiansky, Eddy Mitchell', null, 'Alain hopes to have a baby with his wife Anna. However, Anna believes she is destined to become a famous pianist rather than a housewife and mother. Everything changes when they adopt a female puppy named Bambou. After successfully passing an audition, Anna leaves on a concert tour with a world famous conductor. Being apart takes its toll on the couple and they decide to break up. Alain finds himself alone, without a wife or a baby--just a dog, that he is not sure he wants to keep.', 'Alain hopes to have a baby with his wife Anna. However, Anna believes she is destined to become a famous pianist rather than a housewife and mother. Everything changes when they adopt a female puppy named Bambou. After successfully passing an audition, Anna leaves on a concert tour with a world famous conductor. Being apart takes its toll on the couple and they decide to break up. Alain finds himself alone, without a wife or a baby--just a dog, that he is not sure he wants to keep.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hz6dkTYhag4cp9t9qJ9AHRcaCS1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38195'),
  ('702187017387289245', 'Bambukat 2', 2026, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Pankaj Batra', 'Jass Grewal', 'Ammy Virk, Simi Chahal, Karamjit Anmol, Binnu Dhillon, Singh Gurdeep', null, 'Disgraced and disowned, a defiant village inventor gets one last shot at redemption when a royal crash sparks a class war-forcing him to race not just for glory, but for justice.', 'Disgraced and disowned, a defiant village inventor gets one last shot at redemption when a royal crash sparks a class war-forcing him to race not just for glory, but for justice.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FyZToIdLzKfaG0sv2JKuJQMMD8Qd.jpg', 'plex:movie:bambukat-2'),
  ('658524034656797311', 'Bamse i Trollskogen', 1991, 'Animation, Fantasy, Family', 'Rune Andréasson', 'Rune Andréasson', 'Olof Thunberg', null, 'Bamse is a good-hearted bear whose grandmother cooks a special kind of honey, that gives him superpowers. When someone starts transforming the bear''s friends into balloons and other things, Bamse and his friends Skalman (a turtle) and Lille Skutt (a rabbit) must journey through the woods to stop this person.', 'Bamse is a good-hearted bear whose grandmother cooks a special kind of honey, that gives him superpowers. When someone starts transforming the bear''s friends into balloons and other things, Bamse and his friends Skalman (a turtle) and Lille Skutt (a rabbit) must journey through the woods to stop this person.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iM6tVCiZH3LlPWSskfHeafJlruM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18452'),
  ('489398769372726412', 'Ban the Sadist Videos!', 2005, 'Documentary, History', 'David Gregory', 'David Gregory', 'Wes Craven, Ruggero Deodato, Jesús Franco, Dario Argento, Romano Scavolini, Stephen Woolley, Julian Petley, Mary Whitehouse', null, 'An in-depth analysis of the "Video Nasty" scandal of the early 1980s in Britain.', 'An in-depth analysis of the "Video Nasty" scandal of the early 1980s in Britain.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cR1L2rdzTATfyolWanqUGSSTx3I.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75222'),
  ('113612766825543615', 'Bana Bir Şeyhler Oluyor', 2003, null, 'Yılmaz Erdoğan', 'Yılmaz Erdoğan', 'Yılmaz Erdoğan, Demet Akbağ, Altan Erkekli, Zerrin Sümer, Sinan Bengier, Binnur Kaya, Salih Kalyon, Bican Günalan', null, '“Anlatacaklarım var! Vaaz vermek değil niyetim, duyduğumu söylemek. Söylemeye değer şeyler duyuyorum zira. Belki hayatı daha yaşanır kılmak için ya da belki sade, ama sade anlatmak için... Sen anlat dedi Tanrı bana, anlaşılsın diye değil, hiçbir mükafat istemeden anlat... Çünkü bir mükafattır artık bir anlatıcıya doğru düzgün anlaşılmak! Sen anlat dedi... Sen sade anlat! Umudu hatırlatsın diye umutsuzluğu, çareye yol açsın diye çaresizliği anlat... Ders verme dedi kimseye, çünkü hoca denmez öğrenmesini bitirene. Çırakları olan bir çıraktır usta, olsa olsa... Sen anlat dedi bana Tanrı, sen sade anlat.... “ Yılmaz Erdoğan, “Bana Bir Şeyhler Oluyor” oyununun kahramanı Hilmi Duran’a söylettiği bu sözlerle, yazar olarak neden böyle bir oyun yazmak zorunda kaldığını açıklamakla kalmıyor, aynı zamanda kahramanının da kimliğini ele veriyor.', '“Anlatacaklarım var! Vaaz vermek değil niyetim, duyduğumu söylemek. Söylemeye değer şeyler duyuyorum zira. Belki hayatı daha yaşanır kılmak için ya da belki sade, ama sade anlatmak için... Sen anlat dedi Tanrı bana, anlaşılsın diye değil, hiçbir mükafat istemeden anlat... Çünkü bir mükafattır artık bir anlatıcıya doğru düzgün anlaşılmak! Sen anlat dedi... Sen sade anlat! Umudu hatırlatsın diye umutsuzluğu, çareye yol açsın diye çaresizliği anlat... Ders verme dedi kimseye, çünkü hoca denmez öğrenmesini bitirene. Çırakları olan bir çıraktır usta, olsa olsa... Sen anlat dedi bana Tanrı, sen sade anlat.... “ Yılmaz Erdoğan, “Bana Bir Şeyhler Oluyor” oyununun kahramanı Hilmi Duran’a söylettiği bu sözlerle, yazar olarak neden böyle bir oyun yazmak zorunda kaldığını açıklamakla kalmıyor, aynı zamanda kahramanının da kimliğini ele veriyor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vVcAEnGjYAPOn4pwTtvj3n4ighC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83565'),
  ('264557207240845412', 'Bana Bir Soygun Yaz', 2012, 'Comedy', 'Biray Dalkıran, Seyhan Bilir', 'İnci Uluçay', 'Hakan Yılmaz, Çetin Altay, Umut Oğuz, Mehmet Özgür, Mehmet Usta, Sera Tokdemir, Hazel Çamlıdere, Ömür Arpacı', null, 'When Onur’s girlfriend Leyla burns his belongings, including a mysterious box of pastries meant for Hacamat Hüso’s friend, she unwittingly destroys fifty thousand euros hidden inside. Homeless and confused, Onur turns to childhood pals Fiko and Süleyman, only to be grabbed by Hacamat’s men and beaten, prompting the three friends to scramble desperately to recover the lost money and save their lives.', 'When Onur’s girlfriend Leyla burns his belongings, including a mysterious box of pastries meant for Hacamat Hüso’s friend, she unwittingly destroys fifty thousand euros hidden inside. Homeless and confused, Onur turns to childhood pals Fiko and Süleyman, only to be grabbed by Hacamat’s men and beaten, prompting the three friends to scramble desperately to recover the lost money and save their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sr2lW3gXxHs8VzPjtcH3tnalm9J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:179737'),
  ('407088251566237649', 'Banana', 2010, 'Animation, Family, Comedy', 'Kyle Balda, Samuel Tourneux', 'Pierre Coffin', 'Pierre Coffin', 'G', 'The Minions fight over a delicious banana... but is that all they want?!', 'The Minions fight over a delicious banana... but is that all they want?!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AnmIMKAQjXLjD2DI0ba4D9DpkHv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54551'),
  ('743975609400604440', 'Banana', 2015, 'Comedy', 'Gherardo Gossi, Massimiliano Sturiale, Andrea Jublin', 'Andrea Jublin', 'Ascanio Balbo, Anna Bonaiuto, Giorgio Colangeli, Camilla Filippi, Gianfelice Imparato, Andrea Jublin, Marco Todisco, Giselda Volodi', null, 'Giovanni, known as "Banana" because of his mania for wearing a Brazil jersey, is a 14-year-old boy trying not to give up on his dreams in a world of frustrated, giving up and courageless people. Out of Competition "Sezione Cinema al parco" Giffoni 2015', 'Giovanni, known as "Banana" because of his mania for wearing a Brazil jersey, is a 14-year-old boy trying not to give up on his dreams in a world of frustrated, giving up and courageless people. Out of Competition "Sezione Cinema al parco" Giffoni 2015', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hyHTIeWqgSm8slpTbSnj8zbIdCm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:318368'),
  ('373120451535366182', 'Banana Joe', 1982, 'Action, Comedy', 'Steno, Luigi Kuveiller, Massimo Carocci', 'Bud Spencer, Mario Amendola, Steno', 'Bud Spencer, Marina Langner, Mario Scarpetta, Gianfranco Barra, Enzo Garinei, Gunther Philipp, Giorgio Bracardi, Gisela Hahn', null, 'Island farmer Banana Joe helps the local community by trading his bananas for goods. When gangsters arrive with plans to construct a banana processing plant, Joe kicks them out, but the mob boss discovers that Joe is operating without a license. After the mob tips off the authorities and Joe''s boat is impounded, he ventures into a big city for the first time to seek help.', 'Island farmer Banana Joe helps the local community by trading his bananas for goods. When gangsters arrive with plans to construct a banana processing plant, Joe kicks them out, but the mob boss discovers that Joe is operating without a license. After the mob tips off the authorities and Joe''s boat is impounded, he ventures into a big city for the first time to seek help.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jMFM6rbvpglsazWkTBTbF9RUKXH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11340'),
  ('730408382729106316', 'Banana Paradise', 1989, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Wang Tung, Liao Pen-jung, Ming-kuo Lin', 'Sung Wang', 'Doze Niu Cheng-Tse, Chang Shih, Wen Ying, Regina Tsang Hing-Yu, Go Ming, Li Kun, Elten Ting, Kai-Chun Chen', null, 'A young man and his friend move to Taiwan, believing it to be a land of possibilities, but it''s not long before they''re accused of being spies.', 'A young man and his friend move to Taiwan, believing it to be a land of possibilities, but it''s not long before they''re accused of being spies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2aowPFxvHWINYklcBMOPuaGEAE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:262831'),
  ('1038386009017467600', 'Banana Peel', 1963, 'Comedy', 'Marcel Ophüls', 'Charles Williams, Marcel Ophüls, Claude Sautet', 'Jean-Paul Belmondo, Jeanne Moreau, Claude Brasseur, Jean-Pierre Marielle, Gert Fröbe, Alain Cuny, Paulette Dubost, Henri Poirier', null, 'Two scoundrels cheat a millionaire out of a huge bankroll on the French Riviera.', 'Two scoundrels cheat a millionaire out of a huge bankroll on the French Riviera.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/doEewFNc6WYGK4hw5PR0sQqnHP3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83663'),
  ('895692642745845781', 'Banana Split', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Benjamin Kasulke, Darin Moran', 'Joey Power, Hannah Marks', 'Hannah Marks, Liana Liberato, Dylan Sprouse, Luke Spencer Roberts, Meagan Kimberly Smith, Haley Ramm, Jessica Hecht, Addison Riecke', 'R', 'After a messy breakup with her high school boyfriend, April strikes up an unexpected friendship with his new girlfriend, Clara.', 'After a messy breakup with her high school boyfriend, April strikes up an unexpected friendship with his new girlfriend, Clara.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4bzLK14ytjEcOEeLsmICP2ddlXs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:493058'),
  ('7809448041842663', 'Bananas', 1971, 'Comedy', 'Woody Allen, Andrew M. Costikyan, Fred T. Gallo', 'Woody Allen, Mickey Rose', 'Woody Allen, Louise Lasser, Carlos Montalbán, Nati Abascal, Jacobo Morales, Miguel Ángel Suárez, René Enríquez, Jack Axelrod', 'PG-13', 'When a bumbling New Yorker is dumped by his activist girlfriend, he travels to a tiny Latin American nation and becomes involved in its latest rebellion.', 'When a bumbling New Yorker is dumped by his activist girlfriend, he travels to a tiny Latin American nation and becomes involved in its latest rebellion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gK11RUXspxqty0Wq6KoV8J0crKO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11302'),
  ('244385214915945390', 'Band Aid', 2017, 'Comedy, Drama, Music', 'Zoe Lister-Jones, Hillary Spera', 'Zoe Lister-Jones', 'Zoe Lister-Jones, Adam Pally, Fred Armisen, Susie Essman, Retta, Hannah Simone, Ravi Patel, Brooklyn Decker', 'R', 'A couple who can''t stop fighting embark on a last-ditch effort to save their marriage: turning their fights into songs and starting a band.', 'A couple who can''t stop fighting embark on a last-ditch effort to save their marriage: turning their fights into songs and starting a band.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hDYKhDkmvvPnYESr1yNG3K5oMZT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:426230'),
  ('937626193526520226', 'Band Baaja Baaraat', 2010, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Maneesh Sharma, Aseem Mishra', 'Habib Faisal', 'Ranveer Singh, Anushka Sharma, Neeraj Sood, Manmeet Singh, Revant Shergill, Puru Chibber, Manish Chaudhary, Manit Joura', null, 'Shruti and Bittoo decide to start a wedding planning company together after they graduate from university, but romance gets in the way of business.', 'Shruti and Bittoo decide to start a wedding planning company together after they graduate from university, but romance gets in the way of business.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uEh8cvyaW1uKfqvB4HJ8ALoT72M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52696'),
  ('684034260924470284', 'Band Melam', 2026, 'Drama, Romance', 'Sathish Javvaji, Satish Muthyala, Vijai Bulganin', 'Sathish Javvaji, Siva Mupparaju', 'Harsh Roshan, Sridevi Apalla, Narni Srinivas, Chandrabose, Sai Kumar', null, 'Childhood friends Giri and Raaji are torn apart by misfortune and misunderstanding. She pursues education while he follows music with his village band. Their diverging paths eventually lead to an unexpected reunion that changes everything.', 'Childhood friends Giri and Raaji are torn apart by misfortune and misunderstanding. She pursues education while he follows music with his village band. Their diverging paths eventually lead to an unexpected reunion that changes everything.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F4hdgEE7GLj0JLP0q0GXwslG3s7C.jpg', 'plex:movie:band-melam'),
  ('870499911391204232', 'Band of Angels', 1957, 'Romance, Drama, History', 'Raoul Walsh, Lucien Ballard', 'John Twist, Ivan Goff, Ben Roberts', 'Clark Gable, Yvonne De Carlo, Sidney Poitier, Efrem Zimbalist Jr., Rex Reason, Patric Knowles, Torin Thatcher, Andrea King', null, 'Living in Kentucky prior to the Civil War, Amantha Starr is a privileged young woman. Her widowed father, a wealthy plantation owner, dotes on her and sends her to the best schools. When he dies suddenly Amantha''s world is turned upside down. She learns that her father had been living on borrowed money and that her mother was actually a slave and her father''s mistress.', 'Living in Kentucky prior to the Civil War, Amantha Starr is a privileged young woman. Her widowed father, a wealthy plantation owner, dotes on her and sends her to the best schools. When he dies suddenly Amantha''s world is turned upside down. She learns that her father had been living on borrowed money and that her mother was actually a slave and her father''s mistress.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6GfZUN17gZpcTFjAQlmQnuXDHGc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37311'),
  ('441041406493817471', 'Band of Outsiders', 1964, 'Crime, Drama, Comedy', 'Raoul Coutard, Jean-Luc Godard, Hélène Kalougine', 'Jean-Luc Godard', 'Anna Karina, Claude Brasseur, Sami Frey, Danièle Girard, Louisa Colpeyn, Chantal Darget, Georges Staquet, Ernest Menzer', 'NR', 'Cinephile slackers Franz and Arthur spend their days mimicking the antiheroes of Hollywood noirs and Westerns while pursuing the lovely Odile. The misfit trio upends convention at every turn, be it through choreographed dances in cafés or frolicsome romps through the Louvre. Eventually, their romantic view of outlaws pushes them to plan their own heist, but their inexperience may send them out in a blaze of glory -- which could be just what they want.', 'Cinephile slackers Franz and Arthur spend their days mimicking the antiheroes of Hollywood noirs and Westerns while pursuing the lovely Odile. The misfit trio upends convention at every turn, be it through choreographed dances in cafés or frolicsome romps through the Louvre. Eventually, their romantic view of outlaws pushes them to plan their own heist, but their inexperience may send them out in a blaze of glory -- which could be just what they want.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9oqyj79xmcypxLajJdefOtrYx64.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8073'),
  ('515584824043425962', 'Band of Robbers', 2016, 'Adventure, Comedy, Crime, Thriller', 'Aaron Nee, Adam Nee, Noah Rosenthal', 'Aaron Nee, Adam Nee', 'Kyle Gallner, Adam Nee, Matthew Gray Gubler, Hannibal Buress, Melissa Benoist, Daniel Edward Mora, Stephen Lang, Eric Christian Olsen', null, 'A comedic thriller that re-imagines Mark Twain''s iconic literary characters of "Huckleberry Finn" and "Tom Sawyer" as grown men in current day.', 'A comedic thriller that re-imagines Mark Twain''s iconic literary characters of "Huckleberry Finn" and "Tom Sawyer" as grown men in current day.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3gI49YGN95dfipPoofOdQlEkqqr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:333675'),
  ('881643191541460643', 'Band of the Hand', 1986, 'Action', 'Reynaldo Villalobos, Paul Michael Glaser', 'Jack Baran, Leo Garen', 'Stephen Lang, Michael Carmine, Lauren Holly, John Cameron Mitchell, Danny Quinn, Leon, James Remar, Laurence Fishburne', 'R', 'An Indian Vietnam veteran trains five street punks in the Everglades to fight vice in Miami.', 'An Indian Vietnam veteran trains five street punks in the Everglades to fight vice in Miami.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ypfbaT6qB8cUfeflK7PO9F4hvsm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33762'),
  ('1131160516194565899', 'Band Together', 2026, 'Drama, Music', 'Daniel Sánchez Arévalo, Rafa García, Conchi Iglesias', 'Daniel Sánchez Arévalo', 'Javier Gutiérrez, María Vázquez, Judith Fernández, Tamar Novas, Carlos Blanco, Fer Fraga, Xosé A. Touriñán, Marta Larralde', null, 'Two years after the tragic sinking of a fishing boat that shook a small seaside town, the members of the rondalla, a traditional music band, decide to get back together in the endeavour to recover their enthusiasm and leave the grieving behind.', 'Two years after the tragic sinking of a fishing boat that shook a small seaside town, the members of the rondalla, a traditional music band, decide to get back together in the endeavour to recover their enthusiasm and leave the grieving behind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A7bLtYFI04Qb73Vl0qKrVJDDinO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1437873'),
  ('141639976537592738', 'Bandage', 2010, 'Drama, Music, Romance', 'Takeshi Kobayashi', 'Shunji Iwai, Chika Kan', 'Jin Akanishi, Kie Kitano, Kengo Kora, Yuki Shibamoto, Nobuaki Kaneko, Anne Watanabe, Ayumi Ito, Hideyuki Kasahara', null, 'Set in the 1990s during Japan''s "band boom" era, the film tells the tale of a girl in high school, Asako, who goes to a concert and meets Natsu, vocalist of the new band LANDS. Asako ends up being the band manager, but as the band''s popularity starts to soar, the band''s friendship begins to suffer.', 'Set in the 1990s during Japan''s "band boom" era, the film tells the tale of a girl in high school, Asako, who goes to a concert and meets Natsu, vocalist of the new band LANDS. Asako ends up being the band manager, but as the band''s popularity starts to soar, the band''s friendship begins to suffer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/73e2jIBGOun3aUBMl91xyL6Ezzd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74495'),
  ('731526910207933159', 'Banderas, the Tyrant', 1993, 'Drama', 'José Luis García Sánchez, Tessa Hernández, Fernando Arribas', 'José Luis García Sánchez, Rafael Azcona', 'Gian Maria Volonté, Ana Belén, Juan Diego, Fernando Guillén, Javier Gurruchaga, Manuel Bandera, Patricio Contreras, Ignacio López Tarso', null, 'In Santa Fe de Tierra Firme, an imaginary Latin American country, the indigenous dictator Santos Banderas rules with an iron fist. A group of rebels trying to seize power by force while some liberals try a change of government legally.', 'In Santa Fe de Tierra Firme, an imaginary Latin American country, the indigenous dictator Santos Banderas rules with an iron fist. A group of rebels trying to seize power by force while some liberals try a change of government legally.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aqkbZqmW7Vwkp9OnidyM1u3CKsF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:189291'),
  ('259008033505845452', 'Bandhan', 1998, 'Family', 'Rajesh Malik, K. Murali Mohana Rao, Rajan Kinagi', null, 'Salman Khan, Jackie Shroff, Rambha, Shweta Menon, Himani Shivpuri, Aanjjan Srivastav, Shakti Kapoor, Ashok Saraf', null, 'Unable to bear a child, Pooja is asked to compromise with her husband''s new mistress or leave the house. Pooja''s brother, Raju decides to fight for his sister and reunite her with her husband.', 'Unable to bear a child, Pooja is asked to compromise with her husband''s new mistress or leave the house. Pooja''s brother, Raju decides to fight for his sister and reunite her with her husband.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4eL44roDevhwdu87MkLNzucG2ps.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:161229'),
  ('631061877905990134', 'Bandhobi', 2009, 'Drama', 'Shin Dong-il, Park Jong-cheol', 'Lee Chang-won, Shin Dong-il', 'Baek Jin-hee, Mahbub Alam, Park Hyuk-kwon, Yang Hae-hun, Kim Sun, Kim Jae-rok, Lee Il-hwa, Jung Byung-gil', null, 'Min-Seo, a 17-year old rebellious high school Korean girl, lives in a small apartment with her mother and her mother’s penniless lover. She hates her mother’s lover and doesn’t understand both of them. Karim, a 29-year old Muslim migrant worker from Bangladesh has to leave Korea in a month. Before departing, he is desperately searching for his ex-boss to get his unpaid salary. One day, as Min-Seo’s summer vacation begins, Karim encounters Min-Seo on a bus, and together they set out on an emotional journey.', 'Min-Seo, a 17-year old rebellious high school Korean girl, lives in a small apartment with her mother and her mother’s penniless lover. She hates her mother’s lover and doesn’t understand both of them. Karim, a 29-year old Muslim migrant worker from Bangladesh has to leave Korea in a month. Before departing, he is desperately searching for his ex-boss to get his unpaid salary. One day, as Min-Seo’s summer vacation begins, Karim encounters Min-Seo on a bus, and together they set out on an emotional journey.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yfPEIVHuYJTbXHjp8QEzX7QamDb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66644'),
  ('1126207040251542094', 'Bandidas', 2006, 'Action, Comedy, Western, Crime', 'Joachim Rønning, Espen Sandberg, Thierry Arbogast', 'Robert Mark Kamen, Luc Besson', 'Penélope Cruz, Salma Hayek Pinault, Steve Zahn, Dwight Yoakam, Denis Arndt, Sam Shepard, Edgar Vivar, Ismael ''East'' Carlo', 'PG-13', 'When a ruthless robber baron takes away everything they cherish, a rough-and-tumble, idealistic peasant and a sophisticated heiress embark on a quest for justice, vengeance…and a few good heists.', 'When a ruthless robber baron takes away everything they cherish, a rough-and-tumble, idealistic peasant and a sophisticated heiress embark on a quest for justice, vengeance…and a few good heists.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/31wgXG6OxDaXbp5IzyNoUJdVS5e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1969'),
  ('115038059738055917', 'Bandido!', 1956, 'Action, Western', 'Richard Fleischer', 'Earl Felton', 'Robert Mitchum, Ursula Thiess, Gilbert Roland, Zachary Scott, Rodolfo Acosta, José Torvay, Henry Brandon, Douglas Fowley', 'NR', 'American arms dealer Kennedy hopes to make a killing by selling to the "regulares" in the 1916 Mexican revolution. American mercenary Wilson favors the rebel faction headed by Escobar, and they plot to hijack Kennedy''s arms; but Wilson also has his eye on Kennedy''s wife. Raids, counter-raids, and escapes follow in a veritable hail of bullets.', 'American arms dealer Kennedy hopes to make a killing by selling to the "regulares" in the 1916 Mexican revolution. American mercenary Wilson favors the rebel faction headed by Escobar, and they plot to hijack Kennedy''s arms; but Wilson also has his eye on Kennedy''s wife. Raids, counter-raids, and escapes follow in a veritable hail of bullets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rHwBVEK7HxurPkBuVJaeAE5ixqO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44022'),
  ('580963310124450313', 'Bandidos', 1967, 'Western', 'Massimo Dallamano, Emilio Foriscot', 'Juan Cobos, Romano Migliorini, Gianbattista Mussetto', 'Enrico Maria Salerno, Terry Jenkins, María Martín, Venantino Venantini, Marco Guglielmi, Cris Huerta, Massimo Sarchielli, Jesús Puente', null, 'Renowned gunman Richard Martin is traveling on a train, held up by Billy Kane, a former student of Martin''s. Kane spares Martin, but only after shooting his hands. Years later, Martin meets an escaped convict, wrongly convicted for the train robbery. Martin trains his new student and both men seek out Billy Kane.', 'Renowned gunman Richard Martin is traveling on a train, held up by Billy Kane, a former student of Martin''s. Kane spares Martin, but only after shooting his hands. Years later, Martin meets an escaped convict, wrongly convicted for the train robbery. Martin trains his new student and both men seek out Billy Kane.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lL6y17DDsiO0NCcfFhUqApY9Bb5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:90015'),
  ('662605617330919517', 'Bandidos', 1991, 'Adventure', 'Luis Estrada, Emmanuel Lubezki', null, 'Eduardo Toussaint, Jorge Poza, Alan Gutiérrez, Sebastián Hiriart, Damián Alcázar, Pedro Armendáriz Jr., Jorge Russek, Gabriela Roel', null, 'In the wake of the Mexican Revolution, a band of pre-teen boys are forced to rely on their own resources for survival.', 'In the wake of the Mexican Revolution, a band of pre-teen boys are forced to rely on their own resources for survival.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4ZbEey7fZt2N3ibc0Oz4f5O5i3w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:317246'),
  ('291964080711217731', 'Bandini', 1963, 'Romance, Drama', 'Bimal Roy, Kamal Bose, Mukul Dutt', 'Nabendu Ghosh', 'Nutan, Ashok Kumar, Dharmendra, Raja Paranjpe, Tarun Bose, Moni Chatterjee, Iftekhar, Chandrima Bhaduri', null, 'In 1930s British-ruled Bengal, a prison-doctor falls in love with a convicted murderer with past connections to a freedom fighter.', 'In 1930s British-ruled Bengal, a prison-doctor falls in love with a convicted murderer with past connections to a freedom fighter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oRb3wtRUzPtGTEtjLNusu7z4kt2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82595'),
  ('304068672764436021', 'Bandit', 2022, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Allan Ungar, Alexander Chinnici', 'Kraig Wenman', 'Josh Duhamel, Elisha Cuthbert, Mel Gibson, Nestor Carbonell, Lorenzo Yearby, Swen Temmel, Keith Arthur Bolden, Dylan Flashner', 'R', 'After escaping a Michigan prison, a charming career criminal assumes a new identity in Canada and goes on to rob a record 59 banks and jewellery stores while being hunted by a rogue task force. Based on the true story of The Flying Bandit.', 'After escaping a Michigan prison, a charming career criminal assumes a new identity in Canada and goes on to rob a record 59 banks and jewellery stores while being hunted by a rogue task force. Based on the true story of The Flying Bandit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yph9PAbmjYPvyvbeZvdYIhCZHEu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:842942'),
  ('819076875164402730', 'Bandit Queen', 1994, 'Action, Crime, Drama, History', 'Shekhar Kapur, Alok Kapur, Rajiv Maikhuri', 'Mala Sen', 'Seema Biswas, Nirmal Pandey, Rajesh Vivek, Raghubir Yadav, Aditya Srivastava, Manoj Bajpayee, Ranjit Chowdhry, Harish Kumar', 'NR', 'Born a lower-caste girl in rural India''s patriarchal society, "married" at 11, repeatedly raped and brutalized, Phoolan Devi finds freedom only as an avenging warrior, the eponymous Bandit Queen. Devi becomes a kind a bloody Robin Hood; this extraordinary biographical film offers both a vivid portrait of a driven woman and a savage critique of the society that made her.', 'Born a lower-caste girl in rural India''s patriarchal society, "married" at 11, repeatedly raped and brutalized, Phoolan Devi finds freedom only as an avenging warrior, the eponymous Bandit Queen. Devi becomes a kind a bloody Robin Hood; this extraordinary biographical film offers both a vivid portrait of a driven woman and a savage critique of the society that made her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aYJgxlxo0NZvA075d4BelEjsbJA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14785'),
  ('616645570505671992', 'Bandit: Bandit Goes Country', 1994, 'Comedy, Action, TV Movie', 'Michael Shea, Hal Needham, Tom Connors', null, 'Brian Bloom, Brian Krause, Christopher Atkins, Elizabeth Berkley, Charles Nelson Reilly, Mel Tillis, Tyler Mane, Al Wiggins', 'PG', 'Bandit returns home for a family reunion. Mel Tillis, forced to make an emergency landing when his plane malfunctions, joins in on the fun', 'Bandit returns home for a family reunion. Mel Tillis, forced to make an emergency landing when his plane malfunctions, joins in on the fun', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9ycnKjFlPV2XY9pYDHevORHaB0C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81994'),
  ('567641494165221582', 'Bandit: Bandit, Bandit', 1994, 'Comedy, Action, TV Movie', 'Tom Connors, Robert Webb, Robin A. Warren', 'Brock Yates', 'Brian Bloom, Brian Krause, Richard Belzer, Gerard Christopher, Ami Dolenz, Larry Manetti, Mary Ann Mobley, Ronna Reeves', 'PG', 'Assigned to deliver a prototype car to a press conference for the Governor, things are complicated by a fraudulent Bandit who ends up stealing Bandit''s rig AND the prototype. Now Bandit has to find out who''s out to ruin his life and recover the car before the Governor''s career is crucified by Big Bob on his radio show and while avoiding a determined Sheriff Buford Enright.', 'Assigned to deliver a prototype car to a press conference for the Governor, things are complicated by a fraudulent Bandit who ends up stealing Bandit''s rig AND the prototype. Now Bandit has to find out who''s out to ruin his life and recover the car before the Governor''s career is crucified by Big Bob on his radio show and while avoiding a determined Sheriff Buford Enright.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3WomnwvLLc3bd2wJ6VBBVSE9FD8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81993'),
  ('763999381910564011', 'Bandit: Bandit''s Silver Angel', 1994, 'Comedy, Action, TV Movie', 'Hal Needham, Michael Shea, Tom Connors', 'Jay Huguely', 'Brian Bloom, Brian Krause, Scott Bloom, Christine Jansen, David Lenthall, Donald O''Connor, Traci Lords, Beth Bruce', 'PG', 'Bandit (Brian Bloom) gets an unexpected and unwelcome visit from his eccentric Uncle Cyrus.', 'Bandit (Brian Bloom) gets an unexpected and unwelcome visit from his eccentric Uncle Cyrus.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tN1fb6JnrIZOKylps9UEJ3d9429.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81996'),
  ('194953194793138503', 'Bandits', 1987, 'Drama', 'Claude Lelouch, Jean-Yves Le Mener', 'Claude Lelouch', 'Jean Yanne, Marie-Sophie L., Patrick Bruel, Charles Gérard, Corinne Marchand, Hélène Surgère, Edwige Navarro, Françoise Bette', null, 'On the day Jean Gabin dies, a kidnaper who also takes a fortune in jewels heisted from Cartiers murders Simon Verini''s wife. (Simon was fencing the jewels for a youthful gang who robbed Cartiers; he suspects them of the murder.) He''s framed for the theft and spends ten years in prison, writing to his daughter, Marie-Sophie, who''s 11 when he''s sent away. Released, he reconnects to Marie-Sophie and to the young thieves, seeks revenge, and is quickly arrested again. She doesn''t know what to make of her father, retreats to her Swiss fiancé, and is flummoxed when one of the young thieves falls for her. Is resolution possible when crime cuts across families and romance?', 'On the day Jean Gabin dies, a kidnaper who also takes a fortune in jewels heisted from Cartiers murders Simon Verini''s wife. (Simon was fencing the jewels for a youthful gang who robbed Cartiers; he suspects them of the murder.) He''s framed for the theft and spends ten years in prison, writing to his daughter, Marie-Sophie, who''s 11 when he''s sent away. Released, he reconnects to Marie-Sophie and to the young thieves, seeks revenge, and is quickly arrested again. She doesn''t know what to make of her father, retreats to her Swiss fiancé, and is flummoxed when one of the young thieves falls for her. Is resolution possible when crime cuts across families and romance?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rYLObQ8eSN7Eqf8WomwyQjsnGyU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:163883'),
  ('549389637706565176', 'Bandits', 1997, 'Drama, Music', 'Katja von Garnier, Torsten Breuer', 'Katja von Garnier, Uwe Wilhelm', 'Katja Riemann, Jasmin Tabatabai, Nicolette Krebitz, Jutta Hoffmann, Hannes Jaenicke, Werner Schreyer, Andrea Sawatzki, Oliver Hasenfratz', null, 'Four female cons who have formed a band in prison get a chance to play at a police ball outside the walls. They take the chance to escape. Being on the run from the law they even make it to sell their music and become famous outlaws.', 'Four female cons who have formed a band in prison get a chance to play at a police ball outside the walls. They take the chance to escape. Being on the run from the law they even make it to sell their music and become famous outlaws.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/khd2KRF2G77kZtIy8pgoB0k8j7A.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11526'),
  ('862161006624749676', 'Bandits', 2001, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Barry Levinson, Dante Spinotti, Josh McLaglen', 'Harley Peyton', 'Bruce Willis, Billy Bob Thornton, Cate Blanchett, Troy Garity, William Converse-Roberts, Brían F. O''Byrne, Stacey Travis, Azura Skye', 'PG-13', 'After escaping from prison, Joe and Terry go on a crime spree, robbing banks through Oregon and California in order to finance their scheme for a new life south of the border. Unfortunately, things get more complicated when they meet Kate, who runs into them with her car. She joins the bandits on their cross-country spree, and eventually she steals something, too: their hearts.', 'After escaping from prison, Joe and Terry go on a crime spree, robbing banks through Oregon and California in order to finance their scheme for a new life south of the border. Unfortunately, things get more complicated when they meet Kate, who runs into them with her car. She joins the bandits on their cross-country spree, and eventually she steals something, too: their hearts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vy5oMqjiYjjd7VWLnqo6c3u88lC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3172'),
  ('1139768380685135129', 'Bandits of Orgosolo', 1961, 'Drama', 'Vittorio De Seta, Vera Gherarducci, Vittorio De Seta', 'Vera Gherarducci, Vittorio De Seta', 'Michele Cossu, Peppeddu Cuccu, Vittorina Pisano', null, 'A Sardinian peasant is implicated in the murder of a policeman and, although innocent, he doesn’t give himself up, lacking faith in the judicial system and fearing that he may lose his sheep while awaiting trial.', 'A Sardinian peasant is implicated in the murder of a policeman and, although innocent, he doesn’t give himself up, lacking faith in the judicial system and fearing that he may lose his sheep while awaiting trial.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3aQfkCI5xDIBPqfyIV4xLtcbxSP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:122699'),
  ('794786148097619530', 'Bandits vs. Samurai Squadron', 1978, 'Action, Adventure, Drama', 'Hideo Gosha, Masao Kosugi, Tadashi Sakai', 'Kaneo Ikegami', 'Tatsuya Nakadai, Shima Iwashita, Matsumoto Hakuō II, Takashi Yamaguchi, Tetsuro Tamba, Keiko Matsuzaka, Teruhiko Aoi, Shōji Ishibashi', null, 'Kumokiri Nizaemon, a former samurai warrior, has abandoned his class to become the leader of a gang of thieves. He leads his outlaws in an attempt to rob the castle of his former clan.', 'Kumokiri Nizaemon, a former samurai warrior, has abandoned his class to become the leader of a gang of thieves. He leads his outlaws in an attempt to rob the castle of his former clan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gECHV1z1anC4SSIsrtnHvFQXPUX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58875'),
  ('1088878754248926006', 'Bandolero!', 1968, 'Western', 'Andrew V. McLaglen, William H. Clothier, Terry Morse Jr.', 'James Lee Barrett', 'James Stewart, Dean Martin, George Kennedy, Raquel Welch, Andrew Prine, Will Geer, Clint Ritchie, Denver Pyle', 'PG-13', 'Posing as a hangman, Mace Bishop arrives in town with the intention of freeing a gang of outlaws, including his brother, from the gallows. Mace urges his younger brother to give up crime. The sheriff chases the brothers to Mexico. They join forces, however, against a group of Mexican bandits.', 'Posing as a hangman, Mace Bishop arrives in town with the intention of freeing a gang of outlaws, including his brother, from the gallows. Mace urges his younger brother to give up crime. The sheriff chases the brothers to Mexico. They join forces, however, against a group of Mexican bandits.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vzBzyeE4XXOsWokyX8EWqcNCNbG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41857'),
  ('590495406085413545', 'Bandslam', 2009, 'Comedy, Drama, Family, Music, Romance', 'Todd Graff, Eric Steelberg, K.C. Hodenfield', 'Todd Graff, Josh A. Cagan', 'Aly Michalka, Vanessa Hudgens, Gaelan Connell, Scott Porter, Ryan Donowho, Charlie Saxton, Lisa Kudrow, Tim Jo', 'PG', 'A new kid in town assembles a fledgling rock band — together, they achieve their dreams and compete against the best in the biggest event of the year, a battle of the bands.', 'A new kid in town assembles a fledgling rock band — together, they achieve their dreams and compete against the best in the biggest event of the year, a battle of the bands.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z654TmQygFasbyi52vwHv8fWxoi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23367'),
  ('752158752810185574', 'Banel & Adama', 2023, 'Drama', 'Ramata-Toulaye Sy, Amine Berrada, Fabacary Coly', 'Ramata-Toulaye Sy', 'Khady Mane, Mamadou Diallo, Binta Racine Sy, Moussa Sow, Ndiabel Diallo, Oumar Samba Dia, Amadou Ndiaye, Amadou Hady Sall', null, 'Chaos ensues shortly after a young man in a remote village in northern Senegal refuses to accept his role as the new village chief.', 'Chaos ensues shortly after a young man in a remote village in northern Senegal refuses to accept his role as the new village chief.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s7qnEdfpdLYWWw8CFs0dqQftt9Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:995806'),
  ('734226088647156343', 'Bañeros 4: Los rompeolas', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Emiliano Alfonsín, Rodolfo Ledo, Gaston Guisado', 'Salvador Valverde Freire, Salvador Valverde Calvo', 'Emilio Disi, Fátima Florez, Gladys Florimonte, Nazareno Móttola, Pachu Peña, Pablo Granados, Freddy Villareal, Karina Jelinek', null, 'The new bathers, together with a spectacular bathtub, will arrive in Mar del Plata with funny gags on the beach, ingenious inventions, innovative traps and imitations, and with the help of the marine animals from the Aquarium, they will face an evil businessman, in a spectacular and fun ending.', 'The new bathers, together with a spectacular bathtub, will arrive in Mar del Plata with funny gags on the beach, ingenious inventions, innovative traps and imitations, and with the help of the marine animals from the Aquarium, they will face an evil businessman, in a spectacular and fun ending.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nBSxogLnVjeOBivLYAYuo6OAsO4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:296945'),
  ('267103801757175127', 'Bañeros 5: Lentos y cargosos', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Luis Alberto Scalella, Gaston Guisado, Rodolfo Ledo', 'Salvador Valverde Calvo, Salvador Valverde Freire', 'Pablo Granados, Pachu Peña, Pichu Straneo, Nazareno Móttola, Gino Renni, Luisa Albinoni, Charlotte Caniggia, Alexander Caniggia', null, '31 years after the first Bañeros, comes the fifth installment of the saga in which the spa is to be sold to new owners, unless the bañeros find a way to collect the money to pay what they owe and avoid losing their place of work.', '31 years after the first Bañeros, comes the fifth installment of the saga in which the spa is to be sold to new owners, unless the bañeros find a way to collect the money to pay what they owe and avoid losing their place of work.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wZESAWVUJKHZpY9JnLBYRJyJMJa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:531841'),
  ('690178311002160911', 'Bang', 1995, 'Drama', 'Ash Baron-Cohen', 'Ash Baron-Cohen', 'Darling Narita, Peter Greene, Michael Newland, Everlast, Michael Artura, James Sharpe, Luis Guizar, Art Cruz', null, 'A young woman in L.A. is having a bad day: she''s evicted, an audition ends with a producer furious she won''t trade sex for the part, and a policeman nabs her for something she didn''t do, demanding fellatio to release her. She snaps, grabs his gun, takes his uniform, and leaves him cuffed to a tree where he''s soon having a defenseless chat with a homeless man. She takes off on the cop''s motorcycle and, for an afternoon, experiences a cop''s life. She talks a young man out of suicide and then is plunged into violence after a friendly encounter with two "vatos." She is torn between self-protection and others'' expectations. Is there any resolution for her torrent of feelings?', 'A young woman in L.A. is having a bad day: she''s evicted, an audition ends with a producer furious she won''t trade sex for the part, and a policeman nabs her for something she didn''t do, demanding fellatio to release her. She snaps, grabs his gun, takes his uniform, and leaves him cuffed to a tree where he''s soon having a defenseless chat with a homeless man. She takes off on the cop''s motorcycle and, for an afternoon, experiences a cop''s life. She talks a young man out of suicide and then is plunged into violence after a friendly encounter with two "vatos." She is torn between self-protection and others'' expectations. Is there any resolution for her torrent of feelings?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pDvf5rsulgcJtZx6voFEO05aC3p.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:124606'),
  ('280806764828852066', 'Bang', 2025, 'Action, Thriller', 'Wych Kaosayananda, Wych Kaosayananda', 'Ken Solarz, Peter M. Lenkov', 'Jack Kesy, Peter Weller, Tristin Mays, Kane Kosugi, Steve Bastoni, Tofan Pirani, Bear Williams, Elliott Allison', null, 'Follows a ruthless hitman who, after narrowly escaping a fatal attempt on his life, betrays his gang in an effort to find forgiveness but ends up becoming a target himself.', 'Follows a ruthless hitman who, after narrowly escaping a fatal attempt on his life, betrays his gang in an effort to find forgiveness but ends up becoming a target himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8SUzKOqe2ectvhYdSnR7Vq2F3n1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1491902'),
  ('1022547178387301544', 'Bang Bang', 1971, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Crime', 'Andrea Tonacci, Thiago Veloso', 'Andrea Tonacci', 'Paulo César Peréio, Abrahão Farc, Ezequias Marques, Thales Penna, Milton Gontijo, Jura Otero, Luís Otávio Madureira Horta, Antonio Naddeo', null, 'An anonymous urban protagonist experiences a series of absurd situations--including a crazy cab ride, an encounter with a wacky criminal gang, and lots of gunplay--infused with a unique anarchic energy, eventually suggesting our true animal nature.', 'An anonymous urban protagonist experiences a series of absurd situations--including a crazy cab ride, an encounter with a wacky criminal gang, and lots of gunplay--infused with a unique anarchic energy, eventually suggesting our true animal nature.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tTJIg8RdzyTJpQ1UoZeJtJSgafk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:173732'),
