  ('584334245682956110', 'Bang Rajan', 2000, 'Action, History, War', 'Tanit Jitnukul, Sakchai Seebunnak, Wichean Reangwichayakul', 'Sittipong Mattanawee, Kongkiat Khomsiri, Bunthin Thuaykaew', 'Winai Kraibutr, Bin Bunluerit, Jaran Ngamdee, Atthakorn Suwannaraj, Phutharit Prombandal, Choomporn Theppitak, Theerayut Pratyabamrung, Bongkoj Khongmalai', 'R', 'Set right before the fall of Thailand''s old capital, Ayuttaya, Bang Rajan draws on the legend of a village of fighters who bravely fended off the Burmese armies.', 'Set right before the fall of Thailand''s old capital, Ayuttaya, Bang Rajan draws on the legend of a village of fighters who bravely fended off the Burmese armies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f2hMEihZQA11HnKbX3kDSJ0z24w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39907'),
  ('490040955718530876', 'Bang the Drum Slowly', 1973, 'Drama', 'Allan Wertheim, Michael P. Petrone, John D. Hancock', 'Mark Harris', 'Michael Moriarty, Robert De Niro, Vincent Gardenia, Phil Foster, Ann Wedgeworth, Patrick McVey, Heather MacRae, Selma Diamond', 'PG', 'The story of a New York pro baseball team and two of its players. Henry Wiggen is the star pitcher and Bruce Pearson is the normal, everyday catcher who is far from the star player on the team and friend to all of his teammates. During the off-season, Bruce learns that he is terminally ill, and Henry, his only true friend, is determined to be the one person there for him during his last season with the club. Throughout the course of the season, Henry and his teammates attempt to deal with Bruce''s impending illness, all the while attempting to make his last year a memorable one.', 'The story of a New York pro baseball team and two of its players. Henry Wiggen is the star pitcher and Bruce Pearson is the normal, everyday catcher who is far from the star player on the team and friend to all of his teammates. During the off-season, Bruce learns that he is terminally ill, and Henry, his only true friend, is determined to be the one person there for him during his last season with the club. Throughout the course of the season, Henry and his teammates attempt to deal with Bruce''s impending illness, all the while attempting to make his last year a memorable one.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2MojRzTHI2UMmhEANYZZCsMPHr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42459'),
  ('1034657784541761404', 'Bang, Boom, Bang', 1999, 'Crime, Action, Comedy', 'Peter Thorwarth, Eckhard Jansen', null, 'Oliver Korittke, Markus Knüfken, Ralf Richter, Diether Krebs, Martin Semmelrogge, Alexandra Neldel, Heinrich Giskes, Christian Kahrmann', null, 'Bank robber Kalle Grabowski escapes from prison while his unemployed smalltime crook buddy is sitting around doing nothing after he just lost all their money. A fast paced comedy from German director Peter Thorwarth.', 'Bank robber Kalle Grabowski escapes from prison while his unemployed smalltime crook buddy is sitting around doing nothing after he just lost all their money. A fast paced comedy from German director Peter Thorwarth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c1bkOK9z6s3ZSkFEejUw76eeuwZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:344'),
