  ('505283928154347346', 'Bangkok Breaking: Heaven and Hell', 2024, 'Action, Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Kongkiat Khomsiri, Thanat Kittikhun, Putipong Saisikaew', 'Kongkiat Khomsiri, Nophand Boonyai', 'Sukollawat Kanarot, Atitaya Tribudarak, Sanya Kunakorn, Natthaya Ongsritragul, Day Thaitanium, Suppakorn Kitsuwan, Teerapat Lohanan, Nat Sakdatorn', null, 'When a dedicated rescue worker inadvertently gets caught up in the kidnapping plot of a mogul''s tween daughter, he must save her from the clutches of rival gangs hunting them down with unpredictable dangers around every corner.', 'When a dedicated rescue worker inadvertently gets caught up in the kidnapping plot of a mogul''s tween daughter, he must save her from the clutches of rival gangs hunting them down with unpredictable dangers around every corner.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6VeDn4oIeUK4XwjWGWMb6qvMImQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1337309'),
  ('645859270495566182', 'Bangkok Dangerous', 2000, 'Thriller, Action, Crime', 'Danny Pang Phat, Oxide Pang Chun, Phasiri Panya', 'Oxide Pang Chun, Danny Pang Phat', 'Pavarit Mongkolpisit, Premsinee Ratanasopha, Patharawarin Timkul, Pisek Intrakanchit, Korkiate Limpapat, Piya Boonnak, Nopadol Kesorn, Prakumponh Jodkongparb', null, 'Kong, a deaf-mute, lives a life of quiet desperation working for Bangkok mobsters. Despite his disability, Kong''s mentor Joe trains him to be a stone-cold assassin. After a brutal hit abroad, Kong returns to Bangkok and falls in love with young pharmacy clerk.', 'Kong, a deaf-mute, lives a life of quiet desperation working for Bangkok mobsters. Despite his disability, Kong''s mentor Joe trains him to be a stone-cold assassin. After a brutal hit abroad, Kong returns to Bangkok and falls in love with young pharmacy clerk.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m7n8oGDoRCvia2oABTFZdYgpyaE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3173'),
  ('726279470571248230', 'Bangkok Dangerous', 2008, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Oxide Pang Chun, Danny Pang Phat, Decha Srimantra', 'Jason Richman', 'Nicolas Cage, Shahkrit Yamnarm, Charlie Yeung Choi-Nei, Panward Hemmanee, Dom Hetrakul, Tuck Napaskorn, Steve Baldocchi, Chris Heebink', 'R', 'When carrying out a hit, assassin Joe always makes use of the knowledge of the local population. On arriving in Bangkok, Joe meets street kid Kong and he becomes his primary aide. But when Kong is nearly killed, he asks Joe to train him up in the deadly arts and unwittingly becomes a target of a band of killers.', 'When carrying out a hit, assassin Joe always makes use of the knowledge of the local population. On arriving in Bangkok, Joe meets street kid Kong and he becomes his primary aide. But when Kong is nearly killed, he asks Joe to train him up in the deadly arts and unwittingly becomes a target of a band of killers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iTRftxHW8i4H7ONaOiCIwEXjNDJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13184'),
  ('315365690339568631', 'Bangkok Haunted', 2001, 'Horror', 'Oxide Pang Chun, Pisut Praesangeam, Chatchai Nakornwong', 'Pisut Praesangeam, Sompope Vejchapipat, Piyapan Choopetch', 'Pramote Seangsorn, Pimsiree Pimsee, Nattee Kosolpisit, Chamanun Wanwinwatsara, Sahatchai Chumrum, Duangcheewan Komolsen, Sathit Cheewaprasertkul, Pancha Ngamsanga', null, 'Three women meet in a cafe and tell each other ghost stories, from a story of an ancient drum with a hidden past, a magic love potion so strong that one can literally die from love, to and a murder case with a twist.', 'Three women meet in a cafe and tell each other ghost stories, from a story of an ancient drum with a hidden past, a magic love potion so strong that one can literally die from love, to and a murder case with a twist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/alF38hmeoqqIsvsBqP2bJcpw9TE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55141'),
  ('691918154017228540', 'Bangkok Loco', 2004, 'Comedy, Music', 'Pornchai Hongrattanaporn', 'Sompope Vejchapipat', 'Krissada Sukosol Clapp, Nountaka Warawanitchanoun, Nimponth Chaisirikul, Pranee Keebut, Kiradej Ketakinta, Sombat Metanee', null, 'The story involves a gifted young rock drummer named Bay who commits a grisly murder and becomes a fugitive from the law. Trained by a monk in a style of drumming called the Drums of the Gods, which treats drumming as a martial art for the forces of good, he must face his opposite drummer from the dark side.', 'The story involves a gifted young rock drummer named Bay who commits a grisly murder and becomes a fugitive from the law. Trained by a monk in a style of drumming called the Drums of the Gods, which treats drumming as a martial art for the forces of good, he must face his opposite drummer from the dark side.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jgUj6zRc50P75a2AAMKw1bpEEPv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:96054'),
  ('848078856649559958', 'Bangkok Love Story', 2007, 'Drama, Action, Romance', 'Poj Arnon, Siam Thongbaiyai, Tiwa Moeithaisong', 'Poj Arnon', 'Arucha Tosawat, Chaiwat Thongsaeng, Wiradit Srimalai, Chadatirud Lertaveesin, Chonprakhan Janthareuang, Ratchanoo Boonchuduang, Suchao Pongwilai, Uthumporn Silaphan', null, 'An unlikely, forbidden love blossoms between a police informant and the icy assassin sent to kill him in this steamy Thai crime drama.', 'An unlikely, forbidden love blossoms between a police informant and the icy assassin sent to kill him in this steamy Thai crime drama.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rjf3HMiVLMcS4cEgUcs5e9gjlMk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47547'),
  ('800011443721394367', 'Bangkok Nites', 2016, 'Drama', 'Katsuya Tomita, Masahiro Mukoyama, Takuma Furuya', 'Katsuya Tomita, Toranosuke Aizawa', 'Subenja Pongkorn, Sunun Phuwiset, Chutipha Promplang, Tanyarat Kongphu, Katsuya Tomita, Hitoshi Ito, Shinsuke Nagase, Apicha Saranchol', null, 'Bangkok, 2015. Ozawa, a Japanese man who had nowhere to go, meets Luck, a woman has reached the height of her glory on Thaniya Street, a place that flourishes by servicing only Japanese men. Through a trip to trace the scars of colonialism, they look for paradise that we had lost.', 'Bangkok, 2015. Ozawa, a Japanese man who had nowhere to go, meets Luck, a woman has reached the height of her glory on Thaniya Street, a place that flourishes by servicing only Japanese men. Through a trip to trace the scars of colonialism, they look for paradise that we had lost.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zIWkR7W9lp1xaGWQ1jNaCdOQdcY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:408262'),
  ('725953687036346421', 'Bangkok Revenge', 2011, 'Action, Drama', 'Jean-Marc Minéo', null, 'Jonathan Patrick Foo, Caroline Ducey, Michaël Cohen, Apiradee Pawaputanon, Winai Kraibutr, Kowit Wattanakul, Lioutsia Goubaidoullina, Thiraphong Riawrukwong', null, 'Manit witnessed the murder of his parents when he was just 10 years old. The killers shot him in the head, but he miraculously survived. However, the damage to his brain left him unable to experience regular human emotions. A martial arts master saved him and took him in. Twenty years later, Manit has become a master of martial arts himself. He returns to the scene of the crime, seeking justice.', 'Manit witnessed the murder of his parents when he was just 10 years old. The killers shot him in the head, but he miraculously survived. However, the damage to his brain left him unable to experience regular human emotions. A martial arts master saved him and took him in. Twenty years later, Manit has become a master of martial arts himself. He returns to the scene of the crime, seeking justice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pNT22AQgeL3l4HdRuDMMoHvOsQg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:128185'),
  ('163098816361628312', 'Bangkok Traffic (Love) Story', 2009, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Somboon Piriyapukdeekul, Varayu Rukskul, Chalermchai Janto', 'Nawapol Thamrongrattanarit, Benjamaporn Srabua, Adisorn Trisirikasem', 'Theeradej Wongpuapan, Sirin Horwang, Ungsumalynn Sirapatsakmetha, Panissara Arayaskul, Pornsawan Sriboonwong, Jirawat Wachirasarunpat, Suporn Sangkaphibal, Watani Tapramesamai', null, 'In the center of Bangkok, 30-year-old Mei Li struggles to find true love. When she accidentally meets a handsome BTS engineer whom she considers the right man, she plans her first move. Though too many obstacles keep arising, Mei Li will never give up.', 'In the center of Bangkok, 30-year-old Mei Li struggles to find true love. When she accidentally meets a handsome BTS engineer whom she considers the right man, she plans her first move. Though too many obstacles keep arising, Mei Li will never give up.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3EUo3JyLrBMk6v3oJyHvg1UsRXR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72733'),
  ('865773074433862042', 'Bangkok, We Have A Problem!', 2014, 'Adventure, Comedy', 'Olivier Baroux, Régis Blondeau', null, 'Kad Merad, Alice Taglioni, Peter Coyote, Claude Perron, Chawanrut Janjittranon, Gérard Jugnot, Claire Nadeau, Michel Aumont', null, 'Serge Renart, a television journalist who''s now a has-been, and Natacha Bison, a war reporter who has been laid off because she posed too much of a danger to her colleagues, find themselves forced to investigate a story together, which will take them to Thailand, in search of one of the best kept secrets of contemporary history. What really happened during the televised broadcast of the Apollo 11 mission, when man first walked on the moon?', 'Serge Renart, a television journalist who''s now a has-been, and Natacha Bison, a war reporter who has been laid off because she posed too much of a danger to her colleagues, find themselves forced to investigate a story together, which will take them to Thailand, in search of one of the best kept secrets of contemporary history. What really happened during the televised broadcast of the Apollo 11 mission, when man first walked on the moon?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8CQa9RqPUmAFGKk9d8U17CgyDRR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:295087'),
  ('651959387206053034', 'Bangla', 2019, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Phaim Bhuiyan, Simone D''Onofrio, Linda Bagalini', 'Mohammad Mahadi, R.S. Arif Hossain', 'Phaim Bhuiyan, Carlotta Antonelli, Simone Liberati, Pietro Sermonti, Alessia Giuliani, Milena Mancini, Rishad Noorani, Raja Sethi', null, 'A 22 year-old Bangladeshi-Italian Muslim boy meets a beautiful, exciting Italian girl who makes him re-analyze his beliefs and culture.', 'A 22 year-old Bangladeshi-Italian Muslim boy meets a beautiful, exciting Italian girl who makes him re-analyze his beliefs and culture.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rNmObjXsu7DZvyGrLG6DtLO8iYc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:573650'),
  ('883659226379211268', 'Banjo', 2016, 'Music, Action', 'Ravi Jadhav, Manoj Lobo', 'Nikhil Mehrotra, Kapil Sawant, Ravi Jadhav', 'Riteish Deshmukh, Nargis Fakhri, Aditya Kumar, Ram Menon, Dharmesh Yelande, Uday Sabnis, Janardhan Parab, Luke Kenny', null, 'A musical drama film directed by Ravi Jadhav, starring Riteish Deshmukh and Nargis Fakhri in the lead roles.', 'A musical drama film directed by Ravi Jadhav, starring Riteish Deshmukh and Nargis Fakhri in the lead roles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sWJLsCVU7MckdprbbQi8g02wRYr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:403517'),
  ('489816661008601470', 'Banjo on My Knee', 1936, 'Comedy, Romance', 'John Cromwell, A.F. Erickson, Ernest Palmer', 'Nunnally Johnson', 'Barbara Stanwyck, Joel McCrea, Walter Brennan, Buddy Ebsen, Helen Westley, Walter Catlett, Tony Martin, Katherine DeMille', 'NR', 'A young husband leaves his river shantyboat community in Pecan Point, Tennessee and travels to New Orleans in search of his runaway wife.', 'A young husband leaves his river shantyboat community in Pecan Point, Tennessee and travels to New Orleans in search of his runaway wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/66D5TtKwXiIX796NT3M5D8vEAor.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:149991'),
  ('192854814990717300', 'Banjo the Woodpile Cat', 1979, 'Animation, Adventure, Family', 'Don Bluth', 'Don Bluth, Toby Bluth', 'Scatman Crothers, Beah Richards, Sparky Marcus, Jerry Harper, Ken Sansom, Anne Beesley, Robin Muir, Georgette Rampone', 'NR', 'Banjo is a curious and rebellious kitten who is always getting into trouble. When he decides to jump off a roof of a chicken coop to see if he can land on his feet, he is ordered to "fetch a switch". Thinking his parents wouldn''t care if he gets hurt, he hitches a ride on a feed truck, all the way to Salt Lake City. After he finds the excitement of the city, he soon finds it cold and lonely and wishes to be home. With the help of stray cat Crazy Legs and a trio of singing cat girls, he finds the truck and returns home.', 'Banjo is a curious and rebellious kitten who is always getting into trouble. When he decides to jump off a roof of a chicken coop to see if he can land on his feet, he is ordered to "fetch a switch". Thinking his parents wouldn''t care if he gets hurt, he hitches a ride on a feed truck, all the way to Salt Lake City. After he finds the excitement of the city, he soon finds it cold and lonely and wishes to be home. With the help of stray cat Crazy Legs and a trio of singing cat girls, he finds the truck and returns home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bH19xDSAbtEDJsaIjJwP1mePPpM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57355'),
  ('640576013427469085', 'Bank Chor', 2017, 'Comedy, Crime, Thriller', 'Bumpy, Adil Afsar, Paarth Harish Joshi', 'Baljeet Singh Marwah, Ishita Moitra', 'Vivek Oberoi, Riteish Deshmukh, Rhea Chakraborty, Sahil Vaid, Bhuvan Arora, Naveen Kaushik, Ramakant Dayma', null, 'A comic-caper, that tells the story of 3 morons trying to rob a bank who pick the worst day possible when everything that can go wrong, goes wrong and how they''re inadvertently caught in the crossfire.', 'A comic-caper, that tells the story of 3 morons trying to rob a bank who pick the worst day possible when everything that can go wrong, goes wrong and how they''re inadvertently caught in the crossfire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tKrtqEs1gffyZNlHW9WduRRjKGA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:456756'),
  ('668912373774878013', 'Bank Error in Your Favour', 2009, 'Comedy', 'Michel Munz, Gérard Bitton', 'Michel Munz, Gérard Bitton', 'Jean-Pierre Darroussin, Gérard Lanvin, Scali Delpeyrat, Philippe Magnan, Éric Naggar, Roger Van Hool, Martin Lamotte, Jennifer Decker', null, 'After working with the bank for a long time, Julien decides to open a restaurant with his best friend. Unfortunately, when the bank refuses to grant him a loan, he comes up with a plan.', 'After working with the bank for a long time, Julien decides to open a restaurant with his best friend. Unfortunately, when the bank refuses to grant him a loan, he comes up with a plan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zKLakpEBDrcU3NoNuU0U5OBY8Vw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26152'),
  ('535593843185173029', 'Bank Holiday', 1938, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Carol Reed, Arthur Crabtree', 'Rodney Ackland, Roger Burford', 'John Lodge, Margaret Lockwood, Hugh Williams, Rène Ray, Merle Tottenham, Linden Travers, Wally Patch, Kathleen Harrison', null, 'A 1930s British summer Bank Holiday starts at midday on Saturday with a rush for the trains to the seaside. Doreen and Milly are off to a beauty contest, Geoffrey and Catherine are having an illicit weekend in the Grand Hotel and May and the kids are set for a more straightforward holiday of sea, sand, and pub. Meanwhile, the manager and performers on the pier are praying for rain.', 'A 1930s British summer Bank Holiday starts at midday on Saturday with a rush for the trains to the seaside. Doreen and Milly are off to a beauty contest, Geoffrey and Catherine are having an illicit weekend in the Grand Hotel and May and the kids are set for a more straightforward holiday of sea, sand, and pub. Meanwhile, the manager and performers on the pier are praying for rain.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sDVhuIxY1KDC3qNcbjUHWUbEY2K.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63069'),
  ('235171613319580119', 'Bank of Dave', 2023, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Chris Foggin, Mike Stern Sterzyński', 'Piers Ashworth', 'Rory Kinnear, Jo Hartley, Joel Fry, Phoebe Dynevor, Hugh Bonneville, Paul Kaye, Cathy Tyson, Florence Hall', 'PG-13', 'The true story of how Dave Fishwick, a working class man and self-made millionaire, fought to set up a community bank so that he could help the local businesses of Burnley not only survive, but thrive. In his bid to help his beloved community, he has to take on the elitist financial institutions of London and fight to receive the first, new banking license to be issued in over 100 years.', 'The true story of how Dave Fishwick, a working class man and self-made millionaire, fought to set up a community bank so that he could help the local businesses of Burnley not only survive, but thrive. In his bid to help his beloved community, he has to take on the elitist financial institutions of London and fight to receive the first, new banking license to be issued in over 100 years.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pKZ8nURAqNmuSpKVTYGko7SD1GP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:937220'),
  ('555855013666392745', 'Bank of Dave 2: The Loan Ranger', 2025, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Chris Foggin, Mike Stern Sterzyński', 'Piers Ashworth', 'Rory Kinnear, Jo Hartley, Chrissy Metz, Amit Shah, Rob Delaney, Leila Farzad, Hugh Bonneville, Dan Fogler', null, 'Two years after founding his own bank, local hero Dave Fishwick takes on the predatory payday lenders bringing misery to his small English town.', 'Two years after founding his own bank, local hero Dave Fishwick takes on the predatory payday lenders bringing misery to his small English town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5gYlz36CufxMrv7uQbI4oqMut48.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1250629'),
  ('373951055919560463', 'Bank Robber', 1993, 'Comedy, Crime, Thriller', 'Nick Mead, Andrzej Sekula', 'Nick Mead', 'Patrick Dempsey, Lisa Bonet, Judge Reinhold, Forest Whitaker, Olivia D''Abo, Mariska Hargitay, Michael Jeter, Mark Pellegrino', null, 'After robbing a bank, the robber hides out from the police in a seedy hotel where he is forced to bribe various tennants for protection as well as their silence which becomes more difficult as greed takes over and the people demand more exuberant bribes from the bank robber to shelter and hide him.', 'After robbing a bank, the robber hides out from the police in a seedy hotel where he is forced to bribe various tennants for protection as well as their silence which becomes more difficult as greed takes over and the people demand more exuberant bribes from the bank robber to shelter and hide him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6m3Wi8249a4JaunSmzW2GWdFiIK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:420034'),
  ('53326830788882231', 'Bank Robbers: The Last Great Heist', 2022, 'Documentary', 'Matías Gueilburt', 'Nicolás Gueilburt', 'Fernando Araujo, Luis Mario Vitette, Sebastián García Bolster, Rubén Alberto de la Torre, Miguel Ángel Sileo, Walter Serrano, Estela Maris Casal, Leandro Dall Acqua', null, 'Through candid interviews, the perpetrators of Argentina''s most notorious bank heist detail how — and why — they carried out the radical 2006 operation.', 'Through candid interviews, the perpetrators of Argentina''s most notorious bank heist detail how — and why — they carried out the radical 2006 operation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1qkIyRyXsrXaear1OdJd0QWaAkC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1000194'),
  ('973229163474514641', 'Bankable', 2012, 'Comedy, Drama, TV Movie', 'Mona Achache, Pierric Gantelmi d''Ille', 'Éric Guého, William Willebrod Wegimont, Mona Achache', 'Pascale Arbillot, Lolita Chammah, Bruno Todeschini, Olivier Barthélémy, Marianne Denicourt, Farida Khelfa, Éric Guého, Sarah Le Picard', null, 'The wealthy Deville family loses their fortune at the same time the unassuming Ricci family suddenly become internet millionaires; things look bleak until their mutual banker suggests Mr. Deville goes to work for the Riccis!', 'The wealthy Deville family loses their fortune at the same time the unassuming Ricci family suddenly become internet millionaires; things look bleak until their mutual banker suggests Mr. Deville goes to work for the Riccis!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bGJ4HP5uOo1AyOSnKufwgsKEgQ2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:331168'),
  ('144617845113683620', 'Bankers Also Have Souls', 1982, 'Comedy', 'Michel Lang', 'Michel Lang, Enrico Vaime, Italo Terzoli', 'Pierre Mondy, Claudia Cardinale, Clio Goldsmith, Jacques François, Rémi Laurent, Henri Guybet, Christophe Bourseiller, Laurence Badie', null, 'A bank clerk is given an unusual retirement gift, a high class call girl. Unaware that he has been ''set up'' by colleagues the man goes with the girl to Venice where he enjoys his new found virility.', 'A bank clerk is given an unusual retirement gift, a high class call girl. Unaware that he has been ''set up'' by colleagues the man goes with the girl to Venice where he enjoys his new found virility.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iSRhmOKP0XxruB3LXTZxymOsUNm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68963'),
  ('715286103238234833', 'Banking on Bitcoin', 2016, 'Documentary, History', 'Christopher Cannucciari', 'Christopher Cannucciari, Prichard Smith', 'Wences Casares, Nathaniel Popper, Alex Winter, Rand Paul, Cameron Winklevoss, Andy Greenberg, Tyler Winklevoss, Michael Casey', 'PG-13', 'Not since the invention of the Internet has there been such a disruptive technology as Bitcoin. Bitcoin''s early pioneers sought to blur the lines of sovereignty and the financial status quo. After years of underground development Bitcoin grabbed the attention of a curious public, and the ire of the regulators the technology had subverted. After landmark arrests of prominent cyber criminals Bitcoin faces its most severe adversary yet, the very banks it was built to destroy.', 'Not since the invention of the Internet has there been such a disruptive technology as Bitcoin. Bitcoin''s early pioneers sought to blur the lines of sovereignty and the financial status quo. After years of underground development Bitcoin grabbed the attention of a curious public, and the ire of the regulators the technology had subverted. After landmark arrests of prominent cyber criminals Bitcoin faces its most severe adversary yet, the very banks it was built to destroy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qW3vsno24UBawZjnrKfQ1qHRPD6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:427451'),
  ('564919618399874962', 'Banklady', 2013, 'Romance, Action, Crime, Drama, History', 'Christian Alvart, The Chau Ngo', 'Kai Hafemeister', 'Ken Duken, Nadeshda Brennicke, Niels-Bruno Schmidt, Charly Hübner, Andreas Schmidt, Heinz Hoenig, Henny Reents, Jürgen Schornagel', null, 'Banklady tells the true story of Gisela Werler, a law-abiding factory worker from Hamburg, who falls in love with a thief and becomes a media darling as Germany’s first and most notorious female bank robber. Cunning, sexy, and exciting, Gisela and her beloved Hermann pull off one daring heist after another. Banklady follows this outlaw who captured Germany’s imagination, boldly defying gender expectations and living a decades-long Bonnie and Clyde romance.', 'Banklady tells the true story of Gisela Werler, a law-abiding factory worker from Hamburg, who falls in love with a thief and becomes a media darling as Germany’s first and most notorious female bank robber. Cunning, sexy, and exciting, Gisela and her beloved Hermann pull off one daring heist after another. Banklady follows this outlaw who captured Germany’s imagination, boldly defying gender expectations and living a decades-long Bonnie and Clyde romance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A15itmW5vVkU9jsbBJAYybMVdlG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:228736'),
  ('534072545900322828', 'Bankrolled', 2021, 'Comedy', 'Marcos Bucay', 'Marcos Bucay', 'Ricardo Polanco, Aldo Escalante, Natalia Téllez, Fabrizio Santini, Seo Ju Park, María Chacón, Giuseppe Gamba, Joaquín Ferreira', null, 'While blind drunk, two unemployed millennials entrepreneurs drunkenly post a video pitch about their revolutionary app to a crowdfunding site. When the app catches fire and they accidentally raise millions of dollars they actually have to create the app.', 'While blind drunk, two unemployed millennials entrepreneurs drunkenly post a video pitch about their revolutionary app to a crowdfunding site. When the app catches fire and they accidentally raise millions of dollars they actually have to create the app.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fGbVBL4D0KmJSv7J5cZxsiZM2qL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:845422'),
  ('720887690726643423', 'Banksters', 2020, 'Drama, Crime', 'Marcin Ziębiński, Dominik Danilczyk, Kacper Habisiak', 'Joanna Wilczewska', 'Antoni Królikowski, Magdalena Lamparska, Katarzyna Zawadzka, Tomasz Karolak, Jan Frycz, Rafał Zawierucha, Marcin Bosak, Maciej Nawrocki', null, 'Karolina works in a bank, she is energetic, self-confident, go-getting. When the latest currency product comes into her hands - a loan in Swiss francs, the woman gets a great chance to prove herself. Having the full consent of his boss - Adam, he unscrupulously starts persuading clients to take the most risky and unfavorable investments. Jan is the gray eminence of the Polish financiers. In his phone, he has contacts to the presidents of the largest banks in Poland. His cynical ideas and decisions affect the economy and the fate of hundreds of thousands of people overnight. Such as Artur - an ambitious head of an IT company who decides to use currency options to develop his business. His partner is Mateusz, who dreams of independence, his own place and the longed-for move away from his in-laws.', 'Karolina works in a bank, she is energetic, self-confident, go-getting. When the latest currency product comes into her hands - a loan in Swiss francs, the woman gets a great chance to prove herself. Having the full consent of his boss - Adam, he unscrupulously starts persuading clients to take the most risky and unfavorable investments. Jan is the gray eminence of the Polish financiers. In his phone, he has contacts to the presidents of the largest banks in Poland. His cynical ideas and decisions affect the economy and the fate of hundreds of thousands of people overnight. Such as Artur - an ambitious head of an IT company who decides to use currency options to develop his business. His partner is Mateusz, who dreams of independence, his own place and the longed-for move away from his in-laws.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3LKtQDyxWo7UwcPoWyPzAjRKfig.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:759331'),
  ('298873953540892955', 'Banksy and the Rise of Outlaw Art', 2020, 'Documentary', 'Elio Espana', 'Elio Espana', 'Banksy, Felix Braun, Ben Eine, Mark Holgate, Claire de Dobay Rifelj, Will Ellsworth-Jones, Kelly ''Risk'' Graval, Richard Jones', null, 'Banksy is the world''s most infamous street artist, whose political art, criminal stunts and daring invasions have outraged the establishment for over two decades. Featuring rare interviews with Banksy, this is the story of how an outlaw artist led a revolutionary new movement and built a multi-million dollar empire, while his identity remained shrouded in mystery.', 'Banksy is the world''s most infamous street artist, whose political art, criminal stunts and daring invasions have outraged the establishment for over two decades. Featuring rare interviews with Banksy, this is the story of how an outlaw artist led a revolutionary new movement and built a multi-million dollar empire, while his identity remained shrouded in mystery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lyARw7klUsztYZh0r6UEpzfRmK5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:672699'),
  ('823965743094132637', 'Banksy Does New York', 2014, 'Documentary', 'Chris Moukarbel, Mai Iskander, Karim Raoul', null, null, null, 'On October 1, 2013, the elusive street artist Banksy launched a month-long residency in New York, an art show he called Better Out Than In. As one new work of art was presented each day in a secret location, a group of fans, called “Banksy Hunters,” took to the streets and blew up social media.', 'On October 1, 2013, the elusive street artist Banksy launched a month-long residency in New York, an art show he called Better Out Than In. As one new work of art was presented each day in a secret location, a group of fans, called “Banksy Hunters,” took to the streets and blew up social media.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qGVpdYQGs5guHf719aaM44JtN6p.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:299729'),
  ('235755238066741370', 'Banned from Television', 1998, 'Documentary, Horror', 'Joe Francis', null, null, null, 'A series of videos containing footage of real life events that were too disturbing for television.', 'A series of videos containing footage of real life events that were too disturbing for television.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hr0Fg5prFF0ze2JWhBwVSzCsqEF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17088'),
  ('105863002179586699', 'Banner of Youth', 1957, 'Animation', 'Jan Lenica, Walerian Borowczyk', null, null, null, 'A short film advertising the newspaper Sztandar Młodych (The Banner of Youth), noteworthy for its abstract elements painted directly onto film stock. An attempt at showing the complexity of the world in a capsule, the film reflects the new policy of the openness to the West during the Thaw of the late 1950s in Poland.', 'A short film advertising the newspaper Sztandar Młodych (The Banner of Youth), noteworthy for its abstract elements painted directly onto film stock. An attempt at showing the complexity of the world in a capsule, the film reflects the new policy of the openness to the West during the Thaw of the late 1950s in Poland.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9MrNUhzqlEBqQsDhQmROZJaETR6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:291087'),
  ('770433457687369090', 'Banning', 1967, 'Romance, Drama', 'Ron Winston, Loyal Griggs', 'James Lee', 'Robert Wagner, Anjanette Comer, Jill St. John, Guy Stockwell, James Farentino, Susan Clark, Howard St. John, Mike Kellin', null, 'A playboy golf pro, kicked off the circuit for alleged cheating, is forced to hustle for a living.', 'A playboy golf pro, kicked off the circuit for alleged cheating, is forced to hustle for a living.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xpgrGgP2FLpFDgphq8urIA5WDh4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84511'),
