  ('380139005690498752', 'Banshee', 2006, 'Crime, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Kari Skogland, David Franco, Don Terry', 'Kirsten Elms', 'Taryn Manning, Romano Orzari, Michael Lombardi, Genelle Williams, Christian Cambell, Tony Calabretta, Morgan Kelly, Bronwen Mantel', 'R', 'A city''s most-notorious car thief must use all the skills at her disposal to evade a serial killer who wants to make her his next victim.', 'A city''s most-notorious car thief must use all the skills at her disposal to evade a serial killer who wants to make her his next victim.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3Xg7SoZn6jbyRT4vjBav9t8vxf5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46952'),
  ('986681300139865748', 'Banshee Chapter', 2013, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Jeremy Obertone, Blair Erickson, Marcus Taylor', 'Blair Erickson', 'Ted Levine, Katia Winter, Michael McMillian, Monique Candelaria, Jenny Gabrielle, Chad Brummett, David Midthunder, Cyd Schulte', 'R', 'On the trail of a missing friend who had been experimenting with mind-altering drugs, a young journalist - aided by a rogue counter-culture writer, finds herself drawn into the dangerous world of top-secret government chemical research and the mystery of a disturbing radio signal of unknown origin.', 'On the trail of a missing friend who had been experimenting with mind-altering drugs, a young journalist - aided by a rogue counter-culture writer, finds herself drawn into the dangerous world of top-secret government chemical research and the mystery of a disturbing radio signal of unknown origin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nyXKB77RrItfUsAcgoIlXmUfged.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:207769'),
  ('165283004925167709', 'Banty Raids', 1963, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Robert McKimson', null, 'Mel Blanc', null, 'A horny hipster rooster, attracted to the hens in Foghorn Leghorn''s barnyard, disguises himself as a baby foundling on Foghorn''s doorstep. Foghorn adopts the girl-crazy rooster as his son, giving him access to all the chickens on the farm!', 'A horny hipster rooster, attracted to the hens in Foghorn Leghorn''s barnyard, disguises himself as a baby foundling on Foghorn''s doorstep. Foghorn adopts the girl-crazy rooster as his son, giving him access to all the chickens on the farm!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/usV5JYzdEwBKSA4oso9RVZ0mvNa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:234459'),
  ('110926675662990520', 'Banyo', 2005, 'Comedy, Thriller, Drama', 'Mustafa Altıoklar, Mirsad Herović', 'Mustafa Altıoklar, Gül Abus Semerci', 'Selçuk Yöntem, Burak Sergen, Seray Sever, Janset Paçal, Demet Evgar, Sermiyan Midyat, Arda Kural', null, 'The film takes place in three bathrooms. Two of them are side-by-side and the third sees the two right across the street. In these 3 places, 3 different couples and a young voyeur boy (actually an art student who researches for a project) are described in stories. At the core of these stories there are determinations of the nature of men and women, marriage and betrayal.', 'The film takes place in three bathrooms. Two of them are side-by-side and the third sees the two right across the street. In these 3 places, 3 different couples and a young voyeur boy (actually an art student who researches for a project) are described in stories. At the core of these stories there are determinations of the nature of men and women, marriage and betrayal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1MfAlH9bahd65OF9KK9o1VhG8fp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52125'),
  ('1074762030188189931', 'Banzai', 1997, 'Comedy', 'Carlo Vanzina, Ulla Bomser, Sergio Salvati', 'Enrico Vanzina, Carlo Vanzina', 'Paolo Villaggio, Antonio Ballerio, Francesca Romana Coluzzi, Francesco De Rosa, Roberto Della Casa, Stefano Antonucci, Laura Migliacci, Sergio Tardioli', null, 'Sergio Colombo is an insurance agent. He had just gone through a divorce so he is a little bit scattered. Wanting to unwind he plans to go to vacation with a magnificent girlfriend but suddenly he is ordered off to Canada in order to sign an important contract. At the airport Colombo accidentally gets on a plane that flies in a direction directly opposite to Canada - to Bankgok.', 'Sergio Colombo is an insurance agent. He had just gone through a divorce so he is a little bit scattered. Wanting to unwind he plans to go to vacation with a magnificent girlfriend but suddenly he is ordered off to Canada in order to sign an important contract. At the airport Colombo accidentally gets on a plane that flies in a direction directly opposite to Canada - to Bankgok.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7ingBB0ie5EOsAXC25DoH10NzYf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:92554'),
  ('221333152416359210', 'Banzaï', 1983, 'Comedy', 'Claude Zidi, Jean-Jacques Tarbès', 'Claude Zidi', 'Coluche, Valérie Mairesse, Marthe Villalonga, Rabah Loucif, Didier Kaminka, François Perrot, Éva Darlan, Zabou Breitman', null, 'Michel works there manically solving people''s problems over the phone. He is about to tie the knot with his girl friend Isabelle, an airline hostess. She flies all over the world, he hates to leave the office. A series of madcap mishaps involving theft or injury (as you would expect in his line of work) ensues after Michel promises Isabelle nothing will delay their marriage and she promises in turn that she''s done flying. Once this unlikely promise is made, it becomes premise and both are forced into escalating white lies to maintain the appearance of keeping their word. Their predicament mounts as Isabelle is forced to do a few more flights, while Michel is compelled to travel to New York, Tunisia, and finally Hong Kong, where they are finally reunited in the throes of a contrived and hilarious drug deal involving a 747, water taxi chases, and martial arts.', 'Michel works there manically solving people''s problems over the phone. He is about to tie the knot with his girl friend Isabelle, an airline hostess. She flies all over the world, he hates to leave the office. A series of madcap mishaps involving theft or injury (as you would expect in his line of work) ensues after Michel promises Isabelle nothing will delay their marriage and she promises in turn that she''s done flying. Once this unlikely promise is made, it becomes premise and both are forced into escalating white lies to maintain the appearance of keeping their word. Their predicament mounts as Isabelle is forced to do a few more flights, while Michel is compelled to travel to New York, Tunisia, and finally Hong Kong, where they are finally reunited in the throes of a contrived and hilarious drug deal involving a 747, water taxi chases, and martial arts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mJxlrfnVXhXNGRCBY5GrbIGHv3r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52557'),
  ('262445203308137009', 'Bao', 2018, 'Animation, Family, Fantasy, Drama, Comedy', 'Domee Shi, Ian Megibben, Patrick Lin', 'Domee Shi', 'Daniel Kailin, Sindy Lau, Sharmaine Yeoh, Tim Zhang', 'G', 'An aging Chinese mother suffering from empty nest syndrome gets another chance at motherhood when one of her dumplings springs to life as a lively, giggly dumpling boy.', 'An aging Chinese mother suffering from empty nest syndrome gets another chance at motherhood when one of her dumplings springs to life as a lively, giggly dumpling boy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tKz7XRXvdy1i7pW4eotaWZSrAx2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:514754'),
  ('703695635169216744', 'Baoh: The Visitor', 1989, 'Horror, Animation, Science Fiction, Action', 'Hiroyuki Yokoyama, Masayuki, Noriyoshi Matsuura', 'Kenji Terada', 'Hiroyuki Hori, Noriko Hidaka, Yusaku Yara, Michitaka Kobayashi, Tomoko Maruo, Shoji Sato, Ikuya Sawaki, Kozo Shioya', null, 'Doress, a Japanese "black projects" organization, has been gathering psionics and creating biological weapons to "make Japan superior". When one of the biological experiments, BAOH, a parasite living inside 17-year-old Ikuro, escapes with a psychic young girl named Sumire, Doress will do anything to get the boy and girl back. The only problem for them is that BAOH has the ability to alter its host into a living death machine in order to keep it alive. BAOH "awakens" to its "Armed Defense Phenomenons", giving Ikuro acid-tipped claws, bio-regeneration, and super-strength. But Doress takes the girl, and BAOH, alongside its host, must fight an army of commandos and psionics to get her back.', 'Doress, a Japanese "black projects" organization, has been gathering psionics and creating biological weapons to "make Japan superior". When one of the biological experiments, BAOH, a parasite living inside 17-year-old Ikuro, escapes with a psychic young girl named Sumire, Doress will do anything to get the boy and girl back. The only problem for them is that BAOH has the ability to alter its host into a living death machine in order to keep it alive. BAOH "awakens" to its "Armed Defense Phenomenons", giving Ikuro acid-tipped claws, bio-regeneration, and super-strength. But Doress takes the girl, and BAOH, alongside its host, must fight an army of commandos and psionics to get her back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wvSMLqZmFWjZ74ILsLtqVt45WTL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62736'),
  ('737994941126369395', 'Baphomet', 2021, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Matthan Harris, Pedro Avila, Andrew Scott Baird', 'Matthan Harris', 'Colin Ward, Rebecca Weaver, Matthan Harris, Ivy Opdyke, Giovanni Lombardo Radice, Charlotte Bjornbak, Gerardo Davila, Dani Filth', null, 'An American family celebrates their 28-year-old daughter''s pregnancy. The celebration is interrupted when a Satanic cult leader, Henrik Brandr, unexpectedly visits their ranch. Henrik offers to pay the family a large sum for ownership of their land. Jacob Richardson, the father, rejects the offer due to the priceless sentimental value of the ranch. Henrik, displeased, begins to put devastating curses on the Richardsons, trying to force them off their land - even if it means murdering them. After suffering unexplainable tragedies, the Richardsons seek help from Marybeth, a white witch high priestess. They soon discover a terrible secret about their house, revealing why their land is so valuable to the cult. They realize they must protect their house from the cult at all costs, and a violent battle between good and evil ensues.', 'An American family celebrates their 28-year-old daughter''s pregnancy. The celebration is interrupted when a Satanic cult leader, Henrik Brandr, unexpectedly visits their ranch. Henrik offers to pay the family a large sum for ownership of their land. Jacob Richardson, the father, rejects the offer due to the priceless sentimental value of the ranch. Henrik, displeased, begins to put devastating curses on the Richardsons, trying to force them off their land - even if it means murdering them. After suffering unexplainable tragedies, the Richardsons seek help from Marybeth, a white witch high priestess. They soon discover a terrible secret about their house, revealing why their land is so valuable to the cult. They realize they must protect their house from the cult at all costs, and a violent battle between good and evil ensues.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1l6S3EID762dvTOrNwoCRNTESa3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:513983'),
  ('593649228349165380', 'Baptism of Blood', 2007, 'Thriller, Drama, History', 'Helvécio Ratton, Lauro Escorel, Cecília Amado', 'Helvécio Ratton, Dani Patarra', 'Caio Blat, Daniel de Oliveira, Cássio Gabus Mendes, Ângelo Antônio, Léo Quintão, Odilon Esteves, Marku Ribas, Marcélia Cartaxo', null, 'In São Paulo, in the late 1960s, the convent of the Dominican friars became a trench of resistance to the military dictatorship that governs Brazil. Moved by Christian ideals, frets Betto, Oswaldo, Fernando, Ivo and Tito came to support the guerrilla group Ação Libertadora Nacional, commanded by Carlos Marighella.', 'In São Paulo, in the late 1960s, the convent of the Dominican friars became a trench of resistance to the military dictatorship that governs Brazil. Moved by Christian ideals, frets Betto, Oswaldo, Fernando, Ivo and Tito came to support the guerrilla group Ação Libertadora Nacional, commanded by Carlos Marighella.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bwiexEIzrBHt2DaGhjt6yY3Pbyo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35967'),
