  ('587503261574264731', 'Bar Boys: After School', 2025, 'Drama', 'Kip Oebanda, Albert Banzon, Xeph Suarez', 'Kip Oebanda, Carlo Enciso Catu, Zig Madamba Dulay', 'Rocco Nacino, Carlo Aquino, Enzo Pineda, Kean Cipriano, Will Ashley, Odette Khan, Glaiza de Castro, Klarisse de Guzman', null, 'Set ten years after the events of the first film, the story explores the impact of time on institutions, relationships, and individuals, delivering a poignant yet inspiring tale about the invisible costs of pursuing one''s dreams.', 'Set ten years after the events of the first film, the story explores the impact of time on institutions, relationships, and individuals, delivering a poignant yet inspiring tale about the invisible costs of pursuing one''s dreams.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4Gb7BfPyMuVWYoCDC8VQLLKgncl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1388456'),
  ('871106069329705279', 'Bar Esperanza', 1983, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Hugo Carvana, Jacques Cheuiche, Nonato Estrela', 'Armando Costa, Martha Alencar, Denise Bandeira', 'Marília Pêra, Hugo Carvana, Anselmo Vasconcelos, Nelson Dantas, Louise Cardoso, Luiz Fernando Guimarães, Júlio Braga, Antonio Pedro', null, 'A group of eccentric people gather at a popular bar in Ipanema, Rio de Janeiro.', 'A group of eccentric people gather at a popular bar in Ipanema, Rio de Janeiro.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cs0LPj2a6YonVYUJBDj6F9gu5rS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:329610'),
  ('1028786707264895297', 'Bar Fight', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Jim Mahoney, Peter Mosiman', 'Jim Mahoney', 'Melissa Fumero, Luka Jones, Rachel Bloom, Julian Gant, Dot-Marie Jones, Vik Sahay, Hope Lauren, Dino Nicandros', null, 'Nina and Allen split everything in their lives 50/50 after their break-up to avoid any drama—everything, that is, except for their favorite local bar. Nina and Allen must compete in a ridiculous, tavern-style custody battle for their prized watering hole, in which lines will be drawn, sides will be chosen, and beers will be drunken.', 'Nina and Allen split everything in their lives 50/50 after their break-up to avoid any drama—everything, that is, except for their favorite local bar. Nina and Allen must compete in a ridiculous, tavern-style custody battle for their prized watering hole, in which lines will be drawn, sides will be chosen, and beers will be drunken.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wz3LJM9tVUgatlS1WhedZRju1ON.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:862553'),
  ('945019632938261856', 'Bar Joseph', 2019, 'Drama', 'Giulio Base, Giuseppe Riccobene', 'Giulio Base', 'Ivano Marescotti, Diop Virginia, Nicola Nocella, Selene Caramazza, Michele Morrone, Vito Mancini, Teodosio Barresi, Ira Fronten', null, 'A love story between a lonely bar owner and a young African immigrant working in his restaurant leads to scandal and violence in a small Italian town.', 'A love story between a lonely bar owner and a young African immigrant working in his restaurant leads to scandal and violence in a small Italian town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hcmF1gchSHjB202Oo5slYm6vu02.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:706513'),
  ('124296842951048715', 'Bar Legend', 2006, 'Action, Crime', 'Cho Beom-gu, Lee Chol-o, Joo Seong-Rim', 'Park Soo-jin', 'Park Gun-hyung, Lee Chun-hee, MC Mong, Oh Dal-su, Kim Su-hyun, Im Hyun-sik, Yoo Ji-tae, Park Ji-yeon', null, 'After living separate lives, three men try to reset their former turf that is now infested with gangsters to its former glory.', 'After living separate lives, three men try to reset their former turf that is now infested with gangsters to its former glory.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s5oe6tdjY6joI5KoegPPLFWJXZJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40114'),
  ('425900547621638909', 'Bar Sport', 2011, 'Comedy', 'Massimo Martelli, Roberto Cimatti, Gianni Costantino', 'Giannandrea Pecorelli, Michele Pellegrini, Nicola Alvau', 'Claudio Bisio, Giuseppe Battiston, Antonio Catania, Antonio Cornacchione, Angela Finocchiaro, Bob Messini, Lunetta Savino, Teo Teocoli', null, 'Inside Bar Sport, a bar on the outskirts of Bologna managed by the histrionic Onassis, the adventures of regulars and casual patrons unfold. Searching for a pinball machine or a payphone, they encounter the omnipresent "technician," so called for his passion for soccer and always ready to chat or moderate other people''s discussions. Thus, the ordeals of the handyman Bovinelli as he deals with the disasters at Muzzi''s house, the diary of a provincial playboy''s conquests, the sex life of the fiery prostitute Elvira, the search for a good restaurant during a dazed motorcycle trip with Cocosecco, or a trip to see Bologna play with the lawyer Della Lana become epic tales of tragicomic exploits.', 'Inside Bar Sport, a bar on the outskirts of Bologna managed by the histrionic Onassis, the adventures of regulars and casual patrons unfold. Searching for a pinball machine or a payphone, they encounter the omnipresent "technician," so called for his passion for soccer and always ready to chat or moderate other people''s discussions. Thus, the ordeals of the handyman Bovinelli as he deals with the disasters at Muzzi''s house, the diary of a provincial playboy''s conquests, the sex life of the fiery prostitute Elvira, the search for a good restaurant during a dazed motorcycle trip with Cocosecco, or a trip to see Bologna play with the lawyer Della Lana become epic tales of tragicomic exploits.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5LELCswWe5KjEFf7W55Rc6uivHK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77000'),
  ('161295877409589970', 'Bara Badhu', 2026, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Beeswaranjan, Bijitesh De', 'Beeswaranjan, Hindol Hazra', 'Sailendra Samantray, Sivani Sangita, Suryamoyee Mohapatra, Hara Rath, Subhasis Sharma', null, 'Two friends plot their way out of unemployment and despair, only to become pawns in village power games. Their quest for a better life becomes a harrowing test of loyalty and resilience.', 'Two friends plot their way out of unemployment and despair, only to become pawns in village power games. Their quest for a better life becomes a harrowing test of loyalty and resilience.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F9rx4jst8Tx7cZu1OR9fhhpNmbjc.jpg', 'plex:movie:bara-badhu'),
  ('503952608178175186', 'Barabar Premistha', 2026, 'Drama', 'Sampath Rudra', 'Sampath Rudra', 'Abainaveen, Rajsekhar Aningi, Bathini Keerthi Latha Goud, Muralidhar Goud, Chandra Hass', null, 'In a village divided between Karmani and Dharmani lineages, Chandu and Bujjamma are born into rival sides of a feud and grown as enemies. When love blossoms between them, it disrupts the village''s beliefs about loyalty, identity, and fate.', 'In a village divided between Karmani and Dharmani lineages, Chandu and Bujjamma are born into rival sides of a feud and grown as enemies. When love blossoms between them, it disrupts the village''s beliefs about loyalty, identity, and fate.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fm.media-amazon.com%2Fimages%2FM%2FMV5BYzcxNTRjZWUtNzQzZC00MDM0LWJkZTUtZDM1NjBhMmIwNTJlXkEyXkFqcGc%40._V1_.jpg', 'plex:movie:barabar-premistha'),
  ('168610368409097100', 'Barabbas', 1961, 'History, Drama, Adventure', 'Richard Fleischer, Aldo Tonti', 'Ivo Perilli, Christopher Fry, Salvatore Quasimodo', 'Anthony Quinn, Silvana Mangano, Arthur Kennedy, Katy Jurado, Harry Andrews, Vittorio Gassman, Norman Wooland, Valentina Cortese', 'NR', 'Epic account of the thief Barabbas, who was pardoned for his crimes and spared crucifixion when Pilate offered the Israelites a choice to pardon Barabbas or Jesus. Struggling with his spirituality, Barabbas goes through many ordeals leading him to the gladiatorial arena, where he tries to win his freedom and confront his inner demons, ultimately becoming a follower of the man who was crucified in his place.', 'Epic account of the thief Barabbas, who was pardoned for his crimes and spared crucifixion when Pilate offered the Israelites a choice to pardon Barabbas or Jesus. Struggling with his spirituality, Barabbas goes through many ordeals leading him to the gladiatorial arena, where he tries to win his freedom and confront his inner demons, ultimately becoming a follower of the man who was crucified in his place.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8qTylsK58cNc9hP7cQksi65j8JW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24248'),
  ('112723325004997002', 'Baragaki: Unbroken Samurai', 2021, 'History, Drama, Action', 'Seiji Mori, Masato Harada, Takahide Shibanushi', 'Masato Harada', 'Junichi Okada, Ko Shibasaki, Ryohei Suzuki, Ryosuke Yamada, Ukon Onoe, Yuki Yamada, Taka Takao, Minosuke Bando', null, 'Set in the 19th century, "Moeyo Ken" follows the life of Toshizo Hijikata. He was the vice-commander of the Shinsengumi and fought against the Meiji Restoration.', 'Set in the 19th century, "Moeyo Ken" follows the life of Toshizo Hijikata. He was the vice-commander of the Shinsengumi and fought against the Meiji Restoration.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/li00o4zPJx1Gzw67Nv2nxnGO5ob.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:726894'),
  ('22187214610029620', 'Baraka', 1992, 'Documentary', 'Ron Fricke, Ron Fricke', 'Genevieve Nicholas, Mark Magidson, Ron Fricke', 'Patrick Disanto', 'NR', 'A paralysingly beautiful documentary with a global vision—an odyssey through landscape and time—that attempts to capture the essence of life.', 'A paralysingly beautiful documentary with a global vision—an odyssey through landscape and time—that attempts to capture the essence of life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ldEuJQ4z7zEvL7iXraESWBUfQcz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14002'),
  ('698093756705558895', 'Baramulla', 2025, 'Horror', 'Aditya Suhas Jambhale, Arnold Fernandes', 'Aditya Suhas Jambhale, Monal Thaakar', 'Manav Kaul, Bhasha Sumbli, Arista Mehta, Rohaan Singh, Neelofar Hamid, Ashwini Koul, Vikas Shukla, Mir Sarwar', 'R', 'A cop''s inquiry into child kidnappings unravels chilling secrets as supernatural events endanger his family and the peaceful town of Baramulla.', 'A cop''s inquiry into child kidnappings unravels chilling secrets as supernatural events endanger his family and the peaceful town of Baramulla.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xm5ER19nTk7iuWFaiNRUYe3Zlz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1561969'),
  ('742571759834662783', 'Baran', 2001, 'Drama, Romance', 'Majid Majidi, Mohammad Davudi, Sirrus Hassanpur', 'Majid Majidi', 'Hossein Abedini, Zahra Bahrami, Reza Naji, Hossein Mahjoub, Abbas Rahimi, Gholam Ali Bakhshi, Jafar Tawakoli, Yadollah Hedayati', 'PG', 'On a building site in present-day Tehran, Lateef, a 17-year-old Turkish worker is irresistibly drawn to Rahmat, a young Afghan worker. The revelation of Rahmat''s secret changes both their lives.', 'On a building site in present-day Tehran, Lateef, a 17-year-old Turkish worker is irresistibly drawn to Rahmat, a young Afghan worker. The revelation of Rahmat''s secret changes both their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mcsAug8npYWQ21W0Adv5ghpJuSk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43774'),
  ('490238480147195106', 'Barão Vermelho: Por que a gente é assim?', 2017, 'Documentary', 'Mini Kerti', 'Mini Kerti, Rodrigo Pinto, Joana Ventura', 'Frejat, Cazuza, Guto Goffi, Fernando Magalhães, Dé Palmeira, Rodrigo santos, Maurício Barros, Ezequiel Neves', null, 'A documentary about Barão Vermelho, one of Brazil''s most famous rock bands during the 1980s, following its steps through archive footage and interviews with all of its remaining members and associated parties.', 'A documentary about Barão Vermelho, one of Brazil''s most famous rock bands during the 1980s, following its steps through archive footage and interviews with all of its remaining members and associated parties.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n2i2e4V5cFa580MxwKurWtmYFtv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:469046'),
  ('527140137299971044', 'Barb & Star Go to Vista Del Mar', 2021, 'Comedy', 'Colin MacLellan, Ginger Gonzalez, Rafael Mandujano', 'Annie Mumolo, Kristen Wiig', 'Kristen Wiig, Annie Mumolo, Jamie Dornan, Damon Wayans Jr., Vanessa Bayer, Fortune Feimster, Phyllis Smith, Ian Gomez', 'PG-13', 'The story of best friends Barb and Star, who leave their small midwestern town for the first time to go on vacation in Vista Del Mar, Florida, where they soon find themselves tangled up in adventure, love, and a villain’s evil plot to kill everyone in town.', 'The story of best friends Barb and Star, who leave their small midwestern town for the first time to go on vacation in Vista Del Mar, Florida, where they soon find themselves tangled up in adventure, love, and a villain’s evil plot to kill everyone in town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m0kQFuMSe6ImokuyG9xfRPtWLQ4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:595813'),
  ('504853192561149953', 'Barb Wire', 1996, 'Science Fiction, Action, Adventure', 'David Hogan, Rick Bota, Carlos Piñero', 'Chuck Pfarrer, Ilene Chaiken', 'Pamela Anderson, Temuera Morrison, Victoria Rowell, Jack Noseworthy, Udo Kier, Steve Railsback, Xander Berkeley, John Paxton', 'R', 'A sexy nightclub owner, Barb Wire moonlights as a mercenary in Steel Harbor, one of the last free zones in the now fascist United States. When scientist Cora Devonshire wanders into Barb''s establishment, she gets roped into a top-secret government plot involving biological weapons. Soon Barb is reunited with her old flame Axel Hood, who is now Cora''s husband and a guerrilla fighter, resulting in plenty of tense action.', 'A sexy nightclub owner, Barb Wire moonlights as a mercenary in Steel Harbor, one of the last free zones in the now fascist United States. When scientist Cora Devonshire wanders into Barb''s establishment, she gets roped into a top-secret government plot involving biological weapons. Soon Barb is reunited with her old flame Axel Hood, who is now Cora''s husband and a guerrilla fighter, resulting in plenty of tense action.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eACq1joafhQTD12gGXNS13J06B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11867'),
  ('777484444856564878', 'Barbara', 1997, 'Romance, Drama', 'Nils Malmros, Jan Weincke', 'Nils Malmros, John Mogensen', 'Anneke von der Lippe, Lars Simonsen, Trond Høvik, Jesper Christensen, Jens Okking, Ove Sprogøe, Ove Petersen, Peter Hesse Overgaard', null, 'Young vicar Mr. Paul arrives at the Faroe Islands to take up a benefice, and meets the young Barbara, twice married to vicars, and with both husbands laid cold in the grave. Despite the warnings of the surrounding community and his own religious scruples, he falls victim to Barbara''s at once innocent and sinful charm. The appearance of the charming and gallant Andreas Heide in Thorshavn puts their love to the severest of tests.', 'Young vicar Mr. Paul arrives at the Faroe Islands to take up a benefice, and meets the young Barbara, twice married to vicars, and with both husbands laid cold in the grave. Despite the warnings of the surrounding community and his own religious scruples, he falls victim to Barbara''s at once innocent and sinful charm. The appearance of the charming and gallant Andreas Heide in Thorshavn puts their love to the severest of tests.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pHvhIJjm1EnvlDKfQuIfHQ5AMS3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:155714'),
  ('1077673636534330332', 'Barbara', 2012, 'Drama', 'Christian Petzold, Madita Selas, Ires Jung', 'Harun Farocki', 'Nina Hoss, Ronald Zehrfeld, Rainer Bock, Christina Hecke, Claudia Geisler-Bading, Peter Weiss, Carolin Haupt, Deniz Petzold', null, 'In 1980s East Germany, Berlin doctor Barbara is banished to a country medical clinic for applying for an exit visa. Deeply unhappy with her reassignment and fearful of her co-workers as possible Stasi informants, Barbara stays aloof, especially from the good-natured clinic head, Andre.', 'In 1980s East Germany, Berlin doctor Barbara is banished to a country medical clinic for applying for an exit visa. Deeply unhappy with her reassignment and fearful of her co-workers as possible Stasi informants, Barbara stays aloof, especially from the good-natured clinic head, Andre.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i7yjITqgz5zSW1jJWzxfwQsyDeo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:88284'),
