  ('70531408447334170', 'Barbara - Becoming Shirin David', 2026, 'Documentary, Biography, Music', 'Michael Schmitt, Carmen Treichl, Jesse Mazuch', 'Michael Schmitt', 'Shirin David', null, 'Shirin David. Babsi. Barbara. Meet the woman behind the rap star as she balances fame, business and her identity in this intimate, emotional documentary.', 'Shirin David. Babsi. Barbara. Meet the woman behind the rap star as she balances fame, business and her identity in this intimate, emotional documentary.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2Fpn9IFXqFcF58SfdOgq6FqMBs2oS.jpg', 'plex:movie:barbara-becoming-shirin-david'),
  ('715623238739644726', 'Barbara the Fair with the Silken Hair', 1970, 'Family, Fantasy', 'Aleksandr Rou, Dmitri Surensky, Anatoli Dikan', 'Mikhail Chuprin, Aleksandr Rou', 'Mikhail Pugovkin, Georgi Millyar, Anatoliy Kubatskiy, Lidiya Korolyova, Aleksei Katyshev, Sergey Nikolaev, Tatyana Klyuyeva, Varvara Popova', null, 'One day, King Yeremei decides to go on a long hike in order to consider all his areas and compile their register. A well appears on his way home, but as soon as the sovereign bent over him, he was seized by the underwater king Chudo-Yudo and demanded an unusual ransom for his release — that which is in the state of Yeremei, but which he does not know about. The tsar is forced to agree to these conditions, because he thinks that each blade of grass was taken into account in the inventory — he still does not suspect that in his absence the Queen gave birth to him an heir.', 'One day, King Yeremei decides to go on a long hike in order to consider all his areas and compile their register. A well appears on his way home, but as soon as the sovereign bent over him, he was seized by the underwater king Chudo-Yudo and demanded an unusual ransom for his release — that which is in the state of Yeremei, but which he does not know about. The tsar is forced to agree to these conditions, because he thinks that each blade of grass was taken into account in the inventory — he still does not suspect that in his absence the Queen gave birth to him an heir.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dswHqQYOeJgnaHTXJowFAAiVF4O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20934'),
  ('818965059753510615', 'Barbarella', 1968, 'Science Fiction, Adventure, Comedy', 'Roger Vadim, Claude Renoir, Carlo Lastricati', 'Claude Brulé, Vittorio Bonicelli, Clement Biddle Wood', 'Jane Fonda, John Phillip Law, Anita Pallenberg, Marcel Marceau, Claude Dauphin, Milo O''Shea, Véronique Vendell, Serge Marquand', 'PG', 'In the far future, a highly sexual woman is tasked with finding and stopping the evil Durand-Durand. Along the way she encounters various unusual people.', 'In the far future, a highly sexual woman is tasked with finding and stopping the evil Durand-Durand. Along the way she encounters various unusual people.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/facTz5BZz4AkJal1FWgjYciekih.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8069'),
  ('627166940545237811', 'Barbarian', 2022, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Alina Krumova, Zach Kuperstein, Natasha Roth', 'Zach Cregger', 'Georgina Campbell, Justin Long, Bill Skarsgård, Richard Brake, Matthew Patrick Davis, Jaymes Butler, Kurt Braunohler, Sophie Sörensen', 'R', 'In town for a job interview, a young woman arrives at her Airbnb late at night only to find that it has been mistakenly double-booked and a strange man is already staying there. Against her better judgement, she decides to stay the night anyway.', 'In town for a job interview, a young woman arrives at her Airbnb late at night only to find that it has been mistakenly double-booked and a strange man is already staying there. Against her better judgement, she decides to stay the night anyway.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/idT5mnqPcJgSkvpDX7pJffBzdVH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:913290'),
  ('764202793108497373', 'Barbarian Invasion', 2022, 'Drama, Action', 'James Lee, Gwai Lou, Tan Chui Mui', 'Tan Chui Mui', 'Zhiny Ooi, Pete Teo, Tan Chui Mui, Bront Palarae, James Lee, Nik Hadiff Dani, Wong Wai Hoong, Aaron Chung', null, 'Moon Lee, a celebrated award-winning actress, has become a full-time mom and divorcée since retiring. Desperate to regain her sense of self, she jumps at the chance to work with her long-time collaborator, director Roger Woo, again. Only this time, he casts her as the lead in a do-your-own stunts martial arts film. The role requires extensive training and though Moon is at first uncertain, she leaves her young son in the care of Roger’s assistant and commits herself to back-breaking training. As soon as she starts to gain some confidence, Roger breaks the news to her: the only way the film can move ahead is to cast her ex-husband, Julliard, as the male lead.', 'Moon Lee, a celebrated award-winning actress, has become a full-time mom and divorcée since retiring. Desperate to regain her sense of self, she jumps at the chance to work with her long-time collaborator, director Roger Woo, again. Only this time, he casts her as the lead in a do-your-own stunts martial arts film. The role requires extensive training and though Moon is at first uncertain, she leaves her young son in the care of Roger’s assistant and commits herself to back-breaking training. As soon as she starts to gain some confidence, Roger breaks the news to her: the only way the film can move ahead is to cast her ex-husband, Julliard, as the male lead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rJvTllLXQLIO3VrSoT05vrP0ct6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:796151'),
  ('733762631598143091', 'Barbarian Queen', 1985, 'Adventure, Fantasy', 'Héctor Olivera, Rodolfo Denevi', 'Howard R. Cohen', 'Lana Clarkson, Katt Shea, Frank Zagarino, Dawn Dunlap, Susana Traverso, Víctor Bó, Armando Capo, Andrea Barbieri', 'R', 'Set during the days of the Roman Empire. A simple village is raided by Roman troops, and most of the people are whisked off to be slaves or killed. Three women survive and set off to liberate their people. When they arrive at the Roman city, they team up with the local underground to seek vengeance and liberation of the slaves', 'Set during the days of the Roman Empire. A simple village is raided by Roman troops, and most of the people are whisked off to be slaves or killed. Three women survive and set off to liberate their people. When they arrive at the Roman city, they team up with the local underground to seek vengeance and liberation of the slaves', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u1W6PBK6okOq2D9uJK5UKSyOFEP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29903'),
  ('227057673092674397', 'Barbarian Queen II: The Empress Strikes Back', 1990, 'Action, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Joe Finley, Francisco Bojórquez, Javier Durán', 'Howard R. Cohen, Lance Smith', 'Lana Clarkson, Greg Wrangler, Rebecca Wood, Elizabeth A. Jaeger, Roger Cudney, Alejandro Bracho, Cecilia Tijerina, Orietta Aguilar', 'R', 'In a final and epic battle in the thrilling sequel to the now classic "Barbarian Queen", Althalia, leads a revolt of peasants and female warriors against the wicked ruler, Arkaris, to regain her throne.', 'In a final and epic battle in the thrilling sequel to the now classic "Barbarian Queen", Althalia, leads a revolt of peasants and female warriors against the wicked ruler, Arkaris, to regain her throne.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6RRL86dkzT51u3quMP5qZPeH3YK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29904'),
  ('49776758868593807', 'Barbarians', 2021, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Charles Dorfman, Charlie Herranz, Sophie Kenny', 'Charles Dorfman', 'Tom Cullen, Inès Spiridonov, Iwan Rheon, Catalina Sandino Moreno, Connor Swindells, Tommy McDonnell, Will Kemp, Kevin Ryan', null, 'A civilized dinner party in a country house sees four friends, Lucas, Adam, Chloe, and Eve, coming together for a birthday celebration. As the night progresses secrets and lies force themselves into the light and polite pretensions are dropped. A knock at the door reveals three masked intruders with an agenda of their own. Will their friendship stand the test? Can they survive the night or will their secrets eventually catch up with them?', 'A civilized dinner party in a country house sees four friends, Lucas, Adam, Chloe, and Eve, coming together for a birthday celebration. As the night progresses secrets and lies force themselves into the light and polite pretensions are dropped. A knock at the door reveals three masked intruders with an agenda of their own. Will their friendship stand the test? Can they survive the night or will their secrets eventually catch up with them?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6dSolFhaf5JOQjgwKCYnEoeJB8z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:811076'),
  ('730170530322425641', 'Barbarians at the Gate', 1993, 'Comedy, Drama, TV Movie', 'Glenn Jordan, Thomas Del Ruth, Nicholas D. Knowland', 'Larry Gelbart', 'James Garner, Jonathan Pryce, Peter Riegert, Joanna Cassidy, Fred Thompson, Leilani Sarelle, Matt Clark, Jeffrey DeMunn', 'R', 'F. Ross Johnson decides to buyout his own tobacco firm RJR Nabisco after the plans of the launch of his new product, a smokeless cigarette Premier, fail on account of market rumours.', 'F. Ross Johnson decides to buyout his own tobacco firm RJR Nabisco after the plans of the launch of his new product, a smokeless cigarette Premier, fail on account of market rumours.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v8StvvS5thbpsidFFPUth6vMziS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27678'),
  ('88994619041921560', 'Barbarosa', 1982, 'Western, Action', 'Fred Schepisi, Ian Baker', 'William D. Wittliff', 'Willie Nelson, Gary Busey, Isela Vega, Gilbert Roland, Danny De La Paz, Alma Martinez, George Voskovec, Sharon Compton', 'PG', 'Karl Westover, an inexperienced farm boy, runs away after unintentionally killing a neighbor, whose family pursues him for vengeance. He meets Barbarosa, a gunman of near-mythical proportions, who is himself in danger from his father-in-law Don Braulio, a wealthy Mexican rancher. Don Braulio wants Barbarosa dead for marrying his daughter against the father''s will. Barbarosa reluctantly takes the clumsy Karl on as a partner, as both of them look to survive the forces lining up against them.', 'Karl Westover, an inexperienced farm boy, runs away after unintentionally killing a neighbor, whose family pursues him for vengeance. He meets Barbarosa, a gunman of near-mythical proportions, who is himself in danger from his father-in-law Don Braulio, a wealthy Mexican rancher. Don Braulio wants Barbarosa dead for marrying his daughter against the father''s will. Barbarosa reluctantly takes the clumsy Karl on as a partner, as both of them look to survive the forces lining up against them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nfxPWtxocxrHutDpAdJhaHVEUek.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31665'),
  ('368872938227540567', 'Barbarossa', 2009, 'Drama, History', 'Renzo Martinelli, Fabio Cianchetti, Ovidiu Paunescu', 'Giorgio Schottler, Anna Samueli, Renzo Martinelli', 'Rutger Hauer, Raz Degan, Kasia Smutniak, Cécile Cassel, Ángela Molina, F. Murray Abraham, Antonio Cupo, Christo Jivkov', null, 'Year 1100. Italy.The Northern lands are ruled by a German emperor: Fredrick aka "Barbarossa. His dream is to conquer also the lands in the Center and in the South so as to revive the Empire that was once of the one Charles Magno.But in the North a young man from Milan has formed an army of 900 young men coming from different cities: the "company of death". This young man''s name is Alberto Da Giussano. His dream is to defeat the Emperor and to give back freedom to the Northern lands.', 'Year 1100. Italy.The Northern lands are ruled by a German emperor: Fredrick aka "Barbarossa. His dream is to conquer also the lands in the Center and in the South so as to revive the Empire that was once of the one Charles Magno.But in the North a young man from Milan has formed an army of 900 young men coming from different cities: the "company of death". This young man''s name is Alberto Da Giussano. His dream is to defeat the Emperor and to give back freedom to the Northern lands.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/haxJ5T4Id5ztqdrGoZFEA1MSekO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45559'),
  ('759563311295623716', 'Barbarous Mexico', 2014, 'Horror, Fantasy', 'Isaac Ezban, Jorge Michel Grau, Gigi Saul Guerrero', 'Gigi Saul Guerrero', 'Joyce Cuervo, Leslie Arce, Sara Camacho, Dulce Alexa, Adrián Aguirre, Mayra Angélica Chávez, Ana Rosa Dávila, Mayra Espinoza', null, 'Eight tales based on the most brutally terrifying Mexican traditions and legends, an anthology of haunting stories woven into the fabric of the Mexican culture, some told through the centuries and some new, but all equally frightening. Bogeymen, trolls, ghosts, monsters, all brought to life. Time for Aztec sacrifices. This is the Day of the Dead.', 'Eight tales based on the most brutally terrifying Mexican traditions and legends, an anthology of haunting stories woven into the fabric of the Mexican culture, some told through the centuries and some new, but all equally frightening. Bogeymen, trolls, ghosts, monsters, all brought to life. Time for Aztec sacrifices. This is the Day of the Dead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xQ1du8KQ0xijNQTceLmttt4Uokz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:267792'),
  ('948099871520589863', 'Barbary Coast', 1935, 'Romance, Western, Drama', 'Howard Hawks, Ray June', 'Ben Hecht, Charles MacArthur', 'Miriam Hopkins, Edward G. Robinson, Joel McCrea, Walter Brennan, Frank Craven, Brian Donlevy, Clyde Cook, Harry Carey', 'NR', 'Mary Rutledge arrives from the east, finds her fiancé dead, and goes to work at the roulette wheel of Luis Chamalis'' Bella Donna, a rowdy gambling house in San Francisco in the 1850s. She falls in love with miner Jim Carmichael and takes his gold dust at the wheel. She goes after him, Chamalis goes after her with intent to harm Carmichael.', 'Mary Rutledge arrives from the east, finds her fiancé dead, and goes to work at the roulette wheel of Luis Chamalis'' Bella Donna, a rowdy gambling house in San Francisco in the 1850s. She falls in love with miner Jim Carmichael and takes his gold dust at the wheel. She goes after him, Chamalis goes after her with intent to harm Carmichael.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hkUzk3WBI11LYgn1qsWGTsFlLOL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76499'),
  ('978839710202170890', 'Barbary-Coast Bunny', 1956, 'Animation, Comedy, Western', 'Chuck Jones', null, 'Mel Blanc, Daws Butler', 'NR', 'After Bugs'' giant gold nugget is stolen by Nasty Canasta, he tries to win it back at Canasta''s San Francisco gambling hall.', 'After Bugs'' giant gold nugget is stolen by Nasty Canasta, he tries to win it back at Canasta''s San Francisco gambling hall.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ygqWikAsAhS3RS8Xt5FnPMxgevt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:101504'),
  ('461811062845082415', 'Barbecue', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Eric Lavaine, François Hernandez', 'Eric Lavaine, Héctor Cabello Reyes', 'Lambert Wilson, Franck Dubosc, Florence Foresti, Guillaume de Tonquédec, Lionel Abelanski, Jérôme Commandeur, Sophie Duez, Lysiane Meis', null, 'On his 50th birthday, a man who''s been watching his weight, health and temper all his life suffers a heart attack. He''s been doing everything he was told he should do and it still didn''t help. He decides to turn the page and let loose.', 'On his 50th birthday, a man who''s been watching his weight, health and temper all his life suffers a heart attack. He''s been doing everything he was told he should do and it still didn''t help. He decides to turn the page and let loose.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f6qSHIFvo2NhvlbAi8WBehd4Xne.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:250349'),
