  ('575335899276893134', 'Barbed Wire Dolls', 1976, 'Crime, Drama, Horror', 'Jesús Franco, Jesús Franco, Gerald Cazal', 'Jesús Franco', 'Lina Romay, Paul Müller, Monica Swinn, Roger Darton, Ronald Weiss, Martine Stedil, Eric Falk, Peggy Markoff', null, 'Maria, an unfortunate young woman, kills her rapist father in self-defense, and is later tried, sentenced, and shipped off to a woman''s penitentiary where she and her fellow inmates are subjected to psychological and sexual abuse at the hands of a psychotic lesbian warden.', 'Maria, an unfortunate young woman, kills her rapist father in self-defense, and is later tried, sentenced, and shipped off to a woman''s penitentiary where she and her fellow inmates are subjected to psychological and sexual abuse at the hands of a psychotic lesbian warden.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3FBtK6Cn80qLESrWqIhbSh0uXLE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28691'),
  ('704481918423028327', 'Barbershop', 2002, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Tim Story, Tom Priestley Jr.', 'Mark Brown, Don D. Scott, Marshall Todd', 'Ice Cube, Anthony Anderson, Cedric the Entertainer, Sean Patrick Thomas, Eve, Troy Garity, Michael Ealy, Keith David', 'PG-13', 'A day in the life of a barbershop on the south side of Chicago. Calvin, who inherited the struggling business from his deceased father, views the shop as nothing but a burden and waste of his time. After selling the shop to a local loan shark, Calvin slowly begins to see his father''s vision and legacy and struggles with the notion that he just sold it out.', 'A day in the life of a barbershop on the south side of Chicago. Calvin, who inherited the struggling business from his deceased father, views the shop as nothing but a burden and waste of his time. After selling the shop to a local loan shark, Calvin slowly begins to see his father''s vision and legacy and struggles with the notion that he just sold it out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/up8cEgEsl2Dq5Djb9lMZYBK0s84.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10611'),
  ('524280631439811119', 'Barbershop 2: Back in Business', 2004, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Kevin Rodney Sullivan, Tom Priestley Jr.', 'Don D. Scott', 'Ice Cube, Cedric the Entertainer, Eve, Sean Patrick Thomas, Troy Garity, Michael Ealy, Queen Latifah, Jazsmin Lewis', 'PG-13', 'The continuing adventures of the barbers at Calvin''s Barbershop. Gina, a stylist at the beauty shop next door, is now trying to cut in on his business. Calvin is again struggling to keep his father''s shop and traditions alive--this time against urban developers looking to replace mom & pop establishments with name-brand chains. The world changes, but some things never go out of style--from current events and politics to relationships and love, you can still say anything you want at the barbershop.', 'The continuing adventures of the barbers at Calvin''s Barbershop. Gina, a stylist at the beauty shop next door, is now trying to cut in on his business. Calvin is again struggling to keep his father''s shop and traditions alive--this time against urban developers looking to replace mom & pop establishments with name-brand chains. The world changes, but some things never go out of style--from current events and politics to relationships and love, you can still say anything you want at the barbershop.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n4sOe401udZJWJEOvKvSs3peZcB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21301'),
  ('706975459562437939', 'Barbershop: The Next Cut', 2016, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Malcolm D. Lee, Greg Gardiner', 'Kenya Barris, Tracy Oliver', 'Ice Cube, Cedric the Entertainer, Regina Hall, Sean Patrick Thomas, Eve, Nicki Minaj, Anthony Anderson, Common', 'PG-13', 'To survive harsh economic times, Calvin and Angie have merged the barbershop and beauty salon into one business. The days of male bonding are gone as Eddie and the crew must now contend with sassy female co-workers and spirited clientele. As the battle of the sexes rages on, a different kind of conflict has taken over Chicago. Crime and gangs are on the rise, leaving Calvin worried about the fate of his son. Together, the friends come up with a bold plan to take back their beloved neighborhood.', 'To survive harsh economic times, Calvin and Angie have merged the barbershop and beauty salon into one business. The days of male bonding are gone as Eddie and the crew must now contend with sassy female co-workers and spirited clientele. As the battle of the sexes rages on, a different kind of conflict has taken over Chicago. Crime and gangs are on the rise, leaving Calvin worried about the fate of his son. Together, the friends come up with a bold plan to take back their beloved neighborhood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9mwzidlGgWfr2hcMWUKM86lOqdo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:326423'),
  ('782607934736034218', 'Barbès, little Algérie', 2024, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Amine Berrada, Hassan Guerrar, Vanessa Bertin', 'Hassan Guerrar, Rachid Benzine, Audrey Diwan', 'Sofiane Zermani, Eye Haïdara, Clotilde Courau, Adila Bendimerad, Khalil Ben Gharbia, Khaled Benaissa, Tariq Bettahar, Nedjim Bouizzoul', null, 'Malek, in his forties, single, has just moved to Montmartre and will soon welcome his nephew Ryiad, who has just arrived from Algeria, into his home. Together they discover Barbès, the neighborhood of the Algerian community, very lively, despite the current health crisis. His meetings with local figures will allow Malek to find a part of himself that he had buried, and to reconcile with his origins.', 'Malek, in his forties, single, has just moved to Montmartre and will soon welcome his nephew Ryiad, who has just arrived from Algeria, into his home. Together they discover Barbès, the neighborhood of the Algerian community, very lively, despite the current health crisis. His meetings with local figures will allow Malek to find a part of himself that he had buried, and to reconcile with his origins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/61g2EHKddDNI9r1FTYaKTXxZBTU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1000061'),
  ('604632418135320914', 'Barbie', 1977, 'Comedy', 'Tina L''Hotsky', 'Tina L''Hotsky', 'Tina L''Hotsky', null, 'Barbie comes home from shopping. She takes her groceries out of the bag and unwraps a little Barbie doll. She fries up the Barbie doll and eats it.', 'Barbie comes home from shopping. She takes her groceries out of the bag and unwraps a little Barbie doll. She fries up the Barbie doll and eats it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A1NvddoqyBjaIfEHDaffIJFGxcM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:617932'),
  ('960397114171443537', 'Barbie', 2011, 'Drama', 'Lee Sang-woo, Kim Su-min', 'Lee Sang-woo', 'Lee Chun-hee, Kim Sae-ron, Kim Ah-ron, Cat Tebo, Earl Jackson', null, 'Soon-young lives with her mentally handicapped father and younger sister Soon-ja. When an American man and his daughter Barbie arrive for an adoption, the family must decide who is to let go, Soon-young or Soon-ja.', 'Soon-young lives with her mentally handicapped father and younger sister Soon-ja. When an American man and his daughter Barbie arrive for an adoption, the family must decide who is to let go, Soon-young or Soon-ja.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qoFs8y8B7ysgCEu8SMjdF0UHoZi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:139588'),
  ('969955402256566000', 'Barbie', 2023, 'Comedy, Adventure', 'David Keadell, Josh Robertson, Danni Lizaitis', 'Noah Baumbach, Greta Gerwig', 'Margot Robbie, Ryan Gosling, America Ferrera, Ariana Greenblatt, Issa Rae, Kate McKinnon, Alexandra Shipp, Emma Mackey', 'PG-13', 'Barbie and Ken are having the time of their lives in the colorful and seemingly perfect world of Barbie Land. However, when they get a chance to go to the real world, they soon discover the joys and perils of living among humans.', 'Barbie and Ken are having the time of their lives in the colorful and seemingly perfect world of Barbie Land. However, when they get a chance to go to the real world, they soon discover the joys and perils of living among humans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iuFNMS8U5cb6xfzi51Dbkovj7vM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:346698'),
  ('1004582299318473037', 'Barbie & Chelsea: The Lost Birthday', 2021, 'Animation, Family', 'Cassi Simonds', 'Nate Federman, Ann Austen', 'Cassidy Naber, America Young, Cassandra Lee Morris, Kirsten Day, Benjamin Pronsky, Laila Berzins, Lisa Fuson, Greg Chun', 'NR', 'Barbie, Chelsea and their family go on a cruise ship for Chelsea''s birthday. But when they cross the international date line skipping her birthday, Chelsea escapes to the jungle island to find a fabled wish and get her birthday back.', 'Barbie, Chelsea and their family go on a cruise ship for Chelsea''s birthday. But when they cross the international date line skipping her birthday, Chelsea escapes to the jungle island to find a fabled wish and get her birthday back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dAmBnfCRBwy5S6n3Qb6aQKJYYRO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:812456'),
  ('77633082538551024', 'Barbie & Her Sisters in a Puppy Chase', 2016, 'Family, Animation', 'Ken Cunningham, Michael Goguen, Conrad Helten', 'Kacey Arnold, Amy Wolfram', 'Erica Lindbeck, Kazumi Evans, Claire Margaret Corlett, Alyssya Swales, Mark Oliver, Alice Campbell, Maryke Hendrikse, Kathleen Barr', 'G', 'Barbie and her sisters go to an island paradise for a dance competition, but they must work together as a team to find their pets after their furry friends go missing at a horse festival.', 'Barbie and her sisters go to an island paradise for a dance competition, but they must work together as a team to find their pets after their furry friends go missing at a horse festival.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i5aTj6smR8H6wHQ3gd0CqxrHXaA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:417047'),
  ('13206600319938453', 'Barbie & Her Sisters in the Great Puppy Adventure', 2015, 'Family, Animation, Adventure', 'Andrew Tan', 'Amy Wolfram', 'Kelly Sheridan, Kazumi Evans, Claire Maggie Corlett, Alyssya Swales, Chelsea Miller, Taylor Dianne Robinson, Bronwen Holmes, Amelia Shoichet-Stoll', 'G', 'Barbie and her sisters, Skipper, Stacie and Chelsea, and their adorable new puppy friends find unexpected mystery and adventure when they return to their hometown of Willows. While going through mementos in Grandma''s attic, the sisters discover an old map, believed to lead to a long-lost treasure buried somewhere in the town. With their puppy pals in tow, the four girls go on an exciting treasure hunt, along the way discovering that the greatest treasure of all is the love and laughter they share as sisters!', 'Barbie and her sisters, Skipper, Stacie and Chelsea, and their adorable new puppy friends find unexpected mystery and adventure when they return to their hometown of Willows. While going through mementos in Grandma''s attic, the sisters discover an old map, believed to lead to a long-lost treasure buried somewhere in the town. With their puppy pals in tow, the four girls go on an exciting treasure hunt, along the way discovering that the greatest treasure of all is the love and laughter they share as sisters!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3ybjPWweUjPXXqIXFERgPnOQ5O3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:361380'),
  ('94545647694893689', 'Barbie and the Diamond Castle', 2008, 'Animation, Family', 'Gino Nichele', null, 'Kelly Sheridan, Melissa Lyons, Maryke Hendrikse, Cassidy Ladden, Nicole Oliver, Chantal Strand, Kathleen Barr, Veena Sood', 'G', 'Liana and Alexa are best friends who share everything, including their love of singing. Upon meeting a girl inside a mirror, the duo embark on a journey that will put their friendship to the ultimate test.', 'Liana and Alexa are best friends who share everything, including their love of singing. Upon meeting a girl inside a mirror, the duo embark on a journey that will put their friendship to the ultimate test.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qewfjmkNpggNuXQtrUjMl8hvHoM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13004'),
  ('251099138803766106', 'Barbie and the Magic of Pegasus', 2005, 'Animation, Family, Romance', 'Greg Richardson', 'Cliff Ruby, Elana Lesser', 'Kelly Sheridan, Kathleen Barr, Lalainia Lindbjerg, Colin Murdock, Mark Hildreth, Brian Drummond, Russell Roberts, John DeSantis', 'G', 'Princess Annika escapes the clutches of the evil wizard, explores the wonders of Cloud Kingdom, and teams up with a magnificent winged horse - who turns out to be her sister, Princess Brietta - to defeat the wizard and break the spells that imprisoned her family.', 'Princess Annika escapes the clutches of the evil wizard, explores the wonders of Cloud Kingdom, and teams up with a magnificent winged horse - who turns out to be her sister, Princess Brietta - to defeat the wizard and break the spells that imprisoned her family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wqKNLSzGN9lqnmtFFwu40g2eWgQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15906'),
  ('223691933942173937', 'Barbie and the Rockers: Out of This World', 1987, 'Animation, Music, TV Movie', 'Bernard Deyriès', 'Martha Moran, Ruth Handler, Bill Dubay', 'Sharon Lewis, Michael Breyner, Mary Adams, Sarah Jayson, Joanne Wilson, Garry Chalk, Doc Harris, Lynn Johnson', 'G', 'Rock sensation Barbie and her band The Rockers, beloved by everyone all around the world, decide to do something no band has ever done before - preform a charity rock concert in outer space.', 'Rock sensation Barbie and her band The Rockers, beloved by everyone all around the world, decide to do something no band has ever done before - preform a charity rock concert in outer space.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7u7fWu9HjjW4C0kYEo8JLjMg0YN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:136215'),
  ('308985432487475908', 'Barbie and the Secret Door', 2014, 'Animation, Family', 'Karen J. Lloyd', null, 'Kelly Sheridan, Brittany McDonald, Ashleigh Ball, Chanelle Peloso, Tabitha St. Germain, Ellie King, Christopher Gaze, Jonathan Holmes', 'G', 'A shy princess discovers a secret door in her kingdom and enters a magical world full of magical creatures. She meets a mermaid and a fairy who tell her about a spoiled ruler threatening them.', 'A shy princess discovers a secret door in her kingdom and enters a magical world full of magical creatures. She meets a mermaid and a fairy who tell her about a spoiled ruler threatening them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i4BIMP1KZmERVwt4BFXKeBBIDvJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:285733'),
  ('308311970314553771', 'Barbie and the Sensations: Rockin'' Back to Earth', 1987, 'TV Movie, Animation, Music, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Bernard Deyriès', 'Bill Dubay, Martha Moran, Ruth Handler', 'Sharon Lewis', 'G', 'Following their concert for world peace in outer space, Barbie and her band the Rockers are going back home. During the trip back to Earth, the band''s space shuttle inadvertently enters a time warp. Upon landing at an airport, they meet Dr. Merrihew and his daughter Kim and soon learn that they have been transported back to 1959. The band then decides to go on a tour around the city alongside Kim. After a performance at Cape Canaveral, Dr. Merrihew helps Barbie and the Rockers return to their time. Back in the present, they stage a big concert in New York City, where Barbie is reunited with an adult Kim and introduced to her daughter Megan.', 'Following their concert for world peace in outer space, Barbie and her band the Rockers are going back home. During the trip back to Earth, the band''s space shuttle inadvertently enters a time warp. Upon landing at an airport, they meet Dr. Merrihew and his daughter Kim and soon learn that they have been transported back to 1959. The band then decides to go on a tour around the city alongside Kim. After a performance at Cape Canaveral, Dr. Merrihew helps Barbie and the Rockers return to their time. Back in the present, they stage a big concert in New York City, where Barbie is reunited with an adult Kim and introduced to her daughter Megan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vUCqvymxUwYxp9H6jw5R5UiaeE5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:198884'),
  ('300318359811570228', 'Barbie and the Three Musketeers', 2009, 'Animation, Family', 'William Lau', 'Amy Wolfram', 'Kelly Sheridan, Tim Curry, Kira Tozer, Willow Johnson, Dorla Bell, Nicole Oliver, Merrilyn Gann, Kathleen Barr', 'G', 'Corinne is a young country girl who heads to Paris to pursue her big dream – to become a female musketeer! Never could she imagine she would meet three other girls who secretly share the same dream! Using their special talents, the girls work together as a team to foil a plot and save the prince. It''s all for one and one for all!', 'Corinne is a young country girl who heads to Paris to pursue her big dream – to become a female musketeer! Never could she imagine she would meet three other girls who secretly share the same dream! Using their special talents, the girls work together as a team to foil a plot and save the prince. It''s all for one and one for all!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zR0ts7zL2P1kQIQXYlnS4KCqqmu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23566'),
  ('742510030226638970', 'Barbie as Rapunzel', 2002, 'Animation, Family', 'Owen Hurley', 'Elana Lesser, Cliff Ruby', 'Kelly Sheridan, Anjelica Huston, Cree Summer, Ian James Corlett, Mark Hildreth, David Kaye, Peter Kelamis, Russell Roberts', 'G', 'Barbie stars as Rapunzel, a young girl who is entrapped by a magical barrier by the wicked, Gothel. Rapunzel finds an escape where she finds a Prince and a feud between two kingdoms which goes back to the day she was kidnapped as a child.', 'Barbie stars as Rapunzel, a young girl who is entrapped by a magical barrier by the wicked, Gothel. Rapunzel finds an escape where she finds a Prince and a feud between two kingdoms which goes back to the day she was kidnapped as a child.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ysiGzuMSc0nFmmDPn9z7U7YSFYf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15015'),
  ('600748392648962530', 'Barbie as the Island Princess', 2007, 'Animation, Family', 'Greg Richardson', 'Elana Lesser, Cliff Ruby', 'Kelly Sheridan, Melissa Lyons, Alessandro Juliani, Christopher Gaze, Steve Marvel, Susan Roman, Garry Chalk, Russell Roberts', 'G', 'Young Rosella is saved by a few kind animals after a shipwreck. Now called Ro, she learns to talk to animals. One day, she saves the life of a prince and returns to civilisation to discover her past.', 'Young Rosella is saved by a few kind animals after a shipwreck. Now called Ro, she learns to talk to animals. One day, she saves the life of a prince and returns to civilisation to discover her past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oguRPUFeHt0H0wO0He4ewTseMXo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13283'),
  ('838174933569867635', 'Barbie as The Princess & the Pauper', 2004, 'Animation, Family, Comedy', 'William Lau', 'Cliff Ruby, Elana Lesser, Mark Twain', 'Kelly Sheridan, Melissa Lyons, Julie Stevens, Mark Hildreth, Mark Luna, Alessandro Juliani, Martin Short, Kathleen Barr', 'G', 'In her first animated musical featuring seven original songs, Barbie comes to life in this modern re-telling of a classic tale of mistaken identity and the power of friendship. Based on the story by Mark Twain.', 'In her first animated musical featuring seven original songs, Barbie comes to life in this modern re-telling of a classic tale of mistaken identity and the power of friendship. Based on the story by Mark Twain.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xHYsUwUe4MaNc6mbNBGTkqZSnPk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15165'),
  ('257790584058539451', 'Barbie Fairytopia: Magic of the Rainbow', 2007, 'Animation, Family, Fantasy, Romance', 'William Lau', null, 'Kelly Sheridan, Lee Tockar, Kathleen Barr, Christopher Gaze, Tabitha St. Germain, Venus Terzo, Andrew Francis, Sharon Alexander', 'G', 'Elina goes to a fairy school to learn dancing and fairy magic. The spring of the fairy land is soon threatened by evil Laverna who intends to prevent fairies from performing the annual vital rainbow dance. Elina must stop quarreling with her fellow students and unite them to save the first bud of the spring.', 'Elina goes to a fairy school to learn dancing and fairy magic. The spring of the fairy land is soon threatened by evil Laverna who intends to prevent fairies from performing the annual vital rainbow dance. Elina must stop quarreling with her fellow students and unite them to save the first bud of the spring.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nJmIZo7qX4iTACcBJdKh3qJ2Tyh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16962'),
  ('900551756080537291', 'Barbie Fairytopia: Mermaidia', 2006, 'Animation, Family, Adventure, Fantasy', 'William Lau, Walter P. Martishius', 'Elise Allen', 'Kelly Sheridan, Lee Tockar, Christopher Gaze, Kathleen Barr, Chiara Zanni, Andrea Libman, Brittney Wilson, Pam Hyatt', 'G', 'In this animated follow-up to Fairytopia, Elina enlists the help of a mermaid, Nori, to save her friend Nalu, a merman prince who has been captured by the wicked Laverna.', 'In this animated follow-up to Fairytopia, Elina enlists the help of a mermaid, Nori, to save her friend Nalu, a merman prince who has been captured by the wicked Laverna.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uBCvRThFwjvwNQeS3Vy7xMPc0Rh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13285'),
  ('104725581110782646', 'Barbie in ''A Christmas Carol''', 2008, 'Animation, Family', 'William Lau', 'Elise Allen', 'Kelly Sheridan, Morwenna Banks, Melissa Lyons, Prudence Edwards, Leanne Araya, Kandyse McClure, Shauntia Fleming, Kathleen Barr', 'G', 'On Christmas Eve, Kelly is reluctant to go to a Christmas Eve ball, so Barbie tells her the story of Eden Starling, a glamorous singing diva in the Victorian England and the owner of a theatre house. However, Eden is self-centered and loves only herself. She is frequently accompanied by her snooty cat, Chuzzlewit. She does not believe in Christmas and orders all her employees to work on Christmas.', 'On Christmas Eve, Kelly is reluctant to go to a Christmas Eve ball, so Barbie tells her the story of Eden Starling, a glamorous singing diva in the Victorian England and the owner of a theatre house. However, Eden is self-centered and loves only herself. She is frequently accompanied by her snooty cat, Chuzzlewit. She does not believe in Christmas and orders all her employees to work on Christmas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fX9g1AE1JIqjX3LPPKVjcmHs6fd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13459'),
  ('107023621241313859', 'Barbie in A Mermaid Tale', 2010, 'Animation, Family, Fantasy', 'Adam Wood', 'Elise Allen', 'Kelly Sheridan, Kathleen Barr, Tabitha St. Germain, Peter Mel, Nakia Burrise, Maryke Hendrikse, Emma Pierson, Ciara Janson', 'G', 'Barbie stars as Merliah, a surfer who learns a shocking secret: she''s a mermaid! She and her dolphin friend set out for an undersea adventure to rescue her mother, the queen of Oceana.', 'Barbie stars as Merliah, a surfer who learns a shocking secret: she''s a mermaid! She and her dolphin friend set out for an undersea adventure to rescue her mother, the queen of Oceana.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jtOlo3AaXVBnqfMeKGFrZUMPFui.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34134'),
  ('394608769521771676', 'Barbie in A Mermaid Tale 2', 2012, 'Animation, Family', 'William Lau', 'Elise Allen', 'Kelly Sheridan, Ashleigh Ball, Kathleen Barr, Nicole Oliver, Nakia Burrise, Maryke Hendrikse, Garry Chalk, Tabitha St. Germain', 'G', 'Merliah Summers, a mermaid from Oceana, travels to Australia for a surfing competition. But when she learns that the evil Eris is planning to take over her kingdom, she must stop her at any cost.', 'Merliah Summers, a mermaid from Oceana, travels to Australia for a surfing competition. But when she learns that the evil Eris is planning to take over her kingdom, she must stop her at any cost.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iVCfTtVDAECpbMSokSNilIR6wPr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:91342'),
  ('867482051287661486', 'Barbie in Princess Power', 2015, 'Animation, Family', 'Ezekiel Norton', 'Marsha Griffin', 'Kelly Sheridan, Britt Irvin, Michael Kopsa, Rebecca Husain, Kira Tozer, Patricia Drake, Michael Adamthwaite, David Kaye', 'G', 'Barbie is Kara - a modern-day princess with a normal life. Kissed by a butterfly which gives her superpowers and allows her to become a Super Sparkle, she is ready to save the kingdom from evil - were it not for her jealous cousin who is also kissed by the butterfly and becomes her rival and nemesis. Watch as Super Sparkle and Dark Sparkle learn that together they can become a great team for good once they learn the power of friendship.', 'Barbie is Kara - a modern-day princess with a normal life. Kissed by a butterfly which gives her superpowers and allows her to become a Super Sparkle, she is ready to save the kingdom from evil - were it not for her jealous cousin who is also kissed by the butterfly and becomes her rival and nemesis. Watch as Super Sparkle and Dark Sparkle learn that together they can become a great team for good once they learn the power of friendship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nCviAdChxibrKRZfvG7MZ2wsqdR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:316322'),
  ('974225680019219496', 'Barbie in Rock ''N Royals', 2015, 'Animation, Music, Family', 'Karen J. Lloyd', null, 'Kelly Sheridan, Chiara Zanni, Bethany Brown, Devyn Dalton, Michael Dobson, Brynna Drummond, Rachel Drance, Alessandro Juliani', 'PG', 'When royal Princess Courtney trades places with famous rock star Erika, two worlds collide while both learn to appreciate new friends and experiences.', 'When royal Princess Courtney trades places with famous rock star Erika, two worlds collide while both learn to appreciate new friends and experiences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aCKWWQpEijagMEfIOz0vW0aTDmv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:355111'),
  ('183060022882056948', 'Barbie in the 12 Dancing Princesses', 2006, 'Animation, Family', 'Greg Richardson', 'Elana Lesser, Cliff Ruby', 'Kelly Sheridan, Catherine O''Hara, Christopher Gaze, Nicole Oliver, Jennifer Copping, Lalainia Lindbjerg, Kathleen Barr, Chiara Zanni', 'G', 'King Randolph sends for his cousin, Duchess Rowena, to help turn his daughters, Princess Genevieve and her eleven sisters, into royal material. But the Duchess strips the sisters of their fun, including their favorite pastime: dancing. When all hope may be lost, the sisters discover a secret passageway to a magical land where they can dance the night away.', 'King Randolph sends for his cousin, Duchess Rowena, to help turn his daughters, Princess Genevieve and her eleven sisters, into royal material. But the Duchess strips the sisters of their fun, including their favorite pastime: dancing. When all hope may be lost, the sisters discover a secret passageway to a magical land where they can dance the night away.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yBB7PwXRFJ29U8m8SnTcWVizFvM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13002'),
  ('971105583270197218', 'Barbie in the Nutcracker', 2001, 'Animation, Family', 'Owen Hurley', 'Linda Engelsiepen, Rob Hudnut, Hilary Hinkle', 'Kelly Sheridan, Kirby Morrow, Tim Curry, Peter Kelamis, Christopher Gaze, Ian James Corlett, French Tickner, Kathleen Barr', 'G', 'The Mouse King casts an evil spell over Clara that causes her to shrink. Clara and the Nutcracker set out on an adventurous journey to find Sugarplum Princess, who has the power to undo the spell.', 'The Mouse King casts an evil spell over Clara that causes her to shrink. Clara and the Nutcracker set out on an adventurous journey to find Sugarplum Princess, who has the power to undo the spell.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eIkXJggVmzN4MyPgJ2kDjOy9lmQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15167'),
  ('78353386031976084', 'Barbie in the Pink Shoes', 2013, 'Animation, Family', 'Owen Hurley', 'Alison Taylor', 'Kelly Sheridan, Katie Crown, Ali Liebert, Brett Dier, Tabitha St. Germain, Bill Mondy, Lori Triolo, Teryl Rothery', 'G', 'About a young girl who finds a pair of pink ballet shoes and is taken to a magical ballet land.There she learns how to help her friends and follow her instincts.', 'About a young girl who finds a pair of pink ballet shoes and is taken to a magical ballet land.There she learns how to help her friends and follow her instincts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4HSPgeq04YUghXbSO5tSPP0jZ4k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:168903'),
  ('309897053134374018', 'Barbie Mariposa', 2008, 'Animation, Fantasy, Family', 'Conrad Helten', 'Elise Allen', 'Chiara Zanni, Tabitha St. Germain, Kathleen Barr, Erin Mathews, Nicole Oliver, Alessandro Juliani, Cathy Weseluck, Alistair Abell', 'G', 'Elina, heroine of the Fairytopia films tells her friend Bibble the story of Flutterfield, a faraway kingdom populated by fairies with butterfly wings. Henna, the evil butterfly fairy has poisoned the queen of Flutterfield in an attempt to take over the kingdom.', 'Elina, heroine of the Fairytopia films tells her friend Bibble the story of Flutterfield, a faraway kingdom populated by fairies with butterfly wings. Henna, the evil butterfly fairy has poisoned the queen of Flutterfield in an attempt to take over the kingdom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qsb1OQCNVMAX3KRT6xhKOl3mM6P.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18198'),
  ('215687327035651845', 'Barbie Mariposa & the Fairy Princess', 2013, 'Animation, Family, Fantasy', 'William Lau', 'Elise Allen', 'Kelly Sheridan, Maryke Hendrikse, Tabitha St. Germain, Kathleen Barr, Mariee Devereux, Alessandro Juliani, Jane Barr, Alistair Abell', 'G', 'Join Mariposa and her new friend, Princess Catania, in this magical adventure to save the fairy land of Shimmervale. Together, the girls learn that with great friends, the sky is the limit.', 'Join Mariposa and her new friend, Princess Catania, in this magical adventure to save the fairy land of Shimmervale. Together, the girls learn that with great friends, the sky is the limit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aUVd4itaF4mDFgld99wMIihjUK7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:196254'),
