  ('278044377776843587', 'Barbie Presents: Thumbelina', 2009, 'Animation, Family', 'Conrad Helten', 'Elise Allen', 'Kelly Sheridan, Anna Cummer, Kelly Metzger, Tabitha St. Germain, Cathy Weseluck, Kathleen Barr, Peter New, Brian Drummond', 'G', 'Meet a tiny girl named Thumbelina who lives in harmony with nature in the magical world of the Twillerbees that''s hidden among the wildflowers. At the whim of a spoiled young girl named Makena, Thumbelina and her two friends have their patch of wildflowers uprooted and are transported to a lavish apartment in the city.', 'Meet a tiny girl named Thumbelina who lives in harmony with nature in the magical world of the Twillerbees that''s hidden among the wildflowers. At the whim of a spoiled young girl named Makena, Thumbelina and her two friends have their patch of wildflowers uprooted and are transported to a lavish apartment in the city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ytKd2jWnzWLCiccutqqMNzcP5RE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16418'),
  ('913993278244551770', 'Barbie Video Game Hero', 2017, 'Animation, Family, Science Fiction', 'Ezekiel Norton, Conrad Helten', 'Nina G. Bargiel', 'Erica Lindbeck, Sienna Bohn, Shannon Chan-Kent, Michael Dobson, Alyssya Swales, Rebekah Asselstine, Brad Swaile, Sam Vincent', null, 'When Barbie is accidentally pulled into her favourite game, she teams up with the roller skater Bella and her friend Cutie, to stop a mischievous emoji who is trying to take control of the game.', 'When Barbie is accidentally pulled into her favourite game, she teams up with the roller skater Bella and her friend Cutie, to stop a mischievous emoji who is trying to take control of the game.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rWQPf9Q8CAHIpBP8SVLE3uaSmf4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:434757'),
