  ('1142722792965209657', 'Barbie: Spy Squad', 2016, 'Action, Animation, Family', 'Conrad Helten', 'Marsha Griffin, Kacey Arnold', 'Erica Lindbeck, Stephanie Sheh, Jenny Pellicer, Alyssya Swales, Elizabeth Irving, Brian Dobson, Rebecca Husain, Cathy Weseluck', 'G', 'Barbie and her best friends Teresa and Renee transform from hard-working gymnasts to undercover secret agents. When their amazing gymnastics skills catch the eye of a top-secret spy agency, the girls are soon following clues to a gem-stealing cat burglar, using high-tech gadgets, glam disguises and cute robo-pets to save the day.', 'Barbie and her best friends Teresa and Renee transform from hard-working gymnasts to undercover secret agents. When their amazing gymnastics skills catch the eye of a top-secret spy agency, the girls are soon following clues to a gem-stealing cat burglar, using high-tech gadgets, glam disguises and cute robo-pets to save the day.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uxdvJHE5V844dTlK2EmqRQCTYDb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:377897'),
  ('1050289753822987727', 'Barbie: Star Light Adventure', 2016, 'Animation, Family, Science Fiction', 'Michael Goguen, Andrew Tan', 'Kacey Arnold', 'Erica Lindbeck, Robbie Daymond, Kimberly Woods, Sarah Anne Williams, Michael Chandler, Dwight Schultz, Ben Bledsoe, Jonathan Lipow', 'G', 'When Barbie, a cosmic princess with a hoverboard, learns that the brightly shining stars have begun to dim, she begins a rescue mission to save the galaxy.', 'When Barbie, a cosmic princess with a hoverboard, learns that the brightly shining stars have begun to dim, she begins a rescue mission to save the galaxy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9Yq33EXs9YpgrwGXJlJL73OTpt1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:415749'),
  ('176414535177749007', 'Barbie: The Pearl Princess', 2014, 'Family, Animation', 'Ezekiel Norton', 'Steve Granat, Cydne Clark', 'Kelly Sheridan, Katie Crown, Mark Oliver, Rebecca Shoichet, Trish Pattendon, John Novak, Simon Hill, Peter New', 'G', 'Barbie plays Lumina, a mermaid girl with the power to change the color of pearls. Cheerful and creative, Lumina finds herself working in a mermaid salon customizing fabulous hairstyles. And when Lumina has the chance to attend the royal ball, her friends adorn her with a gown fit for a princess. At the ball, villains try to seize power over the kingdom, and Lumina finds within herself an unexpected power that proves she is much more than a hair stylist.', 'Barbie plays Lumina, a mermaid girl with the power to change the color of pearls. Cheerful and creative, Lumina finds herself working in a mermaid salon customizing fabulous hairstyles. And when Lumina has the chance to attend the royal ball, her friends adorn her with a gown fit for a princess. At the ball, villains try to seize power over the kingdom, and Lumina finds within herself an unexpected power that proves she is much more than a hair stylist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zA4csIbIKzPOd6DwN5rKxHkVCu6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:255718'),
  ('666906493700302631', 'Barbie: The Princess & the Popstar', 2012, 'Family, Animation', 'Ezekiel Norton', 'Cydne Clark', 'Kelly Sheridan, Jennifer Waris, Ashleigh Ball, Tiffany Giardina, Ellie King, Peter Kelamis, Allison Warnyca, Christopher Gaze', 'G', 'Tori is a blonde princess who is bored of living her royal life, and has dreams of becoming a popstar. Keira, on the other hand, is a brunette popstar who dreams of being a princess. When the two meet, they magically trade places, but after realising it is best to be themselves.', 'Tori is a blonde princess who is bored of living her royal life, and has dreams of becoming a popstar. Keira, on the other hand, is a brunette popstar who dreams of being a princess. When the two meet, they magically trade places, but after realising it is best to be themselves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hab6ZMC3eXj9pQHlSxNUjonphCR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:129533'),
  ('638179593173971663', 'Barbosa', 1988, 'Science Fiction', 'Jorge Furtado, Ana Luíza Azevedo, Nora Goulart', 'Ana Luíza Azevedo, Giba Assis Brasil, Jorge Furtado', 'Antônio Fagundes, Pedro Santos, Zé Victor Castiel, Ariel Nehring, Abel Borba, Nilson Pereira da Silva, Luis Carlos Lopes, Lucas Elias', null, 'Thirty-eight years after the 1950 World Cup, a man went back in time to prevent the goal that defeated Brazil, destroyed his childhood dreams and ended goalkeeper Barbosa''s career.', 'Thirty-eight years after the 1950 World Cup, a man went back in time to prevent the goal that defeated Brazil, destroyed his childhood dreams and ended goalkeeper Barbosa''s career.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b3VPy2qdhrKEqMkkeWzThIAJ4GN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:191376'),
  ('105168384957944778', 'Barça Dreams', 2015, 'Documentary', 'Jordi Llompart', null, 'Lionel Messi, Johan Cruijff, Andrés Iniesta, Pau Gasol, Gary Lineker, Pep Guardiola, Xavi, Gerard Piqué', null, 'Fascinating chronicle of the ascendancy of FC Barcelona - possibly the top team in the world and powerful emblem of Catalan identity - ''Barca: More than a Club''. Director Jordi Llompart charts the team''s inexorable rise from its origins with founder Joan Gamper more than 100 years ago to a Champion''s League-winning side that boasts striker Lionel Messi and prestigious coach Pep Guardiola.', 'Fascinating chronicle of the ascendancy of FC Barcelona - possibly the top team in the world and powerful emblem of Catalan identity - ''Barca: More than a Club''. Director Jordi Llompart charts the team''s inexorable rise from its origins with founder Joan Gamper more than 100 years ago to a Champion''s League-winning side that boasts striker Lionel Messi and prestigious coach Pep Guardiola.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wN8L1Sp9omTVd5aNcxNkQ857eqp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:362256'),
  ('933666570100649666', 'Barcelona', 1994, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Whit Stillman, John Thomas', 'Whit Stillman', 'Taylor Nichols, Chris Eigeman, Tushka Bergen, Mira Sorvino, Pep Munné, Hellena Taylor, Núria Badia, Jack Gilpin', 'PG-13', 'During the 1980s, uptight Ted Boynton is a salesman working in the Barcelona office of a Chicago-based company. He receives an unexpected visit from his cousin Fred, a naval officer who has come to Spain on a public relations mission for a U.S. fleet. Not exactly friends in the past, Ted and Fred strike up relationships with women in the Spanish city and experience conflicts -- Ted with his employer, and Fred with the Barcelona community.', 'During the 1980s, uptight Ted Boynton is a salesman working in the Barcelona office of a Chicago-based company. He receives an unexpected visit from his cousin Fred, a naval officer who has come to Spain on a public relations mission for a U.S. fleet. Not exactly friends in the past, Ted and Fred strike up relationships with women in the Spanish city and experience conflicts -- Ted with his employer, and Fred with the Barcelona community.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7dgX3naR9EsFMvQhwHY8My6r5FR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16771'),
  ('286730912084327996', 'Barcelona Christmas Night', 2015, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'Dani de la Orden, Ricard Canyellas', 'Eric Navarro, Eduard Sola, Daniel González', 'Miki Esparbé, Bárbara Santa-Cruz, Alberto San Juan, Victoria Luengo, Àlex Maruny, Montserrat Carulla, Asunción Balaguer, Berto Romero', null, 'Multiple love stories unfold in Barcelona during Christmas''s Eve.', 'Multiple love stories unfold in Barcelona during Christmas''s Eve.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a21FeB4RLiGEXSSNqPgf6H3TzNG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:343144'),
  ('420567527963278312', 'Barcelona Park at Twilight', 1904, 'Documentary', 'Segundo de Chomón, Henri Vallouy, Segundo de Chomón', null, null, null, 'Early short showing the titular park in around 2 minutes.', 'Early short showing the titular park in around 2 minutes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o89ALmuwCsrANWLfKArqxnYryO9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:160512'),
  ('706966097287153946', 'Barcelona Summer Night', 2013, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Dani de la Orden, Ricard Canyellas, Carles Cambres', 'Eduard Sola, Eric Navarro, Daniel González', 'Francesc Colomer, Jan Cornet, Joan Dausà, Laura Diaz, Miki Esparbé, Sara Espígul, Luis Fernández, Marc García Coté', null, 'In 2012 the comet Rose crossed the skies of the city of Barcelona and its magic that night caused 346 love stories flourish. An atmosphere of dreams, hopes and desire mixed to give a special connection between people. From these stories six are the stars of the film. A dinner among friends with a love of life is coupled with a first time for miles. An encounter that can change their lives and revive old ties that clash with the discovery of a baby on the way. In parallel, the struggle between friendship and love strikes the last story, a clandestine love between gay athletes who have to make a tough decision.', 'In 2012 the comet Rose crossed the skies of the city of Barcelona and its magic that night caused 346 love stories flourish. An atmosphere of dreams, hopes and desire mixed to give a special connection between people. From these stories six are the stars of the film. A dinner among friends with a love of life is coupled with a first time for miles. An encounter that can change their lives and revive old ties that clash with the discovery of a baby on the way. In parallel, the struggle between friendship and love strikes the last story, a clandestine love between gay athletes who have to make a tough decision.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tCWSCWdVjYy9pNytDoH0HB3ALpk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:215828'),
  ('1031392315256381584', 'Barcelona sur', 1981, 'Drama', 'Jordi Cadena, Jaume Peracaula', 'Jordi Cadena, Gustavo Hernández', 'Marta Molins, Alma Muriel, Jaime Moreno, Àngel Jové, Carles Velat, Paca Gabaldón, Irán Eory, José Luis Manzano', null, 'Obsessed with finding her old boyfriend, Gumer, a 25-year-old girl, is released from jail in Barcelona, one of Europe''s most sought-after port cities for drug trafficking and prostitution. Charo, her best friend, tries to help her, although she is not free, since depends on her pimp "Toni". But Gumer will persuade Charo to abandon Toni and form, along with other friends, a band to start businesses on their own.', 'Obsessed with finding her old boyfriend, Gumer, a 25-year-old girl, is released from jail in Barcelona, one of Europe''s most sought-after port cities for drug trafficking and prostitution. Charo, her best friend, tries to help her, although she is not free, since depends on her pimp "Toni". But Gumer will persuade Charo to abandon Toni and form, along with other friends, a band to start businesses on their own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jRKMPTQjXX3qKBYrNtnvQMrhCr2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:301845'),
  ('52161900881053019', 'Bardelys the Magnificent', 1926, 'Action, Drama, Romance', 'King Vidor, William H. Daniels', 'Dorothy Farnum', 'John Gilbert, Eleanor Boardman, Roy D''Arcy, Lionel Belmore, Emily Fitzroy, George K. Arthur, Arthur Lubin, Theodore von Eltz', null, 'Rafael Sabatini''s story of the swashbuckling era and of Bardeleys, the handsome courtier who could win any woman he set his mind to...and was not above boasting about it to all who would listen.', 'Rafael Sabatini''s story of the swashbuckling era and of Bardeleys, the handsome courtier who could win any woman he set his mind to...and was not above boasting about it to all who would listen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1NHq8P83XPor8iU2rXk37J1OSc4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:128899'),
  ('410660953415495441', 'BARDO, False Chronicle of a Handful of Truths', 2022, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Carlos Y. Jacques, Roberto Bonelli, Agueda Anaya Angulo', 'Nicolás Giacobone, Alejandro González Iñárritu', 'Daniel Giménez Cacho, Griselda Siciliani, Íker Sánchez Solano, Ximena Lamadrid, Luz Jiménez, Luis Couturier, Francisco Rubio, Andrés Almeida', 'R', 'A renowned Mexican journalist and documentary filmmaker living in Los Angeles, after being named the recipient of a prestigious international award, is compelled to return to his native country, unaware that this simple trip will push him to an existential limit.', 'A renowned Mexican journalist and documentary filmmaker living in Los Angeles, after being named the recipient of a prestigious international award, is compelled to return to his native country, unaware that this simple trip will push him to an existential limit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3e6RA0CzFDC0pz5TqiRlbHcsc2n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:685691'),
  ('224032733168725404', 'Bare Essence of Life', 2009, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Satoko Yokohama, Katsumi Nojiri', null, 'Kenichi Matsuyama, Kumiko Aso, Seiji Nozoe, Arata Iura, Yoshio Harada, Misako Watanabe, Mayu Kitaki, Yuta Maita', null, 'Yojin, an eccentric young farmer living in the countryside, falls in love for the first time in his life. Her name is Machiko, she teaches in a kindergarten and is from Tokyo.', 'Yojin, an eccentric young farmer living in the countryside, falls in love for the first time in his life. Her name is Machiko, she teaches in a kindergarten and is from Tokyo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yFIQMgm0f1B0FsPcsq94hHLzQ72.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33696'),
  ('200975142277283885', 'Bare Hands', 2025, 'Action, Thriller, Drama', 'Mauro Mancini, Sandro Chessa', 'Davide Lisino, Mauro Mancini', 'Alessandro Gassmann, Francesco Gheghi, Fotinì Peluso, Paolo Madonna, Giordana Marengo, Renato Carpentieri', null, 'Davide, a good kid with the eyes of a child and the body of a grown man, is kidnapped one night and locked inside the dark trailer of a truck. He becomes a prisoner of a mysterious organization that forces him to fight, bare-handed, in brutal underground matches that can end only one way: the death of one of the two fighters.', 'Davide, a good kid with the eyes of a child and the body of a grown man, is kidnapped one night and locked inside the dark trailer of a truck. He becomes a prisoner of a mysterious organization that forces him to fight, bare-handed, in brutal underground matches that can end only one way: the death of one of the two fighters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1JNBFmve22grce9dlTJZ13IXNfh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1276261'),
  ('274853079637765698', 'Bare Naked in Upper Bavaria', 1969, 'Comedy', 'Hans Albin', 'Hans Billian', 'Ini Assmann, Hans von Borsody, Beppo Brem, Peter Garden, Anke Syring, Dorit Dom, Christine Schuberth, Maria Stadler', null, 'The new waitress at the Gasthof zur Post is an object of desire for all men in the village.', 'The new waitress at the Gasthof zur Post is an object of desire for all men in the village.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xbU8jzOtPm3kavdICjA8jcohzr4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:237014'),
  ('165865879327608669', 'Bare Skin', 2026, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Mico Montes, Max Goldberg', 'Mico Montes', 'Rachel Alig, Torrey B. Lawrence, Avery Norris, Ariana Livingston, Ryan Wayne', null, 'Victims of extreme trauma are invited to a group therapy session to share their experiences in a safe setting, but as their stories are told, an unsettling truth reveals that they may all be connected in their misfortune.', 'Victims of extreme trauma are invited to a group therapy session to share their experiences in a safe setting, but as their stories are told, an unsettling truth reveals that they may all be connected in their misfortune.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fmetadata-static.plex.tv%2F2%2Fgracenote%2F204a6d2e95d014a7dbdf900828db6698.jpg', 'plex:movie:bare-skin-2026'),
  ('315044540576036861', 'Barefoot', 2005, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'Til Schweiger, Christof Wahl', 'Til Schweiger, Jann Preuss, Nika von Altenstadt', 'Til Schweiger, Johanna Wokalek, Nadja Tiller, Michael Mendl, Steffen Wink, Alexandra Neldel, Imogen Kogge, Paula Paul', null, 'A hedonistic bachelor - he is his rich family''s black sheep - falls for a suicidal mental patient.', 'A hedonistic bachelor - he is his rich family''s black sheep - falls for a suicidal mental patient.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/unByyrvOdFGXTvvPHawEPQPgl2P.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6183'),
  ('178207565848536873', 'Barefoot', 2014, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Andrew Fleming, Alexander Gruszynski', 'Stephen Zotnowski', 'Evan Rachel Wood, Scott Speedman, J.K. Simmons, Treat Williams, Kate Burton, Andrea Moore, Joe Chrest, David Jensen', 'PG-13', 'The "black sheep" son of a wealthy family meets a young psychiatric patient who''s been raised in isolation her entire life. He takes the naive young woman home for his brother''s wedding an improbable romance blooms, as she impresses everyone with her genuine, simple charms.', 'The "black sheep" son of a wealthy family meets a young psychiatric patient who''s been raised in isolation her entire life. He takes the naive young woman home for his brother''s wedding an improbable romance blooms, as she impresses everyone with her genuine, simple charms.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7CWdmxafzSVEUv4mMlOpw89NKXE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:242042'),
  ('373499082194091350', 'Barefoot at Dawn', 2017, 'Drama', 'Francis Leclerc, Steve Asselin', 'Fred Pellerin, Francis Leclerc', 'Félix Leclerc, Justin Leyrolles-Bouchard, Julien Leclerc, Roy Dupuis, Catherine Sénart, Claude Legault, Tristan Goyette-Plante, Agathe Tremblay', null, 'February 1927: Félix Leclerc''s last year with his family before attending a private college in the fall. Accompanied by Fidor, his faithful friend, he will face adversity, love, death, and will embark on the path of adulthood.', 'February 1927: Félix Leclerc''s last year with his family before attending a private college in the fall. Accompanied by Fidor, his faithful friend, he will face adversity, love, death, and will embark on the path of adulthood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b76RKAfj9nc50hu75W8RSbjJHwm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:465242'),
  ('405839280551795849', 'Barefoot Gen', 1983, 'Animation, Drama, War, History', 'Mori Masaki, Naoko Kusumi, Susumu Aketagawa', 'Keiji Nakazawa', 'Issei Miyazaki, Masaki Kouda, Seiko Nakano, Takao Inoue, Yoshie Shimamura, Takeshi Aono, Katsuji Mori, Taeko Nakanishi', null, 'A story about the effect of the atomic bombing of Hiroshima on a boy''s life and the lives of the Japanese people.', 'A story about the effect of the atomic bombing of Hiroshima on a boy''s life and the lives of the Japanese people.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kVqQToQ47e27b9uoryttWgTPiik.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14087'),
  ('778341707134085292', 'Barefoot Gen 2', 1986, 'Animation, Drama, War', 'Toshio Hirata, Susumu Aketagawa, Kinichi Ishikawa', 'Hideo Takayashiki', 'Issei Miyazaki, Kei Nakamura, Masaki Kouda, Kae Shimamura, Kimi Aoyama, Koichi Kitamura, Masato Yamamoto, Masumi Satou', null, 'Three years after the Hiroshima bombing, a teenager helps a group of orphans to survive and find their new life.', 'Three years after the Hiroshima bombing, a teenager helps a group of orphans to survive and find their new life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kho0D6jPrVIBfyuNoBzO5roWwL0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14088'),
  ('361940314555557733', 'Barefoot in the Park', 1967, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Gene Saks, Howard Grace, Joseph LaShelle', 'Neil Simon', 'Robert Redford, Jane Fonda, Charles Boyer, Mildred Natwick, Herb Edelman, Mabel Albertson, Fritz Feld, James Stone', 'NR', 'In this film based on a Neil Simon play, newlyweds Corie, a free spirit, and Paul Bratter, an uptight lawyer, share a sixth-floor apartment in Greenwich Village. Soon after their marriage, Corie tries to find a companion for mother, Ethel, who is now alone, and sets up Ethel with neighbor Victor. Inappropriate behavior on a double date causes conflict, and the young couple considers divorce.', 'In this film based on a Neil Simon play, newlyweds Corie, a free spirit, and Paul Bratter, an uptight lawyer, share a sixth-floor apartment in Greenwich Village. Soon after their marriage, Corie tries to find a companion for mother, Ethel, who is now alone, and sets up Ethel with neighbor Victor. Inappropriate behavior on a double date causes conflict, and the young couple considers divorce.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rYRorEvNI7fBHiFui1qEinuSYbC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17887'),
  ('684559500109979807', 'Barefoot to the Neck', 2009, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Hansjörg Thurn, Marco Uggiano', 'Sarah Schnier', 'Martin Brambach, Christoph M. Ohrt, Constantin von Jascheroff, Diane Willems, Stefanie Höner, Sarah Kim Gries, Zsolt Bács, Gotthard Lange', null, 'A nudist site in eastern Germany is sold to Dieter Lohe, a conservative textile manufacturer from Bavaria. He visits his new property with his daughter Natalie, and plans to use the property as a hunting ground.', 'A nudist site in eastern Germany is sold to Dieter Lohe, a conservative textile manufacturer from Bavaria. He visits his new property with his daughter Natalie, and plans to use the property as a hunting ground.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jfck57tPn33f3HkZ4NaG1k4Lguj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62449'),
  ('698982349190429753', 'Bareilly Ki Barfi', 2017, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Ashwiny Iyer Tiwari, Gavemic U Ary, Mukesh Chhabra', 'Shreyas Jain, Ashwiny Iyer Tiwari, Rajat Nonia', 'Kriti Sanon, Ayushmann Khurrana, Rajkummar Rao, Rohit Choudhary, Pankaj Tripathi, Seema Pahwa, Semwal Swati, Naila Grrewal', null, 'Bitti Mishra is a bohemian Bareilly girl who falls deeply in love with Pritam Vidrohi, an author because she admires his progressive way of thinking. Finding him though proves to be as hard as looking for a needle in the haystack. So Bitti seeks the help of the local printing press-owner, Chirag Dubey on her journey of love.', 'Bitti Mishra is a bohemian Bareilly girl who falls deeply in love with Pritam Vidrohi, an author because she admires his progressive way of thinking. Finding him though proves to be as hard as looking for a needle in the haystack. So Bitti seeks the help of the local printing press-owner, Chirag Dubey on her journey of love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gviYC7rpJ4HWbbEFs0ZW5u965Tq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:467106'),
  ('829287690532035382', 'Barely Legal', 2003, 'Comedy', 'John B. Aronson, David Mickey Evans, Jeffrey F. January', 'David H. Steinberg', 'Erik von Detten, Vince Vieluf, Sarah-Jane Potts, Tony Denman, Daniel Farber, Cameron Richardson, Riley Smith, Samm Levine', 'R', 'Teenager Deacon works at a video shop, and his buddies, Fred and Matt, sell the bootleg porno films he acquires. Deacon gets fired, but the pals have the bright idea of filming their own Internet porn flick in order to make money and become more popular at school. Hijinks ensue as they cast and create their movie, but porn industry player Vic Ramalot grows jealous of their burgeoning success and tries to put a stop to the project.', 'Teenager Deacon works at a video shop, and his buddies, Fred and Matt, sell the bootleg porno films he acquires. Deacon gets fired, but the pals have the bright idea of filming their own Internet porn flick in order to make money and become more popular at school. Hijinks ensue as they cast and create their movie, but porn industry player Vic Ramalot grows jealous of their burgeoning success and tries to put a stop to the project.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xN3CR1V3ccOmp1LXhR1FutwmuU2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15276'),
  ('468450463224245966', 'Barely Legal', 2011, 'Comedy', 'Jose Montesinos, Ben Demaree, Dan Golden', 'Naomi L. Selfman', 'Jeneta St. Clair, Lisa Younger, Melissa Johnston, Morgan Benoit, Myko Olivier, Matthew Keoki Miller, Joy Amber Stephens, Lee Doud', 'NR', 'Sue, Cheryl and Lexi are three college freshmen who have been best friends since they were born on the same day. They do something special every year for their birthday, but on their eighteenth, they set out to lose their virginity.', 'Sue, Cheryl and Lexi are three college freshmen who have been best friends since they were born on the same day. They do something special every year for their birthday, but on their eighteenth, they set out to lose their virginity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5x2xQFjhsWCCvQg7gks7YffZesV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76815'),
  ('185340548747328150', 'Barely Lethal', 2015, 'Action, Comedy, Adventure, Romance', 'Kyle Newman, Peter Lyons Collister, Scott Cameron', 'John D''Arco', 'Hailee Steinfeld, Sophie Turner, Jessica Alba, Samuel L. Jackson, Dove Cameron, Thomas Mann, Gabriel Basso, Emma Holzer', 'PG-13', 'A 16-year-old international assassin yearning for a "normal" adolescence fakes her own death and enrolls as a senior in a suburban high school. She quickly learns that being popular can be more painful than getting water-boarded.', 'A 16-year-old international assassin yearning for a "normal" adolescence fakes her own death and enrolls as a senior in a suburban high school. She quickly learns that being popular can be more painful than getting water-boarded.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8emz9dKW8KKIqG8WcFG1lJbr2ub.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:248574'),
  ('1086565104719767926', 'Barfi!', 2012, 'Drama, Romance, Comedy', 'Anurag Basu, Vijai Singh, Ravi Varman', 'Anurag Basu', 'Ranbir Kapoor, Priyanka Chopra Jonas, Ileana D''Cruz, Saurabh Shukla, Jisshu Sengupta, Ashish Vidhyarthi, Akash Khurana, Roopa Ganguly', null, 'The heartwarming tale of Barfi, a charming deaf-mute young man from 1970s Darjeeling, and two unalike women who can''t help but fall for him.', 'The heartwarming tale of Barfi, a charming deaf-mute young man from 1970s Darjeeling, and two unalike women who can''t help but fall for him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5cJIx2zKjDoUtPSliou23xsReb1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:127501'),
  ('1078852961292845927', 'Barfly', 1987, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Robby Müller, Barbet Schroeder', 'Charles Bukowski', 'Mickey Rourke, Faye Dunaway, Alice Krige, Jack Nance, J.C. Quinn, Frank Stallone Jr., Sandy Martin, Roberta Bassin', 'R', 'Downtrodden writer Henry and distressed goddess Wanda aren''t exactly husband and wife: they''re wedded to their bar stools. But, they like each other''s company—and Barfly captures their giddy, gin-soaked attempts to make a go of life on the skids.', 'Downtrodden writer Henry and distressed goddess Wanda aren''t exactly husband and wife: they''re wedded to their bar stools. But, they like each other''s company—and Barfly captures their giddy, gin-soaked attempts to make a go of life on the skids.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uAsAVy7yoMZ2r5ZBQQXw4PKX3JY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10937'),
  ('850392852612085122', 'Bargain', 2015, 'Drama', 'Lee Chung-hyun, Kim Sang-il', 'Lee Chung-hyun', 'Park Hyoung-soo, Lee Zoo-young, Lee Sang-hoon', null, 'A middle-aged man takes a high school girl to a motel room and bargains with her about the payment for sex. He argues for a discount on the grounds that she is not a virgin. At a loss, the girl agrees.', 'A middle-aged man takes a high school girl to a motel room and bargains with her about the payment for sex. He argues for a discount on the grounds that she is not a virgin. At a loss, the girl agrees.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7Ij7ILsQ47dHzueM1RohKR8gQTP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:493390'),
  ('967618040919786473', 'Barış Akarsu: Merhaba', 2022, 'Drama, Music', 'Mert Dikmen', 'Mert Dikmen, Can Anar', 'İsmail Ege Şaşmaz, Almila Ada, Hüseyin Avni Danyal, Ebru Nil Aydın, Şafak Pekdemir, Metin Coşkun, Aslıhan Kapanşahin, Burak Satıbol', null, 'A life story of Barış Akarsu, who was a Turkish rock musician and actor.', 'A life story of Barış Akarsu, who was a Turkish rock musician and actor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3gYc7mLMN1zjDpXCJgA7UKEgeOJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:982768'),
  ('296976181387073056', 'Barjo', 1992, 'Drama', 'Jérôme Boivin, Jean-Claude Larrieu', 'Jacques Audiard', 'Richard Bohringer, Anne Brochet, Hippolyte Girardot, Consuelo De Haviland, Roy Lekus, Renaud Danner, Nathalie Boutefeu, Jac Berrocal', null, 'The narrator, "Barjo" (nutcase, crap artist), is an obsessive simpleton, given to filling his notebook with verbatim dialog, observed trivia, and oddball speculation on human behavior and the end of the world. When his house burns, he moves in with his twin sister, Fanfan -- an impulsive, quixotic egoist -- and her husband, Charles, the Aluminum King. Charles becomes the focus of the film, as his wife and brother-in-law bewilder him.', 'The narrator, "Barjo" (nutcase, crap artist), is an obsessive simpleton, given to filling his notebook with verbatim dialog, observed trivia, and oddball speculation on human behavior and the end of the world. When his house burns, he moves in with his twin sister, Fanfan -- an impulsive, quixotic egoist -- and her husband, Charles, the Aluminum King. Charles becomes the focus of the film, as his wife and brother-in-law bewilder him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r2zJ6FqrFuXAtbbpKKGJubPIIfr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59729'),
  ('726832455816178641', 'Bark', 2024, 'Thriller', 'Marc Schölermann, Tina Fratnik, peter meyer', 'Steve Fauquier', 'Michael Weston, A.J. Buckley, Ricky Watson, Lennon Sickels, Joana Vinogradoff, Crazy Horrse', null, 'Charismatic Nolan Bentley wakes up in the middle of a remote forest, tied to a tree with no recollection of how he got there. With his time relentlessly running out, a mysterious stranger appears and he must finally reckon with the demons of his past and fight to survive to find a way out of his nightmare.', 'Charismatic Nolan Bentley wakes up in the middle of a remote forest, tied to a tree with no recollection of how he got there. With his time relentlessly running out, a mysterious stranger appears and he must finally reckon with the demons of his past and fight to survive to find a way out of his nightmare.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oOfPCEijTMEAwrGkK6Y8IkpKm7r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1146892'),
  ('296232642358837709', 'Barking at the Stars', 1998, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Zdravko Šotra', 'Milovan Vitezović, Zdravko Šotra', 'Dragan Mićanović, Nataša Tapušković, Velimir Živojinović, Nikola Simić, Dragan Jovanović, Vesna Trivalić, Bogdan Diklić, Aleksandar Berček', null, 'Comedy about teachers and students at a high school in a small provincial town. Mihailo tries to win the heart of a girl his brother is also chasing.', 'Comedy about teachers and students at a high school in a small provincial town. Mihailo tries to win the heart of a girl his brother is also chasing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vbVH6qUzk0LbPVA37dqhASIvUPJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55138'),
  ('1028871867517461341', 'Barking Dogs Never Bite', 2000, 'Comedy, Crime, Drama', 'Bong Joon Ho, Cho Yong-kyu, Song Ji-ho', 'Bong Joon Ho, Song Ji-ho, Son Tae-woong', 'Lee Sung-jae, Bae Doona, Kim Ho-jung, Byun Hee-bong, Koh Soo-hee, Kim Roi-ha, Kim Jin-goo, Im Sang-soo', 'NR', 'An idle part-time college lecturer is annoyed by the yapping sound of a nearby dog. He decides to take drastic action.', 'An idle part-time college lecturer is annoyed by the yapping sound of a nearby dog. He decides to take drastic action.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6jTxgTN3rS2p1DH36IsBsVpdF5e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21531'),
  ('315947842084320445', 'Barn of the Naked Dead', 1974, 'Horror', 'Alan Rudolph, E. Lynn, Edward D. Markley', 'Roman Valenti', 'Andrew Prine, Manuela Thiess, Sherry Alberoni, Gyl Roland, Sheila Bromley, Gil Lamb, Al Cormier, Jennifer Ashley', 'R', 'Three showgirls on their way to Las Vegas have stuck all night when their car breaks down. The next morning ,a man offers them help, but, he''s really a maniac.', 'Three showgirls on their way to Las Vegas have stuck all night when their car breaks down. The next morning ,a man offers them help, but, he''s really a maniac.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5csCQOLwpkaxNg5TSztonu8ma4j.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28146'),
  ('267098789220440103', 'Barnacle Bill', 1930, 'Music, Animation, Comedy', 'Dave Fleischer', null, 'Ann Little, Billy Murray', null, 'Sailor Bimbo (as Barnacle Bill) jumps ship with his little black book and visits his lady friend, Betty Boop (with dog''s ears).', 'Sailor Bimbo (as Barnacle Bill) jumps ship with his little black book and visits his lady friend, Betty Boop (with dog''s ears).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mDTS2UMkA169N0XGmZI87kvqPS8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:166619'),
  ('363882782660303894', 'Barnacle Bill', 1957, 'Comedy', 'Charles Frend, Douglas Slocombe, Tom Pevsner', 'T. E. B. Clarke', 'Alec Guinness, Harry Locke, Frederick Piper, Fred Griffiths, Gerald Case, William Mervyn, John Horsley, Derek Waring', null, 'A seasick sea captain commands an amusement pier despite local opposition. Released in the U.S. as ''All at Sea''', 'A seasick sea captain commands an amusement pier despite local opposition. Released in the U.S. as ''All at Sea''', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pvtr61ZLnXBgsQBE3NDEXvKvSNC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44134'),
  ('300185919975968859', 'Barndommens gade', 1986, 'Drama', 'Astrid Henning-Jensen', 'Erik Thygesen, Tove Ditlevsen, Astrid Henning-Jensen', 'Sofie Gråbøl, Louise Fribo, Carl Quist Møller, Vigga Bro, Torben Jensen, Kirsten Lehfeldt, Lene Vasegaard, Benny Poulsen', null, 'In a small two-room apartment in a backyard in Vesterbro, Copenhagen, 14-year-old Ester lives with her father, mother, and older brother Carl. It is a typical working-class neighborhood of the time, and the apartment lacks any modern conveniences. Coal must be fetched from a dark basement where homeless people have sought shelter and lodging for the night. Ester is a dreamer. She wants to be a writer and secretly writes poetry. She often loses track of time and place when her thoughts wander.', 'In a small two-room apartment in a backyard in Vesterbro, Copenhagen, 14-year-old Ester lives with her father, mother, and older brother Carl. It is a typical working-class neighborhood of the time, and the apartment lacks any modern conveniences. Coal must be fetched from a dark basement where homeless people have sought shelter and lodging for the night. Ester is a dreamer. She wants to be a writer and secretly writes poetry. She often loses track of time and place when her thoughts wander.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z5i0wqnpLW7X5vanHY3MieZQEyq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52547'),
  ('1151472151203708682', 'Barney''s Great Adventure', 1998, 'Family, Fantasy, Adventure', 'Steve Gomer, Sandi Sissel', 'Stephen White', 'Kyla Pratt, Trevor Morgan, George Hearn, Shirley Douglas, Alan Fawcett, Jane Wheeler, David Joyner, Bob West', 'G', 'Mom and dad dump son Cody, daughter Abby, her best friend Marcella and a baby on the farm with Grandpa and Grandma. Purple dinosaur Barney soon appears to entertain the kids, and when a large colorful egg deposited on a farm by a shooting star is accidentally carted off, Barney and the kids start their chase for it.', 'Mom and dad dump son Cody, daughter Abby, her best friend Marcella and a baby on the farm with Grandpa and Grandma. Purple dinosaur Barney soon appears to entertain the kids, and when a large colorful egg deposited on a farm by a shooting star is accidentally carted off, Barney and the kids start their chase for it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tSadXiI88soRyS4mcSr7PsKWaqN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17644'),
  ('798592566254011183', 'Barney''s Version', 2010, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Richard J. Lewis, Guy Dufaux', 'Michael Konyves', 'Paul Giamatti, Dustin Hoffman, Rosamund Pike, Minnie Driver, Scott Speedman, Rachelle Lefevre, Bruce Greenwood, Mark Addy', 'R', 'The picaresque and touching story of the politically incorrect, fully lived life of the impulsive, irascible and fearlessly blunt Barney Panofsky.', 'The picaresque and touching story of the politically incorrect, fully lived life of the impulsive, irascible and fearlessly blunt Barney Panofsky.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vdsSaFbBWl8N6RV2XJuPBFyKeV8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46829'),
  ('87915142557944083', 'Barnie''s Minor Annoyances', 2001, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Bruno Chiche, Régis Blondeau', 'Bruno Chiche, Fabrice Roger-Lacan, Alain Layrac', 'Fabrice Luchini, Nathalie Baye, Marie Gillain, Hugo Speer, Serge Hazanavicius, Mélanie Bernier, Warren Zavatta, Thomas Chabrol', null, 'Barnie lives in Calais but works in London. Everyday, he takes the Eurostar to go to his office. Although he is married to Lucie, Barnie has two lovers in London: Margot, a young and fresh advertising executive, and Mark, a hot 35 years old auctioneer. Everything could work out fine like that, until Margot, Mark and Lucie separately offer Barnie the same birthday present: a return ticket to Venice on the Orient-Express, and on the same dates. What will Barnie do? Who will he choose to go with? After thinking that going with Lucie could actually save his marriage, problems are not over: Margot and Mark both show up at Barnie and Lucie''s house, pretending to be a couple, and asking Barnie for some explanations. Which he obviously can''t give...', 'Barnie lives in Calais but works in London. Everyday, he takes the Eurostar to go to his office. Although he is married to Lucie, Barnie has two lovers in London: Margot, a young and fresh advertising executive, and Mark, a hot 35 years old auctioneer. Everything could work out fine like that, until Margot, Mark and Lucie separately offer Barnie the same birthday present: a return ticket to Venice on the Orient-Express, and on the same dates. What will Barnie do? Who will he choose to go with? After thinking that going with Lucie could actually save his marriage, problems are not over: Margot and Mark both show up at Barnie and Lucie''s house, pretending to be a couple, and asking Barnie for some explanations. Which he obviously can''t give...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AirxwUaEklmhVMnTtId6U0583Am.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56625'),
  ('939419291504509296', 'Barnum''s Trunk', 1904, 'Comedy, Fantasy', 'Gaston Velle', null, 'Gaston Velle', null, 'A magician and some assistants put up a series of posters of music hall acts in a frame. Then the magician brings each poster to life.', 'A magician and some assistants put up a series of posters of music hall acts in a frame. Then the magician brings each poster to life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gAhPKOOu1Mqgs04PECbpmpZY102.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:232148'),
  ('732978217134576579', 'Barnyard', 2006, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Dominique Monfery, Steve Oedekerk', 'Steve Oedekerk', 'Kevin James, Courteney Cox, Sam Elliott, Danny Glover, Wanda Sykes, Andie MacDowell, David Koechner, Jeffrey Garcia', 'PG', 'Otis is a mischievous, carefree Holstein cow who lives on a farm where, unbeknownst to humans, the animals are anthropomorphic. He prefers having fun with his best friends: Pip the mouse, Freddy the ferret, Peck the rooster, and Pig the pig - rather than following strict rules and accepting responsibility. This annoys his stern adoptive father Ben, the leader of the farm''s community. One evening, Otis convinces Ben to cover his night watch so he can attend a massive party in the barn and impress Daisy, a pregnant cow who recently arrived at the farm with her best friend Bessy as a newcomer. As the animals party, Dag the coyote and his pack attempt to raid the chicken coop. Ben fends them off alone but is fatally wounded and killed. Otis must now learn the value of responsibility when he becomes the leader of his farm home''s community.', 'Otis is a mischievous, carefree Holstein cow who lives on a farm where, unbeknownst to humans, the animals are anthropomorphic. He prefers having fun with his best friends: Pip the mouse, Freddy the ferret, Peck the rooster, and Pig the pig - rather than following strict rules and accepting responsibility. This annoys his stern adoptive father Ben, the leader of the farm''s community. One evening, Otis convinces Ben to cover his night watch so he can attend a massive party in the barn and impress Daisy, a pregnant cow who recently arrived at the farm with her best friend Bessy as a newcomer. As the animals party, Dag the coyote and his pack attempt to raid the chicken coop. Ben fends them off alone but is fatally wounded and killed. Otis must now learn the value of responsibility when he becomes the leader of his farm home''s community.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qB9jFInwUEb2VLhMeKQX17Vdrnp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9907'),
  ('417877350852846033', 'Barnyard Olympics', 1932, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Wilfred Jackson', null, 'Walt Disney, Marcellite Garner, Pinto Colvig', null, 'Mickey and his friends are staging a sort of olympics in a makeshift stadium on his farm. The main event is a sort of quadrathlon, with running, pole vaulting, rowing, and cycling. Mickey gets a late start due to some foul play by Pete, and that''s not the only foul play.', 'Mickey and his friends are staging a sort of olympics in a makeshift stadium on his farm. The main event is a sort of quadrathlon, with running, pole vaulting, rowing, and cycling. Mickey gets a late start due to some foul play by Pete, and that''s not the only foul play.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3ofPMFadGYIPRnIZVw6VnWXceMW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:156468'),
  ('723993622315581915', 'Barocco', 1976, 'Thriller, Crime', 'André Téchiné, Bruno Nuytten', 'Marilyn Goldin, André Téchiné', 'Isabelle Adjani, Gérard Depardieu, Marie-France Pisier, Jean-Claude Brialy, Julien Guiomar, Hélène Surgère, Claude Brasseur, Jean-François Stévenin', null, 'A woman falls in love with the man who killed her former boyfriend.', 'A woman falls in love with the man who killed her former boyfriend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b5QyjskM3B7qVNehwDUYw1Xj8Wo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64983'),
  ('207152098891843416', 'Baron Blood', 1972, 'Horror', 'Mario Bava, Mario Bava', 'Vincent Fotre, Willibald Eser, Mario Bava', 'Joseph Cotten, Elke Sommer, Massimo Girotti, Antonio Cantafora, Umberto Raho, Luciano Pigozzi, Nicoletta Elmi, Dieter Tressler', 'PG', 'A young man, Peter, returns to Austria in search of his heritage. There he visits the castle of an ancestor, a sadistic Baron who was cursed to a violent death by a witch whom the Baron had burned at the stake. Peter reads aloud the incantation that causes Baron Blood to return and continue his murderous tortures.', 'A young man, Peter, returns to Austria in search of his heritage. There he visits the castle of an ancestor, a sadistic Baron who was cursed to a violent death by a witch whom the Baron had burned at the stake. Peter reads aloud the incantation that causes Baron Blood to return and continue his murderous tortures.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/62uQ7UABPvTbPnSBwz3tOgCHdNm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5485'),
  ('209380496026736060', 'Baron Münchhausen', 2012, 'Adventure, Family, Comedy', 'Andreas Linke, Stefan Unterberger', 'Marc O. Seng', 'Jan Josef Liefers, Jessica Schwarz, Katja Riemann, Helen Ottmann, Isabelle Ottmann, Tayfun Bademsoy, Gennadi Vengerov, Tilo Prückner', null, 'In a small inn, the impoverished Baron von Münchhausen tries to keep his head above water with the help of his stories.', 'In a small inn, the impoverished Baron von Münchhausen tries to keep his head above water with the help of his stories.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kLErYdVLrdYKkkryg3K3AUGtKvI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:153443'),
  ('858398195435549625', 'Baronesa', 2018, 'Documentary, Drama', 'Fernanda de Sena, Giselle Ferreira, Juliana Antunes', 'Juliana Antunes', 'Andreia Pereira de Sousa, Leid Ferreira, Felipe Rangel Soares', null, 'The everyday life of a Belo Horizonte lower class neighborhood.', 'The everyday life of a Belo Horizonte lower class neighborhood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hY0wgkNp9gMtqOydPIpS5kVJFkZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:440254'),
  ('775511371330358792', 'Baronessen fra benzintanken', 1960, 'Comedy', 'Annelise Reenberg', 'Peer Guldbrandsen, John Olsen, Annelise Reenberg', 'Ghita Nørby, Dirch Passer, Ove Sprogøe, Maria Garland, Karin Nellemose, Karl Stegger, Ulla Lock, Emil Hass Christensen', null, 'The film begins with Baron von Rosensteen''s funeral. As Rosensteen has no heirs, the old Rosensteen Castle is to be inherited by the Rabenfeldt family. Supreme Court Attorney Berg visits the widow baroness about a document found among the papers of her son, the deceased baron. It turns out that the baron had a child out of wedlock with a non-noble woman. The widow baroness and the Supreme Court attorney decide to find the child, as this would mean that an heir to the castle had been found. The child turns out to be a girl named Anne Tofte, who works at a gas station with her uncle Lars Tofte and his colleague Hans Høy. They persuade Anne to live with the baroness for a while, which she is not very keen on. The widow tries to teach Anne to be a fine lady, rather than the tomboyish workshop mechanic her uncle had raised her to be.', 'The film begins with Baron von Rosensteen''s funeral. As Rosensteen has no heirs, the old Rosensteen Castle is to be inherited by the Rabenfeldt family. Supreme Court Attorney Berg visits the widow baroness about a document found among the papers of her son, the deceased baron. It turns out that the baron had a child out of wedlock with a non-noble woman. The widow baroness and the Supreme Court attorney decide to find the child, as this would mean that an heir to the castle had been found. The child turns out to be a girl named Anne Tofte, who works at a gas station with her uncle Lars Tofte and his colleague Hans Høy. They persuade Anne to live with the baroness for a while, which she is not very keen on. The widow tries to teach Anne to be a fine lady, rather than the tomboyish workshop mechanic her uncle had raised her to be.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u643Zj2FxVD6LjiUC7lsUplocIo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46255'),
  ('653181091886391479', 'Barot House', 2019, 'Thriller, Mystery', 'Bugs Bhargava Krishna', 'Sanjeev k Jha', 'Amit Sadh, Manjari Fadnnis, Aaryan Menghji, Aseem Hattangadi, Farida Patel Venkat, Kiearra Soni', null, 'A series of inexplicable and gruesome killings tear the Barot family apart and destroy the close relationship between father and son. Who could be behind this mindless slaughter? When the truth is discovered, it throws the family into further turmoil. But is the truth really the truth or games of a troubled mind?', 'A series of inexplicable and gruesome killings tear the Barot family apart and destroy the close relationship between father and son. Who could be behind this mindless slaughter? When the truth is discovered, it throws the family into further turmoil. But is the truth really the truth or games of a troubled mind?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/abzKYvfeFYCLJvwc4ZUpdU3YQ7Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:621385'),
  ('87395454412291840', 'Barquero', 1970, 'Western', 'Gordon Douglas, Rusty Meek, Gerald Perry Finnerman', 'William Marks, George Schenck', 'Lee Van Cleef, Warren Oates, Forrest Tucker, Kerwin Mathews, Mariette Hartley, Marie Gomez, Armando Silvestre, John Davis Chandler', 'R', 'Jake Remy leads a gang of outlaw cutthroats making their escape toward Mexico from a successful robbery. Barring their way is a river--crossable only by means of a ferry barge. The barge operator, Travis, refuses to be bullied into providing transport for the gang and escapes across river with most of the local populace--leaving Remy and his gang behind, desperately seeking a way across. A river-wide stand-off begins between the gang and the townspeople, both groups of which have left people on the wrong side of the river.', 'Jake Remy leads a gang of outlaw cutthroats making their escape toward Mexico from a successful robbery. Barring their way is a river--crossable only by means of a ferry barge. The barge operator, Travis, refuses to be bullied into providing transport for the gang and escapes across river with most of the local populace--leaving Remy and his gang behind, desperately seeking a way across. A river-wide stand-off begins between the gang and the townspeople, both groups of which have left people on the wrong side of the river.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qq9fkHnSbzzEVWOcnflwzcKpTRF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32142'),
  ('304661155845122345', 'Barracuda', 1978, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Harry Kerwin, Edmund Gibson, Wayne Crawford', 'Wayne Crawford, Harry Kerwin', 'Wayne Crawford, Jason Evers, Roberta Leighton, Cliff Emmich, William Kerwin, Bert Freed, Barbara Keegan, Jerry Albert', 'PG', 'Little coastal town is being terrorized by deadly Barracudas.', 'Little coastal town is being terrorized by deadly Barracudas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/razrwhyLx7Nx1CWRCUayyeQQ2sI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29957'),
  ('573881231657279443', 'Barracuda', 1997, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Philippe Haïm, Jean-Claude Thibaut', 'Nicolas Lartigue, Patrick Olivier Meyer, Philippe Haïm', 'Guillaume Canet, Jean Rochefort, Claire Keim, Michel Scourneau, Rose Thiéry, Cécile Cotte, Philippe Lefebvre, Karine Nuris', null, 'Fred Astaire-fan Clément invites comic-book artist Luc to Sunday dinner with Clément and his wife Violette. Luc''s girlfriend Margot announces her pregnancy, prompting Luc to forget about the invitation, but Clément insists that Luc join him. After Luc arrives and sees that Violette is only a life-size plastic doll, he decides to leave but gets clobbered on the head. Awakening, he finds he''s been handcuffed to the bathroom sink and gagged. Cruelties ensue, with crazed Clément getting visionary advice from both Astaire and Violette.', 'Fred Astaire-fan Clément invites comic-book artist Luc to Sunday dinner with Clément and his wife Violette. Luc''s girlfriend Margot announces her pregnancy, prompting Luc to forget about the invitation, but Clément insists that Luc join him. After Luc arrives and sees that Violette is only a life-size plastic doll, he decides to leave but gets clobbered on the head. Awakening, he finds he''s been handcuffed to the bathroom sink and gagged. Cruelties ensue, with crazed Clément getting visionary advice from both Astaire and Violette.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1ccJ9drEt1JkZqNfp0rV6e17oEj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59976'),
  ('555114599645508588', 'Barrage', 2017, 'Drama', 'Laura Schroeder, Hélène Louvart', 'Laura Schroeder, Marie Nimier', 'Lolita Chammah, Themis Pauwels, Isabelle Huppert, Elsa Houben, Luc Schiltz, Marja-Leena Junker, Charles Müller', null, 'After ten years abroad, Catherine returns to Luxembourg, to catch up with her daughter Alba, brought up by Catherine’s mother Elisabeth. Alba is cold and distant with this stranger showing up unexpectedly in her life, so is Elisabeth, keen to keep her protégée to herself. One day, Catherine cannot take it anymore. She kidnaps Alba and takes her on a trip to a lake up North. Begins an unsettling journey into the puzzling world of motherly love, only to find out that sometimes the true opponent is yourself.', 'After ten years abroad, Catherine returns to Luxembourg, to catch up with her daughter Alba, brought up by Catherine’s mother Elisabeth. Alba is cold and distant with this stranger showing up unexpectedly in her life, so is Elisabeth, keen to keep her protégée to herself. One day, Catherine cannot take it anymore. She kidnaps Alba and takes her on a trip to a lake up North. Begins an unsettling journey into the puzzling world of motherly love, only to find out that sometimes the true opponent is yourself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jFMrk5cx6NN2g7GP9r040kFK1o5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:427257'),
  ('320640851267169705', 'Barren Illusion', 1999, 'Science Fiction, Drama, Romance', 'Kiyoshi Kurosawa, Takeshi Furusawa, Takahide Shibanushi', 'Kiyoshi Kurosawa', 'Shinji Takeda, Miako Tadano, Hosaku Yasui, Masamichi Matsumoto, Kazushige Inami, Akiko Ohku, Shinji Aoyama, Naoki Yamamoto', null, 'In a near future where allergies have become an epidemic, music producer Haru half-heartedly dates post office clerk and mail thief Michi. He searches for violent ways to reactivate his life, she dreams of escaping abroad; both volunteer to test a new drug which may provide a cure.', 'In a near future where allergies have become an epidemic, music producer Haru half-heartedly dates post office clerk and mail thief Michi. He searches for violent ways to reactivate his life, she dreams of escaping abroad; both volunteer to test a new drug which may provide a cure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pXpx7OnIofdAGYxBZR3EKk68shb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:103953'),
  ('835859001980520190', 'Barren Land', 2025, 'Thriller, Crime', 'Albert Pintó, David Acereto, Lucas Casaban', 'Fernando Navarro', 'Luis Zahera, Karra Elejalde, Jesús Carroza, Vicente Romero Sánchez, Emilio Palacios, Jero Medina, Paula Díaz, Antonio Gil', null, 'Barren Land is the story of three friends. All three trapped between the abandonment of the institutions, the violent and unstoppable rise of the narco in the province and the dangerous increase of social discontent. Three friends trapped in a powder keg that will test their friendship.', 'Barren Land is the story of three friends. All three trapped between the abandonment of the institutions, the violent and unstoppable rise of the narco in the province and the dangerous increase of social discontent. Three friends trapped in a powder keg that will test their friendship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7GO6vjOFA4Uft5USA1j2NnJ5Zcl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1305273'),
