  ('1122982015981752958', 'Basara: The Princess Goh', 1992, 'History, Drama', 'Hiroshi Teshigahara, Gengon Nakaoka, Fujio Morita', 'Genpei Akasegawa, Hiroshi Teshigahara', 'Rie Miyazawa, Tatsuya Nakadai, Toshiya Nagasawa, Matsumoto Hakuō II, Rentaro Mikuni, Kyōko Enami, Hisashi Igawa, Kei Suma', null, 'Furuta Oribe is ordered to become tea master under Toyotomi Hideyoshi after his teacher Sen no Rikyū, the former tea master, was ordered to commit suicide. Princess Goh, daughter of the lord but adopted by Hideyoshi, is outraged when Rikyū''s severed head is thrown in the Nijo River. She sends Usu, Oribe''s servant, to retrieve the head and deliver it to Rikyū''s adopted daughter.', 'Furuta Oribe is ordered to become tea master under Toyotomi Hideyoshi after his teacher Sen no Rikyū, the former tea master, was ordered to commit suicide. Princess Goh, daughter of the lord but adopted by Hideyoshi, is outraged when Rikyū''s severed head is thrown in the Nijo River. She sends Usu, Oribe''s servant, to retrieve the head and deliver it to Rikyū''s adopted daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e2NLO5V9GznZrcC9OebACWJtxUO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:244956'),
  ('792479248887433883', 'Baseball Bugs', 1946, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Friz Freleng', null, 'Mel Blanc, Bea Benaderet, Frank Graham, Tedd Pierce', 'NR', 'Bugs Bunny single handedly takes on the “Gas-House Gorillas,” a baseball team of hulking, cigar-chomping bullies.', 'Bugs Bunny single handedly takes on the “Gas-House Gorillas,” a baseball team of hulking, cigar-chomping bullies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6jc1LFe4tfqkdcldqymbjIDh7yg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34929'),
  ('9939856373126011', 'Baseball Girl', 2020, 'Drama', 'Oh Sung-taek, Choi Yun-tae, Hwang Seung-yun', 'Choi Yun-tae', 'Lee Joo-young, Lee Jun-hyuk, Yeom Hye-ran, Song Young-gyu, Kwak Dong-yeon, Joo Hae-eun, You Chea-myung, Jang Jun-whee', null, 'A girl baseball player who is about to graduate from high school will try to enter the professional baseball world forbidden to women.', 'A girl baseball player who is about to graduate from high school will try to enter the professional baseball world forbidden to women.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yu1T175AaYTwVYTzdGoG7KsK5f1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:636291'),
  ('158270066822809381', 'Based on a True Story', 2017, 'Thriller, Mystery', 'Roman Polanski, Paweł Edelman, Lucien Balibar', 'Olivier Assayas, Roman Polanski', 'Emmanuelle Seigner, Eva Green, Vincent Perez, Dominique Pinon, Brigitte Roüan, Camille Chamoux, Josée Dayan, Noémie Lvovsky', null, 'Delphine is the author of an autobiographical novel that has become a bestseller. Exhausted by the promotional tour, just when she feels out of place, paralyzed by the idea of having to start writing again, she meets Elle, a young, attractive, intelligent, intuitive woman who seems to understand her better than anyone.', 'Delphine is the author of an autobiographical novel that has become a bestseller. Exhausted by the promotional tour, just when she feels out of place, paralyzed by the idea of having to start writing again, she meets Elle, a young, attractive, intelligent, intuitive woman who seems to understand her better than anyone.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w9OGJ6bE5vNYyIjIPz9QUqBO1ya.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:416051'),
  ('777441135039680809', 'BASEketball', 1998, 'Comedy', 'David Zucker, Steve Mason, Jeffrey Reiner', 'David Zucker, Robert LoCash, Lewis Friedman', 'Trey Parker, Matt Stone, Dian Bachar, Yasmine Bleeth, Jenny McCarthy, Ernest Borgnine, Robert Vaughn, Trevor Einhorn', 'R', 'Two losers from Milwaukee, Coop and Remer, invent a new game combining basketball with the rules of baseball. When the game becomes a huge success, they, along with a billionaire''s help, form the Professional Baseketball League where everyone gets the same pay and no team can change cities. When a rival owner wants to institute major rule changes, Coop and Remer''s team is the only one standing in the way.', 'Two losers from Milwaukee, Coop and Remer, invent a new game combining basketball with the rules of baseball. When the game becomes a huge success, they, along with a billionaire''s help, form the Professional Baseketball League where everyone gets the same pay and no team can change cities. When a rival owner wants to institute major rule changes, Coop and Remer''s team is the only one standing in the way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oKZdAUV9XSLp091f0GmtQEu0UZy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14013'),
  ('802562007646698455', 'Basette', 2008, 'Comedy, Crime, Drama', 'Maurizio Calvesi, Gabriele Mainetti, Matteo Albano', 'Nicola Guaglianone', 'Valerio Mastandrea, Marco Giallini, Daniele Liotti, Flavio Insinna, Luisa Ranieri, Lidia Vitale, Santa De Santis, Alessandro Tavanti', null, 'Antonio''s first day as a thief is marked by tears. During an incursion at the mall, his mother is arrested. Some 20 years later, Antonio along with his two inseparable friends, after some minor robberies, take on a post office. Things don''t go as planned.', 'Antonio''s first day as a thief is marked by tears. During an incursion at the mall, his mother is arrested. Some 20 years later, Antonio along with his two inseparable friends, after some minor robberies, take on a post office. Things don''t go as planned.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aSjzVyOqfgxx1c37IgOAh8UhFuZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:258123'),
  ('926202313006577702', 'Bashing', 2006, 'Drama', 'Masahiro Kobayashi, Kōichi Saitō', 'Masahiro Kobayashi', 'Fusako Urabe, Ryuzo Tanaka, Nene Otsuka, Kikujiro Honda, Teruyuki Kagawa, Takayuki Katô', null, 'Yuko is a Japanese girl who was taken hostage in Iraq while volunteering there as an aid worker. Finally released and back in her hometown, Yuko finds herself ostracized as a national disgrace by society that sees her helping a country other than Japan, and the embarrassment of getting captured but not killed, as things of which to be brutally ashamed.', 'Yuko is a Japanese girl who was taken hostage in Iraq while volunteering there as an aid worker. Finally released and back in her hometown, Yuko finds herself ostracized as a national disgrace by society that sees her helping a country other than Japan, and the embarrassment of getting captured but not killed, as things of which to be brutally ashamed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/46L4jESVZPPmvhNOj4DqQ11U0Jt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39798'),
  ('381487283861520589', 'Bashu, the Little Stranger', 1991, 'Drama, War', 'Bahram Beyzai, Firooz Malekzadeh', 'Bahram Beyzai', 'Susan Taslimi, Parviz Pourhosseini, Adnan Afravian, Bashu, Akbar Doudkar, Farrokhlagha Houshmand', null, 'During the Iran-Iraq War, Bashu, a young boy loses his house and all his family. Scared, he sneaks into a truck that is leaving the area. He gets off the truck in the Northern part of the country, where everything from landscape to language is different. He meets Naii, who is trying to raise her two young children on a farm, while her husband is away. Despite cultural differences, and the fact that they do not speak the same language, Bashu and Naii slowly form a strong bond.', 'During the Iran-Iraq War, Bashu, a young boy loses his house and all his family. Scared, he sneaks into a truck that is leaving the area. He gets off the truck in the Northern part of the country, where everything from landscape to language is different. He meets Naii, who is trying to raise her two young children on a farm, while her husband is away. Despite cultural differences, and the fact that they do not speak the same language, Bashu and Naii slowly form a strong bond.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rRUWwpVRtc7vyXUV1Bj64wFZJaV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43980'),
  ('255369097600847383', 'Basic', 2003, 'Action, Drama, Mystery, Thriller, Crime', 'Steve Mason, John McTiernan, Mischa Hausserman', 'James Vanderbilt', 'John Travolta, Connie Nielsen, Samuel L. Jackson, Tim Daly, Giovanni Ribisi, Brian Van Holt, Taye Diggs, Dash Mihok', 'R', 'When a hurricane hits a US Army base on the edge of the Panama Canal, an elite covert operations team of US Army Rangers recruits are on a routine jungle training exercise that goes horribly awry. Only two recruits are rescued, one of which is badly injured, but both have different accounts regarding the fate of their leader, legendary and ruthless Army Ranger Drill Sergeant Nathan West, and the rest of their platoon. Tom Hardy, an ex-army Ranger turned maverick DEA agent is brought in to solve the mystery and uncover what really happened out there.', 'When a hurricane hits a US Army base on the edge of the Panama Canal, an elite covert operations team of US Army Rangers recruits are on a routine jungle training exercise that goes horribly awry. Only two recruits are rescued, one of which is badly injured, but both have different accounts regarding the fate of their leader, legendary and ruthless Army Ranger Drill Sergeant Nathan West, and the rest of their platoon. Tom Hardy, an ex-army Ranger turned maverick DEA agent is brought in to solve the mystery and uncover what really happened out there.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jtyF4NF9fQlyGP8cgU1mK3DLUTB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10782'),
  ('620478994581964085', 'Basic Instinct', 1992, 'Thriller, Mystery', 'Paul Verhoeven, Jan de Bont, Louis D''Esposito', 'Joe Eszterhas', 'Michael Douglas, Sharon Stone, George Dzundza, Jeanne Tripplehorn, Denis Arndt, Leilani Sarelle, Bruce A. Young, Chelcie Ross', 'R', 'Catherine, a novelist with an insatiable sexual appetite, becomes a prime suspect when her boyfriend is brutally murdered -- a crime she had described in her latest story.', 'Catherine, a novelist with an insatiable sexual appetite, becomes a prime suspect when her boyfriend is brutally murdered -- a crime she had described in her latest story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/76Ts0yoHk8kVQj9MMnoMixhRWoh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:402'),
  ('353435183235955503', 'Basic Instinct 2', 2006, 'Crime, Mystery, Thriller', 'Michael Caton-Jones, Gyula Pados, Chris Lowe', 'Leora Barish, Henry Bean', 'Sharon Stone, David Morrissey, Charlotte Rampling, David Thewlis, Stan Collymore, Indira Varma, Heathcote Williams, Hugh Dancy', 'R', 'Novelist Catherine Tramell is once again in trouble with the law, and Scotland Yard appoints psychiatrist Dr. Michael Glass to evaluate her. Though, like Detective Nick Curran before him, Glass is entranced by Tramell and lured into a seductive game.', 'Novelist Catherine Tramell is once again in trouble with the law, and Scotland Yard appoints psychiatrist Dr. Michael Glass to evaluate her. Though, like Detective Nick Curran before him, Glass is entranced by Tramell and lured into a seductive game.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yNRSbx6AhOlW673t2073Wr2iH4U.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3093'),
  ('358403353334323776', 'Basic Sanitation, the Movie', 2007, 'Comedy', 'Jorge Furtado, Jacob Solitrenick, Leo Henkin', 'Jorge Furtado', 'Fernanda Torres, Wagner Moura, Camila Pitanga, Bruno Garcia, Janaína Kremer, Lázaro Ramos, Tonico Pereira, Paulo José', null, 'When they discover their town lacks funding for a sewage system, but does have a federal grant to make a movie, a group of villagers decide to make a sci-fi joint about a monster who lives in the building site of a septic tank.', 'When they discover their town lacks funding for a sewage system, but does have a federal grant to make a movie, a group of villagers decide to make a sci-fi joint about a monster who lives in the building site of a septic tank.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oIiIV61Q2x7vE62sE1TyNGxraT2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64397'),
  ('853634130765535647', 'Basic Training', 1971, 'Documentary', 'William Brayne, Frederick Wiseman', 'Frederick Wiseman', null, null, 'Shot during the summer of 1970 at Fort Knox, Kentucky, Frederick Wiseman’s film Basic Training focuses on a group of men going through infantry training, showing how they are turned from civilians into soldiers. As well as being a unique portrait of the US army at work, the film is also a fascinating snapshot of a time and place at a defining moment in American history.', 'Shot during the summer of 1970 at Fort Knox, Kentucky, Frederick Wiseman’s film Basic Training focuses on a group of men going through infantry training, showing how they are turned from civilians into soldiers. As well as being a unique portrait of the US army at work, the film is also a fascinating snapshot of a time and place at a defining moment in American history.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cblsF9wzhtCyaby62dCPb7Li3kD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:114388'),
  ('355164629563848866', 'Basic Training', 1985, 'Comedy', 'Andrew Sugerman, Stephen W. Gray', 'Bernie Kahn', 'Ann Dusenberry, Rhonda Shear, Angela Aames, Will Nye, Walter Gotell, Marty Brill, William A. Forester, Christopher Pennock', 'R', 'Melinda comes to Washington DC to visit her friend Debbie, and to find a job in government, where she hopes to do her part to make it better. She gets a lower echelon administrative position at the Pentagon, and finds things pretty slack. Her boss seems to be more interested in getting into her pants than trying to find lost data on the Russians. Melinda resists his advances and begins working her way up in the Pentagon, finding subtle ways of getting her policies implemented by manipulating the slovenly males that populate the Pentagon, including finding a way to defuse the mounting conflict with the Russians', 'Melinda comes to Washington DC to visit her friend Debbie, and to find a job in government, where she hopes to do her part to make it better. She gets a lower echelon administrative position at the Pentagon, and finds things pretty slack. Her boss seems to be more interested in getting into her pants than trying to find lost data on the Russians. Melinda resists his advances and begins working her way up in the Pentagon, finding subtle ways of getting her policies implemented by manipulating the slovenly males that populate the Pentagon, including finding a way to defuse the mounting conflict with the Russians', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2Se4g1AXUW55nZsAf06T6rrdCpa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:105246'),
  ('498669947214050937', 'Basil', 1998, 'Drama, Romance', 'Radha Bharadwaj, David Johnson', 'Radha Bharadwaj', 'Jared Leto, Christian Slater, Claire Forlani, Rachel Pickup, Derek Jacobi, David Ross, Crispin Bonham-Carter, Jenny Downham', 'R', 'A lonely young aristocrat in turn-of the century England struggles to meet the approval of his over-bearing, class-conscious father while trying to please the selfish woman he loves.', 'A lonely young aristocrat in turn-of the century England struggles to meet the approval of his over-bearing, class-conscious father while trying to please the selfish woman he loves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dwEVoYhQE3MUykPb345UotKZOOY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37613'),
  ('1004172696056899270', 'Basilicata Coast To Coast', 2010, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Rocco Papaleo, Annarita Battista, Livio Bordone', 'Walter Lupo, Rocco Papaleo', 'Alessandro Gassmann, Paolo Briguglia, Max Gazzè, Rocco Papaleo, Giovanna Mezzogiorno, Claudia Potenza, Michela Andreozzi, Augusto Fornari', null, 'A musical comedy, a journey filled with unexpected twists and unexpected encounters, leading a group of musicians to set out to the rhythm of their musical verses to participate in the Scanzano Jonico Song-Theatre Festival, walking across Basilicata, from the Tyrrhenian to the Ionian Sea, along the route that gives the project its name. The journey will have a therapeutic effect.', 'A musical comedy, a journey filled with unexpected twists and unexpected encounters, leading a group of musicians to set out to the rhythm of their musical verses to participate in the Scanzano Jonico Song-Theatre Festival, walking across Basilicata, from the Tyrrhenian to the Ionian Sea, along the route that gives the project its name. The journey will have a therapeutic effect.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1jFrV9DPPS38jgYgyUFJXukMsAt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43200'),
  ('391126751584933299', 'Basilisk: The Serpent King', 2006, 'Action, Horror, TV Movie, Fantasy', 'Stephen Furst, Mariana Vodenicharova, Asya Chakarova', 'Wil McCarthy, Chase Parker', 'Jeremy London, Wendy Carter, Cleavant Derricks, Griff Furst, Sarah Skeeters, Stephen Furst, Yancy Butler, Doug Dearth', 'NR', 'Two millennia ago, a Lybian king has a basilisk (snake-shaped dragon), which petrifies people, subjected to the same fate with a golden scepter during a solar eclipse. Both these and several victims are dug up by modern archaeologist Harrison ''Harry'' McColl''s expedition. Despite a cryptic warning from tribal locals, everything goes to his Colorado university''s museum. It''s all exhibited during another eclipse, which leads to the monster reviving. Harry and some of his friends must try to petrify the monster again.', 'Two millennia ago, a Lybian king has a basilisk (snake-shaped dragon), which petrifies people, subjected to the same fate with a golden scepter during a solar eclipse. Both these and several victims are dug up by modern archaeologist Harrison ''Harry'' McColl''s expedition. Despite a cryptic warning from tribal locals, everything goes to his Colorado university''s museum. It''s all exhibited during another eclipse, which leads to the monster reviving. Harry and some of his friends must try to petrify the monster again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i5WRZ8HPDwRvvJySTbd6OoqEJri.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53850'),
  ('1144112804657537142', 'Baska', 2026, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Patryk Wereszczyński, Marcin Ziębiński', 'Małgorzata Kalicińska, Malgorzata Kalicinska', 'Małgorzata Socha, Piotr Głowacki, Mikołaj Roznerski, Dorota Kolak, Franciszek Krawczyński', null, 'Baska (Malgorzata Socha) runs a catering company from home. In addition, she takes care of three children and takes care of her husband, Kacper (Piotr Glowacki), who constantly works overtime in the office. Somewhere she lost her spark and zest for life. When she meets the handsome and famous choreographer Jim (Mikolaj Roznerski) at work, her life turns upside down. Jim helps Baska gain new clients and her business flourishes. Baska is also blooming. However, her home life suffers. In addition, Kacper begins to suspect Baska of having an affair and demands a divorce. Baska must decide whether she wants to start her life anew or return to what she has built over the years.', 'Baska (Malgorzata Socha) runs a catering company from home. In addition, she takes care of three children and takes care of her husband, Kacper (Piotr Glowacki), who constantly works overtime in the office. Somewhere she lost her spark and zest for life. When she meets the handsome and famous choreographer Jim (Mikolaj Roznerski) at work, her life turns upside down. Jim helps Baska gain new clients and her business flourishes. Baska is also blooming. However, her home life suffers. In addition, Kacper begins to suspect Baska of having an affair and demands a divorce. Baska must decide whether she wants to start her life anew or return to what she has built over the years.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F4c6iy1ofXoh63xMBHlDyPc60uBg.jpg', 'plex:movie:baska-2026-2'),
  ('747626882036243726', 'Basket Case', 1982, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Frank Henenlotter, Bruce Torbet, Jerome Horwitz', 'Frank Henenlotter', 'Kevin Van Hentenryck, Terri Susan Smith, Beverly Bonner, Robert Vogel, Diana Browne, Lloyd Pace, Bill Freeman, Ruth Neuman', 'R', 'A young man carrying a big basket that contains his extremely deformed, formerly conjoined twin brother seeks vengeance on the doctors who separated them against their will.', 'A young man carrying a big basket that contains his extremely deformed, formerly conjoined twin brother seeks vengeance on the doctors who separated them against their will.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ciyzEBzJ1TnafkgGXr6DqEVh1wk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27813'),
  ('300526464091867375', 'Basket Case 2', 1990, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Frank Henenlotter, Robert M. Baldwin', 'Frank Henenlotter', 'Kevin Van Hentenryck, Annie Ross, Heather Rattray, Kathryn Meisle, Jason Evers, Ted Sorel, Matt Mitler, David Emge', 'R', 'Duane and his basket-bound mutant brother are taken in by a secret home for wayward freaks.', 'Duane and his basket-bound mutant brother are taken in by a secret home for wayward freaks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sqw2XSwhsfMcoVRnnXcbOeh9IrH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27815'),
  ('366923095874779587', 'Basket Case 3: The Progeny', 1992, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Frank Henenlotter, Matt Maiellaro, Christopher Mills', 'Robert Martin, Frank Henenlotter', 'Kevin Van Hentenryck, Annie Ross, Gil Roper, Dan Biggers, Jim O''Doherty, Tina Louise Hilbert, Carla Morrell, Carmen Morrell', 'R', 'Duane recovers from his delusional breakdown to find his freakish basket-bound brother Belial will soon become a father. But not everything is joyous as the once tight knit brothers no longer seem to trust each other.', 'Duane recovers from his delusional breakdown to find his freakish basket-bound brother Belial will soon become a father. But not everything is joyous as the once tight knit brothers no longer seem to trust each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nSh40LxVLIvm4wyATNmS4gq5JMO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27816'),
  ('8789712891227642', 'Basketball and Mathematics', 2009, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Rodolphe Marconi, Sébastien Perroy, Laurent Courand', 'Sébastien Perroy', 'Jean-Denis Marcoccio, Aurélien Baty, Ugo Venel, Emilie Piponnier, Katherine Erhardy, Gilles Barande, Ronan Le Joubioux, Maxime Aibeche', null, 'Jérôme and Cédric play basketball in the same team at school and are best friends. Jérôme also gives Cédric some private math lessons. During one of those sessions, Cédric''s action will be interpreted by both young men in a different way.', 'Jérôme and Cédric play basketball in the same team at school and are best friends. Jérôme also gives Cédric some private math lessons. During one of those sessions, Cédric''s action will be interpreted by both young men in a different way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/39lGRmWfWIXbPrLudeqJGBDhwa9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:186789'),
  ('407566618753621079', 'Baskin', 2015, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Can Evrenol, Alp Korfalı', 'Can Evrenol, Oğulcan Eren Akay, Cem Özüduru', 'Mehmet Cerrahoglu, Görkem Kasal, Ergun Kuyucu, Muharrem Bayrak, Fatih Dokgöz, Sabahattin Yakut, Berat Efe Parlar, Şevket Süha Tezel', 'NR', 'A squad of unsuspecting cops go through a trapdoor to Hell when they stumble upon a Black Mass in an abandoned building.', 'A squad of unsuspecting cops go through a trapdoor to Hell when they stumble upon a Black Mass in an abandoned building.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oNiinNDzPUH0I3K4puCwrJa7Hn1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:334394'),
