  ('195754253148903496', 'Bastaard', 2019, 'Thriller', 'Mathieu Mortelmans, Ann Willems, Els Verhaeghe', 'Mathieu Mortelmans, Jan Pepermans, Stefanie Vanhecke', 'Spencer Bogaert, Tine Reymer, Bjarne Devolder, Koen De Bouw, Lucas Van den Eynde, Dirk Roofthooft, Lukas Bulteel, Els Olaerts', null, 'Two years after the tragic loss of his older brother, 17-year-old Daan unwillingly goes along when his grieving family decides to give shelter to a homeless teenager called Radja. But as Daan witnesses how this stranger''s presence deeply affects his mother, he starts to unravel Radja''s mysterious past.', 'Two years after the tragic loss of his older brother, 17-year-old Daan unwillingly goes along when his grieving family decides to give shelter to a homeless teenager called Radja. But as Daan witnesses how this stranger''s presence deeply affects his mother, he starts to unravel Radja''s mysterious past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3jQsFqoXsIOFOC2uZKt1Gxuwxqc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:522645'),
  ('277793151836542290', 'Bastard', 2011, 'Drama, Thriller, Crime, Mystery', 'Carsten Unger, Lars Petersen', 'M. Reza Bahar, Carsten Unger', 'Martina Gedeck, Markus Krojer, Antonia Lingemann, Finn Kirchner, Sibylle Canonica, Hanns Zischler, Thomas Thieme, Matthias Koeberlin', null, 'The nine-year-old Nikolas has been missing for days. The criminal psychologist Claudia Meinert notices contradictions in her conversation with the parents of the missing child. In particular Nikolas'' mother appears to be hiding something. When a video of the missing Nikolas surfaces, showing him tied up in a cellar, the trail leads to his school. The 13-year-old Leon and Mathilda strike the psychologist as conspicuous and provocative. Shortly afterwards, Meinert encounters the children with Nikolas'' parents at the local swimming pool and her suspicions are confirmed: the parents are entangled in an insidious father-mother-child game with the possible suspects Leon and Mathilda. Now it is up to the psychologist to resolve the dark mystery of Nikolas'' disappearance and save the child.', 'The nine-year-old Nikolas has been missing for days. The criminal psychologist Claudia Meinert notices contradictions in her conversation with the parents of the missing child. In particular Nikolas'' mother appears to be hiding something. When a video of the missing Nikolas surfaces, showing him tied up in a cellar, the trail leads to his school. The 13-year-old Leon and Mathilda strike the psychologist as conspicuous and provocative. Shortly afterwards, Meinert encounters the children with Nikolas'' parents at the local swimming pool and her suspicions are confirmed: the parents are entangled in an insidious father-mother-child game with the possible suspects Leon and Mathilda. Now it is up to the psychologist to resolve the dark mystery of Nikolas'' disappearance and save the child.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gbIDVYCzJ7dvrILigscnNQlwMFs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:235815'),
  ('625022685038698638', 'Bastard', 2015, 'Horror', 'Powell Robinson, Patrick Robert Young, Ryan Hendrickson', 'Patrick Robert Young', 'Rebekah Kennedy, Ellis Greer, Dan Creed, Will Tranfo, Tonya Kay, Burt Culver, Ryan Shoos, Nadine Arlyn', 'R', 'Five strangers - newlywed serial killers, a suicidal, depressed policeman, and two young runaways with a secret - become suspects and potential victims when a masked murderer makes its presence known in an isolated mountain town.', 'Five strangers - newlywed serial killers, a suicidal, depressed policeman, and two young runaways with a secret - become suspects and potential victims when a masked murderer makes its presence known in an isolated mountain town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4EkZKzb1tFgUpYZyUKclqzpX072.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:287692'),
  ('1039967939083096486', 'Bastard Out of Carolina', 1996, 'Drama', 'Anjelica Huston, Anthony B. Richmond', null, 'Jennifer Jason Leigh, Ron Eldard, Glenne Headly, Lyle Lovett, Jena Malone, Dermot Mulroney, Christina Ricci, Michael Rooker', 'R', 'A poor, struggling South Carolinian mother and daughter face painful choices with their resolve and pride. Bone, the eldest daughter, and Anney her tired mother, grow both closer and farther apart: Anney sees Glen as her last chance.', 'A poor, struggling South Carolinian mother and daughter face painful choices with their resolve and pride. Bone, the eldest daughter, and Anney her tired mother, grow both closer and farther apart: Anney sees Glen as her last chance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jYFwFOkHwWxaStR21UIgdb96Gzh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41240'),
  ('264951987322370930', 'Bastard Swordsman', 1983, 'Action', 'Tony Lou Chun-Ku, Philip Ma Kam-Cheung', 'Tony Lou Chun-Ku', 'Norman Tsui Siu-Keung, Tony Liu Tian-jue, Wang Yong, Leanne Liu, Alex Man Chi-Leung, Chen Szu-Chia, Eddie Koo Koon Chung, Lo Meng', null, 'Yun Fei Yang is the viciously bullied orphan who takes on the unpleasant tasks at a formidable kung-fu school. Constantly mocked by the other students of the school, Yen counts as his only friend the daughter of the resident master. Any internal wrangling between the various members is put to one side when a swordsman from a rival clan reminds the master of the duel he must take part in once a decade. Unfortunately the defending clan chief is well aware that his rival is more powerful than himself. The expected defeat is further complicated when a wandering swordsman arrives on the scene and joins himself to the injured party, immediately adding to Yen''s woes.', 'Yun Fei Yang is the viciously bullied orphan who takes on the unpleasant tasks at a formidable kung-fu school. Constantly mocked by the other students of the school, Yen counts as his only friend the daughter of the resident master. Any internal wrangling between the various members is put to one side when a swordsman from a rival clan reminds the master of the duel he must take part in once a decade. Unfortunately the defending clan chief is well aware that his rival is more powerful than himself. The expected defeat is further complicated when a wandering swordsman arrives on the scene and joins himself to the injured party, immediately adding to Yen''s woes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zmRpgFSJRTmjv4laQj1HPyUA98x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72121'),
  ('460924907922752943', 'Bastards', 2006, 'Action, Drama, War', 'Aleksandr Atanesyan, Dmitriy Yashonkov, Yuliya Egorova', 'Aleksandr Atanesyan, Vladimir Kunin', 'Andrei Panin, Andrey Krasko, Aleksandr Golovin, Vladimir Kashpur, Sergey Perelygin, Rostislav Bershauer, Vladimir Andreyev, Igor Yurtayev', null, 'A "Hitlerjugend" kind of story, set in the Soviet Union during the Second World War, based on a fictitious story from the eponymous book by Vladimir Kunin.', 'A "Hitlerjugend" kind of story, set in the Soviet Union during the Second World War, based on a fictitious story from the eponymous book by Vladimir Kunin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mSmPUpwMW0yHgR9g8EbefTMFeHV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62678'),
  ('172994959223035567', 'Bastards', 2013, 'Drama, Crime, Thriller', 'Claire Denis, Agnès Godard, Christelle Lahaye', 'Claire Denis, Jean-Pol Fargeau', 'Vincent Lindon, Chiara Mastroianni, Julie Bataille, Michel Subor, Lola Créton, Alex Descas, Grégoire Colin, Florence Loiret Caille', null, 'Marco returns to Paris after his brother-in-law''s suicide, where he targets the man his sister believes caused the tragedy – though he is ill-prepared for her secrets as they quickly muddy the waters.', 'Marco returns to Paris after his brother-in-law''s suicide, where he targets the man his sister believes caused the tragedy – though he is ill-prepared for her secrets as they quickly muddy the waters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zSgi7jVGP8jNMhAUpU2v34eaxcS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:179109'),
  ('750331187492983847', 'Bastille Day', 2016, 'Action', 'James Watkins, Tim Maurice-Jones, Paul Spriggs', 'Andrew Baldwin, James Watkins', 'Idris Elba, Richard Madden, Charlotte Le Bon, Kelly Reilly, José Garcia, Anatol Yusef, Ériq Ebouaney, Alex Fondja', 'R', 'Michael Mason is an American pickpocket living in Paris who finds himself hunted by the CIA when he steals a bag that contains more than just a wallet. Sean Briar, the field agent on the case, soon realises that Michael is just a pawn in a much bigger game and is also his best asset to uncover a large-scale conspiracy.', 'Michael Mason is an American pickpocket living in Paris who finds himself hunted by the CIA when he steals a bag that contains more than just a wallet. Sean Briar, the field agent on the case, soon realises that Michael is just a pawn in a much bigger game and is also his best asset to uncover a large-scale conspiracy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lTby7l0zX7xG8Pt0eNrWBrNzdqX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:333669'),
  ('652254478100158377', 'Bat', 2018, 'Animation', 'Julia Ocker', null, null, null, 'Since some bird chicks hatched in the neighborhood, the bat hasn''t got any sleep.', 'Since some bird chicks hatched in the neighborhood, the bat hasn''t got any sleep.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xKC5ZdG5HXdAAVaDTmW2XSeq2YX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1137928'),
  ('219356909071355261', 'Bat Thumb', 2001, 'Action, Comedy, Fantasy, Adventure', 'David Bourla', 'Steve Oedekerk', 'Steve Oedekerk, Paul Greenberg, Rob Paulsen, Jim Jackman, Mark DeCarlo, Jackie Harris Greenberg', 'NR', 'Super hero Wuce Bane (a.k.a. Bat Thumb) and his trusty sidekick, Blue Jay, are called upon to save Gaaathumb City from the evil, despicable, and poorly dressed "No Face." Will the city survive? Will Bat Thumb''s true identity be revealed? Will Vicky Nail learn to control her unruly waves? Find out the answers to all these questions in this latest comic adventure from master storyteller Steve O.', 'Super hero Wuce Bane (a.k.a. Bat Thumb) and his trusty sidekick, Blue Jay, are called upon to save Gaaathumb City from the evil, despicable, and poorly dressed "No Face." Will the city survive? Will Bat Thumb''s true identity be revealed? Will Vicky Nail learn to control her unruly waves? Find out the answers to all these questions in this latest comic adventure from master storyteller Steve O.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7nIJrkr0wZRX5Pa5M4XMU0fAehz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18411'),
  ('539003037987228521', 'Bat Without Wings', 1980, 'Action, Mystery, Adventure, Horror', 'Chor Yuen, Wong Chit', 'Chor Yuen', 'Derek Yee, Ching Li, Wang Yong, Tang Ching, Susanna Au-Yeung Pui-San, Eddie Koo Koon Chung, Ku Feng, Jason Pai Piao', null, 'When a notorious fiend known as the "Bat Without Wings" returns to his small village after a five-year absence and kidnaps a young maiden, it''s up to her family and a resourceful swordsmen to brave the horrors of the underworld to bring her back home alive.', 'When a notorious fiend known as the "Bat Without Wings" returns to his small village after a five-year absence and kidnaps a young maiden, it''s up to her family and a resourceful swordsmen to brave the horrors of the underworld to bring her back home alive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i75JistFDIZ3K9TSHd42iAg1c6w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73748'),
  ('69576606567644824', 'Bat★21', 1988, 'Action, War, Drama', 'Peter Markle, Mark Irwin', 'William C. Anderson, George Gordon', 'Gene Hackman, Danny Glover, Jerry Reed, David Marshall Grant, Clayton Rohner, Erich Anderson, Joe Dorsey, Michael Ng', 'R', 'Lt. Col. Iceal "Ham" Hambleton is a weapons countermeasures expert and when his aircraft is shot over enemy territory the Air Force very much wants to get him back. Hambleton knows the area he''s in is going to be carpet-bombed but a temporary shortage of helicopters causes a delay. Working with an Air Force reconnaissance pilot, Capt. Bartholomew Clark, he maps out an escape route.', 'Lt. Col. Iceal "Ham" Hambleton is a weapons countermeasures expert and when his aircraft is shot over enemy territory the Air Force very much wants to get him back. Hambleton knows the area he''s in is going to be carpet-bombed but a temporary shortage of helicopters causes a delay. Working with an Air Force reconnaissance pilot, Capt. Bartholomew Clark, he maps out an escape route.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tiwhsOX3zm9QGfdFK4IfrGvZWJj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14911'),
  ('616646520756296984', 'Bataan', 1943, 'Action, Drama, War', 'Tay Garnett, Sidney Wagner', 'Garrett Fort, Dudley Nichols', 'Robert Taylor, George Murphy, Thomas Mitchell, Lloyd Nolan, Lee Bowman, Robert Walker, Desi Arnaz, Barry Nelson', 'NR', 'During Japan''s invasion of the Philippines in 1942, Capt. Henry Lassiter, Sgt. Bill Dane and a diverse group of American soldiers are ordered to destroy and hold a strategic bridge in order to delay the Japanese forces and allow Gen. MacArthur time to secure Bataan. When the Japanese soldiers begin to rebuild the bridge and advance, the group struggles with not only hunger, sickness and gunfire, but also the knowledge that there is likely no relief on the way.', 'During Japan''s invasion of the Philippines in 1942, Capt. Henry Lassiter, Sgt. Bill Dane and a diverse group of American soldiers are ordered to destroy and hold a strategic bridge in order to delay the Japanese forces and allow Gen. MacArthur time to secure Bataan. When the Japanese soldiers begin to rebuild the bridge and advance, the group struggles with not only hunger, sickness and gunfire, but also the knowledge that there is likely no relief on the way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gDJ6uGQqDkg45QeyGmHRpkZ8HVS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43506'),
  ('1065145776396077532', 'Batch ''81', 1982, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Mike de Leon, Rody Lacap, Ding Achacoso', 'Raquel Villavicencio, Clodualdo del Mundo Jr., Mike de Leon', 'Mark Gil, Sandy Andolong, Ward Luarca, Noel Trinidad, Ricky Sandico, Bing Pimentel, Charito Solis, Chanda Romero', null, 'Sid Lucero, a 21-year old pre-Med student, is an aspiring neophyte of the Alpha Kappa Omega fraternity. Over a six-month initiation period, he and six other neophytes are subjected to severe physical and psychological torture in and outside the fraternity house.', 'Sid Lucero, a 21-year old pre-Med student, is an aspiring neophyte of the Alpha Kappa Omega fraternity. Over a six-month initiation period, he and six other neophytes are subjected to severe physical and psychological torture in and outside the fraternity house.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lTz0Zq9RNZTV4CPbg6Bpvee66VU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56126'),
  ('835764213550374823', 'Bates Motel', 1987, 'Horror, Drama', 'Richard Rothstein, Debra Rubinstein, Bill Butler', 'Richard Rothstein', 'Bud Cort, Lori Petty, Moses Gunn, Gregg Henry, Khrystyne Haje, Jason Bateman, Kerrie Keane, Robert Picardo', null, 'A mentally disturbed man who roomed with the late Norman Bates at a psychiatric facility inherits the infamous Bates Motel after his death and attempts to fix it up as a respectable business.', 'A mentally disturbed man who roomed with the late Norman Bates at a psychiatric facility inherits the infamous Bates Motel after his death and attempts to fix it up as a respectable business.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9RbbMBMjJDD2Su6ierduGT1rNf5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86330'),
  ('338053503626325354', 'Bath Buddy', 2020, 'Action, Comedy', 'Yizeng Liu, Joshua', 'Xing Wenxiong, Joshua', 'Peng Yuchang, Qiao Shan, Jin Shijia, Bu Guanjin, Wei Qing, Hong Jiantao, Ba Duo, Xunzimo Liu', null, 'It''s about a second generation rich boy whom loses his memory, and ends up in a bath parlor/spa and eventually learns the skills on how to give the best bath to customers.', 'It''s about a second generation rich boy whom loses his memory, and ends up in a bath parlor/spa and eventually learns the skills on how to give the best bath to customers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8QRuprmtwNcLRCy0pwjVfW63A1J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:758895'),
  ('1050383188104678757', 'Bath Day', 1946, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Charles August Nichols', null, 'Ruth Clifford, Clarence Nash', 'NR', 'Minnie gives Figaro a bath and ties a ribbon around his neck. Figaro feels like a sissy, and when he mixes it up with some alley cats, they mock him, and the leader attacks. But Figaro is so afraid that his shaking topples a series of trash cans onto the aggressor. The rest of the cats didn''t see this happen, and think Figaro defeated their leader. Of course, now he''s all dirty, and he needs another bath.', 'Minnie gives Figaro a bath and ties a ribbon around his neck. Figaro feels like a sissy, and when he mixes it up with some alley cats, they mock him, and the leader attacks. But Figaro is so afraid that his shaking topples a series of trash cans onto the aggressor. The rest of the cats didn''t see this happen, and think Figaro defeated their leader. Of course, now he''s all dirty, and he needs another bath.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yaN6Cl2f1DcBeh2jwjHIJwUWPdQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:125405'),
  ('805698836698724576', 'Bath Time', 2014, 'Crime, Horror', 'Eduardo Casanova, Raquel GarcÍa, Lita Echeverría', 'Eduardo Casanova', 'Macarena Gómez, Gonzalo Kindelán, Aria Wrana, Miriam Prado, Jorge Prado', null, 'A screaming baby awakens madness and bloodlust.', 'A screaming baby awakens madness and bloodlust.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/scoH7TEui6N3BDEm9azKQtyO3xm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:357021'),
  ('430285229516544779', 'Bathing Beauty', 1944, 'Music, Comedy, Romance', 'George Sidney, Herman E. Webber, Sandy Roth', 'Allen Boretz, Frank Waldman, Dorothy Kingsley', 'Red Skelton, Esther Williams, Basil Rathbone, Bill Goodwin, Jean Porter, Nana Bryant, Carlos Ramírez, Ethel Smith', 'NR', 'After breaking up with her fiancé, a gym teacher returns to work at a women''s college, but a legal loophole allows him to enroll as one of her students.', 'After breaking up with her fiancé, a gym teacher returns to work at a women''s college, but a legal loophole allows him to enroll as one of her students.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9vqXU1hFpyLkJK4Wvt3bfUVMbqI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43546'),
  ('983557157495460249', 'Bathing Buddies', 1946, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Dick Lundy', null, null, null, 'Woody and Wally share an apartment building. Woody''s favorite pastime is playing golf... it''s just a shame he plays inside the house instead of outside. Finally, Wally breaks his club and tells him not to make any more noise. Woody decides to forget his troubles by taking a bath. His bathtub is coin-operated and when he inserts a dime for the water, it falls down the drain.', 'Woody and Wally share an apartment building. Woody''s favorite pastime is playing golf... it''s just a shame he plays inside the house instead of outside. Finally, Wally breaks his club and tells him not to make any more noise. Woody decides to forget his troubles by taking a bath. His bathtub is coin-operated and when he inserts a dime for the water, it falls down the drain.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mLaJWlDlTedLSQ0VRxHrbjHnf3e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:237037'),
  ('378874620015524861', 'Bathing Forbidden', 1906, 'Comedy', 'Johann Schwarzer', null, null, null, 'Three young women are smiling and playing in a lake, their nude bodies reflecting in the water, when a forest watcher appears from the wood, and chases them away. They get out of the water, pick their clothes from tree branches, and move away before putting them on. The bearded man seems to be shy, but he is chasing after them through the wood, anyway.', 'Three young women are smiling and playing in a lake, their nude bodies reflecting in the water, when a forest watcher appears from the wood, and chases them away. They get out of the water, pick their clothes from tree branches, and move away before putting them on. The bearded man seems to be shy, but he is chasing after them through the wood, anyway.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4HbaMXHcUB3ueyYj4JKsNx07DOz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:196488'),
  ('829751865060603411', 'Bathing in a Stream', 1897, 'Documentary', 'Alice Guy-Blaché', null, null, null, 'A group of kids play in a stream.', 'A group of kids play in a stream.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aklUGYANVvAIUmRaeiUmj2RY400.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:119949'),
  ('264660220468674536', 'Bathory: Countess of Blood', 2008, 'Drama, Fantasy', 'Juraj Jakubisko, F. A. Brabec, Ján Ďuriš', 'Juraj Jakubisko', 'Anna Friel, Karel Roden, Vincent Regan, Hans Matheson, Deana Horváthová, Franco Nero, Antony Byrne, Bolek Polívka', 'R', 'Bathory is based on the legends surrounding the life and deeds of Countess Elizabeth Bathory known as the greatest murderess in the history of mankind. Contrary to popular belief, Elizabeth Bathory was a modern Renaissance woman who ultimately fell victim to men’s aspirations for power and wealth.', 'Bathory is based on the legends surrounding the life and deeds of Countess Elizabeth Bathory known as the greatest murderess in the history of mankind. Contrary to popular belief, Elizabeth Bathory was a modern Renaissance woman who ultimately fell victim to men’s aspirations for power and wealth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qZsQ02liDzz9Ydb1dzFwLxef7me.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15208'),
