  ('334413087697714740', 'Batla House', 2019, 'Action, Drama, Thriller', 'Nikkhil Advani, Ankit Choudhary, Sahil Khanna', 'Ritesh Shah', 'John Abraham, Mrunal Thakur, Ravi Kishan, Sahidur Rahaman, Kranti Prakash Jha, Alok Pandey, Faizan Khan, Chirag Katrecha', null, 'Following a gunfight with suspects believed to be innocent by the media and public, an honest cop struggles to justify police actions before beginning the hunt for fugitives.', 'Following a gunfight with suspects believed to be innocent by the media and public, an honest cop struggles to justify police actions before beginning the hunt for fugitives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lHATvvxVvcHRy9G8ZJGXA7J6JEg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:550485'),
  ('34052935220313525', 'Batman', 1943, 'Action, Adventure, Crime', 'Lambert Hillyer, James S. Brown Jr.', 'Victor McLeod, Leslie Swabacker, Harry L. Fraser', 'Lewis Wilson, Douglas Croft, J. Carrol Naish, Shirley Patterson, William Austin, Knox Manning, Frank Austin, Lynton Brent', null, 'Japanese master spy Daka operates a covert espionage-sabotage organization located in Gotham City''s now-deserted Little Tokyo, which turns American scientists into pliable zombies. The great crime-fighters Batman and Robin, with the help of their allies, are in pursuit.', 'Japanese master spy Daka operates a covert espionage-sabotage organization located in Gotham City''s now-deserted Little Tokyo, which turns American scientists into pliable zombies. The great crime-fighters Batman and Robin, with the help of their allies, are in pursuit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AvzD3mrtokIzZOiV6zAG7geIo6F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:125249'),
  ('147457591056328697', 'Batman', 1966, 'Action, Comedy, Crime', 'Leslie H. Martinson, Howard Schwartz', 'Lorenzo Semple Jr.', 'Adam West, Burt Ward, Lee Meriwether, Cesar Romero, Burgess Meredith, Frank Gorshin, Alan Napier, Neil Hamilton', 'PG', 'The Dynamic Duo faces four super-villains who plan to hold the world for ransom with the help of a secret invention that instantly dehydrates people.', 'The Dynamic Duo faces four super-villains who plan to hold the world for ransom with the help of a secret invention that instantly dehydrates people.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zzoPxWHnPa0eyfkMLgwbNvdEcVF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2661'),
  ('618315372712749039', 'Batman', 1989, 'Fantasy, Action, Crime', 'Tim Burton, Roger Pratt, Leslie Tomkins', 'Warren Skaaren, Sam Hamm', 'Michael Keaton, Jack Nicholson, Kim Basinger, Robert Wuhl, Pat Hingle, Billy Dee Williams, Michael Gough, Jack Palance', 'PG-13', 'Having witnessed his parents'' brutal murder as a child, millionaire philanthropist Bruce Wayne fights crime in Gotham City disguised as Batman, a costumed hero who strikes fear into the hearts of villains. But when a deformed madman known as ''The Joker'' seizes control of Gotham''s criminal underworld, Batman must face his most ruthless nemesis ever while protecting both his identity and his love interest, reporter Vicki Vale.', 'Having witnessed his parents'' brutal murder as a child, millionaire philanthropist Bruce Wayne fights crime in Gotham City disguised as Batman, a costumed hero who strikes fear into the hearts of villains. But when a deformed madman known as ''The Joker'' seizes control of Gotham''s criminal underworld, Batman must face his most ruthless nemesis ever while protecting both his identity and his love interest, reporter Vicki Vale.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cij4dd21v2Rk2YtUQbV5kW69WB2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:268'),
  ('790260335046279397', 'Batman & Bill', 2017, 'Documentary', 'Don Argott, Sheena M. Joyce, Don Argott', 'Marc Tyler Nobleman', 'Michael Uslan, Roy Thomas, Marc Tyler Nobleman, Thomas Andrae, Benjamin Zaido Cruz, Athena Finger, Bill Finger, Bob Kane', 'PG-13', 'Everyone thinks that Bob Kane created Batman, but that’s not the whole truth. One author makes it his crusade to make it known that Bill Finger, a struggling writer, actually helped invent the iconic superhero, from concept to costume to the very character we all know and love. Bruce Wayne may be Batman’s secret identity, but his creator was always a true mystery.', 'Everyone thinks that Bob Kane created Batman, but that’s not the whole truth. One author makes it his crusade to make it known that Bill Finger, a struggling writer, actually helped invent the iconic superhero, from concept to costume to the very character we all know and love. Bruce Wayne may be Batman’s secret identity, but his creator was always a true mystery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gc1oyq0K8TdtFTXmYV03v536HsI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:456348'),
  ('367768004086559818', 'Batman & Mr. Freeze: SubZero', 1998, 'Animation, Action, Crime', 'Boyd Kirkland, Yukio Suzuki', 'Boyd Kirkland, Randy Rogel', 'Kevin Conroy, Michael Ansara, Loren Lester, Mary Kay Bergman, Robert Costanzo, Mari Devon, George Dzundza, Bob Hastings', 'NR', 'When Mr. Freeze kidnaps Barbara Gordon, as an involuntary organ donor to save his dying wife, Batman and Robin must find her before the operation can begin.', 'When Mr. Freeze kidnaps Barbara Gordon, as an involuntary organ donor to save his dying wife, Batman and Robin must find her before the operation can begin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kjjz8mVNrwNUa9uz8IMnqS79rxj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15805'),
  ('818767615256549906', 'Batman & Robin', 1997, 'Action, Science Fiction, Adventure', 'Joel Schumacher, Stephen Goldblatt, Richard Holland', 'Akiva Goldsman', 'George Clooney, Chris O''Donnell, Arnold Schwarzenegger, Uma Thurman, Alicia Silverstone, Michael Gough, Pat Hingle, Elle Macpherson', 'PG-13', 'Batman and his sidekick Robin attempt to the foil the sinister schemes of a deranged set of new villains, most notably the melancholy Mr. Freeze, who wants to make Gotham City into an arctic region, and the sultry Poison Ivy, a botanical femme fatale. As the Dynamic Duo contend with these bad guys, a third hero, Batgirl, joins the ranks of the city''s crime-fighters.', 'Batman and his sidekick Robin attempt to the foil the sinister schemes of a deranged set of new villains, most notably the melancholy Mr. Freeze, who wants to make Gotham City into an arctic region, and the sultry Poison Ivy, a botanical femme fatale. As the Dynamic Duo contend with these bad guys, a third hero, Batgirl, joins the ranks of the city''s crime-fighters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i7hEUpDuMN2LOrCEifFyGSHZQSY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:415'),
  ('14213418729967770', 'Batman and Harley Quinn', 2017, 'Adventure, Animation, Comedy, Crime', 'Sam Liu, Matthew Girardi', 'Bruce Timm, Jim Krieg', 'Kevin Conroy, Melissa Rauch, Paget Brewster, Loren Lester, Kevin Michael Richardson, Eric Bauza, Trevor Devall, John DiMaggio', 'PG-13', 'Batman and Nightwing are forced to team with the Joker''s sometimes-girlfriend Harley Quinn to stop a global threat brought about by Poison Ivy and Jason Woodrue, the Floronic Man.', 'Batman and Nightwing are forced to team with the Joker''s sometimes-girlfriend Harley Quinn to stop a global threat brought about by Poison Ivy and Jason Woodrue, the Floronic Man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v3RP6pp6pfRdvch6QioeQvNdMJs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:408648'),
  ('1082477883606820954', 'Batman and Robin', 1949, 'Action, Science Fiction, Thriller, Adventure, Crime', 'Spencer Gordon Bennet, Ira H. Morgan', 'Bob Kane, Joseph F. Poland, Royal K. Cole', 'Robert Lowery, Johnny Duncan, Lyle Talbot, Jane Adams, Ralph Graves, Don C. Harvey, William Fawcett, Leonard Penn', 'NR', 'This 15-chapter serial pits Batman and Robin against The Wizard, who uses a device that allows him to control machinery to hold the city hostage.', 'This 15-chapter serial pits Batman and Robin against The Wizard, who uses a device that allows him to control machinery to hold the city hostage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/411pEyeqP5rLS6Zc9batSRL0c8G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:93560'),
  ('704667814081852654', 'Batman Begins', 2005, 'Drama, Crime, Action', 'Wally Pfister, Simon Lamont, Hans Bjerno', 'Christopher Nolan, David S. Goyer', 'Christian Bale, Michael Caine, Liam Neeson, Katie Holmes, Gary Oldman, Cillian Murphy, Tom Wilkinson, Rutger Hauer', 'PG-13', 'Driven by tragedy, billionaire Bruce Wayne dedicates his life to uncovering and defeating the corruption that plagues his home, Gotham City. Unable to work within the system, he instead creates a new identity, a symbol of fear for the criminal underworld - The Batman.', 'Driven by tragedy, billionaire Bruce Wayne dedicates his life to uncovering and defeating the corruption that plagues his home, Gotham City. Unable to work within the system, he instead creates a new identity, a symbol of fear for the criminal underworld - The Batman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sPX89Td70IDDjVr85jdSBb4rWGr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:272'),
  ('282989139312480081', 'Batman Beyond', 2014, 'Action, Animation, Science Fiction', 'Darwyn Cooke', 'Paul Dini, Darwyn Cooke, Bruce Timm', 'Will Friedle, Kevin Conroy', 'NR', 'This short celebrating 75 years of Batman from artist Darwyn Cooke returns fans to the world of Batman Beyond as Terry McGinnis'' futuristic Dark Knight faces his most formidable foe of all - himself.', 'This short celebrating 75 years of Batman from artist Darwyn Cooke returns fans to the world of Batman Beyond as Terry McGinnis'' futuristic Dark Knight faces his most formidable foe of all - himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dDD8EwK7LHhfq2gmJznS94QSFaD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:269246'),
  ('594629335160367519', 'Batman Beyond: Return of the Joker', 2000, 'Animation, Action, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Curt Geda, Yoshihiro Kasahara', 'Bruce Timm, Glen Murakami, Paul Dini', 'Will Friedle, Kevin Conroy, Mark Hamill, Angie Harmon, Dean Stockwell, Arleen Sorkin, Tara Strong, Mathew Valencia', 'PG', 'The Joker is back with a vengeance, and Neo-Gotham''s Dark Knight, Terry McGinnis, needs answers as he stands alone to face the old Gotham''s most infamous Clown Prince of Crime.', 'The Joker is back with a vengeance, and Neo-Gotham''s Dark Knight, Terry McGinnis, needs answers as he stands alone to face the old Gotham''s most infamous Clown Prince of Crime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cY30YkhK84E18ROghF4osi67EYT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16234'),
  ('689527834958590617', 'Batman Beyond: The Movie', 1999, 'Animation, Action, Science Fiction', 'Curt Geda, Sung-Il Cho', 'Alan Burnett, Paul Dini, Stan Berkowitz', 'Will Friedle, Kevin Conroy, Michael Ansara, Linda Hamilton, Sherman Howard, Teri Garr, Seth Green, George Takei', 'NR', 'Fuelled by remorse and vengeance, a high schooler named Terry McGinnis becomes the new Batman as he fights crime in the futuristic Neo-Gotham City.', 'Fuelled by remorse and vengeance, a high schooler named Terry McGinnis becomes the new Batman as he fights crime in the futuristic Neo-Gotham City.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8YgqCWC9Vf9732oa4uUcQRR38GC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64202'),
  ('208568215345762864', 'Batman Forever', 1995, 'Action, Crime, Fantasy', 'Joel Schumacher, Stephen Goldblatt, Conrad E. Palmisano', 'Akiva Goldsman, Janet Scott Batchler, Lee Batchler', 'Val Kilmer, Tommy Lee Jones, Jim Carrey, Nicole Kidman, Chris O''Donnell, Michael Gough, Pat Hingle, Drew Barrymore', 'PG-13', 'Batman faces off against two foes: the schizophrenic, horribly scarred former District Attorney Harvey Dent, aka Two-Face, and the Riddler, a disgruntled ex-Wayne Enterprises inventor seeking revenge against his former employer by unleashing his brain-sucking weapon on Gotham City''s residents. As the caped crusader also copes with tortured memories of his parents'' murder, he has a new romance, with psychologist Chase Meridian.', 'Batman faces off against two foes: the schizophrenic, horribly scarred former District Attorney Harvey Dent, aka Two-Face, and the Riddler, a disgruntled ex-Wayne Enterprises inventor seeking revenge against his former employer by unleashing his brain-sucking weapon on Gotham City''s residents. As the caped crusader also copes with tortured memories of his parents'' murder, he has a new romance, with psychologist Chase Meridian.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i0fJS8M5UKoETjjJ0zwUiKaR8tr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:414'),
  ('319816733955503715', 'Batman Ninja', 2018, 'Animation, Action, Science Fiction', 'Satoshi Sawada, Shuhei Morita, Junichi Yamamoto', 'Kazuki Nakashima', 'Koichi Yamadera, Wataru Takagi, Rie Kugimiya, Ai Kakuma, Hochu Otsuka, Daisuke Ono, Akira Ishida, Kengo Kawanishi', 'PG-13', 'Batman, along with many of his allies and adversaries, finds himself transported to feudal Japan by Gorilla Grodd''s time displacement machine.', 'Batman, along with many of his allies and adversaries, finds himself transported to feudal Japan by Gorilla Grodd''s time displacement machine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5xSB0Npkc9Fd9kahKBsq9P4Cdzp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:485942'),
  ('93623428971456792', 'Batman Ninja vs. Yakuza League', 2025, 'Animation, Action, Science Fiction', 'Jumpei Mizusaki, Shinji Takagi, Takanobu Mizuno', 'Kazuki Nakashima', 'Koichi Yamadera, Yuki Kaji, Kengo Kawanishi, Daisuke Ono, Ayane Sakura, Akio Otsuka, Nobuyuki Hiyama, Romi Park', 'PG-13', 'The Batman family has returned to the present to discover that Japan has disappeared, and a giant island - Hinomoto - is now in the sky over Gotham City. At the top sit the Yakuza, a group of superpowered individuals who reign without honor or humanity and look suspiciously like the Justice League. Now, it’s up to Batman and his allies to save Gotham!', 'The Batman family has returned to the present to discover that Japan has disappeared, and a giant island - Hinomoto - is now in the sky over Gotham City. At the top sit the Yakuza, a group of superpowered individuals who reign without honor or humanity and look suspiciously like the Justice League. Now, it’s up to Batman and his allies to save Gotham!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sVVT6GYFErVv0Lcc9NvqCu0iOxO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1297763'),
  ('1013436818586369108', 'Batman Returns', 1992, 'Action, Fantasy', 'Tim Burton, Stefan Czapsky, Tom Duffield', 'Daniel Waters', 'Michael Keaton, Danny DeVito, Michelle Pfeiffer, Christopher Walken, Michael Gough, Pat Hingle, Michael Murphy, Vincent Schiavelli', 'PG-13', 'The monstrous Penguin, who dwells in the sewers beneath Gotham, joins up with corrupt mayoral candidate Max Shreck to topple the Batman once and for all. But when Shreck''s timid assistant Selina Kyle finds out, and Shreck tries to kill her, she''s transformed into the sexy Catwoman. She teams up with the Penguin and Shreck to destroy Batman, but sparks fly unexpectedly when she confronts the caped crusader.', 'The monstrous Penguin, who dwells in the sewers beneath Gotham, joins up with corrupt mayoral candidate Max Shreck to topple the Batman once and for all. But when Shreck''s timid assistant Selina Kyle finds out, and Shreck tries to kill her, she''s transformed into the sexy Catwoman. She teams up with the Penguin and Shreck to destroy Batman, but sparks fly unexpectedly when she confronts the caped crusader.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jKBjeXM7iBBV9UkUcOXx3m7FSHY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:364'),
  ('1103159857954169341', 'Batman Returns: The Bat, the Cat, and the Penguin', 1992, 'Documentary, TV Movie', 'Michael Meadows', 'Michael Meadows', 'Robert Urich, Michael Keaton, Tim Burton, Michelle Pfeiffer, Anthony De Longis, Danny DeVito, Bob Kane, Stan Winston', null, 'Behind the scenes documentary about the making of Batman Returns.', 'Behind the scenes documentary about the making of Batman Returns.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ye1aMj92R1RG4lonmNKhvwWUFgI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:348909'),
  ('22828366216424888', 'Batman Tech', 2008, 'Documentary', 'Steven C. Smith', 'Steven C. Smith', 'Dave Hoffman, Christopher Nolan, Charles Roven, Len Wein, Paul Levitz', 'NR', 'He''s caped, cowled and the coolest superhero of them all, because underneath that Batsuit, Batman only has his human strength and intellect to rely on. That and the greatest arsenal of crime fighting weaponry ever devised. But just where does comic book science fiction end and scientific fact begin? What technologies are behind the gadgets in Batman''s utility belt? And just how plausible is the Batmobile? Get ready for a real life trip to the Batcave as we reveal the secrets behind Batman Tech.', 'He''s caped, cowled and the coolest superhero of them all, because underneath that Batsuit, Batman only has his human strength and intellect to rely on. That and the greatest arsenal of crime fighting weaponry ever devised. But just where does comic book science fiction end and scientific fact begin? What technologies are behind the gadgets in Batman''s utility belt? And just how plausible is the Batmobile? Get ready for a real life trip to the Batcave as we reveal the secrets behind Batman Tech.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tlAYMNTvga69AUXMIY0HeeoblHT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:186579'),
  ('48172562991264526', 'Batman Unlimited: Animal Instincts', 2015, 'Action, Animation, Family', 'Butch Lukic', 'Heath Corson', 'Roger Craig Smith, Chris Diamantopoulos, Dana Snyder, Will Friedle, Charlie Schlatter, Yuri Lowenthal, John DiMaggio, Keith Szarabajka', 'NR', 'Gotham City is under siege by a series of bizarre crimes and only the world''s greatest detective, Batman, can unravel the mystery! The trail leads to none other than the Penguin and his Animilitia, an animal-inspired squad of villains including Silverback, Cheetah, Killer Croc and the monstrous Man-Bat.', 'Gotham City is under siege by a series of bizarre crimes and only the world''s greatest detective, Batman, can unravel the mystery! The trail leads to none other than the Penguin and his Animilitia, an animal-inspired squad of villains including Silverback, Cheetah, Killer Croc and the monstrous Man-Bat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9e6iPMBr9rQKPoK8g3YDTVvI5ud.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:327418'),
  ('980171002525920096', 'Batman Unlimited: Mechs vs. Mutants', 2016, 'Animation, Action, Science Fiction', 'Curt Geda', 'Curt Geda, Chris Wyatt', 'Roger Craig Smith, Oded Fehr, Lucien Dodge, Dana Snyder, Chris Diamantopoulos, Phil LaMarr, Will Friedle, Charlie Schlatter', 'NR', 'Mr. Freeze turns Killer Croc and Bane into super-sized monsters, and they bash their way through downtown Gotham until the Caped Crusader and his team of heroes join the fight in their giant robot mechs.', 'Mr. Freeze turns Killer Croc and Bane into super-sized monsters, and they bash their way through downtown Gotham until the Caped Crusader and his team of heroes join the fight in their giant robot mechs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3re2aBFRYk4KDcoAxoyr8ZTOXX8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:411802'),
  ('392968590480099785', 'Batman Unlimited: Monster Mayhem', 2015, 'Action, Animation, Family', 'Butch Lukic', 'Heath Corson', 'Roger Craig Smith, Troy Baker, Chris Diamantopoulos, Kari Wührer, Noel Fisher, Khary Payton, Will Friedle, Yuri Lowenthal', 'PG', 'The Joker is aided in his Halloween quest to render modern technology useless and take over Gotham City by Solomon Grundy, Silver Banshee, Clayface and Scarecrow.', 'The Joker is aided in his Halloween quest to render modern technology useless and take over Gotham City by Solomon Grundy, Silver Banshee, Clayface and Scarecrow.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jceXBNFMPLAKlo2MPJGJlXJBQJL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:342917'),
  ('813383544295496728', 'Batman Unmasked: The Psychology of The Dark Knight', 2008, 'Documentary', 'Steven C. Smith', 'Steven C. Smith', 'Robert Clotworthy, Christopher Nolan, Christian Bale, Dan Didio, Len Wein, Paul Levitz, Dennis O''Neil', 'NR', 'Delve into the world of Batman and the vigilante justice that he brought to the city of Gotham. Batman is a man who, after experiencing great tragedy, devotes his life to an ideal--but what happens when one man takes on the evil underworld alone? Examine why Batman is who he is--and explore how a boy scarred by tragedy becomes a symbol of hope to everyone else.', 'Delve into the world of Batman and the vigilante justice that he brought to the city of Gotham. Batman is a man who, after experiencing great tragedy, devotes his life to an ideal--but what happens when one man takes on the evil underworld alone? Examine why Batman is who he is--and explore how a boy scarred by tragedy becomes a symbol of hope to everyone else.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e15wNHmLX7PJUo8lqzQRhwbX7PL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29751'),
  ('441939765882668304', 'Batman v Superman: Dawn of Justice', 2016, 'Action, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Misha Bukowski, Zack Snyder, Larry Fong', 'David S. Goyer, Chris Terrio', 'Ben Affleck, Henry Cavill, Jesse Eisenberg, Gal Gadot, Amy Adams, Diane Lane, Laurence Fishburne, Jeremy Irons', 'PG-13', 'Fearing the actions of a god-like Super Hero left unchecked, Gotham City’s own formidable, forceful vigilante takes on Metropolis’s most revered, modern-day savior, while the world wrestles with what sort of hero it really needs. And with Batman and Superman at war with one another, a new threat quickly arises, putting mankind in greater danger than it’s ever known before.', 'Fearing the actions of a god-like Super Hero left unchecked, Gotham City’s own formidable, forceful vigilante takes on Metropolis’s most revered, modern-day savior, while the world wrestles with what sort of hero it really needs. And with Batman and Superman at war with one another, a new threat quickly arises, putting mankind in greater danger than it’s ever known before.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5UsK3grJvtQrtzEgqNlDljJW96w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:209112'),
  ('346151728277208783', 'Batman vs Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles', 2019, 'Animation, Science Fiction, Adventure, Crime, Comedy, Action', 'Jake Castorena', 'Marly Halpern-Graser', 'Troy Baker, Eric Bauza, Darren Criss, Kyle Mooney, Baron Vaughn, Carlos Alazraqui, Cas Anvar, Rachel Bloom', 'PG-13', 'Batman, Batgirl, and Robin forge an alliance with the Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles to fight against the Turtles'' sworn enemy, The Shredder, who has apparently teamed up with Ra''s Al Ghul and The League of Assassins.', 'Batman, Batgirl, and Robin forge an alliance with the Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles to fight against the Turtles'' sworn enemy, The Shredder, who has apparently teamed up with Ra''s Al Ghul and The League of Assassins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yP3h0Pu8htyb9450mWJ9Vu1rU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:581997'),
  ('34772211806454802', 'Batman vs. Robin', 2015, 'Crime, Action, Adventure, Animation', 'Jay Oliva', 'J. M. DeMatteis', 'Jason O''Mara, Stuart Allan, David McCallum, Sean Maher, Jeremy Sisto, ''Weird Al'' Yankovic, Robin Atkin Downes, Peter Onorati', 'PG-13', 'Damian Wayne is having a hard time coping with his father''s "no killing" rule. Meanwhile, Gotham is going through hell with threats such as the insane Dollmaker, and the secretive Court of Owls.', 'Damian Wayne is having a hard time coping with his father''s "no killing" rule. Meanwhile, Gotham is going through hell with threats such as the insane Dollmaker, and the secretive Court of Owls.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aGp9XDXmVM5lCKHWtgBC15S7XLr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:321528'),
  ('721655701903412280', 'Batman vs. Two-Face', 2017, 'Animation, Action, Science Fiction', 'Rick Morales', 'Michael Jelenic, James Tucker', 'Adam West, Burt Ward, William Shatner, Julie Newmar, Jeff Bergman, Sirena Irwin, Thomas Lennon, Lee Meriwether', 'PG', 'Former Gotham City District Attorney Harvey Dent, one side of his face scarred by acid, goes on a crime spree based on the number ''2''. All of his actions are decided by the flip of a defaced, two-headed silver dollar.', 'Former Gotham City District Attorney Harvey Dent, one side of his face scarred by acid, goes on a crime spree based on the number ''2''. All of his actions are decided by the flip of a defaced, two-headed silver dollar.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yTbj8Kcp4WFwMRdEejnn55KIsfH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:464882'),
  ('565355496996865619', 'Batman: Assault on Arkham', 2014, 'Thriller, Animation, Action, Crime', 'Meredith Layne, Ethan Spaulding, Jay Oliva', 'Heath Corson', 'Kevin Conroy, Neal McDonough, Hynden Walch, Matthew Gray Gubler, Troy Baker, Eric Bauza, Chris Cox, John DiMaggio', 'PG-13', 'Batman works desperately to find a bomb planted by the Joker while Amanda Waller sends her newly-formed Suicide Squad to break into Arkham Asylum and recover vital information stolen by the Riddler.', 'Batman works desperately to find a bomb planted by the Joker while Amanda Waller sends her newly-formed Suicide Squad to break into Arkham Asylum and recover vital information stolen by the Riddler.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b9KxvIAZkl2f57kjObj8Z9z9LhL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:242643'),
  ('984576172895886072', 'Batman: Bad Blood', 2016, 'Science Fiction, Action, Animation, Adventure, Crime', 'Jay Oliva, Kazuyoshi Takeuchi, Seigo Kitazawa', 'J. M. DeMatteis', 'Jason O''Mara, Yvonne Strahovski, Stuart Allan, Sean Maher, Morena Baccarin, Steve Blum, Gaius Charles, John DiMaggio', 'PG-13', 'When Batman goes missing, it takes the entire Bat "family" - including Batwoman and Batwing - to keep the peace in Gotham and unravel the mystery behind the Dark Knight''s disappearance.', 'When Batman goes missing, it takes the entire Bat "family" - including Batwoman and Batwing - to keep the peace in Gotham and unravel the mystery behind the Dark Knight''s disappearance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ktjbGsGm5GKlHDvvwQajXvDW2BN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:366924'),
  ('362379428758050672', 'Batman: Gotham by Gaslight', 2018, 'Thriller, Action, Animation, Science Fiction', 'Sam Liu', 'Jim Krieg', 'Bruce Greenwood, Jennifer Carpenter, Anthony Stewart Head, Scott Patterson, John DiMaggio, Yuri Lowenthal, Grey DeLisle, William Salyers', 'R', 'In an alternative Victorian Age Gotham City, Batman begins his war on crime while he investigates a new series of murders by Jack the Ripper.', 'In an alternative Victorian Age Gotham City, Batman begins his war on crime while he investigates a new series of murders by Jack the Ripper.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7souLi5zqQCnpZVghaXv0Wowi0y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:471474'),
  ('335518049275833443', 'Batman: Gotham Knight', 2008, 'Science Fiction, Action, Crime, Animation', 'Futoshi Higashide, Yasuhiro Aoki, Jong-Sik Nam', 'Brian Azzarello, Greg Rucka, Josh Olson', 'Kevin Conroy, Jason Marsden, Scott Menville, George Newbern, Corey Padnos, Crystal Scales, Alanna Ubach, Gary Dourdan', 'PG-13', 'Six interlocking stories reveal Bruce Wayne''s earliest adventures as Batman and the steps he took to become the grim avenger of Gotham City.', 'Six interlocking stories reveal Bruce Wayne''s earliest adventures as Batman and the steps he took to become the grim avenger of Gotham City.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3i1o0sHBP0VUpuSVmkdCRKYoDBC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13851'),
  ('591576886488183475', 'Batman: Hush', 2019, 'Action, Animation, Crime, Mystery', 'Justin Copeland', 'Ernie Altbacker', 'Jason O''Mara, Jennifer Morrison, Maury Sterling, Sean Maher, Geoffrey Arend, James Garrett, Jerry O''Connell, Rebecca Romijn', 'PG-13', 'A mysterious new villain known only as Hush uses a gallery of villains to destroy Batman''s crime-fighting career as well as Bruce Wayne''s personal life, which has been further complicated by a relationship with Selina Kyle/Catwoman.', 'A mysterious new villain known only as Hush uses a gallery of villains to destroy Batman''s crime-fighting career as well as Bruce Wayne''s personal life, which has been further complicated by a relationship with Selina Kyle/Catwoman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eiVQORVyVuNNZHPAELuWtlXoQsD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:537056'),
  ('783499483097038565', 'Batman: Mask of the Phantasm', 1993, 'Animation, Crime, Mystery, Action, Adventure', 'Bruce Timm, Eric Radomski, Yukio Suzuki', 'Alan Burnett, Martin Pasko, Paul Dini', 'Kevin Conroy, Dana Delany, Hart Bochner, Stacy Keach, Mark Hamill, Abe Vigoda, Dick Miller, John P. Ryan', 'PG', 'Andrea Beaumont leaves her father to return to Gotham, rekindling an old romance with Bruce Wayne. At the same time, a mysterious figure begins to hunt down Gotham''s criminals, wrongly implicating Batman in the murders. Now on the run from the law, Batman must find and stop the culprit, while also navigating his relationship with Andrea.', 'Andrea Beaumont leaves her father to return to Gotham, rekindling an old romance with Bruce Wayne. At the same time, a mysterious figure begins to hunt down Gotham''s criminals, wrongly implicating Batman in the murders. Now on the run from the law, Batman must find and stop the culprit, while also navigating his relationship with Andrea.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hT4ehUteagUrhUOHAtmYiY7mp5l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14919'),
  ('383477569754710764', 'Batman: Mystery of the Batwoman', 2003, 'Fantasy, Animation, Adventure, Crime, Action, Drama', 'Curt Geda, Tim Maltby, Jennifer Graves', 'Michael Reaves', 'Kevin Conroy, Kimberly Brooks, Kelly Ripa, Elisa Gabrielli, Kyra Sedgwick, David Ogden Stiers, Kevin Michael Richardson, John Vernon', 'PG', 'As if the Penguin wasn''t enough to contend with, a new vigilante has surfaced in Gotham City, and her strong-arm tactics give Batman cause for concern. Being the World''s Greatest Detective and The Dark Knight, he sets out to uncover her identity while stopping a dangerous criminal plot.', 'As if the Penguin wasn''t enough to contend with, a new vigilante has surfaced in Gotham City, and her strong-arm tactics give Batman cause for concern. Being the World''s Greatest Detective and The Dark Knight, he sets out to uncover her identity while stopping a dangerous criminal plot.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mlmhpUArJdpRPO211v3lETe3uzg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21683'),
  ('125556052534650477', 'Batman: Return of the Caped Crusaders', 2016, 'Action, Animation, Adventure, Family, Science Fiction', 'Rick Morales', 'Michael Jelenic, James Tucker', 'Adam West, Burt Ward, Julie Newmar, Jeff Bergman, Sirena Irwin, Thomas Lennon, William Salyers, Lynne Marie Stewart', 'PG', 'Adam West and Burt Ward returns to their iconic roles of Batman and Robin. The film sees the superheroes going up against classic villains like The Joker, The Riddler, The Penguin and Catwoman, both in Gotham City… and in space.', 'Adam West and Burt Ward returns to their iconic roles of Batman and Robin. The film sees the superheroes going up against classic villains like The Joker, The Riddler, The Penguin and Catwoman, both in Gotham City… and in space.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i6qL5EYGXI4867S4KwZ1mPWvmTx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:411736'),
  ('927257375527580995', 'Batman: Soul of the Dragon', 2021, 'Animation, Action, Adventure, Crime', 'Sam Liu, Seo Seon Jong', 'Jeremy Adams', 'David Giuntoli, Mark Dacascos, Kelly Hu, Michael Jai White, James Hong, Eric Bauza, Grey DeLisle, Chris Cox', 'R', 'Bruce Wayne faces a deadly menace from his past, with the help of three former classmates: world-renowned martial artists Richard Dragon, Ben Turner and Lady Shiva.', 'Bruce Wayne faces a deadly menace from his past, with the help of three former classmates: world-renowned martial artists Richard Dragon, Ben Turner and Lady Shiva.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uDhnTtSxU5a8DtZdbbin3aZmkmU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:732450'),
  ('680554547832732501', 'Batman: Strange Days', 2014, 'Action, Animation', 'Bruce Timm', 'Bruce Timm', 'Kevin Conroy, Brian George, Tara Strong, Bruce Timm', null, 'A lost tale from Batman''s past, the Dark Knight tracks a strange giant to the mysterious lair of Hugo Strange.', 'A lost tale from Batman''s past, the Dark Knight tracks a strange giant to the mysterious lair of Hugo Strange.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/doNcszmSj14ik6owOlGx5Ul9hwC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:264170'),
  ('471082238609587136', 'Batman: The Doom That Came to Gotham', 2023, 'Animation, Fantasy, Action, Mystery', 'Sam Liu, Christopher Berkeley', 'Jase Ricci', 'David Giuntoli, Patrick Fabian, John DiMaggio, Karan Brar, Navid Negahban, Darin De Paul, Emily O''Brien, Christopher Gorham', 'PG-13', 'Explorer Bruce Wayne accidentally unleashes an ancient evil, and returns to Gotham after being away for two decades. There, Batman battles Lovecraftian supernatural forces and encounters allies and enemies such as Green Arrow, Ra''s al Ghul, Mr. Freeze, Killer Croc, Two-Face and James Gordon.', 'Explorer Bruce Wayne accidentally unleashes an ancient evil, and returns to Gotham after being away for two decades. There, Batman battles Lovecraftian supernatural forces and encounters allies and enemies such as Green Arrow, Ra''s al Ghul, Mr. Freeze, Killer Croc, Two-Face and James Gordon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sKWN5ZzDxnfVixUavs09HfBCCA3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1003579'),
  ('97404598974213689', 'Batman: The Killing Joke', 2016, 'Animation, Action, Crime, Drama', 'Seigo Kitazawa, Isamitsu Kashima, Kazuyoshi Takeuchi', 'Brian Azzarello', 'Kevin Conroy, Mark Hamill, Tara Strong, Ray Wise, John DiMaggio, Robin Atkin Downes, Brian George, JP Karliak', 'R', 'As Batman hunts for the escaped Joker, the Clown Prince of Crime attacks the Gordon family to prove a diabolical point mirroring his own fall into madness.', 'As Batman hunts for the escaped Joker, the Clown Prince of Crime attacks the Gordon family to prove a diabolical point mirroring his own fall into madness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lrQ3LeNIN0nmviZ692seNBUl1Pq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:382322'),
  ('431387505670175666', 'Batman: The Long Halloween, Part One', 2021, 'Animation, Mystery, Action, Crime', 'Chris Palmer', 'Tim Sheridan', 'Jensen Ackles, Josh Duhamel, Naya Rivera, Billy Burke, Jack Quaid, Titus Welliver, Troy Baker, Frances Callier', 'PG-13', 'Following a brutal series of murders taking place on Halloween, Thanksgiving, and Christmas, Gotham City''s young vigilante known as the Batman sets out to pursue the mysterious serial killer alongside police officer James Gordon and district attorney Harvey Dent.', 'Following a brutal series of murders taking place on Halloween, Thanksgiving, and Christmas, Gotham City''s young vigilante known as the Batman sets out to pursue the mysterious serial killer alongside police officer James Gordon and district attorney Harvey Dent.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sR7gppb0YGjwLvE6Vnj6wYv5MnW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:736073'),
  ('238552955909372551', 'Batman: The Long Halloween, Part Two', 2021, 'Animation, Mystery, Action, Crime', 'Chris Palmer', 'Tim Sheridan', 'Jensen Ackles, Josh Duhamel, Naya Rivera, Billy Burke, Titus Welliver, Troy Baker, Laila Berzins, Zach Callison', 'R', 'As Gotham City''s young vigilante, the Batman, struggles to pursue a brutal serial killer, district attorney Harvey Dent gets caught in a feud involving the criminal family of the Falcones.', 'As Gotham City''s young vigilante, the Batman, struggles to pursue a brutal serial killer, district attorney Harvey Dent gets caught in a feud involving the criminal family of the Falcones.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5X1n5q08mZ7NpNpxehMFODxfNYq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:736074'),
