  ('45033848116873840', 'Baton Out of the Bag', 1956, 'Family, Fantasy', 'Eva Mičulková, Zdeněk Maršálek, Mojmír Drvota', 'Jiří Brdečka, Jaromír Pleskot', 'Ladislav Pešek, Josef Beyvl, František Smolík, Renata Borová, Miroslav Fišák, Aleš Košnar, Irena Pejšková, Petra Pleskotová', null, 'A poor musician with a good heart, as a reward for sharing even the last piece of bread despite being hungry himself, is rewarded with a miraculous napkin on which the best delicacies appear. However, a greedy innkeeper steals it from him along with a miraculous donkey from which ducats are pouring...', 'A poor musician with a good heart, as a reward for sharing even the last piece of bread despite being hungry himself, is rewarded with a miraculous napkin on which the best delicacies appear. However, a greedy innkeeper steals it from him along with a miraculous donkey from which ducats are pouring...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yhCT8GvwXn1H4ednmwqxkRoeve3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:109980'),
  ('1143317299883130257', 'Baton Rouge', 1988, 'Thriller, Crime, Mystery, Romance', 'Rafael Moleón', 'Agustín Díaz Yanes, Rafael Moleón', 'Victoria Abril, Carmen Maura, Antonio Banderas, Ángel de Andrés López, Laura Cepeda, Eduardo Calvo, Pedro Díez del Corral, Lupe Barrado', null, 'Poor gigolo tries to frame his rich mature mistress, but gets tangled in his own wiles.', 'Poor gigolo tries to frame his rich mature mistress, but gets tangled in his own wiles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/44y8OTkb90hBOLTVoqdMXg4zpU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:253632'),
  ('1025163122263267913', 'Batrachian''s Ballad', 2016, 'Documentary', 'Leonor Teles, Leonor Teles', 'Leonor Teles', 'Leonor Teles', null, '“Once upon a time, before people came along, all the creatures were free and able to be with one another”, narrates the voiceover. “All the animals danced together and were immeasurably happy. There was only one who wasn’t invited to the celebration – the frog. In his rage about the injustice, he committed suicide.” Something Romani and frogs have in common is that they will never be unseen, or stay unnoticed. In her film, young director Leonor Teles weaves the life circumstance of Romani in Portugal today with the recollections of a yesterday. Anything but a passive observer, Teles consciously decides to participate and take up position. As a third pillar, she establishes an active applied performance art that becomes integrated in the cinematic narrative. Thereby transforming “once upon a time” into “there is”. “Afterwards, nothing will be as it was and the melody of life will have changed”, explains a voice off-camera. Golden Bear for Best Short Film 2016', '“Once upon a time, before people came along, all the creatures were free and able to be with one another”, narrates the voiceover. “All the animals danced together and were immeasurably happy. There was only one who wasn’t invited to the celebration – the frog. In his rage about the injustice, he committed suicide.” Something Romani and frogs have in common is that they will never be unseen, or stay unnoticed. In her film, young director Leonor Teles weaves the life circumstance of Romani in Portugal today with the recollections of a yesterday. Anything but a passive observer, Teles consciously decides to participate and take up position. As a third pillar, she establishes an active applied performance art that becomes integrated in the cinematic narrative. Thereby transforming “once upon a time” into “there is”. “Afterwards, nothing will be as it was and the melody of life will have changed”, explains a voice off-camera. Golden Bear for Best Short Film 2016', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uLlmpzhbHa73eAlUY2vO8ET46y2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:393588'),
  ('634904405330683470', 'Bats', 1999, 'Horror, Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Louis Morneau, George Mooradian, Mike Mickens', 'John Logan', 'Lou Diamond Phillips, Dina Meyer, Bob Gunton, Leon, Carlos Jacott, David McConnell, Marcia Dangerfield, Oscar Rowland', 'PG-13', 'Genetically mutated bats escape and it''s up to a bat expert and the local sheriff to stop them.', 'Genetically mutated bats escape and it''s up to a bat expert and the local sheriff to stop them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pZRcf2BwcxWg594X6XT2jkR2qdb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10496'),
  ('907426774229360605', 'Bats', 2021, 'Horror', 'Becca Hirani, Becca Hirani, Scott Chambers', 'Scott Chambers', 'Megan Purvis, Georgia Conlan, Amanda-Jade Tyler, Ricardo Freitas, Kate Sandison, Venetia Cook, Marek Lichtenberg, Nicole Nabi', null, 'An alien virus that once wiped civilizations out in ancient times through out time has returned overnight by a mysterious thunderstorm infecting all the bats in the area causing them grow into grotesque giant carnivore man-eater monster bats and it''s up to humankind to fight for their lives to survive or history will once again repeat it''s self as it has thousands of years ago.', 'An alien virus that once wiped civilizations out in ancient times through out time has returned overnight by a mysterious thunderstorm infecting all the bats in the area causing them grow into grotesque giant carnivore man-eater monster bats and it''s up to humankind to fight for their lives to survive or history will once again repeat it''s self as it has thousands of years ago.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g79oYx9fzazEJEZn38dN7vvpV7V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:792101'),
  ('316420848810454487', 'Bats: Human Harvest', 2007, 'Horror', 'Jamie Dixon, Ivo Peitchev, Alexander Krumov', 'Brett Merryman, Chris Denk', 'Tomas Arana, David Chokachi, Michael Jace, Pollyanna McIntosh, Martin Papazian, Melissa De Sousa, Mike Straub, Todd Jensen', null, 'A group of Delta Force soldiers, accompanied by a CIA agent, are sent to the Belzan forest in Chechnya in search of a rogue American weapons researcher, Dr. Benton Walsh. As they search for Walsh''s camp, they are attacked by genetically-altered carnivorous bats. The survivors attempt to reach helicopter extraction but encounter various challenges, including Chechen rebels.', 'A group of Delta Force soldiers, accompanied by a CIA agent, are sent to the Belzan forest in Chechnya in search of a rogue American weapons researcher, Dr. Benton Walsh. As they search for Walsh''s camp, they are attacked by genetically-altered carnivorous bats. The survivors attempt to reach helicopter extraction but encounter various challenges, including Chechen rebels.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ykRiMerjJPWeVlPamivyWhBgnM0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70024'),
  ('248706247992031671', 'Battal Gazi Destanı', 1971, 'Action, War, History', 'Zeki Ökten, Atıf Yılmaz', 'Ayşe Şasa, Atıf Yılmaz', 'Cüneyt Arkın, Meral Zeren, Fikret Hakan, Reha Yurdakul, Kerim Afşar, Erden Alkan, Melek Görgün, Ali Taygun', null, 'Depiction of the life of the legendary Muslim Serdar of Malatya, Battal Gazi.', 'Depiction of the life of the legendary Muslim Serdar of Malatya, Battal Gazi.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bIjBh43oMC00ePT3SCN02sfxIKE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:405821'),
  ('514463591858015543', 'Battal Gazi''nin İntikamı', 1973, 'Adventure', 'Natuk Baytan', 'Natuk Baytan, Duygu Sağıroğlu', 'Cüneyt Arkın, Meral Zeren, Bilâl İnci, Reha Yurdakul, Nevin Nuray, İhsan Gedik, Necdet Kökeş, Sertan Acar', null, 'After the Byzantine emperor''s brother, Knight Alyon, is killed, Knight Andrea swears revenge and decides to take revenge on Battal Gazi. He first kills Ahmet Turani, then raids the village where Battal lives and the banquet hall, killing people. After killing his wife and kidnapping his beloved child, Battal Gazi takes revenge on the Byzantines. Battal Gazi, who had imposed tribute on the Byzantines and inflicted heavy losses with his incredible bravery, suffers an unexpected blow. The Byzantines set a trap for Cengaver, killing his wife and kidnapping his child. By drugging his son and hypnotizing him to turn him against his father, the Byzantines aim to pit father and son against each other. The young child is raised to believe he is the son of the Byzantine Alyon and to seek revenge on Battal Gazi, whom he believes to be his father''s killer. Battal Gazi, however, swears to rescue his son at any cost and to mete out the punishment the Byzantines deserve.', 'After the Byzantine emperor''s brother, Knight Alyon, is killed, Knight Andrea swears revenge and decides to take revenge on Battal Gazi. He first kills Ahmet Turani, then raids the village where Battal lives and the banquet hall, killing people. After killing his wife and kidnapping his beloved child, Battal Gazi takes revenge on the Byzantines. Battal Gazi, who had imposed tribute on the Byzantines and inflicted heavy losses with his incredible bravery, suffers an unexpected blow. The Byzantines set a trap for Cengaver, killing his wife and kidnapping his child. By drugging his son and hypnotizing him to turn him against his father, the Byzantines aim to pit father and son against each other. The young child is raised to believe he is the son of the Byzantine Alyon and to seek revenge on Battal Gazi, whom he believes to be his father''s killer. Battal Gazi, however, swears to rescue his son at any cost and to mete out the punishment the Byzantines deserve.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xV8BSLd73IqkKk9srT5aSWFZxIZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:452969'),
  ('887127848817380934', 'Battal Gazi''nin Oğlu', 1974, 'Action', 'Natuk Baytan, Mustafa Yılmaz', 'Duygu Sağıroğlu', 'Cüneyt Arkın, Zerrin Arbaş, Bilâl İnci, İsmail Yavuz Selekman, Hikmet Taşdemir, Nazan Adalı, Nevin Nuray, Mine Sun', null, 'When Battal Gazi is killed by Byzantine Prince, his son swears to take revenge.', 'When Battal Gazi is killed by Byzantine Prince, his son swears to take revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9eWUocLjpKj73Bx0MRPGdLJRL2n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:184980'),
  ('834943079560656102', 'Batti Gul Meter Chalu', 2018, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Shree Narayan Singh, Shrilekha Gaherwar, Ritesh Verma', 'Vipul K Rawal, Sidhartha Singh', 'Shahid Kapoor, Shraddha Kapoor, Yami Gautam Dhar, Divyendu Sharma, Farida Jalal, Sushmita Mukherjee, Samir Soni, Rajendra Chawla', null, 'The life of three friends takes a tragic turn when inflated electricity bills despite frequent power cuts in a hilly town up north of the country expose the rotten system.', 'The life of three friends takes a tragic turn when inflated electricity bills despite frequent power cuts in a hilly town up north of the country expose the rotten system.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bBobaRCN9IOEtCho3EGxA25NF5N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:496334'),
  ('566379185653370796', 'Battle', 1986, 'Animation, Action', 'Oleksandr Mukhin, Mykhailo Titov, Viktor Shchyhol', 'Mykhailo Titov, V. Goryachev', null, null, 'A man kills a toy designer and steals his latest product. The product, a mini-army complete with weapons, then wages war on the killer. The first Ukrainian screen adaptation of Stephen King''s story.', 'A man kills a toy designer and steals his latest product. The product, a mini-army complete with weapons, then wages war on the killer. The first Ukrainian screen adaptation of Stephen King''s story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/efPncfi6qMaW0TIBOD08mye7SuH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:396538'),
  ('956019039525505466', 'Battle', 2018, 'Drama, Romance, Music', 'Katarina Launing, Jørgen Johansson, Milo Rietvelt', 'Maja Lunde', 'Lisa Teige, Fabian Svegaard Tapia, Vebjørn Enger, Charlott Madeleine Utzig, Achmed Akkabi, Karen-Lise Mynster, Stig R. Amdam, Sofie Albertine Foss', 'R', 'Amalie is the girl who has everything, good looks, money, a boyfriend and a big talent of dancing. One day, her world falls apart and she moves from everything she knows. Then enter Mikael. He is dancing in the streets and Amalie joins him in dancing on the streets, dancing Battles.', 'Amalie is the girl who has everything, good looks, money, a boyfriend and a big talent of dancing. One day, her world falls apart and she moves from everything she knows. Then enter Mikael. He is dancing in the streets and Amalie joins him in dancing on the streets, dancing Battles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zfGhtAX7xe7W0ZgEcM2n6tnxgc0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:513574'),
  ('482722320390165160', 'Battle Angel', 1993, 'Animation, Action, Science Fiction', 'Hiroshi Fukutomi', 'Akinori Endo', 'Miki Ito, Shunsuke Kariya, Kappei Yamaguchi, Mami Koyama, Shigeru Chiba, Ryuuzaburou Ootomo, Kazuhiko Kishino, Koji Totani', null, 'In his travels as a bounty hunter, Hunter–Warrior and cyborg healer Ido one day discovers and repairs the remnants of a cyborg whom he names Gally. Though possessing the body of a young woman, Gally now embodies Ido''s most sophisticated and lethal cybernetic skills. The preternaturally strong, amnesiac Gally begins to forge a life for herself in a world where every day is a struggle for survival.', 'In his travels as a bounty hunter, Hunter–Warrior and cyborg healer Ido one day discovers and repairs the remnants of a cyborg whom he names Gally. Though possessing the body of a young woman, Gally now embodies Ido''s most sophisticated and lethal cybernetic skills. The preternaturally strong, amnesiac Gally begins to forge a life for herself in a world where every day is a struggle for survival.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/urvznwew7HrjrIEbK2RLaEkaezs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17189'),
  ('736195242104680765', 'Battle at Big Rock', 2019, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Colin Trevorrow, Larry Fong, Charlie Endean', 'Emily Carmichael, Colin Trevorrow', 'André Holland, Natalie Martinez, Melody Hurd, Pierson Salvador, Chris Finlayson, Noah Cole, Ethan Cole', null, 'A family''s camping trip at Big Rock National Park becomes a terrifying fight for survival.', 'A family''s camping trip at Big Rock National Park becomes a terrifying fight for survival.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/llnKykkow6C5viJsTeHfUTMQptI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:630322'),
  ('809505556419897790', 'Battle Beneath the Earth', 1967, 'Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Montgomery Tully, Pat Kelly, Kenneth Talbot', 'Charles F. Vetter', 'Kerwin Mathews, Viviane Ventura, Robert Ayres, Peter Arne, Al Mulock, Martin Benson, Peter Elliott, Earl Cameron', 'NR', 'Government officials discover a horrible plot: the Chinese are tunneling their way to the United States.', 'Government officials discover a horrible plot: the Chinese are tunneling their way to the United States.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sZjnS4iYjAvY8sW6h3AXpUNiC1T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44538'),
  ('136861435463254625', 'Battle Beyond the Stars', 1980, 'Science Fiction, Action, Adventure', 'Jimmy T. Murakami, James Sbardellati, Don Keith Opper', 'John Sayles', 'Richard Thomas, Robert Vaughn, John Saxon, George Peppard, Darlanne Fluegel, Sybil Danning, Sam Jaffe, Jeff Corey', 'PG', 'A young farmer assembles a band of diverse mercenaries to defend his peaceful planet from an evil tyrant.', 'A young farmer assembles a band of diverse mercenaries to defend his peaceful planet from an evil tyrant.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z4EYBy4Xk8yv11YgYei42v46Qol.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14460'),
  ('966885979432245368', 'Battle Beyond the Sun', 1959, 'Science Fiction', 'Francis Ford Coppola', null, 'Ivan Pereverzev, Aleksandr Shvorin, Larisa Borisenko, Konstantin Bartashevich, Gurgen Tonunts, Valentin Chernyak, Viktor Dobrovolsky, Aleksandra Popova', 'NR', 'Battle Beyond the Sun (1962) is the English-dubbed and re-edited American version of the 1959 Soviet film Nebo Zovyot (The Heavens Call). Acquired by Roger Corman and reworked by a young Francis Ford Coppola, the film relocates its Cold War “space race” to a fictional future where rival nations—North Hemis and South Hemis—compete to reach Mars first. When one crew’s mission goes awry, their rivals risk their own flight to attempt a daring rescue near the Martian moons, where strange cosmic dangers await.', 'Battle Beyond the Sun (1962) is the English-dubbed and re-edited American version of the 1959 Soviet film Nebo Zovyot (The Heavens Call). Acquired by Roger Corman and reworked by a young Francis Ford Coppola, the film relocates its Cold War “space race” to a fictional future where rival nations—North Hemis and South Hemis—compete to reach Mars first. When one crew’s mission goes awry, their rivals risk their own flight to attempt a daring rescue near the Martian moons, where strange cosmic dangers await.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uJUnkGIH74faI0hiq6D05lKkw53.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72838'),
  ('118105461588749644', 'Battle Circus', 1953, 'Drama, Romance, War', 'Al Jennings, Richard Brooks', 'Richard Brooks', 'Humphrey Bogart, June Allyson, Keenan Wynn, Robert Keith, William Campbell, Perry Sheehan, Patricia Tiernan, Adele Longmire', 'NR', 'A young Army nurse, Lt Ruth McGara, newly assigned to the 8666th MASH during the Korean War, attracts the sexual attention of the unit''s commander Dr. Jed Webbe. Major Webbe, who has a drinking problem, at first wants a "no strings" relationship. McGara is warned by the other nurses of Webbe''s womanizing ways. Despite these initial handicaps, their love flourishes against a background of war, enemy attacks, death and injury. The relationship deepens and uplifts both characters.', 'A young Army nurse, Lt Ruth McGara, newly assigned to the 8666th MASH during the Korean War, attracts the sexual attention of the unit''s commander Dr. Jed Webbe. Major Webbe, who has a drinking problem, at first wants a "no strings" relationship. McGara is warned by the other nurses of Webbe''s womanizing ways. Despite these initial handicaps, their love flourishes against a background of war, enemy attacks, death and injury. The relationship deepens and uplifts both characters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oSsRPi35KNeIUjMAXNIWDBBg7Uq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:91245'),
  ('846048600283349578', 'Battle Cries', 1999, 'Drama, Romance', 'Sólveig Anspach, Isabelle Razavet', 'Sólveig Anspach, Pierre Erwan Guillaume', 'Karin Viard, Laurent Lucas, Julien Cottereau, Claire Wauthion, Blandine Lenoir, Lili Cognard', null, 'A woman in the fourth month of her first pregnancy fights to save the baby while being treated for breast cancer.', 'A woman in the fourth month of her first pregnancy fights to save the baby while being treated for breast cancer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9UFQ1qRCklBL5EDzCz3MeVyp4pw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79268'),
  ('92212284261648880', 'Battle Cry', 1955, 'War, Drama, Romance', 'Raoul Walsh, Sidney Hickox, John Prettyman', 'Leon Uris', 'Van Heflin, Aldo Ray, Mona Freeman, James Whitmore, Nancy Olson, Raymond Massey, Tab Hunter, Anne Francis', 'NR', 'The dramatic story of US Marines in training, in combat, and in love, during World War II. The story centers on a major who guides the raw recruits from their training to combat.', 'The dramatic story of US Marines in training, in combat, and in love, during World War II. The story centers on a major who guides the raw recruits from their training to combat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ae9Wrw5vQ4WM2NqxNPlYRbfV2n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51426'),
  ('363413431145256540', 'Battle Drone', 2018, 'Science Fiction, Action', 'Mitch Gould', 'Mitch Gould, Jo Marr, Michael Philip', 'Louis Mandylor, Dominique Swain, Michael Paré, Natassia Malthe, Richard Alan Reid, Oleg Taktarov, Dan Southworth, Jason Earles', null, '6 mercenaries are hired by CIA to abduct an heir to a republic and take out an arms dealer in Moscow. They get a followup mission in Chernobyl. Treason awaits them.', '6 mercenaries are hired by CIA to abduct an heir to a republic and take out an arms dealer in Moscow. They get a followup mission in Chernobyl. Treason awaits them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dhHpbBemuyEBgcYGrmm7bHpjgdO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:508648'),
  ('63989708327029416', 'Battle for Haditha', 2007, 'Action, Adventure, Drama, History, War', 'Nick Broomfield, Mark Wolf, Barney Broomfield', 'Nick Broomfield, Marc Hoeferlin, Anna Telford', 'Matthew Knoll, Elliott Ruiz, Eric Mehalacopoulos, Nathan De La Cruz, Andrew McLaren, Jase Willette, Thomas Hennessy, Falah Abraheem Flayeh', null, 'An investigation of the massacre of 24 men, women and children in Haditha, Iraq allegedly shot by 4 U.S. Marines in retaliation for the death of a U.S. Marine killed by a roadside bomb. The movie follows the story of the Marines of Kilo Company, an Iraqi family, and the insurgents who plant the roadside bomb.', 'An investigation of the massacre of 24 men, women and children in Haditha, Iraq allegedly shot by 4 U.S. Marines in retaliation for the death of a U.S. Marine killed by a roadside bomb. The movie follows the story of the Marines of Kilo Company, an Iraqi family, and the insurgents who plant the roadside bomb.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jHyRWich4t0CQtgHiN7nnrbcEVv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14111'),
  ('652059109617571701', 'Battle for Saipan', 2022, 'War, History, Action', 'Brandon Slagle, Niccolo De La Fere', 'Brandon Slagle', 'Casper Van Dien, Jeff Fahey, Louis Mandylor, Jennifer Wenger, Devanny Pinn, Natalya Nikolaeva, Eoin O''Brien, Josh Riley', 'R', 'On July 7, 1944, a U.S. Army hospital on the remote island of Saipan is overrun by Japanese forces during a relentless attack. Outgunned and surrounded by the enemy, a lone medic puts it all on the line to lead a band of wounded soldiers to safety.', 'On July 7, 1944, a U.S. Army hospital on the remote island of Saipan is overrun by Japanese forces during a relentless attack. Outgunned and surrounded by the enemy, a lone medic puts it all on the line to lead a band of wounded soldiers to safety.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9N3KwhzBCcqmFcqHpPCsjqfym9M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1037644'),
  ('513249975767651327', 'Battle for Sevastopol', 2015, 'War, Drama, Romance', 'Varvara Filipchuk, Natalia Domeretskaya, Taras Shapoval', 'Maxim Budarin, Maxim Dankevich, Leonid Korin', 'Yulia Peresild, Evgeny Tsyganov, Natella Abeleva-Taganova, Nikita Tarasov, Joan Blackham, Polina Pakhomova, Oleg Vasilkov, Sergey Radchenko', null, 'The story of Lyudmila Pavlichenko, the most successful female sniper in history.', 'The story of Lyudmila Pavlichenko, the most successful female sniper in history.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cURuQIcuJ5U8ToPJByqytaIpL7U.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:332270'),
  ('697511591685812168', 'Battle For SkyArk', 2015, 'Family, Science Fiction, Action, Adventure', 'Simon Hung, Hiroyuki Haga, Louis Joseph Comeau IV', 'Guy Malim, Simon Hung', 'Garrett Coffey, Caon Mortenson, Riley Jane, Taylor Coliee, Luke Davis, Chantal Thuy, Mike Michaels', 'PG-13', 'In the near future the earth has become desolate and dangerous. Now inhabited by by a mysterious race of creatures, humanity has been forced to find refuge in the SkyArk, a man-made city in the sky. As the population grows, space becomes scarce and only the rich and powerful can stay, dumping the poor and orphaned of SkyArk to the abandoned earth.', 'In the near future the earth has become desolate and dangerous. Now inhabited by by a mysterious race of creatures, humanity has been forced to find refuge in the SkyArk, a man-made city in the sky. As the population grows, space becomes scarce and only the rich and powerful can stay, dumping the poor and orphaned of SkyArk to the abandoned earth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cb2t0c07LP2lmP1URmXB3AUMWdq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:335077'),
  ('548471282207205271', 'Battle for Terra', 2007, 'Action, Adventure, Animation, Science Fiction', 'Aristomenis Tsirbas', 'Evan Spiliotopoulos', 'Evan Rachel Wood, Brian Cox, James Garner, Chris Evans, Danny Glover, Amanda Peet, David Cross, Justin Long', 'PG', 'A peaceful alien planet faces annihilation, as the homeless remainder of the human race sets its eyes on Terra. Mala, a rebellious Terrian teenager, will do everything she can to stop it.', 'A peaceful alien planet faces annihilation, as the homeless remainder of the human race sets its eyes on Terra. Mala, a rebellious Terrian teenager, will do everything she can to stop it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iAcPYIsYwFqAyY7KctWkkdkJGhI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16873'),
  ('1105729427041258090', 'Battle for the Lost Planet', 1986, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Brett Piper', 'Brett Piper', 'Matt Mitler, Denise Coward, Joe Gentissi, Bill MacGlaughlin, Saunder Finard, Helene Michele Martin, Robin Lovett, Mark Deshaies', null, 'To escape his captors an industrial spy hijacks a space shuttle only to find the controls malfunctioning. Catapulting through outerspace, he sights alien battleships approaching earth. Many years later when the arc of his flight path returns him to earth, he discovers the planet is completely under alien domination, totally devastated by thermo-nuclear battles. Desperate and alone, he searches for any human existence. Finding a group of survivors, together they fight the aliens to save mankind.', 'To escape his captors an industrial spy hijacks a space shuttle only to find the controls malfunctioning. Catapulting through outerspace, he sights alien battleships approaching earth. Many years later when the arc of his flight path returns him to earth, he discovers the planet is completely under alien domination, totally devastated by thermo-nuclear battles. Desperate and alone, he searches for any human existence. Finding a group of survivors, together they fight the aliens to save mankind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x6wNDKNfJKArLjl7QBMFI6uMMiL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:214391'),
  ('546450499961917480', 'Battle for the Planet of the Apes', 1973, 'Action, Science Fiction', 'J. Lee Thompson, Richard H. Kline, Ric Rondell', 'John William Corrington, Joyce Hooper Corrington', 'Roddy McDowall, Natalie Trundy, Austin Stoker, Severn Darden, Claude Akins, Paul Williams, Richard Eastham, Lew Ayres', 'G', 'The fifth and final episode in the Planet of the Apes series. After the collapse of human civilization, a community of intelligent apes led by Caesar lives in harmony with a group of humans. Gorilla General Aldo tries to cause an ape civil war and a community of human mutants who live beneath a destroyed city try to conquer those whom they perceive as enemies. All leading to the finale.', 'The fifth and final episode in the Planet of the Apes series. After the collapse of human civilization, a community of intelligent apes led by Caesar lives in harmony with a group of humans. Gorilla General Aldo tries to cause an ape civil war and a community of human mutants who live beneath a destroyed city try to conquer those whom they perceive as enemies. All leading to the finale.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dP5dYjLp5p2CG103cJMio4Nj29d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1705'),
  ('543362740358636148', 'Battle for the Western Front', 2022, 'War', 'Aaron Huggett', 'Aaron Huggett', 'Michael Lake, Christopher Cordell, Sylvain Plasse, Somerville Black, Aaron Huggett, Corey Chainey, Sam Biskey, Julian Seguin', null, 'Inspired by Canuck WWI flying ace Billy Bishop, two young soldiers crash the front lines in August 1918. With the Allies detained, their platoon must desperately hold out alongside legendary Anishinaabe sniper Francis "Peggy" Pegahmagabow.', 'Inspired by Canuck WWI flying ace Billy Bishop, two young soldiers crash the front lines in August 1918. With the Allies detained, their platoon must desperately hold out alongside legendary Anishinaabe sniper Francis "Peggy" Pegahmagabow.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oICQpXrmszXvw0t95isR559J6IL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1041317'),
  ('903435555306397453', 'Battle Girl: The Living Dead in Tokyo Bay', 1991, 'Science Fiction, Horror, Action', 'Kazuo Komizu, Kazuo Komizu', 'Hitoshi Matsuyama', 'Cutie Suzuki, Keralino Sandorovich, Ryo Narushima, Kenji Ohtsuki, Masami Yoshida, Shinobu Kandori, Chieko Suzuki, Tomoko Sawai', null, 'A meteor lands in Japan and the fallout creates a “shield” around Tokyo, encasing the city in a foggy darkness. A state of martial law is declared. People are in a panic as violent crime and corruption spreads throughout the region and punk gangs are ruling the streets. As if things weren’t bad enough, a chemical reaction from the meteor unleashes a deadly virus and now the dead are coming back to life as flesh-eating zombies!', 'A meteor lands in Japan and the fallout creates a “shield” around Tokyo, encasing the city in a foggy darkness. A state of martial law is declared. People are in a panic as violent crime and corruption spreads throughout the region and punk gangs are ruling the streets. As if things weren’t bad enough, a chemical reaction from the meteor unleashes a deadly virus and now the dead are coming back to life as flesh-eating zombies!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Adfbmy5s7lw4j6ErIEQDYnJhqEl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56814'),
  ('568250518954394835', 'Battle Hymn', 1957, 'Drama, War', 'Douglas Sirk, Russell Metty', 'Vincent B. Evans, Charles Grayson', 'Rock Hudson, Anna Kashfi, Dan Duryea, Don DeFore, Martha Hyer, Jock Mahoney, Alan Hale Jr., James Edwards', 'NR', 'Dean Hess, who entered the ministry to atone for bombing a German orphanage, decides he’s a failure at preaching. Rejoined to train pilots early in the Korean War, he finds Korean orphans raiding the airbase garbage. With a pretty Korean teacher, he sets up an orphanage for them and others.', 'Dean Hess, who entered the ministry to atone for bombing a German orphanage, decides he’s a failure at preaching. Rejoined to train pilots early in the Korean War, he finds Korean orphans raiding the airbase garbage. With a pretty Korean teacher, he sets up an orphanage for them and others.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4wvma37xBJJvoxnCiXNBM0ryRDm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75046'),
  ('355286981697011379', 'Battle in Outer Space', 1959, 'Science Fiction, Action', 'Hajime Koizumi, Ishirō Honda, Koji Kajita', 'Shinichi Sekizawa', 'Koreya Senda, Ryō Ikebe, Kyōko Anzai, Yoshio Tsuchiya, Leonard Stanford, Harold Conway, Hisaya Ito, Minoru Takada', null, 'In 1965, the space station JSS-3 is destroyed by a fleet of UFOs, which then begin a global siege on Earth, using rays to manipulate gravity and control the minds of men. In response, a global council meeting is held to determine the source of the attacks and prepare a rocket ship armada for a counter-attack, a true battle in outer space. . . The film is a sequel of sorts to Toho''s THE MYSTERIANS in the reprise of the Etsuko Shiraishi character of that film as its heroine. It was edited to 74 minutes for its American release.', 'In 1965, the space station JSS-3 is destroyed by a fleet of UFOs, which then begin a global siege on Earth, using rays to manipulate gravity and control the minds of men. In response, a global council meeting is held to determine the source of the attacks and prepare a rocket ship armada for a counter-attack, a true battle in outer space. . . The film is a sequel of sorts to Toho''s THE MYSTERIANS in the reprise of the Etsuko Shiraishi character of that film as its heroine. It was edited to 74 minutes for its American release.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dKAqyu8aiYlnmAHzOzJt69B6m20.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62472'),
  ('1097324995028470613', 'Battle in Seattle', 2007, 'Action, Drama', 'Stuart Townsend, Barry Ackroyd', 'Stuart Townsend', 'Martin Henderson, Michelle Rodriguez, Woody Harrelson, Charlize Theron, Jennifer Carpenter, André 3000, Ray Liotta, Connie Nielsen', 'R', 'Thousands of activists arrive in Seattle, Washington in masses to protest the WTO Ministerial Conference of 1999 (World Trade Organization). Although it began as a peaceful protest with a goal of stopping the WTO talks, it escalated into a full-scale riot and eventually, a State of Emergency that pitted protesters against the Seattle Police Department and the National Guard.', 'Thousands of activists arrive in Seattle, Washington in masses to protest the WTO Ministerial Conference of 1999 (World Trade Organization). Although it began as a peaceful protest with a goal of stopping the WTO talks, it escalated into a full-scale riot and eventually, a State of Emergency that pitted protesters against the Seattle Police Department and the National Guard.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jO8tKM4mCMXpLVd5GnmlfJByghF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13177'),
  ('646581263714133692', 'Battle of Britain', 1969, 'War, History, Action', 'Guy Hamilton, Freddie Young, Maurice Carter', 'James Kennaway, Wilfred Greatorex', 'Harry Andrews, Michael Caine, Trevor Howard, Curd Jürgens, Ian McShane, Kenneth More, Laurence Olivier, Nigel Patrick', 'G', 'In 1940, the Royal Air Force fights a desperate battle against the might of the Luftwaffe for control of the skies over Britain, thus preventing an attempted Nazi invasion.', 'In 1940, the Royal Air Force fights a desperate battle against the might of the Luftwaffe for control of the skies over Britain, thus preventing an attempted Nazi invasion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/98kyEWxcqqNrsaprUtPaQ4adsNG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11463'),
  ('172227297547686604', 'Battle of Jangsari', 2019, 'Drama, History, War', 'Kwak Kyung-taek, Kim Tae-hun, Kim Sung-hwan', 'Lee Man-hee', 'Kim Myung-min, Minho, Kim Sung-cheol, Kim In-kwon, Kwak Si-yang, Lee Jae-wook, Jang Ji-gun, Lee Ho-jung', 'NR', 'Korean War, September 1950. In order to fight the enemy forces based in the South of the peninsula, General MacArthur orders the start of the Incheon Landing Operation, deploying diversionary attacks in other locations. Without real military forces to spare, 772 very young Korean student soldiers, barely trained, are sent to Jangsari Beach, where they will face a heroic fate and discover the value of friendship. (A sequel to Operation Chromite, released in 2016.)', 'Korean War, September 1950. In order to fight the enemy forces based in the South of the peninsula, General MacArthur orders the start of the Incheon Landing Operation, deploying diversionary attacks in other locations. Without real military forces to spare, 772 very young Korean student soldiers, barely trained, are sent to Jangsari Beach, where they will face a heroic fate and discover the value of friendship. (A sequel to Operation Chromite, released in 2016.)', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/caYipV8vKfj628YKpEk3cHDc2jv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:567629'),
  ('731550692701433656', 'Battle of Kosovo', 1989, 'Drama, History, War', 'Zdravko Šotra, Radoslav Vladić', 'Ljubomir Simović', 'Gorica Popović, Vojislav Brajović, Žarko Laušević, Ljuba Tadić, Branislav Lečić, Katarina Gojković, Neda Arnerić, Ivan Bekjarev', null, 'In 1389, the Serbian prince Lazar Hrebeljanović refused to submit to the Turkish Sultan Murat, who was invading Serbia with a large army, in order to continue conquering Europe through it.', 'In 1389, the Serbian prince Lazar Hrebeljanović refused to submit to the Turkish Sultan Murat, who was invading Serbia with a large army, in order to continue conquering Europe through it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nHs8Q67k87eNBGuekRQnKPG6CGM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:108107'),
  ('7638992435292827', 'Battle of Los Angeles', 2011, 'Science Fiction, Action', 'Mark Atkins, Mark Atkins, Dan Golden', 'Mark Atkins', 'Kel Mitchell, Nia Peeples, Dylan Vox, Gerald Webb, Theresa June-Tao, Edward DeRuiter, Robert Pike Daniel, Tim Abell', 'NR', 'In February 1942 US forces engaged an unidentified flying object above Los Angeles. Now almost 70 years later, the alien invaders have returned.', 'In February 1942 US forces engaged an unidentified flying object above Los Angeles. Now almost 70 years later, the alien invaders have returned.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/guOIn7uP2tVVz6IcE3byMOwY13x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59197'),
  ('236748998417512703', 'Battle of Love', 1999, 'Drama, Romance', 'James Ha Chim-Si, Stephan Yip Tin-Hang', 'Shek Hon-Kit', 'Alan Chan Kwok-Kuen, Tom Poon, Ha Hung, Philip Keung Ho-Man, Houshou Nana, Wong Mei-Fan, Johnny Wang Lung-Wei, Tsang Yin', null, 'Wei Yangsheng went around looking for the whereabouts of his offspring''s roots. When he came to the vicinity of Maoxi County, there was a loud voice outside the temple. It turned out that the nearby "Yunyu Villa" was pursuing a flower picker. Wei Yangsheng was misunderstood as a thief, so he fisted first. The owner, Nangong Yi, sees Weiyangsheng''s talents at first glance, and he can''t help but tolerate him not to kill, and instead he is imprisoned in secret. Wei Yangsheng was shocked for fear that the owner would have "special hobbies".', 'Wei Yangsheng went around looking for the whereabouts of his offspring''s roots. When he came to the vicinity of Maoxi County, there was a loud voice outside the temple. It turned out that the nearby "Yunyu Villa" was pursuing a flower picker. Wei Yangsheng was misunderstood as a thief, so he fisted first. The owner, Nangong Yi, sees Weiyangsheng''s talents at first glance, and he can''t help but tolerate him not to kill, and instead he is imprisoned in secret. Wei Yangsheng was shocked for fear that the owner would have "special hobbies".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iatd8qgJhuO94NKNZ02huBdnNTd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:731141'),
  ('1099771925443097854', 'Battle of Memories', 2017, 'Drama, Mystery, Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Charlie Lam Chi-Kin, Yang Jiang, Haiping Gu', 'Ren Peng, Leste Chen', 'Huang Bo, Xu Jinglei, Duan Yihong, Patricio Antonio Liang, Yang Zishan, Hsu Wei-ning, Eoin O''Brien, Wang Zhener', 'NR', 'A man becomes involved in a memory manipulation operation to try and regain lost memories. He thinks the exercise may help repair his failed marriage, but accidentally ends up with the mind of a serial killer.', 'A man becomes involved in a memory manipulation operation to try and regain lost memories. He thinks the exercise may help repair his failed marriage, but accidentally ends up with the mind of a serial killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2bykI8po16H8a3zQMOsOFFARw3d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:449306'),
  ('133268754349143386', 'Battle of the Amazons', 1973, 'Action, Fantasy', 'Alfonso Brescia, Franco Pasquetto, Benito Stefanelli', 'Mario Amendola, Bruno Corbucci, Fernando Vizcaíno Casas', 'Lincoln Tate, Paola Tedesco, Mirta Miller, Benito Stefanelli, Genie Woods, Solvi Stübing, Alberto Dell''Acqua, Roberto Alessandri', null, 'A tribe of vicious female warriors terrorizes the countryside, and especially the males, until one day the men and some local villagers decide to fight back.', 'A tribe of vicious female warriors terrorizes the countryside, and especially the males, until one day the men and some local villagers decide to fight back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l1lcsdRbvQQc5IWCoYuS3VymF5f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:96106'),
  ('675599396026756572', 'Battle of the Brave', 2004, 'Drama, History, Romance, War', 'Jean Beaudin, Louis de Ernsted, Marc Larose', 'Pierre Billon', 'Noémie Godin-Vigneau, David La Haye, Juliette Gosselin, Vincent Perez, Irène Jacob, Sébastien Huberdeau, Gérard Depardieu, Tim Roth', null, 'In the mid-18th Century, as England and France battle over control of Canada, an epic romance between a peasant woman and a trapper unfurls', 'In the mid-18th Century, as England and France battle over control of Canada, an epic romance between a peasant woman and a trapper unfurls', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p4IlppLWJdAr0V6XU1uUc7tKG6q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57709'),
  ('810138067644898416', 'Battle of the Bulge', 1965, 'Drama, History, War', 'Ken Annakin, Jack Hildyard', 'John Melson, Philip Yordan, Milton Sperling', 'Henry Fonda, Robert Shaw, Robert Ryan, Dana Andrews, Telly Savalas, George Montgomery, Ty Hardin, Pier Angeli', 'NR', 'In the winter of 1944, the Allied Armies stand ready to invade Germany at the coming of a New Year. To prevent it, Hitler orders an all-out offensive to re-take French territory and capture the major port city of Antwerp.', 'In the winter of 1944, the Allied Armies stand ready to invade Germany at the coming of a New Year. To prevent it, Hitler orders an all-out offensive to re-take French territory and capture the major port city of Antwerp.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vNEw6H6St25991C0a8r6AQKTdqi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13524'),
  ('117044595095244145', 'Battle of the Bulge: Winter War', 2020, 'War, Action, Drama, Thriller', 'Apostolos Gliarmis, Steven Luke, Joseph Loeffler', 'Steven Luke', 'Brittany Benjamin, Jordan McFadden, Billy Zane, Steven Luke, Tom Berenger, Kathleen Timberman, Aaron Courteau, Andrew Stecker', 'NR', 'Lt. Robert Cappa and his platoon of 2nd Infantry Division soldiers must defend a vital supply depot from being captured by attacking German soldiers.', 'Lt. Robert Cappa and his platoon of 2nd Infantry Division soldiers must defend a vital supply depot from being captured by attacking German soldiers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/em2NY3recLURRJ4d6QuXGNN5H2a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:755529'),
  ('62492610424131988', 'Battle of the Classes', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Michel Leclerc, Alexis Kavyrchine, Anne Giraudau', 'Baya Kasmi, Michel Leclerc', 'Leïla Bekhti, Édouard Baer, Ramzy Bedia, Eye Haïdara, Laurent Capelluto, Sébastien Chassagne, Tom Levy, Baya Kasmi', null, 'As everyone knows, children make no difference between social classes, skin colors or religions. But then why does Corentin, Paul and Sofia''s nine-year-old son, only have friends like him at Bagnolet''s school? And when his friends all leave for a private school in Paris, his parents are frightened. From now on, Corentin is the only one in his class. But the only what?', 'As everyone knows, children make no difference between social classes, skin colors or religions. But then why does Corentin, Paul and Sofia''s nine-year-old son, only have friends like him at Bagnolet''s school? And when his friends all leave for a private school in Paris, his parents are frightened. From now on, Corentin is the only one in his class. But the only what?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mHIeGGpbSbtW2pVuap4vdewyhvQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:570132'),
  ('504767336983736669', 'Battle of the Coral Sea', 1959, 'War, Drama, Romance', 'Paul Wendkos', 'Daniel B. Ullman, Stephen Kandel', 'Cliff Robertson, Gia Scala, Teru Shimada, Patricia Cutts, Gene Blakely, Rian Garrick, L.Q. Jones, Robin Hughes', 'PG', 'A US submarine and its crew are captured by the Japanese on the eve of a major WWII battle.', 'A US submarine and its crew are captured by the Japanese on the eve of a major WWII battle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5lays4bkpjNRS2pS419DF5ALHOU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48412'),
  ('594057209233387325', 'Battle of the Damned', 2013, 'Action, Science Fiction, Adventure', 'Roger Chingirian, Christopher Hatton', 'Christopher Hatton', 'Dolph Lundgren, Matt Doran, Melanie Zanetti, David Field, Lydia Look, Broadus Mattison, Jen Sung, Oda Maria', null, 'Following a deadly viral outbreak, private military soldier Max Gatling leads a handful of survivors and a ragtag band of robots against an army of the infected.', 'Following a deadly viral outbreak, private military soldier Max Gatling leads a handful of survivors and a ragtag band of robots against an army of the infected.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xmGJwTaQ8XTnW4EPNag6Eu2KaTL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:185471'),
  ('864000732492804519', 'Battle of the Godfathers', 1973, 'Drama, Action, Thriller', 'Jürgen Roland, Klaus Werner', 'Werner Jörg Lüddecke, August Rieger', 'Herbert Fleischmann, Henry Silva, Patrizia Gori, Horst Janson, Véronique Vendell, Raf Baldassarre, Ermelinda De Felice, Sonja Jeannine', null, 'Hamburg business man Otto Westermann is also the boss of organized crime in the city. His reign as godfather is in danger, though, as an ambitious Sicilian mafioso enters the fray. His goal is clear and simple: he wants to take over Hamburg. But Westermann isn''t as easy to defeat as the Sicilian expects. And soon Hamburg is on the verge of a bloody mob war.', 'Hamburg business man Otto Westermann is also the boss of organized crime in the city. His reign as godfather is in danger, though, as an ambitious Sicilian mafioso enters the fray. His goal is clear and simple: he wants to take over Hamburg. But Westermann isn''t as easy to defeat as the Sicilian expects. And soon Hamburg is on the verge of a bloody mob war.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rcG0CQxgSQ9d07omrrTGi6iD1Vm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:138760'),
  ('562075199470067836', 'Battle of the Sexes', 2017, 'Drama, Comedy, History', 'Jonathan Dayton, Valerie Faris, Linus Sandgren', 'Simon Beaufoy', 'Emma Stone, Steve Carell, Andrea Riseborough, Sarah Silverman, Bill Pullman, Elisabeth Shue, Alan Cumming, Austin Stowell', 'PG-13', 'The true story of the 1973 tennis match between world number one Billie Jean King and ex-champ and serial hustler Bobby Riggs.', 'The true story of the 1973 tennis match between world number one Billie Jean King and ex-champ and serial hustler Bobby Riggs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fWy0A3VojTCb0S2MKtEJjpquubF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:369192'),
  ('659459697472185262', 'Battle of the Warriors', 2006, 'Action, War, Adventure', 'Jacob Cheung Chi-Leung, Yoshitaka Sakamoto', 'Jacob Cheung Chi-Leung', 'Andy Lau, Ahn Sung-ki, Fan Bingbing, Choi Si-won, Wang Zhiwen, Chin Siu-Ho, Wu Ma, Nicky Wu', 'R', 'In 370 B.C, China was separated as seven nations and several other small tribes, one of these being the city state of Liang. The nation of Zhao is led by the terrifying Xiang Yangzhong who orders his troops to conquer the small city. Leaping to the defense of the people of Liang is ''Ge Li'' from the Mo-Tsu tribe, their last hope from the terrors of Yangzhong''s troops.', 'In 370 B.C, China was separated as seven nations and several other small tribes, one of these being the city state of Liang. The nation of Zhao is led by the terrifying Xiang Yangzhong who orders his troops to conquer the small city. Leaping to the defense of the people of Liang is ''Ge Li'' from the Mo-Tsu tribe, their last hope from the terrors of Yangzhong''s troops.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/90DnSPn76GJVBlkcqqUR4ssMtH4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14808'),
  ('480134154220590691', 'Battle of the Wolf', 2026, 'Action', 'Jingle Ma Choh-Sing, Jingle Ma Choh Sing', 'Yuez Zeng', 'Chen Fei, Ken Law Ho-Ming, Jingmu Li, Luan Mingyuan, Wang Xi Ran', null, 'Instructor Zhang Zhiyong and his wife Yang Man encountered a terrorist attack by international criminals on their flight back to China from a West Asian country. Displaying extraordinary courage and determination, Zhang successfully protected his wife, child, and fellow passengers, thwarted the terrorists'' plot, and safely led his compatriots back to their homeland.', 'Instructor Zhang Zhiyong and his wife Yang Man encountered a terrorist attack by international criminals on their flight back to China from a West Asian country. Displaying extraordinary courage and determination, Zhang successfully protected his wife, child, and fellow passengers, thwarted the terrorists'' plot, and safely led his compatriots back to their homeland.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fm.media-amazon.com%2Fimages%2FM%2FMV5BM2M1Nzk4MmQtYjc2MC00N2VlLTg1ZjctNTljZGZiOWQ5MDE2XkEyXkFqcGc%40._V1_.jpg', 'plex:movie:battle-of-the-wolf-2026'),
  ('881112449646263106', 'Battle of the Worlds', 1961, 'Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Antonio Margheriti, Thomas Sagone', 'Ennio De Concini', 'Claude Rains, Bill Carter, Maya Brent, Umberto Orsini, Jacqueline Derval, Carol Danell, John Stacy, Jim Dolen', null, 'A stray planet on a collision course with Earth instead takes orbit around our blue marble. What seems like a dead planet suddenly launches a fleet of flying saucers which attack our space fleets.', 'A stray planet on a collision course with Earth instead takes orbit around our blue marble. What seems like a dead planet suddenly launches a fleet of flying saucers which attack our space fleets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pB0PFki9xYEg0xnPCczT7wjQOTT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22726'),
  ('522976712821683623', 'Battle of the Year', 2013, 'Music, Drama', 'Benson Lee, Michael Barrett', 'Chris Parker', 'Josh Holloway, Laz Alonso, Josh Peck, Caity Lotz, Chris Brown, Ivan ''Flipz'' Velez, Terrence J, Sway Calloway', 'PG-13', 'A down-on-his-luck coach is hired to prepare a team of the best American dancers for an international tournament that attracts all the best crews from around the world, but the Americans haven''t won in fifteen years.', 'A down-on-his-luck coach is hired to prepare a team of the best American dancers for an international tournament that attracts all the best crews from around the world, but the Americans haven''t won in fifteen years.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dB4L9yt9eFbVhx8tSuDUHoMeN4x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:109417'),
  ('396498753228462148', 'Battle Over Britain', 2023, 'War', 'Callum Burn', 'Callum Burn, Andrew Burn', 'Arnold Voysey, Vin Hawke, Hannah Harris, Chris Clynes, Tom Gordon, Micky David', null, 'A young pilot, fresh out of training, is called to join a Flight while they wait for the call to scramble. Throughout a single day, he witnesses the skies of southern England filled with deadly dog fights, and after every exhausting battle the men return to their dispersal hut, only to find another of their number missing. Unwilling to surrender, the pilot and his comrades unite to take to the skies once more, determined to defend not only the airfield, but their entire country.', 'A young pilot, fresh out of training, is called to join a Flight while they wait for the call to scramble. Throughout a single day, he witnesses the skies of southern England filled with deadly dog fights, and after every exhausting battle the men return to their dispersal hut, only to find another of their number missing. Unwilling to surrender, the pilot and his comrades unite to take to the skies once more, determined to defend not only the airfield, but their entire country.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8htJ7keZTwa08aC9OKyiqaq1cNJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1136318'),
  ('700853768744887860', 'Battle Planet', 2008, 'Action, Science Fiction', 'Greg Aronowitz', 'Greg Aronowitz', 'Zack Ward, Monica May, Colleen Smith, Kevin Thompson, John Duerler, Stephen Settgast, Meg Cionni, Brea Grant', 'PG-13', 'In the not-so-distant future, Captain Jordan Strider, a Special Forces Officer in the New World Alliance, is chosen for a top-secret mission. Sent to a desolate planet, Terra 219, to arrest possible traitors to the Alliance, Strider must survive with only a government issued experimental suit as protection. He quickly learns of a plan to end all humanity.', 'In the not-so-distant future, Captain Jordan Strider, a Special Forces Officer in the New World Alliance, is chosen for a top-secret mission. Sent to a desolate planet, Terra 219, to arrest possible traitors to the Alliance, Strider must survive with only a government issued experimental suit as protection. He quickly learns of a plan to end all humanity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rhDQ8jgr75S7Pit4JQXx8cYbsmV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17571'),
  ('566879278645010725', 'Battle Royale', 2000, 'Drama, Thriller, Action', 'Kinji Fukasaku, Katsumi Yanagijima', 'Kenta Fukasaku', 'Tatsuya Fujiwara, Aki Maeda, Takeshi Kitano, Taro Yamamoto, Masanobu Ando, Ko Shibasaki, Chiaki Kuriyama, Takashi Tsukamoto', 'NR', 'In the future, the Japanese government captures a class of ninth-grade students and forces them to kill each other under the revolutionary "Battle Royale" act.', 'In the future, the Japanese government captures a class of ninth-grade students and forces them to kill each other under the revolutionary "Battle Royale" act.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aLGKAQKgzWpJ6egyWzzC11jXBRJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3176'),
  ('887529968811913060', 'Battle Royale High School', 1987, 'Animation, Action, Fantasy, Horror', 'Ichiro Itano, Takashi Watanabe, Hideaki Anno', 'Ichiro Itano', 'Kazuki Yao, Satoru Inagaki, Shin Aomori, Kazuhiko Inoue, Tomohiro Nishimura, Sakiko Tamagawa, Mari Yokoo, Michie Tomizawa', null, 'When the school Karate club''s star fighter quits and decides to go pro, he unwittingly fulfills an ancient interdimensional prophecy and becomes demon king of his dimension. Soon his high school becomes a battleground for demon slaying samurai, interplanetary law enforcement, and even his own traitorous demon minions. Well animated fight scenes ensue.', 'When the school Karate club''s star fighter quits and decides to go pro, he unwittingly fulfills an ancient interdimensional prophecy and becomes demon king of his dimension. Soon his high school becomes a battleground for demon slaying samurai, interplanetary law enforcement, and even his own traitorous demon minions. Well animated fight scenes ensue.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k5j0GR9Gc3fkHS5deIrXKWOBqGJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56609'),
  ('1145233521354059659', 'Battle Royale II: Requiem', 2003, 'Action, Thriller', 'Kenta Fukasaku, Kinji Fukasaku', 'Kenta Fukasaku, Norio Kida', 'Shugo Oshinari, Ai Maeda, Tatsuya Fujiwara, Ayana Sakai, Takeshi Kitano, Natsuki Kato, Aki Maeda, Riki Takeuchi', 'NR', 'It''s three years after the events of the original Battle Royale, and Shuya Nanahara is now an internationally-known terrorist determined to bring down the government. His terrorist group, Wild Seven, stages an attack that levels several buildings in Tokyo on Christmas Day, killing 8000 people. In order for the government to study the benefits of "teamwork", the new students work in pairs, with their collars electronically linked so that if one of them is killed, the other dies as well. They must kill Nanahara in three days - or die.', 'It''s three years after the events of the original Battle Royale, and Shuya Nanahara is now an internationally-known terrorist determined to bring down the government. His terrorist group, Wild Seven, stages an attack that levels several buildings in Tokyo on Christmas Day, killing 8000 people. In order for the government to study the benefits of "teamwork", the new students work in pairs, with their collars electronically linked so that if one of them is killed, the other dies as well. They must kill Nanahara in three days - or die.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sKoVS6wVmIY0fCDcJYZZ1y3yOK3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3177'),
  ('683271640965912154', 'Battle Scars', 2020, 'War', 'Samuel Gonzalez Jr., Zachary Leazer, Ezequiel Arribas', 'Christopher Lang, Samuel Gonzalez Jr.', 'Jonathan Peacy, Arturo Castro, Arielle Brachfeld, Jason Vail, Kit Lang, Emily Trosclair, Noah Forrest, Meghan Hemingway', null, 'After his best friend is drafted to fight in Vietnam, a young man must grapple with the reality of life before and after war.', 'After his best friend is drafted to fight in Vietnam, a young man must grapple with the reality of life before and after war.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oQjiSqSN4XJYtgrswLSpWrHZQta.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:727790'),
  ('1141039030750835101', 'Battle Star Wars', 2020, 'Science Fiction, Action', 'Eldar Erlich, Kyle Hardy, Brendan Petrizzo', 'Jeremy M. Inman', 'Alyson Gorske, Aimee Stolte, Justin Berti, Benedikt Sebastian, Luke Fattorusso, Alissa Filoramo, Canyon Prince, Ross Forte', null, 'When the leader of the evil Coalition threatens to destroy a Rebel planet for its resources, his daughter will have no choice but to join the Rebel side and fight for what is right.', 'When the leader of the evil Coalition threatens to destroy a Rebel planet for its resources, his daughter will have no choice but to join the Rebel side and fight for what is right.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ocA0ECiFoB4d1HITyEDQlLk7x84.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:667574'),
  ('351232075584777505', 'Battle Under Orion', 2009, 'Drama, Action, War', 'Tetsuo Shinohara, Satoshi Murakawa, Hideo Yamamoto', 'Harutoshi Fukui, Kenzaburô Iida, Yasuo Hasegawa', 'Hiroshi Tamaki, Keiko Kitagawa, Yoshikuni Dôchin, Yuta Hiraoka, Eisaku Yoshida, Toru Masuoka, Mitsuru Fukikoshi, Masaya Kikawada', null, 'The story of a Japanese sub''s last mission during WWII.', 'The story of a Japanese sub''s last mission during WWII.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f8XHw3q3Eek2HaT8G5QkAY7isg7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38625'),
  ('599896307977225610', 'Battle: Freestyle', 2022, 'Romance, Drama', 'Ingvild Søderlind', 'Martina Cecelia', 'Lisa Teige, Fabian Svegaard Tapia, Ellen Dorrit Petersen, Morad Aziman, Georgia May Anta, Bao Andre Nguyen, Keiona, Léa Djyl', null, 'Amalie and Mikael lead their street dance team to the finals in France but tough competition and personal distractions threaten to ruin their dreams.', 'Amalie and Mikael lead their street dance team to the finals in France but tough competition and personal distractions threaten to ruin their dreams.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6D6QumiHEhnpZG12Ibjy2BxA6n4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:785521'),
  ('4683380899420334', 'Battle: Los Angeles', 2011, 'Science Fiction, Action', 'Jonathan Liebesman, Jason Baldwin Stewart, Mara LePere-Schloop', 'Christopher Bertolini', 'Aaron Eckhart, Ramón Rodríguez, Will Rothhaar, Michael Peña, Bridget Moynahan, Noel Fisher, Joey King, Beth Keener', 'PG-13', 'When once distant UFOs become a terrifying threat and an alien invasion force begins attacking Earths major costal and riverside cities, a U.S Marine staff sergeant and his team are sent into battle only to find they must take it upon themselves to defeat an unknown enemy and protect what remains of Los Angeles.', 'When once distant UFOs become a terrifying threat and an alien invasion force begins attacking Earths major costal and riverside cities, a U.S Marine staff sergeant and his team are sent into battle only to find they must take it upon themselves to defeat an unknown enemy and protect what remains of Los Angeles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jloyGeVYZSxM9zsLFvVOWuj2ey4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44943'),
  ('864980980112756065', 'Battledogs', 2013, 'Action, Horror, Science Fiction', 'Alexander Yellen, Justin Duval', 'Shane van Dyke', 'Craig Sheffer, Kate Vernon, Dennis Haysbert, Ariana Richards, Bill Duke, Wes Studi, Ernie Hudson, Ben Anklam', null, 'When a strange werewolf virus threatens to decimate first New York and then the world, a rogue general uses the disease to create an army of super-soldiers.', 'When a strange werewolf virus threatens to decimate first New York and then the world, a rogue general uses the disease to create an army of super-soldiers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4WLRJssh4YzWokxVgk3hfSANKm8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:184712'),
  ('142405345926510696', 'Battlefield', 2024, 'Drama, History, War', 'Gianni Amelio, Paolo Giacomo Marino, Luan Amelio Ujkaj', 'Gianni Amelio, Alberto Taraglio', 'Alessandro Borghi, Gabriel Montesi, Federica Rosellini, Giovanni Scotti, Vince Vivenzio, Alberto Cracco, Luca Lazzareschi, Maria-Grazia Plos', null, 'These are the years of the First World War and Dr. Stefano Zorzi spends his days in the Exemption Clinic in a large city of Northern Italy, where he not only takes care of soldiers who arrive from the massacre of the front, but also he fights simulation and self-harm of those who hope to be dispensed, by sending them before the Military Court. If Stefano, in fact, does his utmost to heal soldiers and send them back to fight, Dr. Giulio Farradio makes them ill, or helps them to self-injure seriously enough to be exonerated. The two doctors, who went to university together and were great friends, they not only (secretly) challenge each other on a professional level, but also on the sentimental one: they are both linked to Anna, a courageous nurse with a strong character. But when the great ‘Spanish’ fever epidemic arrived in 1918, the time for love, politics and science ends up getting confused dangerously...', 'These are the years of the First World War and Dr. Stefano Zorzi spends his days in the Exemption Clinic in a large city of Northern Italy, where he not only takes care of soldiers who arrive from the massacre of the front, but also he fights simulation and self-harm of those who hope to be dispensed, by sending them before the Military Court. If Stefano, in fact, does his utmost to heal soldiers and send them back to fight, Dr. Giulio Farradio makes them ill, or helps them to self-injure seriously enough to be exonerated. The two doctors, who went to university together and were great friends, they not only (secretly) challenge each other on a professional level, but also on the sentimental one: they are both linked to Anna, a courageous nurse with a strong character. But when the great ‘Spanish’ fever epidemic arrived in 1918, the time for love, politics and science ends up getting confused dangerously...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g2lwA7YYaoAPhQZ8O8MQPNhx67s.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1174246'),
  ('557899474090988064', 'Battlefield Baseball', 2003, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Yudai Yamaguchi', 'Ryuichi Takatsu', 'Tak Sakaguchi, Atsushi Ito, Hideo Sakaki, Shoichiro Masumoto, Alex Revan, Kanae Uotani, Donpei Tsuchihira, Yoshikazu Ebisu', null, 'Battlefield Baseball is a tough game — it doesn''t end until all the members on the opposing team are dead. In this game the Gedo High team is composed of blue-faced zombies, and their opponents on the Seido High team know they don''t have a chance at beating them unless they can bring back a star pitcher who has a lethal pitch called the Super Tornado, but who has hung up his cleats and has no desire to return to the game.', 'Battlefield Baseball is a tough game — it doesn''t end until all the members on the opposing team are dead. In this game the Gedo High team is composed of blue-faced zombies, and their opponents on the Seido High team know they don''t have a chance at beating them unless they can bring back a star pitcher who has a lethal pitch called the Super Tornado, but who has hung up his cleats and has no desire to return to the game.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zBR2uo91eF4UK66eF6tMDl9Fd1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51890'),
  ('161970378522519725', 'Battlefield Earth', 2000, 'Science Fiction, Action, Adventure', 'Roger Christian, Giles Nuttgens, Walter Gasparovic', 'Corey Mandell, J.D. Shapiro', 'John Travolta, Barry Pepper, Forest Whitaker, Kim Coates, Sabine Karsenti, Christian Tessier, Sylvain Landry, Michael Byrne', 'PG-13', 'In the year 3000, man is no match for the Psychlos, a greedy, manipulative race of aliens on a quest for ultimate profit. Led by the powerful Terl, the Psychlos are stripping Earth clean of its natural resources, using the broken remnants of humanity as slaves. What is left of the human race has descended into a near primitive state. After being captured, it is up to Tyler to save mankind.', 'In the year 3000, man is no match for the Psychlos, a greedy, manipulative race of aliens on a quest for ultimate profit. Led by the powerful Terl, the Psychlos are stripping Earth clean of its natural resources, using the broken remnants of humanity as slaves. What is left of the human race has descended into a near primitive state. After being captured, it is up to Tyler to save mankind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wXCRuBHdJ5aTFQdsuGJFXNdo79T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5491'),
  ('196507924432789806', 'Battlefield Heroes', 2011, 'War, Comedy, History', 'Lee Joon-ik, Chung Chung-hoon, Bae Il-hyuck', 'Cho Chul-hyun, O Seung-hyeon', 'Jung Jin-young, Lee Moon-sik, Ryu Seung-ryong, Hwang Jung-min, Yoon Je-moon, Sun Woo-sun, Kim Min-sang, Lee Kwang-soo', null, 'This story unfolds 8 years after ''Battle of Hwangsanbeol'', which destroyed Baekjae, when Silla-Tang Dynasty union attacks Goguryeo.', 'This story unfolds 8 years after ''Battle of Hwangsanbeol'', which destroyed Baekjae, when Silla-Tang Dynasty union attacks Goguryeo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jV6ddUVrgH1YJlAsvGtm5g7plqK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65881'),
  ('404179106424832074', 'Battlefield: Fall of The World', 2022, 'Action, Science Fiction', 'Huang Zhaosheng', 'Dada Huang, Huang Zhaosheng', 'Ren Tianye, Zhang Zhilu, Choenyi Tsering, He Zhuoen, Liu Jianwei, Alexandre Robillard', null, 'Earth has completely succumbed to an alien invasion, and the planet, which was once everyone''s home, has become a hell. To stop the monsters from invading, the guard troops formed by different countries have disregarded their personal safety to defend what is left. Cheng Ling, who barely survived the times by scavenging from the garbage, met Zhu Rong''s team when he was being attacked by an alien hellhound. With the help of Gao Ren and the others, Cheng Ling believes that it''s destiny that leads him here, so he decided to accept the mission to destroy the aliens'' evil plans and search for new hope for humanity. Along the way, the team was encircled by the plunderers and chased by hellhounds. They met Dr. Dojepamo, who had mastered the technology to subdue the hellhounds. When the group finally arrived at the resistance point, they discovered that the so-called resistance point was just a trap set by the hellhound hunters. The real danger has just begun...', 'Earth has completely succumbed to an alien invasion, and the planet, which was once everyone''s home, has become a hell. To stop the monsters from invading, the guard troops formed by different countries have disregarded their personal safety to defend what is left. Cheng Ling, who barely survived the times by scavenging from the garbage, met Zhu Rong''s team when he was being attacked by an alien hellhound. With the help of Gao Ren and the others, Cheng Ling believes that it''s destiny that leads him here, so he decided to accept the mission to destroy the aliens'' evil plans and search for new hope for humanity. Along the way, the team was encircled by the plunderers and chased by hellhounds. They met Dr. Dojepamo, who had mastered the technology to subdue the hellhounds. When the group finally arrived at the resistance point, they discovered that the so-called resistance point was just a trap set by the hellhound hunters. The real danger has just begun...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jJL2KJNUxxm7SIRBFN56j6Th5ES.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1022811'),
  ('333083103356111415', 'Battleground', 1949, 'Action, Adventure, Drama, War', 'William A. Wellman, Paul Vogel', 'Robert Pirosh', 'Van Johnson, John Hodiak, Ricardo Montalban, George Murphy, Marshall Thompson, Jerome Courtland, Don Taylor, Bruce Cowling', null, 'Members of the U.S. Army''s 101st Airborne Division are fighting for their country amidst the rugged terrain of Bastogne, Belgium, in December 1944. Holley and his American compatriots have already seen one of their own, Roderigues, perish under enemy fire. The men try to rebuff another series of Nazi attacks, but what they really need is a change in the weather. Without clear skies, they''ll never get the air support they need.', 'Members of the U.S. Army''s 101st Airborne Division are fighting for their country amidst the rugged terrain of Bastogne, Belgium, in December 1944. Holley and his American compatriots have already seen one of their own, Roderigues, perish under enemy fire. The men try to rebuff another series of Nazi attacks, but what they really need is a change in the weather. Without clear skies, they''ll never get the air support they need.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qSrcs7zmF61aRtzmOVPxeBBowap.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31623'),
  ('7825946063745162', 'Battles Without Honor and Humanity', 1973, 'Drama, Crime, Action', 'Kinji Fukasaku, Sadaji Yoshida, Akira Shimizu', 'Kazuo Kasahara', 'Bunta Sugawara, Hiroki Matsukata, Kunie Tanaka, Eiko Nakamura, Tsunehiko Watase, Gorō Ibuki, Nobuo Kaneko, Toshie Kimura', null, 'In the teeming black markets of postwar Japan, Shozo Hirono and his buddies find themselves in a new war between factious and ambitious yakuza.', 'In the teeming black markets of postwar Japan, Shozo Hirono and his buddies find themselves in a new war between factious and ambitious yakuza.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qQmEEj5B3bTQI8Dq8u4zq80Z7JL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34326'),
  ('693377356635531482', 'Battles Without Honor and Humanity: Deadly Fight in Hiroshima', 1973, 'Drama, Crime, Action', 'Kinji Fukasaku, Sadaji Yoshida, Akira Shimizu', 'Kazuo Kasahara', 'Bunta Sugawara, Kinya Kitaoji, Meiko Kaji, Sonny Chiba, Hiroshi Nawa, Mikio Narita, Gin Maeda, Asao Koike', null, 'Repeatedly beat to a pulp by gamblers, cops, and gangsters, lone wolf Shoji Yamanaka finally finds a home as a Muraoka family hitman and falls in love with boss Muraoka''s niece. Meanwhile, the ambitions of mad dog Katsutoshi Otomo draws our series'' hero, Shozo Hirono, and the other yakuza into a new round of bloodshed.', 'Repeatedly beat to a pulp by gamblers, cops, and gangsters, lone wolf Shoji Yamanaka finally finds a home as a Muraoka family hitman and falls in love with boss Muraoka''s niece. Meanwhile, the ambitions of mad dog Katsutoshi Otomo draws our series'' hero, Shozo Hirono, and the other yakuza into a new round of bloodshed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5rhcljWjsUg6O2LtiN1HiB5HBv8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52980'),
  ('836849136373035781', 'Battles Without Honor and Humanity: Final Episode', 1974, 'Action, Drama, Crime', 'Kinji Fukasaku, Sadaji Yoshida', 'Kōji Takada', 'Bunta Sugawara, Joe Shishido, Nobuo Yana, Nobuo Kaneko, Hiroki Matsukata, Akira Kobayashi, Kunie Tanaka, Asao Uchida', null, 'While Hirono is in prison, his rival Takeda turns his own crime organization into a political party, whose two executives stir up new tensions in their thirst for power.', 'While Hirono is in prison, his rival Takeda turns his own crime organization into a political party, whose two executives stir up new tensions in their thirst for power.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8NlodXb8Vdl594bBBQYWsj6MB1L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64912'),
  ('892679664038582623', 'Battles Without Honor and Humanity: Police Tactics', 1974, 'Crime, Drama, Action', 'Kinji Fukasaku, Tōru Dobashi, Sadaji Yoshida', 'Kazuo Kasahara', 'Bunta Sugawara, Tatsuo Umemiya, Toshio Kurosawa, Kunie Tanaka, Shingo Yamashiro, Ichirō Ogura, Akio Hasegawa, Shinichirō Mikami', null, 'As Japan gears up for the 1964 Olympic games, the cops start to crack down on the gangs, under pressure from the public and the press, adding a new dimension in the war for power among the yakuza families of Hiroshima.', 'As Japan gears up for the 1964 Olympic games, the cops start to crack down on the gangs, under pressure from the public and the press, adding a new dimension in the war for power among the yakuza families of Hiroshima.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fYcMKQ4z0wrgahBsvLf9J4Z40B8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52979'),
  ('569632440844927556', 'Battles Without Honor and Humanity: Proxy War', 1973, 'Action, Drama, Crime', 'Kinji Fukasaku, Tōru Dobashi, Sadaji Yoshida', 'Kazuo Kasahara', 'Bunta Sugawara, Takeshi Katō, Akira Kobayashi, Mikio Narita, Kunie Tanaka, Shingo Yamashiro, Nobuo Kaneko, Hideo Murota', null, 'Shozo Hirono has managed to separate from the Yamamori family and create his own small family, and extend his circle of acquaintances. These new friendships include a powerful underboss of the Muraoka family, Noboru Uchimoto.', 'Shozo Hirono has managed to separate from the Yamamori family and create his own small family, and extend his circle of acquaintances. These new friendships include a powerful underboss of the Muraoka family, Noboru Uchimoto.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9Ucid2Y7CHfZpS3z15SAOdx5eI7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52874'),
  ('720291345200323002', 'Battleship', 2012, 'Thriller, Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Peter Berg, Tobias A. Schliessler, Aaron McBride', 'Erich Hoeber, Jon Hoeber', 'Taylor Kitsch, Alexander Skarsgård, Rihanna, Brooklyn Decker, Tadanobu Asano, Hamish Linklater, Liam Neeson, Peter MacNicol', 'PG-13', 'When mankind beams a radio signal into space, a reply comes from ‘Planet G’, in the form of several alien crafts that splash down in the waters off Hawaii. Lieutenant Alex Hopper is a weapons officer assigned to the USS John Paul Jones, part of an international naval coalition which becomes the world''s last hope for survival as they engage the hostile alien force of unimaginable strength. While taking on the invaders, Hopper must also try to live up to the potential that his brother, and his fiancée''s father—an Admiral—expect of him.', 'When mankind beams a radio signal into space, a reply comes from ‘Planet G’, in the form of several alien crafts that splash down in the waters off Hawaii. Lieutenant Alex Hopper is a weapons officer assigned to the USS John Paul Jones, part of an international naval coalition which becomes the world''s last hope for survival as they engage the hostile alien force of unimaginable strength. While taking on the invaders, Hopper must also try to live up to the potential that his brother, and his fiancée''s father—an Admiral—expect of him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9b0Im7SfedHiajTwzSL9zGyBI7M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44833'),
  ('322605093931728908', 'Battleship Potemkin', 1925, 'Drama, History, War', 'Sergei Eisenstein, Eduard Tisse, Aleksandr Antonov', 'Sergei Tretyakov, Nina Agadzhanova, Sergei Eisenstein', 'Aleksandr Antonov, Vladimir Barsky, Grigori Aleksandrov, Ivan Bobrov, Mikhail Gomorov, Aleksandr Levshin, Nina Poltavtseva, Konstantin Feldman', 'NR', 'A dramatized account of a great Russian naval mutiny and a resultant public demonstration, showing support, which brought on a police massacre.', 'A dramatized account of a great Russian naval mutiny and a resultant public demonstration, showing support, which brought on a police massacre.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hZmsRLsCnE9Zshf1YJONUpCOhds.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:643'),
  ('371197422585341398', 'Battlestar Galactica', 1978, 'Science Fiction, Adventure', 'Richard A. Colla, Alan J. Levi, Ben Colman', 'Glen A. Larson', 'Richard Hatch, Dirk Benedict, Lorne Greene, Herbert Jefferson Jr., Maren Jensen, Laurette Spang, Terry Carter, Tony Swartz', 'PG', 'After the destruction of the Twelve Colonies of Mankind, the last major fighter carrier leads a makeshift fugitive fleet in a desperate search for the legendary planet Earth.', 'After the destruction of the Twelve Colonies of Mankind, the last major fighter carrier leads a makeshift fugitive fleet in a desperate search for the legendary planet Earth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/96ETJEnHoVuptkCNMtxcEZ5iWzN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:148980'),
  ('958316208283183812', 'Battlestar Galactica: Blood & Chrome', 2012, 'Science Fiction, TV Movie, Action', 'Jonas Pate, Lukas Ettlin', null, 'Luke Pasqualino, Ben Cotton, Lili Bordán, Jill Teed, John Pyper-Ferguson, Brian Markinson, Karen LeBlanc, Sebastian Spence', 'PG-13', 'The first Cylon war has been raging for 10 years and a young Ensign William Adama joins the fleet. Disappointed not to be assigned to a fighter but to a freighter, his co-pilot also isn''t too keen on having a rookie flying his aircraft as he has only a short time before he again becomes a civilian. Their cargo is a civilian scientist, but they no sooner leave than she has new orders for them and a new destination. Although she’s less than forthcoming about the details, Adama is keen—particularly as it involves going into Cylon controlled space. However, nothing is as it seems.', 'The first Cylon war has been raging for 10 years and a young Ensign William Adama joins the fleet. Disappointed not to be assigned to a fighter but to a freighter, his co-pilot also isn''t too keen on having a rookie flying his aircraft as he has only a short time before he again becomes a civilian. Their cargo is a civilian scientist, but they no sooner leave than she has new orders for them and a new destination. Although she’s less than forthcoming about the details, Adama is keen—particularly as it involves going into Cylon controlled space. However, nothing is as it seems.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fuHuvxnfcPXZauX1Pm7qwmc9k5L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:257368'),
  ('928594115175488787', 'Battlestar Galactica: Razor', 2007, 'Science Fiction, Action, Drama, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Félix Alcalá, Stephen McNutt, Doug McLean', 'Ronald D. Moore, Michael Taylor', 'Michelle Forbes, Stephanie Jacobsen, Graham Beckel, Jamie Bamber, Edward James Olmos, Mary McDonnell, Katee Sackhoff, Tricia Helfer', 'PG', 'The history and adventures of the Battlestar Pegasus, from shortly before the Cylon invasion to shortly after Lee Adama is made commander. The story is told through the eyes of and largely focuses on one particular member of Pegasus''s crew, Kendra Shaw.', 'The history and adventures of the Battlestar Pegasus, from shortly before the Cylon invasion to shortly after Lee Adama is made commander. The story is told through the eyes of and largely focuses on one particular member of Pegasus''s crew, Kendra Shaw.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tO3EoFJj0FJjKelDW5SUtquDIy2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69315'),
  ('148322823403217464', 'Battlestar Galactica: The Plan', 2009, 'Science Fiction, Action, Drama', 'Edward James Olmos, Stephen McNutt, Wayne Rose', 'Jane Espenson', 'Edward James Olmos, Dean Stockwell, Michael Trucco, Grace Park, Michael Hogan, Callum Keith Rennie, Kate Vernon, Rick Worthy', 'NR', 'When the initial Cylon attack against the Twelve Colonies fails to achieve complete extermination of human life as planned, twin Number Ones (Cavils) embedded on Galactica and Caprica must improvise to destroy the human survivors.', 'When the initial Cylon attack against the Twelve Colonies fails to achieve complete extermination of human life as planned, twin Number Ones (Cavils) embedded on Galactica and Caprica must improvise to destroy the human survivors.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vwtHIRwwASCiX0Ku487DY7YZrag.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:105077'),
  ('556279226378887018', 'Battletruck', 1982, 'Science Fiction, Action, Adventure', 'Chris Menges, Harley Cokeliss, Buddy Joe Hooker', 'Irving Austin, Harley Cokeliss, John Beech', 'Michael Beck, Annie McEnroe, James Wainwright, Bruno Lawrence, John Bach, Randy Powell, John Ratzenberger, Mark Hadlow', 'PG', 'It''s the 21st century, the Oil Wars have made a mess of the planet and the land outside major cities is lawless. After Hunter comes to the aid of Corlie, who has run away from the villainous Straker, he takes her to the peaceful community of Clearwater. Unfortunately for the citizens of Clearwater, Straker fully intends to get Corlie back.', 'It''s the 21st century, the Oil Wars have made a mess of the planet and the land outside major cities is lawless. After Hunter comes to the aid of Corlie, who has run away from the villainous Straker, he takes her to the peaceful community of Clearwater. Unfortunately for the citizens of Clearwater, Straker fully intends to get Corlie back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vKzIyRYkKfrUgHewh067a6i4Wj3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27873'),
  ('73329248478576619', 'Battling Bosko', 1932, 'Comedy, Animation', 'Hugh Harman', null, 'Rochelle Hudson, Johnny Murray', null, 'Bosko is a brave little boxer who battles the champion, Gas House Harry. The enormous brute proves a bit much, even for a plucky underdog. Some of the animation is later reused in "Bosko''s Parlor Pranks" by M.G.M. in 1934.', 'Bosko is a brave little boxer who battles the champion, Gas House Harry. The enormous brute proves a bit much, even for a plucky underdog. Some of the animation is later reused in "Bosko''s Parlor Pranks" by M.G.M. in 1934.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4xzuGy4rNoTxIdSNVUUiLKXJXdX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:157472'),
  ('152976764340842800', 'Battling Butler', 1926, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Buster Keaton, Devereaux Jennings, Bert Haines', 'Lex Neal, Al Boasberg', 'Buster Keaton, Snitz Edwards, Sally O''Neil, Walter James, Budd Fine, Francis McDonald, Mary O''Brien, Tom Wilson', null, 'A meek millionaire masquerades as a boxing star to win a girl''s heart.', 'A meek millionaire masquerades as a boxing star to win a girl''s heart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7MVdo4OyzIcwycN58J9n855ggoS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51371'),
  ('768260131910757656', 'Batty Baseball', 1944, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Tex Avery', 'Rich Hogan', 'Pinto Colvig, Wally Maher, Jerry Mann', null, 'A series of visual gags about baseball. One running gag has an angry fan screaming "Kill the ump!" Be careful what you wish for.....', 'A series of visual gags about baseball. One running gag has an angry fan screaming "Kill the ump!" Be careful what you wish for.....', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/af1RDjA3sciHfsUECUGQH5fM5Tz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84665'),
  ('396915539048956693', 'Bauhaus', 2019, 'Drama', 'Gregor Schnitzler, Nina Haun', 'Jan Braren', 'Alicia von Rittberg, Noah Saavedra, Jörg Hartmann, Nina Gummich, Marie Hacke, Ulrich Brandhoff, Julia Riedler, Christoph Letkowski', null, 'Weimar, 1921. The life of 20-year-old Lotte Brendel seems to be predetermined. Her father sees her as a future wife and mother on the side of a man who is to take over the parental carpentry business. But the idiosyncratic Lotte joins a group of young artists against the will of her family, applies at the Bauhaus and is accepted. The Weimar Bauhaus, under the direction of the visionary Walter Gropius, aspires not only to combine arts and crafts, but also to find the place for the "New Man". In the student Paul Seligmann Lotte finds a supporter and her great love.', 'Weimar, 1921. The life of 20-year-old Lotte Brendel seems to be predetermined. Her father sees her as a future wife and mother on the side of a man who is to take over the parental carpentry business. But the idiosyncratic Lotte joins a group of young artists against the will of her family, applies at the Bauhaus and is accepted. The Weimar Bauhaus, under the direction of the visionary Walter Gropius, aspires not only to combine arts and crafts, but also to find the place for the "New Man". In the student Paul Seligmann Lotte finds a supporter and her great love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5LgDLNYgxLhVHSAKNDie8Zr62vx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:530563'),
  ('949012807523724197', 'Bauhaus Spirit: 100 Years of Bauhaus', 2018, 'Documentary', 'Thomas Tielsch, Niels Bolbrinker', null, 'Torsten Blume, Rosan Bosch, Alfredo Brillembourg, Hubert Klumpner, Stephen Kovats, Christian Mio Loclair', null, 'Founded in 1919 by Walter Gropius, Bauhaus was supposed to unite sculpture, painting, design and architecture into a single combined constructive discipline. It is a synthesis of liberated imagination and stringent structure; cross-medial concepts that embellish and enrich our existence, illumination and clarity, order and playfulness. But Bauhaus was never just an artistic experiment. Confronted with the social conditions of that particular time, as well as the experience of WWI, the movement concerned itself with the political and social connotations of design from the very outset. Hence, Bauhaus history is not just the history of art, but also the history of an era that stretches from the early 20th century to the modern day.', 'Founded in 1919 by Walter Gropius, Bauhaus was supposed to unite sculpture, painting, design and architecture into a single combined constructive discipline. It is a synthesis of liberated imagination and stringent structure; cross-medial concepts that embellish and enrich our existence, illumination and clarity, order and playfulness. But Bauhaus was never just an artistic experiment. Confronted with the social conditions of that particular time, as well as the experience of WWI, the movement concerned itself with the political and social connotations of design from the very outset. Hence, Bauhaus history is not just the history of art, but also the history of an era that stretches from the early 20th century to the modern day.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d9zne2Gca4WBlpxpNKGeSStqlEE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:514215'),
  ('232320448420534454', 'Baumgeflüster', 2026, 'Romance', 'Dirk Kummer', 'Claudia Matschulla, Arnd Mayer', 'Linus Schütz, Aaron Friesz, Robert Stadlober, Inka Friedrich', null, 'Yascha Krüger, Förster wider Willen, übernimmt im Freisinger Wald eine Vertretungsstelle. Er verliebt sich in den Fotografen Mats Stein, verstrickt sich in Lügen und muss um die Liebe kämpfen. Der studierte Forstwirt arbeitet im Ministerium und ist Single auf der Suche. Leider verschreckt er potenzielle Partner oft direkt beim ersten Date. Florist Holger und dessen Partner Mirko sehen für ihren besten Freund bald alle Liebes-Felle davonschwimmen. Als Yascha überraschend den erkrankten Revierförster Werner Prunks vertreten muss, bekommt er einen Extra-Auftrag von seiner Chefin Anke Hofmann: Es gibt dort im Forstrevier einen Privatwald, den sie für ein großflächiges, staatliches Areal unbedingt erwerben will. Dort soll ein Nationalpark entstehen. Die bisher verkaufsunwillige Besitzerin ist gerade verstorben und Yascha soll den Abkauf nun bei deren Erben durchsetzen. Als Yascha dem attraktiven Fotografen Mats Stein begegnet, der auf der Suche nach seinem ausgebüxten Dackel Gustl ist, fliegen die Funken zwischen den beiden jungen Männern sofort. Dann realisiert Yascha, dass Mats ausgerechnet der besagte Erbe ist. Als wäre das nicht schon Stress genug, tauchen auch noch Holger, mit dem Liebeskummer seines Lebens, sowie seine Mutter Pari im Forsthaus auf. Yascha versucht mühevoll, seinem neuen Job und den neuen Kollegen gerecht zu werden, den Überraschungsbesuch bei Laune zu halten und Mats unauffällig vom Verkauf seines Privatwaldes zu überzeugen. Zwischen Waldabenteuern, Dackeldramen und Dienstanweisungen verliert er dabei zunehmend die Kontrolle, verstrickt sich in Lügen und riskiert Herz und Job.', 'Yascha Krüger, Förster wider Willen, übernimmt im Freisinger Wald eine Vertretungsstelle. Er verliebt sich in den Fotografen Mats Stein, verstrickt sich in Lügen und muss um die Liebe kämpfen. Der studierte Forstwirt arbeitet im Ministerium und ist Single auf der Suche. Leider verschreckt er potenzielle Partner oft direkt beim ersten Date. Florist Holger und dessen Partner Mirko sehen für ihren besten Freund bald alle Liebes-Felle davonschwimmen. Als Yascha überraschend den erkrankten Revierförster Werner Prunks vertreten muss, bekommt er einen Extra-Auftrag von seiner Chefin Anke Hofmann: Es gibt dort im Forstrevier einen Privatwald, den sie für ein großflächiges, staatliches Areal unbedingt erwerben will. Dort soll ein Nationalpark entstehen. Die bisher verkaufsunwillige Besitzerin ist gerade verstorben und Yascha soll den Abkauf nun bei deren Erben durchsetzen. Als Yascha dem attraktiven Fotografen Mats Stein begegnet, der auf der Suche nach seinem ausgebüxten Dackel Gustl ist, fliegen die Funken zwischen den beiden jungen Männern sofort. Dann realisiert Yascha, dass Mats ausgerechnet der besagte Erbe ist. Als wäre das nicht schon Stress genug, tauchen auch noch Holger, mit dem Liebeskummer seines Lebens, sowie seine Mutter Pari im Forsthaus auf. Yascha versucht mühevoll, seinem neuen Job und den neuen Kollegen gerecht zu werden, den Überraschungsbesuch bei Laune zu halten und Mats unauffällig vom Verkauf seines Privatwaldes zu überzeugen. Zwischen Waldabenteuern, Dackeldramen und Dienstanweisungen verliert er dabei zunehmend die Kontrolle, verstrickt sich in Lügen und riskiert Herz und Job.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FcojIqNSmeZpxwPp6sAkkPJRhwWj.jpg', 'plex:movie:baumgefluster'),
  ('487635813853651408', 'Bawaal', 2023, 'Drama, Romance, Action, History', 'Nitesh Tiwari, Mitesh Mirchandani, Mukesh Chhabra', 'Nitesh Tiwari, Piyush Gupta, Shreyas Jain', 'Varun Dhawan, Janhvi Kapoor, Manoj Pahwa, Anjuman Saxena, Prateek Pachori, Varun Tamta, Aparna Ghoshal, Shashie Vermaa', null, 'Ajay Dixit, an ordinary history teacher in a high school, enjoys mini celebrityhood in his town courtesy of the fake image he has built. He shares a strained relationship with his newly-wed wife. Circumstances force him to take a trip to Europe for the World War II trail accompanied by his wife. Will his relationship with his wife survive this trip? Will he manage to win the war within?', 'Ajay Dixit, an ordinary history teacher in a high school, enjoys mini celebrityhood in his town courtesy of the fake image he has built. He shares a strained relationship with his newly-wed wife. Circumstances force him to take a trip to Europe for the World War II trail accompanied by his wife. Will his relationship with his wife survive this trip? Will he manage to win the war within?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kT0mA3kYzvl2UZGxhJnLyTUYa2z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1142127'),
  ('677655033431447997', 'Bawarchi', 1972, 'Comedy, Drama, Family', 'Hrishikesh Mukherjee, Jaywant Pathare', 'Tapan Sinha, Hrishikesh Mukherjee', 'Rajesh Khanna, Jaya Bachchan, Usha Kiran, Harindranath Chattopadhyay, A.K. Hangal, Durga Khote, Asrani, Kali Bannerjee', null, 'Desperate for a cook, the disgruntled Sharmas are relieved when a multi-talented man, Raghu, takes up the job. However, when all seems well, the family jewels disappear and so does Raghu.', 'Desperate for a cook, the disgruntled Sharmas are relieved when a multi-talented man, Raghu, takes up the job. However, when all seems well, the family jewels disappear and so does Raghu.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/34zBSGpu8MnUlIF74PcWfrZZAG1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60389'),
  ('306816952241343923', 'Bawdy Tales', 1973, 'Comedy', 'Sergio Citti, Tonino Delli Colli, Umberto Angelucci', 'Pier Paolo Pasolini, Sergio Citti', 'Ninetto Davoli, Franco Citti, Nicoletta Machiavelli, Gianni Rizzo, Silvano Gatti, Enzo Petriglia, Sebastiano Soldati, Santino Citti', null, 'Locked up in prison and awaiting execution, bored young vagabonds Bernardino and Mammone pass their time competing in a vulgar storytelling competition, relating indecent accounts about castration, unsavory testicles and an atypical threesome. Not intended for the faint of heart, this audacious piece of moviemaking focuses on tales of jealousy, murder and uncontrollable desires.', 'Locked up in prison and awaiting execution, bored young vagabonds Bernardino and Mammone pass their time competing in a vulgar storytelling competition, relating indecent accounts about castration, unsavory testicles and an atypical threesome. Not intended for the faint of heart, this audacious piece of moviemaking focuses on tales of jealousy, murder and uncontrollable desires.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fW1zN1xsRtjgSY3dNw4eBFdVQEh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:93064'),
  ('183856984483861820', 'Baxter', 1989, 'Horror, Drama, Comedy', 'Jérôme Boivin, Yves Angelo', 'Jacques Audiard, Jérôme Boivin', 'Lise Delamare, Jean Mercure, Jacques Spiesser, Catherine Ferran, Sabrina Leurquin, Jean-Paul Roussillon, François Driancourt, Maxime Leroux', 'R', 'A white Bull Terrier named Baxter is given to an elderly woman by her daughter. As time passes, the dog develops aggressive and murderous behavior in order to be adopted by another family.', 'A white Bull Terrier named Baxter is given to an elderly woman by her daughter. As time passes, the dog develops aggressive and murderous behavior in order to be adopted by another family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c77bDsP7jfMiEeRM5wd0UV0Aine.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52794'),
  ('613539007529674410', 'Baxter, Vera Baxter', 1977, 'Mystery, Drama', 'Marguerite Duras, Sacha Vierny, Robert Pansard-Besson', 'Marguerite Duras', 'Delphine Seyrig, Noëlle Châtelet, Claudine Gabay, Gérard Depardieu, Nathalie Nell, Claude Aufaure, François Périer, Marguerite Duras', null, 'In an empty villa, Vera Baxter sits and contemplates her life, as she recounts to a woman who was drawn to the villa when she heard the name Vera Baxter pronounced. Vera tells her about her no-good husband, who has been using her to keep his failing business afloat, up to her present love affair.', 'In an empty villa, Vera Baxter sits and contemplates her life, as she recounts to a woman who was drawn to the villa when she heard the name Vera Baxter pronounced. Vera tells her about her no-good husband, who has been using her to keep his failing business afloat, up to her present love affair.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xaLdvNsiYZAfCv9S6ocFETE4X1f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65719'),
  ('112106491088606279', 'Bay Coven', 1987, 'Horror, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Carl Schenkel, Jacques Steyn, Tony Thatcher', 'Tim Kring', 'Pamela Sue Martin, Tim Matheson, Barbara Billingsley, Jeff Conaway, Woody Harrelson, Susan Ruttan, James B. Sikking, Inga Swenson', 'NR', 'A young newlywed couple move to a remote island only to find a secret coven of witches who want them to join all the fun...or face the consequences.', 'A young newlywed couple move to a remote island only to find a secret coven of witches who want them to join all the fun...or face the consequences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zWjJjT9oyhjnQnMzCBFB9qRwb1l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:111816'),
  ('410957762721492506', 'Bay of Angels', 1963, 'Romance, Drama', 'Jacques Demy, Gérald Duduyer, Costa-Gavras', 'Jacques Demy', 'Jeanne Moreau, Claude Mann, Paul Guers, Henri Nassiet, Nicole Chollet, André Certes, Jean-Pierre Lorrain, Georges Alban', 'NR', 'A bank clerk is drawn into the risky world of a gorgeous gambling addict.', 'A bank clerk is drawn into the risky world of a gorgeous gambling addict.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7gMfVJur6DgujNyt1297GIGYMwJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60773'),
  ('819858152371637570', 'Bayala: A Magical Adventure', 2019, 'Animation, Adventure, Family, Fantasy', 'Aina Järvine, Federico Milella', 'Dennys McCoy, Vanessa Walder', 'Madison Mullahey, Jessica Webb, Olivia Manning, Gregory Max, Rebecca Becker, Louise White, Vibe Jones, Andrew Watts', null, 'As the dragons have almost disappeared from the kingdom of Bayala, the magic powers of the fairies are weakening. The fairy princesses Sera and Surah are thrilled when they discover they have the key to save the world in their hands: a dragon egg! Now the sisters must reach the dragon mountains and they embark on an adventurous journey into the unknown...', 'As the dragons have almost disappeared from the kingdom of Bayala, the magic powers of the fairies are weakening. The fairy princesses Sera and Surah are thrilled when they discover they have the key to save the world in their hands: a dragon egg! Now the sisters must reach the dragon mountains and they embark on an adventurous journey into the unknown...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ouKUXkQSLyC4ADXbC8ft7vxiIJF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:587065'),
  ('877541316981852233', 'Bayo', 2025, 'Drama, Romance', 'Roman Perez Jr.', 'En Villasis', 'Ashley Lopez, Anne Marie Gonzales, Nathan Cajucom, Arnold Reyes', null, 'A new girl in town uses seduction and mind games to tear a loving couple apart. Her motive: lust with a little bit of business.', 'A new girl in town uses seduction and mind games to tear a loving couple apart. Her motive: lust with a little bit of business.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pNClIec4AsWkZmMBqqYXMPO0nzd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1476450'),
  ('159020172676401365', 'Bayonet', 2018, 'Drama', 'Kyzza Terrazas, Nadia Ayala Tabachnik, Guillermo Garza', 'Rodrigo Marquez-Tizano, Kyzza Terrazas', 'Luis Gerardo Méndez, Brontis Jodorowsky, Laura Birn, Joonas Saartamo, Ilkka Koivula, Ville Virtanen, Gabriel Nuncio, Rodrigo ''''El Jaguar'''' Ortiz', null, 'Miguel “Bayoneta” Galíndez is a retired boxer from Tijuana who finds himself living in a cramped flat in Finland. As his future begins to look up, a desire for redemption draws him back into the ring.', 'Miguel “Bayoneta” Galíndez is a retired boxer from Tijuana who finds himself living in a cramped flat in Finland. As his future begins to look up, a desire for redemption draws him back into the ring.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h6Xi5lAcJPIxcIfJryhg1DGnyne.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:495659'),
  ('196784846951714541', 'Bayonetta: Bloody Fate', 2013, 'Animation, Action, Fantasy', 'Hiroya Iijima, Fuminori Kizaki, Michinori Chiba', 'Fuminori Kizaki, Mitsutaka Hirota', 'Atsuko Tanaka, Mie Sonozaki, Wataru Takagi, Tessyo Genda, Daisuke Namikawa, Miyuki Sawashiro, Norio Wakamoto, Reiko Suzuki', 'R', 'Bayonetta is an ancient witch who awakens from a five hundred-year slumber with no memory of her life. Armed with a gun in each limb, she embarks on a journey to rediscover her past, defeating all bloodthirsty angels that stand in her way.', 'Bayonetta is an ancient witch who awakens from a five hundred-year slumber with no memory of her life. Armed with a gun in each limb, she embarks on a journey to rediscover her past, defeating all bloodthirsty angels that stand in her way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dfg7dqm0YX16D6QYDKDdh3Qi930.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:242546'),
  ('446643772784943135', 'Bayrampaşa: Ben Fazla Kalmayacağım', 2008, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Hamdi Alkan, Ferhat Öçmen', 'Birol Güven', 'Vural Çelik, Yasemin Baştan, Okan Tangücü, Hakan Yılmaz, Halil Ergün, Tamer Karadağlı, Alper Kul, Ferdi Akarnur', null, 'The story of a man who was wrongfully arrested and forced to spend years in prison without being able to explain his situation.', 'The story of a man who was wrongfully arrested and forced to spend years in prison without being able to explain his situation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p38gseSv0neSFmmgcWKRbvejvwr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51433'),
  ('108817005760716512', 'Bayside Shakedown', 1998, 'Comedy, Drama, Crime', 'Katsuyuki Motohiro, Osamu Fujiishi, Eiichiro Hasumi', 'Ryôichi Kimizuka', 'Yuji Oda, Toshiro Yanagiba, Eri Fukatsu, Miki Mizuno, Yusuke Santamaria, Kobayashi Susumu, Kenta Satoi, Soichiro Kitamura', null, 'Aoshima, a police detective working in the Bayside Precinct, is continually frustrated by the hierarchy and red tape that plague the system. His friend Muroi is climbing the ladder of the police bureaucracy. Muroi has made a pact with Aoshima that while Aoshima looks after the streets, Muroi would make life easier for the cops on the beat. One day in Bayside, a series of events turns the small station upside down.', 'Aoshima, a police detective working in the Bayside Precinct, is continually frustrated by the hierarchy and red tape that plague the system. His friend Muroi is climbing the ladder of the police bureaucracy. Muroi has made a pact with Aoshima that while Aoshima looks after the streets, Muroi would make life easier for the cops on the beat. One day in Bayside, a series of events turns the small station upside down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4pveFVl8gyGrnfD4Tr8icw2fAjY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55382'),
  ('400275839244487111', 'Bayside Shakedown 2', 2003, 'Action, Comedy, Drama, Crime', 'Katsuyuki Motohiro, Osamu Fujiishi', 'Ryôichi Kimizuka', 'Yuji Oda, Toshiro Yanagiba, Eri Fukatsu, Miki Mizuno, Yusuke Santamaria, Takehiko Ono, Kenta Satoi, Satoru Saito', null, 'The movie takes place again in the fictional Wangan Station of the Tokyo Metropolitan Police Department the once empty space within Wangan''s jurisdiction has become a popular tourist attraction. When a string of murders of company execs begins taking place, Aoshima jumps at the opportunity to pursue something other than his current case, which he finds less than inspiring. However the powers that be have other ideas, and Wangan again plays host to a special investigation team from headquarters. Aoshima''s friend Superintendent Shinji Muroi, assigned by headquarters to assist Okita, is again powerless to help the local officers as decisions are made by the higher ups.', 'The movie takes place again in the fictional Wangan Station of the Tokyo Metropolitan Police Department the once empty space within Wangan''s jurisdiction has become a popular tourist attraction. When a string of murders of company execs begins taking place, Aoshima jumps at the opportunity to pursue something other than his current case, which he finds less than inspiring. However the powers that be have other ideas, and Wangan again plays host to a special investigation team from headquarters. Aoshima''s friend Superintendent Shinji Muroi, assigned by headquarters to assist Okita, is again powerless to help the local officers as decisions are made by the higher ups.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7PV3sA9WakDNeeoUaO2zqkXu1L2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55384'),
  ('297781271273241034', 'Bayside Shakedown 3: Set the Guys Loose', 2010, 'Action, Drama, Comedy', 'Katsuyuki Motohiro, Kazunari Kawagoe, Takashi Matsukawa', 'Ryôichi Kimizuka', 'Yuji Oda, Eri Fukatsu, Yusuke Santamaria, Atsushi Ito, Yuki Uchida, Soichiro Kitamura, Takehiko Ono, Satoru Saito', null, 'After Detective Shunsaku Aoshima is promoted to section chief he has the daunting task of dealing with eight cases at the same time, which includes a murder case, bomb threat, and a bus hijacking. Complications also arise between Detective Aoshima and his juniors.', 'After Detective Shunsaku Aoshima is promoted to section chief he has the daunting task of dealing with eight cases at the same time, which includes a murder case, bomb threat, and a bus hijacking. Complications also arise between Detective Aoshima and his juniors.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/optOvxSsLZHAyaBBqvRepf4JCQV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65841'),
  ('1010450473665662416', 'Bayside Shakedown the Final: The New Hope', 2012, 'Action, Crime', 'Katsuyuki Motohiro, Kazunari Kawagoe', 'Ryôichi Kimizuka', 'Yuji Oda, Eri Fukatsu, Yusuke Santamaria, Miki Mizuno, Masahiro Komoto, Yuki Uchida, Atsushi Ito, Naoki Kawano', null, 'Set 2 years after prior film "Bayside Shakedown 3: Set the Guys Loose," a major case occurs that has the potential to take down the entire police organization. For the next 3 days, Shunsaku Aoshima and his colleagues struggle to unravel the case...', 'Set 2 years after prior film "Bayside Shakedown 3: Set the Guys Loose," a major case occurs that has the potential to take down the entire police organization. For the next 3 days, Shunsaku Aoshima and his colleagues struggle to unravel the case...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eknDKoJ42BbwBsBxHaXcD9mp7Zr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:193402'),
  ('649662681341215854', 'Baywatch', 2017, 'Comedy, Action, Crime', 'Seth Gordon, Marlie Arnold, Eric Steelberg', 'Mark Swift, Damian Shannon', 'Dwayne Johnson, Zac Efron, Priyanka Chopra Jonas, Alexandra Daddario, Kelly Rohrbach, Ilfenesh Hadera, Jon Bass, Yahya Abdul-Mateen II', 'R', 'Devoted lifeguard Mitch Buchannon butts heads with a brash new recruit. Together, they uncover a local criminal plot that threatens the future of the Bay.', 'Devoted lifeguard Mitch Buchannon butts heads with a brash new recruit. Together, they uncover a local criminal plot that threatens the future of the Bay.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6HE4xd8zloDqmjMZuhUCCw2UcY1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:339846'),
  ('1132630866739368983', 'Baywatch: Forbidden Paradise', 1995, 'Action, Drama, TV Movie', 'Douglas Schwartz, James Pergola, Gregory J. Barnett', 'Deborah Schwartz', 'David Hasselhoff, Alexandra Paul, Pamela Anderson, David Charvet, Yasmine Bleeth, Jaason Simmons, Ricky Dean Logan, Vincent Klyn', null, 'The world''s most popular television series moves to Hawaii for a tropical adventure. The fun and romance is threatened when Matt is stung by a fish and captured by Hawaiian villagers.', 'The world''s most popular television series moves to Hawaii for a tropical adventure. The fun and romance is threatened when Matt is stung by a fish and captured by Hawaiian villagers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/laQWRGlGnB7LlxrlzVWKyFLV0d3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:288246'),
  ('612017643162905278', 'Baywatch: Hawaiian Wedding', 2003, 'Action, Drama, Adventure, TV Movie', 'Douglas Schwartz, Stuart Asbjornsen, Lewis Stout', null, 'David Hasselhoff, Pamela Anderson, Alexandra Paul, Yasmine Bleeth, Michael Bergin, Angelica Bridges, Nicole Eggert, Carmen Electra', 'PG-13', 'Mitch Buchannon, believed to have died in a boating accident survived and only has amnesia, he has been recovering in a Los Angeles hospital. His new fiancée, Allison Ford, resembles his old lover, Lt. Stephanie Holden who died years ago.', 'Mitch Buchannon, believed to have died in a boating accident survived and only has amnesia, he has been recovering in a Los Angeles hospital. His new fiancée, Allison Ford, resembles his old lover, Lt. Stephanie Holden who died years ago.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nMUGYIvqZdwye3spOAHDP0Fyw7A.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56427'),
  ('701911080208600821', 'Baywatch: Panic at Malibu Pier', 1989, 'TV Movie, Thriller, Drama', 'John McPherson, Richard Compton', 'Douglas Schwartz, Michael Berk', 'David Hasselhoff, Parker Stevenson, Shawn Weatherly, Billy Warlock, Erika Eleniak, Peter Phelps, Gina Hecht, Brandon Call', null, 'Welcome to the bay... Mitch and his friends enter the sink or swim world that is BAYWATCH.', 'Welcome to the bay... Mitch and his friends enter the sink or swim world that is BAYWATCH.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ergA9Qjc2T4RZ9AumIGA3Axf6a5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:478024'),
  ('725090794711579931', 'Bbuddah Hoga Terra Baap', 2011, 'Action, Thriller', 'Puri Jagannadh', 'Puri Jagannadh', 'Amitabh Bachchan, Hema Malini, Sonu Sood, Sonal Chauhan, Prakash Raj, Makrand Deshpande, Shawar Ali, Vishwajeet Pradhan', null, 'After a series of bomb blasts in Mumbai, ACP Karan Malhotra announces that he will bring in the culprits responsible within a very short period of time as well attempts to convince his college sweetheart, Tanya P. Nath, to marry him. He then sets about interrogating several suspects so much so that an underworld gangster, Kabir, is compelled to hire an assassin to do away with him. The potential killer, Viju, is an uptight older ex-convict as well as a former gangster, who now runs a pub in Paris, and is willing to kill Karan. As he sets about this gruesome task, he comes across an old flame, Kamini, as well as his estranged wife, Sita - and it is these encounters that may well be the turning point in this life that may convince him to leave the bombs and Bandooks behind and spend the rest of his life praying and watching the Bhakti Channel.', 'After a series of bomb blasts in Mumbai, ACP Karan Malhotra announces that he will bring in the culprits responsible within a very short period of time as well attempts to convince his college sweetheart, Tanya P. Nath, to marry him. He then sets about interrogating several suspects so much so that an underworld gangster, Kabir, is compelled to hire an assassin to do away with him. The potential killer, Viju, is an uptight older ex-convict as well as a former gangster, who now runs a pub in Paris, and is willing to kill Karan. As he sets about this gruesome task, he comes across an old flame, Kamini, as well as his estranged wife, Sita - and it is these encounters that may well be the turning point in this life that may convince him to leave the bombs and Bandooks behind and spend the rest of his life praying and watching the Bhakti Channel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yatGTB5sPpVySH7LqAALljmeeR5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69774'),
  ('93798783667494332', 'BDE', 2023, 'Comedy', 'Michaël Youn, Virginie Irdel', 'Michaël Youn, Matt Alexander', 'Michaël Youn, Héléna Noguerra, Lucien Jean-Baptiste, Vincent Desagnat, Rayane Bensetti, Ludovik, Manon Azem, Virginie Hocq', null, 'The story of four lifelong friends who met in the 2000s when they were presidents of the BDE of the Nantes Institute of Business. At the time, they were the "Bioman": the kings of partying, excess and "transmutation". 20 years later, they have mellowed out and lead well-ordered lives. Except... Once a year, when they get together for the WEB: the Bioman Weekend. There, they "transmute" hard as they like to say. In short: they drink and sing in a pathetic way.', 'The story of four lifelong friends who met in the 2000s when they were presidents of the BDE of the Nantes Institute of Business. At the time, they were the "Bioman": the kings of partying, excess and "transmutation". 20 years later, they have mellowed out and lead well-ordered lives. Except... Once a year, when they get together for the WEB: the Bioman Weekend. There, they "transmute" hard as they like to say. In short: they drink and sing in a pathetic way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tJso5lzMmDF5TI8BJZYQnOUh91o.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:957752'),
  ('277158980048772134', 'Be Afraid', 2017, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Drew Gabreski, Scott Peck', 'Gerald Nott', 'Brian Krause, Jaimi Paige, Louis Herthum, Jared Abrahamson, Michelle Hurd, Michael Leone, Noell Coet, Sade Kimora Young', null, 'Not long after John Chambers and his family arrive at their new home in a small country town of Pennsylvania, John begins to experience sleep paralysis. Lying there paralyzed, trapped within his own nightmare, other-worldly beings visit John. They are entities which exist in the darkest shadows of the night and can only be seen out of the corner of one''s eye. These encounters begin to haunt John, transforming to complete terror as he discovers the entities'' sole purpose... the abduction of his seven year old son. In the end, John will uncover the town''s horrific secret, a portal on his land, and make one last attempt to save his son before the shadow people permanently take him away to their world.', 'Not long after John Chambers and his family arrive at their new home in a small country town of Pennsylvania, John begins to experience sleep paralysis. Lying there paralyzed, trapped within his own nightmare, other-worldly beings visit John. They are entities which exist in the darkest shadows of the night and can only be seen out of the corner of one''s eye. These encounters begin to haunt John, transforming to complete terror as he discovers the entities'' sole purpose... the abduction of his seven year old son. In the end, John will uncover the town''s horrific secret, a portal on his land, and make one last attempt to save his son before the shadow people permanently take him away to their world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nCDyv3YRKwIuLi9o0k88Ntu9ala.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:448252'),
  ('942593122060177227', 'Be Beautiful and Shut Up', 1958, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Marc Allégret, Armand Thirard', 'Gabriel Arout, Jean Marsan, Marc Allégret', 'Henri Vidal, Mylène Demongeot, Béatrice Altariba, René Lefèvre, Jean-Paul Belmondo, Anne Collette, Robert Dalban, François Darbon', null, 'A beautiful 18-year-old orphan escapes from a reformatory and hooks up with a gang of jewel smugglers, and decides on a life of crime. However, she falls for and marries a policeman, putting a crimp in her criminal career.', 'A beautiful 18-year-old orphan escapes from a reformatory and hooks up with a gang of jewel smugglers, and decides on a life of crime. However, she falls for and marries a policeman, putting a crimp in her criminal career.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/96guOjLXPrgz5xKcRTRJv2rGEzN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80543'),
  ('565564120755576931', 'Be Big!', 1931, 'Comedy', 'James W. Horne', 'H.M. Walker', 'Stan Laurel, Oliver Hardy, Anita Garvin, Charlie Hall, Isabelle Keith, Jack Hill, Baldwin Cooke, Harry Earles', 'NR', 'Stan and Ollie are on their way to Atlantic City with their wives, when Ollie gets a phone call from a lodge buddy telling him that a stag party is taking place that night in their honor. Ollie pretends to be sick and sends the wives on ahead, promising that he and Stan will meet them in the morning. The pair dress in their lodge gear, but their wives return having missed their train. With no obvious escape route, Stan and Ollie take to a bed in fear and in response to Stan''s plea of "What''ll I do?", Ollie replies "Be big!".', 'Stan and Ollie are on their way to Atlantic City with their wives, when Ollie gets a phone call from a lodge buddy telling him that a stag party is taking place that night in their honor. Ollie pretends to be sick and sends the wives on ahead, promising that he and Stan will meet them in the morning. The pair dress in their lodge gear, but their wives return having missed their train. With no obvious escape route, Stan and Ollie take to a bed in fear and in response to Stan''s plea of "What''ll I do?", Ollie replies "Be big!".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zMcP8mAANmxVnzRdKIWLvzfAtp5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48648'),
  ('687176313462618321', 'Be Careful What You Wish For', 2020, 'Horror', 'Agustín Oso Tapia', 'Agustín Oso Tapia', 'Fernanda Castillo, Juan Ríos, Iván Arana, Valery Sais, José Sefami', null, 'Pamela is an eight-year-old girl who loves horror movies and fairy tales. When his uncle gives her away a doll named "Hellequin" as a birthday gift, a tale of betrayal begins to unfold before her eyes.', 'Pamela is an eight-year-old girl who loves horror movies and fairy tales. When his uncle gives her away a doll named "Hellequin" as a birthday gift, a tale of betrayal begins to unfold before her eyes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lG6Wx5tWOEHkOuexEvNYha3ofvM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:681429'),
  ('848542842481868396', 'Be Cool', 2005, 'Comedy, Crime', 'F. Gary Gray, Mark S. Constance, J. Michael Haynie', 'Peter Steinfeld', 'John Travolta, Uma Thurman, Vince Vaughn, Cedric the Entertainer, Dwayne Johnson, André 3000, Steven Tyler, Robert Pastorelli', 'PG-13', 'Disenchanted with the movie industry, Chili Palmer tries the music industry, meeting and romancing a widow of a music executive along the way.', 'Disenchanted with the movie industry, Chili Palmer tries the music industry, meeting and romancing a widow of a music executive along the way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ekKCH7Zkb5ZTr1f1AczZY23FH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4551'),
  ('101645620904983426', 'Be Happy', 2025, 'Drama, Music, Family', 'Remo D''Souza, Vijay Kumar Arora', 'Kanishka Singh Deo, Chirag Garg, Tushar Hiranandani', 'Abhishek Bachchan, Inayat Verma, Nora Fatehi, Nassar, Johny Lever, Sonali Bendre, Remo D''Souza, Elli Avram', null, 'A single father attempts to help his talented daughter achieve her dream of performing on the country''s biggest dance reality show.', 'A single father attempts to help his talented daughter achieve her dream of performing on the country''s biggest dance reality show.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6bvW47MtJKo2ipPYJ2xDvdf4zbz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:607141'),
  ('227857253805228247', 'Be Happy', 2026, 'Drama, Romance', 'Gabourey Sidibe', 'Cameron J. Ross', 'Tisha Campbell, Mekhi Phifer, Russell Hornsby, Zing Ashford', 'TV-14', 'Follows 50-year-old Val, a devoted wife and stay-at-home mom who seeks to reignite the spark in her marriage after her child heads to college.', 'Follows 50-year-old Val, a devoted wife and stay-at-home mom who seeks to reignite the spark in her marriage after her child heads to college.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fmetadata-static.plex.tv%2Ff%2Fgracenote%2Ffdd644ad0014cdc6b0a585865eaac158.jpg', 'plex:movie:be-happy-2026-1'),
  ('101485097954054207', 'Be Here Now', 2015, 'Documentary', 'Lilibet Foster', null, 'Andy Whitfield, Jai Courtney, Indigo Whitfield, Jesse Whitfield, Pat Whitfield, Robert Whitfield, Vashti Whitfield', null, 'An inspiring feature documentary and love story, about the overnight sensation, actor and international sex symbol, Andy Whitfield, who put the same determination and dedication that he brought to his lead role in "Spartacus" into fighting life-threatening cancer.', 'An inspiring feature documentary and love story, about the overnight sensation, actor and international sex symbol, Andy Whitfield, who put the same determination and dedication that he brought to his lead role in "Spartacus" into fighting life-threatening cancer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lOSmCfNnJOcM6BYnTB16OnJAhcP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:339158'),
