  ('1044730311423622329', 'Be Kind Rewind', 2008, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Michel Gondry, Ellen Kuras', 'Michel Gondry', 'Jack Black, Yasiin Bey, Danny Glover, Mia Farrow, Melonie Díaz, Irv Gooch, Chandler Parker, Arjay Smith', 'PG-13', 'A man whose brain becomes magnetized unintentionally destroys every tape in his friend''s video store. In order to satisfy the store''s most loyal renter, an aging woman with signs of dementia, the two men set out to remake the lost films.', 'A man whose brain becomes magnetized unintentionally destroys every tape in his friend''s video store. In order to satisfy the store''s most loyal renter, an aging woman with signs of dementia, the two men set out to remake the lost films.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f0oX20YrQEiVPDH9InCQ1d3Cm66.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4953'),
  ('808853408851289963', 'Be My Cat: A Film for Anne', 2015, 'Horror, Thriller, Crime', 'Adrian Țofei', 'Adrian Țofei', 'Adrian Țofei, Sonia Teodoriu, Florentina Hariton, Alexandra Stroe, GiEmSi, Dorina Țofei', 'NR', 'An aspiring filmmaker goes to shocking extremes to convince Hollywood actress Anne Hathaway to star in his film. First entry in Adrian Țofei''s spiritual trilogy which includes We Put the World to Sleep and Pure.', 'An aspiring filmmaker goes to shocking extremes to convince Hollywood actress Anne Hathaway to star in his film. First entry in Adrian Țofei''s spiritual trilogy which includes We Put the World to Sleep and Pure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n03Okhxq86AqTbqrVvt8mu2OWYO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:328216'),
