  ('739679196456689459', 'Be My Husband', 1981, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Alla Surikova, Grigoriy Belenkiy, Vladlen Sharun', 'Eduard Akopov', 'Andrey Mironov, Elena Proklova, Nina Ruslanova, Natalya Krachkovskaya, Vladimir Basov, Anton Tabakov, Baadur Tsuladze, Oleg Anofriev', null, 'Natasha, a woman struggling to find housing in a crowded resort town with her young son. She forces a stranger, Viktor, to pretend to be her husband to secure accommodation that bans children, leading to unexpected romantic developments.', 'Natasha, a woman struggling to find housing in a crowded resort town with her young son. She forces a stranger, Viktor, to pretend to be her husband to secure accommodation that bans children, leading to unexpected romantic developments.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kVPEa2Jn7amg2c4NrlIIdmKKSJV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63300'),
  ('368966014429984502', 'Be My Master', 2018, 'Drama', 'Hideo Jojo, Takehiko Tamiya, Ippei Itou', 'Hideo Jojo, Hitoshi Ishikawa', 'Katsuya Maiguma, Aika Yukihira, Yurisa, Chiharu Yamane, Masaki Miura, Nobu Morimoto, Kazuyoshi Ozawa, Akihiko Sai', null, 'A married ad designer (Meguro) is having an affair with a married woman (Ming). When an ad agency head visits Meguro, it''s revealed that he''s Ming''s husband (Shanwei). Shanwei warns Meguro to not only continue the affair but also record (for Shanwei) and "mentor" Ming in a series of escalating sexual domination/humiliation rituals. If Meguro refuses, Shanwei will disclose the affair to everyone, including Meguro''s wife.', 'A married ad designer (Meguro) is having an affair with a married woman (Ming). When an ad agency head visits Meguro, it''s revealed that he''s Ming''s husband (Shanwei). Shanwei warns Meguro to not only continue the affair but also record (for Shanwei) and "mentor" Ming in a series of escalating sexual domination/humiliation rituals. If Meguro refuses, Shanwei will disclose the affair to everyone, including Meguro''s wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8b5t20EVVOpojz3LO11NifeiEWO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:592742'),
  ('772068123038632167', 'Be My Slave', 2012, 'Drama, Romance, Comedy', 'Tōru Kamei, Masato Nakao', 'Takehiko Minato', 'Mitsu Dan, Itsuji Itao, Hiroaki Mayama, Kanji Furutachi, Ken Kaito, Ini Kusano, Michié, Asuka Shingu', null, 'Dan Mitsu stars as Kana, a female employee at a publishing company who strikes up a sexual relationship with a younger co-worker. He soon discovers that Kana''s fetishes extend to sadomasochistic tendencies, involving a mysterious man only known as "Sensei". This discovery will push his relationship with Kana to a new, dangerous level that he may not be ready for.', 'Dan Mitsu stars as Kana, a female employee at a publishing company who strikes up a sexual relationship with a younger co-worker. He soon discovers that Kana''s fetishes extend to sadomasochistic tendencies, involving a mysterious man only known as "Sensei". This discovery will push his relationship with Kana to a new, dangerous level that he may not be ready for.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mphwtZdvx6AGz3bsllhXpTQqkGC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:179058'),
  ('1128145085478755333', 'Be My Star', 2002, 'Romance, Drama', 'Valeska Grisebach, Bernhard Keller', 'Valeska Grisebach', 'Nicole Gläser, Christopher Schöps, Monique Gläser, Jeanine Gläser, Anika Jahn, Christina Sandke, Sebastian Rinka', null, 'It is about a girl''s everyday life at the end of her school days, trying to find a way into society and her own life.', 'It is about a girl''s everyday life at the end of her school days, trying to find a way into society and her own life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pqow8MIqL17BQHqIzhgI7EBE5x0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:125794'),
  ('472106201739866174', 'Be My Valentine', 2026, 'Horror', 'Stefanie Davis', 'Stefanie Davis', 'Samantha Dalesio, Mitchell Patrick Greene, Bella Jackson, Amanda Brown, Nick Sloan', null, 'Gina has fallen in love with a man she hasn''t met. As she documents her relationship journey, she becomes more and more obsessed with Zach to the point of bloody consequences.', 'Gina has fallen in love with a man she hasn''t met. As she documents her relationship journey, she becomes more and more obsessed with Zach to the point of bloody consequences.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FfXSMQzxmPIsKdzxP75BTT1Zkje4.jpg', 'plex:movie:be-my-valentine-2026'),
  ('11922952194708738', 'Be My Valentine, Charlie Brown', 1975, 'Animation, Family, TV Movie, Comedy', 'Phil Roman', 'Charles M. Schulz', 'Duncan Watson, Stephen Shea, Melanie Kohn, Greg Felton, Lynn Mortensen, Linda Ercoli, Bill Melendez', 'G', 'It''s Valentine''s Day again and Charlie Brown dreams the seemingly hopeless dream to receiving a valentine from anyone. All the while, the rest of the gang have their own trials whether it be Linus'' struggle to get the biggest card he can for his beloved teacher, or Lucy trying to get some token from Schroeder while Snoopy and Woodstock are having fun spearing valentines on each other''s nose.', 'It''s Valentine''s Day again and Charlie Brown dreams the seemingly hopeless dream to receiving a valentine from anyone. All the while, the rest of the gang have their own trials whether it be Linus'' struggle to get the biggest card he can for his beloved teacher, or Lucy trying to get some token from Schroeder while Snoopy and Woodstock are having fun spearing valentines on each other''s nose.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6yLVjYyIKzAC8TAparmjDWzWc2V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31726'),
  ('646505023422583937', 'Be My Wife', 1921, 'Comedy', 'Max Linder, Charles Van Enger', 'Max Linder', 'Max Linder, Alta Allen, Caroline Rankin, Lincoln Stedman, Rose Dione, Charles McHugh, Viora Daniel, Arthur Clayton', null, 'Max is determined to woo Mary, despite her Aunt Agatha''s disapproval. Then, Max and Mary become embroiled in the world of Madam Coralie, a prominent dressmaker-bootlegger.', 'Max is determined to woo Mary, despite her Aunt Agatha''s disapproval. Then, Max and Mary become embroiled in the world of Madam Coralie, a prominent dressmaker-bootlegger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sKWp3OoIK0y31xT6WXHBprpOmNB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:175483'),
  ('1010708614816926345', 'Be Pretty and Shut Up!', 1981, 'Documentary', 'Delphine Seyrig, Carole Roussopoulos', null, 'Delphine Seyrig, Jill Clayburgh, Marie Dubois, Delia Salvi, Juliet Berto, Patti D''Arbanville, Maidie Norman, Louise Fletcher', null, 'The film is a series of interviews with various well-known film actresses, including Jenny Agutter, Maria Schneider, and Jane Fonda. The title, which is borrowed from a 1958 film with the same name by Marc Allegret, refers to the sense the actresses have of what is expected of them by the film industry.', 'The film is a series of interviews with various well-known film actresses, including Jenny Agutter, Maria Schneider, and Jane Fonda. The title, which is borrowed from a 1958 film with the same name by Marc Allegret, refers to the sense the actresses have of what is expected of them by the film industry.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q1zuhf2GtnljbO6Z3pyCdhsjxwt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:311267'),
  ('300043646721958831', 'Be Sick… It''s Free', 1968, 'Comedy', 'Luigi Zampa, Nando Angelini, Sofia Scandurra', 'Alberto Sordi, Luigi Zampa, Sergio Amidei', 'Alberto Sordi, Ida Galli, Bice Valori, Sara Franchetti, Nanda Primavera, Patrizia De Clara, Leopoldo Trieste, Adriana Giuffrè', null, 'Comedy about the flawed Italian healthcare system of the time and a doctor''s expeirence with it.', 'Comedy about the flawed Italian healthcare system of the time and a doctor''s expeirence with it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ilPCRdZSsHeBisrSgkDE2ejUB2r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58188'),
  ('116246267425657727', 'Be Somebody', 2016, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Joshua Caldwell, Eve M. Cohen', 'Lamar Damon', 'Matthew Espinosa, Sarah Jeffery, Allison Paige, Caitlin Keats, LaMonica Garrett, Mahaley Patel, Liana Ramirez, Trista Nabors', 'PG', 'Pop superstar Jordan Jaye has a big dream he just wants to live like a regular teenager. When he''s chased down by some excited female fans, he finds a perfect hideout and a reluctant new friend from a small town, high-school art student, Emily Lowe. Despite being from different worlds, they soon discover they have way more in common than they ever imagined. Over the course of several days, the two embark on an unexpected journey of friendship, first love and self-discovery -- proving that maybe opposites really do attract.', 'Pop superstar Jordan Jaye has a big dream he just wants to live like a regular teenager. When he''s chased down by some excited female fans, he finds a perfect hideout and a reluctant new friend from a small town, high-school art student, Emily Lowe. Despite being from different worlds, they soon discover they have way more in common than they ever imagined. Over the course of several days, the two embark on an unexpected journey of friendship, first love and self-discovery -- proving that maybe opposites really do attract.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/KYATn1yL1MzXnOEOYScX3QcpEI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:397517'),
  ('133505600620769669', 'Be Somebody', 2021, 'Comedy, Mystery, Drama', 'Xunzimo Liu', 'Xunzimo Liu, Zhang Benyu', 'Yin Zheng, Deng Jiajia, Yu Entai, Yang Haoyu, Chen Minghao, Zhang Benyu, Ke Da, Qin Xiaoxian', null, 'During the Republican era, a group of frustrated people from the movie industry is invited in a luxurious mansion to make a movie out of a gruesome case that has recently rattled the city of Shanghai, in the hopes that it would turn into a huge sensation and make them famous. However, they never expected that the murderer would be in their midst and that the truth behind the case would be far more bizarre than their fictional movie plot.', 'During the Republican era, a group of frustrated people from the movie industry is invited in a luxurious mansion to make a movie out of a gruesome case that has recently rattled the city of Shanghai, in the hopes that it would turn into a huge sensation and make them famous. However, they never expected that the murderer would be in their midst and that the truth behind the case would be far more bizarre than their fictional movie plot.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8z7IptdlKjox7BIiwNwSdSV68HP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:895435'),
  ('260670411465218886', 'Be Sure to Share', 2009, 'Drama', 'Sion Sono, Shogo Ueno, Shinnosuke Mitsushima', 'Sion Sono', 'Ryohei Kurosawa, Eiji Okuda, Ayumi Ito, Keiko Takahashi, Sousuke Takaoka, Denden, Mitsuru Fukikoshi, Toshiki Ayata', null, 'Shiro''s struggle with his father''s cancer and impending death leads to a realization that he must communicate his love and admiration for him before it''s too late. A series of flashbacks reveals their relationship over time, and the trouble Shiro faced connecting to his strict father who was also his teacher and soccer coach. With a consuming secret of his own, Shiro, now in his late twenties and about to get engaged, must eventually learn how to share the pain of it with his loved ones.', 'Shiro''s struggle with his father''s cancer and impending death leads to a realization that he must communicate his love and admiration for him before it''s too late. A series of flashbacks reveals their relationship over time, and the trouble Shiro faced connecting to his strict father who was also his teacher and soccer coach. With a consuming secret of his own, Shiro, now in his late twenties and about to get engaged, must eventually learn how to share the pain of it with his loved ones.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rxyWqDTsaGzvXZdptVZiqCKRVog.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55008'),
  ('407243797750552443', 'Be There or Be Square', 1998, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Feng Xiaogang, Zhao Fei', 'Xiao Yang Gu, Feng Xiaogang', 'Ge You, Xu Fan, Bobby C. King, Feng Xiaogang', null, 'The story of two Chinese immigrants'' struggles in America. Yuan Liu has lived in LA for years. He has no stable job, no family and lives in a wagon. He seems content with his life until the day he meets Qing Li, a woman with the big "American dream".', 'The story of two Chinese immigrants'' struggles in America. Yuan Liu has lived in LA for years. He has no stable job, no family and lives in a wagon. He seems content with his life until the day he meets Qing Li, a woman with the big "American dream".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wXhr2tVejuVFxqkl53ltGSn9Ncx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:126545'),
  ('290140186434401774', 'Be Water', 2020, 'Documentary', 'Caleb Heller, Bao Nguyen', null, 'Bruce Lee, Linda Lee Cadwell, Shannon Lee, Diana Lee Inosanto, Sam Ho, Jeff Chang, Andre Morgan, Doug Palmer', null, 'In 1971, after being rejected by Hollywood, Bruce Lee returned to his parents’ homeland of Hong Kong to complete four iconic films. Charting his struggles between two worlds, this portrait explores questions of identity and representation through the use of rare archival footage, interviews with loved ones and Bruce’s own writings.', 'In 1971, after being rejected by Hollywood, Bruce Lee returned to his parents’ homeland of Hong Kong to complete four iconic films. Charting his struggles between two worlds, this portrait explores questions of identity and representation through the use of rare archival footage, interviews with loved ones and Bruce’s own writings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yUDtBBQEpmYptyk6wbYR54Sa2OD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:653733'),
  ('1053444885979260630', 'Be with Me', 2005, 'Drama, Romance', 'Eric Khoo, Adrian Tan', 'Theresa Poh Lin Chan', 'Theresa Poh Lin Chan, Chiew Sung Ching, Lawrence Yong, Leong Kooi Eng, Elizabeth Choy, Seet Keng Yew, Lynn Poh, Ng Sway Ah', null, 'Three tales of love wrap around the true story of a blind and deaf woman named Theresa Chan. In the first an elderly shopkeeper is devoted to his sick wife. In the second, two teenage girls become soul mates and lovers. In the third a chubby security guard tries to find the courage to woo a beautiful woman who works in his building.', 'Three tales of love wrap around the true story of a blind and deaf woman named Theresa Chan. In the first an elderly shopkeeper is devoted to his sick wife. In the second, two teenage girls become soul mates and lovers. In the third a chubby security guard tries to find the courage to woo a beautiful woman who works in his building.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sP2Dmq7pANMhPxl8fbl04fxQHYH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29965'),
  ('836101003246091391', 'Be with You', 2004, 'Drama, Fantasy, Romance', 'Nobuhiro Doi, Takahide Shibanushi, Hiroyuki Inokoshi', 'Yoshikazu Okada', 'Yuko Takeuchi, Shido Nakamura, Akashi Takei, Yōsuke Asari, Chihiro Ohtsuka, Yuta Hiraoka, Mikako Ichikawa, Katsuo Nakamura', null, 'Takumi and his six-year-old son, Yuji, haven''t come to terms with their wife and mother''s death. One day, they meet a woman with an uncanny resemblance to her sheltering from the rain near their home.', 'Takumi and his six-year-old son, Yuji, haven''t come to terms with their wife and mother''s death. One day, they meet a woman with an uncanny resemblance to her sheltering from the rain near their home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/osyTJKFpP3HEHbFY5FzuZNEXo7q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36092'),
  ('63110807853311668', 'Be With You', 2018, 'Romance, Drama, Fantasy', 'Park Jun-gyu, Lee Jang-hoon, Cho Sang-yun', 'Kang Su-Jin, Lee Jang-hoon', 'So Ji-sub, Son Ye-jin, Kim Ji-hwan, Ko Chang-seok, Lee Jun-hyeok, Son Yeo-eun, Lee You-jin, Kim Hyeon-soo', null, 'Along with his young son, Ji-ho, Woo-jin misses his wife Soo-a, who died after promising to return a year later with the rainy season. Miraculously, they reunite with Soo-a when the rainy season comes around, but she has no memory of her husband and son whom she dearly loved.', 'Along with his young son, Ji-ho, Woo-jin misses his wife Soo-a, who died after promising to return a year later with the rainy season. Miraculously, they reunite with Soo-a when the rainy season comes around, but she has no memory of her husband and son whom she dearly loved.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mvstNgM68EyCRWwpArakLhWvvtk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:499028'),
  ('660785675530586837', 'Be-Boy Kidnapp''n Idol', 1989, 'Animation, Drama, Romance', 'Kazuhiro Konishi, Fusanobu Fujiyama, Kenichi Yatagai', 'Michiko Onuki', 'Nozomu Sasaki, Takeshi Kusao, Shuichi Ikeda, Show Hayami, Kiyonobu Suzuki, Hidetoshi Nakamura, Atsushi Anbe', 'NR', 'When thugs target his idol best friend, a model student must face emotions he’s hidden for too long.', 'When thugs target his idol best friend, a model student must face emotions he’s hidden for too long.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6kySz0kYM3X622eMeKE8AxaOOPp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:507455'),
  ('46348565494860117', 'Beach Babes 2: Cave Girl Island', 1995, 'Science Fiction', 'David DeCoteau, Launi Jocsing, Fred Kennamer', 'Mark Michelini', 'Roxanne Blaze, Tina Lawrence, Stephanie Hudson, Rodrigo Botero, Stefan Galio, Kenneth Johnson, Guy Payne, Lenny Rose', 'R', 'The Beach Babes are back... and better than ever! Attempting to return to their home planet, Xena, once again, crash lands the T-Bird ship - this time on a primitive island full of naughty nubile natives. Chased by rampaging dinosaurs and pursued by the evil megalomaniac, James T. Renford II, and his wise-cracking sidekick, Gund, the stranded space sirens have the island rockin''. In an effort to help out the hot heroines, one of the girl''s pumped-up playmates rewires Renford''s computers which accidentally sets off a chain reaction that will cause the island to explode in an ultimate cosmic climax!', 'The Beach Babes are back... and better than ever! Attempting to return to their home planet, Xena, once again, crash lands the T-Bird ship - this time on a primitive island full of naughty nubile natives. Chased by rampaging dinosaurs and pursued by the evil megalomaniac, James T. Renford II, and his wise-cracking sidekick, Gund, the stranded space sirens have the island rockin''. In an effort to help out the hot heroines, one of the girl''s pumped-up playmates rewires Renford''s computers which accidentally sets off a chain reaction that will cause the island to explode in an ultimate cosmic climax!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g43FQI73aX8PcUslyilVZsmiXmn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49595'),
  ('682732581866417716', 'Beach Babes from Beyond', 1993, 'Science Fiction, Comedy', 'James Lawrence Spencer, David DeCoteau, Jerry Gibson', 'Alexander Sachs, William Kelman', 'Joe Estevez, Don Swayze, Joey Travolta, Burt Ward, Jackie Stallone, Linnea Quigley, Roxanne Blaze, Tamara Landry', 'R', 'When smokeshow space teens Xena, Sola, and Luna steal Xena''s dad''s spaceship for an illicit joyride, they run out of gas and come crashing to Earth. There, they meet Dave and Jerry, two equally horny Earth dudes who are good to go and endless scenes of hot, silly, and sultry sex ensue. But when Dave''s easy going Uncle Bud is targeted for eviction from his ramshackle beach house, the hormonal honeys must put their libidos aside and enter a bikini contest, the prize money of which will save the day.', 'When smokeshow space teens Xena, Sola, and Luna steal Xena''s dad''s spaceship for an illicit joyride, they run out of gas and come crashing to Earth. There, they meet Dave and Jerry, two equally horny Earth dudes who are good to go and endless scenes of hot, silly, and sultry sex ensue. But when Dave''s easy going Uncle Bud is targeted for eviction from his ramshackle beach house, the hormonal honeys must put their libidos aside and enter a bikini contest, the prize money of which will save the day.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v5TXbzoPvjsU1JAM8mS7E0gMJro.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29795'),
  ('795389228629878837', 'Beach Ball', 1965, 'Comedy, Music', 'Lennie Weinrib, Gary Kurtz, Floyd Crosby', 'Sam Locke, Paul Rapp', 'Edd Byrnes, Brenda Benet, Chris Noel, Aron Kincaid, Diana Ross, Dick Miller, Gail Gilmore, Jack Bernardi', 'NR', 'Edd Byrnes tries to get an ethnic-music-studies grant to buy instruments for his rock and roll group.', 'Edd Byrnes tries to get an ethnic-music-studies grant to buy instruments for his rock and roll group.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s1h7YHwGoPBQtqUW24wUyLuzPBY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:90177'),
  ('940281857411578795', 'Beach Blanket Bingo', 1965, 'Music, Comedy', 'William Asher, Floyd Crosby, Dale Hutchinson', 'William Asher, Leo Townsend', 'Frankie Avalon, Annette Funicello, Deborah Walley, Harvey Lembeck, John Ashley, Jody McCrea, Donna Loren, Marta Kristen', 'NR', 'In the fourth of the highly successful Frankie and Annette beach party movies, a motorcycle gang led by Eric Von Zipper kidnaps singing star Sugar Kane managed by Bullets, who hires sky-diving surfers Steve and Bonnie from Big Drop for a publicity stunt. With the usual gang of kids and a mermaid named Lorelei.', 'In the fourth of the highly successful Frankie and Annette beach party movies, a motorcycle gang led by Eric Von Zipper kidnaps singing star Sugar Kane managed by Bullets, who hires sky-diving surfers Steve and Bonnie from Big Drop for a publicity stunt. With the usual gang of kids and a mermaid named Lorelei.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/96PQsb6z1hGtck5ZM5B5CsXm7fw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26483'),
