  ('970452634264353064', 'Beach House', 1977, 'Comedy', 'Sergio Citti, Tonino Delli Colli', 'Vincenzo Cerami, Sergio Citti', 'Ugo Tognazzi, Mariangela Melato, Anna Melato, Gigi Proietti, Paolo Stoppa, Flora Carabella, Jodie Foster, Marco Marsili', null, 'Summer Sunday at a small beach house at the coast of Rome. Many people and stories: women''s basketball team, two sports-obsessed soldiers, two men with their girlfriends and the priest with a big secret, an elderly couple with their pregnant granddaughter, and engagemented couple wanting to have sex for the first time.', 'Summer Sunday at a small beach house at the coast of Rome. Many people and stories: women''s basketball team, two sports-obsessed soldiers, two men with their girlfriends and the priest with a big secret, an elderly couple with their pregnant granddaughter, and engagemented couple wanting to have sex for the first time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/APAMSZ2QnChI7PlC1TAEKcvrR9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56379'),
  ('916499433638771519', 'Beach of the War Gods', 1973, 'Action, War', 'Jimmy Wang Yu, Chiu Yao-Hu, Richard Tung Chin-Hu', 'Jimmy Wang Yu', 'Jimmy Wang Yu, Lung Fei, Tien Yeh, Hsueh Han, Shan Mao, Kwan Hung, Chang Yi-Kuai, Hsieh Hsing', null, 'In the waning days of the Ming dynasty, Japanese marauders raid villages on the Chinese coast. A wandering swordsman single-handedly dispatches a group of the foreign thugs, and agrees to help defend the town. He assembles a core team of highly skilled warriors, and together they train the townsfolk to stand up to the foreign pirates, using strategy and skill. When the army launches an all-out assault on the town, a ferocious battle rages, leading to final conflict on the Beach of the War Gods.', 'In the waning days of the Ming dynasty, Japanese marauders raid villages on the Chinese coast. A wandering swordsman single-handedly dispatches a group of the foreign thugs, and agrees to help defend the town. He assembles a core team of highly skilled warriors, and together they train the townsfolk to stand up to the foreign pirates, using strategy and skill. When the army launches an all-out assault on the town, a ferocious battle rages, leading to final conflict on the Beach of the War Gods.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4TW4HvVQUQkmSkBqptSdZGyv7hl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58358'),
  ('141622590990521554', 'Beach Party', 1963, 'Comedy, Music', 'William Asher, Clark L. Paylow, Kay Norton', 'Lou Rusoff', 'Robert Cummings, Dorothy Malone, Frankie Avalon, Annette Funicello, Morey Amsterdam, Harvey Lembeck, Eva Six, John Ashley', 'NR', 'Anthropology Professor Robert Orwell Sutwell and his secretary Marianne are studying the sex habits of teenagers. The surfing teens led by Frankie and Dee Dee don''t have much sex but they sing, battle the motorcycle rats and mice led by Eric Von Zipper and dance to Dick Dale and the Del Tones.', 'Anthropology Professor Robert Orwell Sutwell and his secretary Marianne are studying the sex habits of teenagers. The surfing teens led by Frankie and Dee Dee don''t have much sex but they sing, battle the motorcycle rats and mice led by Eric Von Zipper and dance to Dick Dale and the Del Tones.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3Wmf7VKBIlwUSpakKDMi9LIGnP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26484'),
  ('293141134847694434', 'Beach Picnic', 1939, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Clyde Geronimi, Jack Cutting', null, 'Clarence Nash, Lee Millar', 'NR', 'Donald Duck is at the beach and tries to ride a rubber horse. He notices Pluto sleeping at the shore and decides to have some fun with him by sending the rubber horse over to Pluto which completely mesmerizes him. Meanwhile, a tribe of ants abduct Donald''s picnic lunch. Donald lays out fly paper to stop the ants. Pluto follows one of the ants and, of course, he and later Donald become enmeshed in the fly paper', 'Donald Duck is at the beach and tries to ride a rubber horse. He notices Pluto sleeping at the shore and decides to have some fun with him by sending the rubber horse over to Pluto which completely mesmerizes him. Meanwhile, a tribe of ants abduct Donald''s picnic lunch. Donald lays out fly paper to stop the ants. Pluto follows one of the ants and, of course, he and later Donald become enmeshed in the fly paper', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j5bLuYOGBJ2HclYTJwRl84Ushjc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53453'),
  ('739791759217879307', 'Beach Rats', 2017, 'Drama, Romance', 'Eliza Hittman, Hélène Louvart', 'Eliza Hittman', 'Harris Dickinson, Madeline Weinstein, Kate Hodge, Neal Huff, Nicole Flyus, Frank Hakaj, David Ivanov, Anton Selyaninov', 'R', 'On the outskirts of Brooklyn, Frankie, an aimless teenager, suffocates under the oppressive glare cast by his family and a toxic group of delinquent friends. Struggling with his own identity, Frankie begins to scour hookup sites for older men.', 'On the outskirts of Brooklyn, Frankie, an aimless teenager, suffocates under the oppressive glare cast by his family and a toxic group of delinquent friends. Struggling with his own identity, Frankie begins to scour hookup sites for older men.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oQZPPsvoipd38jasPhvJOpajbug.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:426238'),
  ('1091959587981724780', 'Beach Red', 1967, 'War, Drama', 'Cornel Wilde, Cecil Cooney', 'Cornel Wilde, Clint Johnston, Don Peterson', 'Cornel Wilde, Rip Torn, Burr DeBenning, Patrick Wolfe, Jean Wallace, Jaime Sánchez, Dale Ishimoto, Genki Koyama', 'NR', 'American troops storm ashore on a Japanese-held island and push inland while their enemies plan a counterattack in this look at warfare. Soldiers on both sides are haunted by memories of home and the horrifying, sickening images they find in combat.', 'American troops storm ashore on a Japanese-held island and push inland while their enemies plan a counterattack in this look at warfare. Soldiers on both sides are haunted by memories of home and the horrifying, sickening images they find in combat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eNtergfwCXRIoYQT2Wqjz2vvqpn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39519'),
  ('1120358604511793820', 'Beachcomber', 2026, 'Drama', 'Aristotelis Maragkos, Giorgos Karvelas', 'Aristotelis Maragkos, Chrysoula Korovesi', 'Hristos Passalis, Aliki Andriomenou, Sotiris Belsis', null, 'Elias dreams of building a boat from scrap metal, chasing the shadow of his sailor father''s legacy. But as his creation crumbles, so does the myth he''s built around himself-forcing him to confront the fragile truth of who he really is.', 'Elias dreams of building a boat from scrap metal, chasing the shadow of his sailor father''s legacy. But as his creation crumbles, so does the myth he''s built around himself-forcing him to confront the fragile truth of who he really is.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FrxwYgfDBjwxUqPMIDxmlstV5RX4.jpg', 'plex:movie:beachcomber-2026'),
  ('64522708114593456', 'Beached Tuna', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Matteo Martinez', 'Matteo Martinez, Frank Matano', 'Frank Matano, Lucia Guzzardi, Marika Costabile, Niccolò Senni, Francesco Arienzo, Fabrizio Nevola, Piero Grant', null, 'Francesco, a young man who wants to be a comedian, insults his girlfriend to make his public laugh; she will break up with and so he will think of a crazy plan to win her back.', 'Francesco, a young man who wants to be a comedian, insults his girlfriend to make his public laugh; she will break up with and so he will think of a crazy plan to win her back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dmAFI18nypGhfAUBS5HnpcY63Uz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:521329'),
  ('761035831113489489', 'Beaches', 1988, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Garry Marshall, Dante Spinotti', 'Mary Agnes Donoghue', 'Bette Midler, Barbara Hershey, John Heard, Spalding Gray, Lainie Kazan, James Read, Grace Johnston, Mayim Bialik', 'PG-13', 'A privileged rich debutante and a cynical struggling entertainer share a turbulent, but strong childhood friendship over the years.', 'A privileged rich debutante and a cynical struggling entertainer share a turbulent, but strong childhood friendship over the years.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vol5TCGHDbi8r0yo0TrIGFiGxJ7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15592'),
  ('612229046614868110', 'Beachhead', 1954, 'War', 'Stuart Heisler, Emmett Emerson, Gordon Avil', 'Richard Alan Simmons', 'Tony Curtis, Frank Lovejoy, Mary Murphy, Eduard Franz, Skip Homeier, John Doucette, Alan Wells, Akira Fukunaga', 'PG', 'On a Japanese-occupied island during World War II, only two soldiers remain alive after a mission attempt goes horribly wrong. Trapped on the island, they must escort a scientist and his daughter to the other side of the island where their ship awaits. They must battle nature, hard terrain, and advancing Japanese troops.', 'On a Japanese-occupied island during World War II, only two soldiers remain alive after a mission attempt goes horribly wrong. Trapped on the island, they must escort a scientist and his daughter to the other side of the island where their ship awaits. They must battle nature, hard terrain, and advancing Japanese troops.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rG2E8gcWzHCBLNvxdwZXfgLLPT2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62753'),
  ('520034255076284935', 'Beacon', 2024, 'Thriller', 'Roxy Shih, Mallory Horsman, Mallory Horsman', 'Julio Rojas', 'Demián Bichir, Julia Goldani Telles', null, 'After an ambitious solo trip leaves her shipwrecked on a remote island, a young sailor is rescued by its lone inhabitant: a lighthouse keeper. As the walls of reality begin to vanish and the trust between them unravels, survival becomes a test of grueling proportions.', 'After an ambitious solo trip leaves her shipwrecked on a remote island, a young sailor is rescued by its lone inhabitant: a lighthouse keeper. As the walls of reality begin to vanish and the trust between them unravels, survival becomes a test of grueling proportions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4AB3bHhsNBpnhMDThJP6RI0tery.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1276035'),
  ('614724634822581093', 'Bean', 1997, 'Family, Adventure, Comedy', 'Francis Kenny, Mel Smith, John Greaves', 'Richard Curtis, Robin Driscoll', 'Rowan Atkinson, Peter MacNicol, Pamela Reed, Tricia Vessey, Andrew Lawrence, Harris Yulin, Burt Reynolds, Richard Gant', 'PG-13', 'Childlike Englishman, Mr. Bean, is an incompetent watchman at the Royal National Gallery. After the museum''s board of directors'' attempt to have him fired is blocked by the chairman, who has taken a liking to Bean, they send him to Los Angeles to act as their ambassador for the unveiling of a historic painting to humiliate him. Fooled, Mr. Bean must now successfully unveil the painting or risk his and a hapless Los Angeles curator''s termination.', 'Childlike Englishman, Mr. Bean, is an incompetent watchman at the Royal National Gallery. After the museum''s board of directors'' attempt to have him fired is blocked by the chairman, who has taken a liking to Bean, they send him to Los Angeles to act as their ambassador for the unveiling of a historic painting to humiliate him. Fooled, Mr. Bean must now successfully unveil the painting or risk his and a hapless Los Angeles curator''s termination.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/IwrDPrB4d2DMcpnGkvan46yINL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1281'),
  ('371648107304846669', 'Beanpole', 2019, 'Drama, War', 'Kantemir Balagov, Ksenia Sereda', 'Alexander Terekhov, Kantemir Balagov', 'Viktoriya Miroshnichenko, Vasilisa Perelygina, Konstantin Balakirev, Kseniya Kutepova, Olga Dragunova, Andrey Bykov, Igor Shirokov, Timofey Glazkov', 'NR', '1945, Leningrad. World War II has devastated the city, demolishing its buildings and leaving its citizens in tatters, physically and mentally. Two young women, Iya and Masha, search for meaning and hope in the struggle to rebuild their lives amongst the ruins.', '1945, Leningrad. World War II has devastated the city, demolishing its buildings and leaving its citizens in tatters, physically and mentally. Two young women, Iya and Masha, search for meaning and hope in the struggle to rebuild their lives amongst the ruins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nKVrJm1dOwALdr2KHxNFhkbTSZc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:517148'),
  ('871373755266014905', 'Beans', 2000, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Bora Tekay', 'Haluk Özenç', 'Selim Erdoğan, Elvin Beşikçioğlu, Bülent Kayabaş, Burak Sergen, Taner Barlas, Haluk Özenç, Gürkan Uygun, Kutay Köktürk', null, 'The duty of taking the tax return forms of the villagers to the big city is assigned to a naive young guy. The villagers trust him, and hand their tax return forms to him. Taking the forms along with the lunchbox full of beans his mother cooked for him, he''s underway. But he meets some weird people on the way, who also run into some other weird people, and things start to follow an unexpected path for everyone involved, bringing hillarious moments along.', 'The duty of taking the tax return forms of the villagers to the big city is assigned to a naive young guy. The villagers trust him, and hand their tax return forms to him. Taking the forms along with the lunchbox full of beans his mother cooked for him, he''s underway. But he meets some weird people on the way, who also run into some other weird people, and things start to follow an unexpected path for everyone involved, bringing hillarious moments along.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yqi6g5FB23q3y7Sc5qvHPs0lwoS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:284139'),
  ('571748011878705695', 'Beans', 2021, 'Drama', 'Marie Davignon, Rene Haynes, Maxime Giroux', 'Meredith Vuchnich, Tracey Deer', 'Kiawentiio, Rainbow Dickerson, Violah Beauvais, Paulina Alexis, D''Pharaoh Woon-A-Tai, Joel Montgrand, Taio Gélinas, Brittany LeBorgne', null, 'Twelve-year-old Beans is on the edge: torn between innocent childhood and reckless adolescence; forced to grow up fast and become the tough Mohawk warrior she needs to be during the Oka Crisis, the turbulent Indigenous uprising that tore Quebec and Canada apart for 78 tense days in the summer of 1990.', 'Twelve-year-old Beans is on the edge: torn between innocent childhood and reckless adolescence; forced to grow up fast and become the tough Mohawk warrior she needs to be during the Oka Crisis, the turbulent Indigenous uprising that tore Quebec and Canada apart for 78 tense days in the summer of 1990.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2LkLGOTHOvMCxKwJBav607Hqmgw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:726220'),
  ('511600237434053508', 'Beanstalk Bunny', 1955, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Chuck Jones, Carl W. Stalling', null, 'Mel Blanc, Arthur Q. Bryan', null, 'Bugs Bunny and Daffy Duck (as Jack) find themselves at the top of a beanstalk where they get chased around by a giant Elmer Fudd.', 'Bugs Bunny and Daffy Duck (as Jack) find themselves at the top of a beanstalk where they get chased around by a giant Elmer Fudd.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1QSeGZCe3RveftLoRBE1zMoSnq6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:106928'),
  ('434300885925977813', 'Bear Country', 1953, 'Documentary', 'James Algar', 'James Algar', 'Winston Hibler', 'G', 'Bear Country is a 1953 American short documentary film directed by James Algar. It won an Academy Award at the 26th Academy Awards in 1954 for Best Short Subject (Two-Reel).[1] The film was produced by Walt Disney as part of the True-Life Adventures series of nature documentaries.', 'Bear Country is a 1953 American short documentary film directed by James Algar. It won an Academy Award at the 26th Academy Awards in 1954 for Best Short Subject (Two-Reel).[1] The film was produced by Walt Disney as part of the True-Life Adventures series of nature documentaries.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iBovkMfembshuPKX31o0nqlqiTY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:162106'),
  ('429806142279962113', 'Bear Cub', 2004, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Miguel Albaladejo, Alfonso Sanz', 'Miguel Albaladejo, Salvador García Ruiz', 'José Luis García Pérez, David Castillo, Empar Ferrer, Elvira Lindo, Arno Chevrier, Mario Arias, Daniel Llobregat, Josele Román', 'PG-13', 'Pedro, a gay man with an active social life and big circle of friends, takes in his nephew Bernardo for a couple weeks. When it appears as though it might become a permanent arrangement, however, Pedro turns to his friends for guidance as he and 9-year-old Bernardo begin to forge a household together.', 'Pedro, a gay man with an active social life and big circle of friends, takes in his nephew Bernardo for a couple weeks. When it appears as though it might become a permanent arrangement, however, Pedro turns to his friends for guidance as he and 9-year-old Bernardo begin to forge a household together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oAit5WpzApbgtJ1nJ95rl30zAuR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47549'),
  ('104951503069975475', 'Bear Island', 1979, 'Thriller, Action, Adventure, Mystery', 'Don Sharp, Alan Hume', 'Don Sharp, David Butler', 'Donald Sutherland, Vanessa Redgrave, Richard Widmark, Christopher Lee, Barbara Parkins, Lloyd Bridges, Lawrence Dane, Patricia Collins', null, 'A group of people converge on a barren Arctic island. They have their reasons for being there but when a series of mysterious accidents and murders take place, a whole lot of darker motives become apparent. Could the fortune in buried Nazi gold be the key to the mystery? Donald Sutherland and Vanessa Redgrave investigate', 'A group of people converge on a barren Arctic island. They have their reasons for being there but when a series of mysterious accidents and murders take place, a whole lot of darker motives become apparent. Could the fortune in buried Nazi gold be the key to the mystery? Donald Sutherland and Vanessa Redgrave investigate', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wV47h3DO46jb8eZPluCXq5unHTR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38629'),
  ('777842368786576881', 'Bear Story', 2016, 'Animation, Drama', 'Gabriel Osorio, Gabriel Osorio, Antonia Herrera Oesterheld', 'Gabriel Osorio, Daniel Castro', null, 'G', 'An old bear goes out every day to a busy street corner. Through a tin marionette theater of his own making, the bear will tell us his life story.', 'An old bear goes out every day to a busy street corner. Through a tin marionette theater of his own making, the bear will tell us his life story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e1jOg4lKOfWmOhfX2hjHpVkGlau.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:351981'),
  ('1106892490977230956', 'Bearly Asleep', 1955, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Jack Hannah', null, 'Clarence Nash, James MacDonald', 'NR', 'Park ranger Donald sends his bears off to hibernate, but Humphrey would rather stay in his hammock, run out for a glass of water, etc., than sleep; when he does get to sleep, his snoring gets him thrown out. His search for a new bed leads him right into the ranger''s house.', 'Park ranger Donald sends his bears off to hibernate, but Humphrey would rather stay in his hammock, run out for a glass of water, etc., than sleep; when he does get to sleep, his snoring gets him thrown out. His search for a new bed leads him right into the ranger''s house.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vRZjExI2lPltMdry8EDNPGOlGxe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54163'),
  ('127166600702761795', 'Bears', 2014, 'Documentary', 'Keith Scholey, Alastair Fothergill, Sophie Darlington', null, 'John C. Reilly', 'G', 'Filmmakers Alastair Fothergill and Keith Scholey chronicle a year in the lives of an Alaskan brown bear named Sky and her cubs, Scout and Amber. Their saga begins as the bears emerge from hibernation at the end of winter. As time passes, the bear family must work together to find food and stay safe from other predators, especially other bears. Although their world is exciting, it is also risky, and the cubs'' survival hinges on family togetherness.', 'Filmmakers Alastair Fothergill and Keith Scholey chronicle a year in the lives of an Alaskan brown bear named Sky and her cubs, Scout and Amber. Their saga begins as the bears emerge from hibernation at the end of winter. As time passes, the bear family must work together to find food and stay safe from other predators, especially other bears. Although their world is exciting, it is also risky, and the cubs'' survival hinges on family togetherness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dO2JdK7MonWis9Jg2im9IcVq7eJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:214314'),
  ('226672740298717721', 'Beast', 2018, 'Mystery, Crime, Drama', 'Michael Pearce, Giles Barron, Benjamin Kračun', 'Michael Pearce', 'Jessie Buckley, Johnny Flynn, Trystan Gravelle, Geraldine James, Oliver Maltman, Tim Woodward, Hattie Gotobed, Shannon Tarbet', 'R', 'A troubled woman living in an isolated community finds herself pulled between the control of her oppressive family and the allure of a secretive outsider suspected of a series of brutal murders.', 'A troubled woman living in an isolated community finds herself pulled between the control of her oppressive family and the allure of a secretive outsider suspected of a series of brutal murders.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kZdncyp1IKhEqwv5zdmUpK5Dc7S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:470918'),
  ('726579302502650060', 'Beast', 2022, 'Animation, Drama, Thriller', 'Hugo Covarrubias, Zyanya Salcedo, Hugo Covarrubias', 'Hugo Covarrubias, Martín Erazo', null, null, 'Inspired by real events, "Bestia" enters the life of a secret police agent in the military dictatorship in Chile. The relationship with her dog, her body, her fears and frustrations, reveal a macabre fracture in her mind and a country.', 'Inspired by real events, "Bestia" enters the life of a secret police agent in the military dictatorship in Chile. The relationship with her dog, her body, her fears and frustrations, reveal a macabre fracture in her mind and a country.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nK2SA0oiZK8AMmGJeriUBrRFDrp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:828751'),
  ('662691807750319369', 'Beast Cops', 1998, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Dante Lam Chiu-Yin, Gordon Chan, Tony Cheung Tung-Leung', 'Gordon Chan, Chan Hing-Kai', 'Michael Wong, Anthony Wong Chau-Sang, Patrick Tam Yiu-Man, Roy Cheung Yiu-Yeung, Kathy Chow Hoi-Mei, Sam Lee, Stephanie Che Yuen-Yuen, Kam Kong', null, 'Tung is a street cop in Hong Kong who''s friends with a Triad named Fai. Fai hires a hit man to murder a business rival; the hit goes wrong and Fai, implicated in the incident, goes on the run.', 'Tung is a street cop in Hong Kong who''s friends with a Triad named Fai. Fai hires a hit man to murder a business rival; the hit goes wrong and Fai, implicated in the incident, goes on the run.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r1kz0gAYZCeB8mLDzxG7hmenrdV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44267'),
