  ('490196972916120512', 'Beast in Space', 1980, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Alfonso Brescia, Silvio Fraschetti, Massimo Carocci', 'Alfonso Brescia, Aldo Crudo', 'Sirpa Lane, Marina Hedman, Vassili Karis, Lucio Rosato, Claudio Undari, Claudio Zucchet, Giuseppe Fortis, Venantino Venantini', null, 'In the future the struggle for space superiority has forced humanity to search the cosmos for a rare element called Antallum that is the key ingredient for the construction of neutron bombs. Starship captain Larry Madison and his crew are assigned to retrieve Antallum from the remote planet Lorigon. However, Madison and crew find themselves under the control of a powerful computer on Lorigon that incites everyone to have sex. Some versions feature brief adult scenes shot with body doubles.', 'In the future the struggle for space superiority has forced humanity to search the cosmos for a rare element called Antallum that is the key ingredient for the construction of neutron bombs. Starship captain Larry Madison and his crew are assigned to retrieve Antallum from the remote planet Lorigon. However, Madison and crew find themselves under the control of a powerful computer on Lorigon that incites everyone to have sex. Some versions feature brief adult scenes shot with body doubles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1aLcooc0GiS9FOoO1StbotXGJJv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52883'),
  ('705819893444225536', 'Beast Man Snow Man', 1955, 'Science Fiction, Horror, Adventure', 'Ishirō Honda, Tadashi Iimura, Kihachi Okamoto', 'Takeo Murata', 'Akira Takarada, Akemi Negishi, Momoko Kôchi, Nobuo Nakamura, Sachio Sakai, Yoshio Kosugi, Kenji Kasahara, Toshitsugu Suzuki', 'NR', 'Three competing parties all race against time to track down an elusive creature known only as the Snowman.', 'Three competing parties all race against time to track down an elusive creature known only as the Snowman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lMoz0FNw8X6zdyXeSytyrRDo0dD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:171502'),
