  ('780477557677208392', 'Beast of War', 2025, 'Thriller, Action, War, Horror', 'Kiah Roache-Turner, Mark Wareham', 'Kiah Roache-Turner', 'Mark Coles Smith, Joel Nankervis, Sam Delich, Maximillian Johnson, Lee Tiger Halley, Sam Parsonson, Tristan McKinnon, Aswan Reid', 'R', 'When their boat sinks while crossing the Timor Sea during World War II, a troop of young Australian soldiers must find a way to survive the harsh seas on a quickly shrinking raft. Hundreds of miles from anywhere, they must confront interpersonal conflicts, enemy attacks, and the advances of one very large, very hungry great white shark.', 'When their boat sinks while crossing the Timor Sea during World War II, a troop of young Australian soldiers must find a way to survive the harsh seas on a quickly shrinking raft. Hundreds of miles from anywhere, they must confront interpersonal conflicts, enemy attacks, and the advances of one very large, very hungry great white shark.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2xgDjVEOtu5LlbPEngxfbCqWEFg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1244531'),
  ('1090853302766601270', 'Beast Stalker', 2008, 'Action, Thriller, Crime', 'Dante Lam Chiu-Yin, Cheung Man-Po, Leslie Lam Pak-Wai', 'Dante Lam Chiu-Yin, Jack Ng Wai-Lun', 'Nicholas Tse Ting-Fung, Nick Cheung Ka-Fai, Zhang Jingchu, Miao Pu, Liu Kai-Chi, Sherman Chung Shu-Man, Zhang Chenghe, Lau Kong', 'R', 'Sergeant Tong is wracked with guilt after he unwittingly kills a young girl whilst capuring a criminal named Cheung. When the girl''s sister is later kidnapped in a ploy to get Cheung released, Sergeant Tong vows to find and rescue her before she comes to harm.', 'Sergeant Tong is wracked with guilt after he unwittingly kills a young girl whilst capuring a criminal named Cheung. When the girl''s sister is later kidnapped in a ploy to get Cheung released, Sergeant Tong vows to find and rescue her before she comes to harm.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hlaIVAyQc2Wo5AIpprYIkpbirAT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18060'),
  ('863049357148432824', 'Beastie Boys', 2008, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Yoon Jong-bin, Go Rak-sun, Lee Il-hyung', 'Yoon Jong-bin', 'Yoon Kye-sang, Ha Jung-woo, Yoon Jin-seo, Kim Min-joo, Don Lee, Yu Ha-jun, Kwon Yul, Yoon A-jung', null, 'Two friends are involved in the male escort business. One starts an honest relationship with one of his clients. The other cheats on his girlfriend and has his many scams catch up to him.', 'Two friends are involved in the male escort business. One starts an honest relationship with one of his clients. The other cheats on his girlfriend and has his many scams catch up to him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zjyxG7uZE9MDb4Ri0F7sNr26f0i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69383'),
  ('658568309568297598', 'Beastie Boys Story', 2020, 'Music, Documentary', 'Spike Jonze, Autumn Durald Arkapaw, Tom Gaito', 'Adam Horovitz, Spike Jonze, Mike D', 'Mike D, Adam Horovitz, Adam Yauch, Ben Stiller, Steve Buscemi, David Cross, Michael Kenneth Williams, Afrika Bambaataa', 'R', 'Here''s a little story they''re about to tell... Mike Diamond and Adam Horovitz share the story of their band and 40 years of friendship in a live documentary experience directed by friend, collaborator, and their former grandfather, Spike Jonze.', 'Here''s a little story they''re about to tell... Mike Diamond and Adam Horovitz share the story of their band and 40 years of friendship in a live documentary experience directed by friend, collaborator, and their former grandfather, Spike Jonze.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mph9vxXnEgiFrkrUqMk40DpPtEX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:664416'),
  ('853125734201444109', 'Beastly', 2011, 'Romance, Fantasy, Drama', 'Daniel Barnz, Mandy Walker, Isabelle Guay', 'Daniel Barnz', 'Alex Pettyfer, Vanessa Hudgens, Mary-Kate Olsen, LisaGay Hamilton, Neil Patrick Harris, Dakota Johnson, Erik Knudsen, Peter Krause', 'PG-13', 'A modern-day take on the "Beauty and the Beast" tale where a New York teen is transformed into a hideous monster in order to find true love.', 'A modern-day take on the "Beauty and the Beast" tale where a New York teen is transformed into a hideous monster in order to find true love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uSAXWZsSD0pE4HYVUiDgusnEyyl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38117'),
