  ('47156070191139916', 'Beastmaster III: The Eye of Braxus', 1996, 'Fantasy, Action, Adventure', 'Michael J. Davis, Gabrielle Beaumont, Francis R. Mahony III', 'David Wise', 'Marc Singer, Tony Todd, Keith Coulouris, Sandra Hess, Casper Van Dien, Patrick Kilpatrick, Lesley-Anne Down, David Warner', 'PG', 'Before he died, Dar''s father gave a mysterious amulet to Tal, Dar''s younger brother who is now king. Dar, while wandering with his animal companions, chances to meet and rescue a family who seek the help of King Tal against Lord Agon, a sorcerer who has conquered their land. Dar obtains an audience for them with Tal, who rallies his troops to march against Agon in the morning. Alas, the young king is captured by Agon''s crimson warriors during the night.', 'Before he died, Dar''s father gave a mysterious amulet to Tal, Dar''s younger brother who is now king. Dar, while wandering with his animal companions, chances to meet and rescue a family who seek the help of King Tal against Lord Agon, a sorcerer who has conquered their land. Dar obtains an audience for them with Tal, who rallies his troops to march against Agon in the morning. Alas, the young king is captured by Agon''s crimson warriors during the night.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8nC2YMR0lHnPNUv7LGdt9DuXiam.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36291'),
  ('1041367607113689801', 'Beasts', 2021, 'Drama', 'Noé Bach, Naël Marandin', 'Marion Doussot, Marion Desseigne-Ravel, Naël Marandin', 'Diane Rouxel, Finnegan Oldfield, Jalil Lespert, Olivier Gourmet, Bruno Raffaelli, Clémence Boisnard, Samuel Churin, Sophie Cattani', null, 'Constance and her fiancé hope to one day take over, modernize and expand her father’s farm, on the verge of bankruptcy, to the large-scale farms that share the land and power. She gains the support of the influential and charismatic Sylvain, their fate quickly lying in his hands... When Sylvain''s desire for her steps in the negotiations, Constance must face yet another kind of violence.', 'Constance and her fiancé hope to one day take over, modernize and expand her father’s farm, on the verge of bankruptcy, to the large-scale farms that share the land and power. She gains the support of the influential and charismatic Sylvain, their fate quickly lying in his hands... When Sylvain''s desire for her steps in the negotiations, Constance must face yet another kind of violence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lopHBX7VhlDpANpGun9EmwDCFoP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:714017'),
  ('199990555543135354', 'Beasts Cage', 2008, 'Drama', 'Hiroyuki Kawasaki', 'Kosuke Komatsu', 'Aoi Mizumori, Kazu Itsuki, Kenji Nakazawa', null, 'A young bar waitress, Natsuko has accepted to many Mr. Uehara, a rich art teacher. It’s because Uehara could pay the debt for Natsuko’s ex-husband. Mr. Uchara agreed with the terms but suspected that Natsuko betrayed him for money and continued to meet Seiji. Mr. Uehara determined to punish his young wife in his “artistic” way. He tied her up and locked her in the basement of his house, or better described as “the beasts’ cage”, a place where a “bitch” was tortured and sexually abused in various SM ways', 'A young bar waitress, Natsuko has accepted to many Mr. Uehara, a rich art teacher. It’s because Uehara could pay the debt for Natsuko’s ex-husband. Mr. Uchara agreed with the terms but suspected that Natsuko betrayed him for money and continued to meet Seiji. Mr. Uehara determined to punish his young wife in his “artistic” way. He tied her up and locked her in the basement of his house, or better described as “the beasts’ cage”, a place where a “bitch” was tortured and sexually abused in various SM ways', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/apuIoAFqgwc0ZZmpgjtIGcCMtKJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:348084'),
  ('993398670706852239', 'Beasts Clawing at Straws', 2020, 'Mystery, Thriller, Crime, Drama', 'Kim Yong-hoon, Kim Tae-sung, Cho Yong-jin', 'Kim Yong-hoon', 'Jeon Do-yeon, Jung Woo-sung, Bae Sung-woo, Youn Yuh-jung, Jeong Man-sik, Jin Kyung, Shin Hyun-been, Jung Ga-ram', null, 'A struggling restaurant owner, caring for his sick mom, finds a bag of cash in a sauna locker, while a customs officer gets into trouble when his girlfriend runs off with money he borrowed from a loan shark.', 'A struggling restaurant owner, caring for his sick mom, finds a bag of cash in a sauna locker, while a customs officer gets into trouble when his girlfriend runs off with money he borrowed from a loan shark.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lO4hjVBxrVtMmupGraIR3c7Jq1Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:571648'),
  ('613514644125227962', 'Beasts of No Nation', 2015, 'Drama, War', 'Cary Joji Fukunaga, Cary Joji Fukunaga', 'Cary Joji Fukunaga', 'Abraham Attah, Idris Elba, Emmanuel Nii Adom Quaye, Opeyemi Fagbohungbe, Emmanuel Affadzi, Richard Pepple, Ama K. Abebrese, Kobina Amissah-Sam', 'R', 'Based on the experiences of Agu, a child fighting in the civil war of a West African country. Follows Agu''s journey as he''s forced to join a group of soldiers. While he fears his commander and many of the men around him, his fledgling childhood has been brutally shattered by the war raging through his country, and he is at first torn between conflicting revulsion and fascination.', 'Based on the experiences of Agu, a child fighting in the civil war of a West African country. Follows Agu''s journey as he''s forced to join a group of soldiers. While he fears his commander and many of the men around him, his fledgling childhood has been brutally shattered by the war raging through his country, and he is at first torn between conflicting revulsion and fascination.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1D4vcJmJc58WXarpRtwgd2do9Rg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:283587'),
  ('436871016025195838', 'Beasts of the Southern Wild', 2012, 'Drama, Fantasy', 'Ben Richardson, Benh Zeitlin, Gordon Bell', 'Benh Zeitlin, Lucy Alibar', 'Quvenzhané Wallis, Dwight Henry, Levy Easterly, Gina Montana, Lowell Landes, Pamela Harper, Amber Henry, Jonshel Alexander', 'PG-13', 'Hushpuppy, an intrepid six-year-old girl, lives with her father, Wink, in ''the Bathtub'', a southern Delta community at the edge of the world. Wink’s tough love prepares her for the unraveling of the universe—for a time when he’s no longer there to protect her. When Wink contracts a mysterious illness, nature flies out of whack—temperatures rise and the ice caps melt, unleashing an army of prehistoric creatures called aurochs. With the waters rising, the aurochs coming, and Wink’s health fading, Hushpuppy goes in search of her lost mother.', 'Hushpuppy, an intrepid six-year-old girl, lives with her father, Wink, in ''the Bathtub'', a southern Delta community at the edge of the world. Wink’s tough love prepares her for the unraveling of the universe—for a time when he’s no longer there to protect her. When Wink contracts a mysterious illness, nature flies out of whack—temperatures rise and the ice caps melt, unleashing an army of prehistoric creatures called aurochs. With the waters rising, the aurochs coming, and Wink’s health fading, Hushpuppy goes in search of her lost mother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nQJmWekGYlXhezGUb21xFfEfwhH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84175'),
  ('158950447436386120', 'Beat', 1997, 'Action, Drama', 'Kim Sung-soo, Kim Hyung-koo, Lee Kang-san', 'Sim San', 'Jung Woo-sung, Ko So-young, Yu Oh-seong, Im Chang-jung, Sa Hyeon-jin, Song Keum-Sik, Jang Dong-jik, Shin Beom-sik', null, 'Min, a tough guy whose widowed mother is a drunk. The story traces his journey from high school to the underworld as one of his friends introduces him to life in the mob. Complicating Min''s life further is his romance with Romi, a girl from an upper-class family with dreams of going to a prestigious college.', 'Min, a tough guy whose widowed mother is a drunk. The story traces his journey from high school to the underworld as one of his friends introduces him to life in the mob. Complicating Min''s life further is his romance with Romi, a girl from an upper-class family with dreams of going to a prestigious college.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hWx3FSlsTyBwcZz7AWisS0oWOFr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67089'),
  ('54943012060400445', 'Beat', 2000, 'Drama', 'Gary Walkow', 'Gary Walkow', 'Kiefer Sutherland, Courtney Love, Ron Livingston, Norman Reedus, Sam Trammell, Alec Von Bargen, Tommy Perna, Daniel Martínez', 'R', 'The true story of two murders that shaped the lives of several college students who went on to become some of the most influential writers of the "Beat Generation."', 'The true story of two murders that shaped the lives of several college students who went on to become some of the most influential writers of the "Beat Generation."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xU21EkXXbBC2zYH5zs4hEXFbEqI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3178'),
  ('143713684604923797', 'Beat Girl', 1960, 'Drama', 'Edmond T. Gréville, Walter Lassally', 'Dail Ambler', 'David Farrar, Noëlle Adam, Christopher Lee, Gillian Hills, Adam Faith, Shirley Anne Field, Peter McEnery, Claire Gordon', null, 'When her architect father brings home a much younger new wife, rebellious and resentful teen Jenny goes to extreme lengths to sabotage their relationship.', 'When her architect father brings home a much younger new wife, rebellious and resentful teen Jenny goes to extreme lengths to sabotage their relationship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hCA0ecn9LjRWbXXu1E1jUIUi0JV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43092'),
  ('299139523064177046', 'Beat Street', 1984, 'Drama, Music', 'Stan Lathan, Tom Priestley Jr.', 'Andrew Davis, David Gilbert, Paul Golding', 'Guy Davis, Rae Dawn Chong, Saundra Santiago, Doug E. Fresh, Mary Alice, Shawn Elliott, Duane Jones, Kadeem Hardison', 'PG', 'An aspiring DJ, from the South Bronx, and his best friend, a promoter, try to get into show business by exposing people to hip-hop music and culture.', 'An aspiring DJ, from the South Bronx, and his best friend, a promoter, try to get into show business by exposing people to hip-hop music and culture.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cn0gXtGgQXT7EVVXKJRhK4E1nOc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17667'),
  ('889641560125126109', 'Beat the Devil', 1953, 'Adventure, Comedy', 'Oswald Morris, John Huston, Robert Sterne', 'Truman Capote, John Huston', 'Humphrey Bogart, Jennifer Jones, Gina Lollobrigida, Robert Morley, Peter Lorre, Edward Underdown, Ivor Barnard, Marco Tulli', 'NR', 'A group of con artists stake their claim on a bogus uranium mine.', 'A group of con artists stake their claim on a bogus uranium mine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yBg55pY6WYPqzZuQ1rJ4Cjj5nOG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22733'),
  ('881599284914882522', 'Beat the Devil', 2002, 'Comedy, Action, Fantasy', 'Tony Scott, Paul Cameron', 'David Carter, Vincent Ngo, Greg Hahn', 'Clive Owen, Gary Oldman, James Brown, Marilyn Manson, Danny Trejo, Tony Wilson, Tomi Rae Brown, Judge Bradley', null, 'The Driver drag-races the Devil, in order to earn James Brown his soul.', 'The Driver drag-races the Devil, in order to earn James Brown his soul.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/QkWtQ5Vle4w8MzgpsLtwDpw28q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51939'),
  ('718229761845029567', 'Beat the World', 2011, 'Music, Drama', 'Robert Adetuyi, Hubert Taczanowski', 'Robert Adetuyi', 'Tyrone Marshall Brown, Mishael Morgan, Nikki Grant, Chase Armitage, Ray Johnson, Kristy Flores, Shane Pollard, Luís Lobianco', 'PG-13', 'Three dance crews – one Latin American, one European and one Canadian – prepare to battle at the International Beat the World competition in Detroit. Along the way, they struggle with gambling debt, bad break-ups and their own egos. In the final showdown to become world champions they find that their lifelong hopes, dreams and even lives, are at stake.', 'Three dance crews – one Latin American, one European and one Canadian – prepare to battle at the International Beat the World competition in Detroit. Along the way, they struggle with gambling debt, bad break-ups and their own egos. In the final showdown to become world champions they find that their lifelong hopes, dreams and even lives, are at stake.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nZCPl2Du2PRkky4Mzb4YiXk9C1Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66767'),
  ('13762040650884369', 'Beata te', 2022, 'Comedy, Fantasy, TV Movie', 'Paola Randi, Valerio Azzali', 'Lisa Nur Sultan, Carlotta Corradi', 'Serena Rossi, Fabio Balsamo, Paola Tiziana Cruciani, Gianni Ferreri, Valentina Correani, Elisa Di Eusanio, Corrado Fortuna, Emiliano Masala', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xY2tMlIH1A3lYDlQbf43E0LFvFE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:990600'),
  ('879054034179881438', 'Beate', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Samad Zarmandili', 'Gianni Gatti, Salvatore Maira, Antonio Cecchi', 'Donatella Finocchiaro, Paolo Pierobon, Maria Roveran, Lucia Sardo, Licia Navarrini, Felicitè Mbezelè', null, 'In the northeast of Italy, the workers of a lingerie factory are about to be fired. Not far away, a handful of nuns, skilled in the art of embroidery and devoted to the Blessed Armida, risk being removed from their beloved convent. To oppose a destiny already marked, workers and nuns join forces and start a "business" outside the rules in the hopes that a miracle will help them keep the convent and the factory.', 'In the northeast of Italy, the workers of a lingerie factory are about to be fired. Not far away, a handful of nuns, skilled in the art of embroidery and devoted to the Blessed Armida, risk being removed from their beloved convent. To oppose a destiny already marked, workers and nuns join forces and start a "business" outside the rules in the hopes that a miracle will help them keep the convent and the factory.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hvRsZ3fx41kylj7jGMkOM9NFrmJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:522140'),
  ('725015656137217134', 'Beaten to Death', 2023, 'Horror', 'Sam Curtain', 'Sam Curtain, Benjamin Jung-Clarke', 'Thomas Roach, David Tracy, Nicole Tudor, Justan Wagner, June Clarke, Andy Krambousanos, Fiona Svamvur, Benny Blake', 'NR', 'A desperate choice leads Jack down a path that leaves him beaten and bruised as he struggles against man, nature and his own insanity. Stranded in the middle of nowhere after barely surviving a horrific assault, Jack encounters one local after another and quickly learns that a sick game of cat and mouse is about to begin. Battling the deranged country psychos and the harsh landscape, Jack must go to extreme lengths to survive.', 'A desperate choice leads Jack down a path that leaves him beaten and bruised as he struggles against man, nature and his own insanity. Stranded in the middle of nowhere after barely surviving a horrific assault, Jack encounters one local after another and quickly learns that a sick game of cat and mouse is about to begin. Battling the deranged country psychos and the harsh landscape, Jack must go to extreme lengths to survive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yJXHKU5lTu1AL6i798iX43aKNpE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1032949'),
  ('430456846031370626', 'Beating Heart', 1940, 'Drama', 'Henri Decoin, Fred Pasquali, Robert Lefebvre', 'Max Kolpé, Hans Wilhelm', 'Danielle Darrieux, Claude Dauphin, André Luguet, Junie Astor, Charles Dechamps, Roger Blin, Sylvain Itkine, Pierre Feuillère', null, 'Tells the story of a young woman escaping from reform school who tries to steal a foreign ambassador''s watch but ends up falling in love with him.', 'Tells the story of a young woman escaping from reform school who tries to steal a foreign ambassador''s watch but ends up falling in love with him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9uixOIxNlgZjSqWs4OLBujr9RnQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:257050'),
  ('367735728815936610', 'Beating Hearts', 2024, 'Romance, Crime, Drama', 'Gilles Lellouche, Elsa Pharaon, Laurent Tangy', 'Gilles Lellouche, Audrey Diwan, Julien Lambroschini', 'Adèle Exarchopoulos, François Civil, Mallory Wanecque, Malik Frikah, Alain Chabat, Benoît Poelvoorde, Vincent Lacoste, Jean-Pascal Zadi', null, 'Local rebellious teenager Clotaire falls for his schoolmate Jackie, but gang violence leads him to a darker destructive path. After years apart, the star-crossed lovers discover that every path they''ve taken leads them back together.', 'Local rebellious teenager Clotaire falls for his schoolmate Jackie, but gang violence leads him to a darker destructive path. After years apart, the star-crossed lovers discover that every path they''ve taken leads them back together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yu9dRyKcUHTfKcqsomUtpord4t3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:959604'),
  ('1026145016966402531', 'Beating Sun', 2023, 'Drama', 'Pierre-Hubert Martin, Maxime Mudjeredian, Philippe Petit', 'Philippe Petit, Laurette Polmanss, Mathieu Robin', 'Swann Arlaud, Sarah Adler, Grégoire Oestermann, Djibril Cissé, Lee Fortuné-Petit, Pascal Rénéric, Marc Robert, Philippe Petit', null, 'Max is preparing an architecture and landscape competition for the city of Marseille. He is confident, his project is daring but pioneering. The oral is going well. The garden on this square is finally emerging and with it radical changes for the inhabitants as well as for Max whose career is stalling dangerously.', 'Max is preparing an architecture and landscape competition for the city of Marseille. He is confident, his project is daring but pioneering. The oral is going well. The garden on this square is finally emerging and with it radical changes for the inhabitants as well as for Max whose career is stalling dangerously.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/et6LbIzn6XPKO84BHlhjzQ6yhPc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:892504'),
  ('138758170118303922', 'Beatles ''64', 2024, 'Documentary, Music', 'David Tedeschi, Ellen Kuras', null, 'Paul McCartney, Ringo Starr, John Lennon, George Harrison, Martin Scorsese, Ronnie Spector, David Lynch, Brian Epstein', 'R', 'Featuring never-before-seen footage of the band and the legions of young fans who helped fuel their ascendance, follow McCartney, John Lennon, George Harrison and Starr as they land in New York City in February 1964 and solidify their status as the biggest band in the world.', 'Featuring never-before-seen footage of the band and the legions of young fans who helped fuel their ascendance, follow McCartney, John Lennon, George Harrison and Starr as they land in New York City in February 1964 and solidify their status as the biggest band in the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ny9fI756vTYVG3PrJwBUwXOeSBO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1371146'),
  ('958774983719085427', 'Beatrice', 1987, 'Drama', 'Bertrand Tavernier, Bruno de Keyzer', 'Colo Tavernier O''Hagan', 'Julie Delpy, Bernard-Pierre Donnadieu, Monique Chaumette, Robert Dhéry, Michèle Gleizer, Maxime Leroux, Jean-Claude Adelin, Jean-Louis Grinfeld', null, 'Somewhere in France during the Middle Ages. Béatrice is impatient to see her father return from English captivity. She doesn''t expect however that the father whom she loves from distance will be the most hateful person who will submit her and her family to abuse and humiliation.', 'Somewhere in France during the Middle Ages. Béatrice is impatient to see her father return from English captivity. She doesn''t expect however that the father whom she loves from distance will be the most hateful person who will submit her and her family to abuse and humiliation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6KTZcQe3UZeeYkA9hZcRp0opA5l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42009'),
  ('690146992514483530', 'Beatriz', 1976, 'Drama, Horror', 'Gonzalo Suárez, Carlos Suárez, Rodolfo Medina', 'Santiago Moncada, Gonzalo Suárez', 'Carmen Sevilla, Nadiuska, Jorge Rivero, José Sacristán, Sandra Mozarowsky, Elsa Zabala, José Lifante, Óscar Martín', null, 'A child is witness to an assault on a monk by the gang of Lorenzo the Fifth. The monk escapes and takes refuge in the estate of Doña Carlota, a countess who lives with her son Juan and daughter Beatriz. Basilisa, the maid, conjures the devil to free her son from an irreversible illness, but to do so the evil must be transmitted to an innocent soul, and for that she chooses Beatriz. The child begins to be the victim of a possession, for which everyone blames the monk.', 'A child is witness to an assault on a monk by the gang of Lorenzo the Fifth. The monk escapes and takes refuge in the estate of Doña Carlota, a countess who lives with her son Juan and daughter Beatriz. Basilisa, the maid, conjures the devil to free her son from an irreversible illness, but to do so the evil must be transmitted to an innocent soul, and for that she chooses Beatriz. The child begins to be the victim of a possession, for which everyone blames the monk.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ogeK65OH06UIUmPLfDHnBWp4QcC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:258942'),
  ('689302378105105079', 'Beatriz at Dinner', 2017, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Miguel Arteta, Wyatt Garfield', 'Mike White', 'Salma Hayek Pinault, John Lithgow, Connie Britton, Jay Duplass, Amy Landecker, Chloë Sevigny, David Warshofsky, John Early', 'R', 'Beatriz, an immigrant from a poor town in Mexico, has drawn on her innate kindness to build a career as a health practitioner. Doug Strutt is a cutthroat, self-satisfied billionaire. When these two opposites meet at a dinner party, their worlds collide, and neither will ever be the same.', 'Beatriz, an immigrant from a poor town in Mexico, has drawn on her innate kindness to build a career as a health practitioner. Doug Strutt is a cutthroat, self-satisfied billionaire. When these two opposites meet at a dinner party, their worlds collide, and neither will ever be the same.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ypvlGBvm6p0EIvKCzJw0OqsuzK5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:429107'),
  ('1005834445484687265', 'Beats', 2019, 'Drama, Comedy, Music', 'Wendy Ashman, Alan J. Wands, Henry Jay Gordon', 'Brian Welsh, Kieran Hurley', 'Lorn Macdonald, Laura Fraser, Brian Ferguson, Ross Mann, Gemma McElhinney, Amy Manson, Rachel Jackson, Neil Leiper', 'NR', 'Summer 1994, Scotland. Johnno and Spanner are best mates, but Johnno’s family are moving him to a new town and a better life, leaving Spanner behind to face a precarious future. In pursuit of adventure and escape they head out on one last night to an illegal rave before parting ways indefinitely.', 'Summer 1994, Scotland. Johnno and Spanner are best mates, but Johnno’s family are moving him to a new town and a better life, leaving Spanner behind to face a precarious future. In pursuit of adventure and escape they head out on one last night to an illegal rave before parting ways indefinitely.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ePdzn7taDXD1cR8uZjYF8qRT3IR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:493141'),
  ('426521346912122213', 'Beats Rhymes & Life: The Travels of A Tribe Called Quest', 2011, 'Music, Documentary', 'Michael Rapaport, Robert Benavides', null, 'Mary J. Blige, Common, Q-Tip, Michael Rapaport, Phife Dawg, Yasiin Bey, Ali Shaheed Muhammad, Adam Horovitz', 'R', 'Having forged a 20-year run as one of the most innovative and influential hip hop bands of all time, the Queens NY collective known as ''A Tribe Called Quest'' have kept a generation hungry for more of their groundbreaking music since their much publicized breakup in 1998. Michael Rapaport documents the inner workings and behind the scenes drama that follows the band to this day. He explores what''s next for, what many claim, are the pioneers of alternative rap.', 'Having forged a 20-year run as one of the most innovative and influential hip hop bands of all time, the Queens NY collective known as ''A Tribe Called Quest'' have kept a generation hungry for more of their groundbreaking music since their much publicized breakup in 1998. Michael Rapaport documents the inner workings and behind the scenes drama that follows the band to this day. He explores what''s next for, what many claim, are the pioneers of alternative rap.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kiE1jlShHK4HuBQJyLJ4c8lqMn8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70342'),
  ('202626807519826458', 'Beau Brummel', 1924, 'Drama', 'Harry Beaumont, Frank R. Strayer, David Abel', 'Dorothy Farnum', 'John Barrymore, Mary Astor, Willard Louis, Carmel Myers, Irene Rich, Alec B. Francis, Richard Tucker, George Beranger', null, 'George Bryan Brummel, a British military officer, loves Lady Margery, the betrothed of Lord Alvanley. Despite her own desperate love for Brummel, she submits to family pressure and marries Lord Alvanley. Brummel, broken-hearted, embarks upon a life of revelry.', 'George Bryan Brummel, a British military officer, loves Lady Margery, the betrothed of Lord Alvanley. Despite her own desperate love for Brummel, she submits to family pressure and marries Lord Alvanley. Brummel, broken-hearted, embarks upon a life of revelry.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/23uA2XhesdN1FaPLh89QctNlRNB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:144613'),
  ('568642580766824570', 'Beau Brummell', 1954, 'Drama, History, Romance', 'Curtis Bernhardt, Oswald Morris', 'Karl Tunberg', 'Stewart Granger, Elizabeth Taylor, Peter Ustinov, Robert Morley, James Donald, James Hayter, Rosemary Harris, Paul Rogers', null, 'Captain George Bryan Brummell is a British soldier who appreciates fine clothing and innovative dress. Although he initially alienates the Prince of Wales with insulting comments about the prince''s uniform designs, he eventually becomes his close confidant. Brummel also falls in love with the beautiful Lady Patricia Belham. However, his outspoken manner eventually leads to his being exiled to France.', 'Captain George Bryan Brummell is a British soldier who appreciates fine clothing and innovative dress. Although he initially alienates the Prince of Wales with insulting comments about the prince''s uniform designs, he eventually becomes his close confidant. Brummel also falls in love with the beautiful Lady Patricia Belham. However, his outspoken manner eventually leads to his being exiled to France.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5fPDFzIiJQ1YKMKcgGA9agUuQ9t.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43331'),
  ('1020039553229963680', 'Beau Geste', 1926, 'Action, Adventure, Drama', 'Herbert Brenon, J. Roy Hunt', 'Paul Schofield, John Russell, Herbert Brenon', 'Ronald Colman, Neil Hamilton, Ralph Forbes, Alice Joyce, Mary Brian, Noah Beery, Norman Trevor, William Powell', 'NR', 'Brothers Beau, John and Digby Geste join the Foreign Legion, where they fall under the rule of tyrannical Sergeant Markoff. Beau and John are assigned to Fort Zinderneuf, where Markoff tries to break their spirit, aware of a dark family secret concerning a fabulous jewel one of them carries. As tensions rise, Arabs attack the fort and rivalries must be thrown aside in a desperate battle for life.', 'Brothers Beau, John and Digby Geste join the Foreign Legion, where they fall under the rule of tyrannical Sergeant Markoff. Beau and John are assigned to Fort Zinderneuf, where Markoff tries to break their spirit, aware of a dark family secret concerning a fabulous jewel one of them carries. As tensions rise, Arabs attack the fort and rivalries must be thrown aside in a desperate battle for life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o5hMiPxW2paWBfDCRCD7hugBzSp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:189621'),
