  ('432208343401510152', 'Beautiful Accident', 2017, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Romance', 'Ho Wi-ding', 'Ha Zhichao', 'Gwei Lun-mei, Chen Kun, Ouyang Nana, Wang Jingchun, Pan Yi-chun, Kai-Yuan Cheng, Fan Kuang-yao, Hsieh Ying-shiuan', 'NR', 'When a single, successful female lawyer is involved in a highway car accident, she wakes up to find herself in an alternate reality where she''s forced take on the responsibility of a full time mother and wife, dealing with her demanding architect husband and two difficult children.', 'When a single, successful female lawyer is involved in a highway car accident, she wakes up to find herself in an alternate reality where she''s forced take on the responsibility of a full time mother and wife, dealing with her demanding architect husband and two difficult children.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eCJE3xC0oEpUyJk4mecejKBSsPk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:420635'),
  ('834217640361545198', 'Beautiful Beings', 2022, 'Drama', 'Guðmundur Arnar Guðmundsson, Sturla Brandth Grøvlen', 'Guðmundur Arnar Guðmundsson', 'Birgir Dagur Bjarkason, Áskell Einar Pálmason, Viktor Benóný Benediktsson, Snorri Rafn Frímannsson, Sunna Líf Arnarsdóttir, Kamilla Guðrún Lowen, Kristín Ísold Jóhannesdóttir, Ísgerður Elfa Gunnarsdóttir', null, 'A teenage boy, raised by a mother who considers herself psychic, takes a bullied kid into his group of violent misfits. As the group’s troubles escalate toward life-threatening situations, an inner voice awakens in the boy and, with the help of his mother and his new friend, he manages to find his own path.', 'A teenage boy, raised by a mother who considers herself psychic, takes a bullied kid into his group of violent misfits. As the group’s troubles escalate toward life-threatening situations, an inner voice awakens in the boy and, with the help of his mother and his new friend, he manages to find his own path.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oOqZz9rXGcNhuDBpjfLWxOO2T5W.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:879901'),
