  ('558219874246081251', 'Beauty and the Beast', 1991, 'Romance, Family, Animation, Fantasy', 'Gary Trousdale, Kirk Wise', 'Linda Woolverton', 'Paige O''Hara, Robby Benson, Richard White, Jerry Orbach, David Ogden Stiers, Angela Lansbury, Rex Everhart, Jesse Corti', 'G', 'Follow the adventures of Belle, a bright young woman who finds herself in the castle of a prince who''s been turned into a mysterious beast. With the help of the castle''s enchanted staff, Belle soon learns the most important lesson of all -- that true beauty comes from within.', 'Follow the adventures of Belle, a bright young woman who finds herself in the castle of a prince who''s been turned into a mysterious beast. With the help of the castle''s enchanted staff, Belle soon learns the most important lesson of all -- that true beauty comes from within.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hUJ0UvQ5tgE2Z9WpfuduVSdiCiU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10020'),
  ('363081303912046239', 'Beauty and the Beast', 1992, 'Animation, Fantasy, Romance', 'Chinami Namba, Masakazu Higuchi', 'Jack Olesker', 'Edie Mirman, Barry Gordon, Susan Silo', 'G', 'A young, beautiful girl awaits the day she will be killed after having asked for a most humble gift.', 'A young, beautiful girl awaits the day she will be killed after having asked for a most humble gift.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f9nuGVTXEB5Ga34zJcFccM1nVC4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:258680'),
  ('985001904007608756', 'Beauty and the Beast', 2010, 'Fantasy, Drama, Romance', 'David Lister', 'Gavin Scott', 'Estella Warren, Rhett Giles, Victor Parascos, Vanessa Gray, Tony Bellette, Chris Betts, Peter Cook, Nicholas Cooper', 'R', 'A twist on the morality tale of forbidden love between the beautiful Belle and the feared Beast. As the villagers are being brutally murdered and the Beast is hunted down as the one responsible for the mayhem, Belle and Beast team up to defeat the real killer; the power-hungry witch''s malevolent troll.', 'A twist on the morality tale of forbidden love between the beautiful Belle and the feared Beast. As the villagers are being brutally murdered and the Beast is hunted down as the one responsible for the mayhem, Belle and Beast team up to defeat the real killer; the power-hungry witch''s malevolent troll.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eupg5b3CIIbQSJrYa5GD7pNpj7M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30844'),
  ('731647904547417657', 'Beauty and the Beast', 2012, 'Family, Fantasy, TV Movie', 'Marc-Andreas Bochert, Hermann Dunzendorfer', 'Cornelia Gröschel, Marcus Hertneck', 'Maximilian Simonischek, Cornelia Gröschel, Jürgen Tarrach, Johannes Silberschneider, Christoph Letkowski, Karsten Kramer, Carolin Walter, Nadine Wrietz', null, 'German/Austrian TV adaptation of the famous fairy tale “Beauty and the Beast“. There is only one way to break the spell which has turned the prince into a horrible beast: a beautiful girl has to fall in love with the creature. As time is running out, the beast abducts the girl Elsa and takes her prisoner. He puts all his efforts into charming the girl. Elsa does not accept her fate, and the beast is not at all a gentleman with fine manners. The transformative power of love, which frees Elsa of her feelings of guilt towards her parents and which returns the beast to his former humanity, is at the heart of the film. Aimed at a family audience, the film''s eerie scenes are balanced with humor and poetry.', 'German/Austrian TV adaptation of the famous fairy tale “Beauty and the Beast“. There is only one way to break the spell which has turned the prince into a horrible beast: a beautiful girl has to fall in love with the creature. As time is running out, the beast abducts the girl Elsa and takes her prisoner. He puts all his efforts into charming the girl. Elsa does not accept her fate, and the beast is not at all a gentleman with fine manners. The transformative power of love, which frees Elsa of her feelings of guilt towards her parents and which returns the beast to his former humanity, is at the heart of the film. Aimed at a family audience, the film''s eerie scenes are balanced with humor and poetry.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w7I8ZnzbJJiT07e8yU2OU1QlKiJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:226001'),
  ('742471238785260956', 'Beauty and the Beast', 2014, 'Fantasy, Romance', 'Christophe Gans, Christophe Beaucarne, Emile Ghorayeb', 'Christophe Gans, Sandra Vo-Anh', 'Vincent Cassel, Léa Seydoux, André Dussollier, Eduardo Noriega, Myriam Charleins, Audrey Lamy, Sara Giraudeau, Jonathan Demurger', 'PG', 'Forced to face the cruel side of life, a devastated, bankrupt merchant chances upon the enchanted castle of a hideous creature, the mere sight of it chills the bone to the marrow. There, a fate worse than death awaits the poor father-of-six, who, after plucking a sweet-scented rose from the repulsive master''s verdant garden, must do the impossible: permit his compassionate daughter, Belle, to take his place and pay for the sins of her parent. Now, an impenetrable mystery shrouds the haunted mansion, and, as repugnance gradually turns into affection, only true love could break the spell.', 'Forced to face the cruel side of life, a devastated, bankrupt merchant chances upon the enchanted castle of a hideous creature, the mere sight of it chills the bone to the marrow. There, a fate worse than death awaits the poor father-of-six, who, after plucking a sweet-scented rose from the repulsive master''s verdant garden, must do the impossible: permit his compassionate daughter, Belle, to take his place and pay for the sins of her parent. Now, an impenetrable mystery shrouds the haunted mansion, and, as repugnance gradually turns into affection, only true love could break the spell.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8bErT2koHXAUSW5PdLQqgL5gEEe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:197796'),
  ('142438775607211811', 'Beauty and the Beast', 2017, 'Family, Fantasy, Romance', 'Bill Condon, Tobias A. Schliessler, Dino Parks', 'Linda Woolverton', 'Emma Watson, Dan Stevens, Luke Evans, Kevin Kline, Emma Thompson, Ewan McGregor, Josh Gad, Hattie Morahan', 'PG', 'A live-action adaptation of Disney''s version of the classic tale of a cursed prince and a beautiful young woman who helps him break the spell.', 'A live-action adaptation of Disney''s version of the classic tale of a cursed prince and a beautiful young woman who helps him break the spell.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hKegSKIDep2ewJWPUQD7u0KqFIp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:321612'),
  ('522165195620758558', 'Beauty and the Beast: A 30th Celebration', 2022, 'Family, Fantasy, Music, Romance, Animation', 'Hamish Hamilton, Ryan Healey', 'Linda Woolverton', 'H.E.R., Josh Groban, Joshua Henry, Martin Short, David Alan Grier, Shania Twain, Rita Moreno, Jon Jon Briones', 'PG', 'In honor of the 30th anniversary of the animated classic, this animated and live-action blended special showcases the fan-favorite movie, along with new musical performances, sets and costumes inspired by the classic story.', 'In honor of the 30th anniversary of the animated classic, this animated and live-action blended special showcases the fan-favorite movie, along with new musical performances, sets and costumes inspired by the classic story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xWpahhg9ETkiPPsG10RtxecjK0v.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1028851'),
  ('500466093526255201', 'Beauty and the Beast: The Enchanted Christmas', 1997, 'Animation, Family, Fantasy', 'Andy Knight, Keith Ingham, William Speers', 'Flip Kobler, Cindy Marcus, Bill Motz', 'Paige O''Hara, Robby Benson, Jerry Orbach, David Ogden Stiers, Bernadette Peters, Tim Curry, Haley Joel Osment, Paul Reubens', 'G', 'Astonished to find the Beast has a deep-seated hatred for the Christmas season, Belle endeavors to change his mind on the matter.', 'Astonished to find the Beast has a deep-seated hatred for the Christmas season, Belle endeavors to change his mind on the matter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l1Tb0fvnj9wnCgm5qnTRoO6OxDT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13313'),
  ('1093580296526188476', 'Beauty and the Beat', 2025, 'Comedy, Music', 'Kittiphak Thongauam, Pramett Chankrasse, Saroch Nuamsamran', 'Kittiphak Thongauam, Waneepan Ounphoklang, Parrames Samranrom', 'Jacqueline Muench, Thongchai Thongkanthom, Ninew Phetdankaeo, Chawarin Perdpiriyawong, Nimit Luksameepong, Harit Buayoi, Ratthanant Janyajirawong, Araya A. Hargate', null, 'Imagine the excitement when four rival divas are brought together to perform on the same stage. But remember, when two ride on a horse, one must sit behind. So, how will these four divas share the spotlight without chaos?', 'Imagine the excitement when four rival divas are brought together to perform on the same stage. But remember, when two ride on a horse, one must sit behind. So, how will these four divas share the spotlight without chaos?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xEzFDo64EVJ3vGudBvZqfmjzXKm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1318642'),
