  ('140311998546801681', 'Beauty Salon: Special Service 4', 2022, 'Romance', 'Kim Jin-woo-II', null, 'Min Do-yoon, Min Jung, Sae Bom, Cheon Yoo-ji, Sang Woo', null, 'Focusing on the relationship between men and women in a beauty salon, Dae-hye, the director of a korean erotic film beauty salon, becomes more difficult to sell in a depression. The building owner’s rent pressure also comes in, and employee Juhee suggests to Dae-hye to do a bikini service, saying that a bikini beauty salon has hit the jackpot in a foreign country. Surprisingly, bikini service is on the jackpot and guests are increasingly looking for a more powerful service.', 'Focusing on the relationship between men and women in a beauty salon, Dae-hye, the director of a korean erotic film beauty salon, becomes more difficult to sell in a depression. The building owner’s rent pressure also comes in, and employee Juhee suggests to Dae-hye to do a bikini service, saying that a bikini beauty salon has hit the jackpot in a foreign country. Surprisingly, bikini service is on the jackpot and guests are increasingly looking for a more powerful service.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nJpoe1CKuiqh90qUliO6qHCeNYI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:721187'),
  ('808063431390868318', 'Beauty Salon: Special Service 5', 2021, 'Romance', 'Cho Tae Ho', null, 'Seung Ha, Kang Min-woo, Min Do-yoon, Hae Il, So Jeong', null, 'Jimin, who runs a hair salon alone in a recession, hears about Min-woo, who comes as a customer one day, and changes his sales strategy to hire a new employee. What are trade secrets?', 'Jimin, who runs a hair salon alone in a recession, hears about Min-woo, who comes as a customer one day, and changes his sales strategy to hire a new employee. What are trade secrets?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vksJwa9P7O2otzqRKe8qDRGQYPK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:938091'),
  ('438701721420710556', 'Beauty Shop', 2005, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Bille Woodruff, Theo van de Sande', 'Norman Vance Jr., Kate Lanier', 'Queen Latifah, Alicia Silverstone, Andie MacDowell, Alfre Woodard, Mena Suvari, Della Reese, Kevin Bacon, Djimon Hounsou', 'PG-13', 'Far from Chicago, hairdresser Gina Norris has relocated to Atlanta with her daughter and has quickly established herself as a rare talent in her profession. But after repeatedly butting heads with her shady, over-the-top boss, Jorge, Norris sets out to create her own salon -- even snagging a few of Jorge''s employees and clients. Now, Jorge will do anything to shut her down.', 'Far from Chicago, hairdresser Gina Norris has relocated to Atlanta with her daughter and has quickly established herself as a rare talent in her profession. But after repeatedly butting heads with her shady, over-the-top boss, Jorge, Norris sets out to create her own salon -- even snagging a few of Jorge''s employees and clients. Now, Jorge will do anything to shut her down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3y5I9WKlfeNnSQbOvS4l3mVPqri.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14177'),
  ('840790296479902053', 'Beauty Water', 2020, 'Animation, Drama, Horror', 'Cho Kyung-hun', 'Lee Han-bin', 'Moon Nam-sook, Jang Min-hyeok, Cho Hyun-jung, Kim Bo-yeong, Choi Seung-hoon, Kim So-hyeong, Kang Shi-hyun, Park Sung-kwang', null, 'Beauty Water looks like a common skin cosmetic. But unlike other cosmetics, people can sculpt their skin with it like molding clay and change their appearance. An ordinary girl, Yaeji, comes across the ''Beauty Water'' by chance, and her endless desire to be the most beautiful woman brings her unimaginable disaster.', 'Beauty Water looks like a common skin cosmetic. But unlike other cosmetics, people can sculpt their skin with it like molding clay and change their appearance. An ordinary girl, Yaeji, comes across the ''Beauty Water'' by chance, and her endless desire to be the most beautiful woman brings her unimaginable disaster.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pFotlGivCvAWi3SvPycacqju6dN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:706712'),
  ('797166841259445007', 'Beauty''s Worth', 1922, 'Drama', 'Robert G. Vignola, Ira H. Morgan', 'Luther Reed', 'Marion Davies, Forrest Stanley, June Elvidge, Truly Shattuck, Lydia Yeamans Titus, Hallam Cooley, Antrim Short, Thomas Jefferson', 'NR', 'Prudence Cole is an unsophisticated Quaker girl being raised by her two aunts. Prudence is flirted with by snobbish Henry Garrison, who actually disdains the girl for her lack of worldliness and savoir faire. When Henry and his friends try to embarrass her at a posh resort, Prudence turns the tables on them.', 'Prudence Cole is an unsophisticated Quaker girl being raised by her two aunts. Prudence is flirted with by snobbish Henry Garrison, who actually disdains the girl for her lack of worldliness and savoir faire. When Henry and his friends try to embarrass her at a posh resort, Prudence turns the tables on them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ekJ80zh25f2pqg1EVOLoBmPsicA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:205275'),
  ('10935911994973339', 'Beaver Trilogy', 2000, 'Documentary, Music', 'Claes Thulin, Trent Harris', 'Trent Harris', 'Sean Penn, Crispin Glover, Richard LeVon Griffiths, E. G. Daily, Stefan Arngrim, John Bluto, Shane McCabe, Ken Butler', null, 'Our story begins in 1979, with a chance meeting in a Salt Lake City parking lot where filmmaker Trent Harris is approached by an earnest small-town dreamer from Beaver, Utah. Harris jumps at the chance when the young man invites him to come to the small town to film a talent show. At the show, the man dons a blond wig and performs in drag as Olivia Newton John. Harris captures it all on tape: A portrait of a true outsider. Harris shot a dramatic piece, "Beaver Kid 2" based on the documentary; This interpretation of the story, made in 1981 on a home video camera with a budget of $100, features a young Sean Penn as "the Beaver Kid". Still possessed, Harris then rewrote the script, cast up-and-comer Crispin Glover in the lead, and created the final segment, "The Orkly Kid", with funding from the American Film Institute. The trilogy unveils the inner world of a fantastic character in three incarnations.', 'Our story begins in 1979, with a chance meeting in a Salt Lake City parking lot where filmmaker Trent Harris is approached by an earnest small-town dreamer from Beaver, Utah. Harris jumps at the chance when the young man invites him to come to the small town to film a talent show. At the show, the man dons a blond wig and performs in drag as Olivia Newton John. Harris captures it all on tape: A portrait of a true outsider. Harris shot a dramatic piece, "Beaver Kid 2" based on the documentary; This interpretation of the story, made in 1981 on a home video camera with a budget of $100, features a young Sean Penn as "the Beaver Kid". Still possessed, Harris then rewrote the script, cast up-and-comer Crispin Glover in the lead, and created the final segment, "The Orkly Kid", with funding from the American Film Institute. The trilogy unveils the inner world of a fantastic character in three incarnations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zdKOqEM3yGOq8dhXATD6qcZTHWu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44131'),
  ('196172318302798540', 'Beaver Valley', 1950, 'Documentary, Family', 'C.O. Slyfield, James Algar, Alfred Milotte', 'Ted Sears, Lawrence Edward Watkin', 'Winston Hibler', null, 'The film depicts a young male beaver who must defend his new family against hungry predators, mischievous river otters, and the ever-impending threat of winter.', 'The film depicts a young male beaver who must defend his new family against hungry predators, mischievous river otters, and the ever-impending threat of winter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5EDLL0pyKlc8LuOFJUpWzwWMpFE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:162352'),
  ('463469590640431518', 'Beavis and Butt-Head Do America', 1996, 'Animation, Comedy, Adventure, Crime, Music', 'Mike Judge, Yvette Kaplan, David J. Miller', 'Mike Judge, Joe Stillman', 'Mike Judge, Bruce Willis, Demi Moore, Cloris Leachman, Robert Stack, Jacqueline Barba, Pamela Blair, Eric Bogosian', 'PG-13', 'Slacker duo Beavis and Butt-Head wake to discover their TV has been stolen. Their search for a new one takes them on a clueless adventure across America, during which they manage to accidentally become America''s most wanted.', 'Slacker duo Beavis and Butt-Head wake to discover their TV has been stolen. Their search for a new one takes them on a clueless adventure across America, during which they manage to accidentally become America''s most wanted.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vqdgQiRCSzgpFXLlbxbybfkleBM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3179'),
  ('464151139415366206', 'Beavis and Butt-Head Do the Universe', 2022, 'Animation, Comedy, Science Fiction, TV Movie', 'Albert Calleros, John Rice', null, 'Mike Judge, Andrea Savage, Gary Cole, Nat Faxon, Chi McBride, Chris Diamantopoulos, Brian Huskey, Tig Notaro', 'PG-13', 'In 1998, Beavis and Butt-Head are sentenced to Space Camp by a “creative” judge. Their obsession with a docking simulator (huh huh) leads to a trip on the Space Shuttle, with predictably disastrous results. After going through a black hole, they re-emerge in our time, where they look for love, misuse iPhones, and are hunted by the Deep State. Spoiler: They don’t score.', 'In 1998, Beavis and Butt-Head are sentenced to Space Camp by a “creative” judge. Their obsession with a docking simulator (huh huh) leads to a trip on the Space Shuttle, with predictably disastrous results. After going through a black hole, they re-emerge in our time, where they look for love, misuse iPhones, and are hunted by the Deep State. Spoiler: They don’t score.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rVKMA2j8m8hWgsDyXOllXp8DsWI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:828947'),
  ('397653991813532974', 'Bebe Main Badmash Banuga', 2026, 'Drama', 'Sukhminder Dhanjal, Hapreet', 'Sukhminder Dhanjal', 'Jagjeet Sandhu, Aveera Singh Masson, Raghavv Bbhanot', null, 'A gentle nursing student, mocked for his kindness, reinvents himself as a tough guy. His playful transformation leads to an energetic journey of love, conflict, and ambition, turning him into someone extraordinary.', 'A gentle nursing student, mocked for his kindness, reinvents himself as a tough guy. His playful transformation leads to an energetic journey of love, conflict, and ambition, turning him into someone extraordinary.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2Fxs1UbPD98BKoKrlhw4BhrGHjg4S.jpg', 'plex:movie:bebe-main-badmash-banuga'),
  ('10076621009621587', 'Bebe''s Kids', 1992, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Bruce W. Smith, Frans Vischer, Russell P. Marleau', 'Reginald Hudlin', 'Robin Harris, Faizon Love, Vanessa Bell Calloway, Wayne Collins Jr., Marques Houston, Jonell Green, Tone Loc, Myra J.', 'PG-13', 'When Robin meets the lovely Jamika he thinks he''s in heaven. But when he meets her friend Bebe''s children, whom she is looking after, he knows he''s in hell.', 'When Robin meets the lovely Jamika he thinks he''s in heaven. But when he meets her friend Bebe''s children, whom she is looking after, he knows he''s in hell.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uuUHtdsxLqr79QlCCnJNwPkOTTB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36616'),
  ('20144494557511805', 'Beber de tu sangre', 2020, 'Horror', 'Edin Alain Martinez Aguirre', 'Edin Alain Martinez Aguirre', 'Guillermo Zapata, Ana Paulina Martínez, Jitzel Galicia, Ernesto Salinas, Olivia Adriana, Paola Hernández, Rey David Martínez, Elvira E. Ramírez Ramos', null, 'A female vampire falls in love with a man she met in a bar. A male vampire invites a pregnant woman and her friends to watch his theatre play. These two vampires are husband and wife.', 'A female vampire falls in love with a man she met in a bar. A male vampire invites a pregnant woman and her friends to watch his theatre play. These two vampires are husband and wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4b6HY7rud6LMO00EatxrJfFaBJV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:745527'),
  ('424696359793685407', 'Bebert and the Train', 1963, 'Comedy', 'Yves Robert', 'François Boyer', 'Martin Lartigue, Jean Richard, Blanchette Brunoy, Jacques Higelin, Pierre Mondy, Michel Serrault, Jean Lefebvre, Christian Marin', null, 'The Martin family is shopping in a department store. Tiennot is responsible for looking after his little brother, Bébert, but he prefers to chase girls. On the train home, Tiennot leaves Bébert alone. On arrival, Bébert has disappeared. The Martin family sets out to find him.', 'The Martin family is shopping in a department store. Tiennot is responsible for looking after his little brother, Bébert, but he prefers to chase girls. On the train home, Tiennot leaves Bébert alone. On arrival, Bébert has disappeared. The Martin family sets out to find him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vcaVMchlX6jHxKBdon8fWnMQit7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64132'),
  ('964191173306343982', 'Bebo''s Girl', 1964, 'Drama', 'Luigi Comencini, Leopoldo Machina, Maurizio Tanfani', 'Marcello Fondato', 'Claudia Cardinale, George Chakiris, Marc Michel, Dany París, Carla Calò, Monique Vita, Ugo Chiti, Emilio Esposito', null, 'At the end of World War II, shallow, self-centered Mara is the prettiest girl in her small Italian village; Bebo is a Communist partisan who is finding it difficult to adjust to the dull banalities of life in peacetime. When Mara’s father, a passionate Communist, declares that his daughter will marry the returning hero, her reactions range from joy to bitter resentment.', 'At the end of World War II, shallow, self-centered Mara is the prettiest girl in her small Italian village; Bebo is a Communist partisan who is finding it difficult to adjust to the dull banalities of life in peacetime. When Mara’s father, a passionate Communist, declares that his daughter will marry the returning hero, her reactions range from joy to bitter resentment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l9SCXFzqseCGiPNCTMnsRSd8LSj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58000'),
  ('942062267028658546', 'Bécassine !', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Patrick Blossier, Bruno Podalydès', 'Bruno Podalydès', 'Emeline Bayart, Michel Vuillermoz, Karin Viard, Vimala Pons, Josiane Balasko, Bruno Podalydès, Denis Podalydès, Blutch', null, 'Born to a poor farming family in Brittany, Bécassine finds work as a nanny with the Marquise de Grand-Air who has recently adopted a lovely baby named Loulotte. A strong bond develops between Becassine and Loulotte, and life is sweet, until the Grand-Airs are threatened with financial ruin… Can Bécassine save the day? Naïve, funny, dreamy, optimistic, loving, Bécassine is also inventive, courageous and always ready to handle any situation in her own unique way – a superheroine like no other. César-winner Bruno Podalydès returns with a family movie adapted from the beloved French comic book Bécassine.', 'Born to a poor farming family in Brittany, Bécassine finds work as a nanny with the Marquise de Grand-Air who has recently adopted a lovely baby named Loulotte. A strong bond develops between Becassine and Loulotte, and life is sweet, until the Grand-Airs are threatened with financial ruin… Can Bécassine save the day? Naïve, funny, dreamy, optimistic, loving, Bécassine is also inventive, courageous and always ready to handle any situation in her own unique way – a superheroine like no other. César-winner Bruno Podalydès returns with a family movie adapted from the beloved French comic book Bécassine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5ckdbvN2cRmKaau20G5r6WZRPVu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:510467'),
  ('244700785115801535', 'Bécassine, le trésor viking', 2001, 'Family, Animation, Fantasy', 'Philippe Vidal', 'Yves Coulon, Béatrice Marthouret', 'Muriel Robin, Zabou Breitman, Philippe Gildas, Frédéric Mitterrand, Gilbert Lévy, Kelly Marot, Jean-Jacques Nervest, Guillaume Orsat', null, 'Known and loved by generations of children, Pinchon''s classic Bécassine is now a feature-length movie. A cross between Mary Poppins and Mr Bean, Bécassine is the nanny every child dreams of having ! Her mismatched green dress, white apron and red-and-white striped socks might look a little strange, but the gawky Bécassine is a truly lovable character. Her adventures begin when Bécassine arrives in Paris to take care of Charlotte, the daughter of one of her former charges. Bécassine and Charlotte get caught up in a fanatic and comical adventure filled with song and dance. They race from Paris to Marseilles to Ibiza and Lapland trying to unravel the mystery of what happened to Charlotte''s father, Edmond. What is he running from ? What secret is he trying to protect ? Will Charlotte''s family escape the evil clutches of Gaspard, a so-called family friend ?', 'Known and loved by generations of children, Pinchon''s classic Bécassine is now a feature-length movie. A cross between Mary Poppins and Mr Bean, Bécassine is the nanny every child dreams of having ! Her mismatched green dress, white apron and red-and-white striped socks might look a little strange, but the gawky Bécassine is a truly lovable character. Her adventures begin when Bécassine arrives in Paris to take care of Charlotte, the daughter of one of her former charges. Bécassine and Charlotte get caught up in a fanatic and comical adventure filled with song and dance. They race from Paris to Marseilles to Ibiza and Lapland trying to unravel the mystery of what happened to Charlotte''s father, Edmond. What is he running from ? What secret is he trying to protect ? Will Charlotte''s family escape the evil clutches of Gaspard, a so-called family friend ?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uLLONiOYo382rLb2Ku4nUUGTSJO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22507'),
  ('152358776136460229', 'Because I Love You', 2017, 'Drama, Fantasy, Romance', 'Kim Gi-tae, Joo Ji-hong', 'Hwang Seung-jae', 'Cha Tae-hyun, Kim Yoo-jung, Seo Hyun-jin, Lim Ju-hwan, Sunwoo Yong-nyeo, Park Keun-hyong, Sung Dong-il, Oh Na-ra', null, 'Lee Hyeong is a talented songwriter. He happens to connect people who are not good with love. Those include Hyeong-Gyeong who wants to become a singer, but she suffers from stage fright. Scully is a high school student. She helps Lee Hyeong''s spirit. Chan-Young is a colleague of Lee Hyeong and he likes Hyeong-Gyeong, but in vain.', 'Lee Hyeong is a talented songwriter. He happens to connect people who are not good with love. Those include Hyeong-Gyeong who wants to become a singer, but she suffers from stage fright. Scully is a high school student. She helps Lee Hyeong''s spirit. Chan-Young is a colleague of Lee Hyeong and he likes Hyeong-Gyeong, but in vain.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aK9UlvDQohZMc1qh83uBmoWtMDp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:422545'),
  ('776408550511537459', 'Because I Said So', 2007, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Michael Lehmann, Julio Macat, Bob Brown', 'Karen Leigh Hopkins, Jessie Nelson', 'Diane Keaton, Mandy Moore, Gabriel Macht, Tom Everett Scott, Lauren Graham, Piper Perabo, Stephen Collins, Ty Panitz', 'PG-13', 'In an effort to prevent family history from repeating itself, meddlesome mom Daphne Wilder attempts to set up her youngest daughter, Milly, with Mr. Right. Meanwhile, her other daughters try to keep their mom''s good intentions under control.', 'In an effort to prevent family history from repeating itself, meddlesome mom Daphne Wilder attempts to set up her youngest daughter, Milly, with Mr. Right. Meanwhile, her other daughters try to keep their mom''s good intentions under control.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wQtGQnr5RPnmzSfV9zUcgh8R9NX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1257'),
  ('999220976504018874', 'Because of a Boy', 2002, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Fabrice Cazeneuve', null, 'Julien Baumgartner, Julia Maraval, Jérémie Elkaïm, François Comar, Patrick Bonnel, Christiane Millet, Antoine Michel, Nils Ohlund', null, 'When Vincent finds himself a victim of outing in his high school, he must accept to live with the drastic changes it provokes, and redefine his relationships with his friends and family.', 'When Vincent finds himself a victim of outing in his high school, he must accept to live with the drastic changes it provokes, and redefine his relationships with his friends and family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/14puo5ld6RyRZOMZv0GwpepTo0W.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16006'),
  ('764444245026318564', 'Because of Cupid', 2026, 'Romance, Drama, TV Movie, Comedy', 'Elizabeth Farrer, Ryan Knight', 'Amy Meyerson, Kevin Duda', 'Amy Groening, Evan Roderick, Tennille Read, Darryl Hinds, Richard Waugh', 'TV-G', 'Follows Naomi and Marcus, best friends and bartenders in Buffalo, New York, who enter a Valentine''s Day mocktail contest to kickstart their dream business. After unknowingly adding a real love potion to their mocktail, they win the competition but spark chaos when judges-and Marcus-fall under its spell. As media attention grows, they race to find an antidote, questioning whether their own feelings are real. Ultimately, they discover their love is genuine, secure a career-making deal, and realize that the true magic was between them all along.', 'Follows Naomi and Marcus, best friends and bartenders in Buffalo, New York, who enter a Valentine''s Day mocktail contest to kickstart their dream business. After unknowingly adding a real love potion to their mocktail, they win the competition but spark chaos when judges-and Marcus-fall under its spell. As media attention grows, they race to find an antidote, questioning whether their own feelings are real. Ultimately, they discover their love is genuine, secure a career-making deal, and realize that the true magic was between them all along.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fmetadata-static.plex.tv%2F2%2Fgracenote%2F2d1277cb03b5bbd3333b1d622fe67a1d.jpg', 'plex:movie:because-of-cupid'),
  ('749271868828736724', 'Because of the Cats', 1973, 'Drama, Crime, Mystery', 'Fons Rademakers, Eduard van der Enden', 'Hugo Claus, Fons Rademakers', 'Bryan Marshall, Alexandra Stewart, Sebastian Graham Jones, Anthony Allen, Ida Goemans, Nicholas Hoye, Sylvia Kristel, Delia Lindsay', 'R', 'A gang of six wealthy, well-dressed and well-spoken hoodlums break into a married couple''s house and rape the wife while forcing the husband to watch. Thus begins a dogged investigation by a determined detective who quickly finds that their cult-like solidarity can be a serious obstacle to breaking them.', 'A gang of six wealthy, well-dressed and well-spoken hoodlums break into a married couple''s house and rape the wife while forcing the husband to watch. Thus begins a dogged investigation by a determined detective who quickly finds that their cult-like solidarity can be a serious obstacle to breaking them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3HkUI1vaDg8E68263johm0hLnz1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46554'),
  ('704813170529922847', 'Because of Winn-Dixie', 2005, 'Family, Comedy, Drama', 'Wayne Wang, Karl Walter Lindenlaub, Glen Trotiner', 'Joan Singleton', 'Jeff Daniels, AnnaSophia Robb, Cicely Tyson, Eva Marie Saint, Dave Matthews, Courtney Jines, Elle Fanning, Luke Benward', 'PG', 'A girl, abandoned by her mother when she was three, moves to a small town in Florida with her father. There, she adopts an orphaned dog she names Winn-Dixie. The bond between the girl and her special companion brings together the people in a small Florida town and heals her own troubled relationship with her father.', 'A girl, abandoned by her mother when she was three, moves to a small town in Florida with her father. There, she adopts an orphaned dog she names Winn-Dixie. The bond between the girl and her special companion brings together the people in a small Florida town and heals her own troubled relationship with her father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k2zDrIqMFi8944h3BbBAQfsBn9h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17880'),
  ('283287811815475335', 'Because We Are Champions', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Christoph Schnee, Armin Golisano', 'David Marqués, Oliver Philipp, Javier Fesser', 'Wotan Wilke Möhring, Katharina Schüttler, Ben Münchow, Ursula Werner, Sabine Vitua, Enno Kalisch, Dominik Klingberg, Rainer Laupichler', null, 'Things are not going well for basketball coach Andreas: He gets fired, his wife leaves him, and then he is caught driving under the influence. The consequence? Community hours. From now on, Andreas will coach a basketball team of players with mental disabilities.', 'Things are not going well for basketball coach Andreas: He gets fired, his wife leaves him, and then he is caught driving under the influence. The consequence? Community hours. From now on, Andreas will coach a basketball team of players with mental disabilities.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e7Tjtnvnfnv3rZoJQpIAmKEkwzz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:950865'),
  ('791253290845921960', 'Because, Because of a Woman', 1963, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Michel Deville, Claude Lecomte', 'Nina Companéez, Michel Deville', 'Jacques Charrier, Mylène Demongeot, Marie Laforêt, Juliette Mayniel, Jill Haworth, Odile Versois, Roland Dubillard, Louis Velle', null, 'A young man is a collector of feminine conquests. One morning, leaving one of his mistresses he is addressed by one of his past flirts. As revenge, she denounces him later to the police as the murderer of her fiance who was found dead the same morning. With the help of his mistresses and some new ones he makes on the road, the young man goes in search of the man he thinks is the killer, then his blond consort with whom he fell in love at the first sight the evening before.', 'A young man is a collector of feminine conquests. One morning, leaving one of his mistresses he is addressed by one of his past flirts. As revenge, she denounces him later to the police as the murderer of her fiance who was found dead the same morning. With the help of his mistresses and some new ones he makes on the road, the young man goes in search of the man he thinks is the killer, then his blond consort with whom he fell in love at the first sight the evening before.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n9LgZuvRhjTFVL4eUmqACRYehL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:109762'),
  ('885518424395327558', 'BECK', 2010, 'Drama, Music', 'Yukihiko Tsutsumi, Satoru Karasawa, Tatsuya Shirashi', 'Tetsuya Oishi', 'Hiro Mizushima, Takeru Satoh, Kenta Kiritani, Aoi Nakamura, Osamu Mukai, Shioli Kutsuna, Cunning Takeyama, Sari Kurauchi', null, 'Yukio is your average high school student who spends his days going to class and avoiding bullies. That is until he meets Ryusuke, a guitar prodigy. Together with Taira, Chiba, and Saku they form the rock band BECK. As their popularity increases so does the danger as Ryusuke''s past catches up with him.', 'Yukio is your average high school student who spends his days going to class and avoiding bullies. That is until he meets Ryusuke, a guitar prodigy. Together with Taira, Chiba, and Saku they form the rock band BECK. As their popularity increases so does the danger as Ryusuke''s past catches up with him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nrwjbDQ8XIRJor9QHVBIl1nxRnC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60163'),
  ('797093281708323919', 'Beck - The Man with the Icons', 1997, 'Crime, Drama', 'Jens Mårtensson, Pelle Seth, Jan Blomgren', 'Rolf Börjlind', 'Peter Haber, Mikael Persbrandt, Figge Norling, Stina Rautelin, Per Morberg, Ingvar Hirdwall, Rebecka Hemse, Lilian Johansson', null, 'Beck and his men investigates a murder of a Russian woman. At the same time as SÄPO (The Swedish Security Agency) sees a chance of getting a Russian in the embassy deported.', 'Beck and his men investigates a murder of a Russian woman. At the same time as SÄPO (The Swedish Security Agency) sees a chance of getting a Russian in the embassy deported.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1noq3jB393NeYCI7gqZ5ztAE4zr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:270043'),
  ('429000178974548513', 'Beck 01 - The Decoy Boy', 1997, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'John Christian Rosenlund, Pelle Seth', 'Rolf Börjlind', 'Peter Haber, Mikael Persbrandt, Figge Norling, Stina Rautelin, Per Morberg, Ingvar Hirdwall, Rebecka Hemse, Peter Hüttner', null, 'A man working at a garbage incinerator discovers the body of a dead man burned to ashes in the oven. Police detective Martin Beck handles the case. All he knows is that a brutal murder has happened. But he does not know when or where. He has no body, motive or a crime scene, not a single trace. All he has is some teeth and a mysterious Internet address...', 'A man working at a garbage incinerator discovers the body of a dead man burned to ashes in the oven. Police detective Martin Beck handles the case. All he knows is that a brutal murder has happened. But he does not know when or where. He has no body, motive or a crime scene, not a single trace. All he has is some teeth and a mysterious Internet address...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/74oJEmnx6TBHDJokVmCmsYuUnax.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:383623'),
  ('763366365038686263', 'Beck 03 - White Nights', 1998, 'Crime, Thriller, Drama, Mystery', 'Kjell Sundvall, Olof Johnson', 'Rolf Börjlind', 'Peter Haber, Mikael Persbrandt, Stina Rautelin, Per Morberg, Ingvar Hirdwall, Rebecka Hemse, Fredrik Ultvedt, Michael Nyqvist', null, 'When the police reveal a narcotic smuggling the driver is shot dead. It appears that the driver is Superintendent Martin Beck''s son. Beck breaks down and moves out of the way. But on his colleagues request he returns.', 'When the police reveal a narcotic smuggling the driver is shot dead. It appears that the driver is Superintendent Martin Beck''s son. Beck breaks down and moves out of the way. But on his colleagues request he returns.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/htztrAIrrsI0XUYXjUALpJqQZvS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:270044'),
  ('235104742919811034', 'Beck 04 - Eye for an Eye', 1998, 'Crime, Thriller, Mystery, Drama', 'Olof Johnson, Kjell Sundvall', 'Rolf Börjlind', 'Peter Haber, Mikael Persbrandt, Stina Rautelin, Per Morberg, Ingvar Hirdwall, Rebecka Hemse, Joakim Nätterqvist, Fredrik Ultvedt', null, 'In this film Beck and his team are trying to find a serial killer, whose victims are spread all over Sweden. An obvious connection is that all the victims are women, and they were all in the same class, and Beck thinks that a scandal back in the past has something to do with the murders. But no one wants to talk about the past and it becomes a struggle to find the perpetrator before the final murder - only one woman is still alive.', 'In this film Beck and his team are trying to find a serial killer, whose victims are spread all over Sweden. An obvious connection is that all the victims are women, and they were all in the same class, and Beck thinks that a scandal back in the past has something to do with the murders. But no one wants to talk about the past and it becomes a struggle to find the perpetrator before the final murder - only one woman is still alive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fw1eU3UKOT2jSGHxxGukU51jMTQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:270045'),
  ('857413066878635461', 'Beck 05 - The Boarding House Pearl', 1998, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller, Mystery', 'Olof Johnson, Kjell Sundvall', 'Rolf Börjlind', 'Peter Haber, Mikael Persbrandt, Stina Rautelin, Per Morberg, Ingvar Hirdwall, Rebecka Hemse, Michael Nyqvist, Fredrik Ultvedt', null, 'Inspector Beck and his team get involved in a large-scale smuggling of cesium 133. A gang from the east uses refugees who with a promise to stay in Sweden and with danger to their own life take in the dangerous explosive chemical substance.', 'Inspector Beck and his team get involved in a large-scale smuggling of cesium 133. A gang from the east uses refugees who with a promise to stay in Sweden and with danger to their own life take in the dangerous explosive chemical substance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9GjNiocPoJ9rkwTyRrI6pm8ic2P.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:270046'),
  ('98480643404209997', 'Beck 06 - The Monster', 1998, 'Crime, Thriller, Drama, Mystery', 'Harald Hamrell, Olof Johnson', 'Rolf Börjlind', 'Peter Haber, Mikael Persbrandt, Stina Rautelin, Per Morberg, Ingvar Hirdwall, Rebecka Hemse, Fredrik Ultvedt, Peter Hüttner', null, 'A bomb threat is called in to a police station in Stockholm. The police bomb squad blows the briefcase to pieces and it looks like false alarm, until a baby is found inside. Soon, e-mails are sent out to every newspaper about the nasty situation that the police had tried to keep secret. Will the police ever overcome the "Monster"?', 'A bomb threat is called in to a police station in Stockholm. The police bomb squad blows the briefcase to pieces and it looks like false alarm, until a baby is found inside. Soon, e-mails are sent out to every newspaper about the nasty situation that the police had tried to keep secret. Will the police ever overcome the "Monster"?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vBcagAzL3BHsZsDTy2OsnC6hcbF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:270047'),
  ('564409567025365531', 'Beck 07 - The Money Man', 1998, 'Thriller, Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Harald Hamrell, Olof Johnson', 'Rolf Börjlind', 'Peter Haber, Mikael Persbrandt, Stina Rautelin, Per Morberg, Ingvar Hirdwall, Rebecka Hemse, Fredrik Ultvedt, Michael Nyqvist', null, 'A gay police officer''s double life is paid by Becks archenemy, Gavling. A man who runs Stockholm''s underworld. In return have the homosexual police, been serving Gavling with secret information from the archive of the police authorities.', 'A gay police officer''s double life is paid by Becks archenemy, Gavling. A man who runs Stockholm''s underworld. In return have the homosexual police, been serving Gavling with secret information from the archive of the police authorities.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9zBu3WlMsZlFZMN9v7rupJhOGvF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:270105'),
  ('1067924051072338267', 'Beck 08 - Trails in Darkness', 1998, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Morten Arnfred, Eric Kress', 'Rolf Börjlind', 'Peter Haber, Mikael Persbrandt, Stina Rautelin, Per Morberg, Rebecka Hemse, Michael Nyqvist, Cecilia Häll, Carlo Schmidt', null, 'A serial killer that decapitates people is on the loose in the Stockholm subway. Martin Beck and his colleagues try to catch the killer, while the panic in the city increases.', 'A serial killer that decapitates people is on the loose in the Stockholm subway. Martin Beck and his colleagues try to catch the killer, while the panic in the city increases.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p9vFfqBfme7zwmGRoCzlVm1K1Nm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24771'),
  ('1052698944333804925', 'Beck 09 - The Price of Vengeance', 2001, 'Thriller, Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Kjell Sundvall, Olof Johnson', 'Rolf Börjlind, Cecilia Börjlind', 'Peter Haber, Mikael Persbrandt, Sophie Tolstoy, Marie Göranzon, Per Morberg, Ingvar Hirdwall, Rebecka Hemse, Shanti Roney', null, 'Two patrolling cops stumble on to three criminals who have just stolen large amounts of explosives, and are killed in cold blood. Martin Beck and his team must now work day and night to find out who the killers are and what they are planning to do with the explosives before it''s too late. Meanwhile, Gunvald Larsson who was a close friend of one of the murdered cops is ignoring all rules in his quest for revenge.', 'Two patrolling cops stumble on to three criminals who have just stolen large amounts of explosives, and are killed in cold blood. Martin Beck and his team must now work day and night to find out who the killers are and what they are planning to do with the explosives before it''s too late. Meanwhile, Gunvald Larsson who was a close friend of one of the murdered cops is ignoring all rules in his quest for revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/58feIi9ZffXskcRUOyDeURBby9R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:119644'),
  ('335829996834182779', 'Beck 10 - The Man Without a Face', 2001, 'Thriller, Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Harald Hamrell, Olof Johnson', 'Cecilia Börjlind, Rolf Börjlind', 'Peter Haber, Mikael Persbrandt, Malin Birgerson, Marie Göranzon, Hanns Zischler, Mårten Klingberg, Jimmy Endeley, Peter Hüttner', null, 'A man is found dead, stabbed to death with a knife. The chocking thing is that his face has been removed. After questioning his wife who described the marriage as happy also told that a mysterious foreign man knocked on their door the day before the murder. Beck and his men are given the case.', 'A man is found dead, stabbed to death with a knife. The chocking thing is that his face has been removed. After questioning his wife who described the marriage as happy also told that a mysterious foreign man knocked on their door the day before the murder. Beck and his men are given the case.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p4Q0Mrb1hNpbeVeugResbwf0To.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:270106'),
  ('465329680567741306', 'Beck 11 - The Cartel', 2001, 'Thriller, Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Kjell Sundvall, Olof Johnson', 'Cecilia Börjlind, Rolf Börjlind', 'Peter Haber, Mikael Persbrandt, Malin Birgerson, Marie Göranzon, Rafael Edholm, Hanns Zischler, Mårten Klingberg, Jimmy Endeley', null, 'It''s a dark night in Stockholm. A chef is murdered in his own kitchen and Martin Beck gets on the case.', 'It''s a dark night in Stockholm. A chef is murdered in his own kitchen and Martin Beck gets on the case.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qyIdPtK8IQpTiNu8FSPkjsijBE7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:270111'),
  ('442955733163012479', 'Beck 12 - The Loner', 2002, 'Thriller, Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Kjell Sundvall, Olof Johnson', 'Rolf Börjlind, Cecilia Börjlind', 'Peter Haber, Mikael Persbrandt, Malin Birgerson, Marie Göranzon, Hanns Zischler, Mårten Klingberg, Jimmy Endeley, Peter Hüttner', null, 'An Asian woman is found dead in the water of Stockholm''s archipelago. She has been murdered and everything indicates that she was a prostitute. Meanwhile a series of break-ins has occurred on an island outside of Stockholm. Suddenly a retired old man is also found dead in his own yard. Now Beck has two cases to solve and they both point in the same direction.', 'An Asian woman is found dead in the water of Stockholm''s archipelago. She has been murdered and everything indicates that she was a prostitute. Meanwhile a series of break-ins has occurred on an island outside of Stockholm. Suddenly a retired old man is also found dead in his own yard. Now Beck has two cases to solve and they both point in the same direction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eZO0PcuMZjpilWWLjNTXI2hHY4T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:263120'),
  ('333638392397975327', 'Beck 13 - Sender Unknown', 2002, 'Thriller, Crime, Mystery, Drama', 'Harald Hamrell, Olof Johnson', 'Rolf Börjlind, Cecilia Börjlind', 'Peter Haber, Mikael Persbrandt, Malin Birgerson, Marie Göranzon, Hanns Zischler, Ingvar Hirdwall, Rebecka Hemse, Jimmy Endeley', null, 'Martin Beck, Gunvald Larsson and Alice Levander investigate the mysterious murder of an accountant that was found shot to death at the airport parking. At the same time a reporter receives a package from an anonymous source, with information regarding the embezzling of funds that should have been used for fixing up nuclear reactors. When the reporter contacts Beck, his home gets blown up by a bomb.', 'Martin Beck, Gunvald Larsson and Alice Levander investigate the mysterious murder of an accountant that was found shot to death at the airport parking. At the same time a reporter receives a package from an anonymous source, with information regarding the embezzling of funds that should have been used for fixing up nuclear reactors. When the reporter contacts Beck, his home gets blown up by a bomb.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nKeZ3Et3UtkMtWL3s1Xe0mOdsbM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:270112'),
  ('838257371396204159', 'Beck 14 - The Advertising Man', 2002, 'Crime, Thriller, Drama, Mystery', 'Olof Johnson, Daniel Lind Lagerlöf', 'Cecilia Börjlind, Rolf Börjlind', 'Peter Haber, Mikael Persbrandt, Marie Göranzon, Malin Birgerson, Hanns Zischler, Mårten Klingberg, Jimmy Endeley, Peter Hüttner', null, 'A man is raping women after having met them through ads on public noticeboards. At first this seems like an easy crime to solve for Martin Beck and his colleagues but they soon discover that somebody''s motivations are far more complex.', 'A man is raping women after having met them through ads on public noticeboards. At first this seems like an easy crime to solve for Martin Beck and his colleagues but they soon discover that somebody''s motivations are far more complex.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nglUrQeP5dNrJuVfrl8PMnj3yon.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:263116'),
  ('306175081967582952', 'Beck 15 - The Boy in the Glass Ball', 2002, 'Drama, Crime, Thriller, Mystery', 'Daniel Lind Lagerlöf, Olof Johnson', 'Cecilia Börjlind, Rolf Börjlind', 'Peter Haber, Mikael Persbrandt, Malin Birgerson, Marie Göranzon, Rebecka Hemse, Hanns Zischler, Mårten Klingberg, Jimmy Endeley', null, 'Mother of an autistic boy is found murdered in her home. The boy holds the murder weapon, covered in blood..', 'Mother of an autistic boy is found murdered in her home. The boy holds the murder weapon, covered in blood..', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uh54P50je6HMsFEvPpq1CkvHlCw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:270199'),
  ('54540776788520897', 'Beck 16 - The Last Witness', 2002, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Harald Hamrell', 'Rolf Börjlind, Cecilia Börjlind', 'Peter Haber, Mikael Persbrandt, Marie Göranzon, Ingvar Hirdwall, Rebecka Hemse, Mårten Klingberg, Gunilla Röör, Thomas Hanzon', null, 'A series of grisly murders where the victims faces have been removed by acid starts to turn up around Stockholm. Detective Martin Beck and Gunvald Larsson are once again drawn into the darkness.', 'A series of grisly murders where the victims faces have been removed by acid starts to turn up around Stockholm. Detective Martin Beck and Gunvald Larsson are once again drawn into the darkness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o4SoVGex5KMgI6fC9UhfIbPguWQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:137190'),
  ('154544969680534971', 'Beck 17 - The Scorpion', 2006, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller, Mystery', 'Harald Hamrell, Carl Sundberg', 'Rolf Börjlind, Cecilia Börjlind', 'Peter Haber, Mikael Persbrandt, Björn Bengtsson, Ing-Marie Carlsson, Källa Bie, Marie Göranzon, Ingvar Hirdwall, Måns Nathanaelson', null, 'An abused woman is feverishly sought by police in the murder of her ex-husband but is being hidden by abused woman-advocates. At the same time, Gunvald Larsson discovers a police report that his long-estranged sister has been abused. He confronts her with his knowledge but she denies it.', 'An abused woman is feverishly sought by police in the murder of her ex-husband but is being hidden by abused woman-advocates. At the same time, Gunvald Larsson discovers a police report that his long-estranged sister has been abused. He confronts her with his knowledge but she denies it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k0Pgf65hXrSIT15lZpu6DG0v9MN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:164431'),
  ('937808400489875498', 'Beck 18 - The Girl in the Root Cellar', 2006, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Harald Hamrell, Carl Sundberg', 'Cecilia Börjlind, Rolf Börjlind', 'Peter Haber, Mikael Persbrandt, Marie Göranzon, Stina Rautelin, Ing-Marie Carlsson, Måns Nathanaelson, Ingvar Hirdwall, Peter Hüttner', null, 'A small girl is found dead in a deserted underground cellar. She has been dead for some time but there is fresh food for her. Who is she?', 'A small girl is found dead in a deserted underground cellar. She has been dead for some time but there is fresh food for her. Who is she?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k2kFZxLxIBqHjPtLHy83PEWTuTF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:270117'),
  ('499639328519920394', 'Beck 19 - The Vulture', 2007, 'Thriller, Drama, Crime, Mystery', 'Kjell Sundvall, Olof Johnson', 'Cecilia Börjlind, Rolf Börjlind', 'Peter Haber, Mikael Persbrandt, Marie Göranzon, Ing-Marie Carlsson, Måns Nathanaelson, Stina Rautelin, Peter Hüttner, Victor Ström', null, 'Swedish politician John Veden vanishes without a trace. There''s no hint he''s dead yet but Beck''s team gets the case due to Police Chief Oberg''s friendship with the man whom she dined with him the evening before he vanished. When they find out Veden was a gambler with heavy debts battling his addiction the case leads Martin Beck, Gunvald Larsson and freshly returned Lena Klingström into Sweden''s illegal gambling scene. And Veden was planning to expose his own addiction and his party''s huge financial profits from gambling in a confessional book - which his political allies got wind of via illegal data theft. With several people having an interest that Veden stays missing the team tries to find the politician and the true perpetrator while Beck is grappling privately with his ambivalent feelings about working with ex Lena again....', 'Swedish politician John Veden vanishes without a trace. There''s no hint he''s dead yet but Beck''s team gets the case due to Police Chief Oberg''s friendship with the man whom she dined with him the evening before he vanished. When they find out Veden was a gambler with heavy debts battling his addiction the case leads Martin Beck, Gunvald Larsson and freshly returned Lena Klingström into Sweden''s illegal gambling scene. And Veden was planning to expose his own addiction and his party''s huge financial profits from gambling in a confessional book - which his political allies got wind of via illegal data theft. With several people having an interest that Veden stays missing the team tries to find the politician and the true perpetrator while Beck is grappling privately with his ambivalent feelings about working with ex Lena again....', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a9zTDGkWg0dpT7oPPgmJNP0lExW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:270116'),
  ('985692076301873239', 'Beck 20 - The Lawyer', 2007, 'Drama, Crime, Mystery, Thriller', 'Olof Johnson, Kjell Sundvall', 'Rolf Börjlind, Cecilia Börjlind', 'Peter Haber, Mikael Persbrandt, Dan Ekborg, Sara Sommerfeld, Marie Göranzon, Jesper Malm, Stina Rautelin, Ing-Marie Carlsson', null, 'The murder of a prominent attorney is connected to one of his recent cases, in which a company was being sued for serious environmental damage. Martin Beck and Lena Klingström find evidence which brings new light to the investigation - but who''s pulling the strings?', 'The murder of a prominent attorney is connected to one of his recent cases, in which a company was being sued for serious environmental damage. Martin Beck and Lena Klingström find evidence which brings new light to the investigation - but who''s pulling the strings?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qMs8bRAz4uPdnLFCi6uMZucjRZS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:270114'),
  ('717040468758158075', 'Beck 21 - The Japanese Painting', 2007, 'Drama, Crime, Thriller, Mystery', 'Rolf Lindström, Kjell Sundvall', 'Cecilia Börjlind, Rolf Börjlind', 'Peter Haber, Mikael Persbrandt, Dieter Pfaff, Marie Göranzon, Ing-Marie Carlsson, Stina Rautelin, Jeff Ranara, Måns Nathanaelson', null, 'After a woman buys a Japanese shunga painting from an auction and later is found murdered in a hotel in Stockholm, the police gets dragged into a murder investigation where they meet the dark side of the art world.', 'After a woman buys a Japanese shunga painting from an auction and later is found murdered in a hotel in Stockholm, the police gets dragged into a murder investigation where they meet the dark side of the art world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zX629VwVP4UkItuVKk5qmufKZq0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:265981'),
  ('688600960022409428', 'Beck 22 - The Weak Link', 2007, 'Drama, Crime, Mystery, Thriller', 'Harald Hamrell, Carl Sundberg', 'Cecilia Börjlind, Rolf Börjlind', 'Peter Haber, Mikael Persbrandt, Marie Göranzon, Stina Rautelin, Ing-Marie Carlsson, Anki Larsson, Ingvar Hirdwall, Rebecka Hemse', null, 'A teenage girl is found by her parents brutally raped and murdered in the woods. It''s now up to Beck and his team to catch the criminal.', 'A teenage girl is found by her parents brutally raped and murdered in the woods. It''s now up to Beck and his team to catch the criminal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jnl6vdW4T8VBNnuIwwF1g53hjVk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:128692'),
  ('939165015550556276', 'Beck 23 - The Silent Scream', 2007, 'Crime, Mystery, Thriller, Drama', 'Carl Sundberg, Harald Hamrell', 'Rolf Börjlind, Cecilia Börjlind', 'Peter Haber, Mikael Persbrandt, Stina Rautelin, Marie Göranzon, Ing-Marie Carlsson, Måns Nathanaelson, Ingvar Hirdwall, Peter Hüttner', null, 'Two young girls are killed on railway by a passing train. It does not seem to fit the profile of a normal suicide. So if this is a double homicide who would do this and why? Martin Beck and his team start following the step backwards in order to figure out what has happened. With good and intensive police work they find man side trails from the main path.', 'Two young girls are killed on railway by a passing train. It does not seem to fit the profile of a normal suicide. So if this is a double homicide who would do this and why? Martin Beck and his team start following the step backwards in order to figure out what has happened. With good and intensive police work they find man side trails from the main path.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xLHjlujzyjaD1a0LgNNcSDCR5Cz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:270113'),
  ('1138057653888786542', 'Beck 24 - In the Name of God', 2007, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller, Mystery', 'Rolf Lindström, Kjell Sundvall', 'Cecilia Börjlind, Rolf Börjlind', 'Peter Haber, Mikael Persbrandt, Marie Göranzon, Stina Rautelin, Ing-Marie Carlsson, Måns Nathanaelson, Ingvar Hirdwall, Peter Hüttner', null, 'A paparazzi photographer gets brutally murdered in Stockholm. His apartment is searched and the computer together with photo equipment is missing.', 'A paparazzi photographer gets brutally murdered in Stockholm. His apartment is searched and the computer together with photo equipment is missing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eqvNioO6xlb0Dzn2s1InSRv8RyH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:265980'),
