  ('1140786186991586463', 'Becket', 1964, 'Drama, History', 'Peter Glenville, Geoffrey Unsworth', 'Edward Anhalt', 'Richard Burton, Peter O''Toole, John Gielgud, Gino Cervi, Paolo Stoppa, Donald Wolfit, David Weston, Martita Hunt', 'PG-13', 'Thomas Becket, Henry II''s longtime advisor, finds his friendship with the debauched king corroding when he is unwillingly appointed as Archbishop of Canterbury in an attempt to gain absolute loyalty from the Church.', 'Thomas Becket, Henry II''s longtime advisor, finds his friendship with the debauched king corroding when he is unwillingly appointed as Archbishop of Canterbury in an attempt to gain absolute loyalty from the Church.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/swWmxVbq0pXv4wwsc2O803PiXR7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15421'),
  ('1036892319577005494', 'Beckett', 2021, 'Crime, Action, Thriller, Mystery', 'Noel Corbally, Emmanuela Fragiadaki, Yorgos Korakianitis', 'Kevin Rice', 'John David Washington, Vicky Krieps, Panos Koronis, Boyd Holbrook, Alicia Vikander, Daphne Alexander, Lena Kitsopoulou, Isabella Margara', 'R', 'An American tourist in Greece finds himself on the run after a tragic accident plunges him into a political conspiracy that makes him a target for assassination.', 'An American tourist in Greece finds himself on the run after a tragic accident plunges him into a political conspiracy that makes him a target for assassination.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hGIxOfxsgcNS8aco8xgFlv3rYnt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:597433'),
  ('166302718168533806', 'Beckman', 2020, 'Action', 'James Codeglia, Gabriel Sabloff, Gabriel Sabloff', 'Gabriel Sabloff, Tommy Blaze, Steven Keller', 'David A.R. White, Brighton Sharbino, Jeff Fahey, Burt Young, William Baldwin, Jacob Melton, Kira Reed Lorsch, Kevin Downes', 'NR', 'A contract killer, becomes the reverend of a LA church, until a cult leader and his minions kidnap his daughter. Blinded by vengeance, he cuts a bloody path across the city. The only thing that can stop him is his newfound faith.', 'A contract killer, becomes the reverend of a LA church, until a cult leader and his minions kidnap his daughter. Blinded by vengeance, he cuts a bloody path across the city. The only thing that can stop him is his newfound faith.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z0r3YjyJSLqf6Hz0rbBAnEhNXQ7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:697064'),
  ('48764176059940389', 'Becks letzter Sommer', 2015, 'Drama, Comedy, Music', 'Frieder Wittich', 'Oliver Ziegenbalg, Frieder Wittich', 'Christian Ulmen, Nahuel Pérez Biscayart, Eugene Boateng, Friederike Becht, Fabian Hinrichs, Nils Dörgeloh, Hermann Beyer, Sebastian Achilles', null, 'Robert Beck failed as a musician and works frustrated as a teacher - until he learns about his gifted student Rauli. A musical genius: He sings and plays guitar like a young god. Beck is motivated to help Rauli to become a successful and published musician to fulfill his own long-held dreams of a music career.', 'Robert Beck failed as a musician and works frustrated as a teacher - until he learns about his gifted student Rauli. A musical genius: He sings and plays guitar like a young god. Beck is motivated to help Rauli to become a successful and published musician to fulfill his own long-held dreams of a music career.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eKs5KtPkJDyTRcns1ZsxXX5sSuw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:343856'),
  ('100290005384758308', 'Becky', 2020, 'Thriller, Horror, Action', 'Jonathan Milott, Cary Murnion, Greta Zozula', 'Nick Morris, Ruckus Skye, Lane Skye', 'Lulu Wilson, Kevin James, Joel McHale, Robert Maillet, Amanda Brugel, Isaiah Rockcliffe, Ryan McDonald, James McDougall', 'R', 'A teenager''s weekend at a lake house with her father takes a turn for the worse when a group of convicts wreaks havoc on their lives.', 'A teenager''s weekend at a lake house with her father takes a turn for the worse when a group of convicts wreaks havoc on their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9wqKF883Kn9c0SZV4ZmkIkFhBLh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:601844'),
  ('695114473448633063', 'Becky Sharp', 1935, 'Drama, Romance', 'Rouben Mamoulian, Wiard B. Ihnen, Roy Webb', 'Francis Edward Faragoh', 'Miriam Hopkins, Frances Dee, Cedric Hardwicke, Billie Burke, Alison Skipworth, Nigel Bruce, Alan Mowbray, G.P. Huntley', 'NR', 'In early 19th century England, ambitious and ruthless orphan Rebecca Sharp advances from the position of governess to the heights of British society. The first feature length film to use three-strip Technicolor.', 'In early 19th century England, ambitious and ruthless orphan Rebecca Sharp advances from the position of governess to the heights of British society. The first feature length film to use three-strip Technicolor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bBjky6HkzOWMxnL44wjCMPPAWDk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43888'),
  ('885306107404519193', 'Becloud', 2010, 'Drama', 'Alejandro Gerber Bicecci', 'Alejandro Gerber Bicecci', 'Aldo Estuardo, Roberto Mares, Marta Aura, Sonia Couoh, Asur Zagada, Luisa Pardo, Téresa Rábago, Mar Nava', null, 'Alejandro Gerber Bicecci''s "Vaho" (Becloud) tells the story of three childhood friends, Andres, Felipe, and Jose, and their lives in a dusty, run down corner of Mexico City. The boys were inseparable until they witnessed a tragedy that haunts them to the present day. The tragedy shaped each boy differently, and had a profound effect on their lives.', 'Alejandro Gerber Bicecci''s "Vaho" (Becloud) tells the story of three childhood friends, Andres, Felipe, and Jose, and their lives in a dusty, run down corner of Mexico City. The boys were inseparable until they witnessed a tragedy that haunts them to the present day. The tragedy shaped each boy differently, and had a profound effect on their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wgDwefozAZ9Snhf9iwisXCyR2W3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:116633'),
  ('563584308865945953', 'Becoming', 2020, 'Science Fiction, Drama, Thriller, Horror', 'Omar Naim, Shepherd Ahlers', 'Omar Naim', 'Toby Kebbell, Penelope Mitchell, Jason Patric, Jeff Daniel Phillips, Beth Broderick, Stephen Rider, Melissa Bolona, Lew Temple', null, 'A couple on a road trip through America encounter a terrifying dark force older than the country itself. An evil that transforms loved ones into someone terrifying, the entity has left a trail of murdered families going back hundreds of years.', 'A couple on a road trip through America encounter a terrifying dark force older than the country itself. An evil that transforms loved ones into someone terrifying, the entity has left a trail of murdered families going back hundreds of years.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9NZdljsmvWcAGyPqzKgmdLvn97t.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:526052'),
  ('384196643796509189', 'Becoming a Father', 2020, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Hugues Poulain, Stéphanie Pillonca', 'Catherine Hoffmann, Stéphanie Pillonca', 'Ary Abittan, Julie de Bona, Youssef Hajdi, Guillaume Duhesme, Annie Grégorio, Mélanie Guth, Yona Kervern, Marie Vincent', null, 'Frank is a father whose dreams will be shaken by the birth of his daughter with Down syndrome. How will he face the small and big sacrifices that this new life imposes on him?', 'Frank is a father whose dreams will be shaken by the birth of his daughter with Down syndrome. How will he face the small and big sacrifices that this new life imposes on him?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qJlaQRaHM7beO3xLEWS42L43182.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:672701'),
  ('448164711334253643', 'Becoming Al Pacino', 2022, 'Documentary, History, TV Movie', 'Jean-Baptiste Péretié', 'Jean-Baptiste Péretié', 'Sarah-Jane Sauvegrain, Al Pacino', null, 'A journey through the meteoric rise and tempestuous story of the legendary American actor Al Pacino, from the Bronx of New York to worldwide stardom.', 'A journey through the meteoric rise and tempestuous story of the legendary American actor Al Pacino, from the Bronx of New York to worldwide stardom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sOWjfvdokidKwBcsrWPrVCijNcl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:926616'),
  ('808616869457171488', 'Becoming Astrid', 2018, 'Drama, History', 'Pernille Fischer Christensen, Erik Molberg Hansen, Jeanette Klintberg', 'Pernille Fischer Christensen, Kim Fupz Aakeson', 'Alba August, Maria Bonnevie, Trine Dyrholm, Henrik Rafaelsen, Magnus Krepper, Björn Gustafsson, Marius Damslev, Willy Ramnek Petri', null, 'When Astrid Lindgren was very young something happened that affected her profoundly, and this combination of both miracle and calamity came to shape her entire life. It was an event that transformed her into one of the most inspiring women of our age and the storyteller a whole world would come to love. This is the story of when a young Astrid, despite the expectations of her time and religious upbringing, decided to break free from society''s norms and follow her heart.', 'When Astrid Lindgren was very young something happened that affected her profoundly, and this combination of both miracle and calamity came to shape her entire life. It was an event that transformed her into one of the most inspiring women of our age and the storyteller a whole world would come to love. This is the story of when a young Astrid, despite the expectations of her time and religious upbringing, decided to break free from society''s norms and follow her heart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eEbu8tFPSyM4zt9dPJjeFj3qwlF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:484428'),
  ('794393841869373582', 'Becoming Bond', 2017, 'Documentary, Comedy', 'Josh Greenbaum, John W. Rutland', 'Josh Greenbaum', 'George Lazenby, Josh Lawson, Kassandra Clementi, Jane Seymour, Jeff Garlin, Dana Carvey, Adamo Palladino, Jake Johnson', null, 'The stranger-than-fiction true story of George Lazenby, a poor Australian car mechanic who, through an unbelievable set of circumstances, landed the role of James Bond despite having never acted a day in his life.', 'The stranger-than-fiction true story of George Lazenby, a poor Australian car mechanic who, through an unbelievable set of circumstances, landed the role of James Bond despite having never acted a day in his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oRyVYIqegDB5rWjfloeu1Zgk332.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:438493'),
  ('845058592675500433', 'Becoming Colette', 1991, 'Drama, History', 'Danny Huston, Wolfgang Treu', 'Ruth Graham', 'Klaus Maria Brandauer, Mathilda May, Virginia Madsen, Paul Rhys, John van Dreelen, Jean-Pierre Aumont, Lucienne Hamon, Georg Tryphon', 'R', 'French writer recalls her start as the country wife of a Paris publisher who called her erotic work his own.', 'French writer recalls her start as the country wife of a Paris publisher who called her erotic work his own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8BnkdXF69Pr9lR7zXDV1wS3zEop.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:223370'),
  ('645719239098207635', 'Becoming Cousteau', 2021, 'Documentary', 'Liz Garbus', 'Mark Monroe, Pax Wassermann', 'Jacques-Yves Cousteau, Philippe Cousteau, Jean-Michel Cousteau, Francine Cousteau, Pierre-Yves Cousteau, Diane Cousteau, Albert Falco, Louis Malle', 'PG-13', 'Adventurer, filmmaker, inventor, author, unlikely celebrity and conservationist: For over four decades, Jacques-Yves Cousteau and his explorations under the ocean became synonymous with a love of science and the natural world. As he learned to protect the environment, he brought the whole world with him, sounding alarms more than 50 years ago about the warming seas and our planet’s vulnerability. In BECOMING COUSTEAU, from National Geographic Documentary Films, two-time Academy Award®-nominated filmmaker Liz Garbus takes an inside look at Cousteau and his life, his iconic films and inventions, and the experiences that made him the 20th century’s most unique and renowned environmental voice — and the man who inspired generations to protect the Earth.', 'Adventurer, filmmaker, inventor, author, unlikely celebrity and conservationist: For over four decades, Jacques-Yves Cousteau and his explorations under the ocean became synonymous with a love of science and the natural world. As he learned to protect the environment, he brought the whole world with him, sounding alarms more than 50 years ago about the warming seas and our planet’s vulnerability. In BECOMING COUSTEAU, from National Geographic Documentary Films, two-time Academy Award®-nominated filmmaker Liz Garbus takes an inside look at Cousteau and his life, his iconic films and inventions, and the experiences that made him the 20th century’s most unique and renowned environmental voice — and the man who inspired generations to protect the Earth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qS1wLXuGjyXgsBoGW3gaok40IaU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:774823'),
  ('295307924086857946', 'Becoming Jane', 2007, 'Romance, Drama', 'Julian Jarrold, Eigil Bryld', 'Kevin Hood, Sarah Williams', 'Anne Hathaway, James McAvoy, Julie Walters, James Cromwell, Maggie Smith, Joe Anderson, Lucy Cohu, Laurence Fox', 'PG', 'Though young Jane Austen''s financially strapped parents expect her to marry the nephew of wealthy Lady Gresham, Jane herself knows that such a union will destroy her creativity and sense of self-worth. Instead, she becomes involved with Tom Lefroy, a charming but penniless apprentice lawyer who gives her the knowledge of the heart she needs for her future career as a novelist.', 'Though young Jane Austen''s financially strapped parents expect her to marry the nephew of wealthy Lady Gresham, Jane herself knows that such a union will destroy her creativity and sense of self-worth. Instead, she becomes involved with Tom Lefroy, a charming but penniless apprentice lawyer who gives her the knowledge of the heart she needs for her future career as a novelist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9v2hp5qrhx8JpodGPVYfRrSAxuv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2977'),
  ('721061989410222067', 'Becoming Led Zeppelin', 2025, 'Documentary, Music', 'Bernard MacMahon, Vern Moen', 'Bernard MacMahon, Allison McGourty', 'Jimmy Page, John Paul Jones, Robert Plant, John Bonham, Jeff Beck, Peter Grant', 'PG-13', 'The individual journeys of the four members of the band, as they move through the music scene of the 1960s, playing small clubs throughout Britain and performing some of the biggest hits of the era, until their meeting in the summer of 1968 for a rehearsal that changes their lives forever.', 'The individual journeys of the four members of the band, as they move through the music scene of the 1960s, playing small clubs throughout Britain and performing some of the biggest hits of the era, until their meeting in the summer of 1968 for a rehearsal that changes their lives forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cAxteOtjaeQN045qNNbSEwu78c4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:857800'),
  ('409649425025632765', 'Becoming Male in the Middle Ages', 2022, 'Drama', 'Isadora Neves Marques, Marta Simões', 'Isadora Neves Marques', 'Isabel Costa, Zé Bernardino, Isadora Neves Marques, Nuno Nolasco, Vítor Andrade, Joana Manuel', null, 'Mirene and André are a heterosexual couple struggling with infertility issues. Carl and Vicente are a homosexual couple undergoing an experimental procedure in order to have a biological child.', 'Mirene and André are a heterosexual couple struggling with infertility issues. Carl and Vicente are a homosexual couple undergoing an experimental procedure in order to have a biological child.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y3CBMbKjFQzXFJ0NuQUKtl8rgg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:924175'),
  ('413540506919329324', 'Becoming Marilyn', 2022, 'Documentary, History, TV Movie', 'Michèle Dominici', null, 'Agnès Jaoui, Georgia Scalliet, Marilyn Monroe, Jean Harlow, Ingrid Bergman, Anita Ekberg, Rita Hayworth, Jane Russell', null, 'The story of how Norma Jeane Mortenson became Marilyn Monroe (1926-62), a lucid path of self-discovery, from anonymity to stardom: the painful birth of a myth.', 'The story of how Norma Jeane Mortenson became Marilyn Monroe (1926-62), a lucid path of self-discovery, from anonymity to stardom: the painful birth of a myth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u2DcsCdev5ihVPKeuFEwtBabtsV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1011403'),
  ('1116175665493774342', 'Becoming Victoria Wood', 2026, 'Documentary, Comedy', 'Catherine Abbott', null, 'Victoria Wood, Jessica Barden, Dawn French, Jennifer Saunders, Maxine Peake', null, 'Comic genius Victoria Wood battled inner struggles behind her beloved public image. Through personal accounts and others'' memories, we see how her early challenges shaped her unique ability to make Britain laugh.', 'Comic genius Victoria Wood battled inner struggles behind her beloved public image. Through personal accounts and others'' memories, we see how her early challenges shaped her unique ability to make Britain laugh.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FdoQ7aDUx7jAQGR1QlWjSwTBMTTV.jpg', 'plex:movie:becoming-victoria-wood'),
  ('890907250213930394', 'Becoming Warren Buffett', 2017, 'Documentary', 'Brian Oakes, Peter W. Kunhardt, Clair Popkin', null, 'Warren Buffett, Susan Buffett, Bill Gates, Aiden Linkov', 'PG-13', 'The story of the evolution of a boy from Nebraska who became one of the most respected men in the world, and the heroes who helped guide him along the way. By allowing access to his life and never-before-released home videos, Buffett offers a glimpse into his unique mind to help us understand what is truly important when money no longer has meaning.', 'The story of the evolution of a boy from Nebraska who became one of the most respected men in the world, and the heroes who helped guide him along the way. By allowing access to his life and never-before-released home videos, Buffett offers a glimpse into his unique mind to help us understand what is truly important when money no longer has meaning.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sMS6f2uBu0tyGK9iowA21La9F1o.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:438137'),
  ('1135259954488928106', 'Becoming Zlatan', 2015, 'Documentary', 'Magnus Gertten, Fredrik Gertten, Jon Rudberg', 'Magnus Gertten', 'Zlatan Ibrahimović, Leo Beenhakker, Fabio Capello, Ronald Koeman, Jari Litmanen, Marco van Basten, Hasse Borg, Andy van der Meijde', null, 'The decisive years of Swedish soccer player Zlatan Ibrahimović, told through rare archive footage in which a young Zlatan speaks openly about his life and challenges. The film closely follows him, from his debut with the Malmö FF team in 1999 through his conflict-ridden years with Ajax Amsterdam, and up to his final breakthrough with Juventus in 2005.', 'The decisive years of Swedish soccer player Zlatan Ibrahimović, told through rare archive footage in which a young Zlatan speaks openly about his life and challenges. The film closely follows him, from his debut with the Malmö FF team in 1999 through his conflict-ridden years with Ajax Amsterdam, and up to his final breakthrough with Juventus in 2005.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l2RxbkV56deZFaI1arbFPA1PpHh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:379998'),
  ('967353297919379088', 'Bed & Breakfast', 2010, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Márcio Garcia, Marcus Dartagnãn, Charity Thomson', 'Leland Douglas', 'Juliana Paes, Dean Cain, Julian Stone, Zilah Mendoza, Eric Roberts, John Savage, Julia Duffy, Calvin Jung', null, 'Bed and Breakfast is a romantic comedy about a saleswoman from a large department store in Rio who discovers she has inherited property in the wine country of California. She could never expect what she would find in "Webster", a small country town', 'Bed and Breakfast is a romantic comedy about a saleswoman from a large department store in Rio who discovers she has inherited property in the wine country of California. She could never expect what she would find in "Webster", a small country town', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/33A14tBrCfz0fGcLOINbh3lqwBm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64458'),
  ('357647009025191349', 'Bed and Board', 1970, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'François Truffaut, Néstor Almendros, Jean-François Stévenin', 'Bernard Revon, Claude de Givray, François Truffaut', 'Jean-Pierre Léaud, Claude Jade, Daniel Ceccaldi, Claire Duhamel, Hiroko Matsumoto, Daniel Boulanger, Silvana Blasi, Barbara Laage', 'PG', 'Parisian everyman Antoine Doinel has married his sweetheart Christine Darbon, and the newlyweds have set up a cozy domestic life of selling flowers and giving violin lessons while Antoine fitfully works on his long-gestating novel. As Christine becomes pregnant with the couple''s first child, Antoine finds himself enraptured with a young Japanese beauty. The complications change the course of their relationship forever.', 'Parisian everyman Antoine Doinel has married his sweetheart Christine Darbon, and the newlyweds have set up a cozy domestic life of selling flowers and giving violin lessons while Antoine fitfully works on his long-gestating novel. As Christine becomes pregnant with the couple''s first child, Antoine finds himself enraptured with a young Japanese beauty. The complications change the course of their relationship forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s9R5wKbrB9SfOG1FzbICbOsssX8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:258'),
  ('410363058047752035', 'Bed and Breakfast', 2003, 'Comedy', 'Claude Duty, David Johnson', 'Claude Duty, Jean-Philippe Barrau', 'Marina Foïs, Julie Depardieu, Léa Drucker, Sebastian Barrio, Annie Grégorio, Philippe Harel, Bulle Ogier, Lionel Abelanski', null, 'Tired of their stressful parisian lifestyle, Caroline and Bertrand decide to start a new life, running a traditional gîte in deepest Provence. It is not long before they start to question the wisdom of this move – the buldings are in a state of near-dilapidation, their friend and supposed partner Sophie has walked out on them, and they are but a stone’s throw from a far more attarctive holiday home, catering for gay men. Will this change be as good as a rest or the start of a nightmare?', 'Tired of their stressful parisian lifestyle, Caroline and Bertrand decide to start a new life, running a traditional gîte in deepest Provence. It is not long before they start to question the wisdom of this move – the buldings are in a state of near-dilapidation, their friend and supposed partner Sophie has walked out on them, and they are but a stone’s throw from a far more attarctive holiday home, catering for gay men. Will this change be as good as a rest or the start of a nightmare?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jLjg2cf8Lb8lRPrPXdOZxuqClmF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62341'),
  ('750691778034516661', 'Bed and Sofa', 1927, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Grigory Giber, Abram Room', 'Viktor Shklovskiy, Abram Room', 'Nikolai Batalov, Lyudmila Semyonova, Vladimir Fogel, Leonid Yurenyov, Mariya Yarotskaya, Yelena Sokolova, Boris Shlikhting', null, 'Life changes for a Moscow couple after they allow an old friend of the husband’s to move in.', 'Life changes for a Moscow couple after they allow an old friend of the husband’s to move in.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uEYi67LRcdPa94bpbtCm0EqwuIQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:98200'),
  ('469890430464247532', 'Bed Bugs', 2017, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Jan Henrik Stahlberg, Ferhat Yunus Topraklar', 'Jan Henrik Stahlberg, Wolfram Fleischhauer', 'Jan Henrik Stahlberg, Franz Rogowski, Thomas Bading, Susanne Bredehöft, Jan Pohl, Saralisa Volm, Hans-Ulrich Laux, Roald Schramm', null, 'Burned out and lonely Rocky is almost 50 years old and has seen better times as a womanizer. One day, Thorben shows up at his door claiming to be his son. He is trying to get advice on how to be successful with women.', 'Burned out and lonely Rocky is almost 50 years old and has seen better times as a womanizer. One day, Thorben shows up at his door claiming to be his son. He is trying to get advice on how to be successful with women.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wWRiQLxQrCpaant8gNaKcCMwMte.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:464287'),
  ('864115291997290129', 'Bed Number 6', 2020, 'Horror', 'Vincenzo Mineo, Francesca Amitrano, Milena Cocozza', 'Cristiano Brignola, Michelangelo La Neve', 'Carolina Crescentini, Andrea Lattanzi, Roberto Citran, Carla Cassola, Pier Giorgio Bellocchio, Riccardo Bortoluzzi, Nathalie Caldonazzo, Paola Sotgiu', null, 'Doctor Bianca Valentino is hired to cover the night shift in the ward of a pediatric hospital. She finds herself immersed in an environment that, behind its reassuring image, hides a terrifying secret linked to its past as a children''s asylum. The ghost of a child wanders the corridors tormenting her and transforming her nights in the clinic into an endless nightmare that day after day is about to become reality.', 'Doctor Bianca Valentino is hired to cover the night shift in the ward of a pediatric hospital. She finds herself immersed in an environment that, behind its reassuring image, hides a terrifying secret linked to its past as a children''s asylum. The ghost of a child wanders the corridors tormenting her and transforming her nights in the clinic into an endless nightmare that day after day is about to become reality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/maf9uJ3oTrE8dul8e6EuLEuktfh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:653258'),
  ('881338093728189302', 'Bed of Roses', 1933, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Gregory La Cava, Charles Rosher, Max Steiner', 'Wanda Tuchock', 'Constance Bennett, Joel McCrea, John Halliday, Pert Kelton, Samuel S. Hinds, Franklin Pangborn, Tom Herbert, Robert Emmett O''Connor', 'NR', 'A girl from the wrong side of the tracks is torn between true love and a life of sin.', 'A girl from the wrong side of the tracks is torn between true love and a life of sin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lLozxIipN4j21KkGOxl57UbX1If.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:144784'),
  ('508974336666011311', 'Bed of Roses', 1996, 'Drama, Romance', 'Michael Goldenberg, Adam Kimmel, Michael Haley', 'Michael Goldenberg', 'Christian Slater, Mary Stuart Masterson, Pamela Adlon, Josh Brolin, Brian Tarantina, Debra Monk, Mary Alice, Kenneth Cranham', 'PG', 'The seeds of love are planted when Lisa, a high-powered investment banker, receives flowers from a secret admirer. But when his fairy-tale fantasies clash with her workaholic ways, they soon find out that sometimes, it''s harder than it seems for love to conquer all.', 'The seeds of love are planted when Lisa, a high-powered investment banker, receives flowers from a secret admirer. But when his fairy-tale fantasies clash with her workaholic ways, they soon find out that sometimes, it''s harder than it seems for love to conquer all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zCXvHCEm8334d0d646ldDkXnKws.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20927'),
  ('828935390501944943', 'Bed of the Dead', 2016, 'Horror', 'Ryan Port, Sarah Macleod, Ashley Hallihan', 'Jeff Maher, Cody Calahan', 'Colin Price, Alysa King, Gwenlyn Cumyn, Dennis Andres, George Krissa, Alex Loubert, Mary-Elizabeth Willcott, Craig Cyr', null, 'Four twentysomethings find themselves stuck on a haunted antique bed where leaving means suffering a gruesome death. Plagued with frightening hallucinations, they must figure out the bed''s secrets before they are ultimately picked off one by one.', 'Four twentysomethings find themselves stuck on a haunted antique bed where leaving means suffering a gruesome death. Plagued with frightening hallucinations, they must figure out the bed''s secrets before they are ultimately picked off one by one.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v1o1QrDi1JElS9lxwu78TKaNxw6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:405174'),
  ('849665987268279584', 'Bed Rest', 2023, 'Horror', 'Lori Evans Taylor, Jean-Philippe Bernier', 'Lori Evans Taylor', 'Melissa Barrera, Guy Burnet, Edie Inksetter, Sebastian Billingsley-Rodriguez, Erik Athavale, Kristen Sawatzky, Koen Schneiderat, Paul Essiembre', 'R', 'After struggling to start a family, Julie Rivers becomes pregnant and moves into a new home with her husband. She''s ordered to mandatory bed rest, and begins seeing ghostly happenings throughout the house.', 'After struggling to start a family, Julie Rivers becomes pregnant and moves into a new home with her husband. She''s ordered to mandatory bed rest, and begins seeing ghostly happenings throughout the house.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tiZF8b9T9fMcwvsEEkJ5ik1wCnV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:917007'),
  ('99444098681520446', 'Bed Scenes', 1998, 'Drama, Romance', 'François Ozon, Mathieu Vadepied, Yorick Le Saux', 'François Ozon', 'Valérie Druguet, François Delaive, Philippe Dajoux, Loïc Even, François Genty, Bruno Slagmulder, Sébastien Charles, Jérémie Elkaïm', null, 'Seven brief scenes, each with a couple, explore the surprises and the changes of heart that can occur during sexual encounters. Only one of the seven couples has been in bed together before; several are strangers or new acquaintances. A prostitute and her john, an older woman and a youth who follows her home, two women friends, a gay man with a straight man, a man with distinctive ideas about soap and water, a woman who wants the light left on, and a Spanish-speaking woman with a French-speaking man make for an array of possibilities and unanticipated consequences. The 7 bed scenes are titled: The Black Hole [Le trou noir]; Mr. Clean [Monsieur Propre]; Madame; Heads or Tails [Tête bêche]; The Ideal Man [L''homme idéal]; Love in the Dark [L''amour dans le noir]; and The Virgins [Les puceaux].', 'Seven brief scenes, each with a couple, explore the surprises and the changes of heart that can occur during sexual encounters. Only one of the seven couples has been in bed together before; several are strangers or new acquaintances. A prostitute and her john, an older woman and a youth who follows her home, two women friends, a gay man with a straight man, a man with distinctive ideas about soap and water, a woman who wants the light left on, and a Spanish-speaking woman with a French-speaking man make for an array of possibilities and unanticipated consequences. The 7 bed scenes are titled: The Black Hole [Le trou noir]; Mr. Clean [Monsieur Propre]; Madame; Heads or Tails [Tête bêche]; The Ideal Man [L''homme idéal]; Love in the Dark [L''amour dans le noir]; and The Virgins [Les puceaux].', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pIQnN2XVkq2LNQK4QthtNnZxTgB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49276'),
  ('79600852673810020', 'Bedazzled', 1967, 'Fantasy, Comedy, Romance', 'Austin Dempster, Stanley Donen', 'Peter Cook', 'Peter Cook, Dudley Moore, Eleanor Bron, Raquel Welch, Alba, Robert Russell, Barry Humphries, Parnell McGarry', null, 'A hapless loser sells his soul to the Devil in exchange for seven wishes, but has trouble winning over the girl of his dreams.', 'A hapless loser sells his soul to the Devil in exchange for seven wishes, but has trouble winning over the girl of his dreams.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4POWJtOXt19PWfO18rHpw5GIQc6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18209'),
  ('700620700197745845', 'Bedazzled', 2000, 'Fantasy, Comedy, Romance', 'Harold Ramis, Bill Pope, Michael Haley', 'Peter Tolan, Harold Ramis, Larry Gelbart', 'Brendan Fraser, Elizabeth Hurley, Frances O''Connor, Miriam Shor, Orlando Jones, Paul Adelstein, Toby Huss, Gabriel Casseus', 'PG-13', 'Elliot Richards, a socially awkward IT worker, is given seven wishes to get the girl of his dreams when he meets a very seductive Satan. The catch: his soul. Some of his wishes include being a 7 foot basketball star, a wealthy, powerful man, and a sensitive caring guy. But, as could be expected, the Devil puts her own little twist on each of his fantasies.', 'Elliot Richards, a socially awkward IT worker, is given seven wishes to get the girl of his dreams when he meets a very seductive Satan. The catch: his soul. Some of his wishes include being a 7 foot basketball star, a wealthy, powerful man, and a sensitive caring guy. But, as could be expected, the Devil puts her own little twist on each of his fantasies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sBV28EVvWsJRosMsEFCbVmpAZEl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1636'),
  ('824541653939231720', 'Bedeviled', 2017, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Abel Vang, Burlee Vang, Jimmy Jung Lu', 'Abel Vang, Burlee Vang', 'Saxon Sharbino, Mitchell Edwards, Brandon Soo Hoo, Victory Van Tuyl, Carson Boatman, Jordan Essoe, Alexis G. Zall, Robyn Cohen', 'R', 'When a group of teenagers receive an invite to download the latest smartphone app, an intelligent personal assistant, they expect a harmless way to get directions and restaurant recommendations. But the sinister nature of the app soon reveals itself, tormenting the friends by tapping into their darkest fears.', 'When a group of teenagers receive an invite to download the latest smartphone app, an intelligent personal assistant, they expect a harmless way to get directions and restaurant recommendations. But the sinister nature of the app soon reveals itself, tormenting the friends by tapping into their darkest fears.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nj41nDNmpRNQSaHithu8VmOGUDG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:407531'),
  ('987097730596257379', 'Bedevilled', 2010, 'Thriller, Crime, Drama, Horror', 'Jang Cheol-soo, Nam Jin-a, Kim Gi-tae', 'Choi Kwan-young', 'Seo Young-hee, Ji Sung-won, Baek Su-ryeon, Park Jeong-hak, Bae Sung-woo, Oh Yong, Hwang Min-Ho, A-in', 'NR', 'A disillusioned Seoul woman visits a remote island to reconnect with a childhood friend, only to find her trapped in an oppressive cycle of physical, mental, and sexual abuse. As tensions escalate, the situation spirals into a harrowing tale of survival and retribution.', 'A disillusioned Seoul woman visits a remote island to reconnect with a childhood friend, only to find her trapped in an oppressive cycle of physical, mental, and sexual abuse. As tensions escalate, the situation spirals into a harrowing tale of survival and retribution.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3ZgFJY1kje1XhXPvC8UtRKA2tX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59421'),
