  ('1086242463478680066', 'Bedfellows', 2008, 'Drama, Horror', 'Drew Daywalt', 'Drew Daywalt', 'Kerry Finlayson, Edin Gali, Peter Giliberti', null, 'When a woman is being called in the middle of the night, she finds out that it''s not her husband laying next to her.', 'When a woman is being called in the middle of the night, she finds out that it''s not her husband laying next to her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/46ATb6LjTHBaYxbTmNJezNsMxEx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:174611'),
  ('1050471745109092694', 'Bedhead', 1991, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Family', 'Robert Rodriguez, Robert Rodriguez', 'Robert Rodriguez, Bryant Delafosse', 'Rebecca Rodriguez, David Rodriguez, Tina Rodriguez, Elizabeth Rodriguez', null, 'David defaces his sister''s doll. In the fight that follows Rebecca falls and hits her head. When she comes to, she discovers that she has telekinetic powers, and uses them to take revenge on her brother David.', 'David defaces his sister''s doll. In the fight that follows Rebecca falls and hits her head. When she comes to, she discovers that she has telekinetic powers, and uses them to take revenge on her brother David.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uZfh1OSJP26YFK88DppMvdoCNTR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:105704'),
  ('1148493384470148476', 'Bedknobs and Broomsticks', 1971, 'Family, Animation, Fantasy', 'Robert Stevenson, Frank V. Phillips, Ward Kimball', 'Bill Walsh, Don DaGradi', 'Angela Lansbury, David Tomlinson, Roddy McDowall, Sam Jaffe, John Ericson, Bruce Forsyth, Cindy O''Callaghan, Roy Snart', 'G', 'Three children evacuated from London during World War II are forced to stay with an eccentric spinster. The children''s initial fears disappear when they find out she is in fact a trainee witch.', 'Three children evacuated from London during World War II are forced to stay with an eccentric spinster. The children''s initial fears disappear when they find out she is in fact a trainee witch.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1BBzsThIZ06UmjZ3rChYGZhJtFQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12335'),
  ('30043494858482890', 'Bedlam', 1946, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Mark Robson, Nicholas Musuraca, C. Bakaleinikoff', 'Val Lewton, Mark Robson', 'Boris Karloff, Anna Lee, Billy House, Richard Fraser, Glen Vernon, Ian Wolfe, Jason Robards Sr., Leyland Hodgson', 'NR', 'London, 1761. St. Mary''s of Bethlehem, a sinister madhouse, is visited by wealthy people who enjoy watching the patients confined there as if they were caged animals. Nell Bowen, one of the visitors, is horrified by the deplorable living conditions of the unfortunate inhabitants of this godforsaken place, better known as Bedlam.', 'London, 1761. St. Mary''s of Bethlehem, a sinister madhouse, is visited by wealthy people who enjoy watching the patients confined there as if they were caged animals. Nell Bowen, one of the visitors, is horrified by the deplorable living conditions of the unfortunate inhabitants of this godforsaken place, better known as Bedlam.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rDYbo7kSkVjdKMAdJwN4pOMO6z1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24111'),
  ('965514164425453176', 'Bedlam', 2015, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Chew Barker', 'Chew Barker', 'Guy Edmonds, John Boxer, Peter McAllum, Cassandra Swaby, Gary Boulter, Greg Hatton, Amanda Marsden, Steve Maresca', 'R', 'George is haunted by the demons of his family''s past and tortured by the voices inside his head. He makes one last attempt at recovery by contacting his dead mother''s doctor. The doctor''s orders; that he attend Bedlam Hospital for a guaranteed recovery. As George checks in he''s confronted by a world of society''s unwanted, unloved and unstable. Soon, he will discover that all is not as it seems. The hospital hides a dark secret. Welcome to Bedlam...', 'George is haunted by the demons of his family''s past and tortured by the voices inside his head. He makes one last attempt at recovery by contacting his dead mother''s doctor. The doctor''s orders; that he attend Bedlam Hospital for a guaranteed recovery. As George checks in he''s confronted by a world of society''s unwanted, unloved and unstable. Soon, he will discover that all is not as it seems. The hospital hides a dark secret. Welcome to Bedlam...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t0MrlCELHT4Vv92pzvBioUNueV4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:263865'),
  ('751869613873984483', 'Bedmen', 1973, 'Science Fiction, Comedy', 'Günay Kosova, Suat Kapki', 'Günay Kosova', 'Levent Çakır, Emel Özden, Altan Günbay, Nalan Çöl, Ceyhan Cem, Funda Ege, Hüseyin Sayar, Kadriye Fidan', null, 'From 1973, it''s a Turkish Batman and Robin ignoring a Commissioner Gordon type before fighting a Blofeld-esque villain (bald, strokes cat) while spending their downtime in strip clubs! Yep, there''s more nudity in this film than every other Batman movie combined, which admittedly isn''t much but we''ll take what we can get. For some reason the dynamic duo sometimes have capes and sometimes don''t. In one scene Batman even picks up a gun and shoots a couple of bad guys before tucking the gun into his belt. You won''t see that in the comics. This time no clips from other films (that I noticed anyway) but lots of music is lifted from elsewhere, including the James Bond theme.', 'From 1973, it''s a Turkish Batman and Robin ignoring a Commissioner Gordon type before fighting a Blofeld-esque villain (bald, strokes cat) while spending their downtime in strip clubs! Yep, there''s more nudity in this film than every other Batman movie combined, which admittedly isn''t much but we''ll take what we can get. For some reason the dynamic duo sometimes have capes and sometimes don''t. In one scene Batman even picks up a gun and shoots a couple of bad guys before tucking the gun into his belt. You won''t see that in the comics. This time no clips from other films (that I noticed anyway) but lots of music is lifted from elsewhere, including the James Bond theme.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5wxPnAzmld7XJyE5JJ5PHnYNNAX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62516'),
  ('755641448944128834', 'Bedroom Eyes', 1984, 'Mystery, Thriller, Comedy', 'William Fruet, Miklós Lente', 'Michael Alan Eddy', 'Kip Gilman, Barbara Law, Jayne Catling, Christine Cattell, James B. Douglas, Dayle Haddon, Danny Higham, Alf Humphreys', 'R', 'A young businessman, out jogging one night, sees a beautiful woman undressing in her bedroom window. He is compelled to return every night to watch her, until one night he witnesses a murder in the same apartment and soon becomes the prime suspect.', 'A young businessman, out jogging one night, sees a beautiful woman undressing in her bedroom window. He is compelled to return every night to watch her, until one night he witnesses a murder in the same apartment and soon becomes the prime suspect.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t2rJhIZR65DxRBjHNqVBHP5IeER.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42083'),
  ('526313610936932250', 'Bedroom Eyes II', 1989, 'Thriller', 'Chuck Vincent, Larry Revene', 'Jerry Ciccoritti, Michael Alan Eddy', 'Wings Hauser, Kathy Shower, Linda Blair, Veronica Hart, Joe Giardina, Kevin Thomsen, Jennifer Delora, Harvey Siegel', 'R', 'This sequel to 1986''s Bedroom Eyes is the mixture as before, with Wings Hauser replacing the first film''s star Kenneth Gilman. Once again, stockbroker Hauser begins succumbing to his chronic voyeurism. And also once again, his obsession gets him mixed up in a murder.', 'This sequel to 1986''s Bedroom Eyes is the mixture as before, with Wings Hauser replacing the first film''s star Kenneth Gilman. Once again, stockbroker Hauser begins succumbing to his chronic voyeurism. And also once again, his obsession gets him mixed up in a murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yMALV9Aop8eihOX4ZRhTglXfgdl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:128789'),
  ('1121065926895091096', 'Bedroom Mazurka', 1970, 'Comedy', 'John Hilbard, Erik Wittrup Willumsen', 'Bob Ramsing', 'Ole Søltoft, Annie Birgit Garde, Birte Tove, Anne Grete Nissen, Axel Strøbye, Karl Stegger, Paul Hagen, Gunilla Ekroth', null, 'Max (Søltoft) is a popular teacher at a public school who needs a new schoolmaster. In an effort to entice him to take the vacated position, the boys hire a stripper to seduce the sexually inexperienced scholar. The wife and daughter of the former headmaster also wish to tutor the teacher in their own private lessons in human sexuality.', 'Max (Søltoft) is a popular teacher at a public school who needs a new schoolmaster. In an effort to entice him to take the vacated position, the boys hire a stripper to seduce the sexually inexperienced scholar. The wife and daughter of the former headmaster also wish to tutor the teacher in their own private lessons in human sexuality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nfc95uvqM1XHIqSUgujEoM1vCLL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24943'),
  ('1033565233813647307', 'Bedrooms and Hallways', 1998, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Ashley Rowe, Rose Troche', 'Robert Farrar', 'Kevin McKidd, Hugo Weaving, James Purefoy, Tom Hollander, Christopher Fulford, Julie Graham, Con O''Neill, Paul Higgins', null, 'At the suggestion of a straight friend, gay man Leo joins a men’s group, where he causes some upsets by declaring his attraction to one of its members.', 'At the suggestion of a straight friend, gay man Leo joins a men’s group, where he causes some upsets by declaring his attraction to one of its members.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tH02iMSE2qSmkl6i0x4sbhfS58M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40694'),
  ('478202263032092492', 'Bedside Dentist', 1971, 'Romance, Comedy', 'John Hilbard, Rolf Rønne', 'Finn Henriksen, John Hilbard', 'Ole Søltoft, Birte Tove, Annie Birgit Garde, Carl Ottosen, Søren Strømberg, Susanne Jagd, Paul Hagen, Karl Stegger', null, 'Thomas, a naive young dental student, faces a rather difficult challenge. His millionaire aunt, a bit of a sex nut, will give both him and his dental school millions if he can prove that he is sexually able and skillful. His schoolmates hear rumors of this trial, but understand the challenge to be for him to keep his celibacy.', 'Thomas, a naive young dental student, faces a rather difficult challenge. His millionaire aunt, a bit of a sex nut, will give both him and his dental school millions if he can prove that he is sexually able and skillful. His schoolmates hear rumors of this trial, but understand the challenge to be for him to keep his celibacy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4Roz78riyYOqJ7GBG4Bob7dwA9e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24958'),
  ('967768488613569753', 'Bedside Head', 1972, 'Comedy', 'John Hilbard', 'Bob Ramsing', 'Ole Søltoft, Birte Tove, Axel Strøbye, Annie Birgit Garde, Karl Stegger, Hans W. Petersen, Bjørn Puggaard-Müller, Miskow Makwarth', null, 'The young headmaster of a boy''s boarding school has decided that due to the virility of his young charges, they are a sort of national treasure. He believes that his school should become co-educational as soon as possible. In order to raise funds for the changeover, the boys stay behind during their summer vacation and temporarily convert the school into a love hotel.', 'The young headmaster of a boy''s boarding school has decided that due to the virility of his young charges, they are a sort of national treasure. He believes that his school should become co-educational as soon as possible. In order to raise funds for the changeover, the boys stay behind during their summer vacation and temporarily convert the school into a love hotel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fYoke0FqQLJ9WZXoCgrXpkWospV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24954'),
  ('471490240839089889', 'Bedside Romance', 1973, 'Comedy, Romance', 'John Hilbard, Aage Wiltrup', 'John Hilbard', 'Birte Tove, Paul Hagen, Annie Birgit Garde, Ole Søltoft, Karl Stegger, Søren Strømberg, Arthur Jensen, Ole Monty', null, 'A girl inherits a string of industrial concerns that will become bankrupt by the inheritance tax unless the girl marries the son of the owner of a competing industrial concern.', 'A girl inherits a string of industrial concerns that will become bankrupt by the inheritance tax unless the girl marries the son of the owner of a competing industrial concern.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u6V0sCn7KC5d5HpTMEu3x6z3vch.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24956'),
  ('1107225831848853626', 'Bedtime Bedlam', 1955, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Paul J. Smith', null, 'June Foray, Stan Freberg, Grace Stafford', null, 'Woody Woodpecker is running a babysitting service and is offered $50 by a couple if he will look after their baby. Woody jumps at the chance. Unfortunately, turns out the baby is an infant gorilla!', 'Woody Woodpecker is running a babysitting service and is offered $50 by a couple if he will look after their baby. Woody jumps at the chance. Unfortunately, turns out the baby is an infant gorilla!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kvW6KydFD9jBj1wjdOIxqUPfguE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:235555'),
  ('451056949297844806', 'Bedtime Eyes', 1987, 'Drama', 'Tatsumi Kumashiro', 'Rio Kishida', 'Kanako Higuchi, Michael Wright, Michiyo Yasuda, Eiji Okuda, Akira Emoto, Naoto Takenaka, Hideaki Satô, Fujio Tokita', null, 'Based on a polemic novel by Amy Yamada, Bedtime Eyes is about the intense love relationship between a second rate Japanese jazz singer and a black American GI on the margins of the law.', 'Based on a polemic novel by Amy Yamada, Bedtime Eyes is about the intense love relationship between a second rate Japanese jazz singer and a black American GI on the margins of the law.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dlozKAUiOLsxFtbT2OFXAZ8Us5i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:569151'),
