  ('264821238789680989', 'Bedtime for Bonzo', 1951, 'Comedy, Family, Romance', 'Frederick de Cordova, Carl E. Guthrie', 'Lou Breslow, Val Burton', 'Ronald Reagan, Diana Lynn, Walter Slezak, Lucille Barkley, Jesse White, Herbert Heyes, Herb Vigran, Harry Tyler', 'NR', 'College prof Peter Boyd tries to salvage his professional and personal reputation by using a lab chimp to prove that environment trumps heredity in behavioral development.', 'College prof Peter Boyd tries to salvage his professional and personal reputation by using a lab chimp to prove that environment trumps heredity in behavioral development.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6fyCX61AY0MsNwMZ0dz5IOquvcK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43371'),
