  ('296339467910945402', 'Bedtime for the Bride', 1896, 'Drama', 'Albert Kirchner', null, 'Louise Willy', null, 'A newlywed couple in front of their wedding-bed after their wedding. The woman undresses in front of her husband. A French erotic short film considered to be one of the first erotic films made.', 'A newlywed couple in front of their wedding-bed after their wedding. The woman undresses in front of her husband. A French erotic short film considered to be one of the first erotic films made.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bejzaXIEJZncBSyzsadlVQuhog7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:302980'),
  ('1088947445708270141', 'Bedtime Stories', 2008, 'Fantasy, Comedy, Family, Romance', 'Adam Shankman, Daniel Silverberg, Conte Mark Matal', 'Matt Lopez, Tim Herlihy', 'Adam Sandler, Keri Russell, Guy Pearce, Courteney Cox, Lucy Lawless, Carmen Electra, Jonathan Pryce, Richard Griffiths', 'PG', 'Skeeter Bronson is a down-on-his-luck guy who''s always telling bedtime stories to his niece and nephew. But his life is turned upside down when the fantastical stories he makes up for entertainment inexplicably turn into reality. Can a bewildered Skeeter manage his own unruly fantasies now that the outrageous characters and situations from his mind have morphed into actual people and events?', 'Skeeter Bronson is a down-on-his-luck guy who''s always telling bedtime stories to his niece and nephew. But his life is turned upside down when the fantastical stories he makes up for entertainment inexplicably turn into reality. Can a bewildered Skeeter manage his own unruly fantasies now that the outrageous characters and situations from his mind have morphed into actual people and events?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2PljsqbhxrFUzfTnaVhsseHhXN0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10202'),
  ('784424482021978004', 'Bedtime Story', 1964, 'Comedy', 'Ralph Levy, Clifford Stine', 'Paul Henning, Stanley Shapiro', 'Marlon Brando, David Niven, Shirley Jones, Dody Goodman, Aram Stephan, Parley Baer, Marie Windsor, Rebecca Sand', 'NR', 'Benson is a Casanova who tricks women into having sex with him before leaving them. He is content with this game until he meets Jamison, a real operator who poses as an exiled prince and not only gets women to share his bed but also to give him money to help him fund his supposed counter-revolution.', 'Benson is a Casanova who tricks women into having sex with him before leaving them. He is content with this game until he meets Jamison, a real operator who poses as an exiled prince and not only gets women to share his bed but also to give him money to help him fund his supposed counter-revolution.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4oN375vg2eJSHZzf9kztiwnu3jP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40618'),
  ('466124870639438472', 'Bedways', 2010, 'Music, Drama, Romance', 'Rolf Peter Kahl', 'Rolf Peter Kahl', 'Miriam Mayet, Lana Cooper, Matthi Faust, Arno Frisch, Laura Tonke, Moritz Ross, Helge-Björn Meyer, Ute Schwidden', null, 'A huge, run-down apartment in Berlin Mitte. Two women and a man, rehearsals for a movie about love and sex, that will never be shot. Acting and reality mingle into a dangerous mélange.', 'A huge, run-down apartment in Berlin Mitte. Two women and a man, rehearsals for a movie about love and sex, that will never be shot. Acting and reality mingle into a dangerous mélange.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Dyn152ce3Jp4zwqlVLIi5rw5AK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62489'),
  ('855838837356332700', 'Bee at the Beach', 1950, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Jack Hannah', null, 'Clarence Nash', 'NR', 'Donald cheerfully sets up his umbrella etcetera for a day at the beach, but so did a mischievously lazy bee, who doesn''t accept his actions inadvertently mess up the bee''s spot. Once Donald is in the water in an inflatable raft, the irate insect uses its angle to sting not the duck, but the dingy, more often then Donald has fingers and toes to stuff in the holes, next makes sure to attract the ''gastronomical'' attention of a whole band of sharks: duck hunting season at sea is open. Donald uses all the resourcefulness of desperation, and his only weapon, the beach umbrella...', 'Donald cheerfully sets up his umbrella etcetera for a day at the beach, but so did a mischievously lazy bee, who doesn''t accept his actions inadvertently mess up the bee''s spot. Once Donald is in the water in an inflatable raft, the irate insect uses its angle to sting not the duck, but the dingy, more often then Donald has fingers and toes to stuff in the holes, next makes sure to attract the ''gastronomical'' attention of a whole band of sharks: duck hunting season at sea is open. Donald uses all the resourcefulness of desperation, and his only weapon, the beach umbrella...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dLpioR9ib7AQT2JcMbp5m62TWJz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53454'),
  ('824901636642860250', 'Bee Movie', 2007, 'Family, Animation, Adventure, Comedy', 'Steve Hickner, Simon J. Smith, David C. Lawson', 'Jerry Seinfeld, Spike Feresten, Barry Marder', 'Jerry Seinfeld, Renée Zellweger, Matthew Broderick, Patrick Warburton, John Goodman, Chris Rock, Kathy Bates, Barry Levinson', 'PG', 'Barry B. Benson, a recent college graduate who wants more out of his life than making honey, decides to sue the human race after learning about the exploitation of bees at the hands of mankind. What will happen next?', 'Barry B. Benson, a recent college graduate who wants more out of his life than making honey, decides to sue the human race after learning about the exploitation of bees at the hands of mankind. What will happen next?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aWe27GmvfVYAd7p0KEtJZWwLWk5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5559'),
  ('427995881773686313', 'Bee On Guard', 1951, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Jack Hannah', null, 'Clarence Nash, Pinto Colvig', 'NR', 'Gardener Donald spots bees in his garden and follows them back to the hive in search of honey. The bee guarding the hive won''t let him in, so Donald disguises himself as a bee.', 'Gardener Donald spots bees in his garden and follows them back to the hive in search of honey. The bee guarding the hive won''t let him in, so Donald disguises himself as a bee.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ry9jZPLFPr7XGPrS3Wd70y5aFwC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53455'),
  ('57940661376267763', 'Bee Season', 2005, 'Drama, Family', 'Scott McGehee, Giles Nuttgens, David Siegel', 'Naomi Foner', 'Richard Gere, Juliette Binoche, Flora Cross, Max Minghella, Kate Bosworth, Corey Fischer, Sam Zuckerman, Joan Mankin', null, 'Wife and mother Miriam begins a downward emotional spiral as her husband avoids their collapsing marriage by immersing himself in his 11-year-old daughter''s quest to become a spelling-bee champion.', 'Wife and mother Miriam begins a downward emotional spiral as her husband avoids their collapsing marriage by immersing himself in his 11-year-old daughter''s quest to become a spelling-bee champion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xeUOz7tYY8YuARrwAQL54DThscu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24618'),
  ('873606459449766966', 'Beefcake', 1998, 'Drama, History, Documentary', 'Thom Fitzgerald, Kayla Popp, Michael Weir', 'Thom Fitzgerald', 'Daniel MacIvor, Joshua Peace, Jack Griffin Mazeika, Carroll Godsman, Jonathan Torrens, Thomas Wayne Harris, Jaime Robertson, Dick Sircom', null, 'A look at the 1950s muscle men''s magazines and the representative industry which were popular supposedly as health and fitness magazines, but were in reality primarily being purchased by the still-underground homosexual community. Chief among the purveyors of this literature was Bob Mizer, who maintained a magazine and developed sexually inexplicit men''s films for over 40 years. Aided by his mother, the two maintained a stable of not so innocent studs.', 'A look at the 1950s muscle men''s magazines and the representative industry which were popular supposedly as health and fitness magazines, but were in reality primarily being purchased by the still-underground homosexual community. Chief among the purveyors of this literature was Bob Mizer, who maintained a magazine and developed sexually inexplicit men''s films for over 40 years. Aided by his mother, the two maintained a stable of not so innocent studs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6glCVk9RuTiGqB12nRDft1NkFj3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:97537'),
  ('775015452721572477', 'Been So Long', 2018, 'Drama, Music, Romance', 'Tinge Krishnan, Nick Justin, Catherine Derry', 'Ché Walker', 'Michaela Coel, Arinzé Kene, Ronkẹ Adékoluẹjo, George MacKay, Joe Dempsie, Luke Norris, Arsher Ali, Ashley Thomas', null, 'A single mother in London''s Camden Town hears music when she meets a handsome stranger with a past. But she''s not sure she''s ready to open her heart.', 'A single mother in London''s Camden Town hears music when she meets a handsome stranger with a past. But she''s not sure she''s ready to open her heart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uh1oyc7pFX6jixPHiOvilVi4szO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:462469'),
