  ('770188491677392501', 'Beer for My Horses', 2008, 'Action, Comedy', 'Michael Salomon, Paul Elliott', 'Toby Keith, Rodney Carrington', 'Toby Keith, Rodney Carrington, Greg Serano, Claire Forlani, Ted Nugent, Barry Corbin, Tom Skerritt, Gina Gershon', 'PG-13', '"Beer for My Horses" tells the story of two best friends that work together as deputies in a small town. The two defy the Sheriff and head off on an outrageous road trip to save the protagonist''s girlfriend from drug lord kidnappers.', '"Beer for My Horses" tells the story of two best friends that work together as deputies in a small town. The two defy the Sheriff and head off on an outrageous road trip to save the protagonist''s girlfriend from drug lord kidnappers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4iN1FHRsI0ml03w6VTU4RG0GlEA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15926'),
  ('763544745128174699', 'Beer League', 2006, 'Comedy', 'Frank Sebastiano, David Phillips', 'Frank Sebastiano, Artie Lange', 'Artie Lange, Ralph Macchio, Cara Buono, Anthony DeSando, Jimmy Palumbo, Joe Lo Truglio, Jerry Minor, Seymour Cassel', 'R', 'An unemployed slacker inspires his softball teammates to improve their game to avoid getting kicked out of the local league.', 'An unemployed slacker inspires his softball teammates to improve their game to avoid getting kicked out of the local league.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yoB3G8yGNLHdbr4TSKZqRp7UJ72.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14137'),
  ('280141698758071665', 'Beerfest', 2006, 'Comedy', 'Frankie DeMarco, Jay Chandrasekhar, Jai James', 'Kevin Heffernan, Erik Stolhanske, Jay Chandrasekhar', 'Erik Stolhanske, Jay Chandrasekhar, Steve Lemme, Paul Soter, M.C. Gainey, Cloris Leachman, Jürgen Prochnow, Will Forte', 'R', 'During a trip to Germany to scatter their grandfather''s ashes, German-American brothers Todd and Jan discover Beerfest, the secret Olympics of downing stout, and want to enter the contest to defend their family''s beer-guzzling honor. Their Old Country cousins sneer at the Yanks'' chances, prompting the siblings to return to America to prepare for a showdown the following year.', 'During a trip to Germany to scatter their grandfather''s ashes, German-American brothers Todd and Jan discover Beerfest, the secret Olympics of downing stout, and want to enter the contest to defend their family''s beer-guzzling honor. Their Old Country cousins sneer at the Yanks'' chances, prompting the siblings to return to America to prepare for a showdown the following year.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5srGbSv3zhEUjXFOZR9qHkgJO6l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9988'),
  ('1096375459129569950', 'Beethoven', 1992, 'Family, Comedy', 'Victor J. Kemper, Brian Levant, Michael C. Gross', 'Amy Holden Jones, John Hughes', 'Charles Grodin, Bonnie Hunt, Dean Jones, Nicholle Tom, Christopher Castile, Sarah Rose Karr, Oliver Platt, Stanley Tucci', 'PG', 'The Newton family live in their comfortable home, but there seems to something missing. This "hole" is filled by a small puppy, who walks into their home and their lives. Beethoven, as he is named, grows into a giant of a dog... a St Bernard. Doctor Varnick, the local vet has a secret and horrible sideline, which requires lots of dogs for experiments. Beethoven is on the bad doctor''s list.', 'The Newton family live in their comfortable home, but there seems to something missing. This "hole" is filled by a small puppy, who walks into their home and their lives. Beethoven, as he is named, grows into a giant of a dog... a St Bernard. Doctor Varnick, the local vet has a secret and horrible sideline, which requires lots of dogs for experiments. Beethoven is on the bad doctor''s list.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aSZYXOmQ9SW27gLdHU02PJQGBMH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11806'),
  ('157353896103593682', 'Beethoven Lives Upstairs', 1992, 'Fantasy, Drama, Science Fiction, Family, TV Movie', 'David Devine', 'Heather Conkie', 'Neil Munro, Illya Woloshyn, Fiona Reid, Paul Soles, Albert Schultz, Sheila McCarthy', 'NR', 'When his mother rents their vacant room to a peculiar composer, Christoph can''t believe his bad luck. But as the abrasive boarder, Ludwig Van Beethoven, begins creating his masterful 9th Symphony, Christoph is won over by the majesty of his music. This lighthearted family drama was awarded the 1993 Emmy for Outstanding Children''s Program.', 'When his mother rents their vacant room to a peculiar composer, Christoph can''t believe his bad luck. But as the abrasive boarder, Ludwig Van Beethoven, begins creating his masterful 9th Symphony, Christoph is won over by the majesty of his music. This lighthearted family drama was awarded the 1993 Emmy for Outstanding Children''s Program.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gHZTKuKst1gHviGjBd63hx8GdiT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54785'),
  ('29487469430376400', 'Beethoven''s 2nd', 1993, 'Family, Comedy', 'Rod Daniel, Bill Butler, David R. Ellis', 'Len Blum', 'Charles Grodin, Bonnie Hunt, Nicholle Tom, Christopher Castile, Sarah Rose Karr, Debi Mazar, Chris Penn, Ashley Hamilton', 'PG', 'Beethoven is back -- and this time, he has a whole brood with him now that he''s met his canine match, Missy, and fathered a family. The only problem is that Missy''s owner, Regina, wants to sell the puppies and tear the clan apart. It''s up to Beethoven and the Newton kids to save the day and keep everyone together.', 'Beethoven is back -- and this time, he has a whole brood with him now that he''s met his canine match, Missy, and fathered a family. The only problem is that Missy''s owner, Regina, wants to sell the puppies and tear the clan apart. It''s up to Beethoven and the Newton kids to save the day and keep everyone together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/biH5hW1BRfEr13oCizuAzpdBf2l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10438'),
  ('528603347255401340', 'Beethoven''s 3rd', 2000, 'Family, Comedy', 'David Mickey Evans, Brent Clark, Donald Paul Pemrick', 'Jeff Schechter', 'Judge Reinhold, Julia Sweeney, Joe Pichler, Michaela Gallo, Mike Ciccolini, Jamie Marsh, Danielle Keaton, Frank Gorshin', 'G', 'Everyone''s favorite St. Bernard returns in this family film about man''s best friend. Richard Newton, his wife Beth and kids Brennan and Sara shove off in their camper for a road trip. Along the way, they gain a new passenger: slobbery Beethoven. The Newtons plan to return Beethoven to his owner -- but not before he turns hero when a pair of thieves enter the picture.', 'Everyone''s favorite St. Bernard returns in this family film about man''s best friend. Richard Newton, his wife Beth and kids Brennan and Sara shove off in their camper for a road trip. Along the way, they gain a new passenger: slobbery Beethoven. The Newtons plan to return Beethoven to his owner -- but not before he turns hero when a pair of thieves enter the picture.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1se0w1IwJj7APH94qwbnmgnHjI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24476'),
  ('1061438240174527059', 'Beethoven''s 4th', 2001, 'Family, Comedy', 'David Mickey Evans, John B. Aronson, Marco Black', 'John Loy', 'Judge Reinhold, Julia Sweeney, Joe Pichler, Michaela Gallo, Kaleigh Krish, Matt McCoy, Veanne Cox, Natalie Elizabeth Marston', 'G', 'The family is pleasantly surprised and puzzled when Beethoven suddenly becomes obedient. Turns out it''s a prince and the pauper scenario, with the real Beethoven now living with a pompous rich family.', 'The family is pleasantly surprised and puzzled when Beethoven suddenly becomes obedient. Turns out it''s a prince and the pauper scenario, with the real Beethoven now living with a pompous rich family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dvw8mJlEjxvBggoiAbiPkXfvbFO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24478'),
  ('852248016892432522', 'Beethoven''s 5th', 2003, 'Family, Comedy', 'Mark Griffiths, Christopher Baffa, Tony Steinberg', 'Cliff Ruby, Elana Lesser', 'Dave Thomas, Faith Ford, Daveigh Chase, Tom Poston, Katherine Helmond, Sammy Kahn, Richard Riehle, Clint Howard', 'G', 'When Sara takes Beethoven to spend summer vacation with wacky Uncle Freddie in an old mining town, the mischievous canine "digs up" the missing clue to a legendary hidden fortune of Rita and Moe Selig. Now everybody wants to be the dog''s best friend as his discovery unleashes a frenzy of treasure hunting among the community''s cast of kooky creatures. With help from Uncle Freddie and Garrett (a friend or maybe more), Sara and Beethoven try to help uncover a secret that has been in the crazy little town for years.', 'When Sara takes Beethoven to spend summer vacation with wacky Uncle Freddie in an old mining town, the mischievous canine "digs up" the missing clue to a legendary hidden fortune of Rita and Moe Selig. Now everybody wants to be the dog''s best friend as his discovery unleashes a frenzy of treasure hunting among the community''s cast of kooky creatures. With help from Uncle Freddie and Garrett (a friend or maybe more), Sara and Beethoven try to help uncover a secret that has been in the crazy little town for years.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mIjzNxaUWsacg4R8rDGl6pJn4C8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24477'),
  ('664244935609837408', 'Beethoven''s Big Break', 2008, 'Family, Comedy', 'Mike Elliott, Stephen Campbell', 'Derek Rydall, Brian Levant', 'Jonathan Silverman, Moisés Arias, Rhea Perlman, Stephen Tobolowsky, Eddie Griffin, Oscar Nuñez, Jennifer Finnigan, Joey Fatone', 'PG', 'Eddie, a struggling animal trainer and single dad suddenly finds himself the personal wrangler for a large and lovable St. Bernard whose fabulous movie "audition" catapults the dog to stardom. However, a trio of unscrupulous ne''er-do-wells have plans to kidnap the famous dog and hold him for ransom.', 'Eddie, a struggling animal trainer and single dad suddenly finds himself the personal wrangler for a large and lovable St. Bernard whose fabulous movie "audition" catapults the dog to stardom. However, a trio of unscrupulous ne''er-do-wells have plans to kidnap the famous dog and hold him for ransom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n6BFaobIdGWQhYI1uiq9gmY4FBq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13955'),
  ('1146331711844242750', 'Beethoven''s Christmas Adventure', 2011, 'Family, Comedy, Fantasy', 'John Putch', null, 'John Cleese, Munro Chambers, Kim Rhodes, Jan Skene, Candace Smith, Robert Picardo, Curtis Armstrong, Kyle Massey', 'PG', 'A Christmas elf accidentally takes off in Santa''s sleigh, crash lands in a small town, and loses the magic toy bag. Beethoven must rescue the elf, recover the bag from greedy crooks, and return the sleigh to Santa in time to save Christmas.', 'A Christmas elf accidentally takes off in Santa''s sleigh, crash lands in a small town, and loses the magic toy bag. Beethoven must rescue the elf, recover the bag from greedy crooks, and return the sleigh to Santa in time to save Christmas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wuBKbz0bZUdTAhU26A62AIlvE5A.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78080'),
  ('228460394696447157', 'Beethoven''s Treasure Tail', 2014, 'Family, Comedy, Adventure, Action', 'Ron Oliver, C. Kim Miles', 'Ron Oliver', 'Jonathan Silverman, Kristy Swanson, Jayne Eastwood, David DeLuise, Bretton Manley, Jeffrey Combs, Alec Mapa, Brian George', 'PG', 'After everyone''s favorite St. Bernard gets fired from a movie, Beethoven begins the long journey home with his trainer, Eddie. On their way, they become stranded in a small coastal town where the beloved canine befriends a young boy who is searching for buried treasure.', 'After everyone''s favorite St. Bernard gets fired from a movie, Beethoven begins the long journey home with his trainer, Eddie. On their way, they become stranded in a small coastal town where the beloved canine befriends a young boy who is searching for buried treasure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iORmyini1D3QwDkuTGYBYomskfc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:295887'),
  ('833244838579321807', 'Beetlejuice', 1988, 'Fantasy, Comedy', 'Tim Burton, Thomas E. Ackerman, Douglas S. Turner', 'Warren Skaaren, Michael McDowell', 'Alec Baldwin, Geena Davis, Winona Ryder, Catherine O''Hara, Jeffrey Jones, Michael Keaton, Glenn Shadix, Sylvia Sidney', 'PG', 'A newly dead New England couple seeks help from a deranged demon exorcist to scare an affluent New York family out of their home.', 'A newly dead New England couple seeks help from a deranged demon exorcist to scare an affluent New York family out of their home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nnl6OWkyPpuMm595hmAxNW3rZFn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4011'),
  ('319813852126871476', 'Beetlejuice Beetlejuice', 2024, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Horror', 'Tim Burton, Adam McClain, Nick Gottschalk', 'Miles Millar, Alfred Gough', 'Michael Keaton, Winona Ryder, Catherine O''Hara, Jenna Ortega, Justin Theroux, Willem Dafoe, Monica Bellucci, Arthur Conti', 'PG-13', 'After a family tragedy, three generations of the Deetz family return home to Winter River. Still haunted by Betelgeuse, Lydia''s life is turned upside down when her teenage daughter, Astrid, accidentally opens the portal to the Afterlife.', 'After a family tragedy, three generations of the Deetz family return home to Winter River. Still haunted by Betelgeuse, Lydia''s life is turned upside down when her teenage daughter, Astrid, accidentally opens the portal to the Afterlife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kKgQzkUCnQmeTPkyIwHly2t6ZFI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:917496'),
  ('543047433547370562', 'Beezel', 2024, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Aaron Fradkin, Keelan Carothers', 'Aaron Fradkin, Victoria Fratz Fradkin', 'Bob Gallagher, LeJon Woods, Nicolas Robin, Caroline Quigley, Victoria Fratz Fradkin, Kimberly Salditt Poulin, Leo Wildhagen, Elise Manning', null, 'Over six tumultuous decades, three unwitting guests of a cursed New England home stumble upon a sinister secret dwelling beneath its floors - an eternal witch with an insatiable thirst for the flesh of the living.', 'Over six tumultuous decades, three unwitting guests of a cursed New England home stumble upon a sinister secret dwelling beneath its floors - an eternal witch with an insatiable thirst for the flesh of the living.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a9gZxhG98LATZJGy1vWssyjVkk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1291594'),
  ('16113231800254131', 'Beezy Bear', 1955, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Jack Hannah', null, 'Clarence Nash, James MacDonald, Bill Thompson', 'NR', 'Beekeeper Donald catches Humphrey the bear raiding his hives. He complains to Ranger Woodlore, who assembles his bears and lectures them. Donald puts up a barbed wire fence, which slows Humphrey down a bit, but doesn''t stop him.', 'Beekeeper Donald catches Humphrey the bear raiding his hives. He complains to Ranger Woodlore, who assembles his bears and lectures them. Donald puts up a barbed wire fence, which slows Humphrey down a bit, but doesn''t stop him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kDjYZ7VCGSLIJm1JvTUBpJYsfK3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54167'),
  ('110819327944294227', 'Befikre', 2016, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'Aditya Chopra', 'Aditya Chopra', 'Ranveer Singh, Vaani Kapoor, Elisa Bachir Bey, Julie Ordon, Marinelly Vaslon, Sandra Rosinsky, Hugo Diego Garcia, Ayesha Raza Mishra', 'PG-13', 'What starts as a crazy one-night stand ends up in a relationship. But Dharam and Shyra fall out of love just as quickly. Where will life take them now?', 'What starts as a crazy one-night stand ends up in a relationship. But Dharam and Shyra fall out of love just as quickly. Where will life take them now?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kFFDdXLqpUuVTieIfAhm2oiuyhU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:399624'),
  ('546542312059174009', 'Before and After', 1996, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Barbet Schroeder, Henry J. Bronchtein, Michael DeCasper', 'Ted Tally', 'Meryl Streep, Liam Neeson, Edward Furlong, Julia Weldon, Alfred Molina, Daniel von Bargen, John Heard, Ann Magnuson', 'PG-13', 'Two parents deal with the effects when their son is accused of murdering his girlfriend.', 'Two parents deal with the effects when their son is accused of murdering his girlfriend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oK8UKDrjFS14OFoihaQPfmmMOyI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43566'),
  ('1065578782658612544', 'Before Dawn', 1989, 'War, Drama', 'Anatoly Lesnikov, Yaropolk Lapshin', 'Gennadi Bokarev', 'Evgeny Mironov, Valeri Ryzhakov, Aleksandr Pankratov-Chyornyy, Oleg Korchikov, Kostiantyn Stepankov, Vyacheslav Kirilichev, Raisa Ryazanova, Igor Varpa', null, 'Wartime, summer 1941. Train carrying criminals gets under enemy fire and crashed. Out of all of the living are only a young lieutenant of the NKVD and two prisoners - the thief and repressed Communist party worker.', 'Wartime, summer 1941. Train carrying criminals gets under enemy fire and crashed. Out of all of the living are only a young lieutenant of the NKVD and two prisoners - the thief and repressed Communist party worker.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/724ITQ4pXrRqF5HrtGlarjWxCgD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:229546'),
  ('1142485467935843908', 'Before Dawn', 2024, 'War, Drama, History', 'Daniel Quinn, Jordon Prince-Wright', 'Jarrad Russell', 'Levi Miller, Travis Jeffery, Ed Oxenbould, Stephen Peacocke, Myles Pollard, Tim Franklin, Jordan Dulieu, Darren Jasper', null, 'After leaving his family''s sheep farm in the Australian outback, a young man joins his countrymen on the western front of World War I with hopes of helping expedite an end to the bloody conflict. But as war rages on, he is forced to grapple with the brutal realities of trench warfare, including a near-constant battle to keep himself alive—without leaving another man behind. Inspired by the real-life diary entries of local ANZACs, the feature film details the untold story of some of Australia’s greatest military victories.', 'After leaving his family''s sheep farm in the Australian outback, a young man joins his countrymen on the western front of World War I with hopes of helping expedite an end to the bloody conflict. But as war rages on, he is forced to grapple with the brutal realities of trench warfare, including a near-constant battle to keep himself alive—without leaving another man behind. Inspired by the real-life diary entries of local ANZACs, the feature film details the untold story of some of Australia’s greatest military victories.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a51x5NWJqdzWbFA58dwRgwfgQDj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:981063'),
  ('971945011210611057', 'Before I Disappear', 2014, 'Drama', 'Shawn Christensen, Daniel Katz', 'Shawn Christensen', 'Shawn Christensen, Fatima Ptacek, Emmy Rossum, Paul Wesley, Ron Perlman, Richard Schiff, Fran Kranz, Hani Avital', null, 'At the lowest point in his life, Richie receives a call from his estranged sister, asking him to pick up his eleven-year-old niece from school. What begins as a simple favor turns into a nighttime odyssey through New York City, where the two form an unexpected bond.', 'At the lowest point in his life, Richie receives a call from his estranged sister, asking him to pick up his eleven-year-old niece from school. What begins as a simple favor turns into a nighttime odyssey through New York City, where the two form an unexpected bond.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fVn4g01k6uEFdOsv7lNcJYvcldR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:253254'),
  ('217662530311656993', 'Before I Fall', 2017, 'Drama, Fantasy', 'Ry Russo-Young, Michael Fimognari, Richard Flower', 'Maria Maggenti', 'Zoey Deutch, Kian Lawley, Halston Sage, Elena Kampouris, Jennifer Beals, Logan Miller, Cynthy Wu, Erica Tremblay', 'PG-13', 'Samantha Kingston has everything. Then, everything changes. After one fateful night, she wakes up with no future at all. Trapped into reliving the same day over and over, she begins to question just how perfect her life really was.', 'Samantha Kingston has everything. Then, everything changes. After one fateful night, she wakes up with no future at all. Trapped into reliving the same day over and over, she begins to question just how perfect her life really was.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eowzonDJMCuNXoJGVkP9Z7oCmiM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:397837'),
  ('742279759460475662', 'Before I Forget', 2007, 'Drama, Romance', 'Jacques Nolot, Josée Deshaies', 'Jacques Nolot', 'Jacques Nolot, Jean-Pol Dubois, Marc Rioufol, Bastien d''Asnières, Gaetano Weysen-Volli, Bruno Moneglia, Rémy Le Fur, Jean Pommier', 'NR', 'A portrait of a 58-year-old man battling his inner demons on the search for self-discovery.', 'A portrait of a 58-year-old man battling his inner demons on the search for self-discovery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kMXzyEC6892IVAOB9KmZDZu444U.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40942'),
  ('1051847841730690834', 'Before I Go to Sleep', 2014, 'Thriller, Mystery', 'Rowan Joffé, Ben Davis, Mark Raggett', 'Rowan Joffé', 'Nicole Kidman, Colin Firth, Mark Strong, Ben Crompton, Anne-Marie Duff, Adam Levy, Gabriel Strong, Flynn MacArthur', 'R', 'A woman wakes up every day, remembering nothing as a result of a traumatic accident in her past. One day, new terrifying truths emerge that force her to question everyone around her.', 'A woman wakes up every day, remembering nothing as a result of a traumatic accident in her past. One day, new terrifying truths emerge that force her to question everyone around her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1sSWpTupVixOanIpZdLGzsKvcZS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:204922'),
  ('707649265708007147', 'Before I Hang', 1940, 'Crime, Horror, Science Fiction', 'Nick Grindé, Benjamin H. Kline, Morris Stoloff', 'Robert Hardy Andrews', 'Boris Karloff, Evelyn Keyes, Bruce Bennett, Don Beddoe, Edward Van Sloan, Ben Taggart, Pedro de Cordoba, Wright Kramer', 'NR', 'Dr. John Garth conducting an innovative medical experiment aimed at prolonging life and combating aging. The experiment takes an unexpected turn, placing the doctor in a confrontation with the ethics of his work and the consequences of his research.', 'Dr. John Garth conducting an innovative medical experiment aimed at prolonging life and combating aging. The experiment takes an unexpected turn, placing the doctor in a confrontation with the ethics of his work and the consequences of his research.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/geAC0ve6IKQCLXdB0OESKAFaJJi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26923'),
  ('726457768906945095', 'Before I Self Destruct', 2009, 'Action, Drama', '50 Cent, Robert D. Eras, Stephen Franciosa Jr.', '50 Cent', '50 Cent, Clifton Powell, Ira Berkowitz, Gabriel Ellis, Los Jones, Omar Knight, O.G. Mack McLean, Piper', null, 'A coming of age story about an inner-city youth raised by a hardworking single mother. When his dream of becoming a basketball player fails to materialize, he finds himself employed in a supermarket. After his mother is tragically gunned down, Clarence (played by Jackson) is consumed by revenge and takes up a life of crime in order to support his younger brother.', 'A coming of age story about an inner-city youth raised by a hardworking single mother. When his dream of becoming a basketball player fails to materialize, he finds himself employed in a supermarket. After his mother is tragically gunned down, Clarence (played by Jackson) is consumed by revenge and takes up a life of crime in order to support his younger brother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z16xMsUlG4Hb6ruVgGOY79nTuAA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25467'),
  ('265159417438696731', 'Before I Wake', 2016, 'Drama, Fantasy, Horror, Thriller', 'Mike Flanagan, Michael Fimognari', 'Mike Flanagan, Jeff Howard', 'Kate Bosworth, Jacob Tremblay, Thomas Jane, Annabeth Gish, Lance E. Nichols, Scottie Thompson, Dash Mihok, Jay Karnes', 'PG-13', 'An orphaned child''s dreams—and nightmares—manifest physically as he sleeps.', 'An orphaned child''s dreams—and nightmares—manifest physically as he sleeps.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sI9neTbF3ECdpf2MpC88EMGJH13.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:301804'),
  ('568202109732939159', 'Before Midnight', 2013, 'Romance, Drama', 'Christos Voudouris, Richard Linklater, Christos Nikou', 'Richard Linklater, Julie Delpy, Ethan Hawke', 'Ethan Hawke, Julie Delpy, Seamus Davey-Fitzpatrick, Jennifer Prior, Charlotte Prior, Xenia Kalogeropoulou, Walter Lassally, Ariane Labed', 'R', 'It has been nine years since we last met Jesse and Celine, the French-American couple who once met on a train in Vienna. They now live in Paris with twin daughters but have spent a summer in Greece at the invitation of an author colleague of Jesse''s. When the vacation is over and Jesse must send his teenage son off to the States, he begins to question his life decisions, and his relationship with Celine is at risk.', 'It has been nine years since we last met Jesse and Celine, the French-American couple who once met on a train in Vienna. They now live in Paris with twin daughters but have spent a summer in Greece at the invitation of an author colleague of Jesse''s. When the vacation is over and Jesse must send his teenage son off to the States, he begins to question his life decisions, and his relationship with Celine is at risk.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qbGKJmNUroDz75kh5Oafoall89e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:132344'),
  ('502395493421695678', 'Before Monday', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Massimo Cappelli, Marcello Montarsi', 'Massimo Cappelli, Fabio Troiano, Giuseppe Lo Console', 'Vincenzo Salemme, Fabio Troiano, Andrea Di Maria, Martina Stella, Sandra Milo, Sergio Múñiz, Antonio Guerriero, Roberta Fiore', null, 'After their cars collide, a penniless actor makes a deal with a criminal tycoon to deliver a giant Easter egg from Turin to Naples.', 'After their cars collide, a penniless actor makes a deal with a criminal tycoon to deliver a giant Easter egg from Turin to Naples.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bYu9kaVaXMSBGjTuCiqDeSC9lhG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:418429'),
  ('834034571361202824', 'Before My Eyes', 1989, 'Documentary', 'Mani Kaul', null, null, null, 'A ''filmscape'' on the Kashmir valley.', 'A ''filmscape'' on the Kashmir valley.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a6767qLJ5gfxWn0HbQFeOzTwoct.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:363506'),
  ('852583142184276311', 'Before Night Falls', 2000, 'Drama', 'Xavier Grobet, Julian Schnabel, Guillermo Rosas', 'Cunningham O''Keefe, Lázaro Gómez Carriles, Julian Schnabel', 'Javier Bardem, Olivier Martinez, Johnny Depp, Andrea Di Stefano, Santiago Magill, John Ortiz, Héctor Babenco, Francisco Gattorno', 'R', 'Spanning several decades, this powerful biopic offers a glimpse into the life of famed Cuban poet and novelist Reinaldo Arenas, an artist who was vilified for his homosexuality in Fidel Castro''s Cuba.', 'Spanning several decades, this powerful biopic offers a glimpse into the life of famed Cuban poet and novelist Reinaldo Arenas, an artist who was vilified for his homosexuality in Fidel Castro''s Cuba.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kb2dqj73cfmt6qHAh1ySIlVm6v0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5001'),
  ('1092722990831105352', 'Before Stonewall', 1984, 'Documentary, History', 'Greta Schiller, Robert Rosenberg', null, 'Rita Mae Brown, Red Jordan Arobateau, Ann Bannon, Lisa Ben, Allen Ginsberg, Martin Duberman', null, 'New York City''s Stonewall Inn is regarded by many as the site of gay and lesbian liberation since it was at this bar that drag queens fought back against police June 27-28, 1969. This documentary uses extensive archival film, movie clips and personal recollections to construct an audiovisual history of the gay community before the Stonewall riots.', 'New York City''s Stonewall Inn is regarded by many as the site of gay and lesbian liberation since it was at this bar that drag queens fought back against police June 27-28, 1969. This documentary uses extensive archival film, movie clips and personal recollections to construct an audiovisual history of the gay community before the Stonewall riots.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5LQNv5TQHgD5A5ZdlNIUibiM04S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32728'),
  ('410189189140462918', 'Before Summer Ends', 2017, 'Documentary', 'Maryam Goormaghtigh', null, null, null, 'After five years studying in Paris, Arash has not adjusted to life there and has decided to return to Iran to live. Hoping to change his mind, his two friends Hossein and Ashkan convince him to take a last trip through France.', 'After five years studying in Paris, Arash has not adjusted to life there and has decided to return to Iran to live. Hoping to change his mind, his two friends Hossein and Ashkan convince him to take a last trip through France.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5Qm9hkZmC5O2KA7336XG8Q0uclw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:455265'),
  ('1028306766892286022', 'Before Sunrise', 1995, 'Drama, Romance', 'Richard Linklater, Lee Daniel', 'Richard Linklater, Kim Krizan', 'Ethan Hawke, Julie Delpy, Andrea Eckert, Hanno Pöschl, Karl Bruckschwaiger, Tex Rubinowitz, Erni Mangold, Dominik Castell', 'R', 'An unexpected meeting on a train leads two travelers to spend an evening wandering through Vienna. As the night unfolds, they share stories and conversations about life and love, exploring new ideas while a quiet intimacy grows between them, knowing it may be their only night together.', 'An unexpected meeting on a train leads two travelers to spend an evening wandering through Vienna. As the night unfolds, they share stories and conversations about life and love, exploring new ideas while a quiet intimacy grows between them, knowing it may be their only night together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kf1Jb1c2JAOqjuzA3H4oDM263uB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76'),
  ('348562832226661471', 'Before the Burn', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Fernando Colomo, Juan Hernández, Antonello Novellino', 'Fernando Colomo', 'Salva Reina, Manuela Velasco, Maggie Civantos, Joaquín Núñez, Manuel Manquiña, Andreu Castro, María Alfonsa Rosso, Juan Rueda', 'R', 'Quique is a successful 30-year-old composer. He does not have the necessary funds to support a broken family. With a sister who is in prison for trafficking drugs and an elderly mother suffering from Alzheimer''s, he decides to reconcile his activity with a new job: Drug dealer.', 'Quique is a successful 30-year-old composer. He does not have the necessary funds to support a broken family. With a sister who is in prison for trafficking drugs and an elderly mother suffering from Alzheimer''s, he decides to reconcile his activity with a new job: Drug dealer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oAIUoNCioh274HPwOqoBAC73RFR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:586346'),
  ('1039472695868847690', 'Before the Deluge', 1954, 'Drama', 'André Cayatte, Jean Bourgoin, Tony Aboyantz', 'André Cayatte, Charles Spaak', 'Antoine Balpêtré, Paul Bisciglia, Bernard Blier, Marina Vlady, Jacques Chabassol, Clément Thierry, Jacques Fayet, Roger Coggio', null, 'The title of this French "reality" drama, which translates to Before the Deluge, is a play on Louis XVI''s famous prognostication, "Apres moi, le deluge." Set in 1950, the film concentrates on five Parisian adolescents. Certain that the next war will herald the apocalypse, the youngster make plans to run off to a desert island and set up a new society. This, however, will require money, which is why the boys decide to pull off a "necessary" robbery. Idealism collapses in the face of cold reality, as the five youths suffer from the consequences of their actions. Avant le Deluge was one of a group of films cowritten by director Andre Cayatte and Charles Spaak which endeavored to explore the touchy social issues of the day: others in the Cayatte-Spaak canon include the euthanasia-themed Justice est Faite and the capital-punishment tract Nous sommes tous des assassins.', 'The title of this French "reality" drama, which translates to Before the Deluge, is a play on Louis XVI''s famous prognostication, "Apres moi, le deluge." Set in 1950, the film concentrates on five Parisian adolescents. Certain that the next war will herald the apocalypse, the youngster make plans to run off to a desert island and set up a new society. This, however, will require money, which is why the boys decide to pull off a "necessary" robbery. Idealism collapses in the face of cold reality, as the five youths suffer from the consequences of their actions. Avant le Deluge was one of a group of films cowritten by director Andre Cayatte and Charles Spaak which endeavored to explore the touchy social issues of the day: others in the Cayatte-Spaak canon include the euthanasia-themed Justice est Faite and the capital-punishment tract Nous sommes tous des assassins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1IpTRtLa0HhtsIKsxQMPt2g5VzN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:199431'),
  ('988336600993643374', 'Before the Devil Knows You''re Dead', 2007, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Sidney Lumet, Ron Fortunato, John Silvestri', 'Kelly Masterson', 'Philip Seymour Hoffman, Ethan Hawke, Albert Finney, Marisa Tomei, Aleksa Palladino, Michael Shannon, Amy Ryan, Sarah Livingston', 'R', 'When two brothers organize the robbery of their parents'' jewelry store, the job goes horribly wrong, triggering a series of events that send them and their family hurtling towards a shattering climax.', 'When two brothers organize the robbery of their parents'' jewelry store, the job goes horribly wrong, triggering a series of events that send them and their family hurtling towards a shattering climax.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h4QXi4Ysuc3zICiK9jHxjCAK9Oh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:7972'),
  ('974151975465200800', 'Before the Fall', 2004, 'Drama', 'Dennis Gansel, Torsten Breuer', 'Maggie Peren, Dennis Gansel', 'Max Riemelt, Tom Schilling, Devid Striesow, Joachim Bißmeier, Justus von Dohnányi, Michael Schenk, Florian Stetter, Alexander Held', 'NR', 'In 1942, Friedrich Weimer''s boxing skills get him an appointment to a National Political Academy (NaPolA) – high schools that produce Nazi elite. Over his father''s objections, Friedrich enrolls. During his year in seventh column, Friedrich encounters hazing, cruelty, death, and the Nazi code. His friendship with Albrecht, the ascetic son of the area''s governor, is central to this education.', 'In 1942, Friedrich Weimer''s boxing skills get him an appointment to a National Political Academy (NaPolA) – high schools that produce Nazi elite. Over his father''s objections, Friedrich enrolls. During his year in seventh column, Friedrich encounters hazing, cruelty, death, and the Nazi code. His friendship with Albrecht, the ascetic son of the area''s governor, is central to this education.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dhTTscZkiQefuq6OeYp9rnvhCBW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9393'),
  ('967883794447739369', 'Before the Fall', 2008, 'Crime, Science Fiction', 'F. Javier Gutiérrez, Miguel Ángel Mora', 'F. Javier Gutiérrez, Juan Velarde', 'Mariana Cordero, Eduard Fernández, Elvira de Armiñán, Víctor Clavijo, Nani Jiménez, Juan Carlos Sánchez, Antonio Dechent', null, 'A meteorite is about to collide with Earth and the planet is gripped by despair and chaos. The inhabitants of the little town of Laguna listen to the news in terror. Ale decides to spend his last days shut away, getting drunk and listening to his favorite music. But his plans change when he is forced to help his mother and protect his brother’s four children. Then an ambiguous, disturbing stranger appears.', 'A meteorite is about to collide with Earth and the planet is gripped by despair and chaos. The inhabitants of the little town of Laguna listen to the news in terror. Ale decides to spend his last days shut away, getting drunk and listening to his favorite music. But his plans change when he is forced to help his mother and protect his brother’s four children. Then an ambiguous, disturbing stranger appears.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2yyStP1DnkhTs9mlvuG1wFFsW8V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25922'),
  ('601914163145882752', 'Before the Fire', 2020, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Drew Bienemann, Charlie Buhler', 'Jenna Lyng Adams', 'Jenna Lyng Adams, Jackson Davis, Ryan Vigilant, Charles Hubbell, Lisa Goodman, M.J. Karmi', null, 'Deep in the throes of a global pandemic, up and coming TV star, Ava Boone, is forced to flee the mounting chaos in Los Angeles and return to her rural hometown. But as she struggles to acclimate to a way of life she left behind long ago, her homecoming attracts a dangerous figure from her past – threatening both her and the family that serves as her only sanctuary.', 'Deep in the throes of a global pandemic, up and coming TV star, Ava Boone, is forced to flee the mounting chaos in Los Angeles and return to her rural hometown. But as she struggles to acclimate to a way of life she left behind long ago, her homecoming attracts a dangerous figure from her past – threatening both her and the family that serves as her only sanctuary.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bAwtbmCzhFwKf2wN6QQH301ylbO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:671145'),
  ('434608606627155586', 'Before the Flood', 2016, 'Documentary', 'Fisher Stevens, Antonio Rossi', 'Mark Monroe', 'Leonardo DiCaprio, Bill Clinton, John Kerry, Barack Obama, Elon Musk, Pope Francis, Ban Ki-moon, Alejandro González Iñárritu', 'PG', 'A look at how climate change affects our environment and what society can do to prevent the demise of endangered species, ecosystems, and native communities across the planet.', 'A look at how climate change affects our environment and what society can do to prevent the demise of endangered species, ecosystems, and native communities across the planet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u0EfH2zsp6rLOvEKVvWGgzGRQn3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:410718'),
  ('629175070062787875', 'Before the Night', 2018, 'Drama, Crime', 'Alessandro Stellari, Gherardo Gossi, Luciano Federici', null, 'Fabrizio Gifuni, Dario Aita, Lorenza Indovina, Carlo Calderone, Federico Brugnone, Simone Corbisiero, Davide Giordano, David Coco', null, 'The life and times of Pippo Fava, a Sicilian journalist who fought the Mafia through his local newspaper in the ''70s and early ''80s, meeting an untimely end.', 'The life and times of Pippo Fava, a Sicilian journalist who fought the Mafia through his local newspaper in the ''70s and early ''80s, meeting an untimely end.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sYQosk7M4maF2xjzt5O20Y1tS17.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:525722'),
  ('1140978813291797681', 'Before the Rain', 1994, 'Drama, War', 'Manuel Teran, Milcho Manchevski, Vanja Aljinovic', 'Milcho Manchevski', 'Katrin Cartlidge, Rade Šerbedžija, Grégoire Colin, Labina Mitevska, Phyllida Law, Silvija Stojanovska, Jay Villiers, Josif Josifovski', 'NR', 'The circularity of violence seen in a story that circles on itself. In Macedonia, during the war in Bosnia, Christians hunt an ethnic Albanian girl who may have murdered one of their own. A young monk who''s taken a vow of silence offers her protection. In London, a photographic editor who''s pregnant needs to talk it out with her estranged husband and chooses a toney restaurant.', 'The circularity of violence seen in a story that circles on itself. In Macedonia, during the war in Bosnia, Christians hunt an ethnic Albanian girl who may have murdered one of their own. A young monk who''s taken a vow of silence offers her protection. In London, a photographic editor who''s pregnant needs to talk it out with her estranged husband and chooses a toney restaurant.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sAVSVFonnNkup5xnlxDkuRrmI2N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19155'),
  ('325601062943194596', 'Before the Revolution', 1964, 'Romance, Drama', 'Bernardo Bertolucci, Aldo Scavarda, Gianni Amico', 'Gianni Amico', 'Adriana Asti, Francesco Barilli, Allen Midgette, Morando Morandini, Cristina Pariset, Cecrope Barilli, Evelina Alpi, Gianni Amico', null, 'The study of a youth on the edge of adulthood and his aunt, ten years older. Fabrizio is passionate, idealistic, influenced by Cesare, a teacher and Marxist, engaged to the lovely but bourgeois Clelia, and stung by the drowning of his mercurial friend Agostino, a possible suicide. Gina is herself a bundle of nervous energy, alternately sweet, seductive, poetic, distracted, and unhinged. They begin a love affair after Agostino''s funeral, then Gina confuses Fabrizio by sleeping with a stranger. Their visits to Cesare and then to Puck, one of Gina''s older friends, a landowner losing his land, dramatize contrasting images of Italy''s future. Their own futures are bleak.', 'The study of a youth on the edge of adulthood and his aunt, ten years older. Fabrizio is passionate, idealistic, influenced by Cesare, a teacher and Marxist, engaged to the lovely but bourgeois Clelia, and stung by the drowning of his mercurial friend Agostino, a possible suicide. Gina is herself a bundle of nervous energy, alternately sweet, seductive, poetic, distracted, and unhinged. They begin a love affair after Agostino''s funeral, then Gina confuses Fabrizio by sleeping with a stranger. Their visits to Cesare and then to Puck, one of Gina''s older friends, a landowner losing his land, dramatize contrasting images of Italy''s future. Their own futures are bleak.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eonuTTUGbxVurkBgC1KLJ00QIvR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42788'),
  ('1141836520539358153', 'Before the Rooster Crows', 2016, 'Drama', 'Arí Maniel Cruz, Julio César Torres, Santiago ''Chago'' Benet', 'Kisha Tikina Burgos', 'Cordelia González, Miranda Purcell, Kisha Tikina Burgos, José Eugenio Hernández, Isadora Lee Cintrón, Pablo Alicea, Sylvia Bofill, Laura Isabel Cabrera', null, 'Teenager Carmín lives in a mountainous village in the center of Puerto Rico with her tough and conservative grandmother. Her mother left for the US without her. The arrival of her father, after long years in prison, eases Carmín’s profound sadness. The relationship with him, however, brings its own ambiguousness and complexities and as Carmín moves into womanhood this causes great confusion, mostly for her.', 'Teenager Carmín lives in a mountainous village in the center of Puerto Rico with her tough and conservative grandmother. Her mother left for the US without her. The arrival of her father, after long years in prison, eases Carmín’s profound sadness. The relationship with him, however, brings its own ambiguousness and complexities and as Carmín moves into womanhood this causes great confusion, mostly for her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6xaqXu87NZIJi16lkr7Fu8c8MzS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:396597'),
  ('598357948490129688', 'Before the Winter Chill', 2013, 'Drama', 'Denis Lenoir, Philippe Claudel', 'Philippe Claudel', 'Daniel Auteuil, Kristin Scott Thomas, Leïla Bekhti, Richard Berry, Vicky Krieps, Jérôme Varanfrain, Laure Killing, Anne Metzler', null, 'They are the perfect French haute bourgeois couple: Paul is a respected surgeon and Lucie cooks and gardens exquisitely. But now, in the autumn of his life, Paul can’t resist the lure of an ambiguous and dangerous relationship with a mysterious young woman. Might there be something sinister behind the roses delivered to his office and the “chance” meetings?', 'They are the perfect French haute bourgeois couple: Paul is a respected surgeon and Lucie cooks and gardens exquisitely. But now, in the autumn of his life, Paul can’t resist the lure of an ambiguous and dangerous relationship with a mysterious young woman. Might there be something sinister behind the roses delivered to his office and the “chance” meetings?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/11wMh1PgDuR2F200f7hgbr37N7p.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:218993'),
  ('1004602189188691867', 'Before Tonight Is Over', 1966, 'Drama', 'Peter Solan, Vincent Rosinec, Eva Štefankovičová', 'Tibor Vichta', 'Jana Gýrová, Jitka Zelenohorská, Stano Dančiak, Marián Labuda, Július Pántik, Valentina Thielová, Vladimír Durdík, Erna Suchánová', null, 'Two female clerks using up their savings to enjoy a few days of carefree life, two plumbers looking for an erotic adventure, a building contractor determined to drink away all wages of his workers and a former major who became an alcoholic due to political persecution — these people meet in a ski resort bar somewhere in the High Tatras. During one night they gradually reveal their unfulfilled dreams, illusions and disappointments of ”average" people of those times.', 'Two female clerks using up their savings to enjoy a few days of carefree life, two plumbers looking for an erotic adventure, a building contractor determined to drink away all wages of his workers and a former major who became an alcoholic due to political persecution — these people meet in a ski resort bar somewhere in the High Tatras. During one night they gradually reveal their unfulfilled dreams, illusions and disappointments of ”average" people of those times.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wGjtg404bZeopsDUwm9qTUYt4vz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46214'),
  ('213474861455244459', 'Before We Collapse', 2023, 'Drama, Comedy, Family', 'Jean-Louis Vialard, Anaïs Ascaride, Alice Zeniter', 'Alice Zeniter, Benoît Zeniter', 'Niels Schneider, Ariane Labed, Souheila Yacoub, Myriem Akheddiou, Sephora Pondi, Elsa Guedj, Ana Blagojević, Younès Boucif', null, 'In a dystopia Paris, this is about a campaign manager named Tristan who is knocked sideways when he receives an anonymous letter containing a positive pregnancy test. Potentially suffering from a fatal and incurable genetic illness, Tristan becomes obsessed with the idea of finding the woman who sent him this test. He decides to carry out an investigation, risking his love life and his career in the process.', 'In a dystopia Paris, this is about a campaign manager named Tristan who is knocked sideways when he receives an anonymous letter containing a positive pregnancy test. Potentially suffering from a fatal and incurable genetic illness, Tristan becomes obsessed with the idea of finding the woman who sent him this test. He decides to carry out an investigation, risking his love life and his career in the process.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z2TiCcccQNM1b6BQNuvT7dpAWyP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:925100'),
  ('226245666124797663', 'Before We Go', 2014, 'Romance, Drama, Comedy', 'Chris Evans, John Guleserian, Shahrzad ''Sheri'' Davani', 'Ronald Bass, Jen Smolka, Chris Shafer', 'Chris Evans, Alice Eve, Emma Fitzpatrick, John Cullum, Mark Kassen, Elijah Moreland, Daniel Spink, Alan Cox', 'PG-13', 'A chance encounter between two strangers in Grand Central Terminal sparks a life-changing, nighttime sojourn through New York City. They grow into each other''s most trusted confidants when an evening of unexpected adventure forces them to confront their fears and take control of their lives.', 'A chance encounter between two strangers in Grand Central Terminal sparks a life-changing, nighttime sojourn through New York City. They grow into each other''s most trusted confidants when an evening of unexpected adventure forces them to confront their fears and take control of their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qBnkNKjbJV0E8GvEPidBS1nIRWD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:283350'),
  ('105443039481163541', 'Before We Say Goodbye', 2022, 'Romance, Drama', 'Massimo Cappelli, Claudio Zamarion', 'Massimo Cappelli, Agostino Di Febo', 'Riccardo Maria Manera, Jenny De Nucci, Marina Suma, Mirko Frezza, Pino Quartullo, Loris Loddi, Tiziana Foschi, Rodolfo Santi', null, 'Andrea (Riccardo Maria Manera) is a young man who lives with the surprises and hardships of life. He lives with his best friend, seeks to complete his studies and has an ex-girlfriend who plays with him like cat and mouse. When he discovers that he has an incurable disease, the world collapses on him. Can an illness change a person''s life... for the better? Thanks to Giulia (Jenny De Nucci), Andrea will understand that the time has come to assume what remains of her own existence.', 'Andrea (Riccardo Maria Manera) is a young man who lives with the surprises and hardships of life. He lives with his best friend, seeks to complete his studies and has an ex-girlfriend who plays with him like cat and mouse. When he discovers that he has an incurable disease, the world collapses on him. Can an illness change a person''s life... for the better? Thanks to Giulia (Jenny De Nucci), Andrea will understand that the time has come to assume what remains of her own existence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/toOBdZdacil25u7TmtdolyODZdN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1045341'),
  ('871659131154349198', 'Before We Vanish', 2017, 'Science Fiction, Drama, Thriller', 'Kiyoshi Kurosawa, Akiko Ashizawa, Jun Yokoishi', 'Kiyoshi Kurosawa, Sachiko Tanaka', 'Masami Nagasawa, Ryuhei Matsuda, Mahiro Takasugi, Yuri Tsunematsu, Hiroki Hasegawa, Atsuko Maeda, Shinnosuke Mitsushima, Masahiro Higashide', null, 'Narumi is on bad terms with her husband, Shinji, when, one day, Shinji goes missing. He comes back a couple of days later, but he seems like a totally different person, and he is now gentle and tender. He goes for a walk every day. Meanwhile, journalist Sakurai covers the story of a family that was brutally murdered, when an unexplained phenomenon takes place.', 'Narumi is on bad terms with her husband, Shinji, when, one day, Shinji goes missing. He comes back a couple of days later, but he seems like a totally different person, and he is now gentle and tender. He goes for a walk every day. Meanwhile, journalist Sakurai covers the story of a family that was brutally murdered, when an unexplained phenomenon takes place.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hU6akn1JzH0tl4bHlVfJS7rxeao.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:446164'),
  ('287175778990443551', 'Before What Comes After', 2025, 'Drama', 'Costa-Gavras, Nathalie Durand, Marie Doller', 'Costa-Gavras', 'Denis Podalydès, Kad Merad, Marilyne Canto, Ángela Molina, Charlotte Rampling, Hiam Abbass, Karin Viard, Agathe Bonitzer', null, 'In a kind of philosophical dialogue, Doctor Augustin Masset and renowned writer Fabrice Toussaint discuss life and death… A whirlwind of encounters in which the doctor is the guide and the writer, his passenger, led to confront his own fears and anxieties.', 'In a kind of philosophical dialogue, Doctor Augustin Masset and renowned writer Fabrice Toussaint discuss life and death… A whirlwind of encounters in which the doctor is the guide and the writer, his passenger, led to confront his own fears and anxieties.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k50NfXJnjIQL9y2K9zxcNYyUiXX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1271981'),
  ('1048300546959930363', 'Before Winter Comes', 1969, 'Drama, Comedy', 'J. Lee Thompson, Gilbert Taylor, Ariel Levy', 'Andrew Sinclair', 'David Niven, Chaim Topol, Anna Karina, John Hurt, Anthony Quayle, Ori Levy, John Collin, Karl Stepanek', null, 'Drama/Comedy set in a refugee camp in occupied Austria after World War II. A shrewd multi-lingual interpreter who mediates between Russian and British military brass enters into a friendly rivalry with British Major Giles Burnside, who is in charge of assigning the displaced persons into either the American or Russian zones.', 'Drama/Comedy set in a refugee camp in occupied Austria after World War II. A shrewd multi-lingual interpreter who mediates between Russian and British military brass enters into a friendly rivalry with British Major Giles Burnside, who is in charge of assigning the displaced persons into either the American or Russian zones.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a6gHde5nLjNnGKjKt4N25qREU0b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:204092'),
  ('963566649590651582', 'Before Words', 2013, 'Romance', 'Diego Carvalho Sá, Alice Andrade Drummond, Leo Grego', 'Diego Carvalho Sá', 'Henrique Larré, Maurício Destri, Marcella Arnulf, Layla Ruiz', null, 'Fragments of the approximation between two boys shows the naive curiosity of Celio for Dario, the assumption of Sofia by this approximation and the previous interest of Dario for Celio.', 'Fragments of the approximation between two boys shows the naive curiosity of Celio for Dario, the assumption of Sofia by this approximation and the previous interest of Dario for Celio.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tQMc2DM8hH84HB2MyoAZpvAwxhN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:346638'),
  ('984491295631406094', 'Before You Say ''I Do''', 2009, 'Comedy, Romance, Fantasy, TV Movie', 'Paul Fox, David A. Makin', 'Elena Krupp', 'David Sutcliffe, Jennifer Westfeldt, Lauren Holly, Brad Borbridge, Jeff Roop, John Boylan, Brandon Firla, Roger Dunn', null, 'George Murray''s fiancée Jane Gardner gets cold feet after accepting his ring, terrorized by her first wedding with Doug, who cheated that very day with their wedding coordinator. George wishes he could have met her before she married her ex. After a car crash, George finds himself 10 years in the past, just a few days before the wedding. George has a chance to rewrite history, and stop her from making a terrible mistake. Hopefully, he''ll save his future marriage and not ruin the rest of his life.', 'George Murray''s fiancée Jane Gardner gets cold feet after accepting his ring, terrorized by her first wedding with Doug, who cheated that very day with their wedding coordinator. George wishes he could have met her before she married her ex. After a car crash, George finds himself 10 years in the past, just a few days before the wedding. George has a chance to rewrite history, and stop her from making a terrible mistake. Hopefully, he''ll save his future marriage and not ruin the rest of his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9fOpao3RE7bHNcuZG9MjBSRSs02.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48281'),
  ('953975781300860455', 'Before Your Eyes', 2009, 'Drama, Action, Thriller', 'Miraz Bezar, Isabelle Casez', 'Miraz Bezar', 'Senay Orak, Muhammed Al, Hakan Karsak, Suzan Ilir, Berîvan Ayaz, Fahriye Çelik, Alişan Önlü, Berîvan Eminoglu', null, 'After their parents are murdered, two young Kurdish children are forced to live on the street.', 'After their parents are murdered, two young Kurdish children are forced to live on the street.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7MlNMeqvi27EhAcmdk5q7diS1Cg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78432'),
  ('506788605514232923', 'Befriending the Grouch', 2019, 'Comedy, TV Movie', 'Gerhard Schirlo, Marco Petry', 'Marco Petry', 'Dieter Hallervorden, Alwara Höfels, Julius Göze, Latisha Kohrs, Lior Kudrjawizki, Ursela Monn, Michael Hanemann, Axel Stein', null, 'Olav Hintz, a retired teacher who loves only himself, needs care as he sits in a wheelchair. The nurse, the single parent Trixi has several jobs to complete and gives the care to her 3 children. Chaos is on.', 'Olav Hintz, a retired teacher who loves only himself, needs care as he sits in a wheelchair. The nurse, the single parent Trixi has several jobs to complete and gives the care to her 3 children. Chaos is on.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lYTZWPXZoTHqx14S0L595mrzBKY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:601490'),
  ('279436333323280470', 'Beggars of Life', 1928, 'Adventure, Drama, Crime', 'William A. Wellman', null, 'Wallace Beery, Louise Brooks, Richard Arlen, Blue Washington, Kewpie Morgan, Andy Clark, Mike Donlin, Roscoe Karns', 'NR', 'After killing her treacherous step-father, a girl tries to escape the country with a young vagabond. She dresses as a boy, they hop freight trains, quarrel with a group of hobos, and steal a car in their attempt to escape the police, and reach Canada.', 'After killing her treacherous step-father, a girl tries to escape the country with a young vagabond. She dresses as a boy, they hop freight trains, quarrel with a group of hobos, and steal a car in their attempt to escape the police, and reach Canada.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tUqClcPiLoMDExiC0nnQ6c0Zjku.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85697'),
  ('787650540712401598', 'Begin Again', 2014, 'Comedy, Music, Romance, Drama', 'John Carney, Yaron Orbach, J. Alex Finch', 'John Carney', 'Mark Ruffalo, Keira Knightley, Adam Levine, Hailee Steinfeld, Catherine Keener, James Corden, Yasiin Bey, Aya Cash', 'R', 'Gretta, a budding songwriter, finds herself alone after her boyfriend Dave ditches her. Her life gains purpose when Dan, a record label executive, notices her talent.', 'Gretta, a budding songwriter, finds herself alone after her boyfriend Dave ditches her. Her life gains purpose when Dan, a record label executive, notices her talent.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qx4HXHXt528hS4rwePZbZo20xqZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:198277'),
  ('530723902466056324', 'Beginners', 2011, 'Drama, Romance, Comedy', 'Mike Mills, Kasper Tuxen, Rod Smith', 'Mike Mills', 'Ewan McGregor, Christopher Plummer, Mélanie Laurent, Goran Višnjić, Kai Lennox, Mary Page Keller, Keegan Boos, China Shavers', 'R', 'Oliver meets the irreverent and unpredictable Anna only months after his father Hal Fields has passed away. This new love floods Oliver with memories of his father, who, following the death of his wife of 44 years, came out of the closet at age 75 to live a full, energized, and wonderfully tumultuous gay life – which included a younger boyfriend.', 'Oliver meets the irreverent and unpredictable Anna only months after his father Hal Fields has passed away. This new love floods Oliver with memories of his father, who, following the death of his wife of 44 years, came out of the closet at age 75 to live a full, energized, and wonderfully tumultuous gay life – which included a younger boyfriend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mAquHAmoBgZ1omUNdNsnGVNX74c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55347'),
  ('455942544522041242', 'Beginning', 1967, 'War, Documentary, History', 'Artavazd Peleshian, Elizbar Karavayev', null, 'Felix Dzerzhinsky, Vladimir Lenin, Joseph Stalin, Kliment Voroshilov, Grigoriy Ordzhonikidze', null, 'Philosophical essay about the October Revolution of 1917 in Russia, its influence on the destiny of the world in the 20th century.', 'Philosophical essay about the October Revolution of 1917 in Russia, its influence on the destiny of the world in the 20th century.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vcjKW68vQy2Sm5Q5C7MINKQpCF1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:183718'),
  ('572223145011755963', 'Beginning', 2020, 'Drama', 'Dea Kulumbegashvili, Arseni Khachaturan, Anna Mariakhina', 'Dea Kulumbegashvili, Rati Oneli', 'Ia Sukhitashvili, Rati Oneli, Kakha Kintsurashvili, Saba Gogichaishvil, Giorgi Tsereteli, Ia Kokiashvili, Mari Kopchenovi', 'NR', 'In a sleepy provincial town, a Jehovah’s Witness community is under attack from an extremist group. In the midst of this conflict is Yana, the wife of the community leader, whose familiar world is slowly crumbling around her. Meanwhile, a detective intrudes on her home with devastating consequences.', 'In a sleepy provincial town, a Jehovah’s Witness community is under attack from an extremist group. In the midst of this conflict is Yana, the wife of the community leader, whose familiar world is slowly crumbling around her. Meanwhile, a detective intrudes on her home with devastating consequences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u1kgNoUSgC5bwdfIFhU8t860L1T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:712167'),
  ('400356497744157663', 'Beginning of an Unknown Era', 1967, 'War, Drama', 'Larisa Shepitko, Andrey Smirnov, Genrikh Gabay', 'Ilya Suslov, Mikhail Suslov, Boris Yermolayev', 'Leonid Kulagin, Sergei Volf, Nikolai Gubenko, Georgi Burkov, Igor Klass, Yevgeni Goryunov, Sergei Gorbatyuk, Ivan Turchenkov', null, 'Two young directors adapted the short stories of two Russian authors whose works had been banned for decades, and so their film ended up in the censor’s vault as well – for twenty years. Both tales look back to the post-revolutionary era: ''Angel'' (Olesha) speaks tragically of the brutality and destruction of the time, and ''The Homeland of Electricity'' (Platonov) captures its haunting grotesquery.', 'Two young directors adapted the short stories of two Russian authors whose works had been banned for decades, and so their film ended up in the censor’s vault as well – for twenty years. Both tales look back to the post-revolutionary era: ''Angel'' (Olesha) speaks tragically of the brutality and destruction of the time, and ''The Homeland of Electricity'' (Platonov) captures its haunting grotesquery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oWD3cIyqRUkJw6xJz7YazqJnOX4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:146521'),
  ('775053140785774240', 'Beginning of the End', 1957, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Bert I. Gordon, Jack A. Marta, Wilson Shyer', 'Lester Gorn, Fred Freiberger', 'Peter Graves, Peggie Castle, Morris Ankrum, Than Wyenn, Thomas Browne Henry, Richard Benedict, James Seay, John Close', 'NR', 'An attractive reporter investigating the mysterious destruction of an Illinois town stumbles upon a secret government laboratory conducting radiation experiments on vegetables. The lead scientist is eager to help find out what happened. Together they discover that giant grasshoppers are behind the devastation. Worse yet, thousands of them are headed toward Chicago! Can they be stopped... or is this the BEGINNING OF THE END?', 'An attractive reporter investigating the mysterious destruction of an Illinois town stumbles upon a secret government laboratory conducting radiation experiments on vegetables. The lead scientist is eager to help find out what happened. Together they discover that giant grasshoppers are behind the devastation. Worse yet, thousands of them are headed toward Chicago! Can they be stopped... or is this the BEGINNING OF THE END?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oYwpYmUWUsbQq13lwoU6rUeNraC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66918'),
  ('1291701328151971', 'Beginning of the Great Revival', 2011, 'Drama, Action, History, War', 'Han Sanping, Huang Jianxin, Wang Yan', 'Dong Zhe', 'Andy Lau, Chow Yun-Fat, Nick Cheung Ka-Fai, Daniel Wu, Tony Leung Ka-fai, Liu Ye, Chen Kun, Chang Chen', null, 'A chronicle of the events that led to the founding of the Chinese Communist Party.', 'A chronicle of the events that led to the founding of the Chinese Communist Party.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dw4lcKrxY5JwEzh09g7Vyt7Xc4q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69310'),
  ('290473596998953568', 'Beginnings', 2025, 'Drama', 'Jeanette Nordahl', 'Rasmus Birch, Jeanette Nordahl', 'Trine Dyrholm, David Dencik, Johanne Louise Schmidt, Bjørk Storm Engelshardt Kirkegaard, Luna Fuglsang Svelmøe, Christine Gjerulff, Kurt Dreyer, Hanne Uldal', null, 'Ane and Thomas are in the middle of a divorce - when Ane suddenly suffers a stroke. They decide to stay together until Ane gets back on her feet, but as she struggles to return to life, love manifests where they least expected it.', 'Ane and Thomas are in the middle of a divorce - when Ane suddenly suffers a stroke. They decide to stay together until Ane gets back on her feet, but as she struggles to return to life, love manifests where they least expected it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AmOrPbcDzcmUhohE7zqKAd14J0A.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1239478'),
  ('751202703217734265', 'Begone Dull Care', 1949, 'Animation, Music', 'Norman McLaren, Evelyn Lambart', null, null, null, 'In this extraordinary short animation, Evelyn Lambart and Norman McLaren painted colours, shapes, and transformations directly onto their filmstrip. The result is a vivid interpretation, in fluid lines and colour, of jazz music played by the Oscar Peterson Trio.', 'In this extraordinary short animation, Evelyn Lambart and Norman McLaren painted colours, shapes, and transformations directly onto their filmstrip. The result is a vivid interpretation, in fluid lines and colour, of jazz music played by the Oscar Peterson Trio.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nTufcjJmLZa22XVrjDLMDELH2Uc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:128679'),
  ('501054416929936664', 'Begotten', 1991, 'Fantasy, Horror', 'E. Elias Merhige, E. Elias Merhige', 'E. Elias Merhige', 'Brian Salzberg, Donna Dempsey, Stephen Charles Barry', 'NR', 'Begotten is the creation myth brought to life, the story of no less than the violent death of God and the (re)birth of nature on a barren earth.', 'Begotten is the creation myth brought to life, the story of no less than the violent death of God and the (re)birth of nature on a barren earth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y8GbJny4bBUimJxUGXqq3l3k4OV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1483'),
  ('536985475208602692', 'Begum Jaan', 2017, 'Action, Drama, History', 'Srijit Mukherji, Gopi Bhagat', 'Niranjan Iyengar, Kausar Munir', 'Vidya Balan, Naseeruddin Shah, Pallavi Sharda, Gauahar Khan, Ila Arun, Priyanka Setia, Flora Saini, Ridheema Tiwari', 'R', 'On the eve of Independence, the chairman of the Border Commission, Sir Cyril Radcliffe decides to divide India and Pakistan into equitable halves. What the administration doesn’t account for is the line running through the middle of Begum Jaan’s brothel situated plonk on the border; with one half falling in India and the other in Pakistan.', 'On the eve of Independence, the chairman of the Border Commission, Sir Cyril Radcliffe decides to divide India and Pakistan into equitable halves. What the administration doesn’t account for is the line running through the middle of Begum Jaan’s brothel situated plonk on the border; with one half falling in India and the other in Pakistan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/spjYSwKazSQEkeMywBZIpnzilQp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:413548'),
  ('909197478703939120', 'Behave', 2007, 'Documentary', 'Maria Ramos, Alice Lanari, Henrique Castelo Branco', 'Maria Ramos', 'Luciana Fiala de Siqueira Carvalho, Guaraci de Campos Vianna, Renato Lisboa, Alexandra Carvalho Pires, Eliane de Lima Pereira, Tadeu Valverde, Patrícia Vilela, Alessandro Jardim', null, 'In Rio de Janeiro, over many days, the director Maria Ramos witnesses and films the judgment of several teenagers accused of stealing, trafficking and murdering. Underage youths are protected by the Brazilian laws and their faces can not be exposed; therefore, they are replaced by teenagers from poor communities.', 'In Rio de Janeiro, over many days, the director Maria Ramos witnesses and films the judgment of several teenagers accused of stealing, trafficking and murdering. Underage youths are protected by the Brazilian laws and their faces can not be exposed; therefore, they are replaced by teenagers from poor communities.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gfNJqleoWh5XoBhhyONy0EG1DZz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:151401'),
  ('326798790819529786', 'Behave Yourself!', 1951, 'Comedy, Crime', 'George Beck, James Wong Howe', 'George Beck', 'Farley Granger, Shelley Winters, William Demarest, Francis L. Sullivan, Margalo Gillmore, Lon Chaney Jr., Hans Conried, Elisha Cook Jr.', 'NR', 'A young man takes in a dog that turns out to be wanted by mobsters.', 'A young man takes in a dog that turns out to be wanted by mobsters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fgoySNLE6bHovezVA8NhBycPAlf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:197788'),
  ('410356916340607148', 'Behaving Badly', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Tim Garrick, Mathew Rudenberg', 'Scott Russell, Tim Garrick', 'Nat Wolff, Selena Gomez, Mary-Louise Parker, Elisabeth Shue, Dylan McDermott, Lachlan Buchanan, Heather Graham, Ashley Rickards', 'R', 'Teenager Rick Stevens is willing to do whatever it takes to win the heart of Nina Pennington. He''ll have to deal with his best friend''s horny mom, a drug abusing boss and even the mob if he ever hopes to land the girl of his dreams. Love is never easy!', 'Teenager Rick Stevens is willing to do whatever it takes to win the heart of Nina Pennington. He''ll have to deal with his best friend''s horny mom, a drug abusing boss and even the mob if he ever hopes to land the girl of his dreams. Love is never easy!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vHPRAvYa4AT2KfORbpTlhNGtGEI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:259018'),
  ('905328152919356754', 'Behavior', 2014, 'Drama', 'Ernesto Daranas, Alejandro Pérez', 'Ernesto Daranas', 'Armando Valdés Freyre, Alina Rodríguez, Yuliet Cruz, Silvia Águila, Armando Miguel Gómez, Idalmis Garc, Tomás Cao, Roque Moreno', null, 'Meet Chala, an eleven year-old boy with a hard life and strong respect for Carmela, his sixth grade teacher. The pair develops a solid bond, but after Carmela suffers an accident, things get complicated…', 'Meet Chala, an eleven year-old boy with a hard life and strong respect for Carmela, his sixth grade teacher. The pair develops a solid bond, but after Carmela suffers an accident, things get complicated…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rmIZ7OvY5Ey37AnfSdAXkQNKpMV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:259460'),
  ('996482339657424202', 'Behemoth', 2015, 'Documentary', 'Zhao Liang', null, null, null, 'Under the sun, the heavenly beauty of grasslands will soon be covered by the raging dust of mines. Facing the ashes and noises caused by heavy mining , the herdsmen have no choice but to leave as the meadow areas dwindle. In the moonlight, iron mines are brightly lit throughout the night. Workers who operate the drilling machines must stay awake. The fight is tortuous, against the machine and against themselves. Meanwhile, coal miners are busy filling trucks with coals. Wearing a coal-dust mask, they become ghostlike creatures. An endless line of trucks will transport all the coals and iron ores to the iron works. There traps another crowd of souls, being baked in hell. In the hospital, time hangs heavy on miners'' hands. After decades of breathing coal dust, death is just around the corner. They are living the reality of purgatory, but there will be no paradise.', 'Under the sun, the heavenly beauty of grasslands will soon be covered by the raging dust of mines. Facing the ashes and noises caused by heavy mining , the herdsmen have no choice but to leave as the meadow areas dwindle. In the moonlight, iron mines are brightly lit throughout the night. Workers who operate the drilling machines must stay awake. The fight is tortuous, against the machine and against themselves. Meanwhile, coal miners are busy filling trucks with coals. Wearing a coal-dust mask, they become ghostlike creatures. An endless line of trucks will transport all the coals and iron ores to the iron works. There traps another crowd of souls, being baked in hell. In the hospital, time hangs heavy on miners'' hands. After decades of breathing coal dust, death is just around the corner. They are living the reality of purgatory, but there will be no paradise.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aoomIXBtZUZgge8qcV0yHmEhIV1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:352202'),
  ('781490300841549333', 'Behen Hogi Teri', 2017, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'Ajay K Pannanlal, Shamsher Singh', 'Vinit Vyas', 'Rajkummar Rao, Shruti Haasan, Gautam Gulati, Gulshan Grover, Darshan Jariwala, Natasha Rastogi, Ninad Kamat, Ranjeet Bedi', null, 'Owing to the condition that the girls of the neighborhood should be treated like one''s own sister, Gattu works to capture Binny''s heart and the approval of his community.', 'Owing to the condition that the girls of the neighborhood should be treated like one''s own sister, Gattu works to capture Binny''s heart and the approval of his community.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2zdhiVMVrHFu5J2LarF5bHhSabM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:454769'),
  ('922153730118163841', 'Behind', 2016, 'Mystery, Horror', 'Ángel Gómez Hernández', 'Ángel Gómez Hernández', 'Macarena Gómez, Lone Fleming, Javier Botet, Ruth Díaz, Víctor Clavijo', null, 'A divorced mother is obsessed with the idea that her ex-husband is plotting to take her baby away from her.', 'A divorced mother is obsessed with the idea that her ex-husband is plotting to take her baby away from her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/umYqeVwBpMjsgs7bRELy56UNjou.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:422118'),
  ('28493341348726486', 'Behind Closed Doors', 2014, 'Drama', 'Audrey Estrougo, Guillaume Schiffman', 'Audrey Estrougo', 'Marie Denarnaud, Renaud Astegiani, Aurore Broutin, Marie-Sohna Condé, Oumar Diaw', null, 'Nathalie, 32 years old, is an ordinary woman of her age totally in love with her boyfriend. But her life will totally change when her co-worker rape her after a party. Life is now a struggle where every detail is a fight to get back a normal life. Through this ''ordinary'' story, Natalie will turn into an example for all those women who had chosen to remain silent.', 'Nathalie, 32 years old, is an ordinary woman of her age totally in love with her boyfriend. But her life will totally change when her co-worker rape her after a party. Life is now a struggle where every detail is a fight to get back a normal life. Through this ''ordinary'' story, Natalie will turn into an example for all those women who had chosen to remain silent.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yAVJsrNyZhp5vQyb7pWErASVQCg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:298408'),
  ('945633737750984669', 'Behind Convent Walls', 1978, 'Drama', 'Walerian Borowczyk, Raffaele Errigo, Luciano Tovoli', 'Walerian Borowczyk, Marcello Lizzani, Giuseppe Vezzani', 'Marina Pierro, Ligia Branice, Gabriella Giacobbe, Loredana Martínez, Howard Ross, Rodolfo Dal Pra, Olivia Pascal, Maria Cumani Quasimodo', null, 'A zealous, handsome priest, who is the confessor for a convent full of women, encourages the equally zealous abbess of the institution to enforce strict rules on these unfortunate women. At the same time, a particularly disturbed nun manages to poison herself and many of the other novitiates in yet another scandal which is covered up by church authorities.', 'A zealous, handsome priest, who is the confessor for a convent full of women, encourages the equally zealous abbess of the institution to enforce strict rules on these unfortunate women. At the same time, a particularly disturbed nun manages to poison herself and many of the other novitiates in yet another scandal which is covered up by church authorities.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ybNZljxIg4lp9BnujCjyNkMiqBg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39340'),
  ('349442777781669745', 'Behind Enemy Lines', 1997, 'Action, War', 'Blake T. Evans, Mark Griffiths', 'Dennis Cooley, Andrew Osborne', 'Thomas Ian Griffith, Mon Confiado, Courtney Gains, Chris Mulkey, Spanky Manikan, Leon Miguel, Nonie Buencamino, Ronnie Lazaro', 'R', 'An ex-marine returns to Vietnam when he learns his former mercenary partner whom he thought was killed is being held by a sadistic general.', 'An ex-marine returns to Vietnam when he learns his former mercenary partner whom he thought was killed is being held by a sadistic general.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6eAMxsasHwJAraxAg9lwPdvBAWz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45266'),
  ('912264046491357814', 'Behind Enemy Lines', 2001, 'Action, Drama, Thriller, War', 'John Moore, Brendan Galvin, Patrick Lumb', 'David Veloz, Zak Penn', 'Owen Wilson, Gene Hackman, Gabriel Macht, Olek Krupa, Vladimir Mashkov, Marko Igonda, David Keith, Charles Malik Whitfield', 'PG-13', 'While flying a routine reconnaissance mission over Bosnia, fighter pilot Lt. Chris Burnett photographs something he wasn''t supposed to see and gets shot down behind enemy lines, where he must outrun an army led by a ruthless Serbian general. With time running out and a deadly tracker on his trail, Burnett''s commanding officer, Admiral Reigart, decides to risk his career and launch a renegade rescue mission to save his life.', 'While flying a routine reconnaissance mission over Bosnia, fighter pilot Lt. Chris Burnett photographs something he wasn''t supposed to see and gets shot down behind enemy lines, where he must outrun an army led by a ruthless Serbian general. With time running out and a deadly tracker on his trail, Burnett''s commanding officer, Admiral Reigart, decides to risk his career and launch a renegade rescue mission to save his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fZReMWU3zszvaktDUqOoWCzHssZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8007'),
  ('325866594472335852', 'Behind Enemy Lines II: Axis of Evil', 2006, 'Action, Adventure, Thriller', 'James Dodson, Lorenzo Senatore', null, 'Matt Bushell, Denis Arndt, Ben Cross, Keith David, Bruce McGill, Nicholas Gonzalez, Peter Coyote, April Grace', 'R', 'Navy SEALS, headed by Lt. Bobby James, are dispatched to North Korea on a covert mission, all in an effort to take out a missile site...', 'Navy SEALS, headed by Lt. Bobby James, are dispatched to North Korea on a covert mission, all in an effort to take out a missile site...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7sbLeFbRxSNXHc1ZO4zxFy3sIgc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10005'),
  ('1021105988842660068', 'Behind Enemy Lines III: Colombia', 2009, 'War, Action, Thriller', 'Tim Matheson, Reynaldo Rodriguez, Claudio Chea', null, 'Keith David, Ken Anderson, Joe Manganiello, Channon Roe, Yancey Arias, Chris Johnson, Steven Bauer, Jennice Fuentes', 'R', 'Navy SEALS mount an attack on Colombian special forces to clear their names and rescue a hostage.', 'Navy SEALS mount an attack on Colombian special forces to clear their names and rescue a hostage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/K5R3hdUJ5x3McuGQHlxi6ApasV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14028'),
  ('26027083244860075', 'Behind Green Lights', 1946, 'Crime, Drama', 'Otto Brower, Joseph MacDonald', 'Scott Darling, Charles G. Booth', 'Carole Landis, William Gargan, Richard Crane, Mary Anderson, John Ireland, Charles Russell, Roy Roberts, Mabel Paige', null, 'An unscrupulous private investigator with a penchant for blackmail is found dead in a car and the leading suspect is Janet Bradley, the daughter of a mayoral candidate. With the election just weeks away, shady and ruthless individuals muscle the medical officer into switching the corpse with another body. Lieutenant Sam Carson, one of the few good apples in the bunch must find a way to get to the bottom of it all.', 'An unscrupulous private investigator with a penchant for blackmail is found dead in a car and the leading suspect is Janet Bradley, the daughter of a mayoral candidate. With the election just weeks away, shady and ruthless individuals muscle the medical officer into switching the corpse with another body. Lieutenant Sam Carson, one of the few good apples in the bunch must find a way to get to the bottom of it all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pshb0QuZ0dflGwHkox4qt9COPYV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61436'),
  ('47895044518494326', 'Behind Locked Doors', 1948, 'Thriller, Crime', 'Budd Boetticher, Emmett Emerson, Irving Friedman', 'Eugene Ling, Malvin Wald', 'Lucille Bremer, Richard Carlson, Douglas Fowley, Ralf Harolde, Thomas Browne Henry, Herbert Heyes, Gwen Donovan, Trevor Bardette', 'NR', 'Behind the locked doors of a mental institution resides crooked politico Judge Drake, free from prosecution so long as he pretends to be crazy. To get the goods on Drake, private detective Ross Stewart has himself committed to the asylum as a patient. Meanwhile, reporter Kathy Lawrence, posing as Stewart''s wife, acts as his liaison to the outside world.', 'Behind the locked doors of a mental institution resides crooked politico Judge Drake, free from prosecution so long as he pretends to be crazy. To get the goods on Drake, private detective Ross Stewart has himself committed to the asylum as a patient. Meanwhile, reporter Kathy Lawrence, posing as Stewart''s wife, acts as his liaison to the outside world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/urPLEQQnuzYy0d8lwy8KDMrvAJg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30015'),
  ('1053179841051361913', 'Behind Office Doors', 1931, 'Drama, Romance', 'Melville W. Brown, J. Roy Hunt', 'J. Walter Ruben, Alan Schultz', 'Mary Astor, Robert Ames, Ricardo Cortez, Catherine Dale Owen, Kitty Kelly, Edna Murphy, Charles Sellon, William Morris', null, 'Mary Linden is the secretary who is the unheralded power behind successful executive James Duneen. He takes her for granted until rival Wales tries to take her away from him.', 'Mary Linden is the secretary who is the unheralded power behind successful executive James Duneen. He takes her for granted until rival Wales tries to take her away from him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qIaPU3hkLx6TQ3O9Y9zs9KdbFdt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:156415'),
