  ('967489879893890749', 'Behind Stone Walls', 1932, 'Crime, Drama', 'Jules Cronjager, Frank R. Strayer', 'George B. Seitz', 'Edward Nugent, Priscilla Dean, Ann Christy, Robert Elliott, Robert Ellis, George Chesebro, Vance Carroll, Allan Cavan', null, 'Esther Clay, wife of District Attorney John Clay and mother of attorney Bob Clay, is having an affair with Jack Keene. Scorned by him Esther kills Jack. Bob comes to her defense and confesses to the shooting. The father prosecutes the son who receives a life imprisonment sentence. Jack Keene''s butler Druggett knows the truth and blackmails Esther. Bob''s girlfriend Peg Harper summons John Clay to the scene...', 'Esther Clay, wife of District Attorney John Clay and mother of attorney Bob Clay, is having an affair with Jack Keene. Scorned by him Esther kills Jack. Bob comes to her defense and confesses to the shooting. The father prosecutes the son who receives a life imprisonment sentence. Jack Keene''s butler Druggett knows the truth and blackmails Esther. Bob''s girlfriend Peg Harper summons John Clay to the scene...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yd16buy9ViwwYiZGZpmwLCZW5Rp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:159458'),
  ('963572506698577353', 'Behind That Curtain', 1929, 'Crime, Mystery, Thriller', 'Irving Cummings', 'Clarke Silvemail, Sonya Levien', 'Warner Baxter, Lois Moran, E.L. Park, Boris Karloff, Gilbert Emery, Claude King, Philip Strange, Jamiel Hasson', 'NR', 'Sir George hires Hillary Gatt to find out more about Eric who wants to marry Lois. Gatt is murdered and the couple, married, run off to India. Old friend John Beetham sympathizes with the bride who sees that her hubby is a liar and drunk.', 'Sir George hires Hillary Gatt to find out more about Eric who wants to marry Lois. Gatt is murdered and the couple, married, run off to India. Old friend John Beetham sympathizes with the bride who sees that her hubby is a liar and drunk.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ekUnNnFDK4d1ewTbslECb3md296.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47571'),
