  ('59160957047102081', 'Behind the Planet of the Apes', 1998, 'Documentary, Science Fiction, TV Movie', 'David Comtois, Kevin Burns', 'Brian Anthony, David Comtois, Kevin Burns', 'Roddy McDowall, Charlton Heston, Richard D. Zanuck, John Chambers, Kim Hunter, Linda Harrison, William J. Creber, Mort Abrahams', 'G', 'Roddy McDowall takes you, film by film, from production meetings to make-up sessions, then right onto the movie set to see the actual filming of the science fiction masterpiece. The most comprehensive history of Planet of the Apes ever created, this fascinating 127-minute documentary explores one of the most imaginative and influential series in movie history.', 'Roddy McDowall takes you, film by film, from production meetings to make-up sessions, then right onto the movie set to see the actual filming of the science fiction masterpiece. The most comprehensive history of Planet of the Apes ever created, this fascinating 127-minute documentary explores one of the most imaginative and influential series in movie history.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5Ku4Sn0piPBSm24CC2B5CI3VMuN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17244'),
  ('394494967561290226', 'Behind the Red Door', 2003, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Robert Elswit, Matia Karrell, Dana Warren', 'Matia Karrell, C.W. Cressler', 'Kyra Sedgwick, Kiefer Sutherland, Stockard Channing, Chuck Shamata, Hannah Lochner, Corey Staden, Phillip Craig, Jason Carter', null, 'Natalie, a gifted New York photographer, has a troubled past reflected in her art. When she struggles to make ends meet in the city, her agent, arranges an assignment in Boston for a considerable sum of money. Unable to turn it down in her dire straits, Natalie takes the job -- only to find that her estranged gay brother, Roy, is the employer. Roy wants to mend their broken past, but must convince her to stay long enough to do so.', 'Natalie, a gifted New York photographer, has a troubled past reflected in her art. When she struggles to make ends meet in the city, her agent, arranges an assignment in Boston for a considerable sum of money. Unable to turn it down in her dire straits, Natalie takes the job -- only to find that her estranged gay brother, Roy, is the employer. Roy wants to mend their broken past, but must convince her to stay long enough to do so.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t7L4htGL5UMwK4wCUdHlzkvmDyi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79610'),
  ('1144406464982994391', 'Behind the Screen', 1916, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Charlie Chaplin, Roland Totheroh', 'Charlie Chaplin, Maverick Terrell, Vincent Bryan', 'Charlie Chaplin, Eric Campbell, Edna Purviance, Henry Bergman, Tom Wood, Wesley Ruggles, Charlotte Mineau, Leota Bryan', null, 'During the troubled shooting of several movies, David, the prop man''s assistant, meets an aspiring actress who tries to find work in the studio. Things get messy when the stagehands decide to go on strike.', 'During the troubled shooting of several movies, David, the prop man''s assistant, meets an aspiring actress who tries to find work in the studio. Things get messy when the stagehands decide to go on strike.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u1AYvWE0JYjGjg7XCNAevkJZrMR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53419'),
  ('789751803679184979', 'Behind the Sun', 2001, 'Drama, Thriller, Romance', 'Walter Salles, Walter Carvalho', 'Karim Aïnouz, Sérgio Machado, Walter Salles', 'Rodrigo Santoro, José Dumont, Rita Assemany, Luiz Carlos Vasconcelos, Ravi Ramos Lacerda, Flavia Marco Antonio, Everaldo Pontes, Caio Junqueira', null, 'Brazilian badlands, April 1910. Tonho is ordered by his father to avenge the death of his older brother. The young man knows that if he commits this crime, his life will be divided in two: the twenty years he has already lived and the few days he has left to live, before the other family avenges their son''s death. He is torn between fulfilling his ancestral duty and rebelling against it, urged by his younger brother Pacu. That''s when a tiny travelling circus passes through the vast badlands where Tonho''s family lives.', 'Brazilian badlands, April 1910. Tonho is ordered by his father to avenge the death of his older brother. The young man knows that if he commits this crime, his life will be divided in two: the twenty years he has already lived and the few days he has left to live, before the other family avenges their son''s death. He is torn between fulfilling his ancestral duty and rebelling against it, urged by his younger brother Pacu. That''s when a tiny travelling circus passes through the vast badlands where Tonho''s family lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zkNQBhT8op04I1JYwRqNhjX4quD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36093'),
