  ('838128020602189250', 'Behind the Wall', 2008, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Paul Schneider, Larry Lynn, Noel Harris', 'Micheal Bafaro, Anna Singer', 'Lindy Booth, Lawrence Dane, James Thomas, Andy Jones, Suzie Pollard, Brad Hodder, Jody Richardson, Julia Kennedy', null, 'In this chilling, atmospheric thriller, Katelyn (Lindy Booth) seeks answers about the brutal murder that claimed her mother''s life 20 years ago in the lighthouse where they lived, a crime for which her grief-and-guilt-crazed father has long held the blame. When developers descend on the abandoned lighthouse and begin to vanish mysteriously, Katelyn comes face-to-face with the evil haunts the family''s former abode.', 'In this chilling, atmospheric thriller, Katelyn (Lindy Booth) seeks answers about the brutal murder that claimed her mother''s life 20 years ago in the lighthouse where they lived, a crime for which her grief-and-guilt-crazed father has long held the blame. When developers descend on the abandoned lighthouse and begin to vanish mysteriously, Katelyn comes face-to-face with the evil haunts the family''s former abode.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jDlPWlc4ei1kG6zAwDlg1KxDdGi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45830'),
  ('91152468252973392', 'Behind the Walls', 2008, 'Drama', 'Christian Faure', 'Albert Algoud', 'Émile Berling, Carole Bouquet, Catherine Jacob, Michel Jonasz, Guillaume Gouix, Julien Bouanich, Anthony Decadi, Jonathan Reyes', null, 'A young runaway rejects society''s condemnation and dares to fulfill his dreams. France, 1930s. 14-year-old orphan Yves Tréguier sees the world through the bars of "educational homes" where he is raised in conditions worthy of a penal colony, and dreams of a dramatic escape across the ocean to New York.', 'A young runaway rejects society''s condemnation and dares to fulfill his dreams. France, 1930s. 14-year-old orphan Yves Tréguier sees the world through the bars of "educational homes" where he is raised in conditions worthy of a penal colony, and dreams of a dramatic escape across the ocean to New York.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wyyIH5MiT8SbIxYlDKUm1eiwtXH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48913'),
