  ('974814530245871538', 'Behind You', 2020, 'Horror', 'Andrew Mecham, Matthew Whedon', 'Matthew Whedon, Andrew Mecham', 'Addy Miller, Elizabeth Birkner, Jan Broberg Felt, Philip Brodie, Aimee-Lynn Chadwick, Charan Prabhakar, Skyler M. Day, Caroline Labrum', 'R', 'Two young sisters find that all the mirrors in their estranged aunt''s house are covered or hidden. When one of them happens upon a mirror in the basement, she unknowingly releases a malicious demon.', 'Two young sisters find that all the mirrors in their estranged aunt''s house are covered or hidden. When one of them happens upon a mirror in the basement, she unknowingly releases a malicious demon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2qcnM2j2gatClqweKytsLmSclgj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:684139'),
  ('419452445645582747', 'Behold a Pale Horse', 1964, 'Drama, War', 'Fred Zinnemann, Paul Feyder, Jean Badal', 'J.P. Miller', 'Gregory Peck, Anthony Quinn, Omar Sharif, Raymond Pellegrin, Paolo Stoppa, Mildred Dunnock, Daniela Rocca, Christian Marquand', 'NR', 'Manuel Artiguez, a famous bandit during the Spanish civil war, has lived in French exile for 20 years. When his mother is dying he considers visiting her secretly in his Spanish home town. But his biggest enemy, the Spanish police officer Vinolas, prepared a trap at the hospital as a chance to finally catch Artiguez.', 'Manuel Artiguez, a famous bandit during the Spanish civil war, has lived in French exile for 20 years. When his mother is dying he considers visiting her secretly in his Spanish home town. But his biggest enemy, the Spanish police officer Vinolas, prepared a trap at the hospital as a chance to finally catch Artiguez.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uMbvDdf3iiGhoWT9TNF53sMwjve.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:166607'),
  ('24795109415152491', 'Behold Homolka', 1970, 'Comedy', 'Milan Muchna, Jozef Ort-Šnep, Jaroslav Papoušek', 'Jaroslav Papoušek', 'Josef Šebánek, Marie Motlová, František Husák, Helena Růžičková, Petr Forman, Matěj Forman, Yvonne Kodoňová, Miroslav Jelínek', null, 'This light comedy finds a Czech taxi driver taking his family on a weekend outing in the country. His wife, daughter-in-law, son and two grandchildren are the passengers who disturb the solitude of two young lovers. While the women attend the horse races, the father sits home getting drunk and watching football. The overweight daughter-in-law is upset because she has blown her chances to become a ballerina. All members of the family are caught up in their own individual problems in this realistically portrayed family comedy', 'This light comedy finds a Czech taxi driver taking his family on a weekend outing in the country. His wife, daughter-in-law, son and two grandchildren are the passengers who disturb the solitude of two young lovers. While the women attend the horse races, the father sits home getting drunk and watching football. The overweight daughter-in-law is upset because she has blown her chances to become a ballerina. All members of the family are caught up in their own individual problems in this realistically portrayed family comedy', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d4Gn0sHILjbv76T25i3hzWYl576.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78817'),
  ('76851803437176883', 'Behzat Ç.: Ankara Is on Fire', 2013, 'Action, Adventure, Crime', 'Serdar Akar, Serkan Duran, Goksel Demir', 'Ercan Mehmet Erdem', 'Erdal Beşikçioğlu, Sanem Çelik, Nejat İşler, Aslı Tandoğan, Serenay Sarıkaya, Sadi Celil Cengiz, Fatih Artman, İnanç Konukçu', null, 'In the absence of Behzat Ç., a superintendent named Himmet gets replaced as the president of the murder Bureau. When the murder of minister of Interior makes a big impact, Himmet decides to take advantage of it and he makes his team help the fight against terrorism bureau.', 'In the absence of Behzat Ç., a superintendent named Himmet gets replaced as the president of the murder Bureau. When the murder of minister of Interior makes a big impact, Himmet decides to take advantage of it and he makes his team help the fight against terrorism bureau.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vEW68Dj4G4aJVhqmac1HXvKQMdF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:255161'),
  ('1147980371060013651', 'Behzat Ç.: I Buried You in My Heart', 2011, 'Drama, Action, Crime', 'Serdar Akar, Süleyman Mert Özdemir', 'Emrah Serbes, Serdar Akar', 'Erdal Beşikçioğlu, Fatih Artman, İnanç Konukçu, Canan Ergüder, Berkan Şal, Ege Aydan, Tardu Flordun, Cansu Dere', null, 'An aggressive police officer tries to solve the mystery behind consecutive murders. While doing so, he must fight against his inner demons.', 'An aggressive police officer tries to solve the mystery behind consecutive murders. While doing so, he must fight against his inner demons.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/diadbIiVtYYIsMah4j0Cj2CvHVO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81557'),
  ('403626469557547134', 'Beiimaan Love', 2016, 'Thriller, Romance', 'Rajiv Choudhury', 'Rajeev Chaudhari, Vibanshu Vaibhav', 'Sunny Leone, Rajneesh Duggal, Daniel Weber, Rajeev Verma', null, 'A young and ambitious woman''s life suddenly comes crashing down when she is betrayed in love. Determined to get revenge she reinvents herself as a successful businesswoman.', 'A young and ambitious woman''s life suddenly comes crashing down when she is betrayed in love. Determined to get revenge she reinvents herself as a successful businesswoman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lLTrDNyA1EezXieOPPJDPwaKEo6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:407547'),
  ('821750030462335469', 'Beijing 2008 Olympic Opening Ceremony', 2008, 'Documentary', 'Zhang Yimou', null, 'Hu Jintao, Henry Kissinger, Barbara Bush, George H. W. Bush, George W. Bush, Laura Bush, Shimon Peres, Anne, Princess Royal', null, 'The 2008 Summer Olympics opening ceremony was held at the Beijing National Stadium, also known as the Bird''s Nest. It began at 8:00 p.m. China Standard Time (UTC+8) on August 8, 2008, as 8 is considered to be a lucky number in Chinese culture. Featuring more than 15,000 performers, the ceremony lasted over four hours and cost over $100 million USD to produce.', 'The 2008 Summer Olympics opening ceremony was held at the Beijing National Stadium, also known as the Bird''s Nest. It began at 8:00 p.m. China Standard Time (UTC+8) on August 8, 2008, as 8 is considered to be a lucky number in Chinese culture. Featuring more than 15,000 performers, the ceremony lasted over four hours and cost over $100 million USD to produce.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xD8O2hDT2kbwaZOQ7ptFczGM9gh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26557'),
  ('8572838723872068', 'Beijing Bicycle', 2001, 'Drama', 'Liu Jie, Wang Xiaoshuai', 'Peggy Chiao, Hsu Hsiao-Ming, Tang Danian', 'Cui Lin, Li Bin, Zhou Xun, Gao Yuanyuan, Zhao Yiwei, Pang Yan, Zhou Fangfei, Xie Jian', null, 'A seventeen-year-old country boy working in Beijing as a courier has his bicycle stolen, and finds it with a schoolboy his age.', 'A seventeen-year-old country boy working in Beijing as a courier has his bicycle stolen, and finds it with a schoolboy his age.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mkOBUHcJFfVWLJmWNvE0qZuzAW0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12659'),
  ('582592133949224317', 'Beijing Blues', 2012, 'Drama, Crime', 'Gao Qunshu', 'Gao Qunshu', 'Zhang Lixian, Kong Qianqian, Zuo Ye-Ben, Zhou YunPeng, Bai Yan-Sheng, Chen Zhengyang, Yu Yang', null, 'The unique feature of his film is the actors - they are not professional but celebrities on micro-blogs. Among micro-bloggers in the cast are publisher Zhang Lixian, folk singer Zhou Yunpeng and screenwriter Shi Hang. The film is based on the true story of a Beijing plainclothes policeman named Zhang Huiling, who has been working for more than 10 years in Shuangyushu, a community of Haidian District, Beijing. It depicts the stories of ordinary Chinese people struggling in the metropolis.', 'The unique feature of his film is the actors - they are not professional but celebrities on micro-blogs. Among micro-bloggers in the cast are publisher Zhang Lixian, folk singer Zhou Yunpeng and screenwriter Shi Hang. The film is based on the true story of a Beijing plainclothes policeman named Zhang Huiling, who has been working for more than 10 years in Shuangyushu, a community of Haidian District, Beijing. It depicts the stories of ordinary Chinese people struggling in the metropolis.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3o2nk6ZEiuQL7jAx83DFYJUChk6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:125184'),
