  ('22754840063663991', 'Being 17', 2016, 'Drama', 'André Téchiné, Julien Hirsch', 'Céline Sciamma, André Téchiné', 'Sandrine Kiberlain, Kacey Mottet Klein, Corentin Fila, Alexis Loret, Jean Fornerod, Mama Prassinos, Jean Corso, Rémi Garcia', null, 'Damien lives with his mother Marianne, a doctor, while his father, a pilot, is on a tour of duty abroad with the French military. At school, Damien is bullied by Thomas, who lives in the farming community up in the mountains. The boys find themselves living together when Marianne invites Thomas to come and stay with them while his mother is ill in hospital. Damien must learn to live with the boy who terrorized him.', 'Damien lives with his mother Marianne, a doctor, while his father, a pilot, is on a tour of duty abroad with the French military. At school, Damien is bullied by Thomas, who lives in the farming community up in the mountains. The boys find themselves living together when Marianne invites Thomas to come and stay with them while his mother is ill in hospital. Damien must learn to live with the boy who terrorized him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hC5cEEXTFg0pYvuqAfckP8EWR6G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:377154'),
  ('154534311209594861', 'Being at Home with Claude', 1992, 'Thriller, Crime', 'Jean Beaudin', 'René-Daniel Dubois', 'Roy Dupuis, Jacques Godin, Jean-François Pichette, Gaston Lepage, Hugo Dubé, Johanne-Marie Tremblay, Nathalie Mallette', null, 'The relationship between lovers Yves and Claude comes to an abrupt conclusion when, as the couple are making love, Yves slices Claude''s throat, killing him. After being taken into custody for his crime, the police inspector demands to know the reason behind Yves'' actions. Yves then weaves the tale of his life with Claude, explaining the origins of their relationship and how it reached a point where murder was the only possible conclusion.', 'The relationship between lovers Yves and Claude comes to an abrupt conclusion when, as the couple are making love, Yves slices Claude''s throat, killing him. After being taken into custody for his crime, the police inspector demands to know the reason behind Yves'' actions. Yves then weaves the tale of his life with Claude, explaining the origins of their relationship and how it reached a point where murder was the only possible conclusion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mPUDKYudqqJCg9NqVpsbaLQ3utY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:162836'),
  ('574719833117417887', 'Being Blanche Houellebecq', 2024, 'Comedy', 'Elise Cresson, Christophe Offenstein, Aurélien Fauchet', 'Guillaume Nicloux', 'Blanche Gardin, Michel Houellebecq, Luc Schwarz, Franck Monier, Françoise Lebrun, Gaspar Noé, Jean-Pascal Zadi, Francky Vincent', null, 'Michel Houellebecq travels to Guadeloupe to take part in a look-alike contest, whose jury is chaired by Blanche Gardin. But unforeseen events will plunge our duo into the heart of a bizarre intrigue.', 'Michel Houellebecq travels to Guadeloupe to take part in a look-alike contest, whose jury is chaired by Blanche Gardin. But unforeseen events will plunge our duo into the heart of a bizarre intrigue.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4Aid6eyJ9Ld6I420f5clZ6MQPvS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1043899'),
  ('656937012156622845', 'Being Charlie', 2016, 'Drama, Romance', 'Rob Reiner, Barry Markowitz, Stephen Harrison', 'Matt Elisofon, Nick Reiner', 'Nick Robinson, Morgan Saylor, Devon Bostick, Susan Misner, Ricardo Chavira, Common, Cary Elwes, Christy Summerhays', 'R', 'Charlie is a troublesome 18-year-old who breaks out of a youth drug treatment clinic, but when he returns home to Los Angeles, he''s given an intervention by his parents and forced to go to an adult rehab. There, he meets a beautiful but troubled girl, Eva, and is forced to battle with drugs, elusive love and divided parents.', 'Charlie is a troublesome 18-year-old who breaks out of a youth drug treatment clinic, but when he returns home to Los Angeles, he''s given an intervention by his parents and forced to go to an adult rehab. There, he meets a beautiful but troubled girl, Eva, and is forced to battle with drugs, elusive love and divided parents.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iYr2MGPOCNiTF5IzrO6ZmoMKbSH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:358895'),
  ('268885994292676511', 'Being Eddie', 2025, 'Documentary', 'Angus Wall, Alex Pollini', null, 'Eddie Murphy, Kevin Hart, Jamie Foxx, Pete Davidson, John Landis, Chris Rock, Jerry Bruckheimer, Jerry Seinfeld', 'R', 'From teen comedian to Hollywood legend, Eddie Murphy revisits his extraordinary showbiz ride with raw honesty and humor.', 'From teen comedian to Hollywood legend, Eddie Murphy revisits his extraordinary showbiz ride with raw honesty and humor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8behxK3x7kiCupdrENmOCkOcs8N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1426518'),
  ('1140076063868286033', 'Being Elmo: A Puppeteer''s Journey', 2011, 'Documentary', 'Constance Marks, Philip Shane, James J. Miller', 'Justin Weinstein, Philip Shane', 'Whoopi Goldberg, Frank Oz, Kevin Clash, Bill Barretta, Fran Brill, Joan Ganz Cooney, Arsenio Hall, Hugh Jackman', 'PG', 'Beloved by children of all ages around the world, Elmo is an international icon. Few people know his creator, Kevin Clash, who dreamed of working with his idol, master puppeteer Jim Henson. Displaying his creativity and talent at a young age, Kevin ultimately found a home on Sesame Street. Narrated by Whoopi Goldberg, this documentary includes rare archival footage, interviews with Frank Oz, Rosie O’Donnell, Cheryl Henson, Joan Ganz Cooney and others and offers a behind-the-scenes look at Sesame Street and the Jim Henson Workshop.', 'Beloved by children of all ages around the world, Elmo is an international icon. Few people know his creator, Kevin Clash, who dreamed of working with his idol, master puppeteer Jim Henson. Displaying his creativity and talent at a young age, Kevin ultimately found a home on Sesame Street. Narrated by Whoopi Goldberg, this documentary includes rare archival footage, interviews with Frank Oz, Rosie O’Donnell, Cheryl Henson, Joan Ganz Cooney and others and offers a behind-the-scenes look at Sesame Street and the Jim Henson Workshop.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7W2jIcJoWyMaYNiSkCxhZQX3OQF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75301'),
  ('909904123563251047', 'Being Flynn', 2012, 'Drama', 'Paul Weitz, Declan Quinn', 'Paul Weitz', 'Robert De Niro, Paul Dano, Julianne Moore, Olivia Thirlby, Eddie Rouse, Steve Cirbus, Lili Taylor, Victor Rasuk', 'R', 'Working in a Boston homeless shelter, Nick Flynn re-encounters his father, a con man and self-proclaimed poet. Sensing trouble in his own life, Nick wrestles with the notion of reaching out yet again to his dad.', 'Working in a Boston homeless shelter, Nick Flynn re-encounters his father, a con man and self-proclaimed poet. Sensing trouble in his own life, Nick wrestles with the notion of reaching out yet again to his dad.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wL16oLapLVGK9MDdnkvgM9BioXC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78571'),
