  ('60184166018690400', 'Being James Bond', 2021, 'Documentary', 'Baillie Walsh', null, 'Daniel Craig, Michael G. Wilson, Barbara Broccoli, Harrison Ford, Rami Malek', 'NR', 'Daniel Craig candidly reflects on his 15 year adventure as James Bond. Including never-before-seen archival footage from Casino Royale to the upcoming 25th film No Time To Die, Craig shares his personal memories in conversation with 007 producers, Michael G Wilson and Barbara Broccoli.', 'Daniel Craig candidly reflects on his 15 year adventure as James Bond. Including never-before-seen archival footage from Casino Royale to the upcoming 25th film No Time To Die, Craig shares his personal memories in conversation with 007 producers, Michael G Wilson and Barbara Broccoli.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kKG9gieki5wgEcVXLfnX1lbOcrO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:869250'),
