  ('233692382888031400', 'Being Two Isn''t Easy', 1962, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Kon Ichikawa, Setsuo Kobayashi, Bainari Nakamura', 'Natto Wada', 'Fujiko Yamamoto, Hiroo Suzuki, Eiji Funakoshi, Kumeko Urabe, Mantarō Ushio, Kyôko Kishida, Misako Watanabe, Masako Kyōzuka', null, 'The days leading up to a toddler''s second birthday are seen alternately from the child''s point of view as well as that of his parents.', 'The days leading up to a toddler''s second birthday are seen alternately from the child''s point of view as well as that of his parents.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jF5GG4l33iJa3CPymZ63CNbLZFx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:169147'),
  ('361492835212688091', 'Beirut', 2018, 'Action, Thriller, Drama', 'Brad Anderson, Ahmed Hatimi, Yann Mari Faget', 'Tony Gilroy', 'Jon Hamm, Rosamund Pike, Shea Whigham, Dean Norris, Mark Pellegrino, Douglas Hodge, Alon Aboutboul, Kate Fleetwood', 'R', 'In 1980s Beirut, Mason Skiles is a former U.S. diplomat who is called back into service to save a colleague from the group that is possibly responsible for his own family''s death. Meanwhile, a CIA field agent who is working under cover at the American embassy is tasked with keeping Mason alive and ensuring that the mission is a success.', 'In 1980s Beirut, Mason Skiles is a former U.S. diplomat who is called back into service to save a colleague from the group that is possibly responsible for his own family''s death. Meanwhile, a CIA field agent who is working under cover at the American embassy is tasked with keeping Mason alive and ensuring that the mission is a success.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s2qIeFsI9TskZr1LkSwljQDh5nl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:399248'),
  ('1144150345769338120', 'Beirut Hotel', 2011, 'Romance, Drama', 'Danielle Arbid, Pierric Gantelmi d''Ille', 'Vincent Dieutre, Danielle Arbid', 'Darine Hamze, Rodney El Haddad, Charles Berling, Karl Sarafidis, Fadi Abi Samra, Paul Mattar, Randa Kaadeh, Carole Ammoun', null, 'One evening, a married young singer Zoha meets the French lawyer Mathieu in a night club in Beirut. Mathieu will become suspected of spying, while Zoha is trying to flee from her husband. Despite these problems, the two will witness a love story for few days mixed with violence and fear.', 'One evening, a married young singer Zoha meets the French lawyer Mathieu in a night club in Beirut. Mathieu will become suspected of spying, while Zoha is trying to flee from her husband. Despite these problems, the two will witness a love story for few days mixed with violence and fear.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AfHzNa8xy65TNWX3CNNjjRTyKkI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85179'),
  ('399546417340419928', 'Bekas', 2012, 'Drama', 'Rebin Chalak, Michael Lundin, Bina Qeredaxi', 'Karzan Kader', 'Zamand Taha, Sarwar Fazil, Diya Mariwan, Suliman Karim Mohamad, Rahim Hussen, Abdulrahman Mohamad, Shirwan Mohamad, Bahadin Halabjai', null, 'Two shoeshiner homeless brothers named Zana and Dana live on the edge of survival. They catch a glimpse of Superman through a hole in the wall at the local cinema and decide that they want to go to America in order to meet Superman.', 'Two shoeshiner homeless brothers named Zana and Dana live on the edge of survival. They catch a glimpse of Superman through a hole in the wall at the local cinema and decide that they want to go to America in order to meet Superman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A4iOMaO2Y2udxSmLq3ifZ6A8n0J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:224746'),
  ('184683702989056575', 'Bekçiler Kralı', 1979, 'Comedy', 'Osman F. Seden', 'Osman F. Seden', 'Kemal Sunal, Semra Türel, Reha Yurdakul, Alpay İzer, Yaşar Şener, Hakkı Kıvanç, Mustafa Yavuz, Ahmet Kostarika', null, 'The story of a guard who revolts because of exploiting reeve and tradespeople. People start to think he has an uncle working in the ministry of the interior.', 'The story of a guard who revolts because of exploiting reeve and tradespeople. People start to think he has an uncle working in the ministry of the interior.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ndJmGQYyuSkoMl1KKjkT2OphwsP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80838'),
  ('382785527629704450', 'Beket', 2009, 'Drama', 'Davide Manuli, Tarek Ben Abdallah, Tommaso Valente', 'Davide Manuli', 'Luciano Curreli, Jérôme Duranteau, Simona Caramelli, Fabrizio Gifuni, Paolo Rossi, Roberto Antoni, Simone Maludrottu, Letizia Filippi', null, 'Freak and Jajà, like Vladimir and Estragon, are in a no man’s land, with no date or time. Earth is no longer inhabited by humans but a few strange survivors who appear from time to time. The two protagonists, strangers to each other, meet at a bus stop in the middle of nowhere.', 'Freak and Jajà, like Vladimir and Estragon, are in a no man’s land, with no date or time. Earth is no longer inhabited by humans but a few strange survivors who appear from time to time. The two protagonists, strangers to each other, meet at a bus stop in the middle of nowhere.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ycJKXEsqEFK69bgEhlLQ8zrCwHU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:196357'),
  ('384730302122357867', 'Bel Ami', 2012, 'Romance, Drama', 'Nick Ormerod, Declan Donnellan, Stefano Falivene', 'Rachel Bennette', 'Robert Pattinson, Uma Thurman, Christina Ricci, Kristin Scott Thomas, Colm Meaney, Philip Glenister, Holliday Grainger, Natalia Tena', 'R', 'Georges Duroy travels through 1890s Paris, from cockroach ridden garrets to opulent salons, using his wits and powers of seduction to rise from poverty to wealth, from a prostitute’s embrace to passionate trysts with wealthy beauties, in a world where politics and media jostle for influence, where sex is power and celebrity an obsession.', 'Georges Duroy travels through 1890s Paris, from cockroach ridden garrets to opulent salons, using his wits and powers of seduction to rise from poverty to wealth, from a prostitute’s embrace to passionate trysts with wealthy beauties, in a world where politics and media jostle for influence, where sex is power and celebrity an obsession.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/59bgVtpX6MPy2d5zberJiRNkDDx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86467'),
  ('794049526322840134', 'Bel Canto', 2018, 'Drama, Music, Romance, Thriller', 'Jesse Nye, Paul Weitz, Tobias Datum', 'Paul Weitz, Anthony Weintraub', 'Julianne Moore, Ken Watanabe, Sebastian Koch, Ryo Kase, Tenoch Huerta Mejía, Noé Hernández, Johnny Ortiz, María Mercedes Coroy', null, 'A famous opera singer is held hostage in South America by a guerrilla rebel group after performing at a Japanese businessman''s lavish birthday party. Unexpected bonds are forged in the standoff that ensues.', 'A famous opera singer is held hostage in South America by a guerrilla rebel group after performing at a Japanese businessman''s lavish birthday party. Unexpected bonds are forged in the standoff that ensues.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2pRvnOhFdANmdzDXfuLlZV9jwSb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:519255'),
  ('711546218670539705', 'Bela Donna', 1998, 'Drama, Romance', 'Fábio Barreto, Félix "Chango" Monti', 'Amy Ephron', 'Natasha Henstridge, Eduardo Moscovis, Andrew McCarthy, Florinda Bolkan, Sophie Ward, Odilon Wagner, Letícia Sabatella, Guilherme Karan', null, 'American couple move to the State of Ceará, Brazil, in the 1930s. The husband is looking for oil. His beautiful wife, Donna, soon falls in love with a rude but charming fisherman. The forbidden romance may destroy her marriage and upset the morals of the small village where they live.', 'American couple move to the State of Ceará, Brazil, in the 1930s. The husband is looking for oil. His beautiful wife, Donna, soon falls in love with a rude but charming fisherman. The forbidden romance may destroy her marriage and upset the morals of the small village where they live.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tdML9yUpXnm2VKwju6UzjcHa7z1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71211'),
  ('960614682528364942', 'Bela Kiss: Prologue', 2013, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Gilles Förstner, Lucien Förstner, Sven Latzke', 'Lucien Förstner', 'Kristina Klebe, Rudolf Martin, Fabian Stumm, Ben Bela Böhm, Janina Elkin, Angus McGruther, Julia Horvath, Jörg Koslowsky', null, 'A true story, Bela Kiss was one of the the most brutal serial killers, who killed 23 young women during the beginning of the first World War. The blood-drained bodies were found in metal barrels, conserved in alcohol. According to rumors, he was still seen decades later, in different parts of the world. He never was found and so the whereabouts of this man are unknown, even today. Almost a century later, five bank robbers search for a hideaway in a remote hotel, as they flee from the police. Brutal and unforeseen events take overhand and build a bridge to the past. The assumed safe house turns into a nightmare... is Bela Kiss still alive?', 'A true story, Bela Kiss was one of the the most brutal serial killers, who killed 23 young women during the beginning of the first World War. The blood-drained bodies were found in metal barrels, conserved in alcohol. According to rumors, he was still seen decades later, in different parts of the world. He never was found and so the whereabouts of this man are unknown, even today. Almost a century later, five bank robbers search for a hideaway in a remote hotel, as they flee from the police. Brutal and unforeseen events take overhand and build a bridge to the past. The assumed safe house turns into a nightmare... is Bela Kiss still alive?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n4AhIoEZW4cGCohaGY988vsdYHl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:155288'),
  ('496936506797044035', 'Bela Lugosi Meets a Brooklyn Gorilla', 1952, 'Comedy, Science Fiction, Horror', 'William Beaudine, Charles Van Enger', 'Tim Ryan', 'Bela Lugosi, Duke Mitchell, Sammy Petrillo, Charlita, Muriel Landers, Al Kikume, Mickey Simpson, Milton Newberger', null, 'The Singer Duke Mitchell meets Sammy Petrillo in this parody of Martin & Lewis. They arrive on a jungle island, where a mad scientist played by Bela Lugosi makes human experiments.', 'The Singer Duke Mitchell meets Sammy Petrillo in this parody of Martin & Lewis. They arrive on a jungle island, where a mad scientist played by Bela Lugosi makes human experiments.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oW9A5kF7nbqdhGEPIFWAGTSsqVJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38404'),
  ('1142677578440242527', 'Belarmino', 1964, 'Documentary, Drama', 'Fernando Lopes, Augusto Cabrita', 'Fernando Lopes', 'Belarmino Fragoso, Maria Amélia Fragoso, Ana Paula Fragoso, Júlia Buisel, Bernardo Moreira, Jean Pierre Gebler, Maria Teresa de Noronha', null, 'A portrait of Belarmino Fragoso, a veteran boxer in Lisbon nearing the end of his career. In a blend of reportage and re-enactment, the many vices of the once national featherweight champion are revealed against a background of the grim economics of boxing in 1960s Portugal.', 'A portrait of Belarmino Fragoso, a veteran boxer in Lisbon nearing the end of his career. In a blend of reportage and re-enactment, the many vices of the once national featherweight champion are revealed against a background of the grim economics of boxing in 1960s Portugal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nJ9iqcA78sXBVhQOPoSDp0IWd3W.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:154019'),
  ('1122637435599873160', 'Belcebu', 2005, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Sergio Blasco', 'Sergio Blasco', 'Óscar Pastor, Sergio Blasco, M. Angeles Paúl, Rubén Rodríguez, María de los Ángeles Morales , Cloti Valero, Mapi Romero, Ramón Blanco Solaz', null, 'Gore-splattered Spanish horror film. Satan, personified as a lustful lesbian rock chick, seduces satanic rock idol Belcebu, who through his lyrics regularly encourages his fans to commit suicide. Satan offers him eternal life as a rock star - the only catch being his voluptuous ex-girlfriend, who is determined at all costs to stop him on his quest for world domination...', 'Gore-splattered Spanish horror film. Satan, personified as a lustful lesbian rock chick, seduces satanic rock idol Belcebu, who through his lyrics regularly encourages his fans to commit suicide. Satan offers him eternal life as a rock star - the only catch being his voluptuous ex-girlfriend, who is determined at all costs to stop him on his quest for world domination...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/udbZ9PfoD2tropE0G39cipxk6lE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:89810'),
  ('957305754825304346', 'Belén', 2025, 'Drama', 'Dolores Fonzi, Santiago Masip, Mariana Cavagnaro Rouge', 'Dolores Fonzi, Laura Paredes, Agustina San Martín', 'Dolores Fonzi, Camila Plaate, Laura Paredes, Julieta Cardinali, Luis Machín, César Troncoso, Sergio Prina, Liliana Juárez', 'R', 'In the conservative northwestern region of Argentina, Julieta finds herself accused of infanticide after a medical emergency. With support from her attorney and women''s rights advocates, she fights for justice in a landmark case that could change lives.', 'In the conservative northwestern region of Argentina, Julieta finds herself accused of infanticide after a medical emergency. With support from her attorney and women''s rights advocates, she fights for justice in a landmark case that could change lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4UQ8qAtYeOrUQL3I44foCBfuwUl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1301844'),
  ('1147852523662839235', 'Belfast', 2021, 'Drama, History', 'Haris Zambarloukos, Dominic Masters, Martin Curry', 'Kenneth Branagh', 'Jude Hill, Jamie Dornan, Caitríona Balfe, Lewis McAskie, Judi Dench, Ciarán Hinds, Lara McDonnell, Colin Morgan', 'PG-13', 'Buddy is a young boy on the cusp of adolescence, whose life is filled with familial love, childhood hijinks, and a blossoming romance. Yet, with his beloved hometown caught up in increasing turmoil, his family faces a momentous choice: hope the conflict will pass or leave everything they know behind for a new life.', 'Buddy is a young boy on the cusp of adolescence, whose life is filled with familial love, childhood hijinks, and a blossoming romance. Yet, with his beloved hometown caught up in increasing turmoil, his family faces a momentous choice: hope the conflict will pass or leave everything they know behind for a new life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4xs6nHNBjYpRymw8ZQmnVIbJ8Xa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:777270'),
  ('388893299977769663', 'Belfast, Maine', 1999, 'Documentary', 'Frederick Wiseman, John Davey, Lawrence Dodds', null, null, null, 'A film about ordinary experience in a beautiful old New England port city. It is a portrait of daily life with particular emphasis on the work and the cultural life of the community. Among the activities shown in the film are the work of lobstermen, tug-boat operators, factory workers, shop owners, city counselors, doctors, judges, policemen, teachers, social workers, nurses and ministers. Cultural activities include choir rehearsal, dance class, music lessons and theatre production.', 'A film about ordinary experience in a beautiful old New England port city. It is a portrait of daily life with particular emphasis on the work and the cultural life of the community. Among the activities shown in the film are the work of lobstermen, tug-boat operators, factory workers, shop owners, city counselors, doctors, judges, policemen, teachers, social workers, nurses and ministers. Cultural activities include choir rehearsal, dance class, music lessons and theatre production.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bycGZmokSgvV3wiHZ1xUsTZZh4K.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84661'),
  ('340380321798214283', 'Belgica', 2016, 'Drama', 'Ruben Impens, Felix van Groeningen', 'Felix van Groeningen, Arne Sierens', 'Stef Aerts, Tom Vermeir, Dominique Van Malder, Ben Benaouisse, Boris Van Severen, Sara de Bosschere, Charlotte Vandermeersch, Stefaan De Winter', null, 'The story of two brothers who, even though they have absolutely nothing in common, open a bar together that quickly becomes a regular hangout for nighthawks. Despite the success, they must soon face up to the difficulties inherent in running a family business. Their brotherhood turns into rivalry, through no fault of their own.', 'The story of two brothers who, even though they have absolutely nothing in common, open a bar together that quickly becomes a regular hangout for nighthawks. Despite the success, they must soon face up to the difficulties inherent in running a family business. Their brotherhood turns into rivalry, through no fault of their own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5HMeqtWczMYJ7z3e4GwdXIrj7XF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:330697'),
  ('1025664680430381454', 'Believe in Christmas', 2024, 'TV Movie, Romance, Comedy', 'Christie Will Wolf, Becky Parsons', 'Maggie Dallen, Christie Will Wolf', 'Meghan Ory, John Reardon, Lindura, Kevin Hanchard, Cathy Jones, Kirstin Howell, Bob Mann, Aria Publicover', null, 'Two best friends travel to Christmasland, a place filled with hope and miracles.', 'Two best friends travel to Christmasland, a place filled with hope and miracles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sJklrstcV9xWTcVTK5SAiBIsfQW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1361215'),
  ('995608328247563697', 'Believe: The Eddie Izzard Story', 2009, 'Comedy, Documentary', 'Sarah Townsend', 'Sarah Townsend', 'Eddie Izzard, Sarah Townsend, George Clooney, Steve Coogan, Robin Williams', null, 'The story of one person''s triumph over adversity: cameras followed the comedian on a very stressful comeback tour and caught the story behind some of her best loved material en route. Prior to her Sexie tour in 2003 and under extreme pressure to write, she delved into her own life for inspiration. So began an accidental voyage into her past that paralleled her world tour and culminated in a moment of revelation about the source of her relentless drive. Film contains exclusive never-before-seen footage including the famous ''wolves'' material, Izzard''s first student sketches and unicycle-riding as a street performer in Covent Garden. Hilarious and moving by turns, an inspiring tale of how tragedy can be turned to laughter.', 'The story of one person''s triumph over adversity: cameras followed the comedian on a very stressful comeback tour and caught the story behind some of her best loved material en route. Prior to her Sexie tour in 2003 and under extreme pressure to write, she delved into her own life for inspiration. So began an accidental voyage into her past that paralleled her world tour and culminated in a moment of revelation about the source of her relentless drive. Film contains exclusive never-before-seen footage including the famous ''wolves'' material, Izzard''s first student sketches and unicycle-riding as a street performer in Covent Garden. Hilarious and moving by turns, an inspiring tale of how tragedy can be turned to laughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9YZDTjYrfR6qwxWRBqgvdBhffPk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40150'),
  ('287663596290767092', 'Believer', 2018, 'Crime, Action, Thriller', 'Hong Seung-chul, Lee Hae-young, Kim Tae-kyeong', 'Yau Nai-Hoi, Wai Ka-Fai', 'Cho Jin-woong, Ryu Jun-yeol, Kim Joo-hyuk, Cha Seung-won, Kim Sung-ryung, Park Hae-joon, Nam Moon-chul, Seo Hyun-woo', null, 'After a traumatic event, a drug trafficker turns sides and conspires with a dangerously ambitious undercover police officer to bring down the mysterious kingpin of a major drug cartel.', 'After a traumatic event, a drug trafficker turns sides and conspires with a dangerously ambitious undercover police officer to bring down the mysterious kingpin of a major drug cartel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8mXEq5vomTKsR5YTQIgLj1b2phZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:518963'),
  ('847741588794767535', 'Believer 2', 2023, 'Thriller, Action, Crime', 'Baik, Kim Tae-kyeong, Hong Seung-chul', 'Wai Ka-Fai, Yau Nai-Hoi', 'Cho Jin-woong, Cha Seung-won, Han Hyo-joo, Oh Seung-hoon, Lee Zoo-young, Kim Dong-young, Jung Jun-won, Seo Ha-jung', 'R', 'A determined detective continues his search for the truth behind Asia''s largest drug organization and its elusive boss he has unfinished business with.', 'A determined detective continues his search for the truth behind Asia''s largest drug organization and its elusive boss he has unfinished business with.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g9aDZSqH5KmsHbMurhni5d2wq6q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:958263'),
  ('1104143464573397480', 'Believers', 2007, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Daniel Myrick', 'Daniel Myrick, Julia Fair', 'Johnny Messner, Jon Huertas, Kyle Adahl, Nino Aldi, June Angela, Elizabeth Bogush, John Farley, Carolyn Hennesy', 'R', 'Two paramedics responding to an emergency call find themselves kidnapped by a religious sect whose great obsession is to stop the end of the world by committing suicide and killing people.', 'Two paramedics responding to an emergency call find themselves kidnapped by a religious sect whose great obsession is to stop the end of the world by committing suicide and killing people.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9KEjkM8M6AU1D5jCnikJR5hN6qP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22551'),
  ('1048699214673950596', 'Believers', 2022, 'Drama', 'Hideo Jojo, Tetsuya Kudô, Toshiya Kominami', 'Hideo Jojo', 'Hayato Isomura, Shohei Uno, Yui Kitamura, Katsuya Maiguma, Naoki Yamamoto', null, 'On a small island somewhere near Japan, three cult members have devoted themselves to the "Deserted Island Program". Calling each other by rank, these people-two men and one women-have been chosen by their superiors to throw off the corrupt influence of modern society and "purify" themselves. But as time passes two of the members begin to give into human desire.', 'On a small island somewhere near Japan, three cult members have devoted themselves to the "Deserted Island Program". Calling each other by rank, these people-two men and one women-have been chosen by their superiors to throw off the corrupt influence of modern society and "purify" themselves. But as time passes two of the members begin to give into human desire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o6gF3tCiMwGKM5M9DvgH8sEPXFu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:987573'),
  ('32292326179371122', 'Bell Bottom', 2021, 'Action, Thriller', 'Parvez Shaikh, Ranjit Tiwari, Rajeev Ravi', 'Aseem Arora, Parveez Shaikh', 'Akshay Kumar, Huma Qureshi, Adil Hussain, Lara Dutta, Vaani Kapoor, Denzil Smith, Aniruddh Dave, Thalaivasal Vijay', null, 'By the early ‘80s, India had already witnessed multiple airplane hijacks. In 1984, the country was made to face another such challenge. BellBottom, a RAW Agent, sees through the plan and thus begins India''s first overseas covert operation. An operation, lead by a forgotten hero, that went on to create one of the most defining moments for India.', 'By the early ‘80s, India had already witnessed multiple airplane hijacks. In 1984, the country was made to face another such challenge. BellBottom, a RAW Agent, sees through the plan and thus begins India''s first overseas covert operation. An operation, lead by a forgotten hero, that went on to create one of the most defining moments for India.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aSY5LBwNdpMReaZjGBbcB1kvrHU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:721048'),
  ('532660637100094341', 'Bell from Hell', 1974, 'Drama, Horror, Thriller', 'Claudio Guerín Hill, Juan Antonio Bardem, Manuel Rojas', 'Santiago Moncada', 'Renaud Verley, Viveca Lindfors, Alfredo Mayo, Maribel Martín, Nuria Gimeno, Christina von Blanc, Saturno Cerra, Nicole Vesperini', 'NR', 'When John is released from a psychiatric center where he has been hospitalized for a long time, he decides to move into the house of his dead mother, whose inheritance is in dispute.', 'When John is released from a psychiatric center where he has been hospitalized for a long time, he decides to move into the house of his dead mother, whose inheritance is in dispute.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nrUFmBvg41uGKwOFZHHk5hlMMe6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52849'),
  ('430169057063864819', 'Bell Hoppy', 1954, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Robert McKimson', null, 'Mel Blanc, Tedd Pierce', null, 'Sylvester has been "blackballed" out of membership to the Loyal Order of Alley Cats Mouse and Chowder Club again. To gain the long-coveted membership, the Grand Master offers to let the lisping puddy tat place a big bell around the neck of the largest mouse he can find, so the cats can pounce on the mouse when they hear the bell. Just as that''s going on, Hippety Hopper escapes from a city zoo truck. It''s not long before he encounters the hapless Sylvester. Each attempt to place the bell around Hippety''s neck ends with Sylvester wearing the bell (and the cats pounding the puddy into submission). In the end, Sylvester finally does get the bell around Hippety''s neck, but by the time the cats are ready to pounce on the baby kangaroo-mistaken-for-a-giant-mouse, Hippety has been recaptured. The oblivious cats end up jumping in front of the city zoo truck! Sylvester now gets to serve as Loyal Order''s Grand Master.', 'Sylvester has been "blackballed" out of membership to the Loyal Order of Alley Cats Mouse and Chowder Club again. To gain the long-coveted membership, the Grand Master offers to let the lisping puddy tat place a big bell around the neck of the largest mouse he can find, so the cats can pounce on the mouse when they hear the bell. Just as that''s going on, Hippety Hopper escapes from a city zoo truck. It''s not long before he encounters the hapless Sylvester. Each attempt to place the bell around Hippety''s neck ends with Sylvester wearing the bell (and the cats pounding the puddy into submission). In the end, Sylvester finally does get the bell around Hippety''s neck, but by the time the cats are ready to pounce on the baby kangaroo-mistaken-for-a-giant-mouse, Hippety has been recaptured. The oblivious cats end up jumping in front of the city zoo truck! Sylvester now gets to serve as Loyal Order''s Grand Master.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7P8pPy7GQ1iMN1Q4bHyDFMFvDdK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:235781'),
  ('1024965052364746870', 'Bell, Book and Candle', 1958, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Romance', 'Richard Quine, James Wong Howe, Irving J. Moore', 'Daniel Taradash', 'James Stewart, Kim Novak, Jack Lemmon, Ernie Kovacs, Hermione Gingold, Elsa Lanchester, Janice Rule, Philippe Clay', 'NR', 'Gillian Holroyd, a modern-day witch, becomes smitten with her handsome upstairs neighbor, Shep Henderson. Using her magical powers, she casts a love spell on him, only to face unexpected complications when genuine feelings emerge, threatening her supernatural abilities.', 'Gillian Holroyd, a modern-day witch, becomes smitten with her handsome upstairs neighbor, Shep Henderson. Using her magical powers, she casts a love spell on him, only to face unexpected complications when genuine feelings emerge, threatening her supernatural abilities.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z3MLtVFPT2wIkKCBSE2yBgDmeXI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2006'),
  ('928855419557340045', 'Bella', 2006, 'Drama, Romance', 'Alejandro Monteverde, Andrew Cadelago', 'Alejandro Monteverde', 'Eduardo Verástegui, Tammy Blanchard, Manny Perez, Angélica Aragón, Jamie Tirelli, Ramón Rodríguez, Armando Riesco, Sophie Nyweide', 'PG-13', 'An international soccer star is on his way to sign a multimillion dollar contract when something happens that brings his career to an abrupt end. A beautiful waitress, struggling to make it in New York City, discovers something about herself that she''s unprepared for. In one irreversible moment, their lives are turned upside down.', 'An international soccer star is on his way to sign a multimillion dollar contract when something happens that brings his career to an abrupt end. A beautiful waitress, struggling to make it in New York City, discovers something about herself that she''s unprepared for. In one irreversible moment, their lives are turned upside down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bNMzx71jw8OU9indcV5Hc7eE53w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12586'),
  ('478254601652550088', 'Bella Mafia', 1997, 'Drama, Crime', 'David Greene, Gordon Lonsdale', null, 'Vanessa Redgrave, Dennis Farina, Nastassja Kinski, Jennifer Tilly, Illeana Douglas, James Marsden, Gina Philips, Richard Portnow', 'R', 'Following the brutal murder of her husband and male kin, Sophia unites with her mother-in-law and sisters-in-law, in a fierce quest for vengeance against their enemies.', 'Following the brutal murder of her husband and male kin, Sophia unites with her mother-in-law and sisters-in-law, in a fierce quest for vengeance against their enemies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4xHvnDHzcRKP9aaDaj823WSiD3Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82077'),
  ('701014756138073101', 'Belladonna of Sadness', 1973, 'Animation, Drama, Fantasy', 'Eiichi Yamamoto, Gisaburō Sugii, Atsumi Tashiro', 'Yoshiyuki Fukuda, Eiichi Yamamoto', 'Aiko Nagayama, Takao Itō, Tatsuya Nakadai, Masaya Takahashi, Shigako Shimegi, Masakane Yonekura, Natsuka Yashiro', null, 'An evil feudal lord rapes a village girl on her wedding night and proceeds to ruin her and her husband''s lives. After she''s eventually banished from her village, the girl makes a pact with the devil to gain magical ability and take revenge.', 'An evil feudal lord rapes a village girl on her wedding night and proceeds to ruin her and her husband''s lives. After she''s eventually banished from her village, the girl makes a pact with the devil to gain magical ability and take revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2okYZVVw7RdMwlOKcAJsQ7Nsrpr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64847'),
  ('896083680849208933', 'Bellamy', 2009, 'Drama, Crime', 'Claude Chabrol, Eduardo Serra', 'Odile Barski, Claude Chabrol', 'Gérard Depardieu, Clovis Cornillac, Marie Bunel, Jacques Gamblin, Vahina Giocante, Marie Matheron, Adrienne Pauly, Yves Verhoeven', 'NR', 'A well known Parisian inspector becomes involved in an investigation while on holiday.', 'A well known Parisian inspector becomes involved in an investigation while on holiday.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l1BSVVS4byoPRqm9MeYvlTZin3G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15576'),
  ('1136878362929395193', 'Bellas De Noche', 1975, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'Miguel M. Delgado', 'Francisco Cavazos', 'Jorge Rivero, Sasha Montenegro, Eduardo de la Peña, Carmen Salinas, Mabel Luna, Rosa Carmina, Leticia Perdigón, Raúl ''Chato'' Padilla', null, 'The Boxer Germán Bronco Torres loses his license, and works as bouncer at the cabaret El Pirulí, where he falls for the fichera Carmen, and befriends of the pimp Margarito Fuensanta El Vaselinas, who lost a bet and has to pay to a gangsters. For 500 pesos for El Vaselinas, Bronco prepares a trap in the cabaret to the taxi driver Raul, to seduce his girlfriend, not knowing that the victim is his own sister Lupita.', 'The Boxer Germán Bronco Torres loses his license, and works as bouncer at the cabaret El Pirulí, where he falls for the fichera Carmen, and befriends of the pimp Margarito Fuensanta El Vaselinas, who lost a bet and has to pay to a gangsters. For 500 pesos for El Vaselinas, Bronco prepares a trap in the cabaret to the taxi driver Raul, to seduce his girlfriend, not knowing that the victim is his own sister Lupita.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5ViC0a9Kkt4bpTXThmNnn1Miswz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:338044'),
  ('880843970292841304', 'Bellas De Noche 2 - Las Ficheras', 1977, 'Comedy', 'Miguel M. Delgado', 'Francisco Cavazos, Víctor Manuel Castro', 'Jorge Rivero, Sasha Montenegro, Carmen Salinas, Eduardo de la Peña, Mabel Luna, Lyn May, Víctor Manuel Castro, Rafael Inclán', null, 'Bellas de noche continues. The ex-fichera who bought the cabaret continues to work with several of her former companions, the waiter Fabian, the pugilist Bronco who returns to boxing, Carmen, his wife, who returns to booking, the drunk “La Corcholata”, in love with an old man, and a French woman and the pimp “El Vaselinas”, whose favors are disputed by all the women, but who loses his virility and fights to regain it.', 'Bellas de noche continues. The ex-fichera who bought the cabaret continues to work with several of her former companions, the waiter Fabian, the pugilist Bronco who returns to boxing, Carmen, his wife, who returns to booking, the drunk “La Corcholata”, in love with an old man, and a French woman and the pimp “El Vaselinas”, whose favors are disputed by all the women, but who loses his virility and fights to regain it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xTMoo9Q1KYQLefMQhEHU2Mz8wSL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:204962'),
  ('544189649803758557', 'Bellboy Donald', 1942, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Jack King', null, 'Clarence Nash, John McLeish, Glen Couch', 'NR', 'Donald tries his best to be polite and dignified as a hotel bellboy. But when his first guest is Pete Junior, the job is next to impossible.', 'Donald tries his best to be polite and dignified as a hotel bellboy. But when his first guest is Pete Junior, the job is next to impossible.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/whDoYG0wt6ie9bbStx9B2NpSbBR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53458'),
  ('479243898217293314', 'Belle', 1973, 'Drama', 'André Delvaux, Charles Van Damme, Ghislain Cloquet', 'Monique Rysselinck, André Delvaux', 'Jean-Luc Bideau, Danièle Delorme, Adriana Bogdan, Roger Coggio, René Hainaux, Stéphane Excoffier, John Dobrynine, Valerio Popesco', null, 'Mathieu Grégoire is an esteemed author who lives in Spa with his wife and daughter and leads a carefully structured life. One day, while out in the desolate landscape of the High Fens he meets a mysterious woman whom he calls ''Belle''. An obsessive passion is kindled in Mathieu and in a short space of time he loses all control over his existence.', 'Mathieu Grégoire is an esteemed author who lives in Spa with his wife and daughter and leads a carefully structured life. One day, while out in the desolate landscape of the High Fens he meets a mysterious woman whom he calls ''Belle''. An obsessive passion is kindled in Mathieu and in a short space of time he loses all control over his existence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3wZiLFSHVKKskWizZZ0rdVZzHOd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81912'),
  ('816892550339169217', 'Belle', 2013, 'Drama', 'Amma Asante, Luke Hull, Ben Smith', 'Misan Sagay', 'Gugu Mbatha-Raw, Tom Wilkinson, Sam Reid, Emily Watson, Sarah Gadon, Miranda Richardson, Penelope Wilton, Tom Felton', 'PG', 'Dido Elizabeth Bell, the illegitimate, mixed-race daughter of a Royal Navy admiral, plays an important role in the campaign to abolish slavery in England.', 'Dido Elizabeth Bell, the illegitimate, mixed-race daughter of a Royal Navy admiral, plays an important role in the campaign to abolish slavery in England.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qCK00C3L0bM5jphoYU0gFpG3Hly.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:205601'),
  ('54430656065153152', 'Belle', 2021, 'Animation, Science Fiction, Drama, Music', 'Ryo Horibe, Yohei Shimozawa, Takaaki Yamashita', 'Mamoru Hosoda', 'Kaho Nakamura, Ryo Narita, Shota Sometani, Tina Tamashiro, Lilas Ikuta, Ryoko Moriyama, Michiko Shimizu, Fuyumi Sakamoto', 'PG', 'Suzu is a 17-year-old high-school student living in a rural town with her father. Wounded by the loss of her mother at a young age, Suzu one day discovers the massive online world "U" and dives into this alternate reality as her avatar, Belle. Before long, all of U''s eyes are fixed on Belle, when, suddenly, a mysterious, dragon-like figure appears before her.', 'Suzu is a 17-year-old high-school student living in a rural town with her father. Wounded by the loss of her mother at a young age, Suzu one day discovers the massive online world "U" and dives into this alternate reality as her avatar, Belle. Before long, all of U''s eyes are fixed on Belle, when, suddenly, a mysterious, dragon-like figure appears before her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fYHOD4pxZQk4rsP2tQrZI5uBlZV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:776305'),
  ('87487925624609867', 'Belle', 2025, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Amandine Escoffier, Caroline Champetier, Benoît Jacquot', 'Benoît Jacquot, Julien Boivent', 'Guillaume Canet, Charlotte Gainsbourg, Patrick Descamps, Jérémie Covillault, Anne-Lise Heimburger, Fabio Zenoni, Salim Kéchiouche, Pauline Nyrls', null, 'A couple have a peaceful existence in a small provincial town. He is a teacher and she runs an opticians practical. Their life is turned upside when Belle, a friend’s daughter who is lodging with them, is found dead in her room. The husband becomes the prime suspect as the only one at home at the time.', 'A couple have a peaceful existence in a small provincial town. He is a teacher and she runs an opticians practical. Their life is turned upside when Belle, a friend’s daughter who is lodging with them, is found dead in her room. The husband becomes the prime suspect as the only one at home at the time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9jOZNmxiWl6gnn40IXYY7GKeX5k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1130863'),
  ('92006452348710490', 'Belle al bar', 1994, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Elena Leopardi, Blasco Giurato, Alessandro Benvenuti', 'Ugo Chiti, Nicola Zavagli, Alessandro Benvenuti', 'Alessandro Benvenuti, Eva Robin''s, Andrea Brambilla, Giovanni Pellegrino, Augusto Terenzi, Assumpta Serna, Anna Casalino, Clelia Fradella', null, 'During a marriage crisis, unhappy Leo has to go to another town for work. There he meets his long-lost cousin Giulio, who has become... Giulia, a very charming girl.', 'During a marriage crisis, unhappy Leo has to go to another town for work. There he meets his long-lost cousin Giulio, who has become... Giulia, a very charming girl.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/no56CIgAGzfpB1JlRpO121uArhZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:92074'),
  ('967812024029983067', 'Belle and Sebastian', 2013, 'Adventure', 'Nicolas Vanier, Éric Guichard, Michael Berreby', 'Nicolas Vanier, Fabien Suarez, Juliette Sales', 'Félix Bossuet, Tchéky Karyo, Dimitri Storoge, Mehdi El Glaoui, Andreas Pietschmann, Urbain Cancelier, Margaux Chatelier, Paloma Palma', null, 'Belle and Sebastian is set high in the snowy Alps during the Second World War. The resourceful Sebastian is a lonely boy who tames and befriends a giant, wild mountain dog, Belle – even though the villagers believe her to be ‘the beast’ that has been killing their sheep.', 'Belle and Sebastian is set high in the snowy Alps during the Second World War. The resourceful Sebastian is a lonely boy who tames and befriends a giant, wild mountain dog, Belle – even though the villagers believe her to be ‘the beast’ that has been killing their sheep.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/km3ogCGHmlL7M4msTU6pWcJFpRu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:204668'),
  ('341234529867349661', 'Belle and Sebastian 3: The Last Chapter', 2018, 'Adventure, Family', 'Clovis Cornillac, Thierry Pouget', 'Juliette Sales, Fabien Suarez', 'Félix Bossuet, Clovis Cornillac, Tchéky Karyo, Thierry Neuvic, Margaux Chatelier, André Penvern, Anne Benoît, Lilou Fogli', null, '12 year-old Sebastian has decided not to follow his father and Angelina to Canada, deciding to stay in the alps to watch over Belle who has now become the mother of three beautiful pups. When a stranger arrives claiming to be Belle’s rightful owner, Sebastian will do all it takes to protect his best friend and her little ones.', '12 year-old Sebastian has decided not to follow his father and Angelina to Canada, deciding to stay in the alps to watch over Belle who has now become the mother of three beautiful pups. When a stranger arrives claiming to be Belle’s rightful owner, Sebastian will do all it takes to protect his best friend and her little ones.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5LGqOaSFa7cwyvtt7OWxvbWkRA2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:434358'),
  ('1052584958042747328', 'Belle and Sebastian: Next Generation', 2022, 'Adventure, Family, Drama', 'Pierre Coré, Lauriane Sire, Valérie Pangrazzi', 'Alexandre Coffre, Pierre Coré', 'Robinson Mensah-Rouanet, Caroline Anglade, Alice David, Michèle Laroque, Aurélien Recoing, Syrus Shahidi, Lou Lambrecht, Noa Faure-Duval', null, '10-year-old Sebastien reluctantly spends his vacation in the mountains with his grandmother and aunt. Helping them with the sheep is hardly an exciting prospect for a city boy like him - but that is without considering his encounter with Belle, a huge dog mistreated by her owner. Ready to do anything to fight injustice and to protect his new-found friend, Sebastien will spend the craziest summer of his life.', '10-year-old Sebastien reluctantly spends his vacation in the mountains with his grandmother and aunt. Helping them with the sheep is hardly an exciting prospect for a city boy like him - but that is without considering his encounter with Belle, a huge dog mistreated by her owner. Ready to do anything to fight injustice and to protect his new-found friend, Sebastien will spend the craziest summer of his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/84BVvOi5XZsWbH0arEulQZwz838.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:893364'),
  ('936807654765756092', 'Belle and Sebastian: The Adventure Continues', 2015, 'Adventure, Family', 'Christian Duguay, Christophe Graillot', 'Fabien Suarez, Juliette Sales', 'Félix Bossuet, Tchéky Karyo, Thierry Neuvic, Margaux Chatelier, Urbain Cancelier, Thylane Blondeau, Joseph Malerba, Ludi Boeken', null, 'September, 1945. Sebastian impatiently waits for the return of his friend Angelina, whom he has not seen for two years. When the plane carrying the young woman to her small village in the Alps is reported to have crashed in the mountains, Sebastian is convinced that Angelina is still alive. Along with his faithful dog Belle, Sebastian embarks on the most dangerous adventure of his life.', 'September, 1945. Sebastian impatiently waits for the return of his friend Angelina, whom he has not seen for two years. When the plane carrying the young woman to her small village in the Alps is reported to have crashed in the mountains, Sebastian is convinced that Angelina is still alive. Along with his faithful dog Belle, Sebastian embarks on the most dangerous adventure of his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ma4p0CbGvAXDqKBLPI5VNFRbzSg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:334304'),
  ('707706758586343960', 'Belle belle belle', 2020, 'TV Movie, Comedy', 'Anne Depétrini, Jennifer Peyrot', 'Yaël Berdugo, Nathalie Levy-Lang', 'Joséphine Draï, Reem Kherici, Arié Elmaleh, Jarry, Catherine Hosmalin, Déborah Lukumuena, Suzanne De Baecque, Macha Méril', null, 'Alice is a thirty-something woman with a lot of hang-ups. She thinks she''s ugly and fat, and her lack of self-confidence prevents her from doing anything, professionally or romantically. After a fall on her head, she wakes up convinced that she has magically become a beautiful girl. Armed with her new-found self-confidence, nothing stands in her way: she lands her dream job and finds love in Benjamin. But what happens if this illusion disappears? Will Alice be able to maintain the self-esteem that has been so lacking up to now?', 'Alice is a thirty-something woman with a lot of hang-ups. She thinks she''s ugly and fat, and her lack of self-confidence prevents her from doing anything, professionally or romantically. After a fall on her head, she wakes up convinced that she has magically become a beautiful girl. Armed with her new-found self-confidence, nothing stands in her way: she lands her dream job and finds love in Benjamin. But what happens if this illusion disappears? Will Alice be able to maintain the self-esteem that has been so lacking up to now?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7yqlXM86VroUmZJyQ9pIjYiZZne.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:778980'),
  ('880250785115833153', 'Belle de Jour', 1967, 'Drama, Romance', 'Sacha Vierny, Luis Buñuel, Marc Desages', 'Luis Buñuel, Jean-Claude Carrière', 'Catherine Deneuve, Jean Sorel, Michel Piccoli, Geneviève Page, Pierre Clémenti, Françoise Fabian, Macha Méril, Muni', 'R', 'Beautiful young housewife Séverine Serizy cannot reconcile her masochistic fantasies with her everyday life alongside dutiful husband Pierre. When her lovestruck friend Henri mentions a secretive high-class brothel run by Madame Anais, Séverine begins to work there during the day under the name Belle de Jour. But when one of her clients grows possessive, she must try to go back to her normal life.', 'Beautiful young housewife Séverine Serizy cannot reconcile her masochistic fantasies with her everyday life alongside dutiful husband Pierre. When her lovestruck friend Henri mentions a secretive high-class brothel run by Madame Anais, Séverine begins to work there during the day under the name Belle de Jour. But when one of her clients grows possessive, she must try to go back to her normal life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iUAFECovwPA0cVV9bo4uNGLJSGL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:649'),
  ('886468936062990319', 'Belle du Seigneur', 2012, 'Drama, Romance', 'Glenio Bonder, Eduardo Serra', 'Glenio Bonder, Vincenzo Cerami, James Dearden', 'Jonathan Rhys Meyers, Natalia Vodianova, Ed Stoppard, Marianne Faithfull, Maria Bonnevie, Janine Horsburgh, Leslie Woodhall, Jimmy de Brabant', null, 'English-language adaptation of Albert Cohen''s epic Swiss tale of a tortured love affair between a high-ranking Jewish official and the Protestant wife of one of his employees.', 'English-language adaptation of Albert Cohen''s epic Swiss tale of a tortured love affair between a high-ranking Jewish official and the Protestant wife of one of his employees.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/90pbOSh1EH2Xz6iOBYqEyaC9DXu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:201365'),
  ('581280531043891904', 'Belle épine', 2010, 'Drama', 'Rebecca Zlotowski, Georges Lechaptois, Jean-Baptiste Pouilloux', 'Marcia Romano, Christophe Mura', 'Léa Seydoux, Anaïs Demoustier, Johan Libéreau, Nicolas Maury, Guillaume Gouix, Agathe Schlencker, Anna Sigalevitch, Marie Matheron', null, 'After the death of her mother, 17-year-old Prudence finds herself living alone in her Paris apartment. Then she meets Maryline, a rebel of her own age, who introduces her to the thrills of motorcycle racing on the biker circuit at Rungis. Prudence’s newfound lease of freedom becomes complicated when she falls for a boy Franck who wastes no time in taking advantage of her naivety...', 'After the death of her mother, 17-year-old Prudence finds herself living alone in her Paris apartment. Then she meets Maryline, a rebel of her own age, who introduces her to the thrills of motorcycle racing on the biker circuit at Rungis. Prudence’s newfound lease of freedom becomes complicated when she falls for a boy Franck who wastes no time in taking advantage of her naivety...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/22MXstSxbiKCjAqHHmNkxvZEYIp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63319'),
  ('232671562125360224', 'Belle Époque', 1992, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Fernando Trueba, José Luis Alcaine, Jaime Botella', 'Rafael Azcona', 'Penélope Cruz, Miriam Díaz-Aroca, Gabino Diego, Fernando Fernán Gómez, Michel Galabru, Ariadna Gil, Agustín González, Chus Lampreave', null, 'In 1931, a young soldier deserts from the army and falls into a country farm, where he is welcomed by the owner due to his political ideas. Manolo has four daughters, Fernando likes all of them and they like him, so he has to decide which one to love.', 'In 1931, a young soldier deserts from the army and falls into a country farm, where he is welcomed by the owner due to his political ideas. Manolo has four daughters, Fernando likes all of them and they like him, so he has to decide which one to love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2pb7i9pI6wMH5dlyjbVTXdfSKun.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2470'),
  ('823463871882309851', 'Belle Maman', 1999, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Gabriel Aghion, Romain Winding', 'Gabriel Aghion, Danièle Thompson', 'Vincent Lindon, Mathilde Seigner, Line Renaud, Catherine Deneuve, Stéphane Audran, Danièle Lebrun, Jean Yanne, Artus de Penguern', null, 'At the altar where he is marrying Séverine, the groom, Antoine, gets his first glimpse of her mother, Léa, and suffers what the French call a coup de foudre which we know as love at first sight.', 'At the altar where he is marrying Séverine, the groom, Antoine, gets his first glimpse of her mother, Léa, and suffers what the French call a coup de foudre which we know as love at first sight.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p0z0DxMW2OgGGfrItzTKAEuBVsx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55705'),
  ('462636888538433751', 'Belle of the Nineties', 1934, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Leo McCarey', 'Mae West', 'Mae West, Roger Pryor, Johnny Mack Brown, John Miljan, Duke Ellington, Katherine DeMille, James Donlan, Stuart Holmes', 'NR', 'Nightclub entertainer Ruby Carter moves from St. Louis to New Orleans to escape Tiger Kid. At Ace Lamont''s club, she gains fame but faces drama with Ace''s ex Molly. A jewel theft and fixed fight lead to confrontations.', 'Nightclub entertainer Ruby Carter moves from St. Louis to New Orleans to escape Tiger Kid. At Ace Lamont''s club, she gains fame but faces drama with Ace''s ex Molly. A jewel theft and fixed fight lead to confrontations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6mAklasWR7bSDbMJLkzwu0fukoo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75880'),
  ('778863289612025797', 'Belle Starr', 1941, 'Western', 'Irving Cummings, Ernest Palmer, Ray Rennahan', 'Lamar Trotti', 'Gene Tierney, Randolph Scott, Dana Andrews, Shepperd Strudwick, Elizabeth Patterson, Chill Wills, Louise Beavers, Olin Howland', 'NR', 'After her family''s mansion is burned down by Yankee soldiers for hiding the rebel leader Captain Sam Starr Belle Shirley vows to take revenge. Breaking Starr out of prison, she joins his small guerrilla group for a series of raids on banks and railroads, carpetbaggers and enemy troops. Belle''s bravado during the attacks earns her a reputation among the locals as well as the love of Starr himself. The pair get married, but their relationship starts to break down when Sam Starr lets a couple of psychotic rebels into the gang, leaving Belle to wonder if he really cares about the Southern cause.', 'After her family''s mansion is burned down by Yankee soldiers for hiding the rebel leader Captain Sam Starr Belle Shirley vows to take revenge. Breaking Starr out of prison, she joins his small guerrilla group for a series of raids on banks and railroads, carpetbaggers and enemy troops. Belle''s bravado during the attacks earns her a reputation among the locals as well as the love of Starr himself. The pair get married, but their relationship starts to break down when Sam Starr lets a couple of psychotic rebels into the gang, leaving Belle to wonder if he really cares about the Southern cause.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wh535BiGbryCPtw18IZC6krXEMi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72473'),
  ('983790519648144486', 'Belle Starr''s Daughter', 1948, 'Western', 'Lesley Selander, William A. Sickner', 'W.R. Burnett', 'George Montgomery, Rod Cameron, Ruth Roman, Wallace Ford, Charles Kemper, William Phipps, Edith King, Fred Libby', 'NR', 'The daughter of famous outlaw Belle Starr arrives at the town where her mother was murdered to find her killer.', 'The daughter of famous outlaw Belle Starr arrives at the town where her mother was murdered to find her killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ygQ9tVe48tXx4U8rLfutMoThC9A.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:315530'),
  ('862149647599577941', 'Belle Toujours', 2006, 'Drama', 'Manoel de Oliveira, Sabine Lancelin, Ronan Denecé', 'Manoel de Oliveira', 'Michel Piccoli, Bulle Ogier, Ricardo Trêpa, Leonor Baldaque, Júlia Buisel, Lawrence Foster, Benoît Gourley, Jean-Yves Breton', null, '38 years after the events in the Luis Buñuel classic Belle du jour, Henri Husson thinks he sees Séverine one night at a concert. He follows her and makes her face her past and then takes a slow revenge on her.', '38 years after the events in the Luis Buñuel classic Belle du jour, Henri Husson thinks he sees Séverine one night at a concert. He follows her and makes her face her past and then takes a slow revenge on her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fy7ajB92MUB50uq9LhSrk3lEFoq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17367'),
  ('300349191946573689', 'Belle''s Magical World', 1998, 'Animation, Family', 'Cullen Blaine, Dale Case, Bob Kline', 'Alice Brown, Richard Cray', 'Robby Benson, Paige O''Hara, David Ogden Stiers, Jerry Orbach, Anne Rogers, Gregory Grudt, Kimmy Robertson, Frank Welker', 'G', 'Belle, the Beast, Lumiere, Cogsworth and the rest of those zany castle residents use their imaginations to embark on three magical, storybook adventures. This direct-to-video anthology serves as a "sequel" to Disney''s animated hit film. In "The Perfect World," Belle and the Beast learn about forgiveness. In "Fifi''s Folly," Lumiere''s girlfriend is jealous of his bond with Belle. And in "Broken Wing," the Beast learns to be kind to an injured bird.', 'Belle, the Beast, Lumiere, Cogsworth and the rest of those zany castle residents use their imaginations to embark on three magical, storybook adventures. This direct-to-video anthology serves as a "sequel" to Disney''s animated hit film. In "The Perfect World," Belle and the Beast learn about forgiveness. In "Fifi''s Folly," Lumiere''s girlfriend is jealous of his bond with Belle. And in "Broken Wing," the Beast learns to be kind to an injured bird.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/md6BrF3we17ZnPibam9jZDCl5iN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20235'),
  ('721812164922606078', 'Belle''s Tales of Friendship', 1999, 'Family, Animation', 'Jimbo Marshall', 'Alice Brown, Richard Cray', 'Lynsey McLeod, Hampton Dixon, Jennifer Jesse, Shawn Python, Kirsten Storms, Julie Vanlue, Natalie Trott, Jim Cummings', 'G', 'Two different stories: in the first one a group of children walk into the store eager to hear Belle''s stories, as she is noted to be a great storyteller, in the second one Belle throws a party to cheer Mrs. Potts up.', 'Two different stories: in the first one a group of children walk into the store eager to hear Belle''s stories, as she is noted to be a great storyteller, in the second one Belle throws a party to cheer Mrs. Potts up.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pg9HKDH395O73izcpjsL8N3MmNW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:341986'),
  ('543761721294677561', 'Belles on Their Toes', 1952, 'Comedy', 'Henry Levin, Arthur E. Arling, Lionel Newman', 'Phoebe Ephron, Henry Ephron', 'Jeanne Crain, Myrna Loy, Debra Paget, Jeffrey Hunter, Edward Arnold, Hoagy Carmichael, Barbara Bates, Robert Arthur', 'NR', 'The "Cheaper by the Dozen" crew is back, sans Clifton Webb. Lillian is struggling to make ends meet without her husband''s income, while Anne, Martha, and even Ernestine find romance.', 'The "Cheaper by the Dozen" crew is back, sans Clifton Webb. Lillian is struggling to make ends meet without her husband''s income, while Anne, Martha, and even Ernestine find romance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mQb9vtlMy5qJhaAjktNdok4TYeU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50549'),
  ('140197446427215706', 'Belles, blondes et bronzées', 1981, 'Crime, Comedy', 'Max Pécas, Roger Fellous', 'Max Pécas, Gérard Croce, Carlos Aured', 'Philippe Klébert, Xavier Deluc, Silvia Aguilar, Corinne Brodbeck, Michel Vocoret, Daniel Derval, Ticky Holgado, Otto Retzer', null, 'Mistaken for bank robbers, two friends stumble into a group of beautiful girls and follow them to Morocco for a dance show.', 'Mistaken for bank robbers, two friends stumble into a group of beautiful girls and follow them to Morocco for a dance show.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3o5kFWF5u4A4TZoOxzuHc8d71Rc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:156273'),
  ('304343176225061958', 'Belleville Cop', 2018, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Rachid Bouchareb, Alain Duplantier', 'Rachid Bouchareb, Larry Gross', 'Omar Sy, Luis Guzmán, Franck Gastambide, Julie Ferrier, Biyouna, Diem Nguyen, Ériq Ebouaney, Issaka Sawadogo', null, 'When a childhood friend from Miami gets killed after he comes to warn of encroaching drug gangs, Baaba moves to Miami and teams up with a local officer to bring down the criminals.', 'When a childhood friend from Miami gets killed after he comes to warn of encroaching drug gangs, Baaba moves to Miami and teams up with a local officer to bring down the criminals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6lY1GnJcZeZq3PXsoEwrF3izufJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:495673'),
  ('1093458436401500318', 'Belleville Tokyo', 2011, 'Drama', 'Elise Girard, Renato Berta', 'Elise Girard, Isabelle Pandazopoulos', 'Valérie Donzelli, Jérémie Elkaïm, Jean-Christophe Bouvet, Dominique Cabrera, Jean-Pierre Girard, Margaret Zenou, Pascal Besson, Philippe Nahon', null, 'Un couple se dirige vers un train en partance pour Venise. Sur le quai, Julien annonce à Marie qu’il part en rejoindre une autre et s’en va, la laissant seule à Paris, enceinte. Bouleversée, Marie se refuse à être victime de cette situation. Elle trouve du réconfort dans son travail auprès de ses deux « cow-boys » de patrons, Jean-Jacques et Jean-Loup, qui dirigent un cinéma du quartier latin spécialisé dans les films classiques américains…', 'Un couple se dirige vers un train en partance pour Venise. Sur le quai, Julien annonce à Marie qu’il part en rejoindre une autre et s’en va, la laissant seule à Paris, enceinte. Bouleversée, Marie se refuse à être victime de cette situation. Elle trouve du réconfort dans son travail auprès de ses deux « cow-boys » de patrons, Jean-Jacques et Jean-Loup, qui dirigent un cinéma du quartier latin spécialisé dans les films classiques américains…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ptqpfmNfkwTKtBpc8ArXZsGU5nN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87327'),
  ('752329306315564757', 'Bellezonismo', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Jordi Arencón', 'Jordi Arencón', 'Armando del Río, Miguel Cazorla, Yanet Garcia, Ariadna Cabrol, Coral González', null, 'Socrates and Capi are two car drivers who are in a rally competition. Unexpectedly, the couple gets lost and ends up in a clearing in the middle of a mountain. Far from being depopulated, that location turns out to be perfect for a Beauty Technification Center, a place where you look to perfect the physique.', 'Socrates and Capi are two car drivers who are in a rally competition. Unexpectedly, the couple gets lost and ends up in a clearing in the middle of a mountain. Far from being depopulated, that location turns out to be perfect for a Beauty Technification Center, a place where you look to perfect the physique.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dBgsoKRBq53dF4udLP1kzFYQUoZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:608726'),
  ('464795224896470519', 'Bellflower', 2011, 'Action, Drama, Romance', 'Evan Glodell, Joel Hodge', 'Evan Glodell', 'Evan Glodell, Jessie Wiseman, Tyler Dawson, Rebekah Brandes, Vincent Grashaw, Zack Kraus, Keghan Hurst', 'R', 'Two friends spend all their free time building flame-throwers and weapons of mass destruction in hopes that a global apocalypse will occur and clear the runway for their imaginary gang "Mother Medusa".', 'Two friends spend all their free time building flame-throwers and weapons of mass destruction in hopes that a global apocalypse will occur and clear the runway for their imaginary gang "Mother Medusa".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4bGB2k4JngWLVABKIw1S7cnlh5h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58699'),
  ('306530734625686047', 'Belli di papà', 2015, 'Comedy', 'Federico Masiero, Guido Chiesa', 'Guido Chiesa, Giovanni Bognetti', 'Diego Abatantuono, Andrea Pisani, Matilde Gioli, Francesco Di Raimondo, Marco Zingaro, Uccio De Santis, Umberto Sardella, Francesco Facchinetti', null, 'The wealthy businessman Vincenzo realizes that he is a father too absent, but also that his two sons and 1aughter are spoiled and unable to support themselves economically. So Vincenzo stages their fraudulent bankruptcy and runs with their children in Taranto, in his old house. The boys are struggling to settle, but Vincenzo is confident about them and hope that they will soon find a job in the city. Meanwhile, an impostor blackmailer, who wants to marry the daughter of Vincenzo, arrives in Puglia, to expose the scam.', 'The wealthy businessman Vincenzo realizes that he is a father too absent, but also that his two sons and 1aughter are spoiled and unable to support themselves economically. So Vincenzo stages their fraudulent bankruptcy and runs with their children in Taranto, in his old house. The boys are struggling to settle, but Vincenzo is confident about them and hope that they will soon find a job in the city. Meanwhile, an impostor blackmailer, who wants to marry the daughter of Vincenzo, arrives in Puglia, to expose the scam.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ilX68Cl2Jtxb1cT3cQpHUdyf5Os.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:363869'),
  ('94739980811625032', 'BelliFreschi', 1987, 'Comedy', 'Giorgio Di Battista, David Worth, Paolo Costella', 'Liliana Betti, Paolo Costella, Enrico Oldoini', 'Lino Banfi, Christian De Sica, Lionel Stander, Rosanna Banfi, Lisa Lavender, Marina Viro, Monica Frassinelli, Kaspar Capparoni', null, 'Tom and Jerry two Italian two bit actors go to America because they hope to take part in a film starring Sylvester Stallone. However when they go to his villa in Beverly Hills, Stallone gets murdered and the two are suspected of the murder. Hunted by the CIA and the FBI they flee across the USA disguised as women and end up working in a restaurant as showgirls. Here Tom meets a Mafia boss who falls in love with him and goes to Mexico with him to escape the police hunt. Some years later the two friends meet again: Tom has married the boss''s ex girlfriend even if he still dresses as a woman.', 'Tom and Jerry two Italian two bit actors go to America because they hope to take part in a film starring Sylvester Stallone. However when they go to his villa in Beverly Hills, Stallone gets murdered and the two are suspected of the murder. Hunted by the CIA and the FBI they flee across the USA disguised as women and end up working in a restaurant as showgirls. Here Tom meets a Mafia boss who falls in love with him and goes to Mexico with him to escape the police hunt. Some years later the two friends meet again: Tom has married the boss''s ex girlfriend even if he still dresses as a woman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/47fW1XncV4BNkBoSRK4shdaFWKH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:121344'),
  ('1051167063584485984', 'Bellini and the Sphinx', 2001, 'Crime, Thriller, Mystery', 'Roberto Santucci, Daniel Seda, André Montenegro', 'Alexandre Plosk', 'Fábio Assunção, Malu Mader, Maristane Dresch, Eliana Guttman, Paulo Hesse, Carlos Meceni, Cláudio Gabriel, Vera Mancini', null, 'Doctor Rafidjian turns to Dora Lobo''s investigation agency to locate prostitute Ana Cintia. The case is in charge of Bellini and Beatriz, his new assistant. But the doctor is brutally murdered and the detectives infiltrate the night underworld of São Paulo in search of an answer, where they meet Fatima, a mysterious prostitute who gets involved with Bellini.', 'Doctor Rafidjian turns to Dora Lobo''s investigation agency to locate prostitute Ana Cintia. The case is in charge of Bellini and Beatriz, his new assistant. But the doctor is brutally murdered and the detectives infiltrate the night underworld of São Paulo in search of an answer, where they meet Fatima, a mysterious prostitute who gets involved with Bellini.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sLmUUmJV89TY87C38rf2ZAtzcP9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73158'),
  ('526938441898235934', 'Bellissima', 1952, 'Drama', 'Luchino Visconti, Franco Zeffirelli, Francesco Rosi', 'Luchino Visconti, Suso Cecchi d''Amico, Francesco Rosi', 'Anna Magnani, Walter Chiari, Tina Apicella, Gastone Renzelli, Tecla Scarano, Lola Braccini, Arturo Bragaglia, Nora Ricci', 'NR', 'Film director Blasetti is looking for a little girl for his new movie. Along with other mothers, Maddelena takes her daughter to Cinecittà, hoping she’ll be selected and become a star. She is ready to sacrifice anything for little Maria.', 'Film director Blasetti is looking for a little girl for his new movie. Along with other mothers, Maddelena takes her daughter to Cinecittà, hoping she’ll be selected and become a star. She is ready to sacrifice anything for little Maria.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Ao5l92i1QPYq3Na98cffLInFsGB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43372'),
  ('248982938443140165', 'Bellman and True', 1987, 'Drama, Action, Thriller, Crime', 'Richard Loncraine, Ken Westbury', 'Desmond Lowden, Michael Wearing, Richard Loncraine', 'Bernard Hill, Derek Newark, Richard Hope, Ken Bones, Frances Tomelty, Kieran O''Brien, John Kavanagh, Arthur Whybrow', null, 'Hiller, a computer expert, was bribed by group of bank robbers to obtain details of the security system at a newly-built bank. Having obtained the information, he thought he''d seen the last of the robbers. But now they''ve traced him and his son to London. They hold the son hostage and force Hiller to decode the information about the alarm and then to take part in the robbery.', 'Hiller, a computer expert, was bribed by group of bank robbers to obtain details of the security system at a newly-built bank. Having obtained the information, he thought he''d seen the last of the robbers. But now they''ve traced him and his son to London. They hold the son hostage and force Hiller to decode the information about the alarm and then to take part in the robbery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tn44SR0gJS1J7ZfsgtbqcJUmEJR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:146465'),
  ('907323743786545078', 'Bello recuerdo', 1961, 'Drama, Music', 'Antonio del Amo, Alfredo Fraile', 'Jaime García Herranz', 'Joselito, Libertad Lamarque, Sara García, Roberto Camardiel, Salvador Soler Marí, Antonio Gandía, Félix Fernández, Manuel de Juan', null, 'Back from vacation, Lucy, a school''s music teacher, misses a boy. People say he will not return because he recently lost his father. She is very affected by his favorite student, so she decides to go to see him, finding the house in utter ruin. But chance makes Lucy forced to take the child and immediately found in him the son that was kidnapped years ago in America when she was a famous artist.', 'Back from vacation, Lucy, a school''s music teacher, misses a boy. People say he will not return because he recently lost his father. She is very affected by his favorite student, so she decides to go to see him, finding the house in utter ruin. But chance makes Lucy forced to take the child and immediately found in him the son that was kidnapped years ago in America when she was a famous artist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kC9ec1uRPt3rU2iS4V3I9A09AU4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:103869'),
  ('1114078379238466882', 'Bells Are Ringing', 1960, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Vincente Minnelli, Milton Krasner, William McGarry', 'Betty Comden, Adolph Green', 'Judy Holliday, Dean Martin, Fred Clark, Eddie Foy Jr., Jean Stapleton, Ruth Storey, Dort Clark, Frank Gorshin', 'NR', 'Ella Peterson works in the basement office of Susanswerphone, a telephone answering service. She listens in on others'' lives and adds some interest to her own humdrum existence by adopting different identities for her clients. They include an out-of-work Method actor, a dentist with musical yearnings, and in particular playwright Jeffrey Moss, who is suffering from writer''s block and desperately needs a muse.', 'Ella Peterson works in the basement office of Susanswerphone, a telephone answering service. She listens in on others'' lives and adds some interest to her own humdrum existence by adopting different identities for her clients. They include an out-of-work Method actor, a dentist with musical yearnings, and in particular playwright Jeffrey Moss, who is suffering from writer''s block and desperately needs a muse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1XigaSX2wbUYWttuZjHiFD8sSpU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43029'),
  ('672443519539182336', 'Bells from the Deep', 1993, 'Documentary', 'Werner Herzog, Jörg Schmidt-Reitwein, Martin Manz', 'Werner Herzog', 'Werner Herzog, Vissarion, Vadim Redkin, Yuri Yurievich Yurieff, Anna Hitch, Allan Chumack, Yuriy Tarasov', null, 'A group of pilgrims lie down on the thin ice of the lake Svetloyar and begin to look for the city of Kitesh. According to the legend, God saved the city from the Mongolian prince Batyi''s soldiers by letting it sink to the bottom of the lake. If you listen carefully you can hear the bells of the Kitesh cathedral toll deep down.', 'A group of pilgrims lie down on the thin ice of the lake Svetloyar and begin to look for the city of Kitesh. According to the legend, God saved the city from the Mongolian prince Batyi''s soldiers by letting it sink to the bottom of the lake. If you listen carefully you can hear the bells of the Kitesh cathedral toll deep down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yQiPcF0usfStfHSCnWOpXSQ5luZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:102691'),
  ('935175111062177413', 'Bells of Atlantis', 1952, null, 'Ian Hugo, Len Lye', null, 'Anaïs Nin', null, 'A perfect fusion of poetry and film, with dense layered imagery and music from electro pioneers Louise and Bebe Barron. The writer Anaïs Nin provides dialogue from her novella “House of Incest” and appears adrift in the undersea realm of Atlantis before ascending to dry land.', 'A perfect fusion of poetry and film, with dense layered imagery and music from electro pioneers Louise and Bebe Barron. The writer Anaïs Nin provides dialogue from her novella “House of Incest” and appears adrift in the undersea realm of Atlantis before ascending to dry land.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k0s0Q7tzYj4XSjIJJQom6PboyBJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:209699'),
  ('1021101023369059339', 'Belluscone: A Sicilian Story', 2014, 'History, Documentary', 'Luca Bigazzi, Irma Vecchio, Franco Maresco', 'Franco Maresco, Claudia Uzzo', 'Salvatore De Castro, Marcello Dell''Utri, Ciccio Mira, Valentino Picone, Vittorio Ricciardi, Tatti Sanguineti, Vittorio Sgarbi, Salvatore Ficarra', null, 'This film tells the story of three defeats: Berlusconi’s political and human defeat in his “twilight”, the one of Ciccio Mirra, Berlusconi’s unconditional supporter, deeply rooted in an ancient culture that dies hard, and the director’s artistic defeat in an Italy that recognised itself in this “Berlusconian culture” for a long time, and probably still does.', 'This film tells the story of three defeats: Berlusconi’s political and human defeat in his “twilight”, the one of Ciccio Mirra, Berlusconi’s unconditional supporter, deeply rooted in an ancient culture that dies hard, and the director’s artistic defeat in an Italy that recognised itself in this “Berlusconian culture” for a long time, and probably still does.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/57asrVcZJrwJr6jMno6UaYbmQSj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:290643'),
  ('525897991818655631', 'Belly', 1998, 'Crime, Drama', 'Hype Williams, Teofilo Colon Jr., Angi Bones', 'Hype Williams', 'DMX, Nas, Hassan Johnson, Taral Hicks, Tionne Watkins, Oliver "Power" Grant, Louie Rankin, Stanley Drayton', 'R', 'Tommy Bundy and Sincere are best friends as well as infamous and ruthless criminals and shot-callers in the hood. Respected by many but feared by all. As the police are closing in on them and new players are looking for a come up, will their reign last?', 'Tommy Bundy and Sincere are best friends as well as infamous and ruthless criminals and shot-callers in the hood. Respected by many but feared by all. As the police are closing in on them and new players are looking for a come up, will their reign last?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i4QhjdZXxdOpKOhc9kh4qqWjRWr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12888'),
  ('601200988175106022', 'Belly of the Beast', 2003, 'Action, Thriller', 'Danny Nowak, Tony Ching Siu-Tung, Bob Warwick', 'James Townsend, Steven Seagal', 'Steven Seagal, Byron Mann, Monica Lo Suk-Yee, Tom Wu, Sara Malakul Lane, Elidh MacQueen, Kevork Malikyan, Pongpat Wachirabunjong', 'R', 'Jake and Sunti go to meet Mongkol, the leader of the Abu Karaf. Mongkol confirms that ever since the terrorist attacks of September 11, 2001, Jantapan has worked to corner the narcotics and arms markets. Jake must engage in a battle that will put both his physical and spiritual powers to the ultimate test.', 'Jake and Sunti go to meet Mongkol, the leader of the Abu Karaf. Mongkol confirms that ever since the terrorist attacks of September 11, 2001, Jantapan has worked to corner the narcotics and arms markets. Jake must engage in a battle that will put both his physical and spiritual powers to the ultimate test.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wQXareg5YhYSVJq0f3vMbsvkjhU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12542'),
  ('900392570986473390', 'Belmondo by Belmondo', 2016, 'Documentary', 'Régis Mardon', 'Régis Mardon, Paul Belmondo', 'Jean-Paul Belmondo, Paul Belmondo, Richard Anconina, Ursula Andress, Guy Bedos, Claude Brasseur, Nicole Calfan, Claudia Cardinale', null, 'Jean-Paul Belmondo returns to the settings of a fantastic career, accompanied by his son Paul. Over a career spanning 50 years, Jean-Paul Belmondo’s movies drew over 130 million people into cinemas. This logbook takes us back to sets and countries, from where we can revisit the films in reference and find out about his fruitful collaborations with various directors. Paul Belmondo will lead the investigation, meeting the stars and his father’s friends (eye-witnesses all) and questioning his father about his journey, sharing it with us so we can discover the man and his story like never before.', 'Jean-Paul Belmondo returns to the settings of a fantastic career, accompanied by his son Paul. Over a career spanning 50 years, Jean-Paul Belmondo’s movies drew over 130 million people into cinemas. This logbook takes us back to sets and countries, from where we can revisit the films in reference and find out about his fruitful collaborations with various directors. Paul Belmondo will lead the investigation, meeting the stars and his father’s friends (eye-witnesses all) and questioning his father about his journey, sharing it with us so we can discover the man and his story like never before.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fr0d4uPAbjfZEoFSI0I8y8iEzLJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:444269'),
  ('76580761432075845', 'Belmondo, itinéraire...', 2011, 'Documentary', 'Vincent Perrot, Adrian Martini', 'Vincent Perrot, Jeff Domenech', 'Jean-Paul Belmondo, Jean Becker, Alain Belmondo, Paul Belmondo, Luc Besson, Bertrand Blier, Paulette Breil, Nicole Calfan', null, 'Documentary on the career of Jean-Paul Belmondo.', 'Documentary on the career of Jean-Paul Belmondo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qz9XJifctc9Fhybd9Mc9ocjRORq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:134078'),
  ('976314902090020746', 'Belmondo, le magnifique', 2017, 'Documentary', 'Bruno Sevaistre', null, 'Jean-Paul Belmondo, Guy Bedos, Alain Delon, Jacques Deray, Michel Drucker, Raymond Girard, Jean-Luc Godard, Charles Gérard', null, 'With more than 70 films and 160 million cumulative tickets in France, Jean-Paul Belmondo is one of the essential stars of French cinema.', 'With more than 70 films and 160 million cumulative tickets in France, Jean-Paul Belmondo is one of the essential stars of French cinema.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o9NcWqNso6mfcNbvbCeqWxcvsrc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:474791'),
  ('606662477024727298', 'Belmonte', 2019, 'Drama', 'Pedro Giambruno, Felipe Villarmarzo, Mateo Jaunsolo', 'Federico Veiroj', 'Gonzalo Delgado, Olivia Molinaro Eijo, Giselle Motta, Tomás Wahrmann, Jeannette Sauksteliskis, María Noel Gutiérrez, Marcelo Fernández Borsari, Alejandro Castiglioni', null, 'Federico Veiroj’s fourth feature examines the many, often contradictory layers that make up one’s persona, in this case, a single dad and acclaimed artist who must learn to balance family with creativity.', 'Federico Veiroj’s fourth feature examines the many, often contradictory layers that make up one’s persona, in this case, a single dad and acclaimed artist who must learn to balance family with creativity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1bIm4BY5XroAkLT6tVdIcBwPBsa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:543786'),
  ('724411388408252083', 'Belonging', 2019, 'Crime, Drama', 'Arda Aslan, Barış Candoğan, Ozan Yoleri', 'Burak Çevik', 'Eylül Su Sapan, Çağlar Yalçınkaya', null, 'A murder investigation is flipped inside out in Burak Çevik''s second feature, a spellbinding and surprising work that questions whether we can ever truly understand criminal motives. We begin in the present as an unseen narrator recounts the assassination of his lover''s disapproving mother, accompanied by hauntingly vacant images of urban alienation and garish city lights; we then flash back to witness the first encounter between the lovers-turned-accomplices, their mutual attraction and world-weariness emerging across a sleepless night and morning after. Çevik imbues the proceedings with a stylistic confidence and willingness to bend the conventions of cinematic form to arrive at a complex, gripping double meditation on love and death.', 'A murder investigation is flipped inside out in Burak Çevik''s second feature, a spellbinding and surprising work that questions whether we can ever truly understand criminal motives. We begin in the present as an unseen narrator recounts the assassination of his lover''s disapproving mother, accompanied by hauntingly vacant images of urban alienation and garish city lights; we then flash back to witness the first encounter between the lovers-turned-accomplices, their mutual attraction and world-weariness emerging across a sleepless night and morning after. Çevik imbues the proceedings with a stylistic confidence and willingness to bend the conventions of cinematic form to arrive at a complex, gripping double meditation on love and death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4OOvYrL3MjY15KOmmfopqSXF9c2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:576082'),
  ('405089252321562981', 'Beloved', 1998, 'Drama, Thriller, Horror, Mystery', 'Jonathan Demme, Tak Fujimoto', 'Adam Brooks, Richard LaGravenese, Akosua Busia', 'Oprah Winfrey, Danny Glover, Kimberly Elise, Thandiwe Newton, LisaGay Hamilton, Beah Richards, Albert Hall, Irma P. Hall', 'R', 'After Paul D. finds his old slave friend Sethe in Ohio and moves in with her and her daughter Denver, a strange girl comes along by the name of "Beloved". Sethe and Denver take her in and then strange things start to happen...', 'After Paul D. finds his old slave friend Sethe in Ohio and moves in with her and her daughter Denver, a strange girl comes along by the name of "Beloved". Sethe and Denver take her in and then strange things start to happen...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jIoT0J2fNXXCYZst6OkKStQIPw9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39437'),
  ('604039743856232922', 'Beloved', 2011, 'Drama, Romance, Music', 'Rémy Chevrin, Christophe Honoré', 'Christophe Honoré', 'Chiara Mastroianni, Catherine Deneuve, Ludivine Sagnier, Louis Garrel, Miloš Forman, Paul Schneider, Radivoje Bukvić, Michel Delpech', null, 'From Paris in the 1960s to London in the first decade of the third millennium, Madeleine and her daughter Véra flit from one amorous adventure to the next, living for the moment and taking all the opportunities that life offers. But not every love affair is without its consequences, its upsets and its disappointments. As time goes by and gnaws away at one’s deepest feelings, love becomes a harder game to play.', 'From Paris in the 1960s to London in the first decade of the third millennium, Madeleine and her daughter Véra flit from one amorous adventure to the next, living for the moment and taking all the opportunities that life offers. But not every love affair is without its consequences, its upsets and its disappointments. As time goes by and gnaws away at one’s deepest feelings, love becomes a harder game to play.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1T77id5LO02Ym3ml6oL87KBZvN5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:93188'),
  ('586961330032587246', 'Beloved Berlin Wall', 2009, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Peter Timm, Achim Poulheim', 'Peter Timm', 'Felicitas Woll, Maxim Mehmet, Anna Fischer, Thomas Thieme, Karl Kranzkowski, Gisela Trowe, Katja Danowski, Waldemar Kobus', null, 'Berlin, 1989. Sascha is a young East German border guard and Franzi is a lively young West German woman who''s just moved into a flat next to Sascha''s watchtower at the Berlin Wall. It takes only a slight mishap and a selfless act of chivalry and the two fall in love. But soon the Stasi believes they are witnessing the start of a revolt. This is the time of mass protests and East Germans taking refuge in the West German embassy in Prague after all. Franzi and Sascha have to find their ways to stand up for their love and strive for the impossible; to bring down the wall.', 'Berlin, 1989. Sascha is a young East German border guard and Franzi is a lively young West German woman who''s just moved into a flat next to Sascha''s watchtower at the Berlin Wall. It takes only a slight mishap and a selfless act of chivalry and the two fall in love. But soon the Stasi believes they are witnessing the start of a revolt. This is the time of mass protests and East Germans taking refuge in the West German embassy in Prague after all. Franzi and Sascha have to find their ways to stand up for their love and strive for the impossible; to bring down the wall.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rLmS2p06FKvGvlSAqGqN5EePbAE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43652'),
  ('46889776391063906', 'Beloved Infidel', 1959, 'Drama, Romance', 'Henry King, Stanley Hough, Leon Shamroy', 'Sy Bartlett', 'Gregory Peck, Deborah Kerr, Eddie Albert, Philip Ober, Herbert Rudley, John Sutton, Karin Booth, Ken Scott', null, 'In the late 1930s, Sheilah Graham’s Hollywood column quickly becomes popular for its biting tone. At a party, she meets author F. Scott Fitzgerald, and the two begin a torrid affair. Scott laments that his writing has fallen out of fashion, and when he is fired from his screenwriting position, he begins drinking heavily. Soon his intrusive, volatile behavior threatens their relationship and Sheilah''s career.', 'In the late 1930s, Sheilah Graham’s Hollywood column quickly becomes popular for its biting tone. At a party, she meets author F. Scott Fitzgerald, and the two begin a torrid affair. Scott laments that his writing has fallen out of fashion, and when he is fired from his screenwriting position, he begins drinking heavily. Soon his intrusive, volatile behavior threatens their relationship and Sheilah''s career.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6ABKWW1tklOiP3oWaF2GVBcczgz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:109949'),
  ('341972512550824912', 'Beloved Sisters', 2014, 'Romance, Drama, History', 'Dominik Graf, Michael Wiesweg', 'Dominik Graf', 'Hannah Herzsprung, Florian Stetter, Henriette Confurius, Ronald Zehrfeld, Claudia Messner, Maja Maranow, Michael Wittenborn, Andreas Pietschmann', 'NR', 'A love triangle forms between post-Enlightenment writer Friedrich Schiller and two sisters -- one who became his wife, and the other, his biographer.', 'A love triangle forms between post-Enlightenment writer Friedrich Schiller and two sisters -- one who became his wife, and the other, his biographer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6uszdo0cY7tcOEobd8LPTrRuUQM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:248934'),
  ('394240455040189181', 'Beloved/Friend', 1999, 'Drama', 'Ventura Pons, Jesús Escosa', 'Josep Maria Benet i Jornet', 'Josep Maria Pou, Rosa María Sardà, Mario Gas, David Selvas, Irene Montalà, Jordi Dauder, Josep Mota, Àngels Sánchez', 'NR', 'Based on a work of Josep Maria Benet i Jornet entitled "Testament", the film tells the story of an aging professor of medieval literature with the dilemma of deciding who will inherit his essay on "The Book of friend and loved" by Ramon Llull. Feeling near death as a result of illness, he discovers that the ideal person is a young and intelligent student he is in love with and who is dedicated to male prostitution.', 'Based on a work of Josep Maria Benet i Jornet entitled "Testament", the film tells the story of an aging professor of medieval literature with the dilemma of deciding who will inherit his essay on "The Book of friend and loved" by Ramon Llull. Feeling near death as a result of illness, he discovers that the ideal person is a young and intelligent student he is in love with and who is dedicated to male prostitution.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yvIOKJYryk5KXIZzHt28dYDcuqQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80471'),
  ('1107813652756204750', 'Below', 2002, 'Thriller, Horror, Mystery', 'David Twohy, Ian Wilson, Mark Harris', 'David Twohy, Lucas Sussman, Darren Aronofsky', 'Matthew Davis, Bruce Greenwood, Olivia Williams, Zach Galifianakis, Scott Foley, Holt McCallany, Nick Chinlund, Jason Flemyng', 'R', 'In the dark silence of the sea during World War II, the submarine USS Tiger Shark prowls on what should be a routine rescue mission. But for the shell-shocked crew, trapped together in the sub''s narrow corridors and constricted spaces, this is about to become a journey into the sensory delusions, mental deceptions and runaway fears that lurk just below the surface of the ocean.', 'In the dark silence of the sea during World War II, the submarine USS Tiger Shark prowls on what should be a routine rescue mission. But for the shell-shocked crew, trapped together in the sub''s narrow corridors and constricted spaces, this is about to become a journey into the sensory delusions, mental deceptions and runaway fears that lurk just below the surface of the ocean.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4tsaLD98DcXh4ltOn9wEWhsUkSc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12590'),
  ('978664679117495154', 'Below Her Mouth', 2017, 'Drama, Romance', 'April Mullen, Maya Bankovic, Filomena Guarasci', 'Stephanie Fabrizi', 'Erika Linder, Natalie Krill, Sebastian Pigott, Mayko Nguyen, Tommie-Amber Pirie, Melanie Leishman, Andrea Stefancikova, Daniela Barbosa', null, 'An unexpected affair quickly escalates into a heart-stopping reality for two women whose passionate connection changes their lives forever.', 'An unexpected affair quickly escalates into a heart-stopping reality for two women whose passionate connection changes their lives forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tPhBftWySbanfEialbsUzOuccgN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:370663'),
  ('843932824960642410', 'Below the Earth''s Surface', 2008, 'Action, Thriller', 'Sebastian Vigg', null, 'Liane Forestieri, Henning Baum, Oliver Stritzel, Marco Girnth, Horst-Günter Marx, Ercan Durmaz, Michael Lott, Christian Grashof', 'NR', 'A series of strange accidents plaguing a city located near the mine. Two people were pulled through the funnel, which formed after the collapse of tunnels under the lake. Geologist Nina Thiemann discovers that the mine tunnels are insecure and unstable. A woman with an expert in the field of explosions and a father, a former miner, descend into the ground, hoping that they will prevent catastrophe', 'A series of strange accidents plaguing a city located near the mine. Two people were pulled through the funnel, which formed after the collapse of tunnels under the lake. Geologist Nina Thiemann discovers that the mine tunnels are insecure and unstable. A woman with an expert in the field of explosions and a father, a former miner, descend into the ground, hoping that they will prevent catastrophe', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3jzSR3X4lI0eFVVj9Sv5CUBYE31.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2790'),
  ('391255635027834568', 'Below Utopia', 1997, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Kurt Voss, Denis Maloney', 'David Diamond', 'Alyssa Milano, Justin Theroux, Ice-T, Tommy Lister Jr., Richard Danielson, Nicholas Walker, Robert Pine, Jeanette O''Connor', 'R', 'Daniel returns to his family''s mansion for the holidays along with his girlfriend Susanne. His family''s seemingly-utopian existence is overshadowed by not only the death of Daniel''s brother, but also by Daniel''s failure to live up to his brother''s potential. However, this quickly becomes inconsequential, as blood-thirsty killers soon show up..', 'Daniel returns to his family''s mansion for the holidays along with his girlfriend Susanne. His family''s seemingly-utopian existence is overshadowed by not only the death of Daniel''s brother, but also by Daniel''s failure to live up to his brother''s potential. However, this quickly becomes inconsequential, as blood-thirsty killers soon show up..', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n9cIhPd5WtAx1Id1CshEYv5Fji9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50835'),
  ('548053085202756326', 'Below Zero', 1930, 'Comedy', 'James Parrott, George Stevens', null, 'Stan Laurel, Oliver Hardy, Frank Holliday, Blanche Payson, Bobby Burns, Baldwin Cooke, Kay Deslys, Charlie Hall', 'NR', 'Street musicians Stan and Ollie have no success earning money in the dead of winter in a bad neighborhood. Their instruments are destroyed in an argument with a woman, but their luck seems to turn when Stan finds a wallet.', 'Street musicians Stan and Ollie have no success earning money in the dead of winter in a bad neighborhood. Their instruments are destroyed in an argument with a woman, but their luck seems to turn when Stan finds a wallet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hLfz7IvM31NZVRCFZog3nAohSxm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48562'),
  ('168708549325826260', 'Below Zero', 2021, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Lluís Quílez, Isaac Vila, Rosa Estévez', 'Fernando Navarro, Lluís Quílez', 'Javier Gutiérrez, Karra Elejalde, Luis Callejo, Patrick Criado, Andrés Gertrúdix, Isak Férriz, Miquel Gelabert, Florin Opritescu', 'R', 'When a prisoner transfer van is attacked, the cop in charge must fight those inside and outside while dealing with a silent foe: the icy temperatures.', 'When a prisoner transfer van is attacked, the cop in charge must fight those inside and outside while dealing with a silent foe: the icy temperatures.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dWSnsAGTfc8U27bWsy2RfwZs0Bs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:587996'),
  ('1020912646867298798', 'Belphegor, Phantom of the Louvre', 2001, 'Fantasy, Mystery, Horror', 'Jean-Paul Salomé, Jean-François Robin', 'Danièle Thompson, Jérôme Tonnerre, Jean-Paul Salomé', 'Sophie Marceau, Michel Serrault, Frédéric Diefenthal, Julie Christie, Jean-François Balmer, Patachou, Lionel Abelanski, Françoise Lépine', null, 'A collection of artifacts from an archeological dig in Egypt are brought to the famous Louvre museum in Paris, and while experts are using a laser scanning device to determine the age of a sarcophagus, a ghostly spirit escapes and makes its way into the museum''s electrical system.', 'A collection of artifacts from an archeological dig in Egypt are brought to the famous Louvre museum in Paris, and while experts are using a laser scanning device to determine the age of a sarcophagus, a ghostly spirit escapes and makes its way into the museum''s electrical system.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pOuxeQhR2Acjjr6dgOH4GJz3Wcf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35831'),
  ('1046176211513522066', 'Beltracchi: The Art of Forgery', 2014, 'Crime, Documentary, History', 'Arne Birkenstock, Marcus Winterbauer', 'Arne Birkenstock', 'Wolfgang Beltracchi, Helene Beltracchi', null, 'Wolfgang Beltracchi got away with forging art masterpieces for over 40 years. He may be egotistical and nihilistic, but his genius in undeniable. He managed to fool gallery owners, historians and investors with the stroke of a brush. This documentary follows his last days as a free man.', 'Wolfgang Beltracchi got away with forging art masterpieces for over 40 years. He may be egotistical and nihilistic, but his genius in undeniable. He managed to fool gallery owners, historians and investors with the stroke of a brush. This documentary follows his last days as a free man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lX9pKMa54j0ZDKAuuNDrAf15jXr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:256314'),
  ('703820019192349519', 'Belushi', 2020, 'Documentary', 'R. J. Cutler', 'R. J. Cutler', 'John Belushi, Judith Belushi-Pisano, Harold Ramis, Dan Aykroyd, Chevy Chase, John Landis, Penny Marshall, Lorne Michaels', null, 'Using previously unheard audiotapes recorded shortly after John Belushi’s death, director R.J. Cutler’s documentary feature examines the too-short life of the once-in-a-generation talent who captured the hearts and funny bones of devoted audiences.', 'Using previously unheard audiotapes recorded shortly after John Belushi’s death, director R.J. Cutler’s documentary feature examines the too-short life of the once-in-a-generation talent who captured the hearts and funny bones of devoted audiences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/85yNzqsGBdqRclEZEW0BKRAcrR8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:661845'),
  ('171814011374393015', 'Belzebuth', 2019, 'Horror, Fantasy', 'Emilio Portes, Ramón Orozco Stoltenberg', 'Emilio Portes, Luis Carlos Fuentes', 'Joaquín Cosío, Tobin Bell, Tate Ellington, José Sefami, Yunuen Pardo, Liam Villa, Conde Fabregat, Aurora Gil', 'NR', 'While leading a police investigation of a massacre in a public school at the border of Mexico and U.S.A, special Agent Emanuel Ritter links this strange case to the coming and rising of the ancient demon Belzebuth. But in order to stop the trail of upcoming infanticides, Ritter shall have to confront himself before dealing with the forces of good and evil.', 'While leading a police investigation of a massacre in a public school at the border of Mexico and U.S.A, special Agent Emanuel Ritter links this strange case to the coming and rising of the ancient demon Belzebuth. But in order to stop the trail of upcoming infanticides, Ritter shall have to confront himself before dealing with the forces of good and evil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/em79Vu871uUVZEpBY6qkO5O6psP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:373226'),
  ('372879968272509953', 'Bem Bom', 2021, 'Music, Drama', 'João de Botelho, Patrícia Sequeira', 'Maria Helena Matos, Cucha Carvalheiro, Filipa Martins', 'Bárbara Branco, Lia Carvalho, Ana Marta Ferreira, Carolina Carvalho, Nuno Nolasco, Eduardo Breda, José Mata, Miguel Mateus', null, 'It is 1979. Four young ladies are hired to form a girl band. They can sing, they shine with their dancing, and they shock the country. They become a big hit. They are DOCE.', 'It is 1979. Four young ladies are hired to form a girl band. They can sing, they shine with their dancing, and they shock the country. They become a big hit. They are DOCE.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9bt7LUUYSozfGM3jYTSgd4ltxoA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:722147'),
  ('955003714622287790', 'Bem-Vinda a Quixeramobim', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Halder Gomes, Edmilson Filho, Carina Sanginitto', 'Marina Morais, Márcio Wilson, L.G. Bayão', 'Monique Alfradique, Edmilson Filho, Max Petterson, Chandelly Braz, Silvero Pereira, Valéria Vitoriano, Luis Miranda, Falcão', null, 'Aimée is a millionaire influencer who has all her family''s assets blocked, except for a farm in the countryside of Ceará that she inherited from her grandfather. She leaves for the hinterland in an attempt to sell the property, but ashamed of the new reality, she invents that she will take a "sabbatical period" for a year. Thus, she will have to deal with her new life and sustain the lie on social media.', 'Aimée is a millionaire influencer who has all her family''s assets blocked, except for a farm in the countryside of Ceará that she inherited from her grandfather. She leaves for the hinterland in an attempt to sell the property, but ashamed of the new reality, she invents that she will take a "sabbatical period" for a year. Thus, she will have to deal with her new life and sustain the lie on social media.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7vdr6W7bs8LJMOGgwIJiAQUfG3Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:945805'),
  ('594990023771749642', 'BEM: BECOME HUMAN', 2020, 'Animation, Action, Drama, Fantasy, Horror', 'Takayuki Goto, Tetsuaki Watanabe, Hiroshi Ikehata', 'Atsuhiro Tomioka', 'Katsuyuki Konishi, Mao Ichimichi, Kensho Ono, Maaya Uchida, Kenji Nomura, Junichi Suwabe, Taiten Kusunoki, Akira Sekine', null, 'Two years have passed since Bem, Bela, and Belo disappeared. Bem is now living the life of his dreams with a wife and kids. Except he has a new name and no memory of his humanoid monster past. Is this really domestic bliss or something sinister?', 'Two years have passed since Bem, Bela, and Belo disappeared. Bem is now living the life of his dreams with a wife and kids. Except he has a new name and no memory of his humanoid monster past. Is this really domestic bliss or something sinister?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sERr77NWXFrVXbvtfbgsjnccZnF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:711683'),
  ('403574448392182063', 'Ben', 1972, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Phil Karlson, Russell Metty, Floyd Joyer', 'Gilbert Ralston', 'Lee Montgomery, Joseph Campanella, Arthur O''Connell, Rosemary Murphy, Meredith Baxter, Kaz Garas, Paul Carr, Richard Van Vleet', 'PG', 'A lonely boy becomes good friends with Ben, a rat. This rat is also the leader of a pack of vicious killer rats, killing lots of people.', 'A lonely boy becomes good friends with Ben, a rat. This rat is also the leader of a pack of vicious killer rats, killing lots of people.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/LvTapjbjdg9bGzt79hZAp2idcn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42476'),
  ('829548054738814722', 'Ben & Arthur', 2002, 'Drama, Romance, Thriller', 'Sam Mraovich, Michael Haboush, Sam Mraovich', 'Sam Mraovich', 'Sam Mraovich, Jamie Brett Gabel, Michael Haboush, Bill Hindley, Julie Belknap, Gina Aguilar, Arthur Huber, Richard Hitchcock', null, 'A pair of recently married gay men are threatened by one of the partners'' brother, a religious fanatic who plots to murder them after being ostracized by his church.', 'A pair of recently married gay men are threatened by one of the partners'' brother, a religious fanatic who plots to murder them after being ostracized by his church.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6fVVmRBM7baWubsETorSwHChveV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31130'),
  ('333168484522772043', 'Ben & Charlie', 1972, 'Western, Comedy', 'Michele Lupo, Joe D''Amato, Gianni Arduini', 'Sergio Donati, George Eastman', 'Giuliano Gemma, George Eastman, Marisa Mell, Vittorio Congia, Luciano Catenacci, Remo Capitani, Giacomo Rossi Stuart, Nello Pazzafini', 'PG', 'Also known as Ben & Charlie. When Ben Bellow is released from prison, Charlie Logan is there waiting for him. Not to welcome him, but to tell him that he does not want to hear from him again. But his wish won''t be granted as the the two men constantly forced to reconnect while still hating each other''s guts...', 'Also known as Ben & Charlie. When Ben Bellow is released from prison, Charlie Logan is there waiting for him. Not to welcome him, but to tell him that he does not want to hear from him again. But his wish won''t be granted as the the two men constantly forced to reconnect while still hating each other''s guts...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zDpG8bCjC4HuaRYeGgddXvPLVvI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3698'),
  ('410045908903171883', 'Ben & Gunnar: A Small Film About Male Friendship', 1999, 'Drama, Comedy, TV Movie', 'Tomas Alfredson, Leif Benjour', 'Robert Gustafsson, Jonas Inde, Andres Lokko', 'Robert Gustafsson, Johan Rheborg, Jonas Inde, Cecilia Frode, Sara Key, Karin Weywadt, Lotta Beling, Henrik Schyffert', null, 'Ben and Gunnar meet during a carpool from Stockholm to Göteborg in the summer of 1985 where they are attending a concert with Bruce Springsteen at Ullevi.', 'Ben and Gunnar meet during a carpool from Stockholm to Göteborg in the summer of 1985 where they are attending a concert with Bruce Springsteen at Ullevi.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kd1qqoufTeMRzFfo23bI9iQwmX8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:145271'),
  ('728297775882410386', 'Ben 10 / Generator Rex: Heroes United', 2011, 'Action, Animation, Science Fiction, TV Movie', 'Kenji Ono, Chris Graham', 'Joe Kelly, Rob Hoegee, Duncan Rouleau', 'Daryl Sabara, Yuri Lowenthal, Wally Kurth, Grey DeLisle, John DiMaggio, J.K. Simmons, Michael Emerson, Jennifer Hale', 'PG', 'Ben Tennyson falls through a wormhole and encounters Rex. The two heroes must unite against a foe that can absorb their powers.', 'Ben Tennyson falls through a wormhole and encounters Rex. The two heroes must unite against a foe that can absorb their powers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mRMkd4e4oowrUyFC2kF9eQsFCDr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:402200'),
  ('708889450918372518', 'Ben 10 vs. the Universe: The Movie', 2020, 'Animation, Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'John McIntyre, Henrique Jardim, John McIntyre', 'Benjamin P. Carow, John Martinez, Josh Kim', 'Tara Strong, Montse Hernandez, David Kaye, Dee Bradley Baker, Roger Craig Smith, Daryl Sabara, John DiMaggio, Yuri Lowenthal', 'G', 'A blast from Ben''s past returns to do double the damage on Team Tennyson and planet Earth itself, forcing Ben to go interstellar to save the day. Based on the 2016 reboot.', 'A blast from Ben''s past returns to do double the damage on Team Tennyson and planet Earth itself, forcing Ben to go interstellar to save the day. Based on the 2016 reboot.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/34KSOJVowmkeh6G0HZJMxqdHq6s.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:724475'),
  ('59468680901027208', 'Ben 10: Alien Swarm', 2009, 'Action, TV Movie, Science Fiction', 'Alex Winter, Rhonda Guthrie, Chad Wheeler', 'Jim Krieg, John Turman', 'Ryan Kelley, Galadriel Stineman, Nathan Keyes, Alyssa Diaz, Herbert Siguenza, Barry Corbin, Dee Bradley Baker, Alex Winter', 'PG', 'Ben and a mysterious girl from his past must prevent an alien threat from destroying the world.', 'Ben and a mysterious girl from his past must prevent an alien threat from destroying the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4emrSFOwIlx35OawRcqlwH66TZD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25642'),
  ('348292361540512191', 'Ben 10: Ben 10,010', 2021, 'Animation, Action', 'Henrique Jardim', 'John Martinez, Benjamin P. Carow, Kelly Turnbull', 'Tara Strong, Montse Hernandez, David A. Kaye, Greg Cipes, John DiMaggio, Roger Craig Smith, Robin Atkin Downes, Dwight Schultz', null, 'In a future where an adult Gwen Tennyson is president and the world is being taken over by the alien horde known as the Xerge, a disillusioned Ben 10,000 is called out of retirement to recruit his 10-year-old version from the past. Based on the 2016 reboot.', 'In a future where an adult Gwen Tennyson is president and the world is being taken over by the alien horde known as the Xerge, a disillusioned Ben 10,000 is called out of retirement to recruit his 10-year-old version from the past. Based on the 2016 reboot.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6aDh4yH5FHaMfjdsqw4n97rl7FJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:834802'),
  ('630447119682100013', 'Ben 10: Destroy All Aliens', 2012, 'Animation, Science Fiction, Family, Action, TV Movie', 'Victor Cook', 'Marty Isenberg', 'Tara Strong, Meagan Moore, Paul Eiding, Dee Bradley Baker, Steve Blum, Jim Ward, Richard McGonagle, Fred Tatasciore', 'G', 'Based on the original animated series Ben 10. Ben becomes targeted by an evil Mechamorph Warrior, named "Retaliator," who mistakenly blames Ben for something he did not do and attempts to destroy all aliens.', 'Based on the original animated series Ben 10. Ben becomes targeted by an evil Mechamorph Warrior, named "Retaliator," who mistakenly blames Ben for something he did not do and attempts to destroy all aliens.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fE9MXUsbNzG14e6rHcOTNVJi2r0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:96826'),
  ('942539043430441367', 'Ben 10: Race Against Time', 2008, 'Action, Family, Science Fiction, TV Movie', 'Alex Winter, Morgan Susser, Dennis Burrell', 'Mitch Watson', 'Graham Phillips, Christien Anholt, Haley Ramm, Beth Littleford, Don McManus, Sab Shimono, Aloma Wright, Robert Picardo', null, 'Ben, Gwen, and Max must stop an extraterrestrial who plans to open a gateway that leads to an alien invasion.', 'Ben, Gwen, and Max must stop an extraterrestrial who plans to open a gateway that leads to an alien invasion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fXGAMKFtm74TICGaSTCLGTvyBk4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16000'),
  ('1047403486463635439', 'Ben 10: Secret of the Omnitrix', 2007, 'Animation, Science Fiction, Family, TV Movie, Action', 'Scooter Tidwell, Sebastian Montes', null, 'Tara Strong, Meagan Moore, Paul Eiding, Richard McGonagle, Robert David Hall, Fred Tatasciore, Vanessa Marshall, Dwight Schultz', 'PG', 'After a battle with Dr. Animo in a power plant, Ben notices something strange is happening with the Omnitrix but doesn''t tell anyone. Tetrax arrives and tells them the Omnitrix is broadcasting a self-destruct signal. Tetrax and Ben go to find the creator of the Omnitrix to fix it before it destroys itself and the universe along with it. Gwen stows away to help her cousin.', 'After a battle with Dr. Animo in a power plant, Ben notices something strange is happening with the Omnitrix but doesn''t tell anyone. Tetrax arrives and tells them the Omnitrix is broadcasting a self-destruct signal. Tetrax and Ben go to find the creator of the Omnitrix to fix it before it destroys itself and the universe along with it. Gwen stows away to help her cousin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vPND6Qff1KVYAtjaQuZtij8wtAj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15403'),
  ('750758015838980165', 'Ben and Me', 1953, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Hamilton Luske', null, 'Sterling Holloway, Charles Ruggles, Hans Conried, Bill Thompson', 'NR', 'A revisionist version of American history as a small mouse comes to live with Benjamin Franklin and turns out to be responsible for many of his ideas; including the beginning of the Declaration of Independance!', 'A revisionist version of American history as a small mouse comes to live with Benjamin Franklin and turns out to be responsible for many of his ideas; including the beginning of the Declaration of Independance!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cHnmpGfIyZhUvpzxMZTKGjOLZIj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:151430'),
  ('1095593591419303471', 'Ben Gen 10', 2021, 'Animation, TV Movie', 'Henrique Jardim', 'A.J. Marchisello, Marcus Rinehart', 'Tara Strong, Montse Hernandez, David Kaye, Travis Willingham, Daryl Sabara, John DiMaggio, Robin Atkin Downes, Josh Keaton', null, 'When Ben meets a young Generator Rex on the run from a hostile Providence, he must work through a series of misunderstandings, and defeat the dark wizard Hex in order to save the world.', 'When Ben meets a young Generator Rex on the run from a hostile Providence, he must work through a series of misunderstandings, and defeat the dark wizard Hex in order to save the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nxWAw5kaYjSH8EIcUz6VtHj8jyd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:828397'),
  ('1096785325916178055', 'Ben Is Back', 2018, 'Drama', 'Joseph P. Reidy, John Silvestri, Rachel Jaros', 'Peter Hedges', 'Julia Roberts, Lucas Hedges, Courtney B. Vance, Kathryn Newton, Rachel Bay Jones, David Zaldivar, Alexandra Park, Michael Esper', 'R', '19-year-old Ben Burns unexpectedly returns home to his family''s suburban home on Christmas Eve morning. Ben''s mother, Holly, is relieved and welcoming but wary of her son staying clean. Over a turbulent 24 hours, new truths are revealed, and a mother''s undying love for her son is tested as she does everything in her power to keep him safe.', '19-year-old Ben Burns unexpectedly returns home to his family''s suburban home on Christmas Eve morning. Ben''s mother, Holly, is relieved and welcoming but wary of her son staying clean. Over a turbulent 24 hours, new truths are revealed, and a mother''s undying love for her son is tested as she does everything in her power to keep him safe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eSPiprXuWqwMGi6t8BkdiTz9Ou3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:492452'),
  ('845769330526517757', 'Ben Platt: Live from Radio City Music Hall', 2020, 'Music, Documentary', 'Cameron Barnett, Brett Turnbull, Hayley Collett', null, 'Ben Platt, Nir Felder, Justin Goldner, Amanda Lo, Julia Adamy, Reenat Pinchas, Mike Ricchiuti, Derrick Wright', 'PG', 'Backed by a full band and a ready wit, actor Ben Platt opens up a very personal songbook onstage -- numbers from his debut LP, "Sing to Me Instead."', 'Backed by a full band and a ready wit, actor Ben Platt opens up a very personal songbook onstage -- numbers from his debut LP, "Sing to Me Instead."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aqH990bzdXwaYgAKrVaX0uKeIFm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:699210'),
  ('931199153843401458', 'Ben X', 2007, 'Drama', 'Lou Berghmans, Nic Balthazar', 'Nic Balthazar', 'Greg Timmermans, Laura Verlinden, Marijke Pinoy, Pol Goossen, Titus De Voogdt, Maarten Claeyssens, Tania Van der Sanden, Cesar De Sutter', null, 'Harassed by bullies because of his mild autism, teen Ben finds refuge in an online computer game, which leads him to his virtual dream girl, Scarlite. Together, the odd couple seeks revenge against Ben''s tormentors.', 'Harassed by bullies because of his mild autism, teen Ben finds refuge in an online computer game, which leads him to his virtual dream girl, Scarlite. Together, the odd couple seeks revenge against Ben''s tormentors.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/azxAJ9DlfhpvlKd6jSP3cLqOM99.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6936'),
  ('1069275934730020174', 'Ben-Hur', 1959, 'History, Drama, Adventure', 'William Wyler, Robert Surtees, Sergio Leone', 'Karl Tunberg', 'Charlton Heston, Stephen Boyd, Hugh Griffith, Jack Hawkins, Haya Harareet, Martha Scott, Cathy O''Donnell, Sam Jaffe', 'G', 'In ancient Judea, a Jewish aristocrat opposing Roman occupation of his homeland reunites with his childhood friend, now a Roman commander — setting in motion a saga of betrayal, adventure, tragedy, revenge, and faith.', 'In ancient Judea, a Jewish aristocrat opposing Roman occupation of his homeland reunites with his childhood friend, now a Roman commander — setting in motion a saga of betrayal, adventure, tragedy, revenge, and faith.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m4WQ1dBIrEIHZNCoAjdpxwSKWyH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:665'),
  ('414696460455338260', 'Ben-Hur', 2016, 'Action, History, Adventure, Drama', 'Timur Bekmambetov, Marco Furbatto, Félix Larivière-Charron', 'Keith R. Clarke, John Ridley', 'Jack Huston, Toby Kebbell, Rodrigo Santoro, Morgan Freeman, Nazanin Boniadi, Ayelet Zurer, Pilou Asbæk, Sofia Black-D''Elia', 'PG-13', 'A falsely accused nobleman survives years of slavery to take vengeance on his best friend who betrayed him.', 'A falsely accused nobleman survives years of slavery to take vengeance on his best friend who betrayed him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c9CoGrBA5yw8A7YBMz0hGzfzpNq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:271969'),
  ('704738116129908225', 'Ben-Hur: A Tale of the Christ', 1925, 'Adventure, Drama, Romance', 'Karl Struss, René Guissart, Fred Niblo', 'Carey Wilson', 'Ramon Novarro, Francis X. Bushman, May McAvoy, Betty Bronson, Claire McDowell, Kathleen Key, Carmel Myers, Nigel De Brulier', 'NR', 'Erstwhile childhood friends, Judah Ben-Hur and Messala meet again as adults, this time with Roman officer Messala as conqueror and Judah as a wealthy, though conquered, Israelite. A slip of a brick during a Roman parade causes Judah to be sent off as a galley slave, his property confiscated and his mother and sister imprisoned. Years later, as a result of his determination to stay alive and his willingness to aid his Roman master, Judah returns to his homeland an exalted and wealthy Roman athlete. Unable to find his mother and sister, and believing them dead, he can think of nothing else than revenge against Messala.', 'Erstwhile childhood friends, Judah Ben-Hur and Messala meet again as adults, this time with Roman officer Messala as conqueror and Judah as a wealthy, though conquered, Israelite. A slip of a brick during a Roman parade causes Judah to be sent off as a galley slave, his property confiscated and his mother and sister imprisoned. Years later, as a result of his determination to stay alive and his willingness to aid his Roman master, Judah returns to his homeland an exalted and wealthy Roman athlete. Unable to find his mother and sister, and believing them dead, he can think of nothing else than revenge against Messala.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aCohFCJNxPner7VzjzyNN7H8BgV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31510'),
  ('833431980452740528', 'Benavidez’s Case', 2016, 'Thriller', 'Laura Casabé, Lisandro Bera, Kutty Canteros', 'Laura Casabé, Lisandro Bera', 'Jorge Marrale, Guillermo Pfening, Norma Aleandro, Paula Brasca, Rodrigo Lico Lorente, Alejandro Parrilla, Diego Echegoyen, Oliver Kolker', null, 'Benavidez is a frustrated art teacher, argues with his wife and seeks refuge in his psychiatrist''s house. He becomes a victim of the house system, and at the end of the road he will change his life and his destiny forever.', 'Benavidez is a frustrated art teacher, argues with his wife and seeks refuge in his psychiatrist''s house. He becomes a victim of the house system, and at the end of the road he will change his life and his destiny forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q3vuGp2xzXbNcAk7wY5q6uLyyQz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:388335'),
  ('191780279862333667', 'Bend It Like Beckham', 2002, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Gurinder Chadha, Jong Lin, Guy Heeley', 'Guljit Bindra, Paul Mayeda Berges, Gurinder Chadha', 'Parminder Nagra, Keira Knightley, Jonathan Rhys Meyers, Anupam Kher, Shaheen Khan, Archie Panjabi, Frank Harper, Juliet Stevenson', 'PG-13', 'Jess Bhamra, the daughter of a strict Indian couple in London, is not permitted to play organized soccer, even though she is 18. When Jess is playing for fun one day, her impressive skills are seen by Jules Paxton, who then convinces Jess to play for her semi-pro team. Jess uses elaborate excuses to hide her matches from her family while also dealing with her romantic feelings for her coach, Joe.', 'Jess Bhamra, the daughter of a strict Indian couple in London, is not permitted to play organized soccer, even though she is 18. When Jess is playing for fun one day, her impressive skills are seen by Jules Paxton, who then convinces Jess to play for her semi-pro team. Jess uses elaborate excuses to hide her matches from her family while also dealing with her romantic feelings for her coach, Joe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2dzSBmFWWqt8NbnubJKIWU21Y86.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:455'),
  ('217261042079939944', 'Bend of the River', 1952, 'Western, Adventure', 'Anthony Mann, Irving Glassberg, John Sherwood', 'Borden Chase', 'James Stewart, Arthur Kennedy, Julie Adams, Rock Hudson, Jay C. Flippen, Lori Nelson, Chubby Johnson, Stepin Fetchit', 'NR', 'Two men with questionable pasts, Glyn McLyntock and his friend Cole, lead a wagon-train load of homesteaders from Missouri to the Oregon territory...', 'Two men with questionable pasts, Glyn McLyntock and his friend Cole, lead a wagon-train load of homesteaders from Missouri to the Oregon territory...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pffOvEVDt6XRWDwBkmQ6zWITakJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38732'),
  ('707421025739182922', 'Benda Bilili!', 2010, 'Documentary, Music', 'Florent de La Tullaye, Renaud Barret', null, 'Léon Likabu, Roger Landu, Coco Ngambali Yakala , Theo Nsituvuidi, Claude Kinunu Montana , Paulin Kiara-Maigi, Djunana Tanga-Suele, Cubain Kabeya', null, 'Ricky has a dream: to make Staff Benda Bilili the best band in Congo Kinshasa. Roger, a street child, more than ever wants to join these stars of the ghetto, who get around in customized tricycles. Together, they must avoid the pitfalls of the street, stay united and find the force to hope in music. For six years, from the first rehearsals to their triumph in international festivals, BENDA BILILI! (“beyond appearances”) is the story of this dream come reality.', 'Ricky has a dream: to make Staff Benda Bilili the best band in Congo Kinshasa. Roger, a street child, more than ever wants to join these stars of the ghetto, who get around in customized tricycles. Together, they must avoid the pitfalls of the street, stay united and find the force to hope in music. For six years, from the first rehearsals to their triumph in international festivals, BENDA BILILI! (“beyond appearances”) is the story of this dream come reality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zjA5qBzx5abqOu9uuz85NUBW6gD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55003'),
  ('1134101117815159516', 'Bender: Gold of the Empire', 2021, 'Comedy, Adventure, Action', 'Sergey Trofimov, Igor Zaytsev', 'Oleg Malovichko', 'Sergei Bezrukov, Aram Vardevanyan, Aleksandr Tsekalo, Yuliya Rutberg, Olga Sutulova, Yuliya Makarova, Vera Brezhneva, Yuri Kolokolnikov', null, 'The hunt for imperial gold continues. A priceless scepter, a treasure that could secure a worry-free life in sunny Rio de Janeiro for Ibrahim Bender and his young apprentice Ostap, has slipped from under their noses and ended up in possession of Nestor Makhno, an anarchist army commander. Makhno is convinced that the scepter is one of many imperial relics hidden in the area. With mafia, partisans, and officers of the Red and White armies all determined to get their hands on the fabled gold cache, Ostap and his mentor Ibrahim must surpass their own brilliance to outmaneuver their rivals and snatch the prize. And with Ostap’s beloved fair maiden losing her trust in him, he must do everything in his power to win her back and stop her from marrying another man.', 'The hunt for imperial gold continues. A priceless scepter, a treasure that could secure a worry-free life in sunny Rio de Janeiro for Ibrahim Bender and his young apprentice Ostap, has slipped from under their noses and ended up in possession of Nestor Makhno, an anarchist army commander. Makhno is convinced that the scepter is one of many imperial relics hidden in the area. With mafia, partisans, and officers of the Red and White armies all determined to get their hands on the fabled gold cache, Ostap and his mentor Ibrahim must surpass their own brilliance to outmaneuver their rivals and snatch the prize. And with Ostap’s beloved fair maiden losing her trust in him, he must do everything in his power to win her back and stop her from marrying another man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7nUaUFcoAXe363oMtJqStWtCsWo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:849236'),
  ('248087914397405059', 'Bender. The Beginning', 2021, 'Adventure, Comedy, Action, Drama', 'Igor Zaytsev, Alla Petelina, Sergey Trofimov', 'Oleg Malovichko', 'Sergei Bezrukov, Aram Vardevanyan, Nikita Kologrivyy, Taisiya Vilkova, Aleksandr Tsekalo, Yuliya Rutberg, Olga Sutulova, Yuri Kolokolnikov', null, 'Russian Empire, 1919. By a twist of fate, young idealist Osip Zadunaisky meets an infamous con artist and self-proclaimed Turkish subject Ibrahim Bender. A man of pure thought and aristocratic upbringing, Osip would never have associated with a cunning and unscrupulous swindler, but Bender comes up with an offer Osip cannot refuse. A precious royal relic, a diamond-encrusted golden scepter is hidden somewhere in town; Bender needs a partner on his mission to find it, and offers Osip a share of the profit from selling the treasure. And so begins their joint venture, wrought with comical and dangerous twists and turns, where they have to outsmart and outmaneuver officers of the White Guard as well as the local mafia, who also have their eyes on the scepter. As their quest unfolds, Osip is compelled to learn Bender’s tricks of the trade: charming flattery, delicate deception, soft intimidation... as well as brute force.', 'Russian Empire, 1919. By a twist of fate, young idealist Osip Zadunaisky meets an infamous con artist and self-proclaimed Turkish subject Ibrahim Bender. A man of pure thought and aristocratic upbringing, Osip would never have associated with a cunning and unscrupulous swindler, but Bender comes up with an offer Osip cannot refuse. A precious royal relic, a diamond-encrusted golden scepter is hidden somewhere in town; Bender needs a partner on his mission to find it, and offers Osip a share of the profit from selling the treasure. And so begins their joint venture, wrought with comical and dangerous twists and turns, where they have to outsmart and outmaneuver officers of the White Guard as well as the local mafia, who also have their eyes on the scepter. As their quest unfolds, Osip is compelled to learn Bender’s tricks of the trade: charming flattery, delicate deception, soft intimidation... as well as brute force.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2UjwbkiT2XXb7nYMvv706qIdSsq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:833286'),
  ('216784478677270776', 'Bending All the Rules', 2002, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Morgan Klein, Peter Knight', 'Peter Knight, Morgan Klein', 'Colleen Porch, David Gail, Bradley Cooper, Shauna Vatovec, Kurt McKinney, Ashlee Payne, Caree Davis, Julie Reifers', 'R', 'When single photographer Kenna finally gets her own exhibition, she turns her attention to her love life. Yet two different men, sensitive Jeff and strong-willed Martin, are determined to win her heart, pulling her free spirit in opposite directions.', 'When single photographer Kenna finally gets her own exhibition, she turns her attention to her love life. Yet two different men, sensitive Jeff and strong-willed Martin, are determined to win her heart, pulling her free spirit in opposite directions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/whP9L70ILJMOrlUOq7uMLW1hJF0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67685'),
  ('1037765094723421299', 'Bending The Rules', 2012, 'Action, Drama, Comedy, Crime', 'Kenneth Zunder, Artie Mandelberg', 'Dylan Schaffer', 'Adam Copeland, Jamie Kennedy, D''Arcy Allen, Candi Brooks, Pruitt Taylor Vince, Alicia Witt, Teresa Alvarez, Edrick Browne', 'PG-13', 'Detective Nick Blades is a New Orleans cop on trial for corruption. Assistant District Attorney Theo Gold is the man in charge of putting him behind bars. When these two unlikely partners from opposite sides of the law stumble onto a criminal plot, they’ll need to rely on luck – and patience – to take down a dangerous killer without killing each other first.', 'Detective Nick Blades is a New Orleans cop on trial for corruption. Assistant District Attorney Theo Gold is the man in charge of putting him behind bars. When these two unlikely partners from opposite sides of the law stumble onto a criminal plot, they’ll need to rely on luck – and patience – to take down a dangerous killer without killing each other first.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jjh6utQh3IPGXkVi8D1U8erDVgt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44032'),
  ('756440684243341644', 'Bendita Suegra', 2023, 'Comedy', 'Beto Gómez, Serguei Saldívar Tanaka', 'Melissa Palazuelos, Alejandra Vidal', 'Blanca Guerra, Paulina Goto, Daniel Tovar, Vanesa Restrepo, Andrew Leland Rogers, Minnie West, Hector Kotsifakis, Carmen Beato', null, 'Andrea, a successful veterinarian who loves her job and is in a relationship with Lucio, an up-and-coming lawyer who grew up in the country. Lucio has some news for Andrea: his mother is turning 60 and is throwing a big party to celebrate. Andrea visits the town where Lucio was raised for the first time and would like to become very close to his family, especially her new Mother-in-law Blanca, who is an overprotective mother, ultra-conservative and always thinks she’s right about everything. Andrea tries to fit in by tolerating all her quirks and harsh treatment during the torturous weekend.', 'Andrea, a successful veterinarian who loves her job and is in a relationship with Lucio, an up-and-coming lawyer who grew up in the country. Lucio has some news for Andrea: his mother is turning 60 and is throwing a big party to celebrate. Andrea visits the town where Lucio was raised for the first time and would like to become very close to his family, especially her new Mother-in-law Blanca, who is an overprotective mother, ultra-conservative and always thinks she’s right about everything. Andrea tries to fit in by tolerating all her quirks and harsh treatment during the torturous weekend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5xupm2thQic5GzYi6nim6URMZOY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1120558'),
  ('582495934903398730', 'Bendito Corazon', 2026, 'Drama', 'Miguel Ángel Pérez, César Plascencia', 'Francisco Pérez', 'Juan Manuel Azcona, Nora Cervantes, Manjarrez Belinda, Humberto Fuentes, Alejandro Gutiérrez', null, 'The true story of the sacred heart, told by Father Arturo Cornejo.', 'The true story of the sacred heart, told by Father Arturo Cornejo.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FbfburbW7SnLBscRe2hWneN6z9vB.jpg', 'plex:movie:bendito-corazon'),
  ('248808625199078000', 'Bends', 2013, 'Drama', 'Flora Lau, Christopher Doyle, AQ Lee Man-chun', 'Flora Lau', 'Carina Lau, Chen Kun, Tian Yuan, Lawrence Cheng Tan-Shui, Stephanie Che Yuen-Yuen, Michelle Lo, Elena Kong Mei-Yee, Kenneth Cheung Moon-Yuen', null, 'A wealthy Hong Kong housewife, Anna, lives a spoiled, bored life. When her husband suddenly leaves, taking the money and prestige with him, she refuses to accept her changed circumstances. Her chauffeur, Fai, who lives in an ugly barrack across the border in Shenzhen, is trying to get his wife—whose second pregnancy is a violation of the Chinese one-child policy—over the border so she can give birth in Hong Kong.', 'A wealthy Hong Kong housewife, Anna, lives a spoiled, bored life. When her husband suddenly leaves, taking the money and prestige with him, she refuses to accept her changed circumstances. Her chauffeur, Fai, who lives in an ugly barrack across the border in Shenzhen, is trying to get his wife—whose second pregnancy is a violation of the Chinese one-child policy—over the border so she can give birth in Hong Kong.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eR37EHOXs1GUugfGf2JCLtv0Zr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:230152'),
  ('1027782047912148455', 'Beneath', 2007, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Dagen Merrill, Mike Southon', 'Kevin Burke, Dagen Merrill', 'Nora Zehetner, Brenna O''Brien, Carly Pope, Don S. Davis, Tim Perez, Matthew Settle, Gabrielle Rose, Jessica Amlee', 'R', 'Christy returns to her hometown years after a car accident that disfigured her older sister. Haunted by the accident in which she was the driver, she learns that her worst nightmares have either come true ... or are about to.', 'Christy returns to her hometown years after a car accident that disfigured her older sister. Haunted by the accident in which she was the driver, she learns that her worst nightmares have either come true ... or are about to.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vgwq4t5GVmLqzhp3dmBTQHDWCn5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21623'),
  ('708267393769672501', 'Beneath', 2013, 'Horror', 'Ben Ketai, Timothy A. Burton, Spencer Hutchins', 'Patrick J. Doody, Chris Valenziano', 'Brent Briscoe, Kurt Caceres, Eric Etebari, Jeff Fahey, Joey Kern, Kelly Noonan, Molly Hagan, David Shackelford', 'NR', 'A crew of coal miners becomes trapped 600 feet below ground after a disastrous collapse. As the air grows more toxic and time runs out, they slowly descend into madness and begin to turn on one another. Inspired by true events.', 'A crew of coal miners becomes trapped 600 feet below ground after a disastrous collapse. As the air grows more toxic and time runs out, they slowly descend into madness and begin to turn on one another. Inspired by true events.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yDSClojlVVr2mcnWlQvkc6HSFtu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:257874'),
  ('1062882859686015474', 'Beneath Hill 60', 2010, 'Drama, History, War', 'Jeremy Sims, Toby Oliver, Ross Perkin', 'David Roach', 'Brendan Cowell, Harrison Gilbertson, Steve Le Marquand, Gyton Grantley, Alan Dukes, Alex Thompson, Warwick Young, Mark Coles Smith', 'R', 'The true story of Australia''s cat-and-mouse underground mine warfare—one of the most misunderstood, misrepresented and mystifying conflicts of WW I. It was secret struggle BENEATH the Western Front that combined daring engineering, technology and science. Few on the surface knew of the brave, claustrophobic and sometimes barbaric work of these tunnellers.', 'The true story of Australia''s cat-and-mouse underground mine warfare—one of the most misunderstood, misrepresented and mystifying conflicts of WW I. It was secret struggle BENEATH the Western Front that combined daring engineering, technology and science. Few on the surface knew of the brave, claustrophobic and sometimes barbaric work of these tunnellers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5eHtQC77fmILNRd7FG70SOdChs8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43418'),
  ('763170902610756386', 'Beneath Loch Ness', 2001, 'Action, Horror, Mystery, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Chuck Comisky, Philipp Timme', 'Shane Bitterling, Justin Stanley', 'Patrick Bergin, Lysette Anthony, Brian Wimmer, Lysa Apostle, Adria Dawn, Vernon Wells, Gerry Gibson, David Andriole', null, 'A scientific expedition to Loch Ness runs into trouble when the group leader is killed in a mysterious diving accident. Soon after, when the unorthodox Professor Howell shows up to take over as leader of the group, more strange incidents and attacks start to occur. While Howell and TV producer Elizabeth Borden are busy investigating the source of the attacks, the body of an enormous sea creature washes up on the lake''s shore.', 'A scientific expedition to Loch Ness runs into trouble when the group leader is killed in a mysterious diving accident. Soon after, when the unorthodox Professor Howell shows up to take over as leader of the group, more strange incidents and attacks start to occur. While Howell and TV producer Elizabeth Borden are busy investigating the source of the attacks, the body of an enormous sea creature washes up on the lake''s shore.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rklrzv8F2Cz10iMAGdDs9wAwj9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27009'),
  ('1096507262374378899', 'Beneath Still Waters', 2005, 'Horror', 'Brian Yuzna', 'Mike Hostench, Ángel Sala', 'Michael McKell, Raquel Meroño, Charlotte Salt, Patrick Gordon, Pilar Soto, Manuel Manquiña, Omar Muñoz, Santiago Pasaglia', null, 'Studying under a disciple of Aleister Crowley, the leader of an upper class group invokes a supernatural force that slowly devours the village of Marienbad and its inhabitants, threatening to spread beyond its geographical limits. The mayor from the town nearby commissions the building of a dam which would flood the valley and therefore submerge the village forever sealing the evil force under water after leader and his followers were incapacitated to be kept from escaping. However, fate ensured the leader''s freedom as he remained in the depths when the waters covered Marienbad. Now 40 years later an array of disappearances and deaths in mysterious circumstances are threatening the town next to the reservoir that now covers Marienbad.', 'Studying under a disciple of Aleister Crowley, the leader of an upper class group invokes a supernatural force that slowly devours the village of Marienbad and its inhabitants, threatening to spread beyond its geographical limits. The mayor from the town nearby commissions the building of a dam which would flood the valley and therefore submerge the village forever sealing the evil force under water after leader and his followers were incapacitated to be kept from escaping. However, fate ensured the leader''s freedom as he remained in the depths when the waters covered Marienbad. Now 40 years later an array of disappearances and deaths in mysterious circumstances are threatening the town next to the reservoir that now covers Marienbad.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3tajmTmBG7ptIKTI5uBreIP2BEs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18210'),
  ('522644586514052626', 'Beneath the 12-Mile Reef', 1953, 'Adventure, Drama', 'Robert D. Webb, Edward Cronjager', 'A.I. Bezzerides', 'Robert Wagner, Terry Moore, Gilbert Roland, J. Carrol Naish, Richard Boone, Angela Clarke, Peter Graves, Jay Novello', 'NR', 'Mike and Tony Petrakis are a Greek father and son team who dive for sponges off the coast of Florida. After they are robbed by crooks, Arnold and the Rhys brothers, Mike decides to take his men to the dangerous 12-mile reef to dive for more sponges. Mike suffers a fatal accident when he falls from the reef leaving Tony to carry on the business. But now he has a companion, Gwyneth Rhys.', 'Mike and Tony Petrakis are a Greek father and son team who dive for sponges off the coast of Florida. After they are robbed by crooks, Arnold and the Rhys brothers, Mike decides to take his men to the dangerous 12-mile reef to dive for more sponges. Mike suffers a fatal accident when he falls from the reef leaving Tony to carry on the business. But now he has a companion, Gwyneth Rhys.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lAeqIi5bxqmQNqSaHqNUZ0oVLo6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22734'),
  ('954335771331176335', 'Beneath the Darkness', 2012, 'Thriller, Horror, Drama', 'Martin Guigui', 'Bruce Wilkinson', 'Dennis Quaid, Tony Oller, Aimee Teegarden, Stephen Ford, Devon Werkheiser, Brett Cullen, Dahlia Waingort, Wilbur Penn', 'R', 'After watching their best friend get murdered, a group of teens struggle to expose a local hero as the vicious killer and keep from becoming his next victims.', 'After watching their best friend get murdered, a group of teens struggle to expose a local hero as the vicious killer and keep from becoming his next victims.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vzNQqXgIMxAAKQqnDziFtgksLbo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78461'),
  ('140568641916405913', 'Beneath the Planet of the Apes', 1970, 'Adventure, Science Fiction, Mystery', 'Milton Krasner, Ted Post, Fred R. Simpson', 'Paul Dehn, Mort Abrahams', 'James Franciscus, Kim Hunter, Maurice Evans, Charlton Heston, Linda Harrison, Paul Richards, Victor Buono, James Gregory', 'G', 'The sole survivor of an interplanetary rescue mission lands on the planet of the apes, and uncovers a horrible secret beneath the surface.', 'The sole survivor of an interplanetary rescue mission lands on the planet of the apes, and uncovers a horrible secret beneath the surface.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/szHCeYwi4ubewuYnlnz0YGqWnQC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1685'),
  ('783637950930839325', 'Beneath the Shadow', 2019, 'Drama', 'Keishi Otomo, Takahide Sano, Akiko Ashizawa', 'Kaori Sawai', 'Go Ayano, Ryuhei Matsuda, Mariko Tsutsui, Tomoya Nakamura, Kinari Hirano, Jun Kunimura, Ken Yasuda', null, 'From coworkers to close friends, Konno and Hiasa drift apart. When Hiasa goes missing, Konno must face what he didn’t say in time.', 'From coworkers to close friends, Konno and Hiasa drift apart. When Hiasa goes missing, Konno must face what he didn’t say in time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jZC0g4GgyWN8QPQbWbWDvhNAydV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:660064'),
  ('703911414792246969', 'Beneath the Surface', 2022, 'Fantasy, Horror, Thriller, Mystery, Drama', 'Dominic Ellis, Scott Chambers, Guy Taylor', 'Paul W. Franklin', 'Nicola Wright, Stephanie Lodge, Georgie Banks, Julia Quayle, Beatrice Fletcher, Annie Knox, Matthew Marcelis, Andrew Rolfe', 'R', 'A young woman survives a great white shark attack, whilst on a family boating vacation, however soon realizes the nightmare is far from over. Those around her can not be trusted, and she must face her demons, if she is to step back in the water.', 'A young woman survives a great white shark attack, whilst on a family boating vacation, however soon realizes the nightmare is far from over. Those around her can not be trusted, and she must face her demons, if she is to step back in the water.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xXE9IDEFiye0zNzmnT0eUDbGyVI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:896448'),
  ('795385050471168325', 'Beneath the Valley of the Ultra-Vixens', 1979, 'Comedy', 'Russ Meyer, Russ Meyer', 'Roger Ebert', 'Kitten Natividad, Ann Marie, Ken Kerr, June Mack, Patrick Wright, Henry Rowland, Robert E. Pearson, Michael Finn', 'NR', 'Believe it or not, even Smalltown USA, those unfulfilled and unrelieved in the midst of plenty reside. Levonna and Lamar could have the perfect relationship, were it not for Lamar''s obsession with rear entry.', 'Believe it or not, even Smalltown USA, those unfulfilled and unrelieved in the midst of plenty reside. Levonna and Lamar could have the perfect relationship, were it not for Lamar''s obsession with rear entry.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i1MCj9yhC2qZmfP1Mgh0YKNcd1b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5157'),
  ('604467628370088924', 'Beneath Us', 2020, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Max Pachman', 'Max Pachman, Mark Mavrothalasitis', 'Lynn Collins, Rigo Sanchez, Josue Aguirre, James Tupper, Roberto ''Sanz'' Sanchez, Thomas Chavira, Nicholas Gonzalez, Edy Ganem', 'R', 'The American Dream becomes a nightmare for a group of undocumented day laborers hired by a wealthy couple. What they expect to be their biggest payday turns into a terrifying fight for survival.', 'The American Dream becomes a nightmare for a group of undocumented day laborers hired by a wealthy couple. What they expect to be their biggest payday turns into a terrifying fight for survival.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uqo4lQ5n0hGSdztBLURleHUDnmu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:590575'),
  ('766873070823388550', 'Benedetta', 2021, 'History, Drama, Romance', 'Jeanne Lapoirie, Alain Carsoux, Thierry Poulet', 'Paul Verhoeven, David Birke', 'Virginie Efira, Charlotte Rampling, Daphné Patakia, Lambert Wilson, Olivier Rabourdin, Louise Chevillotte, Hervé Pierre, Clotilde Courau', 'NR', 'A 17th-century nun becomes entangled in a forbidden lesbian affair with a novice. But it is Benedetta''s shocking religious visions that threaten to shake the Church to its core.', 'A 17th-century nun becomes entangled in a forbidden lesbian affair with a novice. But it is Benedetta''s shocking religious visions that threaten to shake the Church to its core.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yofVXmLYQbr8pdOeyDRrf9N8rF4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:454527'),
  ('991308034889167801', 'Benedict Ironbreaker: The Red Taxis', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Manuel Pradal, antoine roch, Fabrice Grange', 'Thierry de Ganay, Manuel Pradal, Jean-Luc Voulfow', 'Gérard Jugnot, Jean Reno, Thierry Lhermitte, Leopold Huet, Hippolyte Girardot, Evelyne Buyle, Jean-Michel Balthazar, Michelangelo Marchese', null, 'At first sight, 10-year-old Benoît Brisefer, seems like any other little boy his age. However, Benoît is endowed with amazing force. All the bandits who cross his path learn this to their own cost. But, unfortunately, no one is perfect... As soon as he catches a cold, Benoît loses his extraordinary physical abilities. Hence he never takes off the woollen scarf wrapped around his neck. Brave and very determined, he doesn''t hesitate a second to take action to defend his friends. So, when Poilonez - a well known crook - and his gang decide to focus on Mr. Dussiflard, his taxi driver friend, Benoît does all that he can to thwart his plans.', 'At first sight, 10-year-old Benoît Brisefer, seems like any other little boy his age. However, Benoît is endowed with amazing force. All the bandits who cross his path learn this to their own cost. But, unfortunately, no one is perfect... As soon as he catches a cold, Benoît loses his extraordinary physical abilities. Hence he never takes off the woollen scarf wrapped around his neck. Brave and very determined, he doesn''t hesitate a second to take action to defend his friends. So, when Poilonez - a well known crook - and his gang decide to focus on Mr. Dussiflard, his taxi driver friend, Benoît does all that he can to thwart his plans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fVoulhYkpBcC49CyNwzLWoLlR94.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:307308'),
  ('273756410020114525', 'Benediction', 2021, 'Drama, History, War', 'Nicola Daley, Adam Tomlinson, Terence Davies', 'Terence Davies', 'Jack Lowden, Peter Capaldi, Simon Russell Beale, Jeremy Irvine, Calam Lynch, Tom Blyth, Kate Phillips, Gemma Jones', null, 'Poet Siegfried Sassoon survived the horrors of fighting in the First World War and was decorated for his bravery, but became a vocal critic of the government''s continuation of the war when he returned from service. Adored by members of the aristocracy as well as stars of London''s literary and stage world, he embarked on affairs with several men as he attempted to come to terms with his homosexuality.', 'Poet Siegfried Sassoon survived the horrors of fighting in the First World War and was decorated for his bravery, but became a vocal critic of the government''s continuation of the war when he returned from service. Adored by members of the aristocracy as well as stars of London''s literary and stage world, he embarked on affairs with several men as he attempted to come to terms with his homosexuality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lKXEXfYLBp9RZvGijz7oDjDlkKY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:399178'),
  ('832490123780215776', 'Benefit of the Doubt', 1993, 'Thriller', 'Jonathan Heap, Johnny E. Jensen', 'Jeffrey Polman, Christopher Keyser', 'Donald Sutherland, Amy Irving, Rider Strong, Christopher McDonald, Graham Greene, Theodore Bikel, Gisela Kovach, Ferdy Mayne', 'R', 'Twenty two years earlier, Karen helped convict her father, Frank, for the murder of her mother. With his new freedom, thanks to parole, Frank returns home to seek revenge. Having always pleaded his innocence, Frank soon works his way back into Karen''s life.', 'Twenty two years earlier, Karen helped convict her father, Frank, for the murder of her mother. With his new freedom, thanks to parole, Frank returns home to seek revenge. Having always pleaded his innocence, Frank soon works his way back into Karen''s life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u6j0UMOmRSObWbP8z1TF0EcMIVb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41598'),
  ('989634727525629922', 'Bengal Brigade', 1954, 'War, Adventure, History', 'László Benedek, Maury Gertsman', 'Richard Alan Simmons', 'Rock Hudson, Arlene Dahl, Ursula Thiess, Torin Thatcher, Arnold Moss, Dan O''Herlihy, Harold Gordon, Michael Ansara', null, 'Year 1856, British India. Capt. Jeffrey Claybourne is severely punished after disobeying an order. Feeling unworthy of his fiancée Vivian Morrow, the daughter of his superior officer, Claybourne leaves the army until he could regain his reputation. When the Rajah Karam launches an attack on the British forces in India, Claybourne finds a chance at redemption.', 'Year 1856, British India. Capt. Jeffrey Claybourne is severely punished after disobeying an order. Feeling unworthy of his fiancée Vivian Morrow, the daughter of his superior officer, Claybourne leaves the army until he could regain his reputation. When the Rajah Karam launches an attack on the British forces in India, Claybourne finds a chance at redemption.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lLJshKeOeXFrGU3RF6hasz9oaer.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:210674'),
  ('488092560881452043', 'Benilde or the Virgin Mother', 1975, 'Drama', 'Elso Roque, Manoel de Oliveira', 'José Régio', 'Maria Amélia Matta, Jorge Rolla, Varela Silva, Glória de Matos, Maria Barroso, Augusto de Figueiredo, Jacinto Ramos, Manoel de Oliveira', null, 'A young girl, Benilde, so protected by her religious family that she seemingly knows nothing about procreation, insists that her mysterious pregnancy is a miracle; however, her distressed bourgeois family decides that Benilde has lost her mind.', 'A young girl, Benilde, so protected by her religious family that she seemingly knows nothing about procreation, insists that her mysterious pregnancy is a miracle; however, her distressed bourgeois family decides that Benilde has lost her mind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7l02l9Ujy9TEI6fGqdO4UzmKLZI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:163880'),
  ('466737359478387588', 'Benim Adım Feridun', 2016, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Çağan Irmak, Gökhan Tiryaki, Fikret Kadıoğlu', 'Çağan Irmak', 'Halil Sezai Paracıkoğlu, Büşra Pekin, Özge Borak, Suzan Aksoy, Tarık Papuççuoğlu, Güngör Bayrak, Cem Kurtoğlu, Ayşe Tunaboylu', null, 'Ersan, who has been in a long-term relationship, has stopped showing interest in his girlfriend and being romantic. Enjoying the comfort of a long-term relationship, one day he is abandoned by his long-term girlfriend Ayla and is left feeling lost. Although he tries to win back the woman he loves for several weeks, his efforts are in vain. Ayla refuses to return. Realizing that he must accept the breakup, Ersan goes to the house where he spent his childhood in Erdek, hoping that a change of scenery will do him good. However, unable to find the solace he seeks there, Ersan notices a wedding nearby while walking along the beach. Ersan enters the wedding with the intention of leaving, but is mistaken for Feridun, the son of his brother who had fallen out with him years ago and moved to Germany, by the groom''s father. At first pleased with this role, Ersan thinks he will escape at the first opportunity, but then he sees Hayal, the groom''s cousin…', 'Ersan, who has been in a long-term relationship, has stopped showing interest in his girlfriend and being romantic. Enjoying the comfort of a long-term relationship, one day he is abandoned by his long-term girlfriend Ayla and is left feeling lost. Although he tries to win back the woman he loves for several weeks, his efforts are in vain. Ayla refuses to return. Realizing that he must accept the breakup, Ersan goes to the house where he spent his childhood in Erdek, hoping that a change of scenery will do him good. However, unable to find the solace he seeks there, Ersan notices a wedding nearby while walking along the beach. Ersan enters the wedding with the intention of leaving, but is mistaken for Feridun, the son of his brother who had fallen out with him years ago and moved to Germany, by the groom''s father. At first pleased with this role, Ersan thinks he will escape at the first opportunity, but then he sees Hayal, the groom''s cousin…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3vNmqvi9MXQskRjsRWfmJJ4cPKk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:447337'),
