  ('261342123959491832', 'Benji', 1974, 'Adventure, Family, Romance', 'Joe Camp, Don Reddy', 'Joe Camp', 'Patsy Garrett, Allen Fiuzat, Cynthia Smith, Peter Breck, Frances Bavier, Terry Carter, Edgar Buchanan, Tom Lester', 'G', 'Benji is a stray who has nonetheless worked his way into the hearts of a number of the townspeople, who give him food and attention whenever he stops by. His particular favorites are a pair of children who feed and play with him against the wishes of their parents. When the children are kidnapped, however, the parents and the police are at a loss to find them. Only Benji can track them down, but will he be in time? If he can save the day, he may just find the permanent home he''s been longing for.', 'Benji is a stray who has nonetheless worked his way into the hearts of a number of the townspeople, who give him food and attention whenever he stops by. His particular favorites are a pair of children who feed and play with him against the wishes of their parents. When the children are kidnapped, however, the parents and the police are at a loss to find them. Only Benji can track them down, but will he be in time? If he can save the day, he may just find the permanent home he''s been longing for.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aSowNmq4bZrmfazhQBePyNF8A2E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23069'),
  ('348689297756773848', 'Benji', 2018, 'Drama, Family, Adventure, Crime', 'Brandon Camp, Thomas Scott Stanton', 'Brandon Camp, Joe Camp', 'Gabriel Bateman, Darby Camp, Kiele Sanchez, Gralen Bryant Banks, Will Rothhaar, Angus Sampson, Jerod Haynes, Jim Gleason', 'PG', 'Two school kids strike up a friendship with an orphaned puppy named Benji. When danger befalls them and they end up kidnapped by robbers who are in over their heads, Benji and his scruffy sidekick come to the rescue.', 'Two school kids strike up a friendship with an orphaned puppy named Benji. When danger befalls them and they end up kidnapped by robbers who are in over their heads, Benji and his scruffy sidekick come to the rescue.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/79pacM3h5FoETnfuRC6O2qPfzn4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:495193'),
  ('26110131742872223', 'Benji the Hunted', 1987, 'Action, Adventure, Family', 'Joe Camp, Don Reddy', 'Joe Camp', 'Benjean, Red Steagall, Frank Inn, Nancy Francis, Bart the Bear', 'G', 'Benji has become stranded on a remote island after a boating accident. He finds himself struggling to survive in the wilderness, avoiding close encounters with a wolf, a bear, and a territorial female cougar with her cub.', 'Benji has become stranded on a remote island after a boating accident. He finds himself struggling to survive in the wilderness, avoiding close encounters with a wolf, a bear, and a territorial female cougar with her cub.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g4mlRGzUKCXfRDUJqSRPY0mKPMC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21299'),
